What teetering and twisted life it still holds dear, this land owes to you, Templar.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Dialla/Act 4/Dialla_Meet_Templar.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[104,21]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
