' || char(13) || '
What teetering and twisted life it still holds dear, this land owes to you, Scion.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Dialla/Act 4/Dialla_Meet_Scion.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[104,21]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(518, 'DiallaAqueductHighgate', '[]', 'Of course, there will be more. You know that, don''t you? Emperors. Avaricious little pests scrabbling to steal the legacy of their betters. Unless we burn that legacy, sear its infection from the flesh of existence.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Go north, my lovely Unbug. Go to Highgate, to the beginning of the end.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Dive headlong into the nightmare sea. Catch and roast yourself a nice, big fishy.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Dialla/Act 4/Dialla_Highgate_Quest.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[104,21]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(519, 'DiallaOyunQuest', '[]', 'The time has come, Not-a-Cockroach, to crawl up into the bowels of this Nightmare, traverse its innards, and rip out its corrupted heart!' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Oyun will help us. Go on now. Hob nob with the Maraketh matriarch. Learn what needs to be learned, and quickly.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
There''s a filthy darkness down in that mountain and it''s reeking with impatience to meet you.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Dialla/Act 4/Dialla_Oyun_Quest.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[105]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(520, 'DiallaFindRapture', '[]', 'The Rapture is our hope. Our desperation. It will set the Nightmare to boil, cook that nice big fishy in its own whining brine.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Listen with all of your ears, Not-a-Cockroach. The Rapture was Malachai''s most wondrous creation, the only fire hot enough to burn the Beast from existence.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
And its fuel? A gemling queen, blood and flesh and gem. Yet my selfish self did not want to burn away, and so the fire was but a tiny spark. The spark of a cataclysm.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
I am sorry, my love, my Malachai.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Go to it, Not-a-Cockroach. Find the Rapture. Make me sorry no more.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Dialla/Act 4/Dialla_Rapture_Quest.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[105]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(521, 'DiallaGemQuest', '[]', 'You know, Not-a-Cockroach, had I accepted my place, my rapturous role, the Beast would be no more, no less, no anything at all. My selfishness tickled the Beast''s fancy and it laughed the world I knew away.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Yet I have had much time to think on my lonesome. Much time to wonder. Wonder if the Rapture really needs to eat a Gemling Queen.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Maybe, something else will get its catastrophic juices slavering. Something like... eyeball soup!' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
The Eye of Fury. The Eye of Desire. Pretty gems for our pretty designs. But where could they be? Don''t fret now. I have my suspicions.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Kaom, the Sovereign of Slaughter. He remains, and suffers his delusions right here in the halls of nightmare. Fury is all he knows, so Fury Kaom will have.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Daresso, King of Swords. Damned by Desire. Oh, aren''t we all? He''s down here too, and Desire''s curse remains his to bear.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Go on, Not-a-Cockroach. Bring me the crown jewels so that we might wake the Rapture and finally put an end to this pestering Beast!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Dialla/Act 4/Dialla_Gem_Quest.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[106]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(522, 'DiallaKaomGem', '[]', 'Pried the Fury from Kaom''s dead hand, did you? Or is it ''dead again'' hand? Or ''redead'' hand? Or is ''undeath'' really just death with benefits?' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
In which case, you didn''t kill Kaom because he was already dead. It''s all a bit of a grey area, really. And completely beside the point.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Dialla/Act 4/Dialla_Kaom_Gem.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[106]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(523, 'DiallaNoKaomGem', '[]', 'Yet we''re still one gem short. Go, Not-a-Cockroach, and relieve Kaom of his Fury.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Dialla/Act 4/Dialla_Daresso_Gem_No_Kaom.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[106]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(524, 'DiallaDaressoGem', '[]', 'Pried the Desire from Daresso''s dead hand, did you? Or is it ''dead again'' hand? Or ''redead'' hand? Or is ''undeath'' really just death with benefits?' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
In which case, you didn''t kill Daresso because he was already dead. It''s all a bit of a grey area, really. And completely beside the point.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Dialla/Act 4/Dialla_Daresso_Gem.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[106]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(525, 'DiallaNoDaressoGem', '[]', 'Yet we''re still one gem short. Go, Not-a-Cockroach, and relieve Daresso of his Desire.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Dialla/Act 4/Dialla_Kaom_Gem_No_Daresso.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[106]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(526, 'DiallaDeliveredBothGems', '[]', 'Fury and Desire, together again. Lovely and lovely. Facets so shiny, replete with the vim of murdered souls.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
My Malachai did the crafting. Beautiful work. General Adus did the murdering. Equally beautiful work, in its own juicy way.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Dialla/Act 4/Dialla_Both_Gems.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[106]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(527, 'DiallaStartRapture', '[]', 'Num nums time, my little Rapture!' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
<i>{"Have you ever been to the End of the World before, my King?" asked the Blackest Monkey.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
"No, I have not." realised the Monkey King.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
"There is my reason to go where you go, be where you be, my King," concluded the Blackest Monkey in a voice as warm and welcoming as death.}' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Do you know who wrote that, Not-a-Cockroach? Victario Nevalius, the People''s Poet of Sarn. He was my friend... and I betrayed him. Took his love and burned it before his eyes.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Now I am betrayed. My heart burned black by the one man I loved... Malachai.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
He''s found a new heart, you see. A Beast''s heart to cuddle up to, to keep him warm and safe at the End of the World.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Today, I remind Malachai of his betrayal. Today, it is his turn to burn...', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Dialla/Act 4/Dialla_Preparing_RaptureDevice.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[106]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(528, 'DiallaTransformed', '[]', 'Malachai''s devices, his creations... He loved them all. Not me.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
He betrayed me then. Said he loved me. Then said he wanted me to die. He betrays me now. Lets me suffer. Lets me wither.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Am I the one and only mistake that you ever made, Malachai?' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Yes, that''s me. Dialla the Gemling Queen. Malachai''s misdemeanour.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Make him regret his mistake, Not-a-Cockroach. Tear open the Beast''s black heart. Rip Malachai from his filthy little nightmare. Cut him, crush him, burn him from existence!' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
He deserves no better, and I deserve no worse. No love for me. No love, no love... no love.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Dialla/Act 4/Dialla_Transformed.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[106]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(529, 'DiallaOnRedBanner', '[]', 'Impatient reekings. They waft to me from that mountain. That''s all I can smell, Not-a-Cockroach. Stinking anticipation.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Dialla/Act 4/Dialla_On_RedBanner.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[105]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(530, 'DiallaOnVoll', '[]', 'Voll the Pure, they called him. Voll the Murderer, I call him. In his name, an Emperor was murdered. In his name, an Empire was murdered.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Yes, it was Malachai''s lips that kissed me. Yes, it was Malachai''s hand that led me to the Rapture. No, no and no again. It was Voll''s words that put me there.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Dialla/Act 4/Dialla_On_Voll.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[105]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(531, 'DiallaOnRapture', '[]', 'The Rapture was to rend open the hide of Nightmare and broil the Beast''s bitter innards in the sweet fire of mortality.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
The vessel was strong and oh-so willing.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
The medicine was oh-so weak.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Dialla/Act 4/Dialla_On_RaptureDevice.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[105]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(532, 'DiallaOnKaom', '[]', 'Old axe for brains. Kaom had Eternals dragged from their homes all over the south coast.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Like sheep, he butchered them, no matter how desperately they bleated. He adorned his doorways with the heads of women and children.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
What makes a hero or a villain? It depends who you ask.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Dialla/Act 4/Dialla_On_Kaom.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[106]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(533, 'DiallaOnDaresso', '[]', 'The Sword King. Before my time. Beyond my time. Where is time, anyway, when you need it? Never stands still, that''s the problem!' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Except if you are Daresso. Petrified with love he is. A love he doesn''t realise is long, long, long... gone.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Dialla/Act 4/Dialla_On_Daresso.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[106]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(534, 'DiallaWithered1', '[]', 'What is that in your eyes? That glistening, that... softness. Is that pity?' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Take those pitying eyes away before I pluck them from your face!' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
I need but one thing from you now: Malachai... dead.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Dialla/Act 4/WitheredDialla_FirstEncounter.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[107]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(535, 'DiallaWithered2', '[]', 'What is that in your eyes? That glistening, that... softness. Is that pity?' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Take those pitying eyes away before I pluck them from your face!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Dialla/Act 4/WitheredDialla_FirstEncounter_MalachaiDead.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[107]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(536, 'DiallaOnPiety', '[]', 'The little cockroach witch? Malachai chose her... chose her over me?!' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Use her then. Use her as Malachai uses her. Burn betrayal with betrayal. It''s all they deserve!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Dialla/Act 4/Dialla_On_Piety.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[107]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(537, 'DiallaOnBlackCore', '[]', 'Yes, I see my Malachai dancing within the darkest. Puppet and Master, power and bondage, cut the strings and the puppet falls. The show ends.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Before you cut the cords, my Not-a-Cockroach, tell my dearest Malachai that he has played his part most wonderfully.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Tell him that I love him, from the bottom of my hate.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Dialla/Act 4/Dialla_On_BlackCore.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[107]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(538, 'DiallaRaptureReward', '[]', 'Take this. I''ve given everything else to him. My youth and beauty. My body and mind. My heart. And at last, the only thing he ever gave to me in return... my gemling power.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
This is all I have left. I entrust it to you, Not-a-Cockroach.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Malachai taught me not to trust anyone.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
It is time to forget everything that Malachai taught me.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Dialla/Act 4/Dialla_Rapture_Reward.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[107]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(539, 'DiallaMalachaiDead1', '[5]', 'A Shadow returns from the darkness. A shadow that stinks of vengeance served. A shadow drenched in the End of the World. The blackest shadow.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
My Malachai is dead. I knew it, felt it, understood it the moment you struck the final blow. I am, I was... the Gemling Queen, and now my King is dead.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Dialla/Act 4/Dialla_MalachaiDead_Shadow.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[107]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(540, 'DiallaMalachaiDead2', '[1]', 'The little girl walked into a dark, dark cave. The little girl met a dark, dark Beast. The little girl ate its dark, dark heart.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
My Malachai is dead. I knew it, felt it, understood it the moment you struck the final blow. I am, I was... the Gemling Queen, and now my King is dead.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Dialla/Act 4/Dialla_MalachaiDead_Witch.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[107]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(541, 'DiallaMalachaiDead3', '[6]', '"The righteous shall inherit." Voll said that, in a candlelit sermon on the eve of cataclysm. The only smart thing that idiot ever said. The only time God actually agreed with him.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
My Malachai is dead. I knew it, felt it, understood it the moment you struck the final blow. I am, I was... the Gemling Queen, and now my King is dead.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Dialla/Act 4/Dialla_MalachaiDead_Templar.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[107]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(542, 'DiallaMalachaiDead4', '[4]', 'I''ve met just one other man like you upon this long and twisted thread that is my life. Chitus. A man who understood what it took to give himself absolutely to Glory.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Yet, you and he are different in one tiny, little way. Chitus died gloriously. You did not.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
And now it is my Malachai who is dead. I knew it, felt it, understood it the moment you struck the final blow. I am, I was... the Gemling Queen, and now my King is dead.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Dialla/Act 4/Dialla_MalachaiDead_Duelist.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[107]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(543, 'DiallaMalachaiDead5', '[3]', 'Malachai once said to me that those that hunt for love will never find it, and those that accept that they are love''s prey are sure to be found... and devoured.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Of course, he had never met you, until now.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
My Malachai is dead. I knew it, felt it, understood it the moment you struck the final blow. I am, I was... the Gemling Queen, and now my King is dead.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Dialla/Act 4/Dialla_MalachaiDead_Ranger.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[107]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(544, 'DiallaMalachaiDead6', '[0]', 'You have fought a long war. A war to end a world, and begin a new one. And you''ve learned the most important thing about war.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
There is no winning. There is only remaining.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
My Malachai is dead. I knew it, felt it, understood it the moment you struck the final blow. I am, I was... the Gemling Queen, and now my King is dead.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Dialla/Act 4/Dialla_MalachaiDead_Marauder.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[107]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(545, 'DiallaMalachaiDead7', '[2]', 'It was said that Malachai was the greatest mind of our age. Our age is gone. This new age, it belongs to you. It was also said that ''great minds think alike''. Let''s hope not.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
So my Malachai is dead? Yes... I knew it, felt it, understood it the moment you struck the final blow. I am, I was... the Gemling Queen, and now my King is dead.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Dialla/Act 4/Dialla_MalachaiDead_Scion.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[107]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(546, 'DiallaOnWraeclast', '[]', 'We dreamed only the greatest dreams, Malachai and I. A truly eternal empire. Eternal life, eternal love. A future no longer afraid of the past.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Eternal lies, eternal loss, those were our true gifts to Wraeclast. This land could not have asked for a worse King and Queen.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Wraeclast leaves the past behind it, now. Malachai''s past. My past. It thanks you, Not-a-Cockroach. It loves you.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
I wish, I wish, I wish... that I could do the same.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Dialla/Act 4/Dialla_MalachaiDead_Common.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[107]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(547, 'PietyCorruptIntro1', '[4]', 'Oh Duelist, you''re so cute when you''re bewildered.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Piety/P_Duelist_10.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[108,109]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(548, 'PietyCorruptIntro2', '[5]', 'Do you assassins offer a money back guarantee, Shadow?', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Piety/P_Shadow_10.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[108,109]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(549, 'PietyCorruptIntro3', '[6]', 'You see, heretic? My God takes good care of me.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Piety/P_Templar_10.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[108,109]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(550, 'PietyCorruptIntro4', '[1]', 'Be happy for me, sister. It''s not often we get to erase our failures.' || char(13) || '
', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Piety/P_Witch_10.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[108,109]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(551, 'PietyCorruptIntro5', '[0]', 'You''ve done well, brute. But let''s not get above ourselves.' || char(13) || '
', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Piety/P_Marauder_10.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[108,109]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(552, 'PietyCorruptIntro6', '[3]', 'You see what happens when you hunt dreams, Ranger?', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Piety/P_Ranger_10.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[108,109]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(553, 'PietyCorruptIntro7', '[2]', 'Who is the wonder child now, Scion?', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Piety/P_Scion_10.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[108,109]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(554, 'PietyCorruptUntransform1', '[4]', 'My beautiful champion. I knew I could rely on you.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Piety/P_Duelist_11.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[108,109]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(555, 'PietyCorruptUntransform2', '[5]', 'Well done, assassin. Another satisfied customer.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Piety/P_Shadow_11.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[108,109]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(556, 'PietyCorruptUntransform3', '[6]', 'I may have misjudged that God of yours...', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Piety/P_Templar_11.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[108,109]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(557, 'PietyCorruptUntransform4', '[1]', 'Our mistakes can be our greatest achievements.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Piety/P_Witch_11.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[108,109]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(558, 'PietyCorruptUntransform5', '[0]', 'Kaom wasn''t half the man you are, Marauder.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Piety/P_Marauder_11.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[108,109]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(559, 'PietyCorruptUntransform6', '[3]', 'You''ve just earned yourself some bigger prey, huntress.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Piety/P_Ranger_11.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[108,109]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(560, 'PietyCorruptUntransform7', '[2]', 'Let''s not make this a habit. It really hurts.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Piety/P_Scion_11.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[108,109]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(561, 'PietyLiberated1', '[4]', 'That''s twice now that I''ve experienced a ''little death'' with you, Duelist. This time it was just the rude awakening I needed.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
When we shared our ''moment'' back in the Lunaris temple, part of me wishes I''d died at your feet as intended. The little girl within me that shies from darkness, from greatness.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Piety/P_Duelist_12.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[109]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(562, 'PietyLiberated2', '[5]', 'Stay those mortal instruments of yours, Shadow. I''ve no wish to test my longevity, nor my sanity, a third time. ' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
When we shared our ''moment'' back in the Lunaris, part of me wishes I''d died at your feet as intended. The little girl within me that shies from darkness, from greatness.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Piety/P_Shadow_12.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[109]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(563, 'PietyLiberated3', '[6]', 'Twice now you''ve baptised me in my own blood, Templar. So believe me when I tell you that I''ve had all the divine revelations that I can stand.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
When we shared our ''moment'' back in the Lunaris, part of me wishes I''d died at your feet as intended. The little girl within me that shies from darkness, from greatness.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Piety/P_Templar_12.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[109]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(564, 'PietyLiberated4', '[1]', 'That''s twice I''ve underestimated you, sister. Twice now that your talents have proved to exceed even mine. So it looks like you''ll be the one to finish what I so blindly started.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Part of me wishes I''d died at your feet as was intended. The little girl within me that shies from darkness, from greatness.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Piety/P_Witch_12.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[109]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(565, 'PietyLiberated5', '[0]', 'There comes a time when brute force is all that we have left. You''ve proved your worth to me, Karui, twice over. Time you proved it to Wraeclast.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Part of me wishes I''d died at your feet as was intended. The little girl within me that shies from darkness, from greatness.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Piety/P_Marauder_12.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[109]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(566, 'PietyLiberated6', '[3]', 'Listen carefully, Ranger, as this is something you will never hear from me again: I was wrong and you were right.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Part of me wishes I''d died at your feet as was intended. The little girl within me that shies from darkness, from greatness.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Piety/P_Ranger_12.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[109]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(567, 'PietyLiberated7', '[2]', 'I was always told to respect my ''betters''. Not once did I ever consider taking that advice... until meeting you.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Part of me wishes I''d died at your feet as was intended. The little girl within me that shies from darkness, from greatness.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Piety/P_Scion_12.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[109]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(568, 'PietyLiberatedCommon', '[]', 'It was Malachai who reached out to me, who wrapped me in Nightmare... made me his slave.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
He has shown me greatness beyond imagining, so much that I thought my mind would shatter under its weight. And although my mind remains intact, my dreams were not so fortunate.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Malachai is in the Beast''s black core right now, harnessing all that the Beast is, and will be. He will destroy this world and forge it anew in the divine image of Nightmare.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Yet as powerful as Malachai has become, he''s neither unreachable nor invulnerable. He sacrificed much to become the Beast''s prime servant, both in spirit and in flesh, yet three vital organs remain.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
His heart, lungs and entrails, keepsakes of humanity lost. They will be our tickets into Malachai''s private, little show. ' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Venture deeper, deep into nightmare''s abattoir. I''ll follow when I''m able. You find me those organs and I''ll get us into the Black Core.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Piety/P_PostNightmare.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[109]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(569, 'PietyGetOrgans', '[]', 'The Black Core is near. If the Beast were in any way human, we could think of the Black Core as the Beast''s heart. I''m not even going to try to explain to you what it really is.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Naturally, the Black Core is an ''invites only'' party and we''re not on the list. Yet I believe I have a way to correct that little oversight. Malachai gave up much of himself when he became the Beast''s prime servant. Both in spirit and in flesh. Yet, in a moment of rare sentimentality, he kept a few pieces. Three vital organs, placed in the safe-keeping of his godless three; Inquisitor Maligaro, Shavronne of Umbra and Doedre Darktongue. No doubt you''ve heard of them on your travels.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Bring me those organs and, I promise, I shall get us into the Black Core.', '', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[109]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(570, 'PietyDeliveredOrgans1', '[1]', 'You''ve come such a long way since we first met in Axiom prison. I was that close to snuffing you out, then and there, sister.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
But now look at us! Working together to destroy the greatest terror that Wraeclast has ever known. If I were the crying type, it''d bring a tear to my eye.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Piety/P_Witch_13.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[108]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(571, 'PietyDeliveredOrgans2', '[2]', 'Fate has a sick sense of humour, doesn''t it? When I saw you that day in Axiom Prison, I genuinely thought it''d be for the last time.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Yet here we are, the whore and the wonder child, committing a mutual act that will be felt for centuries to come.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Piety/P_Scion_13.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[108]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(572, 'PietyDeliveredOrgans3', '[3]', 'I remember when we first crossed paths in Axiom Prison.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Logic dictated that you, a feral little girl of the wild, were to die under Brutus'' bloody fists. You''ve proved logic wrong, time and again.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Now here you are. Here we are. Defying logic one last time.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Piety/P_Ranger_13.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[108]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(573, 'PietyDeliveredOrgans4', '[4]', 'You, my champion, have caused me more pain than any other man in my life.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Yet do you know from whence my true agony has originated? Not from the violence you have inflicted upon me. I''m a big girl. I can take it. No, it is having to look into those pretty eyes of yours across this chasm of creed that separates us.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Until this moment.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Piety/P_Duelist_13.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[108]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(574, 'PietyDeliveredOrgans5', '[6]', 'So tell me heretic, is yours a compassionate God? I doubt even He has room in his divine heart for such an unusually talented sinner as me. ' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Just so that we''re clear about this. I''m not doing this for Him, anyway.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Piety/P_Templar_13.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[108]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(575, 'PietyDeliveredOrgans6', '[0]', 'When I met you that first time in Axiom Prison, I thought you a mindless mountain of muscle.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
I was wrong about you, Karui. So very wrong.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Piety/P_Marauder_13.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[108]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(576, 'PietyDeliveredOrgans7', '[5]', 'The moment I set eyes on you in Axiom that day, I knew you were something special.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Never before had I seen such a perfect balance of physiology and thaumaturgy, Death and Nightmare.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
A perfect killer.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Piety/P_Shadow_13.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[108]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(577, 'PietyOnHelp', '[]', 'Before we walk this path together, it''s important that you understand one thing about me.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
I don''t regret a single thing that I''ve done. I set out to raise humanity up from the cloying mud of its fleshly ignorance. My mistake was not in the aspiration, but in the execution.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Now I intend to correct that mistake.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Really, I''m not helping you, exile. You''re helping me.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
So, have you found those juicy organs for me yet?', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Piety/P_Harvest.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[108]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(578, 'PietyOnGodlessThree', '[]', 'Malachai chose his three most loyal servants to guard those precious innards. His Godless Three. Inquisitor Maligaro, Shavronne of Umbra, and Doedre Darktongue.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
If the history books are accurate, High Templar Voll burned Maligaro and Doedre at the stake on his way to lay siege to Sarn. He didn''t have to worry himself with Shavronne. Brutus had already sorted her out.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Yet slaves of nightmare seem to be shackled just as tightly to life as they are to the Beast. I, of course, am living proof of that.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Don''t worry yourself with that little detail, though. Shackles are made to be unlocked.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Piety/P_Godless.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[109,108]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(579, 'PietyDelivered1Organ', '[]', 'You work fast!' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
You know, it is no mere ''freak of nightmare'' that fashioned that monstrous version of myself, the one you so kindly despatched.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
The Godless Three took great pains in getting me looking... ''just so''. They were none too gentle about it either.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
So no need to play softly with the remaining two. Treat kindness with kindness.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Piety/P_1Organ.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[108]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(580, 'PietyDelivered2Organ', '[]', 'Good! Two down, one to go.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
You know, prior to meeting Maligaro, Shavronne and Doedre, I rather admired them. Their work, their accomplishments... sheer genius! As it turns out, genius is something better appreciated from afar.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
So let''s remove this one, last genius from the vicinity, shall we?', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Piety/P_2Organs.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[108]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(581, 'PietyDelivered3OrganCommon', '[]', 'Excellent work! ' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Now Malachai awaits us within that Black Core, blissful in his ignorance as he puts the finishing touches on his Awakening Engine.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
It''s time we showed him a few finishing touches of our own.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Would you care to do the honours?', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Piety/P_3Organs.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[108,109]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(582, 'PietyOnMalachai', '[]', 'Malachai knew exactly what he was doing when he created the Rapture.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
His primary concern... get inside the Beast and take up the reins of true power. And his second objective... incite a Cataclysm that would wipe the very thought of resistance from this land. ' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
The Beast is the source of all thaumaturgy, the one power in this world that transforms ''what is real'' into ''what is imagined''.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
The entire world is now at the mercy of one man''s vision. It won''t be the future I imagined, and it won''t be the future you imagined, either. While he remains within the Black Core, the only imagination that matters... is Malachai''s.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Piety/P_Malachai.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[108]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(583, 'PietyMalachaiDeath1', '[4]', 'This is what I get for trying to be a bloody hero. An honest death... the only redemption I was ever likely to get. You know, it''s a question that''s always haunted me... whose will be the last face I see. I like the answer. Go, my pretty champion. I want that fine arse of yours to be the last thing I see.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Piety/P_Duelist_14.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[108,109]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(584, 'PietyMalachaiDeath2', '[5]', 'This is what I get for trying to be a bloody hero. Just before you murdered me in the Lunaris, Shadow, I thought you were about to steal my destiny from me. As it turns out, you gave me back my freedom. So go on, shadow boy, and do what you do best. Murder Malachai.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Piety/P_Shadow_14.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[108,109]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(585, 'PietyMalachaiDeath3', '[6]', 'This is what I get for trying to be a bloody saviour. I''ve seen, felt... been things that you can''t imagine, heretic, and I don''t regret a damned moment of it. So go. Finish what we started. And when I find out if this God of yours is real or not, I''ll be sure to let you know.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Piety/P_Templar_14.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[108,109]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(586, 'PietyMalachaiDeath4', '[1]', 'This is what I get for trying to be a bloody hero. Who''d have thought you''d be so suited to the role? I was convinced I''d made a fatal mistake in sparing your life in Axiom Prison. Fatal, yes, but a mistake? No. Go now, sister. It''s up to you to teach Malachai the true definition of Nightmare. ' || char(13) || '
', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Piety/P_Witch_14.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[108,109]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(587, 'PietyMalachaiDeath5', '[0]', 'This is what I get for trying to be a bloody hero. I was so sure that I was creating a prouder world, and I thought the Karui beneath such a future. I was wrong. Leave me, Marauder. I''ve got some explaining to do... to my Ancestors. You go and honour Malachai''s head with a place on your belt.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Piety/P_Marauder_14.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[108,109]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(588, 'PietyMalachaiDeath6', '[3]', 'You... you were born for this. But you''ve always known that, haven''t you. I''ve strived my whole life to make something better, of the world, of myself. You have simply lived, and the irony is, that''s all that either of us ever needed to do. So go, finish the hunt, Ranger. Do what comes so naturally to you.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Piety/P_Ranger_14.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[108,109]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(589, 'PietyMalachaiDeath7', '[2]', 'This is what I get for trying to be a bloody hero. Not that long ago, you represented all that I hated. But there you stand, possessing the one thing I have always dreamed of. A chance to change the world. Go on then. I''ve played my part. I asked the difficult questions. Now it''s up to you to get the answers.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Piety/P_Scion_14.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[108,109]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(590, 'PietyBreakFree1', '[]', 'Now, exile!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Piety/P_Nowexile.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[108,109]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(591, 'PietyEnthrall', '[]', 'Kill me!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Piety/P_EncounterMal_02d.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[108,109]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(592, 'ZanaMissionIntro', '[]', 'I need your help checking and securing a map. I apologise for the intrusion, but it''s somewhat urgent.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Zana/Z_Nov_24.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[125]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(593, 'MissionStrDexInt0GiveQuest2', '[]', 'There is plenty of work to be done, and who knows how long before we all vanish into the void. Let''s get to work.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Zana/Za14.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[125,177,178,180,323,324,379,385,386,416,417]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(594, 'ZanaMissionComplete', '[]', 'Every one of our forays into the Atlas makes our homes just a little bit safer. It may not mean much to you, but it means the world to me.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Zana/Z_Nov_30.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[125]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(595, 'ZanaMissionFailed', '[]', 'Mistakes happen. I just hope the consequences aren''t too dire.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Zana/Z_Nov_27.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[125]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(596, 'MissionStrDexInt1Failed1', '[]', 'Mistakes happen. I just hope the consequences aren''t too dire.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Zana/Za08.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[125,177,178,180,323,324,379,385,386,416,417]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(597, 'MissionStrDexInt1Rewarded', '[]', 'I''m busy. Let''s talk later.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Zana/Z_Nov_28.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[125,177,178,180,323,324,379,385,386,416,417]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(598, 'MissionStrDexInt1GiveQuest', '[]', 'Back for more? I could use a hand turning back the tides of madness.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Zana/Z_Nov_29.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[125]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(599, 'MissionStrDexInt1GiveReward', '[]', 'Again, you prove yourself more than capable out in the atlas. I feel hopeful about this admittedly desperate alliance. I''ve got to take a closer look at a few of the strange corpses you left behind. I think they hold the key to what is happening.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Come find me later in the Eternal Laboratory. I''ve collected some maps that could be useful for you.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Zana/Za11.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[125,177,178,180,323,324,379,385,386,416,417]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(600, 'MissionStrDexInt2GiveQuest1', '[]', 'Whatever is out in the Atlas changing and augmenting the land is extraordinarily dangerous, and it''s got the potential to spill out into our home. We need to put a stop to it. Head out there and see what you can find.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Zana/Z3_47.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[125,177,178,180,323,324,379,385,386,416,417]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(601, 'MissionStrDexInt2GiveQuest2', '[]', 'Every moment we spend talking is time better spent finding a way to protect our homes. Let''s get to work.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Zana/Z_Nov_31.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[125]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(602, 'MissionStrDexInt2GiveQuest3', '[]', 'Darkness looms on the horizon and we need to stop it. Let''s get ready to work.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Zana/Za15.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[125,177,178,180,323,324,379,385,386,416,417]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(603, 'MissionStrDexInt2GiveQuest4', '[]', 'Back for more? I could use a hand turning back the tides of madness.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Zana/Za10.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[125,177,178,180,323,324,379,385,386,416,417]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(604, 'MissionStrDexInt2GiveReward', '[]', 'Every successful expedition buys us a little more time. I just hope it''s enough.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Zana/Za16.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[125,177,178,180,323,324,379,385,386,416,417]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(605, 'MissionStrDexInt2Rewarded1', '[]', 'What you saw out there is... not a good sign. I need some time to think it over.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Zana/Za17.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[125,177,178,180,323,324,379,385,386,416,417]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(606, 'MissionStrDexInt2Rewarded2', '[]', 'I''m glad you''re so eager to help, but I need more time to work out the next step.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Zana/Z_Nov_32.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[125,177,178,180,323,324,379,385,386,416,417]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(607, 'MissionStrDexInt2Rewarded3', '[]', 'It''s unwise to rush into places unknown so quickly. Let me formulate a plan, then we''ll talk.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Zana/Z_Nov_33.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[133]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(608, 'MissionStrDexInt2Rewarded4', '[]', 'Your job for now is done. Go get some rest, and I''ll figure out what''s next.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Zana/Z_Nov_34.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[125,177,178,180,323,324,379,385,386,416,417]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(609, 'MissionStrDexInt3GiveReward1', '[]', 'I was wrong to ever doubt you when we met, exile.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Zana/Za21.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[125,177,178,180,323,324,379,385,386,416,417]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(610, 'MissionStrDexInt3GiveReward2', '[]', 'Fantastic! Let''s just hope it makes a difference.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Zana/Z_Nov_35.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[125]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(611, 'MissionStrDexInt3GiveReward3', '[]', 'Wraeclast''s survival is a race against time. A race I think we can win.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Zana/Z_Nov_36.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[125]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(612, 'MissionStrDexInt3GiveReward4', '[]', 'I think we''re on the brink of a breakthrough.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Zana/Z_Nov_37.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[125]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(613, 'ZanaLabIntro', '[]', 'My name''s Zana, but I already know who you are. I also know what you did, exile. If it weren''t for you, none of us would be standing here. There mightn''t have been a "here" to even stand on.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Zana/ZanaA10_01.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[125,177,178,180,323,324,379,385,386,416,417]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(614, 'ZanaUseMapDevice', '[]', 'This map device is a miracle of both engineering and thaumaturgy. It''s truly astounding.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Given the right coordinates from a map, this device can take you to places that... well, honestly I think it''s easier for you to see for yourself just what it is capable of.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
What lies beyond is dangerous, but so are you. Yet even the godslayer may not be dangerous enough.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Take a Map and use it in this device. I''ll wait for you on the other side.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Zana/ZanaA10_04.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[125,177,178,180,323,324,379,385,386,416,417]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(615, 'ZanaGiveAtlas', '[]', 'How fares your mind? Everything still intact? Good. Then there''s something I need to show you. I''ve spent some time out there, exploring the maps, and despite their apparent randomness, there are threads that connect them. Threads we should follow. ' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
The more we understand these connections, the more each of these maps can offer us, and the closer we''ll be to finding out the secrets that twist them.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
This is the Atlas of Worlds, and we can use it to track these connections; we can use it to chart a path.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Zana/Z3_03.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[125,177,178,180,323,324,379,385,386,416,417]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(616, 'ZanaOnVorici', '[]', 'I know out here a quick kill solves a lot of problems, but Vorici''s eagerness is... unsettling. Plus, he looks at me like I''m another one of his marks.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Zana/Za26.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[125,177,178,180,323,324,379,385,386,416,417]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(617, 'ZanaOnTora', '[]', 'When I utilise my map device, I usually have a pretty good idea of what''s on the other side. But I will never know any place the way Tora knows Wraeclast.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Zana/Za27.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[125,177,178,180,323,324,379,385,386,416,417]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(618, 'ZanaOnCatarina', '[]', 'What can I say? I admire Catarina''s... resourcefulness. I think it''s all a bit unnecessary, and how she can bear the smell is beyond me, but I admire it all the same.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Zana/Za28.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[125,177,178,180,323,324,379,385,386,416,417]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(619, 'ZanaOnVagan', '[]', 'He''s handsome, charming, and a good dancer. And he knows it. Vagan is a piece of work, alright.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Zana/Za29.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[125,177,178,180,323,324,379,385,386,416,417]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(620, 'ZanaOnElreon', '[]', 'What Elreon says and what I''ve seen... Well, they just don''t add up, do they? Don''t bother trying to convince him though. Debating with him is about as pleasant as a stroll through Sarn''s sewers.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Zana/Za30.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[125,177,178,180,323,324,379,385,386,416,417]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(621, 'ZanaOnHaku', '[]', 'Well, let me put it this way. Haku once asked me if I could make the map device''s portals wide enough for an army to march through. That''s not a road I want to go down.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Zana/Za31.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[125,177,178,180,323,324,379,385,386,416,417]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(622, 'ZanaOnExile', '[]', 'My mother died not long after I was born, and my father, too, was gone only a handful of years later. Orphaned, my family''s assets were seized and I was handed off to a series of well-off foster homes as an indentured servant.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
But children are curious creatures, and even by those standards I was extremely curious indeed. I grew up reading everything I could get my hands on, and questioning everything they tried to teach me. I was too smart for my own good, I suppose, because eventually, I started drawing the attention of the Templar.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Luckily for me, Dominus was much less subtle than the previous High Templars, so I managed to leave Oriath on my own terms, mostly, before my impending exile.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Zana/Z3_49.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[125,177,178,180,323,324,379,385,386,416,417]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(623, 'ZanaOnKitava', '[]', 'Good riddance. In all honesty, I thought the gods were just fairy tales the Templars would tell children to keep them in line. I''d have much preferred that.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
No one is happy about what occurred here, but if a silver lining can be found, we all have the opportunity to start again. All our past deeds, good or bad, now lie beneath the rubble.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Zana/ZanaA10_10.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[125,177,178,180,323,324,379,385,386,416,417]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(624, 'ZanaOnRebuilding', '[]', 'Good quality stone is scarce on this island. It''s plentiful on Wraeclast, but shipping it back is slow, and those ships are put to better use bringing back survivors.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
I know of a way that we might be able to source vast quantities of not just stone, but any resource you could possibly imagine. I just need to make sure it''s safe.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Zana/ZanaA10_11.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[125,177,178,180,323,324,379,385,386,416,417]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(625, 'ZanaWildAttention', '[]', 'Still sane, exile?', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Zana/Z_Nov_39_2.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[125,177,178,180,323,324,379,385,386,416,417]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(626, 'ZanaWildUpTo2', '[]', 'I really appreciate the help. There''s a lot out there I don''t understand, but two minds may be able to make sense of it all. ' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Meet me in the Eternal Laboratory. We have much to discuss.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Zana/Za37.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[125,177,178,180,323,324,379,385,386,416,417]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(627, 'ZanaWildUpTo3', '[]', 'Bizarre. The more we uncover, the more questions are raised. I think we need to consider establishing some sort of base of operations. Look for me once you''re back on familiar soil. I''ve got a proposal for you.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Zana/Za38.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[125,177,178,180,323,324,379,385,386,416,417]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(628, 'ZanaWildLevelUp1', '[]', 'The more we learn, the more we question.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Zana/Za39.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[125,177,178,180,323,324,379,385,386,416,417]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(629, 'ZanaWildLevelUp2', '[]', 'We have only just begun to pull back the curtain that obscures the nature of existence.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Zana/Za40.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[125,177,178,180,323,324,379,385,386,416,417]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(630, 'ZanaWildLevelUp3', '[]', 'Bizarre. The more we uncover, the more questions are raised. I think we need to consider establishing some sort of base of operations. Look for me once you''re back on familiar soil. I''ve got a proposal for you.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Zana/Za38.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[125,177,178,180,323,324,379,385,386,416,417]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(631, 'ZanaWildLevelUp4', '[]', 'I don''t presume to know your motivations for helping me. Honestly, it doesn''t even matter, since if you didn''t, there''s a good chance we''d be wiped off the face of the continent. But I''m glad you''re here anyway!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Zana/Za45.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[125,177,178,180,323,324,379,385,386,416,417]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(632, 'ZanaUpTo2Hideout', '[]', 'I understand you''ve created a little hideout for yourself. If you have the room, cohabitation could allow us to strengthen our alliance. What do you think?', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Zana/Za42.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[125,177,178,180,323,324,379,385,386,416,417]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(633, 'ZanaUpTo3', '[]', 'I''ve been thinking. We''ve been seeing a lot of strange things out there, and without a safe place to call home, it can all start to affect one''s sanity. Fortunately, I have a nice little place that''s out of the way, with enough room for the both of us... maybe more. Interested?', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Zana/Za43.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[125,177,178,180,323,324,379,385,386,416,417]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(634, 'ZanaUpTo3Hideout', '[]', 'I''ve been thinking. We''ve been seeing a lot of strange things out there, and without a safe place to call home, it can all start to affect one''s sanity. Your home here is... well, it''s fine, but it never hurts to have options. ' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
I have a nice little place that''s out of the way, with enough room for the both of us... maybe more. Interested?', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Zana/Za44.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[125,177,178,180,323,324,379,385,386,416,417]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(635, 'ZanaUpTo4', '[]', 'I don''t presume to know your motivations for helping me. Honestly, it doesn''t even matter, since if you didn''t, there''s a good chance we''d be wiped off the face of the continent. But I''m glad you''re here anyway!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Zana/Za45.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[125,177,178,180,323,324,379,385,386,416,417]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(636, 'ZanaUpTo5', '[]', 'You know, even if our very existence weren''t at risk, I think I''d still enjoy this work.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Zana/Za46.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[125,177,178,180,323,324,379,385,386,416,417]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(637, 'ZanaUpTo6', '[]', 'My father once told me: You cannot examine a shadow by shining a light on it. I''m finally beginning to understand what he meant.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Zana/Za47.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[125,177,178,180,323,324,379,385,386,416,417]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(638, 'ZanaUpTo7', '[]', 'I''ve been thinking lately: You can''t truly find yourself if you are never lost. The deeper we get, the less I think I understand myself or where I come from...', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Zana/Za48.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[125,177,178,180,323,324,379,385,386,416,417]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(639, 'ZanaUpTo8', '[]', 'Do you remember when we first met? The godslayer, so full of confidence... But I wasn''t sure you''d make it out there.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
I thought I knew everything I would ever need to know. I thought I was ready to go out and make the world my playground, but living amongst my father''s books and papers prepared me no more than someone who spent years gazing out a window. Knowledge can only be tested when it is put to use.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Thank you for helping me test my knowledge. I have learnt just how much there is left to learn.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Zana/Z3_51.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[125,177,178,180,323,324,379,385,386,416,417]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(640, 'ZanaDismissHideout', '[]', 'Stay sane, exile.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Zana/Za02be.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[125,177,178,180,323,324,379,385,386,416,417]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(641, 'ZanaCreateHideout', '[]', 'Let me give you the grand tour...', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Zana/Za50.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[125,177,178,180,323,324,379,385,386,416,417]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(642, 'ZanaHideoutDemo', '[]', 'With a handful of torches, a bookshelf, perhaps a nice little reading nook, this place could be very homey indeed.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Zana/Za51.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[133]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(643, 'ZanaHideoutDemoSelected', '[]', 'I think this will work out nicely for us. There''s even room for a few friends.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Zana/Za52.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[125,177,178,180,323,324,379,385,386,416,417]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(644, 'ZanaInviteHideout', '[]', 'I think this will work out nicely for us. There''s even room for a few friends.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Zana/Za52.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[125,177,178,180,323,324,379,385,386,416,417]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(645, 'ZanaHideoutGiveCraft', '[]', 'I''d like to keep my map device here, if you''ll allow me. I found designs for it in my father''s belongings and I spent much of my youth working on it. I wouldn''t be able to forgive myself if I let it be damaged somehow. Of course, you are welcome to use it as much as you like. And, I think it would look rather fetching sitting here.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Zana/Z3_52.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[125,177,178,180,323,324,379,385,386,416,417]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(646, 'ZanaOnMaps', '[]', 'Not too long ago I''d have told you that maps were a beautiful mix of science, thaumaturgy, and imagination, that I need only picture a place to conjure a path to it.' || char(13) || '
 ' || char(13) || '
I thought them a paradise waiting to happen, but they''re more like a tempting morsel sitting below a massive cage. The hunter may be no more, but all the traps are still set.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Zana/Z_Nov_38.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[133]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(647, 'ZanaHideoutDaily', '[]', 'While you''re here, I''ve got a favour to ask of you. Follow me, and I''ll fill you in on the details.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Zana/Za55.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[125,177,178,180,323,324,379,385,386,416,417]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(648, 'ZanaMissionUniqueMap', '[]', 'I''ve discovered a location in the Atlas with some... unique properties. Even by Atlas standards, this place is strange. I want you to check it out. It could be nothing, but I''d feel better knowing either way.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Zana/Z_Nov_51.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[125]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(649, 'ZanaMissionTag', '[]', 'Thaumaturgically-charged Lodestones placed throughout this map were providing a stable footing for me and my former allies. They''ve since been knocked out of alignment. I don''t think we need much guesswork to figure out who is behind it, but that''s a matter for later. Right now, I need those Lodestones realigned.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Zana/Z_Nov_41.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[125]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(650, 'ZanaMissionKillBoss', '[]', 'There''s a powerful presence in this map, and I think we''d be fools to leave it unchecked. Head on through and put it out of its misery before it can overcomplicate things.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Zana/Z_Nov_14.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[125]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(651, 'ZanaMissionFindMap', '[]', 'In my attempts to evade capture by my former allies, I lost track of some maps I''d been working on. I believe at least one is in the area I''m sending you to. I don''t need it back, but I do need it kept out of dangerous hands.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Zana/Z_Nov_42.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[125]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(652, 'ZanaMissionFindUnique', '[]', 'From time to time I''d come across items of curious origin. The Elderslayers were particularly interested in such finds, often adding them to their growing arsenal. There''s one such item where I''m sending you, and I need you to get to it before they do.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Zana/Z_Nov_43.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[125]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(653, 'ZanaMissionAnotherMission', '[]', 'I''m trying to enlist the help of one of our friends, but it seems one favour demands another. If you can go and help me help them, then I can in turn help you.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Zana/Za61.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[125]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(654, 'ZanaMissionKillExiles', '[]', 'The group of exiles that slew the Elder was, unfortunately, not the first group I''d enlisted. The rest went mad or were slain much more quickly, and yet even the dead ones are still rattling around out there. I don''t think they will cause much of a problem for you, unless one of my former allies gets to them first.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Zana/Z_Nov_44.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[125]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(655, 'ZanaMissionKillMonsters', '[]', 'The map I''m sending you to is infested with one of the Atlas'' many strange manifestations -- this time, groups of corrupted monsters. It''s not integral to our defense of Oriath, but ridding the Atlas of these fiends will make our efforts at least somewhat safer.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Zana/Z_Nov_45.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[125]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(656, 'ZanaMissionCompleteLabTrial', '[]', 'Strange anomalies spring up throughout the Atlas from time to time, tempting fools to their deaths. One such anomaly has appeared in the map I''m sending you to -- it''s a gauntlet of deadly traps. I''m not sure what''s at the end of it, but I don''t want any of the Elderslayers getting there before you do.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Zana/Z_Nov_46.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[125]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(657, 'ZanaMissionKillWarband', '[]', 'The Atlas contains many strange manifestations, the least of which are mirror-cultures of Wraeclast. I''ve come across a few groups of mercenaries that, if left alone, may become a real thorn in our sides. Exile, I need you to find and eliminate them.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Zana/Z_Nov_15.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[125]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(658, 'ZanaMissionFindDivCard', '[]', 'Something on the other side of my map device has gotten ahold of a divination card, one that radiates with enough energy that I can detect it even from here. Find that card before any of our rivals do. I know they''ll be hunting for it.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Zana/Z_Nov_47.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[125]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(659, 'ZanaMissionFindVaalFragment', '[]', 'There''s a strange object of Wraeclast origin in this map, and as far as I can tell, it didn''t come from myself or any of my previous companions. Can you track it down? I just need to ensure we don''t have yet another eager explorer like yourself making a mess.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Zana/Z_Nov_16.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[125]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(660, 'ZanaMissionOpenMonolith', '[]', 'Something in this next map is exhibiting some extremely strange energies, but... It''s immobilised. I''m worried about what could happen if someone else gets to it before we do. And if it poses a danger, well, you know what to do.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Zana/Z_Nov_17.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[125]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(661, 'ZanaMissionDarkshrine', '[]', 'I''ve discovered the presence of a strange shrine in this map. Normally such things wouldn''t concern me, but if one of my former allies were to discover it, it could pose a problem for us later. Get there before they do, and make sure they can''t use it.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Zana/Z_Nov_48.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[125]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(662, 'ZanaMissionKillInvasionBoss', '[]', 'Even among the erratic swarms of fiends, I''ve accidentally stumbled across an oddity. It''s strong and dangerous, and doesn''t belong in this map, so please make sure it doesn''t stay there either.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Zana/Z_Nov_18.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[125]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(663, 'ZanaMissionBeyond', '[]', 'A group of fiends is putting out a strange energy -- the sort usually associated with monsters from beyond the Atlas. I''m worried they are trying to bring something into the map. Make sure whatever it is doesn''t cause us trouble.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Zana/Z_Nov_49.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[125]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(664, 'ZanaMissionOpenUniqueStrongbox', '[]', 'I''ve managed to track down a potent cache of goods that might help us. That was the easy part. Now I need you to do the hard part: securing it before someone else with more nefarious intentions does. Whatever is in there is yours, so long as you get there first.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Zana/Z_Nov_50.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[125]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(665, 'ZanaMissionExtraNoDyingLeaving', '[]', 'By the way, I''ve limited the access into and out of this map. You''ll only get one shot at this, I''m afraid. We simply can''t risk anything or anyone coming out of that portal besides you! So, watch yourself.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Zana/Z_Dec_10.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[125]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(666, 'ZanaMissionExtraTimeLimit', '[]', 'Another thing: Someone or something is tampering with my map device''s ability to provide a stable connection between here and there. We''ve only got a small time window to do this before we''ll need to call it off, so once inside, you''ll need to be quick.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Zana/Z_Dec_11.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[125]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(667, 'ZanaMissionExtraTimeLimitIncreases', '[]', 'There''s a caveat. The connection between here and there is tenuous. I believe the creatures that lie on the other side are the source of the instability. Each one you slay should allow you to stay there a little longer. But if the connection becomes too weak, we''ll have to call it off.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Zana/Z_Dec_12.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[125]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(668, 'ZanaMissionExtraTimeLimitFind', '[]', 'Also, this connection appears to be inherently unstable, so I''m not sure how long I can keep it open. That said, if you can activate any standing stones on the other side, then I should be able to buy you a little more time.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Zana/Z_Dec_13.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[125]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(669, 'ZanaShaperFightHalf', '[]', 'Father, it''s me! Let me help you!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Zana/Z3_23.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[125,177,178,180,323,324,379,385,386,416,417]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(670, 'ZanaShaperFightQuarter', '[]', 'They lie to you, Father. I''m your true memory!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Zana/Z3_24.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[125,177,178,180,323,324,379,385,386,416,417]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(671, 'ZanaShaperFightDeath', '[]', 'I''m so sorry father. I''m so sorry it came to this.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/ZanaCombatNarrator/Za84.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[323]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(672, 'ZanaShaperGauntletRandom', '[]', 'He''s injured, but not for long. We need to get back!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/ZanaNarrator/Z3_22a.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[323]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(673, 'ZanaShaperGauntlet2', '[]', 'He''s recovering! We need to find a way back, quickly!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/ZanaNarrator/Z3_22b.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[323]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(674, 'ZanaShaperGauntlet3', '[]', 'He''s trying to recover. Hurry! Let''s find a way back!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/ZanaNarrator/Z3_22c.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[323]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(675, 'LeoMeeting1', '[4]', 'Good to see a man cut from the same cloth as myself. Leo Redmane''s the name, though no doubt the Grand Arena still remembers me.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Leo/Leo_01_1.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[352]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(676, 'LeoMeeting2', '[5]', 'A fine day to you. Leo Redmane''s the name, though no doubt the streets of Theopolis still remember me.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
So welcome to the ruckus, Shadow. They would never have let you anywhere near an arena in Oriath, snooty bastards. But don''t worry, no one''s looking for a fair fight here.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Leo/Leo_02.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[352]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(677, 'LeoMeeting3', '[0]', 'Your brothers and sisters tend to get a raw deal in the arenas of Oriath. Drugged-up fodder for the bloodthirsty masses. Nothing like that going on with Leo Redmane''s events, I promise you.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
So welcome to the ruckus, Marauder. Red''s the only colour that matters to me.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Leo/Leo_03.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[352]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(678, 'LeoMeeting4', '[3]', 'I know your type aren''t big on rules and regulations, Ranger. The wild doesn''t have much use for them. I can respect that.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
So don''t worry your pretty, little head about it. I, Leo Redmane, have only one rule in my events: Give it everything you''ve got. The audience loves a tryer.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Leo/Leo_04_1.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[352]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(679, 'LeoMeeting5', '[6]', 'Giving up your box seat for a place on the stage are we, your lordship? A bloody fine thing by Leo Redmane.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
The title isn''t the man, if you know what I''m saying. And to be honest, ''winner'' is the only title I''ve ever been interested in.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Leo/Leo_05.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[352]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(680, 'LeoMeeting6', '[2]', 'Leo Redmane''s the name, m''lady, and it would be an honour to have one of such beauty and prowess grace my humble affrays.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Welcome to the ruckus, darling. I am so looking forward to seeing you in action.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Leo/Leo_06.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[352]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(681, 'LeoMeeting7', '[1]', 'Got myself banished from Theopolis Arena for dealing with your kind, Witch. But this isn''t Theopolis, and Leo Redmane''s arena welcomes anyone who can put up a good fight... or a bad one.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
It''s not the methods, but the ruckus that matters to me.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Leo/Leo_07.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[352]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(682, 'MissionPvPDuelFirst', '[]', 'Get out there and shoulder-tap someone for a bit of casual biffo. ' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Why are you looking at me like that? This isn''t Theopolis. There are no marketeer fixers hustling to match-make you a duel. In Sarn, we pick our own fights. ' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
So go on, slap someone in the face with a gauntlet. Then come and see me when you''ve done fighting.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Leo/Leo_15.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[352]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(683, 'MissionPvPDuel', '[]', 'Find yourself an exile to take on and see if you can best them. We''ll catch up when the ruckus is done.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Leo/Leo_16_1.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[352]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(684, 'MissionPvPFFAFirst', '[]', 'It''s the arena for you! Be honoured. That''s not a suggestion, by the way. Be honoured. Sarn Arena is where everything and anything can happen. ' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
I never cease to be amazed by the spectacle when you throw a mixed bag of exiles into the old ''sand bucket''. An all day breakfast of free-range ruckus on toast. ' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
So get in there, and see how long you can take the heat. I''ll be around to listen to your tales of woe when you''re done.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Leo/Leo_17.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[352]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(685, 'MissionPvPFFA', '[]', 'Into the arena you go. Gird your loins and be ready for... well, pretty much anything! See you on the other side.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Leo/Leo_18.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[352]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(686, 'MissionPvPTeamFirst', '[]', 'Let''s see if you can play nicely with others.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Not everyone''s a lone wolf. It''d be a sad, lonely world if we were. There''s many who stick with the pack, who thrive in the camaraderie of battle. ' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Get out there, muster a pack and find yourself a battle. See if you can lead your friends to glory.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
We''ll speak again after.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Leo/Leo_19.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[352]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(687, 'MissionPvPTeam', '[]', 'Get yourself a crew and go make some trouble. I''ll look forward to hearing the gory details.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Leo/Leo_20_1.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[352]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(688, 'MissionPvPCTFFirst', '[]', 'What you need is a goal. Yeah, I know. I sound like a school teacher when I say that. What I mean is, get out there, get yourself a crew together, and try your hand at capturing a flag or two. ' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Exiles fighting together for something they believe in. Coveting, protecting... makes a man think there might be some hope for humanity.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
What? A man''s got to care about something. We''ll talk some more when the affray is done.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Leo/Leo_21.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[352]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(689, 'MissionPvPCTF', '[]', 'There''s a flag out there with your name on it. Don''t keep it waiting. I''ll look forward to hearing the results.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Leo/Leo_22.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[352]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(690, 'MissionPvPGenericFirst', '[]', 'Your timing couldn''t be better! I''ve just the ruckus for you. A fresh affray for those who hunger for glory and violence.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Think I''m talking it up a bit, do you? Well, that''s my job. Don''t tell me how to do my job and I won''t tell you how to do yours... unless you''re making a mess of it. And your job is to get in there and put in some good, clean violence.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
We''ll talk after, if you''re able.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Leo/Leo_23.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[352]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(691, 'MissionPvPGeneric', '[]', 'I''ve just the brutality you''re looking for. No expense spared on my part. Come tell me all about it when you''re done.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Leo/Leo_24.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[352]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(692, 'MissionPvP0GiveReward', '[]', 'You acquitted yourself fairly well that time. There''s always room for improvement, of course.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Leo/Leo_25.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[352]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(693, 'MissionPvP1GiveReward1', '[]', 'You''re a keen one, aren''t you? Good. Keen blades are good for killing. Keen thoughts are good for living.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Leo/Leo_26.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[352]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(694, 'MissionPvP1GiveReward2', '[]', 'Nicely done, for an amateur. Let me know when you feel like sharpening those skills of yours a bit more.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Leo/Leo_28.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[352]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(695, 'MissionPvP2GiveReward', '[]', 'And here I thought I might have dumped you in the deep end.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Leo/Leo_32.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[352]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(696, 'MissionPvP3GiveReward1', '[]', 'Pretty fine work. Think you can top it next time?', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Leo/Leo_43.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[352]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(697, 'MissionPvP3GiveReward2', '[]', 'You made a real statement, that time. I reckon we should keep you talking.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Leo/Leo_44.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[352]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(698, 'MissionPvP3GiveReward3', '[]', 'You''re on a bit of a roll, here!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Leo/Leo_45.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[352]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(699, 'MissionPvP3GiveReward4', '[]', 'Violence really suits you! Brings out the red in your eyes.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Leo/Leo_46.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[352]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(700, 'MissionPvP3GiveReward5', '[]', 'You better be careful, or you''re going to get a name for yourself!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Leo/Leo_47.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[352]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(701, 'MissionPvP3GiveReward6', '[]', 'You surely do put on a good show.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Leo/Leo_48.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[352]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(702, 'LeoUpTo2', '[]', 'At this rate, we''ll make quite the decent gladiator out of you.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
That said, I''m bit concerned about your gear. It''s one thing to have talent, but if you don''t have the right gear, you''ll be a talented corpse. ' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Flasks are a must-have, especially the ones that can wash away any ailments an enemy might curse you with. The fastest, strongest fighter can be rendered as slow and soft as a slug. Thaumaturgy''s a bugger like that. Choose your flasks wisely and use them sparingly. They''ve got to last you the whole fight, remember. ' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Anyway, have a look at the bits and bobs I''ve mustered here. Every item hand-picked to make other exile''s lives miserable. See if anything takes your fancy.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Leo/Leo_29.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[352]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(703, 'LeoUpTo2Hideout', '[]', 'Turns out you''ve found yourself a hideout. And as luck would have it, I find myself in need of somewhere to sleep.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Maramoa''s given me the boot, you see. Oh, you didn''t know about us? Not surprised. Pretty tight-lipped about her private life, that girl. Wouldn''t mention anything to her either, unless you''re looking for a piece of axe. ' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
So, how about it? I don''t take up much space, so there''ll be plenty of room for others, and I''ll defend your house like its my own. What do you say?', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Leo/Leo_30.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[352]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(704, 'LeoUpTo3', '[]', 'You''re proving to be quite the reliable one. I like predictability in an ally, helps me sleep at night. And as luck would have it, I''ve just found myself a new resting spot. ' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Maramoa''s given me the boot, you see. Oh, you didn''t know about us? Not surprised. Pretty tight-lipped about her private life, that girl. Wouldn''t mention anything to her, either, unless you''re looking for a piece of axe. ' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
So, how about joining me, eh? I could do with the company and, as we all know, there''s safety in numbers when it comes to living in Wraeclast.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Leo/Leo_33.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[352]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(705, 'LeoUpTo3Hideout', '[]', 'So, you''ve gone and set up a cosy, little nest with one of the other masters, have you? It''s your fight, your funeral, as they say. ' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Should you change your mind though, I might still have a spot that''d serve the two us just as nicely, if not better. Defendable, comfortable, adaptable and whole lot of other ''ables'' that escape me for the moment. ' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
What do you reckon? Take a look for curiosity''s sake?', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Leo/Leo_34.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[352]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(706, 'LeoCreateHideout', '[]', 'You won''t regret this.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Leo/Leo_35.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[352]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(707, 'LeoHideoutDemo', '[]', 'Sure, it''s no imperial penthouse, but if you''ve been keeping up with real estate these last couple hundred years, you''ll notice that the Wraeclast market''s been a bit flat.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
So what do you think? Is it a keeper?', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Leo/Leo_36.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[352]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(708, 'LeoHideoutChosen', '[]', 'Well played, my friend. Well played. Of course, there''s room for one or two others to join us, if you feel so inclined.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
I''m not fussy when it comes to house-mates, so I''ll leave the choosing to you, eh? Just make sure none of them snore.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Leo/Leo_37.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[352]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(709, 'LeoUpTo4', '[]', 'Bet you''re itching to know how I ended up with a hook, right? Not half as much as my left hand itches in the middle of the night. The mind, eh? It''s the damndest of things. ' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
But here it is. I got complacent. Been fighting in arenas and gutter pits so long I thought I knew it all. It took a waif of a girl with a rusty dirk to take my hand and my pride with one out-of-the-blue slash. ' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
So here''s a bit of blood-earned wisdom for you. Life is a school from which you never graduate. Those who stop learning, start dying.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Leo/Leo_49.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[352]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(710, 'LeoUpTo5', '[]', 'Since you seem pretty committed to proving yourself against your fellow exiles, here''s a word of caution. Exsanguination.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Leo/Leo_50_Placehold.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[352]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(711, 'LeoUpTo6', '[]', 'You''re getting quite a reputation for yourself in fighting circles. So here''s another tip from the Redmane School of Not Dying, just to make sure you don''t trip over your own pedestal. ' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Some say you should focus on your strengths. That''s good for the ego, not so good for keeping your throat unslit. Instead, drag your weaknesses kicking and screaming into the light, and give them a damned good looking-over. That''ll help you protect your soft bits, but more importantly, it''ll train your eye to spot weaknesses in others. ' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Why go toe-to-toe with a man who has bigger toes than you, when it''s his dodgy hamstring you should be going after?', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Leo/Leo_51.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[352]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(712, 'LeoUpTo7', '[]', 'I wish we''d met back in Oriath. I could have made a bloody fortune out of you. Ah well, ancient history, that. Let''s look to the present, and to keeping you from becoming ancient history yourself. ' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
I''ve met some mighty big hitters in my time, and picked up one valuable lesson from them: Don''t get hit. A fighter can learn to take punishment. Body conditioning, armour, stamina... it all helps. But there are still attacks out there that''ll cut through you like you''re yesterday''s bog paper. ' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Best thing when one of those blows falls? Be somewhere else.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Leo/Leo_52.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[352]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(713, 'LeoUpTo8', '[]', 'You probably know me well enough by now to understand that I don''t say what I''m about to lightly. So here it is. ' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
You''re a better fighter than I am. Better than Vagan, better even than the great Daresso, in my mind at least. And you know why you''re better? You just don''t bloody give up! ' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
That''s what it takes for true mastery, inside the arena and out. Sure, we all know how to put the blood, sweat and tears into something. How to just keep swinging that sword until it hits what we want it to hit. That makes us good. But you, you''re different. You''re so full of the fight that you''ve forgotten how to live any other way. ' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
That''s why you, my friend, are one of the Greats.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Leo/Leo_53.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[352]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(714, 'LeoGiveCrafting', '[]', 'I know how exiles think and more importantly, how they fight. Oriathan and Karui, brawler and thaumaturge, I''ve seen every type of combatant. I''ve recorded their strengths and nutted out their weaknesses. ' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
What do I do with all this know-how? I carve and hammer it into weapons and other bits and bobs. I could teach you a thing or two about that, if you''re willing.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
After all, if you''re going to take down exiles, you''ll need the right gear. Can''t eat steak with a spoon, you know.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Leo/Leo_54.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[352]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(715, 'LeoOnDailies', '[]', 'Speaking of which, stop in from time to time for a chat. I''ve always got a few events on the go. Exiles do love to bash each other... as if Wraeclast wasn''t enough of a challenge for them!' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
But now and then, I like to streamline things. Make sure the ruckus has a bit of form and grace to it. Time your visit right, and I''ll be able to point you in the direction of a right, top-notch ruckus.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Leo/Leo_14.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[352]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(716, 'LeoOnCrafting', '[]', 'Why should exile fight exile, you ask? This is our new home, so we need to get to know each other. And I reckon you can''t truly know someone until you''ve fought them.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Leo/Leo_55.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[352]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(717, 'LeoOnPvPCharacter', '[]', 'You know, I''ve a few friends we should think about inviting over. Not your usual rank and file exile, all survivalism and vengeance. ' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
They''re what I''d call your ''exile''s exile'', far more interested in beating the corruption out of each other than in taking on the twisted hordes out there.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
A sensible coping strategy, if you ask me. And a damned fine philosophy for producing gladiators! ' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Anyway, you just say the word. I''m sure they''ll be thrilled to meet you.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Leo/Leo_56.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[352]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(718, 'LeoDaily', '[]', 'Another day, another ruckus. You feeling fighting fit?', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Leo/Leo_57.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[352]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(719, 'LeoDailySelected', '[]', 'Good on you. Now, how can we best make use of your violent cravings?', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Leo/Leo_58.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[352]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(720, 'LeoDismissed', '[]', 'Another day, another ruckus.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Leo/Leo_57_Edit.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[352]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(721, 'LeoOnVorici', '[]', 'Vorici''s a backstabbing ponce with delusions of grandeur.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
I had a gutsful of his type back in Oriath. Now they''re turning up in Wraeclast. There goes the neighbourhood.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Leo/Leo_59.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[352]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(722, 'LeoOnCatarina', '[]', 'I don''t mind admitting that Catarina scares me bloody rigid.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Can''t say I understand her obsession with the deceased, but it''s not for me to tell anyone how to run their life, or death for that matter.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Leo/Leo_60.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[352]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(723, 'LeoOnTora', '[]', 'Tora''s a pussy cat. Scratch her belly and she''s all purrs. Pull her tail and she''ll have your eyes out before you can blink.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Leo/Leo_61.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[352]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(724, 'LeoOnZana', '[]', 'Zana? I respect a woman who knows exactly where things are. Bloody helpful when you lose your keys.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Leo/Leo_62.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[352]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(725, 'LeoOnVagan', '[]', 'Vagan and I go way back. Even faced each other in the arena a few times in our younger days. He''s not a bad bloke.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
It''s just that I wish he''d been understanding enough to set up shop in some other part of Wraeclast.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
It''s not the competition, I mind. It''s the evening chinwags that get to me. A man likes to get a word in, now and then.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Leo/Leo_63.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[352]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(726, 'LeoOnElreon', '[]', 'Never been one to believe in God myself, but damned if I''m going to tell Elreon that. Just in case I''m wrong, you see. ' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
A good fighter always knows where the exits are.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Leo/Leo_64.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[352]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(727, 'LeoOnHaku', '[]', 'Haku''s a bit on the intense side for my liking. It worries me when a man can''t see the funny side of life. Makes him real dangerous.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Leo/Leo_65.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[352]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(728, 'LeoOnArena', '[]', 'Eternals would travel from far and wide to see the spectacles of Sarn Arena. The gemling diva Kalisa gave her final performance in there for Emperor Chitus himself.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Legend has it, on that same day, the first gemling legionnaire cut through four Ezomyte warriors in less time than it would''ve taken Kalisa to sing a single bar. ' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
It''s seen more artists of war and of culture than any other place in the whole of Wraeclast.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Whatever becomes of this land, I''m going to make damned sure of one thing. Sarn Arena will continue to celebrate the spirit of glory. God knows, we all need a bit of glory in a place like this.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Leo/Leo_66.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[352]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(729, 'LeoOnMarylane', '[]', 'Fair Marylene was one of the true greats of the arena in Sarn. Her skill with a longsword was second to none. Pinpoint accuracy and fast as a viper. ' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
As the story goes, she started out as a gutter kid, brought up by her maidservant mother. No one knew for sure who her dad was, but some pegged Kre Faarblood as the most likely candidate. Apparently sowed more than his fair share of wild oats in his day. ' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
You know why she was called ''Fair'' Marylene? She was a looker, by all accounts, but that wasn''t how she earned the nickname. It was down to her fighting style. The girl was a dancer, so sure on her feet that she was bloody near untouchable. ' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Could be something you want to try. Not the dancing bit, not literally, but working on your movement. Some fighters learn to take the hits, others learn to avoid them. Never seen a fighter successfully do both.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Leo/Leo_67.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[352]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(730, 'LeoOnFaarblood', '[]', 'It''s through studying the greats that you learn how to be great yourself. Fighters who live in isolation tend to die there.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Leo/Leo_68.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[352]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(731, 'LeoOnTitucius', '[]', 'This isn''t widely known, but Hector Titucius was an Ezomyte by birth.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Leo/Leo_69_Placehold.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[352]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(732, 'FishNoFishingRod', '[]', 'To become a Master Fisherman, one thing is for certain: you''re going to need a rod, preferably one with good cast speed.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
So if you happen to see a fishing rod on your travels, then bring it back to me. I''ll be here as long as the fish are biting.', 'Audio/Dialogue/Character/StrDexInt/Misc/SolidTrawl_2.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[126]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(733, 'FishFishQuest', '[]', 'Excellent. You have passed the gear check and appear to have a fishing rod. A rather nice one, too. Now you are ready to catch some of Wraeclast''s finest fish.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
The next step on your journey to becoming a Master Fisherman worthy of the Winding Pier is to actually catch some fish. Fishing is the simplest thing in the world. With your rod equipped, just approach a pool of water and cast away. It''s really intuitive.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Soon, you''ll find yourself overburdened with fish of various types. Before you rush off to trade your haul for a better rod though, bring me back a few of the choicest specimens to demonstrate your skill.', 'Audio/Dialogue/Character/StrDexInt/Misc/SolidTrawl_3.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[126]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(734, 'FishIntro', '[]', 'Hi, I''m Krillson of Winding Pier fame. ' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
For years, people have been asking me to teach them how to fish. Many question whether fishing is even possible in a harsh, unforgiving continent like Wraeclast.', 'Audio/Dialogue/Character/StrDexInt/Misc/SolidTrawl_1.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[126]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(735, 'FishComplete', '[]', 'You... managed to catch the fish I wanted? Congratulations! Let''s keep this a secret between the two of us, shall we?' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
In the meantime, take this. It should be useful in the future.', 'Audio/Dialogue/Character/StrDexInt/Misc/SolidTrawl_4.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[126]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(736, 'FishChatFairgraves', '[]', 'It is relatively well known that Captain Sigmund Fairgraves was an explorer and sometimes a pirate.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
What''s less known is that Fairgraves was a whaler of some significance. This is interesting, of course, because whales make up only one percent of all sea life. When you catch one, however, it pays for all the rest of the fish in your net.', 'Audio/Dialogue/Character/StrDexInt/Misc/SolidTrawl_5.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[126]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(737, 'FishChatVorici', '[]', 'The only difference between me and Vorici is what we decide to call a ''fish''.', 'Audio/Dialogue/Character/StrDexInt/Misc/SolidTrawl_7.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[126]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(738, 'FishChatTora', '[]', 'Tora tells me that she wants to free the land from corrupted fish. I would like that. Red Herrings annoy me.', 'Audio/Dialogue/Character/StrDexInt/Misc/SolidTrawl_11.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[126]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(739, 'FishChatCatarina', '[]', 'Unlike Catarina, I prefer my fish to be fresh.', 'Audio/Dialogue/Character/StrDexInt/Misc/SolidTrawl_8.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[126]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(740, 'FishChatVagan', '[]', 'Vagan and I agree that it''s very important that a fish puts up a good fight.', 'Audio/Dialogue/Character/StrDexInt/Misc/SolidTrawl_9.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[126]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(741, 'FishChatElreon', '[]', 'Elreon tells me that God created the fish. Thank God for that.', 'Audio/Dialogue/Character/StrDexInt/Misc/SolidTrawl_10.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[126]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(742, 'FishChatHaku', '[]', 'Haku claims that long ago, one of his ancestors fished up an entire island. Quite the catch, if true.', 'Audio/Dialogue/Character/StrDexInt/Misc/SolidTrawl_6.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[126]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(743, 'FishChatZana', '[]', 'Zana has offered to take me to every corner of Wraeclast. I declined. I would miss my fish too much.', 'Audio/Dialogue/Character/StrDexInt/Misc/SolidTrawl_12.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[126]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(744, 'CrossroadsLoreChapel', '[]', 'Three lunari gone now, since it all began. Perhaps I am the only one who still looks upon Lunaris, who remembers her name. Soon, I will be gone and the moon will go on, alone.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
My husband has returned and he hunts for me. My dead husband hunts me. Corin too, and my uncle. Corpses rise and walk and feed. My girls, they walk now... and feed.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
God has forsaken us. Lunaris is my witness. Tonight, I return to my family.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
<italic>{-Tani}', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Tani/Tani_04.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[80]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(745, 'CrossroadsLoreWindmill', '[]', 'The moon was full the night of the black storm. It is full again.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
They have come for me. They have come for my daughters. Bravalo called out while the others skulked and muttered in the darkness. Corin went to them, arms open, welcoming. The nightmares told her to.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
My uncle tried to stop her. Bravalo crushed his skull with his smith''s hammer. I barred the doors and windows but they screamed like monkeys and beat themselves bloody trying to get in. ' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
I had no choice. I took my two youngest and fled through the cellar, following the tunnel to the mill.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
All we can do is hide and hope. God help us.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
<italic>{-Tani}', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Tani/Tani_03.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[81]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(746, 'CrossroadsLoreVilla', '[]', 'I haven''t slept. No one has slept. Not for three days, not since the black storm in the northern ranges. Not since the nightmares began.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Violent and twisted night terrors. They whisper to us, tempt us, threaten us, beguile us. They promise terrible things in return for even more terrible acts.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
My husband, Denirus, went to Alliston to find a doctor who might help. He should have been back yesterday. I fear for him. I fear for all of us.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
<italic>{-Tani}', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Tani/Tani_01.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[82]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(747, 'CrossroadsLoreVilla2', '[]', 'It has been a little over a week since the black storm.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
My husband has not returned and sickness now sweeps through our village. Many have died and those that lived have... changed.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
These were folk we once called neighbour and friend. Now they limp and stagger through the night, their deformities as grotesque as the madness in their eyes.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
<italic>{-Tani}', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Tani/Tani_02.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[83]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(748, 'HighgateNote', '[]', 'Captain Vincenti,' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
The Highgate holds the secret to the true origin of the gems. Cleanse the mountain of those Maraketh parasites and secure the entrance to those Mines.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Do not disappoint me, Vincenti. As you well know, my displeasure can change a man.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
-Piety', '', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[84]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(749, 'GeofriPlaque', '[]', 'On this day, the 2nd Sacrato of Verusi, 1334 IC, the Army of Purity remembers its most devout and beloved servant, Archbishop Geofri of Phrecia.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
As spoken by Geofri:' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
<i>{Only will and truth can prevail ' || char(13) || '
over the evil of our own kin.}' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
- High Templar Voll, commander of the Army of Purity', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Voll/Voll_GeofriAvenged.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[85]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(750, 'TallStones', '[]', 'We, the Court of Reckoning find you, Doedre Stamatis, guilty of the following transgressions against God:' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
<italic>{Perversion of God''s Creation' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Promotion of Heretical Beliefs' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Unlawful Enslavement of Eternal Citizens' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Torture of the Innocent' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Murder of the Servants of Purity}' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
For these most severe crimes, I do sentence Doedre Darktongue to burn at the stake till naught is left but ash. May her life serve as penance for the lives she has taken, and let Purity sweep away the dust of her deeds from our firmament.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
- High Templar Voll, Commander of the Army of Purity', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Voll/Voll_Purification_TheForest.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[86]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(751, 'DaressoStatue1', '[]', 'At age thirteen, carving knife in hand, I killed beasts for the amusement of the filthy. At fifteen, they thought me worthy to fight a fellow man.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
A butcher he was, twice as big and twice as stupid as I. I butchered the butcher and many like him, earned my way, kill by kill, out of the offal pit and into the Grand Arena.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
I thought I would find wealth and glory in the arena. I was wrong. I found something far more precious. My Lady Merveil.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/DaressoGlyph/Daresso_Statue_01.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[87]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(752, 'DaressoStatue2', '[]', 'I knelt in the sand of the Grand Arena, awaiting the killing blow. I raised my eyes to look upon my death.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Instead, I saw her. Merveil. Her beautiful eyes met mine, and I knew that she saw me too. I turned my opponent''s strike and killed the man with his own dagger. ' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Fighting had always been about survival. The primal instinct to kill or be killed. Now the fight became about something else. Love.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/DaressoGlyph/Daresso_Statue_02.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[88]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(753, 'DaressoStatue3', '[]', 'The previous King of Swords was a giant of a man, both faster and stronger than I. Yet I needed only look up at my Lady Merveil to know that I had no choice. I could not die this day.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
I made him shiver under every parry, striking with all my might, so that my arms felt they might snap with every impact. All the while, I studied his face, watching for that moment when he began to doubt. It took an hour, but finally it was there.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Burning with pain, empty with exhaustion, I stepped inside his faltering swing and I slit the giant''s throat.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
I did not take my victory bow. I knelt in the sand, looked to Merveil, and cried out for my Lady''s hand in marriage.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
From that day forth, I wore the Crown of Swords upon my head and a ring of eternal love upon my finger.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/DaressoGlyph/Daresso_Statue_03.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[89]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(754, 'OyunIntroduction1', '[4]', 'It is the path of blood and glory that leads you to our gate. We Maraketh understand this path, yet we fight for our tribe, our <i>{akhara}.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
You fight only for yourself, care only for yourself. That is your strength. Love breeds fear. You have no such weakness, and that is why you will kill the Beast within the mountain. Lady Dialla has told me this.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
She has much faith in you, Duelist. The question is... can we Maraketh share in her faith?', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Oyun/Oy01.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[102]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(755, 'OyunIntroduction2', '[5]', 'You walk to us upon the backs of the murdered. Though we are both forged upon the battlefield, we Maraketh are not like you.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
We fight for survival. You fight for ambition, and that is why you will understand the Beast within the mountain better than we do. That is why you will kill it. Lady Dialla has told me this.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
She has much faith in you, Shadow. The question is... can we Maraketh share in her faith?', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Oyun/Oy02.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[102]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(756, 'OyunIntroduction3', '[6]', 'Whether it is our gods or your god who have brought you to Highgate, the consequence is the same.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
You believe blindly in the divine, and a blind man is never lost in the darkness. You will kill the Beast within the mountain. Lady Dialla has told me this.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
She has much faith in you, Templar. The question is... can we Maraketh share in her faith?', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Oyun/Oy03.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[102]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(757, 'OyunIntroduction4', '[1]', 'You come to us, a woman like us, and yet nothing like us.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
While we cloak ourselves in tradition and war, you cloak yourself in thaumaturgy and fear, and that is why you will kill the Beast within the mountain. Lady Dialla has told me this.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
She has much faith in you, Witch. The question is... can we Maraketh share in her faith?', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Oyun/Oy04.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[102]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(758, 'OyunIntroduction5', '[0]', 'There was a time when Maraketh and Karui fought side by side against the forces of corruption.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
It would appear that the time has come to finish what we started together. With our help, you will kill the Beast within the mountain. Lady Dialla has told me this.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
She has much faith in you, Marauder. The question is... can we Maraketh share in her faith?', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Oyun/Oy05.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[102]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(759, 'OyunIntroduction6', '[3]', 'Although we two were born lands and cultures apart, I recognise a woman in kind. A woman who fights not only for her own survival, but for the survival of the wilderness she calls home.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Yet, you are not bound like us, to the thoughts and habits of tradition. That is why you will kill the Beast within the mountain. Lady Dialla has told me this.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
She has much faith in you, Ranger. The question is... can we Maraketh share in her faith?', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Oyun/Oy06.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[102]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(760, 'OyunIntroduction7', '[2]', 'I see a woman before me, a woman strong of body and mind. You have the bearing of a <i>{sekhema}, the poise of a warrior, yet... when I look into your eyes, I see nothing that I know.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
That is good. It takes the unknown to destroy the unknowable. That is why you will kill the Beast within the mountain. Lady Dialla has told me this.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
She has much faith in you, Scion. The question is... can we Maraketh share in her faith?', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Oyun/Oy07.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[102]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(761, 'OyunBannerQuest', '[]', 'Sekhema Deshret sealed the Mines, trapped the Nightmare within its black den.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
The Beast should never have been imprisoned. The Beast should have been destroyed, yet, for all her ferocity, it seemed that Deshret lacked the courage to do so.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
And now, after two centuries guarding this hole in the ground, this <i>{akhara} lacks the strength. But you are not Deshret, and you are not one of us. You will succeed where we have failed.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Deshret''s Banner will break the Seal and open the Mines. It was taken from her when she fell to Voll, the Brittle Emperor.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Take the stairs to the south-west, descend to the Dried Lake. You shall have no trouble finding the Brittle Emperor. You''ll smell him before you see him.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Bring Deshret''s Banner home, and you will be free to pass into the darkness as you wish.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Oyun/Oy10.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[102]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(762, 'OyunShownBanner', '[]', 'The wind carries the welcome aroma of shattered bones. It is good to see that you know how to fell even the monarchs of Nightmare.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Once you mount Deshret''s Banner upon the Mines'' entrance, Deshret''s seal will be broken, and the darkness will become your hunting ground.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Oyun/Oy11.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[102]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(763, 'OyunSealBroken', '[]', 'The gate is open, and the darkness calls. Good hunting, Curse-breaker.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Oyun/Oy12.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[102]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(764, 'OyunOnPetarusVanja', '[]', 'I will make allies of whomever I deem useful. We have observed the actions of both blackguard and exile, and it is Petarus and Vanja who give meaning to those actions.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
This <i>{akhara} has not mixed with other than its own for over two hundred years. The outside world has now discovered us, so it is time that we discovered it.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Oyun/Oy13.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[102]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(765, 'OyunOnKira', '[]', 'Kira has the blood of Deshret in her veins and the bonds of Deshret in her mind.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Her loyalty to her <i>{akhara} is admirable. Her loyalty to the past is not.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Oyun/Oy14.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[102]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(766, 'OyunOnTasuni', '[]', 'Tasuni has been corrupted since the day he was born.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Maraketh tradition would have it that such a warped child be left upon the moonlit plain for the gods to adopt. Tasuni was not taken by the gods that night.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Such a thing has never happened before in our <i>{akhara}. Now we know why.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Tasuni is a man caught between two worlds. Our world of light, and the Beast''s world of darkness. He is our scout in the black, and without him, Nightmare would remain beyond our understanding.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
And an enemy you cannot know is an enemy you cannot fight.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Oyun/Oy15.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[102]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(767, 'OyunOnDialla', '[]', 'Dialla wishes the Beast dead. But why? Why would a nightmare wish to kill a nightmare?' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
A question of great interest, yet little importance. It does not matter why the sun rises and sets, as long as it continues to do so.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Oyun/Oy16.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[102]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(768, 'OyunOnDeshret', '[]', 'The Maraketh once stood united under Deshret''s Banner. That was before the plagues, the tempests... the corruption.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Deshret rode here with this <i>{akhara}, the Kiyato, to put an end to the Beast''s curse. And upon the very threshold of the darkness she faltered.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Perhaps she saw that King Kaom had gone there before her and not returned. Or perhaps the nightmare simply overcame Deshret''s seemingly indomitable courage.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Either way, she chose not to ride into the mountain, to slay the Beast. She closed and sealed the Mines and committed this <i>{akhara} to Highgate''s guardianship.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
The tempests, the plagues... they passed. Of their own accord, or because of Deshret''s seal, we do not know.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
But what I do know is this. When Deshret vowed to watch over these Mines, she simply traded one curse for another.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Oyun/Oy17.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[102]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(769, 'OyunOnVoll', '[]', 'Voll and his ''unmen'' have dipped their fleshless claws into the lifeblood of the Maraketh since the day this <i>{akhara} tethered its rhoa here.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Such is the way with men of war. Remove their tongues, yet still they thirst for blood. Remove their bellies, yet still they hunger for battle. Remove their manhood, yet still they lust for conquest.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Oyun/Oy20.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[102]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(770, 'OyunDeshretQuest', '[]', 'Yes, Tasuni has informed me of Deshret''s existence within the Mines, but has been unable to tell me how she comes to be there. Another troubling hole in our knowledge of Nightmare.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Regardless of her origins, I will not risk my <i>{dekhara} in an attempt to free her. Even were she still flesh and blood, I would decide the same.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
She is our Sekhema no longer, and we have fulfilled our duty to her memory many times over. Kira will not agree, yet her revolt will rise only as words. I am her Sekhema and she will not cross me.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
So, free Deshret if the opportunity arises. It is only right that she be allowed to return to the dust of the Vastiri, but it would be wrong if any should follow her there.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Oyun/Oy18.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[102]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(771, 'OyunDeshretFreed', '[]', 'Thank you for doing Deshret so great an honour. Your generosity shall be remembered.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Oyun/Oy19.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[102]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(772, 'OyunOnKaom1', '[]', 'We read the land, learn its stories. Kaom and his warriors entered those Mines some twenty years before Deshret sealed the Mines and bound our <i>{akhara} to this mountain.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Neither soil nor stone speak of Kaom''s return. Perhaps he is dead, or perhaps he merely wishes he was. After Voll, anything seems possible.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Oyun/Oy21.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[102]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(773, 'OyunOnKaom2', '[]', 'We read the land, learn its stories. Kaom and his warriors entered those Mines some twenty years before Deshret sealed them and bound our <i>{akhara} to this mountain.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Neither soil nor stone speak of Kaom''s return. Now we know why. He became a monarch of Nightmare, like Voll before him. It seems the Beast has uses for those with a talent for conquest.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Oyun/Oy22.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[102]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(774, 'OyunOnKaomDead', '[]', 'I am told that you have put King Kaom down to his final rest.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Curse-breaker, and now the Murderer of Legends. Great names hatch upon you like ticks on a rhoa.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Oyun/Oy23.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[102]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(775, 'OyunOnDaresso', '[]', 'Daresso? Yes, Petarus has spoken of him. The disturbing question is this:' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
How does a man who, by all accounts, has been dead for over a hundred years end up as a Nightmare monarch in the bowels of Highgate?' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Unlike Kaom, there is utterly no trace of his passing, and we have scouted every footstep of this mountain and its surrounds. There is no other entrance. No physical entrance.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Deshret, and now this... Daresso. Yes, most disturbing.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Oyun/Oy24.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[102]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(776, 'OyunOnDiallaMissing', '[]', 'Dialla said but one thing to me before descending into the Mines: "My love awaits."' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
I know not why, but those three words frightened me more than any I have heard in my lifetime.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Oyun/Oy25.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[102]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(777, 'OyunOnWitheredDialla', '[]', 'Dialla''s hopes may be crushed, but ours still thrive... in you, Curse-breaker.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
From what Tasuni tells me, the Beast''s innards are now yours to penetrate. Dialla has served her purpose. Now comes the time for you to serve yours.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Find this Malachai that Dialla mutters about so incessantly. If my understanding is true, then he is the mind of the Beast. Kill him, and the body of Nightmare will die with him.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Oyun/Oy26.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[102]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(778, 'OyunOnMalachaiDead', '[]', 'I was right to have faith in you, Curse-breaker.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
You have succeeded where we have failed. You have slain a creature that was thought to live forever in the minds of those who came before you.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Voll, Daresso, Kaom, Deshret... the greatest champions Wraeclast has seen in the last three hundred years. You stood where they fell. Now you are the champion of champions, and Wraeclast should bow at your feet in gratitude.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
You certainly have my gratitude, and that of my <i>{akhara}. We have been exiled from our land by fear and misguided duty. Now we may return, to ride where we will, live how we wish.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Curse-breaker, Giver of Freedom... we thank you.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Oyun/Oy27.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[102]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(779, 'KiraIntroduction', '[]', 'We opened the gates to you for two reasons only. Dominus and Piety. They made themselves our enemies. You made them dead.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Now Oyun believes there is a third reason. The Beast is our enemy. Perhaps you can make it dead as well?', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Kira/Kira_Intro.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[101]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(780, 'KiraFirstMeeting1', '[1]', 'I have seen the look in Piety''s eyes. I see the look in your eyes, Witch. It is not as different as I had hoped.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
No matter. The knife in your hand is better than the spear in the rack.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Kira/Kira_Meet_Witch.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[101]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(781, 'KiraFirstMeeting2', '[3]', 'This land is a wounded animal, its torn flesh infected by Nightmare. Before you put this animal out of its misery, be sure, Ranger, to give thought to those who live on its back.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Kira/Kira_Meet_Ranger.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[101]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(782, 'KiraFirstMeeting3', '[6]', 'Dominus was High Templar in Oriath, was he not? Your God needs to be more careful when He chooses His servants.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Then again, perhaps He learns from His mistakes. We shall see.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Kira/Kira_Meet_Templar.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[101]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(783, 'KiraFirstMeeting4', '[5]', 'We Maraketh are tied to our <i>{akhara}, our tribe. You are a man who has cut his ties, Shadow. A man without restraint can achieve the greatest of deeds... and the worst.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Perhaps it is time to allow yourself to be lashed to something greater than simply <i>{you}.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Kira/Kira_Meet_Shadow.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[101]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(784, 'KiraFirstMeeting5', '[4]', 'Pride is a common flaw in men. We Maraketh beat such sickness out of our boys. Do you know why, Duelist? If left unchecked, pride becomes a plague.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
There is a cure, of course. It''s called ''devotion''.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Kira/Kira_Meet_Duelist.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[101]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(785, 'KiraFirstMeeting6', '[0]', 'The Maraketh and the Karui have fought side by side in the past. And side by side, we were lied to and used. History must not be allowed to repeat.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Let us share only the truth, Marauder, so that we may wipe our memories clean.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Kira/Kira_Meet_Marauder.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[101]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(786, 'KiraFirstMeeting7', '[2]', 'We Maraketh have a saying, Scion. "Only the night can understand the darkness. Only the sun can bring about the dawn."', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Kira/Kira_Meet_Scion.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[101]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(787, 'KiraOnMinesOpen', '[]', 'Deshret''s banner flies at the Mines'' entrance and now the darkness gapes, hungry and expectant.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Our Red Sekhema sealed that gate for a reason. Not simply to prevent the Beast from reaching out, but to hinder those fools who would disturb its slumber.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
And here you are, about to be swallowed by that darkness. Let us hope the Beast doesn''t notice your passing.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Kira/Kira_Mines_Opened.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[101]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(788, 'KiraOnTrading', '[]', 'Oyun has ordered me to help you, to trade with you.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
I have risked much to gather weapons and armour for this <i>{akhara}. I''ve scavenged on the fringes of Voll''s encampment, and scouted the Dead City.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Let us see if you can offer any value in return.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Kira/Kira_Trading.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[101]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(789, 'KiraOnVoll', '[]', 'I''ve led many a war party against Voll and his unmen, and I''ve seen too many of my <i>{dekhara} die. I shall look for your return, but I shall not expect it.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Kira/Kira_Voll.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[101]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(790, 'KiraOnVollDead', '[]', 'Hundreds of our <i>{dekhara} have fallen to Voll and his legion throughout the years. They died defending their <i>{akhara}.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Now Voll is gone, killed by an outsider. You bask in the glory, exile, while I honour the dead.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Kira/Kira_Voll_Dead.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[101]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(791, 'KiraOnPetarusVanja', '[]', 'As we give strength to the outside, we grow weaker on the inside. First, there was Petarus and Vanja. Now there is you.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
It shows how little faith Oyun has in us, in her own <i>{akhara}, that she would treat blackguards and exiles with such admiration.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Kira/Kira_Petarus_Vanja.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[101]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(792, 'KiraOnOyun', '[]', 'Oyun is my <I>{sekhema}, my commander. I am her <i>{dekhara}, her warrior. I defend this <i>{akhara} as Oyun sees fit.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Whether Oyun <i>{is} fit to see what is best for this tribe... it is not for me to say.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Kira/Kira_Oyun.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[101]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(793, 'KiraOnTasuni', '[]', 'My mother gave Tasuni to the gods. The gods gave him back, and I thank them for it, every day.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Given the choice, I would never have chosen Tasuni as my brother, but then, family is not about what you want, it is about what you need.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Kira/Kira_Tasuni.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[101]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(794, 'KiraOnDeshret', '[]', 'Deshret lies shackled in the darkness, while I, her blood, am shackled by duty to remain here. Oyun has decreed it. ' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Will it be you then who frees Deshret from her dishonour? Perhaps you will, perhaps you won''t. Either way, it is Deshret''s fate to suffer at the mercy of injustice.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Kira/Kira_Deshret.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[101]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(795, 'KiraOnDeshretFreed', '[]', 'Deshret has ascended and returned, as we all must, to the dust of Vastiri. The Red Sekhema''s dishonour has passed, and for that, outsider, I will always be grateful.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Yet honour lies not in <i>{whether} an act is committed. Honour lies in <i>{how} an act is committed. What does it say of the Maraketh when we are forbidden to attend to our own?' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
What does it say of Oyun and her belief in her own blood, our own honour?', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Kira/Kira_Deshret_Freed.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[101]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(796, 'KiraOnDialla', '[]', '"When a woman forgets how to die, a woman forgets how to live."' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Deshret said that to her <i>{dekhara} on the day she killed Titucius, Scourge of the Maraketh.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
<i>{I} say this of Dialla: When a woman knows nothing of life, how can she care for the living?', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Kira/Kira_Dialla.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[101]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(797, 'KiraOnWitheredDialla', '[]', 'The Gemling Queen has given of that black life of hers... for what? To wound and wake the Beast that should have been slaughtered in its sleep.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Dialla''s path would lead us into Cataclysm. Follow your own path from now on.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Kira/Kira_Dialla_Withered.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[101]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(798, 'KiraOnMalachaiDead1', '[1]', 'What cannot be understood should be feared. It is the first rule that a child learns.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
There is no shame in my saying this: I fear you, Witch.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Kira/Kira_Malachai_Dead_Witch.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[101]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(799, 'KiraOnMalachaiDead2', '[5]', 'You have slain the Nightmare for your own reasons, Shadow.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
It worries me that I don''t know what those reasons are. It would worry me even more if <i>{you} didn''t know either.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Kira/Kira_Malachai_Dead_Shadow.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[101]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(800, 'KiraOnMalachaiDead3', '[6]', 'What do we call you now? Saviour? Messiah?' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Just remember this, Templar. Your ''Faith'' didn''t kill the Nightmare. You did.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Kira/Kira_Malachai_Dead_Templar.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[101]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(801, 'KiraOnMalachaiDead4', '[3]', 'A predator is defined by its prey.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Now that your prey is dead, great hunter, what will become of you?', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Kira/Kira_Malachai_Dead_Kira.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[101]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(802, 'KiraOnMalachaiDead5', '[4]', 'The Beast is dead, and Wraeclast owes you its life. Is this the grand ending you were hoping for, Duelist?' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Yes, you must be very proud of yourself.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Kira/Kira_Malachai_Dead_Duelist.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[101]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(803, 'KiraOnMalachaiDead6', '[0]', 'I''ve never met a man more able, more ready, to take life and crush it in his hand.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Is there anything else you can do? If not, this land has something more it needs to worry about.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Kira/Kira_Malachai_Dead_Marauder.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[101]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(804, 'KiraOnMalachaiDead7', '[2]', 'The Nightmare is gone and my <i>{akhara} is free to return to the plains.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
We thank you, Lady of Oriath... but do not mistake our gratitude for debt.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Kira/Kira_Malachai_Dead_Scion.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[101]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(805, 'PetarusVanjaFirstMeeting1', '[5]', 'Petarus: I used to hunt your kind back in Theopolis, Shadow. I''ve seen what you do to people, and I know why you do it.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Vanja: ''Why'' stopped being a useful question the moment we set foot in Wraeclast, Petarus.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Petarus: Without the ''why'', what''s left?' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Vanja: ''How''... to survive. Please, Shadow, ignore Petarus.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/PetarusAndVanja/PetAndVan_01.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[103]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(806, 'PetarusVanjaFirstMeeting2', '[1]', 'Vanja: You are most welcome here, sister. What you did back there in Sarn, it was truly...' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Petarus: ...terrifying. Don''t get me wrong. Piety, the rest, they had it coming. But there''s no one like that here. These Maraketh, they''re good people.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Vanja: She knows that! Please, sister, ignore Petarus.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/PetarusAndVanja/PetAndVan_02.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[103]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(807, 'PetarusVanjaFirstMeeting3', '[6]', 'Petarus: My lord Templar, I can''t tell you how good it is to meet a man so willing and able to put the Order back on the road to Faith...' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Vanja: ...oh my god, Petarus!' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Petarus: Vanja!' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Vanja: I''ve just seen too many foul deeds done in the name of Faith.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Petarus: Committed by those who talked of God while they acted for themselves.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Vanja: Fine, Petarus, fine.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/PetarusAndVanja/PetAndVan_03.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[103]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(808, 'PetarusVanjaFirstMeeting4', '[4]', 'Petarus: I saw you fight, back in Theopolis. You were good. But what you did back there in Sarn, it was truly...' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Vanja: ...terrifying. Don''t misunderstand me. Piety, the rest, they deserved what they got. But there''s no one like that here. These Maraketh, they''re good people.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Petarus: He knows that, Vanja! ' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Vanja: I hope so, Petarus.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/PetarusAndVanja/PetAndVan_04.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[103]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(809, 'PetarusVanjaFirstMeeting5', '[3]', 'Vanja: It''s one thing to watch in awe as the she-wolf hunts, quite another to invite her to share your campfire. Wouldn''t you agree, Ranger?' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Petarus: No, she wouldn''t, Vanja, and neither do I.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Vanja: We both saw what she did in Sarn!' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Petarus: And we both know that Piety and the rest had it coming!' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Vanja: Fine, Petarus, fine.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/PetarusAndVanja/PetAndVan_05.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[103]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(810, 'PetarusVanjaFirstMeeting6', '[0]', 'Vanja: Talamoana, warrior. I can''t tell you how good it is to meet a man so willing and able to fight for...' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Petarus: Oh my god, Vanja!' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Vanja: Petarus!' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Petarus: I''ve seen the heads of too many friends dangling from Karui belts.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Vanja: <i>{Friends} whose orders were to clap slaver''s irons on as many Karui as they could get their filthy hands on. Please, Marauder, ignore Petarus.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/PetarusAndVanja/PetAndVan_06.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[103]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(811, 'PetarusVanjaFirstMeeting7', '[2]', 'Petarus: My lady, what you achieved back there in Sarn was truly...' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Vanja: ...terrifying. Don''t misunderstand me. Piety, the rest, they deserved what they got. But there''s no one like that here. These Maraketh, they''re good people.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Petarus: She knows that, Vanja!' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Vanja: I hope so, Petarus.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/PetarusAndVanja/PetAndVan_07.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[103]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(812, 'PetarusVanjaOnMines', '[]', 'Vanja: Emperor Voll is dead, for good this time.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Petarus: And the entrance to the Mines stands open. I suppose you''ll be heading down there to...' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Vanja: ...to free us from the sickening supremacy of Nightmare.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Petarus: I was going to say, ''to kick some nightmare arse''.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Vanja: I think I put it better.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Petarus: Of course you did, sweets.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/PetarusAndVanja/PetAndVan_08.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[103]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(813, 'PetarusVanjaOnHighgate', '[]', 'Petarus: My Grandfather was a captain in the Ebony Legion. My father too. And me. Just following the path that''d been laid out for me.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Vanja: Until you met me.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Petarus: Yes, until I met the most beautiful woman I''d ever seen.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Vanja: Behind bars. An exile waiting to become an experiment. Not quite how I imagined meeting the man of my dreams.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Petarus: I realised then that I wasn''t part of the Ebony Legion any more. I''d become a Blackguard, like every other damned legionnaire in Sarn, taking orders from a madman.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Vanja: Petarus freed me and led us here.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Petarus: I''d heard about the Maraketh from those few legionnaires who survived the assault on Highgate.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Vanja: And I talked them into harbouring us.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Petarus: Vanja can be very persuasive when she wants to be.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/PetarusAndVanja/PetAndVan_17.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[103]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(814, 'PetarusVanjaOnDialla', '[]', 'Petarus: Dialla was there when it all went bad. If anyone can help put things right, it''s...' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Vanja: ...why would she? Wraeclast has been like this for almost three hundred years. What''s made her want to do something about it now?' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Petarus: She''s the Gemling Queen, Vanja! There''s no way we could understand what goes on in that mind of hers. ' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Vanja: I know, and that''s precisely what worries me.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/PetarusAndVanja/PetAndVan_09.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[103]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(815, 'PetarusVanjaOnKira', '[]', 'Vanja: Kira is a racist bully with that fancy hair crest of hers stuck so far up her...' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Petarus: ...come on, Vanja, she''s a warrior. It''s not her job to be nice. It''s her job to defend...' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Vanja: ...look all lithe and sweaty when you''re watching her train? That''s the only ''job'' you''re interested in.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Petarus: I''m studying the Maraketh fighting style!' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Vanja: Sure you are, sweetie.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/PetarusAndVanja/PetAndVan_11.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[103]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(816, 'PetarusVanjaOnOyun', '[]', 'Vanja: Oyun gave us a home...' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Petarus: ...our lives back.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Vanja: Appreciate the good ones when you find them in Wraeclast.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Petarus: It''s not like there are many.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/PetarusAndVanja/PetAndVan_12.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[103]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(817, 'PetarusVanjaOnTasuni', '[]', 'Petarus: Tasuni? He''s a conman.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Vanja: Petarus just doesn''t understand him.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Petarus: I understand that he gets his every need catered for by talking in riddles and telling lies...' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Vanja: ...the truth about the Nightmare. He makes sense of the chaos, as best he can.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Petarus: How can we possibly know whether what he''s telling us is the truth or not?' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Vanja: We can''t. But who else is there to ask?', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/PetarusAndVanja/PetAndVan_13.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[103]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(818, 'PetarusVanjaOnTrading', '[]', 'Vanja: We''ve a few bits and pieces lying about that might help with what''s to come.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Petarus: "Bits and pieces?" I risked my neck to salvage those artefacts!' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Vanja: I know, sweetie, and I really appreciate your... artefacts.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Petarus: You didn''t say that when I brought them in. You said, "Is that all?"' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Vanja: You''d been gone for ages!' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Petarus: And you think <i>{you} could do a quicker job of it?' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Vanja: Yes, if you''d let me, yes!' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Petarus: No. Not for all the jewellery in the world. What if I lost you?' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Vanja: Ok. I''m sorry. We have charms and regalia, sourced at great risk from some of the most dangerous places in Wraeclast. Better?' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Petarus: Yes. Thank you.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/PetarusAndVanja/PetAndVan_15.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[103]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(819, 'PetarusVanjaOnPiety', '[]', 'Vanja: Piety... she still lives?' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Petarus: Then she needs to die <i>{again}...' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Vanja: ...<i>{permanently} this time. I honestly don''t know who I''m more scared of, the Beast or that black-hearted Witch!' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Petarus: It''s the combination that scares me, and it should scare you too, exile.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/PetarusAndVanja/PetAndVan_16.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[103]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(820, 'PetarusVanjaOnBeast', '[]', 'Vanja: I''d heard of the Beast before coming here. Piety talked about it. I suppose she saw no point in keeping secrets from the people she was planning to murder.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Petarus: I''m so sorry, Vanja.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Vanja: God, it''s not your fault, Petarus! Piety used to say that the Beast was the source of her power, how she managed to turn poor men and women into those... things. She kept using a phrase... what was it?' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Petarus: Universal transmogrification. I heard her assistants talk about it, too.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Vanja: The power to change the world into anything you like.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Petarus: Bloody scary power in the hands of someone like Piety.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Vanja: Bloody scary power, full stop!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/PetarusAndVanja/PetAndVan_14.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[103]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(821, 'PetarusVanjaOnDaresso', '[]', 'Petarus: Daresso? He''s down there, inside the mountain?' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Vanja: Are we talking about <i>{the} Daresso? The Sword King?' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Petarus: Seems like it. But... how did he get in there? He left Oriath about a century and a half ago, hoping to find a cure for his lady, Merveil. He would have had to fight his way through the Maraketh, but... Oyun''s never mentioned anything of the sort.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Vanja: Maybe he didn''t go in alive.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Petarus: What do you mean?' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Vanja: We live in a land where the dead walk and <i>{things} like Dialla live for centuries.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Petarus: You think he died somewhere else and then the Beast got hold of him?' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Vanja: Could be.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Petarus: Well, if the Beast can do that, then... what bloody good was Deshret''s Seal?' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Vanja: Exactly.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/PetarusAndVanja/PetAndVan_18.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[103]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(822, 'PetarusVanjaOnDaressoDead', '[]', 'Petarus: You killed the Sword King?' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Vanja: Daresso wasn''t <i>{actually} alive, Petarus.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Petarus: Daresso must have thought he was alive.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Vanja: True. Thinking and being... a bit of a blurred line here in Wraeclast.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Petarus: Exactly.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/PetarusAndVanja/PetAndVan_19.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[103]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(823, 'PetarusVanjaOnWitheredDialla', '[]', 'Petarus: Dialla saw the mistakes of the past with her own eyes, and now she''s given everything to fix them. Right, Vanja?' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Vanja: I don''t know, Petarus. I saw people die for each other in Sarn. I saw clarity, resolution in their eyes. In Dialla''s eyes... I see ghosts.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Petarus: Those eyes have seen horrors that we can''t even imagine.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Vanja: Maybe, but this ''sacrifice'' of hers? I think it was more like a <i>{deal} and Dialla didn''t quite get what she''d bargained for.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/PetarusAndVanja/PetAndVan_10.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[103]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(824, 'PetarusVanjaOnMalachaiDead1', '[1]', 'Petarus: It''s obvious to everyone now.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Vanja: There''s no one like you, Witch.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Petarus: The Beast learned that the hard way...' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Vanja: ...and the whole of Wraeclast will learn about it, one way or another.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Petarus: So, I guess this is the happily-ever-after they promised us when we were kids, right, Vanja?' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Vanja: For us, for Wraeclast... maybe. What about you, sister? Do you even know what that looks like for you?' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Petarus: There''s plenty of happiness to go around now.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Vanja: You deserve a piece of it.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/PetarusAndVanja/PetAndVan_20.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[103]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(825, 'PetarusVanjaOnMalachaiDead2', '[4]', 'Petarus: There''s no arena, no trophy, no accolade, no title...' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Vanja: ...no end to what Petarus could spout in your honour.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Petarus: In this case, I think it''s all right to do so for a bit, don''t you? We''re standing in the presence of the greatest Duelist that ever lived.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Vanja: For once, I actually agree with him.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Petarus: You''ve done more than attain glory, Duelist. You''ve saved the entire bloody world!' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Vanja: We needed a hero and you rose to the occasion. Thank you.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/PetarusAndVanja/PetAndVan_21.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[103]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(826, 'PetarusVanjaOnMalachaiDead3', '[6]', 'Petarus: I am proud to be part of the Order. Your order, my Lord.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Vanja: And I am sorry. I should have had more Faith. I''ve always believed in God. It''s just that, until now, I didn''t think the Templar did.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Petarus: I guess sometimes it takes a miracle, something to prove that we''re not on our own in this world.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Vanja: True. Thank you, Templar, for reminding me what it''s like to believe. It''s a luxury that I haven''t been able to afford.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Petarus: Yet it''s something that all of Wraeclast can have now.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/PetarusAndVanja/PetAndVan_22.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[103]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(827, 'PetarusVanjaOnMalachaiDead4', '[0]', 'Vanja: I am proud to know you, Karui.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Petarus: And I''m sorry. I should have been less hasty...' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Vanja: ...bigoted?' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Petarus: <i>{Quick to judge}, but, then... Wraeclast tends to bring that out in people. Quick to judge or quick to die... it''s been that way for far too long.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Vanja: But thanks to our warrior here, that could all begin to change.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Petarus: Dominus is gone. The Beast is gone. Feels like we can all start again now.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Vanja: Oriathan and Karui, everyone. Thanks to you.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/PetarusAndVanja/PetAndVan_23.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[103]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(828, 'PetarusVanjaOnMalachaiDead5', '[2]', 'Petarus: We are in your debt, my Lady, and soon enough all of Wraeclast will understand the thanks it owes you.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Vanja: You''re actually the first highborn woman I''ve ever met who <i>{deserves} to be called ''my Lady''.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Petarus: Vanja!' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Vanja: It''s true and she knows it. Leadership isn''t about power, it''s about responsibility, and this Lady took the burden from the entire world.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Petarus: Well said, Vanja!' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Vanja: It''d pay for Petarus to listen to me more often, but when it comes to you, Scion, I''m glad he didn''t.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/PetarusAndVanja/PetAndVan_24.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[103]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(829, 'PetarusVanjaOnMalachaiDead6', '[3]', 'Vanja: You are indeed a wonder, mountain cat.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Petarus: Oh, so she''s allowed to share our campfire now, is she?' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Vanja: I can admit when I''m wrong.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Petarus: Sure, someone just has to save the world before you do it.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Vanja: A girl''s got to have standards, Petarus.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Petarus: Well, I think it''s safe to say, Vanja, that our Ranger here has managed to set a whole new standard. One that the whole of Wraeclast will need to live up to.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Vanja: I''m happy to say that I think you''re right, Petarus. So utterly, wonderfully, right.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/PetarusAndVanja/PetAndVan_25.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[103]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(830, 'PetarusVanjaOnMalachaiDead7', '[5]', 'Vanja: I thought you were going to teach us how to survive, Shadow. Instead, you''ve given us all the chance to far more than just that. You''ve given us a chance to live.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Petarus: Yes... maybe I was wrong about you.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Vanja: Maybe?' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Petarus: Completely and utterly wrong, and happy for it. How''s that?' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Vanja: Perfect.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Petarus: And what''s next for you, Shadow? You''ve committed the greatest murder in the history of Wraeclast. How will you top that?' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Vanja: He''s a resourceful man, Petarus. He''ll figure something out.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/PetarusAndVanja/PetAndVan_26.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[103]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(831, 'TasuniGreeting1', '[5]', 'I understand that you like to be called a ''shadow''. An interesting thing about shadows: they are strongest in the day and are utterly consumed by the night.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
There won''t be much daylight where you are going.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Tasuni/T02.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[110]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(832, 'TasuniGreeting2', '[6]', 'Your holy mantle is stained with the blood of the countless, Templar. A sacrifice worthy of a God... just not to the god you had in mind.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Tasuni/T03.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[110]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(833, 'TasuniGreeting3', '[3]', 'Your path is as forked the viper''s tongue, Ranger. Are you the hunting animal or are you the thinking, feeling woman? Yes, you love the wilderness, but that does not make you wild.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Tasuni/T04.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[110]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(834, 'TasuniGreeting4', '[1]', 'I stare into the eyes of madness, Witch. I see a hunger for power that Nightmare would most generously satiate, should you choose to ask it.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Tasuni/T05.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[110]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(835, 'TasuniGreeting5', '[4]', 'You have bled and you have murdered, Duelist. Why? For your precious glory? And where are you now? At the end of a world on the brink of extinction. Glorious!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Tasuni/T06.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[110]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(836, 'TasuniGreeting6', '[0]', 'Kaom''s Way took him down into the darkest of nightmares. Have you asked your Ancestors if that''s really where the Karui Way leads?', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Tasuni/T07.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[110]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(837, 'TasuniGreeting7', '[2]', 'There are few who understand the enormity of Nightmare. That kind of mind, that you and I both possess, are as rare as rhoa''s teeth. All the answers, Scion, are in that beautiful skull of yours.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Tasuni/T08.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[110]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(838, 'TasuniIntroduction', '[]', 'I am Tasuni, he who peers into the gloom, who hears the black hearts that thunder within the mountain deep.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
If you seek enlightenment, find a torch. If you seek to understand the Nightmare, I can help feel your way through the darkness.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Tasuni/T01.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[110]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(839, 'TasuniOnOyun', '[]', 'The Maraketh are stranded in the sandstorm of reflection and regret. We look to our Sekhema to lead us out, yet the sandstorm is all she knows.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
She needs me, her eyes and ears in the darkness, but she will never comprehend my gifts.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Tasuni/T09.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[110]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(840, 'TasuniOnDialla', '[]', 'Dialla has the <i>{form} of a woman, yet the substance is one part corruption and nine parts death.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
One day soon, you will see how lifeless she truly is.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Tasuni/T10.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[110]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(841, 'TasuniOnWitheredDialla', '[]', 'When a boil is fat with infection, it glistens with the lustre of false youth. Lance that boil and it weeps its corruption away and shrivels to nothing.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Whether by purpose or desire, you are the physician who has revealed Dialla''s truest nature.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Tasuni/T11.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[110]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(842, 'TasuniOnKira', '[]', 'Kira rides more swiftly and strikes more truly than any other <i>{dekhara} here. If only she could learn to think as swiftly as she rides and speak as truly as she strikes.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Better and worse are judged not on the talents one prizes, but the talents one needs.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Tasuni/T12.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[110]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(843, 'TasuniOnPetarusVanja', '[]', 'Petarus and Vanja. Two mouths that speak from one mind.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
When together, they express some quite interesting thoughts. When apart, well... half a thought isn''t really even a thought, is it?', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Tasuni/T13.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[110]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(844, 'TasuniOnVoll', '[]', 'The Maraketh speak of his betrayal, but Voll did what he thought was necessary to destroy the Beast.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Now he wanders the desiccation, tortured as much by his failure as by Nightmare.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Tasuni/T14.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[110]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(845, 'TasuniOnVollDead', '[]', 'In destroying Voll, you have avenged many a pretty, bloodied nose around here.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Well done, you.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Tasuni/T15.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[110]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(846, 'TasuniOnDaresso', '[]', 'Nightmare is not without sophistication.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
In life, Daresso was tortured by frustration and shame. In death, Nightmare has erased his past and forged a dream world in which Daresso would remain contented and loved.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
What if Nightmare could do that for all of us? Would we really wish to destroy it then?', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Tasuni/T16.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[110]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(847, 'TasuniOnDaressoDead', '[]', 'Daresso was always a good man at heart, chained to an eternity of love and triumph.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
You set him free.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Tasuni/T17.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[110]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(848, 'TasuniOnDeshret', '[]', 'The Red Sekhema was the woman who forged what it meant to be ''Maraketh'', a people united, strong. Deshret lit fires in the hearts of women and loins of men. When she fell, so did the Maraketh. We''ve been falling ever since.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Tasuni/T18.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[110]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(849, 'TasuniOnKaom', '[]', 'My understanding of Kaom, the man, is that he was a prisoner of his own delusions. Now? He is a prisoner of someone else''s.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
The power of Nightmare to manipulate the soul never ceases to impress me.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
That could be you one day, should you continue to follow this dark and winding path.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Tasuni/T19.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[110]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(850, 'TasuniOnKaomDead', '[]', 'Nightmare gave Kaom everything he ever dreamed of. How did it feel to make that dream die?', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Tasuni/T20.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[110]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(851, 'TasuniOnTheBeast', '[]', 'Beneath your feet, Creation shivers and writhes. It yearns for transformation like a worm in a cocoon that dreams of wings and freedom. A transformation that only the Beast can excite.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
A dark God of ancient sacrifice, a muse to the twisted and vile... the Beast, the Nightmare, the Darkness... names given to it by mortals that think with slugs bound in shells of bone.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Yet, one man knew the Beast''s true name, understood its impenetrable nature.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Malachai.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Tasuni/T21.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[110]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(852, 'TasuniOnGhasts', '[]', 'Upon death, our bodies return to the ground. Those that are marked with darkness nourish the corruption. Those that were mighty in life are stolen away.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
They are carved and crafted, manipulated with malevolent creativity into becoming Malachai''s servants. Forged into Ghasts of pure Nightmare.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Tasuni/T22.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[110]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(853, 'TasuniSealBroken', '[]', 'The gate is open, and now I hear her voice as clearly as if she were sitting right here with me.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Words of a dead woman, reverberating up from the depths of Highgate. A spirit chained, yet not enslaved. Tortured, yet unbroken.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
That dead woman is Deshret, and our Red Sekhema longs to return to the dust of her Vastiri. Free her, and I shall reward you as my gifts allow.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Tasuni/T23.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[110]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(854, 'TasuniDeshretFreed', '[]', 'I felt it, <i>{saw} it... the storm of her release. Our Red Sekhema is free to mingle once more with the red earth of our birthplace.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Deshret was the howling wind, the lash and bite of the driving dust. Our wild Vastiri is weakened by her absence no longer.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
You''ve done yourself proud today, exile. Righted a wrong that we Maraketh have borne for far too long.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
And of course, as promised, you shall be rewarded.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Tasuni/T24.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[110]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(855, 'TasuniOnMalachai', '[]', 'Malachai is what every Ghast aspires to be. The hands and eyes, the voice and mind of the Beast itself.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
I see him in my dreams, forming his designs, crafting his tools, refining the chaos of nightmare into a vision. A future that you and I would not recognise.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
That neither you or I belong to unless, of course, we choose to accept the dark embrace.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
This is Malachai''s greatest work. An act of invention like none other. Should he succeed, he will awaken the Beast.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
What then? The Beast is not Death. Life will go on. A life like nothing we have seen before.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Tasuni/T25.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[110]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(856, 'TasuniOnCataclysm', '[]', 'Ghasts have no use for words. To speak in nightmare is to speak in emotion and image... in thought.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
I see and feel the darkness, and that is how I know that the cataclysm was no accident. Its images are far too rich with intention, far too steeped in satisfaction.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Malachai''s satisfaction. Malachai devastated my people, destroyed the Eternal Empire, for one reason. To put himself right where he is now, within the Black Heart of the Beast.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Tasuni/T26.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[110]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(857, 'TasuniOnGodlessThree', '[]', 'Malachai''s apprentices. Shavronne of Umbra, Doedre Darktongue and Inquisitor Maligaro. You''ll find no more devoted servants in all of Nightmare. In life, they were the three finest forgers of corruption in the Empire.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
I''m inclined to agree with Malachai on this one. It would have been such a waste to let them languish in death.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Poor Deshret. Each had their wicked way with her, you see, their turn at trying to subsume Deshret into the collective corruption. Ingenious, they are. True artists. Had Deshret been in possession of an imagination, they might well have succeeded in creating a Ghast of her. Fortunately for us, Deshret never had such a faculty.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Tasuni/T27.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[110]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(858, 'TasuniOnGodlessThreeDead', '[]', 'If Deshret were able, she''d thank you for dispatching her tormentors, Malachai''s wicked little trio. You''ll have to content yourself with my thanks, instead. Deshret has been avenged, as is the way of the Maraketh. Tidiness helps one sleep at night, don''t you think?', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Tasuni/T28.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[110]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(859, 'TasuniOnMalachaiDead1', '[5]', 'It took a Shadow to destroy the darkness. The progeny of light, bound to obey the candle whether he likes it or not.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
I know that''s not quite what you expected to hear but then the expected is not always what''s needed. You have come to the end of the world, and now you need to return to the beginning. ' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Oriath. Upon the mountain high, a gateway has opened, one that shall lead you back home. Hurry, for as the death throes of the Beast soften and still, I see the gate beginning to close. ' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Follow the light, for that''s what Shadows do, don''t they?', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Tasuni/T29.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[110]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(860, 'TasuniOnMalachaiDead2', '[1]', 'Ah, Witch. I knew you would embrace the Beast. Yet I couldn''t know that you would squeeze the very life from it. Honestly didn''t think you had that much love in you.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Now one thing remains to be seen. Your regard, your touch, your embrace... can mean only doom for the loved. Please, choose your loves wisely, Witch, lest you break poor Oriath''s heart.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Yes, that''s right. Oriath. Upon the mountain high, a gateway has opened, one that shall lead you back home. Hurry, for as the death throes of the Beast soften and still, I see the gate beginning to close. ' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Follow your heart, Witch, no matter how dark it becomes.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Tasuni/T30.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[110]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(861, 'TasuniOnMalachaiDead3', '[4]', 'You are a confusing creature, Duelist. Your heart beats for no one but yourself yet you have committed the greatest and most selfless of acts. Was it an act of the heart or merely... an act? ' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Regardless, you may now stride heroically into the sunset, back to your grand arena.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Yes, in Oriath. Upon the mountain high, a gateway has opened, one that shall lead you back home. Hurry, for as the death throes of Beast soften and still, I see the gate beginning to close. ' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Ever pursue your glory, Duelist, lest you be forgotten.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Tasuni/T31.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[110]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(862, 'TasuniOnMalachaiDead4', '[6]', 'You''re going to tell me that you didn''t kill the Beast, that it was simply your God acting through you. Please don''t. I fear I might be ill upon your self-righteous toes.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
No, Templar. You did this. The oh-so-ordinary man who shall be heralded as ''the chosen one'' by the adoring sheep of Oriath.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Yes, Oriath. Upon the mountain high, a gateway has opened, one that shall lead you back to your flock. Hurry, for as the death throes of Beast soften and still, I see the gate beginning to close. ' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Continue to believe in those lies, Templar. It brings out the best in you.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Tasuni/T32.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[110]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(863, 'TasuniOnMalachaiDead5', '[3]', 'For a lover of nature, Ranger, you surely know how to destroy it. Yes, you can argue, that the Beast was beyond nature, unnatural to its blackened core. I won''t believe you though. It <i>{died} after all. Quite a natural thing to do, wouldn''t you say?' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Something to think about on your way back to Oriath, Ranger.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Yes, Oriath. Upon the mountain high, a gateway has opened, one that shall lead you back home. Hurry, for as the death throes of Beast soften and still, I see the gate beginning to close. ' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Continue your wild ways, Ranger. They seem to come so... naturally.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Tasuni/T33.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[110]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(864, 'TasuniOnMalachaiDead6', '[0]', 'I''m sure your Ancestors are very proud of you, Marauder. Yet also rather... confused. For even the great and powerful Beast could not slay you! And if you can''t be killed then how will you ever sit at your Ancestors'' table?' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Quite a conundrum that. Something to mull over on your way back to Oriath.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Yes, Oriath. Upon the mountain high, a gateway has opened, one that shall lead you back to where it all began. Hurry, for as the death throes of Beast soften and still, I see the gate beginning to close. ' || char(13) || '
 ' || char(13) || '
No one ever said that the Karui Way was an easy way, Marauder.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Tasuni/T34.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[110]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(865, 'TasuniOnMalachaiDead7', '[2]', 'You had no idea who you were when you left Oriath, did you? A slave to the names others gave you. So you went ahead and forged yourself anew. Bane of Nightmare, Purger of Corruption.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
But that leaves us with a rather tricky question, doesn''t it? Who are you, when everything you have lived for is gone? Perhaps the answer awaits you in Oriath.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Yes, Oriath. Upon the mountain high, a gateway has opened, one that shall lead you back home. Hurry, for as the death throes of Beast soften and still, I see the gate beginning to close. ' || char(13) || '
 ' || char(13) || '
So many questions, Scion. Yet the answer is so often the same.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Tasuni/T35.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[110]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(866, 'MalachaiGlyphNotebook', '[]', 'The Rapture Device has absorbed its fill of harvested life from Fury and Desire. It is ready.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
So am I.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
I know now that I was born to be the end and the beginning of the Empire. The Beast has made this clear to me. As clear and undeniable as the sacrifice I must now make.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
My Lady Dialla, my love, my life''s greatest achievement. She must leave me now, for she cannot follow and she will perish if she remains.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
And so I will ask of her more than she would ever give. I will betray her. I will break her heart so that I do not break her soul.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/MalachaiGlyph/M09_Notebook_Rapture.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[99]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(867, 'MalachaiGlyphSkinscrawl', '[]', 'On this day, the eve of this Rapture''s completion, I honour those who have passed and whose passion and knowledge have brought us to the brink of salvation.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Inquisitor Maligaro, a creative force without equal.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Shavronne of Umbra, an aesthete of transcendent sensibility.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Doedre Darktongue, an idol of fervor and dedication.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
You taught me far more than I ever taught you, my students... my friends. We strove to make a greater world together and, in your memory, I shall make that world a reality.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Malachai', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/MalachaiGlyph/M10_Notebook_Harvest.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[100]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(868, 'KaomCarving1', '[]', 'I dreamed of my Ancestors'' halls. They were empty.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
I dreamed of the north, of an offering left to us by Tukohama, an offering that will save the Karui. I needed only to take it.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
I gathered my finest five hundred. I brought them here. I claimed what Tukohama had promised me.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/KaomGlyph/KaomCarving1.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[90]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(869, 'KaomCarving2', '[]', 'We crushed the servants of Kitava beneath our heels as we marched across the land. I allowed not one of my five hundred to fall. The blood of the Ancestors surged in our veins and each and every one of my warriors earned Tukohama''s mark upon their skin. ' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
We descended into the heart of Wraeclast, and there He came to me. Tukohama. He asked of me a sacrifice. I gave it willingly. My axe fell five hundred times, the jade drinking its fill of Karui blood. ' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Tukohama was pleased.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/KaomGlyph/KaomCarving2.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[91]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(870, 'KaomCarving3', '[]', 'The Eternals opened the gate and invited Kitava into this land. The Karui paid the price.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Kitava cut us off from the Ancestors, raised the Remembered as His children, tortured our dreams.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Kitava murdered the Karui Way. I will found a new Way, for I have been chosen. I gather my forces so that I might wage war on Kitava. I am the son of Tukohama, and I will lead the Karui back to glory.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/KaomGlyph/KaomCarving3.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[92]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(871, 'KaomCarving4', '[]', 'The moment your skin touched the corrupted soil of Wraeclast, you were infected. Kitava has soaked this land in his filth. I will crush the corruption from your bones, drain your black blood upon this sacred ground.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Brothers and sisters, I honour you with a warrior''s death. Your spirits will fight by my side when we march against Kitava. You will be given in service to Tukohama.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
You will be remembered with glory.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/KaomGlyph/KaomCarving4.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[93]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(872, 'VollDriedLakeStoryGlyph', '[]', 'I vowed to "care for this empire with my eyes open". I lied to my people. I lied to myself. Blinded by my lust for ''purity'', I placed my faith in the most corrupt of men.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
I watch now as my legion dies, their flesh melting from their twisted bones. They fall... and rise. A tide of mortal death and eternal damnation.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
I feel it now in my own flesh. The heat. The corruption.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
I have failed you, my Empire of Purity. Do not forgive me but please, I beg of you, survive me.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
<italic>{-Voll}', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Voll/Voll_Glyph_FinalWords.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[98]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(873, 'KaomFightIntroRandom', '[]', 'The Black Spirit walks amongst us.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Kaom/KaomPreFight1.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[34]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(874, 'KaomFightIntro2', '[]', 'The Black Spirit walks amongst us.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Kaom/KaomPreFight1b.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[34]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(875, 'KaomFightIntro3', '[]', 'Death will save you!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Kaom/KaomPreFight2.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[34]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(876, 'KaomFightIntro4', '[]', 'Death will save you!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Kaom/KaomPreFight2b.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[34]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(877, 'KaomFightIntro5', '[]', 'Join your Ancestors!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Kaom/KaomPreFight3.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[34]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(878, 'KaomFightIntro6', '[]', 'Join your Ancestors!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Kaom/KaomPreFight3b.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[34]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(879, 'KaomFightIntro7', '[]', 'Another head for my belt.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Kaom/KaomPreFight4.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[34]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(880, 'KaomFightIntro8', '[]', 'Another head for my belt.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Kaom/KaomPreFight4b.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[34]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(881, 'MaligaroFightIntroRandom', '[]', 'Exquisite!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Maligaro/Maligaro_01.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[35]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(882, 'MaligaroFightIntro2', '[]', 'Dissection time!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Maligaro/Maligaro_02.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[35]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(883, 'MaligaroFightIntro3', '[]', 'A body... to kill for!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Maligaro/Maligaro_03.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[35]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(884, 'MaligaroDeathRandom', '[]', 'You have murdered... an artist...', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Maligaro/Maligaro_07.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[35]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(885, 'MaligaroDeath2', '[]', 'I could have made you... into a wonder...', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Maligaro/Maligaro_08.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[35]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(886, 'MaligaroDeath3', '[]', 'You are the greatest form... I never sculpted...', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Maligaro/Maligaro_09.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[35]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(887, 'ShavronneFightIntroRandom', '[]', 'Now you are simply gorgeous!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Shavronne/S01.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[36]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(888, 'ShavronneFightIntro2', '[]', 'You will make such lovely material!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Shavronne/S02.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[36]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(889, 'ShavronneFightIntro3', '[]', 'I shall preserve your beauty for eternity!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Shavronne/S03.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[36]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(890, 'Daresso1Intro', '[]', 'I am Daresso, the Sword King. It was here, in the pits of Theopolis that I made my name, killing rabid dogs and wild boars before I could even be considered a man. In this so glorious of arenas, I care nothing for your past, only your future... and for that, you will have to fight!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/DaressoGod/Daresso_Realm1_Intro.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[38]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(891, 'Daresso1Combat', '[]', 'People of the gutters, steel your bellies, for the slaughter is at hand!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/DaressoGod/Daresso_Realm1_Combat.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[38]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(892, 'Daresso1Complete', '[]', 'An adequate performance, challenger, if a little messy. Yet Barkhul and his stinking flock were simply an audition. Let us see how you fare in the Grand Arena of Theopolis!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/DaressoGod/Daresso_Realm1_Complete.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[38]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(893, 'Daresso2Intro', '[]', 'Welcome to the Grand Arena of Theopolis. It is here that I first laid eyes upon my true purpose, my lady Merveil. It is our inspiration that defines us. What do you fight for, Gladiator? Hundreds of warriors tried to lay claim to the same title as I, but I defeated them all. Victory goes not to the able, but to the ambitious.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/DaressoGod/Daresso_Realm2_Intro.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[38]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(894, 'Daresso2Combat', '[]', 'Die a death worthy of applause, Gladiator!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/DaressoGod/Daresso_Realm2_Combat.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[38]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(895, 'Daresso2Complete', '[]', 'A battle worthy of song! The way you fight reminds me of how it feels to be possessed with the ideal of victory. Is your passion enough to claim a crown? We shall see.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/DaressoGod/Daresso_Realm2_Complete.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[38]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(896, 'Daresso3Intro', '[]', 'A King of Swords is nothing if he cannot defend his crown.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Daresso/Daresso_Realm3_Intro.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[38]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(897, 'DaressoDeath', '[]', 'Sing for me, Merveil. Sing of glory and love...', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Daresso/Daresso_Death_Speech.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[38]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(898, 'BrutusIntroRandom', '[]', 'Your frightened heart echoes from these stones.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Brute/Intro/Brutus_YourFrightened_01.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[7]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(899, 'BrutusIntro2', '[]', 'Your frightened heart echoes from these stones.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Brute/Intro/Brutus_YourFrightened_02.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[7]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(900, 'BrutusIntro3', '[]', 'Your crime is trespass. Your sentence is death!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Brute/Intro/Brutus_YourCrime_01.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[7]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(901, 'BrutusIntro4', '[]', 'Your crime is trespass. Your sentence is death!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Brute/Intro/Brutus_YourCrime_02.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[7]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(902, 'BrutusIntro5', '[]', 'You will know my misery. Come and share it with me.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Brute/Intro/Brutus_YouWillKnow_01.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[7]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(903, 'BrutusIntro6', '[]', 'You think me a horror? I will show you what true horror is...', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Brute/Intro/Brutus_YouThinkme_01.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[7]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(904, 'BrutusIntro7', '[]', 'You think me a horror? I will show you what true horror is...', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Brute/Intro/Brutus_YouThinkme_02.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[7]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(905, 'BrutusChainRandom', '[]', 'Come.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BruteCombat/Brutus_Come_01.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[7]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(906, 'BrutusChain2', '[]', 'Come.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BruteCombat/Brutus_Come_02.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[7]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(907, 'BrutusChain3', '[]', 'Come.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BruteCombat/Brutus_Come_03.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[7]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(908, 'BrutusChain4', '[]', 'Let me embrace you.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BruteCombat/Brutus_LetMeEmbraceYou_01.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[7]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(909, 'BrutusChain5', '[]', 'Let me embrace you.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BruteCombat/Brutus_LetMeEmbraceYou_02.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[7]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(910, 'BrutusChain6', '[]', 'Let me embrace you.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BruteCombat/Brutus_LetMeEmbraceYou_03.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[7]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(911, 'MalachaiIntro1', '[1]', 'I have been expecting you, Witch. You and I are about to create the most beautiful of Nightmares together. Will you go to bed now, little girl? Or do I need to tuck you in?', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Malachai/M12_Intro_Witch_Mono.ogg', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/MalachaiS/M12_Intro_Witch_Stereo.ogg', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[37]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(912, 'MalachaiIntro2', '[4]', 'What a pleasure to finally meet you, Duelist. You and I will create the most beautiful of Nightmares together. Let us bathe you in blood, Duelist. So that this world might be bathed in glory!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Malachai/M13_Intro_Duelist_Mono.ogg', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/MalachaiS/M13_Intro_Duelist_Stereo.ogg', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[37]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(913, 'MalachaiIntro3', '[6]', 'I actually find myself admiring you in this moment, Templar. You and I will create the most beautiful of Nightmares together. Rather the hallmark of God, isn''t it? Let me show you what a real god can do!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Malachai/M14_Intro_Templar_Mono.ogg', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/MalachaiS/M14_Intro_Templar_Stereo.ogg', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[37]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(914, 'MalachaiIntro4', '[3]', 'I admire you in this moment, Ranger. You and I will create the most beautiful of Nightmares together. Creation... usually the concern of Nature, isn''t it? Not anymore.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Malachai/M15_Intro_Ranger_Mono.ogg', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/MalachaiS/M15_Intro_Ranger_Stereo.ogg', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[37]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(915, 'MalachaiIntro5', '[5]', 'I''ve followed your performance, my anti-hero of hubris, and I''ve very much enjoyed it. Now you and I will create the most nightmarish of finales together. We''re going to make your death really count for something.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Malachai/M16_Intro_Shadow_Mono.ogg', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/MalachaiS/M16_Intro_Shadow_Stereo.ogg', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[37]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(916, 'MalachaiIntro6', '[0]', 'In this moment, you and I will create the most beautiful of Nightmares together. Creation... rather the realm of the Gods, isn''t it? Bow your head to your one, true god!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Malachai/M17_Intro_Marauder_Mono.ogg', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/MalachaiS/M17_Intro_Marauder_Stereo.ogg', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[37]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(917, 'MalachaiIntro7', '[2]', 'You could not be more perfect, Scion. So now it is up to us to commit one final act of creation. A single death that will mark the rebirth of an entire world!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Malachai/M18_Intro_Scion_Mono.ogg', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/MalachaiS/M18_Intro_Scion_Stereo.ogg', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[37]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(918, 'MalachaiPietyFree', '[]', 'What!?', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Malachai/M19a_PietyFree_Mono_01.ogg', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/MalachaiS/M19a_PietyFree_Stereo_01.ogg', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[37]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(919, 'Malachai2Intro', '[]', 'Now, let us see if you truly understand what it means to be Nightmare.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Malachai/M21_PietySlain_Mono.ogg', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/MalachaiS/M21_PietySlain_Stereo.ogg', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[37]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(920, 'Malachai2HeartHeal1', '[]', 'I gave my life. Nightmare gave me so much more.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Malachai/M22a_MalachaiHeal_Mono_01.ogg', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/MalachaiS/M22a_MalachaiHeal_Stereo_01.ogg', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[37]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(921, 'Malachai2HeartHeal2', '[]', 'Accept the gift of immortality.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Malachai/M22b_MalachaiHeal_Mono_01.ogg', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/MalachaiS/M22b_MalachaiHeal_Stereo_01.ogg', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[37]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(922, 'Malachai2HeartHeal3', '[]', 'Nightmare is the true Eternal.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Malachai/M22c_MalachaiHeal_Mono_01.ogg', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/MalachaiS/M22c_MalachaiHeal_Stereo_01.ogg', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[37]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(923, 'Malachai2Heart3Dies', '[]', 'Why... are you so in love with Death?', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Malachai/M23_FinalHeart_Mono_01.ogg', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/MalachaiS/M23_FinalHeart_Stereo_01.ogg', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[37]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(924, 'LabyrinthGlyph0', '[]', '"The Just Goddess presides over us all. The future of the Empire rests in her even hands."' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
The Lord''s Labyrinth, opened by Emperor Izaro Phrecius on the second Galvano of Azmeri, 1317 IC.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/IzaroGlyph/Iz_19_StoryGlyph_01.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[142]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(925, 'LabyrinthGlyph1', '[]', '"In the impressionable youth of my reign, I was encouraged to believe in the precious nature of my imperial blood. The ''divine claret'', as one fool of a courtier would repeat with tiresome regularity.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Unfortunately, my divine claret refused to pour from one cup to another. Try as I might, with a lovely procession of young and ever dutiful wives, my noble seed simply would not sprout.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Who, then, to choose as my worthy successor? With the candidates on hand either mediocre at best, or maniacal at worst, I found myself in quite the quandary.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
That''s when Fortune took me by the hand and led me to a forgotten tome on a forgotten shelf in the quietest corner of Sarn Library. A tome entitled, ''Ancient Traditions of Azmerian Ascendancy''.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
The rest, one might say, is history."' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
- Emperor Izaro Phrecius', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/IzaroGlyph/Iz_19_StoryGlyph_02.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[143]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(926, 'LabyrinthGlyph2', '[]', '"The Azmeri were the first culture known in history to use trials of strength, wisdom and spirit to select its chieftains.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
The first Lord''s Trial was a rough-hewn maze festooned with wild animals and brutal traps, crafted to test aspiring Azmerian leaders'' body, mind and soul.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
In conquering the adversities of the maze, a champion proved they were capable of bearing the crushing burden of chieftainship.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
The first trials were simple contraptions reflecting simple times. As the Azmerian civilisation grew in number and complexity, so did the trials, from treacherous mazes to bewildering labyrinths.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Alas, there are no surviving descriptions of the labyrinth that tested and proved the worth of Veruso, Prima Imperialus. I imagine it was quite something to behold."' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
- Emperor Izaro Phrecius', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/IzaroGlyph/Iz_19_StoryGlyph_03.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[144]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(927, 'LabyrinthGlyph3', '[]', '"The Azmeri were consummate survivors. They had to be, having been sired in the most inhospitable range of mountains in all of Wraeclast.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Unfortunate, some might say. I do not. I believe it was the making of them. And of us, their descendants.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
So it is no wonder that they developed the Lord''s Trial. With survival being a moment-by-moment concern, that harried people grew to understand power quite intimately.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Strong leadership is able to bridge the chasm between existence and extinction. Poor leadership might see an entire tribe vanish into that same chasm.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
When the Azmeri descended from their mountains to conquer the fecund lands of central Wraeclast, they thrived and multiplied with utmost alacrity in those more forgiving climes.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
For is it not poverty that teaches us how we might excel in times of plenty?"' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
- Emperor Izaro Phrecius', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/IzaroGlyph/Iz_19_StoryGlyph_04.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[145]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(928, 'LabyrinthGlyph4', '[]', '"The custom of the Lord''s Trial was upheld throughout the founding years of the Empire. Veruso''s successor, Caspiro, was a low-born legionnaire, the lone survivor of a labyrinth that claimed the lives of every high-born contender, including Veruso''s only son.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Caspiro proved to be every bit the emperor that Veruso was.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Alas, the Lord''s Labyrinth was corrupted by those with the vanity to consider their blood more precious than their Empire. Selfish blood breeds selfish times, and the Empire paid for it with its own blood. With the Night of a Thousand Ribbons. With that most regal of cannibals, Emperor Romira.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Not any more. I, Izaro Phrecius, shall return us to Justice. I shall build the greatest Lord''s Labyrinth in Azmerian history, and my successor shall be chosen by the Goddess herself.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Only when the Lord''s Labyrinth is drenched in selfish blood can a true leader ascend the throne."' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
- Emperor Izaro Phrecius', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/IzaroGlyph/Iz_19_StoryGlyph_05.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[146]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(929, 'LabyrinthTrialGlyphPrison', '[]', 'In the court of the Goddess, every man and woman is deemed worthy of redemption.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Though you might be shackled by the tribulations of the past, the trials ahead offer you both freedom and glory.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
The future is yours, if you are bold enough to reach out for it.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/IzaroGlyph/Iz_20_01_QualifyingGlyph_AxionPrison.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[136]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(930, 'LabyrinthTrialGlyphSins', '[]', 'The path to Justice is slender and perfidious, fraught with missteps of ambition and despair, egotism and doubt.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Should you choose this road, beware those who would waylay your hopes and disembowel your dreams.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Remain sure and remain true.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/IzaroGlyph/Iz_20_02_QualifyingGlyph_Chamber.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[137]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(931, 'LabyrinthTrialGlyphChurch', '[]', 'Fear gnaws at the entrails of the faithful and the faithless alike. Fear of the unknown. Fear of the future.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
An empire requires leadership that can assuage those fears, through example, through wisdom, through strength.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
An emperor lights the way through the darkened caverns of uncertainty.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/IzaroGlyph/Iz_20_03_QualifyingGlyph_ChurchDungeon.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[138]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(932, 'LabyrinthTrialGlyphCrematorium', '[]', 'On the Night of a Thousand Ribbons, our finest city burned. It burned with fires lit by cruelty and neglect. It burned with shame for giving the title of ''Emperor'' to a man who did not deserve it.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/IzaroGlyph/Iz_20_05_QualifyingGlyph_Crematorium.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[139]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(933, 'LabyrinthTrialGlyphHedge', '[]', 'A leader cannot simply stride forward into the future and expect his people to be able to follow.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
A leader must look over his shoulder so that he can witness and understand the consequences of the path he has chosen.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
To ensure that his people are still with him. To ensure that he has not become lost.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/IzaroGlyph/Iz_20_07_QualifyingGlyph_HedgeMaze.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[140]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(934, 'LabyrinthTrialGlyphCatacombs', '[]', 'An emperor cannot allow himself to become buried in the shadowed vaults of self-doubt.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Cannot allow thoughts of imagined disaster to spin about inside his mind like so many strife-splintered wheels.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
An emperor navigates his way through the terrors of perplexity with his eyes set firmly on the rising sun.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/IzaroGlyph/Iz_20_08_QualifyingGlyph_Catacombs.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[141]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(935, 'IzaroSpeechAirlock', '[]', 'You stand before the gates of the Lord''s Labyrinth. Within these walls, the Lady of Justice doth preside. She shall weigh your Mind in one hand, your Heart in the other. Should she find you wanting, death shall be your sentence. Should she find you worthy, you will be given the loyalty and love of an empire. The Lord''s Labyrinth awaits you. Choose wisely. Strike quickly. Trust completely. And may you find the ending that you deserve.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Izaro/Iz_01_Intro.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[147]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(936, 'IzaroSpeechComplete', '[]', 'Before your emperor, you are worthy. Before the Goddess of Justice, you are worthy. Receive our blessings. Embrace our gifts. And rise, ascendant, for this is the ending that we all deserve.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Izaro/Iz_16_LabComplete_01.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[147]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(937, 'IzaroSpeechOpenDoorRandom', '[]', 'Ascend with precision.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Izaro/Iz_02_OpensLabyrinthDoor_01.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[147]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(938, 'IzaroSpeechOpenDoor2', '[]', 'The Goddess is watching.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Izaro/Iz_02_OpensLabyrinthDoor_02.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[147]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(939, 'IzaroSpeechOpenDoor3', '[]', 'Justice will prevail.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Izaro/Iz_02_OpensLabyrinthDoor_03.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[147]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(940, 'IzaroFlee1', '[]', 'By the Goddess! What ambition!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Izaro/Iz_03_Fight1B_OutroA.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[147]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(941, 'IzaroFlee2', '[]', 'By the Goddess! What ambition!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Izaro/Iz_03_Fight1B_OutroB.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[147]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(942, 'IzaroFlee3', '[]', 'Such resilience!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Izaro/Iz_03_Fight1C_OutroA.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[147]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(943, 'IzaroFlee4', '[]', 'Such resilience!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Izaro/Iz_03_Fight1C_OutroB.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[147]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(944, 'IzaroFlee5', '[]', 'You were born for this!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Izaro/Iz_03_Fight1D_OutroA.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[147]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(945, 'IzaroFlee6', '[]', 'You were born for this!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Izaro/Iz_03_Fight1D_OutroB.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[147]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(946, 'IzaroFlee7', '[]', 'You are inexhaustible!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Izaro/Iz_03_Fight2C_OutroA.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[147]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(947, 'IzaroFlee8', '[]', 'You are inexhaustible!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Izaro/Iz_03_Fight2C_OutroB.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[147]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(948, 'IzaroDeath1', '[]', 'Triumphant at last!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Izaro/Iz_03_Fight3A_OutroA.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[147]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(949, 'IzaroDeath2', '[]', 'You are free!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Izaro/Iz_03_Fight3B_OutroA.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[147]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(950, 'IzaroDeath3', '[]', 'I die for the Empire!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Izaro/Iz_03_Fight3C_OutroA.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[147]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(951, 'IzaroDeath4', '[]', 'The trap of tyranny is inescapable.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Izaro/PartTwo/IZ_13.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[147]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(952, 'IzaroDeath5', '[]', 'Delight in your gilded dungeon, ascendant.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Izaro/PartTwo/IZ_18.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[147]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(953, 'IzaroDeath6', '[]', 'Your destination is more dangerous than the journey, ascendant.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Izaro/PartTwo/IZ_23.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[147]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(954, 'Izaro1_Prefight', '[]', 'Oh, the weary traveler draws close to the end of the path.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Izaro/PartTwo/IZ_42_a.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[147]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(955, 'Izaro2_Prefight', '[]', 'When the time comes to strike, an emperor strikes without hesitation. To entertain doubt is to dance with death.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Izaro/PartTwo/IZ_43_a.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[147]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(956, 'Izaro3_Prefight', '[]', 'An aspirant can afford to be promising. An emperor must keep those promises.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Izaro/PartTwo/IZ_44_a.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[147]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(957, 'IzaroPlayerDeath1', '[]', 'Apparently, this is the ending that you deserve.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Izaro/PartTwo/IZ_54a_a.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[147]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(958, 'IzaroPlayerDeath2', '[]', 'For those who ascend too quickly, the fall is inevitable.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Izaro/PartTwo/IZ_54b_a.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[147]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(959, 'IzaroPlayerDeath3', '[]', 'Justice is served.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Izaro/PartTwo/IZ_54c_a.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[147]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(960, 'IzaroStartLieutenants', '[]', 'An emperor is only as efficient as those he commands.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Izaro/PartTwo/IZ_56_a.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[147]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(961, 'IzaroAllLieutenantsDead', '[]', 'Must I do everything myself!?', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Izaro/PartTwo/IZ_64_a.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[147]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(962, 'IzaroFinishLieutenants0', '[]', 'Determination overcomes domination. This is the one law of sovereignty!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Izaro/PartTwo/IZ_63_a.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[147]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(963, 'IzaroFinishLieutenants1', '[]', 'They say that two out of three isn''t bad. They couldn''t be more wrong.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Izaro/PartTwo/IZ_62_a.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[147]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(964, 'IzaroFinishLieutenants2', '[]', 'Only one of your lessons was completed, ascendant.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Izaro/PartTwo/IZ_61_a.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[147]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(965, 'IzaroFinishLieutenants3', '[]', 'My three lieutenants remain. Misery loves company, I suppose.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Izaro/PartTwo/IZ_60_AP_a.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[147]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(966, 'IzaroStartToggleStatues', '[]', 'When one defiles the effigy, one defiles the emperor.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Izaro/PartTwo/IZ_69_a.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[147]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(967, 'IzaroFinishToggleStatues0', '[]', 'The people kneel before their true sovereign.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Izaro/PartTwo/IZ_75_a.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[147]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(968, 'IzaroFinishToggleStatues1Lightning', '[]', 'An empire must be built to weather any storm.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Izaro/PartTwo/IZ_74_a.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[147]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(969, 'IzaroFinishToggleStatues1Cold', '[]', 'An empire should sparkle like ice upon the winter stone.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Izaro/PartTwo/IZ_73_a.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[147]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(970, 'IzaroFinishToggleStatues1Fire', '[]', 'Empires are forged in stone and fire.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Izaro/PartTwo/IZ_72_a.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[147]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(971, 'IzaroFinishToggleStatues2', '[]', 'Those who stand should never outnumber those who kneel.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Izaro/PartTwo/IZ_71_a.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[147]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(972, 'IzaroFinishToggleStatues3', '[]', 'You are not an emperor if none will kneel before you.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Izaro/PartTwo/IZ_70_a.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[147]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(973, 'IzaroStartPylons', '[]', 'It is the sovereign who empowers the sceptre. Not the other way round.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Izaro/PartTwo/IZ_76_a.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[147]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(974, 'IzaroAllPylonsDestroyed', '[]', 'One day, even the great Sceptre of God shall fall.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Izaro/PartTwo/IZ_77c_a.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[147]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(975, 'IzaroFinishPylons0', '[]', 'Sweep the trappings of past emperors aside. Make your empire anew!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Izaro/PartTwo/IZ_81_a.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[147]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(976, 'IzaroFinishPylons1', '[]', 'Above all else, an emperor needs to finish what he started.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Izaro/PartTwo/IZ_80_a.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[147]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(977, 'IzaroFinishPylons2', '[]', 'A partial victory is no victory at all.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Izaro/PartTwo/IZ_79_a.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[147]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(978, 'IzaroFinishPylons3', '[]', 'Where the weapons remain, a new enemy will simply take the place of the old.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Izaro/PartTwo/IZ_78_a.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[147]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(979, 'IzaroStartGargoyles', '[]', 'Some things that slumber should never be awoken.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Izaro/PartTwo/IZ_82_a.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[147]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(980, 'IzaroAllGargoylesDead', '[]', 'The loyal must be avenged!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Izaro/PartTwo/IZ_88_a.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[147]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(981, 'IzaroFinishGargoyles0', '[]', 'Pity the emperor who sits alone on his throne.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Izaro/PartTwo/IZ_85_a.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[147]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(982, 'IzaroFinishGargoyles1', '[]', 'To lose a retainer is to lose a dear friend.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Izaro/PartTwo/IZ_86_a.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[147]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(983, 'IzaroFinishGargoyles2', '[]', 'To lose a retainer is to lose a dear friend.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Izaro/PartTwo/IZ_86_a.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[147]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(984, 'IzaroFinishGargoyles3', '[]', 'The Empire lives on, and so do its most loyal of servants.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Izaro/PartTwo/IZ_87_a.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[147]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(985, 'IzaroStartElementals', '[]', 'The essence of an empire must be shared equally amongst all of its citizens.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Izaro/PartTwo/IZ_89_a.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[147]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(986, 'IzaroAllElementalsDead', '[]', 'The Empire''s essence must be saved for the people.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Izaro/PartTwo/IZ_92_a.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[147]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(987, 'IzaroFinishElementals0', '[]', 'The last emperor is always the worst emperor.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Izaro/PartTwo/IZ_95_a.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[147]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(988, 'IzaroFinishElementals1', '[]', 'The sovereign leech leaves but a husk for its descendants.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Izaro/PartTwo/IZ_94_a.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[147]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(989, 'IzaroFinishElementals2', '[]', 'The sovereign leech leaves but a husk for its descendants.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Izaro/PartTwo/IZ_94_a.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[147]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(990, 'IzaroFinishElementals3', '[]', 'A wise emperor recognises that life and empire are the same.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Izaro/PartTwo/IZ_93_a.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[147]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(991, 'IzaroStartChronosStatues', '[]', 'Slowness lends strength to one''s enemies.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Izaro/PartTwo/IZ_96_a.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[147]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(992, 'IzaroFinishChronosStatues0', '[]', 'Wisdom is the offspring of Suffering and Time.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Izaro/PartTwo/IZ_98_a.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[147]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(993, 'IzaroFinishChronosStatues1', '[]', 'Time is the champion of second chances.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Izaro/PartTwo/IZ_101a_a.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[147]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(994, 'IzaroFinishChronosStatues2', '[]', 'Time is the champion of second chances.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Izaro/PartTwo/IZ_101a_a.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[147]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(995, 'IzaroFinishChronosStatues3', '[]', 'Time is not to be wasted.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Izaro/PartTwo/IZ_101b_a.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[147]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(996, 'IzaroStartChargeDisruptors', '[]', 'Complex machinations converge to a single act of power.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Izaro/PartTwo/IZ_102a_a.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[147]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(997, 'IzaroMaxCharges', '[]', 'Behold the machinery at maximum efficiency!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Izaro/PartTwo/IZ_102c_a.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[147]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(998, 'IzaroFinishChargeDisruptors0', '[]', 'Even the grandest designs can be dismantled.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Izaro/PartTwo/IZ_102e_a.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[147]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(999, 'IzaroFinishChargeDisruptors5', '[]', 'While the cogs believe, the Imperial machine marches on.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Izaro/PartTwo/IZ_102f_a.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[147]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100);
INSERT INTO "NPCTextAudio" ("_row", "Id", "Characters", "Text", "Mono_AudioFile", "Stereo_AudioFile", "HasStereo", "__col6", "Video", "__col8", "__col9", "__col10", "NPCs", "NPCPortrait", "__col13", "__col14", "Cooldown", "__col16") VALUES
(1000, 'IzaroFinishChargeDisruptors10', '[]', 'For some, the machine is too complex to comprehend.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Izaro/PartTwo/IZ_102g_a.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[147]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1001, 'IzaroFinishChargeDisruptors15', '[]', 'To the glorious apparatus of empire!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Izaro/PartTwo/IZ_102h_a.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[147]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1002, 'IzaroStartPortals', '[]', 'The Emperor beckons and the world attends.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Izaro/PartTwo/IZ_104a_a.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[147]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1003, 'IzaroAllPortalsDead', '[]', 'You can''t stem <i>{this} tide!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Izaro/PartTwo/IZ_104g_a.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[147]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1004, 'IzaroFinishPortals0', '[]', 'An emperor alone is just a man.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Izaro/PartTwo/IZ_104d_a.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[147]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1005, 'IzaroFinishPortals1', '[]', 'Loyalty is a fire that spreads quickly if the forest is dry.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Izaro/PartTwo/IZ_104e_a.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[147]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1006, 'IzaroFinishPortals2', '[]', 'Loyalty is a fire that spreads quickly if the forest is dry.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Izaro/PartTwo/IZ_104e_a.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[147]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1007, 'IzaroFinishPortals3', '[]', 'This Empire remains filled with emperors in waiting.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Izaro/PartTwo/IZ_104f_a.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[147]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1008, 'IzaroStartTraps1', '[]', 'A throne is the most devious trap of them all.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Izaro/PartTwo/IZ_09.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[147]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1009, 'IzaroStartTraps2', '[]', 'The Empire awaits you with open jaws.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Izaro/PartTwo/IZ_14.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[147]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1010, 'IzaroStartTraps3', '[]', 'You must navigate your empire through troubled waters.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Izaro/PartTwo/IZ_19.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[147]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1011, 'IzaroPlaquePrison', '[]', 'Belief is the strongest metal of them all.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Izaro/PartTwo/IZ_26_Prison.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[147]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1012, 'IzaroPlaqueChamber', '[]', 'There is a fine line between consideration and hesitation. The former is wisdom, the latter is fear.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Izaro/PartTwo/IZ_27_Chamber.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[147]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1013, 'IzaroPlaqueChurch', '[]', 'Shine boldly so that all might find you when the night falls.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Izaro/PartTwo/IZ_28_Church.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[147]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1014, 'IzaroPlaqueCrematorium', '[]', 'Allow your wisdom to be tempered by the flames of the past.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Izaro/PartTwo/IZ_29_Crem.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[147]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1015, 'IzaroPlaqueHedge', '[]', 'An emperor must know precisely where he stands.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Izaro/PartTwo/IZ_30_Hedge.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[147]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1016, 'IzaroPlaqueCatacombs', '[]', 'An emperor must bear two blades. Hope in the left hand. Surety in the right.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Izaro/PartTwo/IZ_31_Cata.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[147]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1017, 'IzaroOpenGoldChest', '[]', 'Where there''s a golden key there must be a golden door.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Izaro/PartTwo/IZ_36_a.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[147]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1018, 'IzaroOpenSilverChest', '[]', 'Where there''s a silver key there must be a silver door.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Izaro/PartTwo/IZ_39_a.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[147]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1019, 'IzaroOpenGoldDoorRandom', '[]', 'Gold is the most liberating of metals.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Izaro/PartTwo/IZ_37a_a.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[147]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1020, 'IzaroOpenGoldDoor2', '[]', 'Let the day dawn golden with possibility.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Izaro/PartTwo/IZ_37b_a.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[147]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1021, 'IzaroOpenSilverDoor', '[]', 'Any mystery can be unlocked, if one has the right key.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Izaro/PartTwo/IZ_40_a.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[147]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1022, 'IzaroGargoyleDoorRandom', '[]', 'Time to feed, my pet!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Izaro/PartTwo/IZ_32a.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[147]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1023, 'IzaroGargoyleDoor2', '[]', 'Argus does enjoy new playthings!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Izaro/PartTwo/IZ_32b.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[147]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1024, 'IzaroGargoyleDoor3', '[]', 'Enjoy your little treat, my dear Argus!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Izaro/PartTwo/IZ_32c.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[147]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1025, 'IzaroGargoyleDoor4', '[]', 'Argus? Fetch!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Izaro/PartTwo/IZ_32d.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[147]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1026, 'IzaroGargoyleDeathRandom', '[]', 'You killed my poor little Argus.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Izaro/PartTwo/IZ_34a_a.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[147]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1027, 'IzaroGargoyleDeath2', '[]', 'Goodbye, Argus. I couldn''t have asked for a more faithful and loving companion.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Izaro/PartTwo/IZ_34b_a.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[147]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1028, 'IzaroGargoyleDeath3', '[]', 'Oh, Argus. I shall miss you.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Izaro/PartTwo/IZ_34c_a.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[147]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1029, 'IzaroDoorLockedRandom', '[]', 'There is nothing quite so enticing as a locked door.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Izaro/PartTwo/IZ_48a_b.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[147]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1030, 'IzaroDoorLocked2', '[]', 'A locked door merely encourages curiosity.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Izaro/PartTwo/IZ_48b_a.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[147]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1031, 'IzaroDoorLocked3', '[]', 'A locked door merely encourages curiosity.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Izaro/PartTwo/IZ_48b_b.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[147]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1032, 'IzaroShrineTagRandom', '[]', 'The pursuit of power can be a grotesque affair.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Izaro/PartTwo/IZ_46a_a.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[147]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1033, 'IzaroShrineTag2', '[]', 'The pursuit of power can be a grotesque affair.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Izaro/PartTwo/IZ_46a_b.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[147]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1034, 'IzaroShrineTag3', '[]', 'Dark influences reside in dark places.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Izaro/PartTwo/IZ_46b_a.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[147]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1035, 'IzaroShrineTag4', '[]', 'Dark influences reside in dark places.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Izaro/PartTwo/IZ_46b_b.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[147]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1036, 'IzaroShrineTag5', '[]', 'A potent little gift from our primitive past.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Izaro/PartTwo/IZ_46c_b.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[147]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1037, 'IzaroShrineTag6', '[]', 'A potent little gift from our primitive past.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Izaro/PartTwo/IZ_46c_b.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[147]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1038, 'WeylinGlyph1', '[]', 'The Son of Ezomyr met the Son of Sarn' || char(13) || '
Upon the road to the Imperial throne.' || char(13) || '
The Eternal offered his cunning,' || char(13) || '
His eyes and ears, bought and paid for.' || char(13) || '
The Ezomyte offered his strength,' || char(13) || '
His sword, earned in the arena.' || char(13) || '
A pact was forged,' || char(13) || '
With the Labyrinth as witness.' || char(13) || '
Two men separated by blood.' || char(13) || '
Two men bound by hope.' || char(13) || '
Two men, and only one emperor.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Weylin/We_01.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[148]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1039, 'WeylinGlyph2', '[]', 'The Ezomyte and the Eternal took their rest' || char(13) || '
In the lee of strife''s gale,' || char(13) || '
And remembered the travelled road.' || char(13) || '
Beast and fiend had fallen and bled,' || char(13) || '
To the Ezomyte''s sword, swift and true.' || char(13) || '
Trap and trial had risen and succumbed,' || char(13) || '
To the Eternal''s wits, quick and shrewd.' || char(13) || '
Two men had cried their triumph,' || char(13) || '
A Warrior and his Guide,' || char(13) || '
Whilst other ascendants echoed their pride,' || char(13) || '
With anguish and agony.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Weylin/We_02.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[149]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1040, 'WeylinGlyph3', '[]', 'The Warrior bled upon Izaro''s stones,' || char(13) || '
And cursed Izaro''s ilk.' || char(13) || '
He looked upon the walls of his tomb,' || char(13) || '
Built by his masters, his enemies,' || char(13) || '
And called for the First Ones to carry him,' || char(13) || '
To the forest and fields of his Ezomyr.' || char(13) || '
Yet while the First Ones remained silent,' || char(13) || '
The Guide did speak' || char(13) || '
Of secrets planted by clever hands ' || char(13) || '
Enslaved by gold.' || char(13) || '
And with one such secret,' || char(13) || '
Plucked the life of the Warrior' || char(13) || '
From the First Ones'' jaws.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Weylin/We_03.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[150]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1041, 'WeylinGlyph4', '[]', 'A Guide, cornered and quailing,' || char(13) || '
A Warrior, watching,' || char(13) || '
The moment bathed in the shadow' || char(13) || '
Of doubt,' || char(13) || '
Of ambition,' || char(13) || '
Of an imperial throne.' || char(13) || '
And a people made free' || char(13) || '
By an Emperor of Ezomyr.' || char(13) || '
The Warrior threw off that cold and cloying shadow,' || char(13) || '
And struck down the slavering beasts.' || char(13) || '
The Guide looked to the Warrior' || char(13) || '
With gratitude in his eyes.' || char(13) || '
And spoke of doubt,' || char(13) || '
Of ambition,' || char(13) || '
Of an imperial throne,' || char(13) || '
And a people made free' || char(13) || '
By an Emperor of Sarn.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Weylin/We_04.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[151]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1042, 'WeylinGlyph5', '[]', 'The Guide led the Warrior down a path' || char(13) || '
That wound and twisted' || char(13) || '
Through fields of blossoming promises.' || char(13) || '
Green-bladed hopes.' || char(13) || '
The Warrior closed his eyes.' || char(13) || '
A mere moment' || char(13) || '
To feel the warmth of the sun on his back,' || char(13) || '
And to drink from the Guide''s proffered flask.' || char(13) || '
Now the Warrior staggers and crawls' || char(13) || '
Down the wounded, tortured causeway.' || char(13) || '
The bitterness stings his weeping eyes.' || char(13) || '
The fire roars in his belly,' || char(13) || '
Consuming him.' || char(13) || '
The Warrior will not ascend.' || char(13) || '
Instead he hunts.' || char(13) || '
Guided by his love for Ezomyr.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Weylin/We_05.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[152]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1043, 'RigwaldIntroRandom', '[]', 'The smell of fear betrays you!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Rigwald/R07_prefight_01_01.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[158]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1044, 'RigwaldIntro2', '[]', 'The smell of fear betrays you!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Rigwald/R07_prefight_01_02.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[158]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1045, 'RigwaldIntro3', '[]', 'Tonight, I will feast!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Rigwald/R07_prefight_02_01.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[158]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1046, 'RigwaldIntro4', '[]', 'Tonight, I will feast!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Rigwald/R07_prefight_02_02.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[158]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1047, 'RigwaldIntro5', '[]', 'The hunt begins!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Rigwald/R07_prefight_03_01.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[158]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1048, 'RigwaldIntro6', '[]', 'The hunt begins!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Rigwald/R07_prefight_03_02.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[158]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1049, 'RigwaldIntro7', '[]', 'The hunt begins!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Rigwald/R07_prefight_03_03.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[158]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1050, 'RigwaldIntro8', '[]', 'I smell fresh meat!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Rigwald/R07_prefight_04_01.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[158]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1051, 'RigwaldIntro9', '[]', 'I smell fresh meat!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Rigwald/R07_prefight_04_02.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[158]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1052, 'RigwaldIntro10', '[]', 'The Greatwolf hungers!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Rigwald/R07_prefight_05_01.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[158]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1053, 'RigwaldIntro11', '[]', 'The Greatwolf hungers!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Rigwald/R07_prefight_05_02.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[158]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1054, 'RigwaldIntro12', '[]', 'The Greatwolf hungers!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Rigwald/R07_prefight_05_03.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[158]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1055, 'RigwaldIntro13', '[]', 'My prey draws near!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Rigwald/R07_prefight_06_01.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[158]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1056, 'RigwaldIntro14', '[]', 'My prey draws near!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Rigwald/R07_prefight_06_02.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[158]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1057, 'RigwaldIntro15', '[]', 'My prey draws near!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Rigwald/R07_prefight_06_03.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[158]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1058, 'RigwaldDeathRandom', '[]', '...First Ones, remember me.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Rigwald/R11_death_01_01.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[158]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1059, 'RigwaldDeath2', '[]', '...First Ones, remember me.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Rigwald/R11_death_01_02.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[158]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1060, 'RigwaldDeath3', '[]', 'The Greatwolf has left me!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Rigwald/R11_death_02_01.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[158]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1061, 'RigwaldDeath4', '[]', 'The Greatwolf has left me!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Rigwald/R11_death_02_02.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[158]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1062, 'RigwaldDeath5', '[]', 'Forgive me, Ezomyr.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Rigwald/R11_death_03_01.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[158]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1063, 'RigwaldDeath6', '[]', 'Forgive me, Ezomyr.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Rigwald/R11_death_03_02.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[158]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1064, 'RigwaldDeath7', '[]', 'There is nothing to regret.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Rigwald/R11_death_04_01.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[158]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1065, 'RigwaldDeath8', '[]', 'There is nothing to regret.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Rigwald/R11_death_04_02.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[158]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1066, 'RigwaldGlyph1', '[]', 'You can take a wolf from the forest. You can collar him, chain him. You can starve him, beat him until he whimpers and bows down. Yet, is that wolf a dog?' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Never.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
A man is only a slave when he allows his heart and mind to be conquered. When he comes to believe that his life is no longer his own. When he chooses to cast his eyes forever to the ground.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Like a king that chooses to press his lips to the feet of an emperor. A king that looks to his goblet and his plate, feasting and fattening while his people starve in their own streets.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Some might say that I should bear the guilt of regicide. That I killed the King of the Ezomytes. Yes, I served King Skothe his last meal, for I saw no king at that table.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
I saw a dog.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
- Rigwald, the Wolven King', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/RigwaldGlyph/R01.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[159]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1067, 'RigwaldGlyph2', '[]', 'I once believed that a boy''s eyes were born pure, clear of cruelty and malice. That it is life that teaches one to hate, to strike out at others through anger and fear.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Yet when I looked into the eyes of Gaius Sentari, I found no anger. I found no hatred. I read no tales of injustice inflicted upon youthful innocence. Saw no walls built by suffering and sorrow.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Instead, I was regarded as a merchant might regard beasts of burden at a market. By Governor Sentari, my countrymen and I were counted, weighed, and allocated. This man to the mines. This woman to the mills. This child to the streets of Sarn to be worked and flogged until the day his blood would drain into the sewers of that wretched city.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
And those that resisted, those that asked to be treated as anything other than animals, were skinned and butchered, with an even dozen of their kin.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Fear not the man who lusts. Fear not the man who hates. Fear the man who feels nothing at all.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
- Rigwald, the Wolven King', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/RigwaldGlyph/R02.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[160]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1068, 'RigwaldGlyph3', '[]', 'The colours and banners of a hundred clans, scattered like the wildflowers of spring across the meadows of Glargarryn. Thousands of men and women, starving, poor, armed with rusted hatchets and hunting bows, looking across that field, with the courage of desperation, at the imperial legion arrayed against them.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Soldiers gleaming in bronze and steel. Trained and hardened men. Their polished shields forming a wall of discipline and determination against the advances of my motley rabble.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
"I sing, I rant, I rave," I said to them, "but today, clansmen, my sword is my voice!"' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
We crashed against that legion like waves upon a cliff. Time and time again they repelled us. The green meadows became brown and red with the mud of toil and the blood of war.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Yet what is a slave to do? Suffer the lingering death of mine and mill, or offer the gift of your life to your people in one bright and glorious moment?' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
For the men and women who followed me into battle, the choice was a simple one.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Three Ezomytes fell for every Eternal and still the courage of my people tore down that polished wall, severed the strong arm of the Empire with a rusted, woodman''s hatchet.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Gaius Sentari ran for his wretched life.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
I called to the Greatwolf to aid me, to give me the scent of that fleeing fox. Though the hunt was swift, I took the time to ensure that Gaius felt some small measure of the suffering he had inflicted before I answered his plea for mercy.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
- Rigwald, the Wolven King' || char(13) || '
', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/RigwaldGlyph/R03.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[161]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1069, 'RigwaldGlyph4', '[]', 'I stood with the Army of Purity and looked upon the mighty walls of Sarn. I fought against Chitus and his Gemling aberrations. I watched the strongest of our army, Ezomyte, Maraketh, Karui and Templar, struck down by creatures born of thaumaturgy.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
It will take more than strong men and women to defeat Chitus, for this is no longer a war of mud and blood. We face monsters, and to defeat them, we need some monsters of our own.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Here I stand, amongst these stones. Here I lay my gifts of blood and song, of flesh and fire. Here I call out to the First Ones, beasts of legend, terrors of our dreams. Here I howl to the Greatwolf himself.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Should he answer, I am ready to pay the price that I know he will ask. It is no more than a man should do for his family. It is no more than a king should do for his people.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
- Rigwald, the Wolven King', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/RigwaldGlyph/R04.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[162]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1070, 'RigwaldGlyph5', '[]', 'The Greatwolf has come for me. His heart beats within my chest. His tongue lolls within my mouth. His fangs crown my jaw. His eyes rest within my sockets.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
I do not see Ezomyte and Eternal, king and commoner, master and slave. I see only prey.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
In the world of street and field, the emperor has fallen. Those who were slaves are now free.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
In the world of forest and mountain, the First Ones hunt and feed as they have done since the first dawn.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
No longer will I walk among my people. I will not have their blood on my lips. I will not be their king.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
I am the King of Wolves now.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
- Rigwald', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/RigwaldGlyph/R05.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[163]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1071, 'RigwaldGlyph6', '[]', 'The Greatwolf has forced me to forget who I was... and has taught me to be so much more.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
A man becomes a king so that he may protect the people of the day. A man becomes a god so that he may protect the people of all the days to come.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
And so the endless hunt begins. ' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
The fervour of the First Ones remains, bound by the druids into fetishes of tooth and bone, skin and claw. I know where these potent talismans have been strewn. I have their scent.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
And so the endless hunt begins.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
I shall pursue the thieves of our ancient heritage. I shall wrest our First Ones from the clutching and the corrupted lest they feed and grow fecund on power not their own. Power I must have, must wield, in the name of all that is Ezomyr to come.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
And so the endless hunt begins.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
- Rigwald', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/RigwaldGlyph/R06_wolf.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[164]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1072, 'RigwaldTransformRandom', '[]', 'The Greatwolf consumes me!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Rigwald/R09_pretrans_01_01.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[158]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1073, 'RigwaldTransform2', '[]', 'The Greatwolf consumes me!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Rigwald/R09_pretrans_01_02.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[158]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1074, 'RigwaldTransform3', '[]', 'The Greatwolf is here!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Rigwald/R09_pretrans_02_01.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[158]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1075, 'RigwaldTransform4', '[]', 'The Greatwolf is here!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Rigwald/R09_pretrans_02_02.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[158]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1076, 'RigwaldTransform5', '[]', 'Flee from the hunger!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Rigwald/R09_pretrans_03_01.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[158]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1077, 'RigwaldTransform6', '[]', 'Flee from the hunger!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Rigwald/R09_pretrans_03_02.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[158]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1078, 'RigwaldTransform7', '[]', 'You should run!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Rigwald/R09_pretrans_04_01.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[158]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1079, 'RigwaldTransform8', '[]', 'You should run!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Rigwald/R09_pretrans_04_02.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[158]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1080, 'CadiroIntroduction', '[]', 'Now you have the look of a connoisseur, an educated appreciator of all things exquisite and dangerous. ' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
And I, Cadiro, am one who provides such delights. Once a lord of influence and opulence, I am now but a humble peddler seeking to recover his lost fortunes. Gold coins of Perandus mintage, secreted away in gilded chests so as to escape the grasping digits of that puritanical usurper, Voll of Thebrus. Perhaps you have seen such chests on your travels?' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
If so, I could offer you antiquities of remarkable potency, paraphernalia of pernicious craftsmanship. All I would ask in return is the conveyance of the contents of said chests to my person.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
As fortune would have it, I have such a wonder in stock even now. A relic of such formidable agency that I shudder to think what it could do in the hands of one predisposed to use it. ' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
For a little coin, those hands could be yours.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Cadiro/Ca_01.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[165,326,761,762,763]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1081, 'CadiroOnCoins', '[]', 'Yes, you are quite right to query my curious penchant for obsolete currency.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Once there was a time when my personal symphony was composed, quite completely, of the delightful tinklings of coinage. Nowadays, I''m dancing to someone else''s tune. ' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
I have a backer, you see, who generously supports my ongoing liquidity. Naturally, he expects a good return on his investment, and it transpires that only coinage of the golden variety will satiate that expectation.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Cadiro/Ca_05.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[165,326,761,762,763]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1082, 'CadiroOnChitus', '[]', 'Chitus was shaping up to be the greatest leader since Veruso. My nephew''s gemling thaumatocracy would have made the Empire truly eternal, would have raised mankind up from the fragile muck of flesh and blood. And the wealth... oh the riches that could have flowed through the Empire''s capitalist capillaries.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Then that idiot of a High Templar had to come along and ruin it all. Him and his ''God of Purity'' and his army of fanatics and barbarians. A veritable horde of ignorance.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
If Chitus had lived, the Empire would have lived, and oh what a wondrous and eternal life it would have had!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Cadiro/Ca_06.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[165,326,761,762,763]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1083, 'CadiroOnFamily', '[]', 'The same day that Veruso planted his banner in the soil of Sarn, the Perandus family built the first market stall. That one stall spawned so many others that the people came to call our venture <i>{Perandus Markets}.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
We were never vain enough to make the name official. Until Chitus took the throne, we were a most unassuming consortium.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Yes, we did occasionally employ the Silent Brotherhood to remove the more stubborn obstacles to our commercial endeavours, but for the most part we tended to solve our issues with coin and contract rather than bow and blade.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
In hindsight, we should have taken the reins of power much earlier. If we had done so then perhaps I could now be speaking of Perandus in the plural rather than the singular.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Cadiro/Ca_07.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[165,326,761,762,763]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1084, 'CadiroOnManor', '[]', 'This was once the pride and joy of the Perandus name. A habitable monument to our mercantile potency. Balls and banquets filled these halls with music and intrigue. Counsels and contracts festooned our studies and boardrooms. Capital built our walls and profits polished our gleaming floors.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Alas, that which is shiny shall dull. That which is grand shall crumble. Such is the stark reality of materialism. Yet this place retains a certain ''decrepit opulence'' that reminds me of the better times that were, and the better times that still could be.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Cadiro/Ca_08.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[165,326,761,762,763]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1085, 'CadiroOnCataclysm', '[]', 'When you''re a <i>{fat purse} such as I, you are wise to insure yourself against being slit and emptied. In the face of Voll''s ridiculous crusade to Highgate, I thought it only prudent to bolster my insurance policies.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
It was in our household god, Prospero, that I found my ideal underwriter. While my relations paid tithe and lip service to Prospero the symbol, Prospero the myth, I chose to dig a little deeper than that.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
To my delight, it transpired that our god was not only real, but of a similar opinion regarding the near, uncertain future of the Empire.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
We signed a contract, Prospero and I, and more than two centuries have borne witness to our successful partnership.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
The best deal I ever made.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Cadiro/Ca_09.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[165,326,761,762,763]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1086, 'CadiroOnProspero', '[]', 'The god of lost souls and found treasures. Lord of the underworld and all its material bounty. Gems, precious metals, coal... a myriad of subterranean substances, exotic and volatile.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
If it has value and it can be unearthed with pick and shovel, it falls within Prospero''s divine concerns. As do all those who trade in them.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Prospero was a god of our ancestors, the Azmerians. As we Eternals descended from those mountains, our gods descended with us.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
To the mundane mind they are myths, nothing but stories. To those with a little more imagination, they can be so much more.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Cadiro/Ca_10.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[165,326,761,762,763]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1087, 'CadiroOnIzaro', '[]', 'Izaro Phrecius? Despite my personal feelings surrounding that man, he did provide we Perandus folk with an unprecedented opportunity.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Over the centuries, the Phrecius family had blocked our every attempt to gain the throne on the scandalous basis that our blood was not of imperial quality.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
So when Izaro called that whole blood fiasco into question with his Lord''s Labyrinth, it gave us the only clear shot we would ever have at sovereignty.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Without Izaro, the Perandus name may never have come to be associated with the throne. So in a somewhat qualified fashion, he has my gratitude.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Cadiro/Ca_11.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[165,326,761,762,763]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1088, 'CadiroOnLabyrinth', '[]', 'So you''ve polished off Izaro''s ''Lord''s Labyrinth'' have you? Proved that you have the mettle for imperial leadership.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Sadly, the Empire isn''t what it used to be, but you''re more than welcome to knock it back into shape for us.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Despite my personal feelings surrounding Izaro Phrecius, he did provide we Perandus folk with an unprecedented opportunity.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Over the centuries, the Phrecius family had blocked our every attempt to gain the throne, on the scandalous basis that our blood was not of imperial quality.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
So when Izaro called that whole blood fiasco into question with his Lord''s Labyrinth, it gave us the only clear shot we would ever have at sovereignty.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Without Izaro, the Perandus name may never have come to be associated with the throne. So in a somewhat qualified fashion, he has my gratitude.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Cadiro/Ca_12.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[165,326,761,762,763]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1089, 'CadiroTrade1_1', '[]', 'You''re getting quite a deal there.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Cadiro/Ca_04a_a.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[165,326,761,762,763]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1090, 'CadiroTrade1_2', '[]', 'You''re getting quite a deal there.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Cadiro/Ca_04a_b.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[165,326,761,762,763]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1091, 'CadiroTrade1_3', '[]', 'You''re getting quite a deal there.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Cadiro/Ca_04a_c.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[165,326,761,762,763]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1092, 'CadiroTrade2_1', '[]', 'Oh, and ''refund'' is not in my vocabulary.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Cadiro/Ca_04b_a.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[165,326,761,762,763]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1093, 'CadiroTrade2_2', '[]', 'Oh, and ''refund'' is not in my vocabulary.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Cadiro/Ca_04b_b.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[165,326,761,762,763]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1094, 'CadiroTrade2_3', '[]', 'Oh, and ''refund'' is not in my vocabulary.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Cadiro/Ca_04b_c.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[165,326,761,762,763]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1095, 'CadiroTrade3_1', '[]', 'May Prospero bless this trade.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Cadiro/Ca_04c_a.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[165,326,761,762,763]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1096, 'CadiroTrade3_2', '[]', 'May Prospero bless this trade.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Cadiro/Ca_04c_b.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[165,326,761,762,763]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1097, 'NavaliWildFreed', '[]', 'Thank you for freeing me. The Mother of Death likes to play these little tricks on me. To remind me of my place. But she also sent you here to help.' || char(13) || '
 ' || char(13) || '
Let me return the favour, exile. We will meet again in town, and then I will help you illuminate your path.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Navali/Nav_S03_02.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[170]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1098, 'NavaliWildAttention', '[]', 'I''ve been waiting for you...', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Navali/Nav_S03_01.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[170]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1099, 'NavaliInviteToHideout', '[]', 'So you''ve finally found yourself a dwelling. Perhaps you have room for another lost soul?', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Navali/Nav_S03_04.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[166]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1100, 'NavaliDismissFromHideout', '[]', 'I''m sure we will see each other again soon.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Navali/Nav_S03_06.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[171]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1101, 'NavaliIntroAct1', '[]', 'Is it choice that carries you here, or is it fate? I see a need in you. A need to peer into your future. A need to follow the right path. But your future has already been cast. So open your mind and embrace it.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Long ago, my people called me a <i>{hatungo}. A wise woman. Now they call me a revenant. But it is not my fate to return to the Mother of Death just yet. For now I stand with one foot in this world, and the other foot in the realm of the dead. I''m an inquirer of the living and an interpreter of death.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
I sense you have questions. For a gift of silver, I will answer them. But you seek more than answers. Riches. Power. These I can also provide, in a way... All you have to do is join me. Heed my words, but walk your path. The future is mine to tell, but yours to claim. It is time to fulfil your prophecy.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Navali/N05.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[166,171]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1102, 'NavaliIntroAct2', '[]', 'And so your path leads you here, exile. Be careful where you step, for as one foot leads the other, so too does each foot leave its mark. A trace of what was. A guide to what will be.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Navali/N06.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[166,171]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1103, 'NavaliIntroAct3', '[]', 'Our paths meet in the shell of a long-dead snail. An empire slow to see where its path was taking it. Built on the husk of another, and destined to be buried time and time again. This city will see great things yet, exile. But not in your lifetime.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Navali/N07.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[166,171]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1104, 'NavaliIntroAct4', '[]', 'Many great things begin at the foot of a mountain, exile. So too do many tragedies. Often a path becomes a fork, and the echoes of your actions push you down one side or the other. Do you know where you are being carried? ...Would you like to?', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Navali/N08.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[166,171]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1105, 'NavaliIntroAct5', '[]', 'The Mother of Death watches over this city with great interest. You have joined us just in time. Before you lies a great many paths, each walked by a different life. But each must come to the same end. Eventually.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Navali/N09.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[166,171]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1106, 'NavaliPcBuysProphecy1', '[]', 'Go, fulfill your prophecy.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Navali/N14a_01.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[166]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1107, 'NavaliPcBuysProphecy2', '[]', 'Go, fulfill your prophecy.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Navali/N14a_02.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[166]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1108, 'NavaliPcBuysProphecy3', '[]', 'Go, fulfill your prophecy.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Navali/N14a_03.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[166]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1109, 'NavaliPcBuysProphecy4', '[]', 'The path is clear. You must face your prophecy.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Navali/N14b_01.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[166]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1110, 'NavaliPcBuysProphecy5', '[]', 'The path is clear. You must face your prophecy.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Navali/N14b_02.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[166]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1111, 'NavaliPcBuysProphecy6', '[]', 'The path is clear. You must face your prophecy.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Navali/N14b_03.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[166]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1112, 'NavaliPcBuysProphecy7', '[]', 'Fate is revealed. Complete your prophecy.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Navali/N14c_01.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[166]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1113, 'NavaliPcBuysProphecy8', '[]', 'Fate is revealed. Complete your prophecy.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Navali/N14c_02.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[166]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1114, 'NavaliPcCompletesProph1', '[]', 'What was prophecy has become history.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Navali/N15a_01.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[166]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1115, 'NavaliPcCompletesProph2', '[]', 'What was prophecy has become history.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Navali/N15a_02.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[166]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1116, 'NavaliPcCompletesProph3', '[]', 'The prophecy is fulfilled.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Navali/N15b_01.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[166]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1117, 'NavaliPcCompletesProph4', '[]', 'The prophecy is fulfilled.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Navali/N15b_02.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[166]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1118, 'NavaliPcCompletesProph5', '[]', 'The prophecy is fulfilled.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Navali/N15b_03.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[166]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1119, 'NavaliPcCompletesProph6', '[]', 'The prophecy has come true.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Navali/N15c_01.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[166]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1120, 'NavaliPcCompletesProph7', '[]', 'The prophecy has come true.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Navali/N15c_02.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[166]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1121, 'NavaliPcCompletesProph8', '[]', 'The prophecy has come true.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Navali/N15c_03.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[166]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1122, 'NavaliPcPostpone1', '[]', 'Fate cannot be stopped. But it can be... contained.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Navali/N16a_01.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[166]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1123, 'NavaliPcPostpone2', '[]', 'Fate cannot be stopped. But it can be... contained.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Navali/N16a_02.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[166]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1124, 'NavaliPcPostpone3', '[]', 'Fate is like a wild beast. It can be chained, but it can''t be tamed.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Navali/N16b_01.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[166]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1125, 'NavaliPcPostpone4', '[]', 'Fate is like a wild beast. It can be chained, but it can''t be tamed.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Navali/N16b_02.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[166]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1126, 'NavaliPcPostpone5', '[]', 'Fate is like a wild beast. It can be chained, but it can''t be tamed.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Navali/N16b_03.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[166]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1127, 'NavaliPcDestroy1', '[]', 'The future is undone.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Navali/N17_01.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[166]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1128, 'NavaliPcDestroy2', '[]', 'The future is undone.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Navali/N17_02.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[166]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1129, 'NavaliPcDestroy3', '[]', 'The future is undone.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Navali/N17_03.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[166]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1130, 'NavaliOnThePaleCourt', '[]', 'Dark minds hide in dark places, but it was not always so.' || char(13) || '
 ' || char(13) || '
The wise Red rulers were long-dead, and the strong seized power. But an unwise leader pulls the people towards ruin. So it came to pass that milk fresh from the nipple was soured, grass grew hard and sharp, and flesh walked the earth without a soul. Hinekora cast her net towards the new kings and queens, but four slipped through the holes and fled into darkness. There they remain. Beyond the reach of the Mother of Death. But not beyond her sight.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Navali/N18.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[166,171]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1131, 'NavaliOnWraeclast', '[]', 'I travelled here through death''s darkened halls, walking the paths of the Remembered. I am but a memory of the woman I was. A memory treasured and sustained by the Mother of Death.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Navali/N12.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[166,171]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1132, 'NavaliOnYama', '[]', 'I awoke in the halls of death with the life I once led little more than a dream half-remembered. Yama the White, my furry companion, stood before me with the Seeing Stone he holds now. Both were given a hair of Hinekora''s dark knowledge, but each serves a separate purpose.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
The Seeing Stone drags me deep into its core, where every instant into eternity is known all at once, like limitless rings on a tree trunk. Yama, like a torch in the mist, guides me back from the stone''s infinite visions.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Navali/N13.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[166,171]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1133, 'NavaliOnEber', '[]', 'The old red ones left this land barren. Crops grew stunted and disease filled the air. If you don''t feed an animal it will soon cast a hungry eye upon its brothers and sisters, and man is no different. The Plaguemaw and his people soon feasted on their own, devouring the very life essence of the young and innocent.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Navali/N19.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[166,171]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1134, 'NavaliOnYriel', '[]', 'When the rains stopped, the Lord fed his farms with the blood of the beasts. But blood carries corruption with it, and the crops soon towered, monstrous and thorned. In the thick jungle of his own making, it was not only he who turned feral.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Navali/N20.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[166,171]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1135, 'NavaliOnInya', '[]', 'Wisdom and knowledge are not one and the same. The queen''s thirst for learning was unending. As she tore through the pages of countless tomes, her knowledge grew and her wisdom slipped away, buckling beneath the weight of insanity.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Navali/N21.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[166,171]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1136, 'NavaliOnVolkuur', '[]', 'Sometimes death is a thief, quick on its feet and quicker with a blade. Sometimes it is a vine, slowly growing tighter and tighter around your neck. But death is not a toy. The unbreathing queen has raised an army of soulless corpses. Her actions mock death, turning it into little more than an obstacle for her puppetry of the flesh.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Navali/N22.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[166,171]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1137, 'NavaliOnAncientRivalries', '[]', 'Wraeclast teems with the memories of a violent past. Although the flesh and minds of its original inhabitants are long-gone, their emotions - anger, fear, envy - remain in the artefacts they have left behind. ' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Doedre Darktongue, Marceus Lioneye, Shavronne of Umbra, Maligaro, Victario. If these names mean nothing to you now, they will soon. Keep an eye out for their long-lost possessions. Each holds the memory of failure, sadness and a desire for revenge.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Navali/N23.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[166,171]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1138, 'NavaliOnThaumaturgy', '[]', 'The great thaumaturgists of the past considered themselves artists of the highest calibre. Their paints were the hidden energies that flow around and through us. Their canvas: the finely-woven fabric of reality itself. And like every great artist, there were times when their brush strokes wavered, when errors were made. Unfortunately, their errors have persisted far longer than their great creations.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Navali/N24.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[166,171]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1139, 'NavaliOnCult', '[]', 'I have not heard of such a cult, nor have I seen visions of them, but if you say you witnessed their presence in Wraeclast, then I believe you.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Be careful. If they can avoid the gaze of the Seeing Stone then they may be beyond the grasp of even the Mother of Death. And that is truly something to fear.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Navali/N25.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[166,171]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1140, 'NavaliOnWarbands', '[]', 'Rats on a sinking ship fight to the death for a splinter of dry wood, not knowing that it too will soon be at the bottom of the sea. We are not the only rats on this ship.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Navali/N26.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[166,171]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1141, 'NavaliOnRivalry', '[]', 'I sense great anger across the land, directed at you. There is another, exiled like you, who wants you dead. For this individual, anger and desperation blur the lines of mortality.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Navali/N27.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[166,171]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1142, 'NavaliOnTools', '[]', 'The tools of divination found on the body of an exile. I have seen it. There are more tools, and the exiles who hold them are gathering in number.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Navali/N34.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[166,171]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1143, 'NavaliOnKaruiGods', '[]', 'Hinekora, my Mother of Death, is not the only god, exile. The Karui are watched over by many. Ngamahu lends us fire, which illuminates the path. Tawhoa gives us the trees and birds that line the path, so that we may enjoy beauty and peace. Tukohama provides us with weapons and knowledge of war, which lets us walk the path safely. ' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
And in the final days of this world, Kitava, whose hunger knows no bounds, will take it all away.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Navali/N30.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[166,171]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1144, 'NavaliPcNoRoom', '[]', 'Too many prophecies remain unfulfilled. Do not risk fracturing your fate.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Navali/N32.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[166,171]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1145, 'NavaliPcError', '[]', 'No amount of silver will help if the wrong questions are asked.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Navali/N33.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[166,171]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1146, 'NavaliPcLacksSilver1', '[]', 'Wisdom of one''s fate has a price, and you do not have the silver to pay it.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Navali/N31a.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[166,171]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1147, 'NavaliPcLacksSilver2', '[]', 'Guidance is priced in silver. If the price is not paid, the stone will stay silent.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Navali/N31b.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[166,171]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1148, 'NavaliPcLacksSilver3', '[]', 'Return when you can pay the silver fee. Only then will your fate be known.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Navali/N31c.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[166,171]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1149, 'NavaliOnCrafting', '[]', 'The onyx amulet you have begun to reshape is special, and it''s metamorphosis is not yet complete. Keep it somewhere safe, for there is more yet to do.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Navali/N35.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[166,171]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1150, 'NavaliOnVaalBoxes', '[]', 'The fragment you have recovered leads to a very dangerous realm. The Red Queen waits in her dark stronghold, and a thousand years of anger bubble just beneath the surface of her flawless, ill-gotten beauty.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Navali/N36.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[166,171]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1151, 'NavaliPcErrorAlt', '[]', 'The stone is silent. Please come back later.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Navali/N70.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[166,171]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1152, 'NavaliProphecyCost', '[]', 'The more deeply woven into fate, the more difficult it is to undo what I have seen. And, the more costly.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Navali/N71.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[166]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1153, 'NavaliProphecy1', '[]', 'Pagan mouths worship pagan gods' || char(13) || '
False idols for false promises', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Navali/N28a.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[166]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1154, 'NavaliProphecy2', '[]', 'A circle of silent giants imprisons a memory of undying misery.' || char(13) || '
A dark tongue whispers dark words carried by the western winds.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Navali/N28b.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[166]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1155, 'NavaliProphecy3', '[]', 'Roots grow from a sky of stone and ' || char(13) || '
soldiers of a forgotten time march once again.' || char(13) || '
', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Navali/N28c.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[166]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1156, 'NavaliProphecy4', '[]', 'Four of shared flesh and blood ' || char(13) || '
raise an army of borrowed blood and bone.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Navali/N28d.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[166]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1157, 'NavaliProphecy5', '[]', 'The echo of the aesthete haunts her greatest creation' || char(13) || '
 bestowing great powers once more.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Navali/N28e.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[166]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1158, 'NavaliProphecy6', '[]', 'At the site of a great atrocity, ' || char(13) || '
the shadows of the distant past hang over the risen red army.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Navali/N28f.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[166]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1159, 'NavaliProphecy7', '[]', 'Beyond the golden gears, the edges of reality crack, ' || char(13) || '
and something hidden from sight spills through.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Navali/N28g.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[166]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1160, 'NavaliProphecy8', '[]', 'Carried by the southern winds,' || char(13) || '
a master of metal seeks aid.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Navali/N28h.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[166]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1161, 'NavaliProphecy9', '[]', 'Smelling of beast and blood,' || char(13) || '
A master hunter seeks aid.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Navali/N28i.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[166]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1162, 'NavaliProphecy10', '[]', 'Guarding a sculpture of flesh and bone and magic,' || char(13) || '
a master of necromancy seeks aid.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Navali/N28j.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[166]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1163, 'NavaliProphecy11', '[]', 'Forged in battle, stewing in arrogance,' || char(13) || '
a master of weapons seeks aid.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Navali/N28k.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[166]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1164, 'NavaliProphecy12', '[]', 'Turning life to death, turning death to art,' || char(13) || '
a master of the darkness seeks aid.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Navali/N28l.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[166]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1165, 'NavaliProphecy13', '[]', 'Forsaken by the light he has sworn to protect,' || char(13) || '
a master of prayer seeks aid.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Navali/N28m.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[166]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1166, 'NavaliProphecy14', '[]', 'Lost in the miasma of dream,' || char(13) || '
a master of many realms seeks aid.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Navali/N28n.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[166]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1167, 'NavaliOnAmbitiousBandit', '[]', 'Thieves make do with what they can find or take by force. When thieves outnumber their victims, they must look farther and farther for what they can take. It is their own greed that carries them into danger.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Navali/N72.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[166,171]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1168, 'NavaliGenericProphecy1', '[]', 'Trouble brews hidden from light,' || char(13) || '
And spills onto the soil.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Navali/N29a.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[166]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1169, 'NavaliGenericProphecy2', '[]', 'Malevolence swells and spreads in minds' || char(13) || '
That can only be cleansed with the spilling of blood.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Navali/N29b.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[166]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1170, 'NavaliGenericProphecy3', '[]', 'Treasures hide in foul flesh' || char(13) || '
the flesh is weak, but the gift is strong', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Navali/N29c.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[166]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1171, 'NavaliGenericProphecy4', '[]', 'A great threat lies in wait' || char(13) || '
in a long forgotten landmark', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Navali/N29d.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[166]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1172, 'NavaliGenericProphecy5', '[]', 'He whose name is written out of history' || char(13) || '
longs to leave his mark', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Navali/N29e.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[166]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1173, 'NavaliGenericProphecy6', '[]', 'A mind mired in dark thoughts' || char(13) || '
feeds on darker acts', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Navali/N29f.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[166]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1174, 'ProphecyDarkTome', '[]', 'My Council, ' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
The sky turns black as ink. ' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
We must gather at once, for I fear the end draws close. ' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
I have uncovered a tome that illustrates certain forbidden techniques used to prolong life far beyond ordinary means. We shall fracture our very souls, and keep safe a piece of one another''s very being. With this, none of us may perish unless all of us perish at once.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
It is not without a cost, for life granted requires life be paid, but it need not be any of ours. Bring your most loyal and healthy retainers, and bid the rest farewell, for we shall not see them again.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Make haste and do not speak of where you are going. Immortality is within our grasp, but there are countless who would risk death - who would kill - for a chance at eternal life.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
-Inya', '', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[167]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1175, 'ShaperMaps1', '[]', 'The first step in a dream takes you further than a thousand in this world.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/ShaperNarrator/SH10.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[181]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1176, 'ShaperMaps2', '[]', 'Unending filth spills forth, like blood ... From a severed jugular.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/ShaperNarrator/SH11.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[181]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1177, 'ShaperMiniboss1Killed', '[]', 'Turn back, trespasser. Cease this madness.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/ShaperNarrator/Sh03d_Miniboss1.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[181]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1178, 'ShaperMiniboss2Killed', '[]', 'You tamper with things you do not understand.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/ShaperNarrator/Sh03e_Miniboss2.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[181]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1179, 'ShaperMiniboss3Killed', '[]', 'Your recklessness will not go unpunished.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/ShaperNarrator/Sh03f_Miniboss3.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[181]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1180, 'ShaperMiniboss4Killed', '[]', 'This is your final warning: Leave, or perish.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/ShaperNarrator/Sh03g_Miniboss4.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[181]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1181, 'ShaperPCUseSextant', '[]', 'The mediocre turned remarkable', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/ShaperNarrator/SH17.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[181]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1182, 'ShaperPCUseShapersOrb', '[]', 'Curiosity is followed by ambition. Ambition is followed by madness.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/ShaperNarrator/SH18.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[181]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1183, 'ShaperPCDeath', '[]', 'Failure. Ambivalence. Death. A final abyss of unending darkness.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/ShaperNarrator/SH19.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[181]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1184, 'ShaperNewMapDrops', '[]', 'What can be found in a dream? A bigger dream.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/ShaperNarrator/SH20.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[181]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1185, 'ShaperAtlasMapDrops', '[]', 'This is the key to a crucible that stretches the sanity of the mind.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/ShaperNarrator/SH21.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[181]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1186, 'ShaperMapArcade', '[]', 'We create so that some part of us may remain after death.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/ShaperNarrator/SH30_01_Arcade.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[181]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1187, 'ShaperMapCrystalOre', '[]', 'As the torch flickers, brilliance emerges in boundless variance.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/ShaperNarrator/SH30_02_CrystalOre.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[181]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1188, 'ShaperMapDesert', '[]', 'Heat. Dust. Wind. These are what forge strong minds and bodies.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/ShaperNarrator/SH30_03_Desert.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[181]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1189, 'ShaperMapJungleValley', '[]', 'Verdant canopies shroud the world in darkness.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/ShaperNarrator/SH30_04_JungleValley.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[181]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1190, 'ShaperMapBeach', '[]', 'A paradise, forever replenished by endless waves teeming with life.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/ShaperNarrator/SH30_05_Beach.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[181]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1191, 'ShaperMapFactory', '[]', 'Repetition. Convention. Duplication. Creation distilled to perfection.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/ShaperNarrator/SH30_06_Factory.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[181]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1192, 'ShaperMapGhetto', '[]', 'Amongst the rabble, brutality is the law.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/ShaperNarrator/SH30_07_Ghetto.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[181]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1193, 'ShaperMapDesertSpring', '[]', 'As mirage becomes reality, hardship is briefly quenched.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/ShaperNarrator/SH30_08_Oasis.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[181]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1194, 'ShaperMapAridLake', '[]', 'Water vanishes; an impromptu prison becomes a tomb.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/ShaperNarrator/SH30_09_AridLake.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[181]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1195, 'ShaperMapFloodedMine', '[]', 'In darkness, beast and man alike clamour to survive.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/ShaperNarrator/SH30_10_Cavern.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[181]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1196, 'ShaperMapChannel', '[]', 'The stone cannot stop the torrent. It can only divert it.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/ShaperNarrator/SH30_11_Channel.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[181]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1197, 'ShaperMapGrotto', '[]', 'Trapped in absolute darkness. Despair. Panic. Terror.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/ShaperNarrator/SH30_12_Grotto.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[181]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1198, 'ShaperMapMarshes', '[]', 'Embraced by mud. Grasped by roots. The careless are silently swallowed.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/ShaperNarrator/SH30_13_Marshes.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[181]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1199, 'ShaperMapToxicSewer', '[]', 'Affluence and effluence, separated by a few feet of soil.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/ShaperNarrator/SH30_14_Sewer.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[181]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1200, 'ShaperMapVaalPyramid', '[]', 'A good slave is driven by only two thoughts: service and sacrifice.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/ShaperNarrator/SH30_15_VaalPyramid.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[181]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1201, 'ShaperMapAcademy', '[]', 'They came for enlightenment, but were imprisoned by madness.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/ShaperNarrator/SH30_16_Academy.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[181]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1202, 'ShaperMapAcidLakes', '[]', 'Clear water springs forth. A moment of purity before it too gathers filth.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/ShaperNarrator/SH30_98_Springs.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[181]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1203, 'ShaperMapDungeon', '[]', 'A penitentiary for those who are not penitent is nothing more than an inn for the evil.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/ShaperNarrator/SH30_18_Dungeon.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[181]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1204, 'ShaperMapGraveyard', '[]', 'Unknown legacies. Untold stories.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/ShaperNarrator/SH30_19_Graveyard.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[181]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1205, 'ShaperMapPhantasmagoria', '[]', 'Every movement is watched, recorded, remembered.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/ShaperNarrator/SH30_20_Phantasmagoria.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[181]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1206, 'ShaperMapVilla', '[]', 'Wealth is powerless to stop the corroding force of time.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/ShaperNarrator/SH30_21_Villa.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[181]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1207, 'ShaperMapWastePool', '[]', 'Verdant life blossoms amidst death.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/ShaperNarrator/SH30_22_WastePool.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[181]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1208, 'ShaperMapBurialChambers', '[]', 'Vile fiends hide beneath the peaceful plains.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/ShaperNarrator/SH30_23_BurialChambers.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[181]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1209, 'ShaperMapPeninsula', '[]', 'The farmer no longer plows or sows. Only the flattened soil remains.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/ShaperNarrator/SH30_24_DryPeninsula.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[181]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1210, 'ShaperMapDunes', '[]', 'Shifting, morphing, expanding. A reminder of the virtues of an agile mind.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/ShaperNarrator/SH30_25_Dunes.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[181]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1211, 'ShaperMapMesa', '[]', 'Barren and sun-bleached. Emptiness as far as the eye can reach.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/ShaperNarrator/SH30_26_Mesa.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[181]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1212, 'ShaperMapPit', '[]', 'Blood turns the soil to mud.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/ShaperNarrator/SH30_27_Pit.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[181]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1213, 'ShaperMapPrimordialPool', '[]', 'A dough of bad blood. A yeast of ill will.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/ShaperNarrator/SH30_28_PrimordialPool.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[181]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1214, 'ShaperMapSpiderLair', '[]', 'Panic only hastens the venom''s passage to the heart.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/ShaperNarrator/SH30_29_SpiderLair.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[181]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1215, 'ShaperMapTower', '[]', 'We ascend to great heights to commit low acts.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/ShaperNarrator/SH30_30_Tower.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[181]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1216, 'ShaperMapCanyon', '[]', 'A deep wound in the land. One that will never heal.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/ShaperNarrator/SH30_31_Canyon.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[181]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1217, 'ShaperMapGeode', '[]', 'Many hands may move a mountain.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/ShaperNarrator/SH30_32_Quarry.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[181]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1218, 'ShaperMapRacecourse', '[]', 'Rats chase their tails for the amusement of fools.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/ShaperNarrator/SH30_33_Racecourse.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[181]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1219, 'ShaperMapRamparts', '[]', 'A wall is the surest sign for raiders that there is something of value to take.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/ShaperNarrator/SH30_34_Ramparts.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[181]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1220, 'ShaperMapSpiderForest', '[]', 'Each branch, each leaf, an extension of a web that spans sanity.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/ShaperNarrator/SH30_35_SpiderForest.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[181]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1221, 'ShaperMapStrand', '[]', 'Nothing good washes up on this dark shore.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/ShaperNarrator/SH30_36_Strand.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[181]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1222, 'ShaperMapThicket', '[]', 'Little light enters. No life escapes.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/ShaperNarrator/SH30_37_Thicket.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[181]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1223, 'ShaperMapAncientCity', '[]', 'This was not the first civilization to believe itself the greatest. And it will not be the last.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/ShaperNarrator/SH30_38_VaalCity.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[181]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1224, 'ShaperMapWharf', '[]', 'Reach out into the abyss, and the abyss reaches back.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/ShaperNarrator/SH30_39_Wharf.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[181]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1225, 'ShaperMapArachnidTomb', '[]', 'They feel your every move, your every breath, with a million little wires.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/ShaperNarrator/SH30_40_ArachnidTomb.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[181]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1226, 'ShaperMapCastleRuins', '[]', 'When the castle falls, it has failed its only purpose.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/ShaperNarrator/SH30_41_CastleRuins.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[181]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1227, 'ShaperMapBoneCrypt', '[]', 'The dead ask to be remembered, but such requests are seldom met.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/ShaperNarrator/SH30_42_Catacombs.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[181]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1228, 'ShaperMapCells', '[]', 'Life crushed together. Left to crumble to dust.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/ShaperNarrator/SH30_43_Cells.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[181]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1229, 'ShaperMapColonnade', '[]', 'Small minds demand the largest structures.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/ShaperNarrator/SH30_44_Colonnade.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[181]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1230, 'ShaperMapAshenWood', '[]', 'Desperately reaching skyward and digging downwards. Sustenance is an eternal struggle.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/ShaperNarrator/SH30_45_DryWoods.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[181]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1231, 'ShaperMapMudGeyser', '[]', 'Filth springs forth like blood from a severed jugular.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/ShaperNarrator/SH30_46_MudGeyser.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[181]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1232, 'ShaperMapArachnidNest', '[]', 'Man is not the only beast to bend nature to its will.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/ShaperNarrator/SH30_47_ArachnidNest.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[181]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1233, 'ShaperMapArena', '[]', 'The sound of a thousand calls for blood echo for eternity.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/ShaperNarrator/SH30_48_Arena.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[181]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1234, 'ShaperMapBog', '[]', 'Layer upon layer of death and rot. Disgusting.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/ShaperNarrator/SH30_49_Bog.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[181]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1235, 'ShaperMapCemetery', '[]', 'A stone forest of forgotten names.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/ShaperNarrator/SH30_50_Cemetery.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[181]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1236, 'ShaperMapBarrows', '[]', 'Man burrows for only the eternal hibernation.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/ShaperNarrator/SH30_51_Barrows.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[181]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1237, 'ShaperMapAtoll', '[]', 'Time turns even the vicious volcanoes to hollow shells.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/ShaperNarrator/SH30_52_Atoll.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[181]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1238, 'ShaperMapPier', '[]', 'Man''s reach extends into the ocean, clawing at its infinite depths.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/ShaperNarrator/SH30_53_Pier.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[181]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1239, 'ShaperMapShore', '[]', 'Each life, each act, as fleeting as footprints in the sand.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/ShaperNarrator/SH30_54_Shore.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[181]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1240, 'ShaperMapTropicalIsland', '[]', 'The temptations of paradise draw forth the good and the bad alike.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/ShaperNarrator/SH30_55_TropicalIsland.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[181]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1241, 'ShaperMapCoves', '[]', 'The dark seas swallow the careless and spit them against sharp rocks.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/ShaperNarrator/SH30_56_Coves.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[181]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1242, 'ShaperMapCursedCrypt', '[]', 'Saints and heathens look the same once the rot takes hold.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/ShaperNarrator/SH30_57_Crypt.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[181]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1243, 'ShaperMapMuseum', '[]', 'Ancient artefacts and beautiful baubles. All paid for in blood.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/ShaperNarrator/SH30_58_Museum.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[181]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1244, 'ShaperMapOrchard', '[]', 'The fruit that grows from bloody ground tastes sweetest.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/ShaperNarrator/SH30_59_Orchard.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[181]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1245, 'ShaperMapOvergrownShrine', '[]', 'A once great monument, now a forgotten memorial.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/ShaperNarrator/SH30_60_OvergrownShrine.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[181]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1246, 'ShaperMapPromenade', '[]', 'Even the greatest achievements will eventually be abandoned.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/ShaperNarrator/SH30_61_Promenade.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[181]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1247, 'ShaperMapReef', '[]', 'Each plank of rotting wood, each dead sailor, feeds the island and makes it grow.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/ShaperNarrator/SH30_62_Reef.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[181]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1248, 'ShaperMapTemple', '[]', 'Immaculate white stone rises from the abyss. Perfection.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/ShaperNarrator/SH30_63_Temple.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[181]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1249, 'ShaperMapArmoury', '[]', 'There is no war. There is no army. Only fear lingers.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/ShaperNarrator/SH30_64_Armory.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[181]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1250, 'ShaperMapArsenal', '[]', 'There is no war. There is no army. Only rage lingers.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/ShaperNarrator/SH30_65_Arsenal.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[181]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1251, 'ShaperMapCourtyard', '[]', 'An elaborate, beautiful garden, hidden from the public. Selfish.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/ShaperNarrator/SH30_66_Courtyard.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[181]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1252, 'ShaperMapMalformation', '[]', 'Boils swell from the earth. Foul malignant flesh without purpose.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/ShaperNarrator/SH30_67_Malformation.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[181]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1253, 'ShaperMapPort', '[]', 'The wealthy foolishly battle the ocean for domain.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/ShaperNarrator/SH30_68_Quay.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[181]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1254, 'ShaperMapGardens', '[]', 'Vibrant colours dash across the grey, consuming Man''s work.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/ShaperNarrator/SH30_69_Terrace.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[181]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1255, 'ShaperMapUndergroundRiver', '[]', 'Life, like still water, becomes trapped. Stagnant. Foul.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/ShaperNarrator/SH30_70_UndergroundRiver.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[181]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1256, 'ShaperMapBazaar', '[]', 'Greed is the only god here.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/ShaperNarrator/SH30_71_Bazaar.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[181]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1257, 'ShaperMapChateau', '[]', 'Beauty and brutality in such close proximity.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/ShaperNarrator/SH30_72_Chateau.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[181]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1258, 'ShaperMapExcavation', '[]', 'Two unexplored frontiers remain: The skies and the soil.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/ShaperNarrator/SH30_73_Excavation.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[181]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1259, 'ShaperMapPrecinct', '[]', 'Crushed together and fenced in, to live out their lives like cattle.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/ShaperNarrator/SH30_74_Precinct.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[181]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1260, 'ShaperMapTortureChamber', '[]', 'Who is the true criminal, the one behind bars, or the one who tortures him?', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/ShaperNarrator/SH30_75_TortureChamber.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[181]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1261, 'ShaperMapUndergroundSea', '[]', 'Silent stillness. The waters are as cold as they are black.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/ShaperNarrator/SH30_76_UndergroundSea.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[181]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1262, 'ShaperMapWasteland', '[]', 'A white bone stripped of its fertile flesh. Life spirals towards its end.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/ShaperNarrator/SH30_77_Wasteland.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[181]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1263, 'ShaperMapLavaChamber', '[]', 'Fiend and fortune-hunter alike turned to ash. A sorry alliance of unending agony.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/ShaperNarrator/SH30_78_Crematorium.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[181]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1264, 'ShaperMapEstuary', '[]', 'Where land springs from water, life will shortly follow.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/ShaperNarrator/SH30_79_Estuary.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[181]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1265, 'ShaperMapNecropolis', '[]', 'Even in death, we long to be close to one another.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/ShaperNarrator/SH30_80_Necropolis.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[181]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1266, 'ShaperMapPlateau', '[]', 'Steep cliffs divide where the trees may grow, and where they may not.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/ShaperNarrator/SH30_81_Plateau.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[181]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1267, 'ShaperMapIvoryTemple', '[]', 'Man and nature intertwined, but only for the chosen few.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/ShaperNarrator/SH30_82_IvoryTemple.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[181]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1268, 'ShaperMapResidence', '[]', 'Home only to misery now.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/ShaperNarrator/SH30_83_Residence.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[181]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1269, 'ShaperMapShipyard', '[]', 'The stone and lumber sleeps. The captains are long dead. Only the sea knows their end.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/ShaperNarrator/SH30_84_Shipyard.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[181]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1270, 'ShaperMapVault', '[]', 'Wealth beyond imagining, locked beyond reach.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/ShaperNarrator/SH30_85_Vault.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[181]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1271, 'ShaperMapLair', '[]', 'In darkness, the alpha rises. The companionship of beasts is fragile indeed.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/ShaperNarrator/SH30_86_Lair.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[181]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1272, 'ShaperMapLighthouse', '[]', 'Fire ignites the sky. A signal to keep away. An invitation to invade.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/ShaperNarrator/SH30_87_Beacon.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[181]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1273, 'ShaperMapGorge', '[]', 'So much power in the hands of so few.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/ShaperNarrator/ShW17_Tribunal.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[181]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1274, 'ShaperMapTerrace', '[]', 'A garden on a stone pedestal. An incredible, and foolish, feat.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/ShaperNarrator/SH30_89_HighGardens.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[181]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1275, 'ShaperMapPlaza', '[]', 'Drought took the plants, famine took the people.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/ShaperNarrator/SH30_90_Plaza.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[181]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1276, 'ShaperMapScriptorium', '[]', 'Knowledge balanced atop a vast pit. Hold on, or perish in the darkness of ignorance.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/ShaperNarrator/SH30_91_Scriptorium.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[181]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1277, 'ShaperMapLeyline', '[]', 'Amidst the barren wastes, a slender strand of life blooms.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/ShaperNarrator/ShW34_Leyline.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[181]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1278, 'ShaperMapWaterways', '[]', 'A river in the sky, far from that which so desperately needs it.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/ShaperNarrator/SH30_93_Waterways.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[181]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1279, 'ShaperMapMaze', '[]', 'They live trapped forever in darkness and confusion. We are no different.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/ShaperNarrator/SH30_94_Maze.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[181]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1280, 'ShaperMapMineralPools', '[]', 'God''s jar of raw materials. Life lying dormant, waiting to sprout.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/ShaperNarrator/SH30_95_MineralPools.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[181]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1281, 'ShaperMapPalace', '[]', 'Death forces even the most determined of despots to pass the crown.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/ShaperNarrator/SH30_96_Palace.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[181]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1282, 'ShaperMapShrine', '[]', 'Black tiles don''t stain so easily.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/ShaperNarrator/SH30_97_Shrine.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[181]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1283, 'ShaperMapSprings', '[]', 'The water brings life, the poison takes it away.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/ShaperNarrator/SH30_17_AcidLakes.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[181]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1284, 'ShaperMapVolcano', '[]', 'Tremble in the might of the flames.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/ShaperNarrator/SH30_99_Volcano.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[181]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1285, 'ShaperMapCaldera', '[]', 'From the heart of fire, rivers of burning rage billow forth.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/ShaperNarrator/ShW40_Caldera.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[181]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1286, 'ShaperMapColosseum', '[]', 'Life means as little as a passing moment of entertainment. Let them rot.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/ShaperNarrator/SH30_A1_Colosseum.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[181]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1287, 'ShaperMapCore', '[]', 'Black monstrous bridges cross oily rivers, leading nowhere. Nothing as it should be.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/ShaperNarrator/SH30_A2_Core.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[181]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1288, 'ShaperMapDarkForest', '[]', 'The trees grow twisted and gnarled, without a hint of light. A curse lingers here.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/ShaperNarrator/SH30_A3_DarkForest.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[181]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1289, 'ShaperMapOvergrownRuin', '[]', 'Only fear remains unforgotten, where once magnificent rites drew important crowds.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/ShaperNarrator/SH30_A4_OvergrownRuin.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[181]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1290, 'ShaperMapChimera', '[]', 'One of my captors hid a beast within his heart. Now his true self can be seen by all.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/ShaperNarrator/ShW41_Chimera.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[181]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1291, 'ShaperMapHydra', '[]', 'One of my captors wore many faces, yet kept her true face hidden. Now she cannot escape her true face.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/ShaperNarrator/SH30_A6_Hydra.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[181]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1292, 'ShaperMapMinotaur', '[]', 'One of my captors felt no emotion. He did not hesitate to inflict pain. Now all he feels is intense, unstoppable agony.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/ShaperNarrator/SH30_A7_Minotaur.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[181]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1293, 'ShaperMapPhoenix', '[]', 'One of my captors refused redemption. He did not see value in a new life. Now new life surrounds him.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/ShaperNarrator/SH30_A8_Phoenix.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[181]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1294, 'ShaperMapShapersRealm', '[]', 'I see you, little mouse... you don''t belong here. Run along!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/ShaperNarrator/Sh03a_ShaperRealmIntro1.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[181]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1295, 'ShaperMapVaalTemple', '[]', 'Voices. Visions. Violence. They will haunt these grounds for all of eternity.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/ShaperNarrator/SH30_B0_VaalTemple.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[181]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1296, 'ShaperMapAlleyways', '[]', 'An unwashed gutter, where wretches cut purses and throats alike.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/ShaperNarrator/ShW14_Alleyways.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[181]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1297, 'ShaperMapLookout', '[]', 'A glorious vista once exclusive to emperors. Not anymore.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/ShaperNarrator/ShW20_Lookout.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[181]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1298, 'ShaperMapPen', '[]', 'Slaves held like cattle. A blood-soaked revolution, just waiting to happen.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/ShaperNarrator/ShW13_Pen.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[181]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1299, 'ShaperMapIceberg', '[]', 'Icy fangs seek tender hulls to sink themselves into.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/ShaperNarrator/ShW29_Iceberg.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[181]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1300, 'ShaperMapCage', '[]', 'Treat a man like a wild animal, and he will soon learn to bite.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/ShaperNarrator/ShW31_Cage.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[181]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1301, 'ShaperMapCitySquare', '[]', 'Countless generations have walked these time-worn stones.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/ShaperNarrator/ShW25_CitySquare.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[181]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1302, 'ShaperMapRelicChambers', '[]', 'Relics of a forbidden past. Hidden away. Forgotten.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/ShaperNarrator/ShW16_RelicChambers.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[181]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1303, 'ShaperMapCourthouse', '[]', 'Justice born of love is a surrender. Justice born of law is a punishment.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/ShaperNarrator/ShW22_Courthouse.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[181]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1304, 'ShaperMapConservatory', '[]', 'Ornate, elaborate, ostentatious... and dripping with death.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/ShaperNarrator/ShW28_Conservatory.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[181]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1305, 'ShaperMapSulphurVents', '[]', 'The creatures that prowl the wildest extremes, nature anoints with cruel efficacy to defend her.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/ShaperNarrator/ShW11_SulphurVents.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[181]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1306, 'ShaperMapHauntedMansion', '[]', 'Forlorn and sorrowful, this once opulent ruin conceals the sins of a fallen line.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/ShaperNarrator/ShW36_HauntedMansion.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[181]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1307, 'ShaperMapMausoleum', '[]', 'A vault for the dead, as if they were valuable. Pathetic.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/ShaperNarrator/ShW38_Mausoleum.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[181]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1308, 'ShaperMapFields', '[]', 'They pleaded for the gods to bless their land. Now they lie under the soil.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/ShaperNarrator/ShW27_Fields.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[181]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1309, 'ShaperMapTribunal', '[]', 'We must all walk the narrow, winding path. The end is always the same.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/ShaperNarrator/SH30_88_Gorge.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[181]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1310, 'ShaperMapCoralRuins', '[]', 'Thrust above the waves, still teeming with horrors from the depths.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/ShaperNarrator/ShW39_CoralRuins.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[181]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1311, 'ShaperMapLaboratory', '[]', 'My last waking moments looked very much like this place... I miss it. I miss her.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/ShaperNarrator/ShW23_Laboratory.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[181]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1312, 'ShaperMapInfestedValley', '[]', 'Should we feel disgusted at how the weak predate the strong, or should we feel... admiration?', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/ShaperNarrator/ShW09_InfestedValley.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[181]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1313, 'ShaperMapMoonTemple', '[]', 'Night''s promises are dark, for even the stars must be harvested.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/ShaperNarrator/ShW33_MoonTemple.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[181]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1314, 'ShaperMapSepulchre', '[]', 'Lives come and go. Only bones and dust remain.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/ShaperNarrator/ShW24_Sepulchre.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[181]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1315, 'ShaperMapSiege', '[]', 'No rest, no peace, no negotiation. Only War.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/ShaperNarrator/ShW19_Siege.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[181]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1316, 'ShaperMapBelfry', '[]', 'Bells are rung in celebration, and in sorrow. And, finally, in despair.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/ShaperNarrator/ShW35_Belfry.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[181]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1317, 'ShaperMapDefiledCathedral', '[]', 'Crafted with reverence. Defiled with ease.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/ShaperNarrator/ShW21_DefiledCathedral.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[181]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1318, 'ShaperMapSummit', '[]', 'We are swept ever upwards by our ambition, with no thought of what awaits us at the peak.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/ShaperNarrator/ShW08_Summit.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[181]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1319, 'ShaperMapPark', '[]', 'A brief respite in a sea of obligation and uncertainty.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/ShaperNarrator/ShW32_Park.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[181]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1320, 'ShaperMapCrimsonTemple', '[]', 'A sanguine supplication to death and depravity.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/ShaperNarrator/ShW26_CrimsonTemple.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[181]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1321, 'ShaperMapDig', '[]', 'A hollow echo of bygone times in a land where none lived long.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/ShaperNarrator/ShW30_Dig.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[181]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1322, 'ShaperMapLavaLake', '[]', 'At the heart of a peaceful, secluded valley, an island of burning, consuming fury.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/ShaperNarrator/ShW12_LavaLake.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[181]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1323, 'ShaperMapBasilica', '[]', 'Built so the prayers would echo. A resonance no god could hear.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/ShaperNarrator/ShW37_Basilica.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[181]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1324, 'ShaperMapSunkenCity', '[]', 'From the walls, water, and ferns... Death comes crawling on ancient steps.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/ShaperNarrator/ShW15_SunkenCity.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[181]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1325, 'ShaperMapCarcass', '[]', 'Life''s wet, reproductive stink abates, relenting to death''s chaste ritual of decay.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/ShaperNarrator/ShW10_Carcass.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[181]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1326, 'ShaperMapDrySea', '[]', 'Heat. Dust. Wind. These are what forge strong minds and bodies.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/ShaperNarrator/SH30_03_Desert.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[181]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1327, 'ShaperMapStagnation', '[]', 'The trees grow twisted and gnarled, without a hint of light. A curse lingers here.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/ShaperNarrator/SH30_A3_DarkForest.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[181]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1328, 'ShaperMapBrambleFall', '[]', 'The trees grow twisted and gnarled, without a hint of light. A curse lingers here.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/ShaperNarrator/SH30_A3_DarkForest.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[181]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1329, 'ShaperMapFrozenCabins', '[]', 'Icy fangs seek tender hulls to sink themselves into.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/ShaperNarrator/ShW29_Iceberg.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[181]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1330, 'ShaperMapBurn', '[]', 'A stone forest of forgotten names.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/ShaperNarrator/SH30_50_Cemetery.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[181]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1331, 'ShaperMapCrimsonTownship', '[]', 'Crafted with reverence. Defiled with ease.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/ShaperNarrator/ShW21_DefiledCathedral.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[181]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1332, 'ShaperMapForkingRiver', '[]', 'Embraced by mud. Grasped by roots. The careless are silently swallowed.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/ShaperNarrator/SH30_13_Marshes.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[181]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1333, 'ShaperMapThaumaturgy', '[]', 'Repetition. Convention. Duplication. Creation distilled to perfection.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/ShaperNarrator/SH30_06_Factory.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[181]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1334, 'ShaperMapIceRiver', '[]', 'Night''s promises are dark, for even the stars must be harvested.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/ShaperNarrator/ShW33_MoonTemple.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[181]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1335, 'ShaperMapForbiddenWoods', '[]', 'Little light enters. No life escapes.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/ShaperNarrator/SH30_37_Thicket.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[181]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1336, 'ShaperMapSilo', '[]', 'Fiend and fortune-hunter alike turned to ash. A sorry alliance of unending agony.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/ShaperNarrator/SH30_78_Crematorium.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[181]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1337, 'ShaperIntro', '[]', 'You force my hand again, little mouse... So be it. You''ve chosen to side with Chaos. This is my world, and you shall obey my Order!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/ShaperNarrator/Sh03h_FightIntro.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[181]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1338, 'ShaperHalfHealthA', '[]', 'Behold the face of your unmaking!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/ShaperNarrator/Sh03l_AfterFirstGauntlet_A.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[181]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1339, 'ShaperHalfHealthB', '[]', 'The horror must be stopped, obstacles destroyed!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/ShaperNarrator/Sh03l_AfterFirstGauntlet_B.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[181]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1340, 'ShaperQuarterHealthA', '[]', 'These memories are mine! I cannot lose them!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/ShaperNarrator/Sh03m_AfterSecondGauntlet_A.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[181]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1341, 'ShaperQuarterHealthB', '[]', 'To save the future, the past must be sacrificed!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/ShaperNarrator/Sh03m_AfterSecondGauntlet_B.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[181]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1342, 'ShaperQuest1a', '[]', 'What''s this? A little mouse, running in my maze... I hope you''ve said your prayers... and lost your faith. The gods do not answer us here.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/ShaperNarrator/Sh01a_Encounter1.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[181]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1343, 'ShaperQuest1b', '[]', 'Well done, little mouse. But there are far worse things lurking in these realms...', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/ShaperNarrator/Sh01b_Outro1.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[181]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1344, 'ShaperQuest2a', '[]', 'The void nourishes, elevates, perfects. Break yourself upon my creation!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/ShaperNarrator/Sh01c_Encounter2.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[181]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1345, 'ShaperQuest2b', '[]', 'Another lost... no matter. The void will provide. Insignificant.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/ShaperNarrator/Sh01d_Outro2.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[181]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1346, 'ShaperQuest3a', '[]', 'You tread on the foundations of a new empire, behold!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/ShaperNarrator/Sh01e_Encounter3.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[181]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1347, 'ShaperQuest3b', '[]', 'The strong feed upon the weak. It''s only a matter of time.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/ShaperNarrator/Sh01f_Outro3.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[181]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1348, 'ShaperQuest4a', '[]', 'What drives you to such violence, little mouse? We shall see...', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/ShaperNarrator/Sh01g_Encounter4.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[181]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1349, 'ShaperQuest4b', '[]', 'Your actions betray your true nature.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/ShaperNarrator/Sh01h_Outro4.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[181]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1350, 'ShaperQuest5', '[]', 'You shall trespass no further. It is time to end this... Argh!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/ShaperNarrator/Sh01i_Encounter5.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[181]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1351, 'ShaperTrueDefeat1_ExtraAudio', '[]', 'Oh... Where am I...? Zana? My little girl? You''re all grown up...', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/ShaperNarrator/Sh04_DeathWithMemories.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[181]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1352, 'ShaperTrueDefeat2_NoAudio', '[]', 'The creature... Gods, how could we have known...?', '', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[181]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1353, 'ShaperTrueDefeat3_NoAudio', '[]', 'I''m so glad to see your face again.', '', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[181]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1354, 'ShaperTrueDefeat4_NoAudio', '[]', 'Zana, my study... you must unlock my private study!', '', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[181]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1355, 'ShaperTrueDefeat5_NoAudio', '[]', 'The weapon, it''s our only chance! I have the key here somewhere... ah!', '', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[181]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1356, 'ShaperTrueDefeat6_NoAudio', '[]', 'Foul beast! Once more into the abyss with you!', '', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[181]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1357, 'ShaperTrueDefeat7_NoAudio', '[]', 'Argh! No, my mind! My memories... fading... Argh!', '', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[181]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1358, 'ShaperOutroGenericRandom', '[]', 'Cast once more into the infinite void. Inconsequential...', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/ShaperNarrator/Sh01-Genericoutro01.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[181]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1359, 'ShaperOutroGeneric2', '[]', 'Death comes for us all, eventually. Even you...', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/ShaperNarrator/Sh01-Genericoutro02.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[181]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1360, 'ShaperOutroGeneric3', '[]', 'You should pray that it does not reach you first...', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/ShaperNarrator/Sh01-Genericoutro03.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[181]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1361, 'ShaperOutroGeneric4', '[]', 'Savour this moment of victory. There will not be another.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/ShaperNarrator/Sh01-Genericoutro04.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[181]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1362, 'ShaperOutroGeneric5', '[]', 'Your vile acts ripple outwards... can''t you feel it...?', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/ShaperNarrator/Sh01-Genericoutro05.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[181]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1363, 'ShaperIntroGenericRandom', '[]', 'Tread no further, villain.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/ShaperNarrator/Sh01-Genericintro01.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[181]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1364, 'ShaperIntroGeneric2', '[]', 'These worlds are not yours.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/ShaperNarrator/Sh01-Genericintro02.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[181]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1365, 'ShaperIntroGeneric3', '[]', 'You reek of imperfection.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/ShaperNarrator/Sh01-Genericintro03.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[181]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1366, 'ShaperIntroGeneric4', '[]', 'Cast yourself into oblivion.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/ShaperNarrator/Sh01-Genericintro04.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[181]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1367, 'ShaperIntroGeneric5', '[]', 'Prepare to face your unmaking.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/ShaperNarrator/Sh01-Genericintro05.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[181]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1368, 'ShaperIntroGeneric6', '[]', 'You do not belong here.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/ShaperNarrator/Sh01-Genericintro06.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[181]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1369, 'ShaperBanishRandom', '[]', 'Imperfect!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/ShaperNarrator/SH25g.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[181]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1370, 'ShaperBanish2', '[]', 'Imperfect!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/ShaperNarrator/SH25g_01.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[181]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1371, 'ShaperBanish3', '[]', 'Irrelevant!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/ShaperNarrator/SH25g_02.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[181]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1372, 'ShaperBanish4', '[]', 'Insubstantial!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/ShaperNarrator/SH25g_03.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[181]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1373, 'ShaperBanish5', '[]', 'Insignificant!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/ShaperNarrator/SH25g_04.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[181]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1374, 'ShaperBanish6', '[]', 'Inconsequential!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/ShaperNarrator/SH25g_05.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[181]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1375, 'ResonatorInfo', '[]', 'Captain Tevarus,' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Altitude is imperative to forging a stable connection with the Prime Resonator in Theopolis. Power source is equally vital. Locate a fissure in the mountainside and lower a conductive cable into it, the deeper the better. It will take an immense amount of thaumaturgical energy to execute the successful disintegration and transmission of objects, both inanimate and animate, between Highgate and Theopolis. For that kind of power, we must tap the origin.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
I needn''t remind you of the consequences should either of those elements prove deficient. That is why I would like you, Tevarus, to be the first to test the Resonator once it is operational.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Accountability is the perfect counterweight to ambition.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
High Templar Dominus', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/DominusGlyph/Dom_SG_ResonatorInstructions.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[97]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1376, 'LaniIntroduction1', '[0]', 'An exile returned? How is that even possible? And a Karui warrior, too. Descending from the sky to destroy our enemies like Tukohama in the stories my mother used to tell me. Well, your ''divine intervention'' gave us just the diversion we needed to take this tower, so if you keep doing things like that then I might have to start believing in the gods again.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Lani/L01.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[182]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1377, 'LaniIntroduction2', '[6]', 'An exile returned? How is that even possible? And a Templar at that. Striding out of the sunlight to lay waste to our enemies like Ramako in the stories my mother used to tell me. Well, your ''divine intervention'' gave us just the diversion we needed to take this tower, so if you keep doing things like that then I might have to start believing in the gods again.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Lani/L02.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[182]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1378, 'LaniIntroduction3', '[]', 'An exile returned? How is that even possible? Rising out of the darkness to claim the souls of our enemies like Hinekora in the stories my mother used to tell me. Well, your ''divine intervention'' gave us just the diversion we needed to take this tower, so if you keep doing things like that then I might have to start believing in the gods again.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Lani/L03.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[182]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1379, 'LaniOverseerReward', '[]', 'And thank you for finishing off that last overseer for us. I don''t know what sort of mother could''ve birthed that land-loving whale, but we were lucky he wasn''t here when we took this tower. He''d have spread us across the floor like butter on a piece of bread.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Here, take something, for helping us in this hopeless fight of ours.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Lani/L06.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[182]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1380, 'LaniCasticusReward', '[]', 'Thank you. By killing Casticus, you''ve given us a fighting chance. ' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
And about his eyes... I''m sorry you had to do that, yet although Utula''s solution might seem brutal, I''ve seen Karui men blinded with a hot poker simply for looking a fraction too long at an Oriathan lady. Yes, this is war... and just a little revenge too. ' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Take something, a token of our thanks.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Lani/L07.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[182]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1381, 'LaniOnUprising', '[]', 'We''d been planning it for months. Spreading the word. Stealing weapons. Gathering support. Utula and his followers did most of the dirty work. I just carried a few messages here and there. Should''ve known I''d end up like this when the real fighting started.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
In the darkest hour before dawn, that''s when we broke our chains, and as many overseer necks as we could wrap our hands around. We took the panopticon as the sun rose over Theopolis, and that''s as far as we got. When you''re up against cold steel and colder hearts, there''s only so far that anger will take you.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Lani/L08.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[182]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1382, 'LaniOnUtula', '[]', 'Few of us can say that we''ve devoted our lives to anything greater than ourselves. Can you? ' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
I think Utula can. Since the day I met him, I''ve seen Utula do nothing that wasn''t in the service of his people.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
He''s a smart one. He could have escaped. He could have sailed off to Ngamakanui and never looked back. Yet there he stands, our herald of freedom. I might die of this wound, yet I''d be giving but a fraction of what Utula has to honour the Karui Way.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Lani/L09.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[182]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1383, 'LaniOnUtulaTraitor', '[]', 'I can''t yet begin to unpick the lies that Utula has told us, but this piece of truth I do have. Utula sensed that very moment when you struck your final blow, when you broke the Templar''s power. He turned to me and told me this. ' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
"Now our King comes to us. He''ll be hungry, so very hungry. I shall prepare him a feast!" ' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Then he gathered his followers and left. ' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Where''s he gone? Oriath Square. You won''t need directions. Just follow the screams.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Lani/L12.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[182]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1384, 'LaniOnUtulaDead', '[]', 'You''ve sent the traitor to meet his Ancestors, have you? That''ll be an interesting conversation. I''m no <i>{hatungo}, but I can foresee Utula walking a long road of trial and suffering before he earns himself a place at the Ancestors'' table. ' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
And just as Utula''s journey continues, so does yours, right into the jaws of Kitava.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
I don''t profess to understand the mind of a god, but I know the stories. Kitava is patient. He waited in the darkest pit of Hinekora''s realm. He will bide his time while his hunger spreads like the plague it is, and when his tribe is replenished, a hundred times over, Kitava will rise one final time to finish the feast that he has started. Oriath is merely the appetiser. There''s a whole world out there for Kitava to taste.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
You''ve proved that you''re a hero who can slay legends. Let''s see if you can kill a god.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Lani/L19.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[182]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1385, 'LaniOnVilenta', '[]', 'I''d be dead right now if not for Vilenta. I just hope I live long enough to repay her. And how will I do that? By talking Utula out of his inclination to slice Vilenta''s throat open. ' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
As far as I''m concerned, our pasts are as broken as our chains.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Lani/L10.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[182]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1386, 'LaniOnBannon', '[]', 'Bannon is... unexpected. At least, he''s not the sort of Templar that I''m used to dealing with. His ideas about Innocence almost make sense to me. The way he worships Innocence, and receives such power in return, it''s like his devotion actually brings out the best in his god.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
But how is that possible? A god is a god. They bless us and they punish us, not the other way around. Yet for Bannon, somehow it''s... different.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Lani/L13.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[182]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1387, 'LaniOnOriathSquare', '[]', 'When I was a courier for my father''s house, I''d cross Cathedral Square a hundred times in a day. On the fairest days that square would be filled to bursting with Oriath''s high born, come to bask in the sun and each other''s glowing nobility. It was a pretty sight, depending on where you stood.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Lani/L15.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[182]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1388, 'LaniInnocenceReward', '[]', 'You deserve recognition for what you have done, you''ve freed us from Templar oppression. Yet I fear you may have defeated the lesser of two evils.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Still... take something. You''ll be needing it in the dark times to come.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Lani/L11.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[182]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1389, 'LaniOnKingsFeast', '[]', 'The King''s Feast is an ancient ritual born of less enlightened times. Long before the Karui followed the Way, one tribe would conquer another and a feast would be prepared for the triumphant King. The main dishes of this feast were selected carefully, for the sweetness of their nature and the tenderness of their flesh.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
You see, when the conquered fills the belly of the conqueror, two tribes become one.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
And that''s what''s happening out there in Theopolis, right now. The Tribe of Kitava is feeding upon the Tribe of Oriath, and the feast won''t end until two tribes become one.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Lani/L14.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[182]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1390, 'LaniOnCultOfKitava', '[]', 'Remember what Utula said about Kitava? ' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
"He is the Tormented One, destined to rise up from the darkness... And we, his children, rise with him."' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
It was there all along, in eyes too bright and smiles too wide. Cunning concealed by kindness. Conquest wearing the mask of Freedom. I didn''t see it because I was looking for something else. Hope.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
The Cult only wanted what it''s always wanted. To be born again in their father''s image. They are Kitava''s children, the first of his tribe. Unless you do something about it, they won''t be the last.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Lani/L16.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[182]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1391, 'LaniTormentQuest', '[]', 'Once Kitava has gobbled up every scrap of Oriathan flesh, sucked every Oriathan bone dry of marrow, he''ll turn his endless hunger to Ngamakanui and the whole Karui Archipelago.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
As you know, the Karui will fight, and they''ll fight hard, but they''re going to need all the help they can get. And I know of three treasures that might just make the difference.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
They were taken when the Templar raided Ngamakanui. A whip woven of Hinekora''s hair. A tooth that Tukohama ripped from his own mouth. A fish hook that was once the jawbone of Valako. Together they''re known as ''Kitava''s Torments'' and lie within the Reliquary that borders Oriath Square. I saw them with my own eyes when delivering messages to the scholars there.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Please, go to the Reliquary and claim those treasures before Kitava''s children do.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Lani/L17.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[182]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1392, 'LaniTormentReward', '[]', 'Not all slaves believed Utula''s lies. Some I know have managed to steal a ship and are soon to set sail for Ngamakanui. Hopefully, with these treasures onboard, Valako will bless their voyage and breathe deeply into their sails.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
No, I''m not going with them. I helped bring this curse down upon Oriath so I''ll help save what little there is left to save. ' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Here, take something, in thanks for your part in preserving the Karui Way.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Lani/L18.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[182]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1393, 'LaniOnKitava', '[]', 'You''re still alive. So is Kitava. What more do you need to know?' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
You''ll find a way, I believe it.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Lani/L20.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[182]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1394, 'VilentaIntroduction', '[]', 'Unlike these assorted ignorami, I''m not surprised to see you here. The Beast is dead, all thanks to you, I suppose. I was listening to the Beast''s death rattles when these lunatics broke in, wrecked the place and dragged me here to tend to their cuts and bruises.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Thankfully, I was able to bring some of my paraphernalia with me. The balance of power is shifting in your favour, O murderer of nightmares. If I am in possession of anything that might smooth the transition of governance, don''t hesitate to ask. You''ll find my terms quite reasonable.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Vilenta/V01.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[183]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1395, 'VilentaOnLani', '[]', 'In contrast to the company she keeps, Lani has quite an astute mind. I put it down to that Oriathan education she''s managed somehow to procure.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Whilst quelling whatever resistance you might meet in this ''noble'' coup of yours, you''d be well-advised to look to Lani for counsel. She''d make the finest of advisers, second only to myself, of course.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Vilenta/V04.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[183]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1396, 'VilentaOnUtula', '[]', 'Utula might appear to conduct himself with honesty and honour yet has all the telltale signs of a desperate man born of desperate times. As the cornered animal will bite and claw, the cornered man will lie, steal and murder in the name of survival. It''s understandable, and deadly if underestimated.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Vilenta/V07.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[183]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1397, 'VilentaOnUtulaTraitor', '[]', 'I told you so. What more need I say?', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Vilenta/V08.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[183]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1398, 'VilentaOnBannon', '[]', 'Bannon claims that a god now lives inside his head and talks to him. What''s more common, divine possession or insanity? I''ll leave you to calculate the odds.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Vilenta/V15.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[183]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1399, 'VilentaOnCasticus', '[]', 'I can''t really fault Justicar Casticus. A man committed, heart and soul, to upholding the law. Of course, law isn''t the same thing as justice, and men like Casticus lack the imagination necessary to make that distinction.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Vilenta/V09.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[183]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1400, 'VilentaOnAvarius', '[]', 'Avarius, Innocence... I''m not sure there''s a great deal of difference. Around the time I heard the Beast''s mortal scream, the newly appointed High Templar Avarius went through something of a... revelation.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
The manner in which he speaks and acts now would indicate that he believes, without doubt, that he is some earthly embodiment of God. That''s Faith for you. It''ll reduce grown men to the madness of infancy.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Vilenta/V10.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[183]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1401, 'VilentaOnPiety', '[]', 'I gave Piety everything, devoted my life to her work. What did that thankless bitch do for me in return? Left me here to polish her beakers while she pursued glory in Wraeclast. ' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Oh. You killed her, did you? Likely as not, you''d have killed me too had I been there. In that case, perhaps we both got exactly what we deserved.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Vilenta/V11.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[183]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1402, 'VilentaOnResearch', '[]', 'Piety and I have devoted ourselves to the betterment of the human condition. As for our methods, Piety had a saying that summed it up nicely. "Would you consider the feelings of the stones when constructing a glorious cathedral in the name of God?"' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Casticus supplied us with slaves, mostly Karui, and I put them to good use. In fact, I believe their participation in my experiments elevated them from squalor to splendor. Our subjects were able to give their otherwise meaningless lives to something greater than themselves.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Isn''t that what we all want in the end?', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Vilenta/V12.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[183]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1403, 'VilentaOnGods', '[]', 'People have talked about the ''return of the gods'' since the birth of Oriath. It''s a gambit, employed by charlatans to fleece the weak minded and morally desperate.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Or so it seemed. ' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Avarius and his Templar drones now greet the dawn filled with power and glorious purpose. Kitava has risen from whatever ethereal cesspit he''s been hiding in for the last few millennia. ' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
So what let the cats out of their proverbial bags? I''m a scholar, not a prophet, yet there''s one occurrence that absolutely reeks with evidential causality. ' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
You killed the Beast.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Vilenta/V13.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[183]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1404, 'VilentaOnInnocence', '[]', 'You really don''t have a strong grip on cause and effect, do you. Things replace other things, it''s the most fundamental of laws. The larger the thing you remove, the bigger the rush to fill the space it''s left behind.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Innocence was the nexus of power in Oriath. Remove him and something of equal or greater power was always going to take his spot. Any idiot could have predicted that Kitava was going to be that something... unless, of course, you thought it was going to be you.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Vilenta/V14.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[183]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1405, 'VilentaOnSignOfPurity', '[]', 'The Sign of Purity, yes... a descry staff that Piety sent me to study at one point. Apparently it was a gift from Innocence to the first High Templar, Maxarius. Dominus couldn''t even bear to touch the thing so he had it locked up in the Ossuary. Quite reactive behaviour for a man of such formidable intellect, yet now it''s making a little more sense.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
The staff was certainly able to conduct and store energy, yet remained inert when I applied corruption to it. It must only respond to divine energy, and with corruption and divinity being diametrically opposed, it''s no wonder that my experiments failed to excite the thing!' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Meaning, if the Sign of Purity is a repository for the power of Innocence, Dominus could never have wielded it, being steeped as he was in the opposing power of the Beast.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
You though... you''re a different matter entirely.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Vilenta/V16.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[183]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1406, 'VilentaOnCathedral', '[]', 'Dominus adopted Chitus Cathedral as his personal laboratory. He decked it out with everything his miraculous mind could conceive of. His great work in Sarn, that which you destroyed, it all began there.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Vilenta/V17.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[183]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1407, 'VilentaOnKitava', '[]', 'Kitava is a primal deity, forged from the most fundamental of human desires. Hunger. The simple act of craving that which we cannot yet consume.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
To defeat Kitava is to squeeze the very heart of human nature into stillness. You don''t think you can do that? I''ll suppose we''ll see, won''t we.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Vilenta/V18.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[183]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1408, 'VilentaSideQuest', '[]', 'Some time ago, I fabricated a device able to sense and amplify the corrupt murmurings of Wraeclast. A Miasmeter.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
I listened to those whispers for years, lingering beyond sane comprehension. And then the scream... such profound agony that my mind was nearly sundered by its percussion. I thought another cataclysm might be upon us. But no, it was you, slaying the Beast. I was witness to a singularly potent cadence.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
This corruption... I am convinced that it holds the very key to our human history, and with it, our very existence. Yet without the Miasmeter, I''m condemned to deafened ignorance.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
It remains in Piety''s laboratory, as long as Utula''s miscreants haven''t vandalised the poor thing. Find it!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Vilenta/V05.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[183]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1409, 'VilentaSideQuestReward', '[]', 'I simply can''t express how wondrous it is to see you. What? No... not you, exile. The Miasmeter. The hope of humanity lies in this beautiful device and the precious knowledge it shall divulge.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Far more useful than an accidental hulk of meat and instinct like yourself. In fact, I wouldn''t be surprised to discover that your slaying of the Beast correlates directly to the strife we must currently suffer.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
At least you''ve proved useful enough to return the Miasmeter to me. That deserves some small reward, I suppose.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Vilenta/V06.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[183]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1410, 'BannonIntro', '[]', 'What in damnation have you done?!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Bannon3D/B01.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[186]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1411, 'BannonRescued', '[]', 'You''ve destroyed Him and yet... I hear the voice of Innocence, begging for our forgiveness, asking for our help... you and I. I heard Him the moment the High Templar fell, whispering inside my damned skull, His heart beating within my chest.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Innocence protects us now, holds fast the door against the murderous tide that rushes to meet us. He wants you to pass through that door, to bring order to the chaos beyond.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
I don''t understand any of this. Moments ago I was just a soldier obeying his High Templar. Bannon the Nobody. Now... my god lays inside my head, telling me to let you through that door and to make my way to... Overseer''s Tower, if it still stands.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
It does? Alright. I don''t know what''s waiting for you out there, but should you survive it, I''ll see you at Overseer''s Tower.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Bannon/B02.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[186]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1412, 'BannonIntroduction', '[]', 'We''re glad you made it. No, damn it all, that''s just too strange to abide. I''m glad you made it, and Innocence tells me I need to keep helping you. So that''s what I''m going to do.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
I know my way around weapons and armour, and all things Templar if you should want for further enlightenment on that subject. As for Innocence... I don''t know. Sometimes he makes sense, other times... he''s a shattered god, but he''ll heal. I''ll make sure of that.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Bannon/B03.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[185]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1413, 'BannonOnProtection', '[]', 'I''m having a little trouble explaining it myself. I''ve never been the most devout of men, especially for a Templar. More of a soldier than a believer. But now? Innocence himself rests within me. His voice is weak, barely a whisper, yet still he has the power to keep us safe from Kitava''s hunger... at least for now.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
For my part, I''m simply grateful. Grateful that I have a god watching my back, and grateful that He''s given me the power to watch others in return.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Bannon/B08.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[185]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1414, 'BannonOnInnocence', '[]', 'For a long time now, I thought my God''s intentions were being twisted by his supposed servants. Did I speak up? No. The pyre would have been my only answer. I did what I was told and drew the lines of morality where I could.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Now I understand the truth. It wasn''t Innocence''s intention being twisted. It was Innocence himself, perverted by the selfish convictions of the men and women who worshipped Him. ' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
A god answers to the believer as the believer answers to their god.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Bannon/B09.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[185]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1415, 'BannonOnSignOfPurity', '[]', 'The Sign of Purity? Let''s see... a staff, bathed in innocent blood. No, sorry, bathed in the blood of Innocence. Yes, Innocence gave a part of his divine self to the thing and gifted it to the Templar. ' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Now that I recall, I read a tome about it when I was a cadet. Bloody long time ago. I skipped most of the boring pages, so only remember the bit where High Templar Maxarius ''smote with flame the army of the faithless with one ray of its hallowing light''. The book''s words, not mine.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Outside of my humble flesh, the Sign of Purity''s about all that''s left of Innocence.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Bannon/B13.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[185]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1416, 'BannonOnOssuary', '[]', 'Devotion should be honoured, I suppose. For centuries now, the Templar have boiled the flesh and skin from the devout and presented the polished remains for public appreciation in the Ossuary.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Personally, I think it''s one of the better ways to remember those who have gone before us. To touch the bones is to remember neither the legend, the legacy, nor the lies. It reminds you that those bones belonged to a man or woman who was just like any other man or woman.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Bannon/B10.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[185]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1417, 'BannonOnLani', '[]', 'I''d be lying if I said my hands were clean of slavery''s blood. I was a soldier. I went where Dominus ordered me to go. I sailed with the expedition to Ngamakanui, killed Karui warriors and rounded up Karui captives like every other bastard in a Templar uniform.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
So I don''t blame Lani for wanting to take back her freedom. And I don''t blame her for believing Utula''s lies either. I certainly swallowed enough of Dominus'' falsities to sicken my soul.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
It''s what we do now that matters. I can see that Lani''s heart is in the right place, and for once in my damned life, so is mine.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Bannon/B06.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[185]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1418, 'BannonOnVilenta', '[]', 'To be perfectly honest with you, I don''t trust her. Yeah, I''ve got my reasons. Piety kept her work pretty quiet but her results were brutally clear. The people she took, the people she... changed. Slaves mostly, and a few ''enemies of God''. Enemies of bloody Dominus more like it. I don''t go in for black and white definitions of good and evil, but with Piety and her ilk, I make an exception.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Whatever''s lurking inside Vilenta, it ain''t ''good'', not by a long shot.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Bannon/B07.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[185]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1419, 'BannonUtulaQuest', '[]', 'Lani''s told me a little about Utula and his cult of Kitava. Enough to know what Utula''s got planned. Bring about the fall of one god so he can raise up one of his own. And this Kitava, from what fragments I can piece together from Innocence... he''s not of the benevolent kind.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Please, find Utula and stop him. I''m not saying this because I want to put Innocence back on his divine throne. I''m saying this because Oriath is my home. It''s made some mistakes but it doesn''t deserve the fate that Utula has in mind.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Bannon/B11.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[185]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1420, 'BannonUtulaReward', '[]', 'The high priest is dead yet the object of his devotion remains. There''s no doubt, you did alright bringing that man-turned-monster to heel, but you weren''t able to stop him fishing his master out of a river of blood.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Damn... sorry, I never could get the hang of ''boosting morale''. Didn''t seem right to polish the edges off harsh facts. Probably why I never made captain.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Still, I''ve been poking around here a bit and have turned up Utula''s stash. Quite the magpie he was so here... help yourself. When it comes to hunting a god, I suppose every little bit helps.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Bannon/B12.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[185]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1421, 'BannonOnKitava', '[]', 'I don''t ask this in the name of Innocence. He understands now the folly his devotees have wrought upon this world. I ask in the name of Oriath. There are many that deserve what Kitava offers, and there are many more who do not.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Put an end to Kitava''s savage reign, for there remains much in this land that is worth saving.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Bannon/B14.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[185]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1422, 'UtulaIntroduction1', '[0]', 'I do not know you, nor you me, but I honour you all the same. Anointed in Templar blood, you come to us, give us the reason, the hope, to rise up.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
The Tormented One has spoken. Kitava, the immortal slave, understands our plight like no other. He speaks through you, warrior. He tells us that we shall be free.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Utula Makora is what they call me, and I''ve the miserable task of being chief to this lot. Well, I put the steel in their hands. I tell them where to stab, where to run, where to die. If that doesn''t make me a chief, what does, eh?', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Utula/U01.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[184]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1423, 'UtulaIntroduction2', '[6]', 'Templar murders Templar. Not a pretty sight, but it was enough to get this sorry lot up and fighting.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
The Tormented One promised us a sign. You''re not quite what I expected, but then who am I to argue with Kitava, the immortal slave. He speaks through you, Templar. He tells us that we shall be free.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Utula Makora is what they call me and I''ve the miserable task of being chief to this lot. Well, I put the steel in their hands. I tell them where to stab, where to run, where to die. If that doesn''t make me a chief, what does, eh?', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Utula/U02.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[184]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1424, 'UtulaIntroduction3', '[]', 'Hah! After everything I''ve done, it took an Oriathan to get these slaves up off their shackled arses and fighting. I guess the Templar should have treated their ''lessers'' better than their slaves, eh?' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Well, I''m not about to turn down a gift from Kitava. If he wants slave and outcast to join hands then let''s remind these Templar that they''re flesh and blood, just like us.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Utula Makora is what they call me. I''m what passes for a chief around here. Well, I put the steel in their hands. I tell them where to stab, where to run, where to die. If that doesn''t make me a chief, what does, eh?', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Utula/U03.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[184]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1425, 'UtulaCasticusQuest', '[]', 'Blood isn''t the only currency we need to earn to buy our freedom. We can kill all the Templar mongrels we like out there. It won''t matter a damn if we don''t get inside their stronghold, the Templar Courts. Might as well put my bloody chains back on right now!' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Problem is, there''s some sort of witchery surrounding the place. Only those who ''see the truth with faithful eyes'' are getting in there. The power of Innocence... it''s all in the eyes, you see.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Yet blessed Kitava has answered my prayers and sent us just the pair of eyes we need. The ever faithful Justicar Casticus. He''s there in the Control Blocks right now, smiting my people with self righteous fury.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Find him, and rip his faithful eyes out. Then I''m sure the good Justicar will be kind enough to ''see'' you into the Templar Courts.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Utula/U06.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[184]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1426, 'UtulaOnCasticusDead', '[]', 'Hah! So you made Justicar Casticus ''see the light'', did you? Couldn''t have happened to a nicer fulla. Yet now I''ve an even more charming chap for you to make the acquaintance of. He''s over at the Chamber of Innocence, beyond the Templar Courts, and I bet he''s just dying to meet you.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
It''s High Templar Avarius I''m talking about, although he''s so filled to the eyeballs with Innocence that it''s hard to tell where the man ends and the god begins these days. That''s good news for us. Kill the man and you kill the god.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
And what are the Templar without their god? Lambs in a slaughterhouse.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Utula/U07.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[184]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1427, 'UtulaOnSlavePens', '[]', 'Take a deep breath. Inhale the twin stink of exploitation and oppression. Yes, these pens and cells have been our home away from home since the first Karui were brought here by Marceus Lioneye. Their great ''Hero of the Empire'', one of the best slavers they ever had.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Not that he was the only one. Captain Sigmund Fairgraves funded many an expedition off the whipped backs of Karui children. High Templar Dominus was only the latest in a long line of men to grow rich by trading in misery.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Oriathan wealth was built on Karui poverty. Oriathan gold will forever be stained red by Karui blood.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Utula/U08.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[184]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1428, 'UtulaOnLani', '[]', 'Lani''s a pretty tough girl, for a half-blood. Her mother was Karui, but her father... a lord with a nose for island flowers.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Despite that Oriathan stain in her blood, Lani risked her life, time and time again, slipping us the information that she bore between the lords and ladies of Theopolis. Honestly couldn''t have put the pieces of this uprising together without her.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
And she''s a fighter. Struck down two overseers before a third managed to put that scratch on her. Don''t worry, it won''t slow her down for long. Not Lani.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Utula/U09.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[184]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1429, 'UtulaOnVilenta', '[]', 'If it weren''t for Lani, I''d have cut that bitch''s throat the moment I met her. But Vilenta seems to know her medicine, so she gets to live... until Lani is better.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Then Vilenta will answer for her crimes against us.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Utula/U10.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[184]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1430, 'UtulaOnOverseersTower', '[]', 'Overseer''s Tower, this place is called. And you know the worst thing about the men who stood here, watching us, cursing us, descending to whip and kick us like curs? They were slaves, like us, willing to turn on their brethren for a bigger cage and a few extra rations. ' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
I can''t quite put into words what a pleasure it was to take this tower, to rip the greedy eyes from those traitors. Did they see it coming? I hope so.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Utula/U11.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[184]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1431, 'UtulaOnKitava', '[]', 'Well... I know his other names. The Black Spirit. The Cannibal King. The Ravenous One. He was all of those things, before Tukohama slashed out his eyes, before Valako drowned him in the sea, before Hinekora whipped him and condemned him to immortal darkness.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Kitava has learned from the suffering inflicted upon him. Learned what cruelty is from his own flesh and blood. Learned what it means to be a slave.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Now he hungers for freedom. Not merely for himself. For all of us who have suffered under whip and shackle.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Kitava is the Tormented One, destined to rise up from the darkness and banish cruelty from this world. And we, his children, rise with him.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Utula/U12.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[184]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1432, 'UtulaOnInnocence', '[]', 'Old red eyes. He''s been quiet for a long time. Just like Kitava... and Tukohama. All of the old gods. Now Innocence has woken up, and with him, power like I''ve never seen the Templar wield before.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
It''s alright though. We slaves, we''ve got our own god looking out for us now. I can see him in the eyes of my brothers and sisters, smell him in the blood we''ve spilled, hear his call in the screams of the fallen.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
I don''t rightly know where the gods have been or what''s brought them crawling back. Nor do I really care. All I need to know, my friend, is that we''re not alone anymore.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Utula/U13.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[184]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1433, 'UtulaOnTemplarCourt', '[]', 'There''s two parts to the Templar. The grim face and the spotty arse.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Out front you''ve got the Templar Courts, usually the last place our <i>{hatungo} see if they''re stupid enough to preach their craft within a Templar''s hearing. Oriath''s wood-mongers must do a roaring trade with that place. When the wind blows right, you can even smell the aroma of barbequed blasphemer from here.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
The arse end, that''s the Chamber of Innocence. It''s where the real earnest believing gets done. Where the young Templar go to pay their respects to God almighty and get the good sense baptised out of their heads. I''ve not seen inside the chamber myself, but you can feel it from over a block away. Like there''s an eye in your gut, peering through your insides, looking for even the tiniest stain of Sin. ' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
I tell you, sane people go in one end of that place, ash and apostles come out the other. Watch yourself in there.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Utula/U14.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[184]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1434, 'UtulaOnAvarius', '[]', 'With Dominus away in Wraeclast, someone had to keep the wheels of oppression turning. Avarius was only too happy to take the job. He''d had plenty of practice already, of course. ' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
It was Avarius who led some of the largest and most crippling raids upon the Ngamakanui and the Ngakuramakoi. It was on his orders that men, women and children were shackled and shipped like cattle to Theopolis. ' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
And it was Avarius who spent five thousand Karui lives building his Templar Courts and his Chamber of Innocence. Who had wives and daughters scrub their husbands'' and fathers'' blood from the stones so as to preserve their ''purity''.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
When you meet Avarius, feel free to exact a little extra vengeance in the name of Karui suffering.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Utula/U15.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[184]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1435, 'UtulaRuinedSquare', '[]', 'Cup your hands, children of Kitava.' || char(13) || '
Drink of the hot, sweet wine of Oriath.' || char(13) || '
And let us stay ourselves from the feast no longer.' || char(13) || '
For our king is ravenous!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/UtulaGod/U16.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[184]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1436, 'UtulaFightIntro', '[]', 'Did you think our vengeance was done, saviour? Oh no, it has only begun!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/UtulaIntro/U17.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[184]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1437, 'SinInnocenceIntro1', '[]', 'I am Sin, the Forgotten One. Would that humanity could forget all of my kind. Perhaps, with your help, that might still come to pass. ' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
For now the blinding light has been dimmed, and darkness floods in to fill the void. The desperate and depraved set a feast for their lord incumbent, Kitava, the Ravenous One.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Sin/S02_pt1.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[187]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1438, 'SinInnocenceIntro2', '[]', 'Should Kitava accept their invitation, there is but one thin sliver of hope for us all. My brother''s Sign of Purity. ' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Look to it in the choking passages of Templar reverence. It shall be your torch when night falls at last.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Sin/S02_pt2.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[187]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1439, 'SinKitavaCutscene', '[]', '', '', '', 0, 0, 'Art/Videos/Cinematic_KitavaStatueBreak.bk2', 0, 0, 1, '[187]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1440, 'SinInnocenceQuest', '[]', 'Deep in the Templar''s Ossuary, in the company of the dead, there lies the Sign of Purity.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Innocence bled himself for the creation of that cruel and desperate weapon. Tempered in his own ruby ichor, it was forged to be a transcendent tool of punishment and purification. The Sign is a living agent of righteousness, or at least, the dubious kind of righteousness that my brother subscribes to.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Innocence found, in the first High Templar, a most faithful servant and gifted the Sign to him, so that it might be used in times of great need. The great need of Innocence believers, that is. Humanity''s general well-being has never been of particular concern to my brother.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Sin/S03.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[187]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1441, 'SinInnocenceKitava', '[]', 'Though I am a god, I have not forgotten my humanity. I care for that which I once was. Kitava remembers nothing and cares for nothing but his own hunger and greed. He is an endless pit of gnashing teeth and churning guts. ' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
While other gods rise on the mainland and fight for the meagre scraps of what was, Kitava has the most fecund and formidable civilisation of his age at his disposal. He can feed when he likes and he grows ever stronger with each morsel. All of Oriath shall soon belong to Kitava, and if that happens, he will rise beyond even our reach.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Sin/S04.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[187]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1442, 'SinOnInnocence', '[]', 'He lives, after a fashion. That pretentious little vessel of his served only to encourage his divine follies. I have procured him a more... sensible host, one that should contain his excesses and temper that fragile ego of his.' || char(13) || '
 ' || char(13) || '
Hear this, Brother! "From mind of lead to heart of gold, your soul shall be bound, your wrath shall grow cold."', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Sin/S05.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[187]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1443, 'SinPCHasSign', '[]', 'An empire is nothing more than a standard pitched in the naked earth. The time has come for you to raise this standard upon the peak of false faith, the apex of Chitus Cathedral.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Drive it deep into that sacred stone. Mark the death of a faithless empire and slay the slavering kingdom that seeks to consume it.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Sin/S06.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[305]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1444, 'SinPCRescue', '[]', 'The flame of hope may flicker but it cannot be extinguished!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Sin/S07.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[188]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1445, 'SinKitavaFailed', '[]', 'There is no shame in falling to a god. Shame lies only in refusing to rise again. You shall soar, that much I''m permitted to foresee.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
You shall ascend to the peak of your loftiest mistake and from there you shall pluck a single, surviving hope from the jaws of immortal despair.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
A ship sails for Lioneye''s Watch not far from here. Be on it.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Sin/S08.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[188]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1446, 'AvariusIntro', '[]', 'The world must be cleansed of impurity.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/AvariusIntro/Ph01_Av01.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[241]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1447, 'AvariusTransition', '[]', 'I am order, I am the new and the eternal. I am Innocence.', '', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[241]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1448, 'AvariusDeath', '[]', 'I am... no more...', '', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[241]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1449, 'LillyKitavaIntro', '[]', 'I''m Captain Lilly Roth, and we sail... for Wraeclast. Better to live in exile than die on this psychotic bonfire of an island.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
You want to make it out of here, you better get on board. But make it quick, ''cause I ain''t got time for tears and regrets.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Lilly/LR_02.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[189]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1450, 'LillySailToWraeclast', '[]', 'Remember, this ain''t no charity run. You owe me. ' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Cast off!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Lilly/LR_03.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[189]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1451, 'LillyIntroduction', '[]', 'Alright, we''re safe for the time being. Now let me introduce myself properly.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Lilly Roth. Yeah, I''m one of <i>{those} Roths. Some call me ''smuggler'', others ''pirate'', yet I prefer the sound of ''nautical entrepreneur''. Came up with that one meself.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
So you come see Lilly if you need something, or even if you just fancy a good chat with a lovely lady.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Lilly/LR_04.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[192]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1452, 'LillyOnTarkleigh', '[]', 'Yeah, I <i>{knew} Tarkleigh, if you catch me drift. He''s got no time for his old bunkmate these days though. Too gaga-eyed over his lost cause of a fishwife, Nessa.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Time was, Tarkleigh and I would smuggle all ''bout the coast of Oriath. Ah, good days they was. Sweet with rum, nothing but the wind and salt in our faces, freedom in our hearts... and the law on our tails.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
But I could tell he were getting ready to make feet for children''s stockings with me, so I cut him loose. Not a spark''s chance under the ocean the dreaded Lilly Roth''s gonna wind up swelling like some drowned carcass.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Still, nice to work with that bugger one more time, just for old time''s sake, you know?', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Lilly/LR_08.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[192]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1453, 'LillyOnBestel', '[]', 'That scallywag? I reckon Bestel thinks I be kind of lass who''d bed down with any sort of rascal. Ha, not too far off I guess. He is rather sweet, but not the most comely of figures.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Actually, he kinda reminds me of me Grandfather, Weylam Roth. A poet and scoundrel extraordinaire, he be. Bestel''s but spittle from the mouth of Old ''Rot-tooth'' Roth.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Ahem...' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
"Buss my blind cheeks," said the Sailor to the Doxie.' || char(13) || '
She sports her dairy treats afar, and relishes her moxie.' || char(13) || '
But a fire ship''ll sink the broken ''neath the ocean waves.' || char(13) || '
Tip nutmegs a deadly token, sends captains to their graves!"', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Lilly/LR_09.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[192]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1454, 'LillyOnTrade', '[]', 'You have the look of a wayfarer about you. I''ve a few bits and bobs in the hold that I managed to salvage from Oriath.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Might be you''re in the market for a little insurance for the road? The sort a nautical charm or a quaff of tonic be providing.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Go on, have a look-see, and if you be thinking to trade, I reckon we can come to a fair arrangement.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Lilly/LR_10.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[192]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1455, 'LillyOnWeylam', '[]', 'Weylam Roth... here, let me share something I remember from me granddaddy''s stories.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
No sooner had the others turned in fear from the great, white Leviathan, did Weylam load the ballista with his final harpoon. And right then he vowed, to sea and sky, that he and he alone would be the one to finally kill this bastard son of the Brine King.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
The ballista fired and the harpoon smote that creature right between the ribs as it made to dive back under the angry sea. Thick clouds of blood bloomed beneath the waves, roses flowering in the black water, and impossible though it seemed, the already shadowed ocean grew darker still...' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
He used the bones of the great beast to reinforce the hull of his ship, the Black Crest. Old Rot-tooth, he''s a true legend. A real pirate hero. I can only hope, one day, me own stories will reach his ears and make him proud of the granddaughter he had to leave behind.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Lilly/LR_14.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[192]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1456, 'LillyOnBlackFlag', '[]', 'You''ve got the Black Flag from me grandfather''s ship? Ah, the Black Crest were the most formidable ship to ever sail the seas. Yet now it''s a hulk of rotted wood and bone, mouldering away in that forsaken graveyard.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
But why is it there? You don''t think that Merveil... Never! I won''t even think it. No Roth would ever fall victim to that tentacled sea-hag. Weylam must be out there somewhere. Yeah, a castaway, that''s it.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
For now, you''ll be after safe passage to the Brine King''s Reef. And there ain''t no ship going to get you there faster than the Black Crest. So, as the only Roth present and accounted for right now, I hereby give you permission to burn that flag in the Beacon. Might as well see if there''s some truth in that old legend about it resurrecting the wrecks of Roths past... and, other less notable vessels.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Maybe when this is all done, I''ll take back the Black Crest for meself and sail out in search of me grandfather. He''s too hardy an old barnacle to kill, so he''ll be out there, somewhere.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Lilly/LR_15.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[192]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1457, 'LillyOnBrineKing', '[]', 'Yeah, I know the Brine King. What pirate doesn''t? Drowned me fair share of mutineers under the full moon... to keep the old king''s slumber when storms threaten, you see.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
If he''s been roused from the depths, it be nothing but ill tidings for those of us with air in our lungs.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
He''ll be getting back to raping and eating us ocean-going folk soon enough. Stealing wombs in which to spawn his slithering offspring.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Aye, that blasphemy is out there somewhere right now, I''d wager. And to think there still be folks needing transport from Oriath... more commissions to be had. But a lecherous sea god, now that complicates things.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Lilly/LR_11.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[192]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1458, 'LillyOnBrineKingDead', '[]', 'The Black Crest, she lives again! And me granddaddy... still can''t believe Merveil did that to him, the bilesome bitch! At least his spirit roams free once again. Wonder if he''ll come and visit his favourite granddaughter one more time...' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Anyways, with the Brine King gone, you''ve done a fine thing for us seafarers. The waters won''t no longer pander to the whim of an overgrown bloody crustacean, and damn me if I don''t feel a stirring in me loins. It''s the ocean, calling... like a lust-starved lover.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
But for now, bugger it all, I''ll be sticking about Lioneye''s Watch until I get me a new ship. Nah, don''t feel sorry for me. With me womanly wiles as sharp they are, I''ll be having Tarkleigh help me pass the time, just you see.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Lilly/LR_16.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[192]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1459, 'LillyTwilightStrandQuest', '[]', 'Don''t think I be forgetting that favour you owes me! In fact, now I think of it, there''s certainly a way you can be repaying this most considerable debt.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
You see, those blasted cultists have been plundering the refugee ships trying to escape Oriath, and if not for my incomparable skill as a sea captain, we''d have met the same fate. But now the drowned dead are washing ashore, and they ain''t staying dead.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
There''s been a whole lot of blood, sweat and tears getting these few lucky survivors here in one piece. What sorta Captain would I be if I let them get ripped apart by walking corpses?' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Wipe the Twilight Strand clean of those filthy undead bastards and I''ll call us even. Might even throw in a little something extra, if you can pull it off.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Lilly/LR_06.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[192]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1460, 'LillyTwilightStrandReward', '[]', 'A wretched sight, so many drowned Oriathans, cast into undeath... You''ve freed them from their torment and I''m sure they be grateful.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Here, that little something extra I were talking about. Though the sea takes away, it gives back in greater measure.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Lilly/LR_07.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[192]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1461, 'BestelIntroduction2', '[]', 'Now there''s a pair of eyes I could never forget. If the tales are true, those peepers of yours have seen all the wonders of Wraeclast by now... and a few things they likely wish they hadn''t.' || char(13) || '
 ' || char(13) || '
Oh, and no need for us to speak of Oriath. My ears are brim full with the sorrows these wretched companions of yours have been spilling.' || char(13) || '
', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Bestel/B03_02.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[191]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1462, 'BestelOnNessaGone', '[]', 'Now there''s a sorry tale, more miserable than any dirge I''ve ever heard. Nessa''s gone... Wandered off into the night muttering to herself about ''dancing to his ditty''.' || char(13) || '
 ' || char(13) || '
No, I didn''t go after her. In truth, she was gone when I woke up the next morn. I only imagined she''d be muttering, you see, on account of the murmurings she''s been making these past few weeks.' || char(13) || '
 ' || char(13) || '
Always the same, about ''him'' and ''his song'', whoever in damnation ''he'' is. ' || char(13) || '
', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Bestel/B03_03.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[191]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1463, 'BestelOnLilly', '[]', 'Lilly Roth? Granddaughter of the legendary Rot-tooth Roth? Oh, apologies if I seem a little... giddy. It''s not any old day you get to meet marine royalty. I mean, you know how I feel about pirates and all, but the Roths have as much in common with those scurvy sea rats as a... as a shark does with a goldfish.' || char(13) || '
 ' || char(13) || '
Lilly has her granddaddy''s blood in her veins; it''s plain for all to see. Look at the lustre in her eyes, the ruddy blush of her skin. That there''s a pirate princess, and no mistake.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Bestel/B03_04.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[191]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1464, 'BestelOnTukohama', '[]', 'With Kitava now stomping around Oriath, it seems mythology is fast turning into reality.' || char(13) || '
 ' || char(13) || '
Then again, the gods didn''t just spring out of some poet''s head. I certainly couldn''t pen an ode to the God of Eternally Flowing Ale and then just stick me mug out to catch the free brew.' || char(13) || '
 ' || char(13) || '
No, I imagine the gods once dined, danced and defecated just like you or I. Now they seem ready to take another stab at it... at life, I mean.' || char(13) || '
 ' || char(13) || '
Take the Karui Father of War, for instance. Old Tukohama. All comfily tucked up in Kaom''s holdfast and playing war like a few thousand years was only a quiet weekend for him.' || char(13) || '
 ' || char(13) || '
Come to think of it... perhaps it was!' || char(13) || '
', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Bestel/B03_08.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[191]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1465, 'BestelOnBrineKing', '[]', 'You won''t find a sailor that doesn''t whisper a quiet prayer to the Brine King before casting off. In fact, under the maddening radiance of a full moon, the more superstitious captains would drown some poor slave or failed mutineer... just to keep old Tsoagoth happy.' || char(13) || '
 ' || char(13) || '
No, that wasn''t a sneeze. That''s the fish god''s old Azmerian name. It''s considered foul luck to speak it on board a ship. A keel-hauling offense.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Bestel/B03_06.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[191]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1466, 'BestelOnBrineKingDead', '[]', 'Clearly the old Brine King wasn''t worth his salt! A fish out of water if ever there was. But I suppose, as someone wise once said, ''you can''t teach a crab to walk straight''.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Too much? Yeah, be honest with you, all this fishy mirth is me just swimming around a tricky topic.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Nessa.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
She''s not coming back to us, is she? Can''t say I''m surprised, what with everything she''s been through... what she''s become. ' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
I wish her all the happiness she can find out there in the sea. More than she could muster on this gods-awful land of ours.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Bestel/B03_17.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[191]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1467, 'BestelOnWeylam', '[]', 'You''ll not find a more renowned pirate as Weylam ''Rot Tooth'' Roth. In times when Fairgraves was still a whelp earning his sea legs, Rot-tooth was prowling the Strait of Oriath in his ship, the ''Black Crest''.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
It''s said he build it hisself, lining its hull with the bones of some great sea beast he slew with nothing but a harpoon and a bottle o'' rum. Never was there a more nimble, more ferocious vessel. Like that leviathan''s spirit still lived and breathed in its timbers.' || char(13) || '
 ' || char(13) || '
No one''s sighted Rot Tooth for twenty years or more, but I know where the Black Crest is. The Ship Graveyard, no less. Seems that Weylam Roth might have had his last meal with Lady Merveil.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Bestel/B03_15.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[191]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1468, 'BestelOnShavronne', '[]', 'Screams. Howls and booms of unholy intonation. The shriek and clank of some unfathomable apparatus and the pervading stench of scorched flesh and boiling blood. That''s Axiom Prison now that our lady of Umbra has come home to roost.' || char(13) || '
 ' || char(13) || '
As a poet, I have nothing against a little creativity. Yet while I might mould word and wonder, Shavronne''s art tends towards the visceral. Flesh, bone and soul.' || char(13) || '
 ' || char(13) || '
Artistic pursuit is the loftiest of callings, but in this instance, I believe some rigorous criticism is in order. ' || char(13) || '
', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Bestel/B03_11.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[191]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1469, 'BestelOnShipGraveyard', '[]', 'Poor Nessa. If the Ship Graveyard is sealed off with some brine-born barrier then the king clearly knows that you''re coming to relieve him of his queen-to-be. ' || char(13) || '
 ' || char(13) || '
Ah well, you should be used to long and arduous journeys now. If nothing else, it''s good fodder for an epic. I''d best get composing!' || char(13) || '
', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Bestel/B03_14.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[191]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1470, 'BestelAberrathQuest', '[]', 'Who''d have thought those bleating bastards would go and find religion, eh? Now, there''s nothing quite so sure to spoil a man''s appetite than an ecclesiastical debate come suppertime.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Yet this goatmen god, this Abberath, seems fair determined to mix his morsels with his spiritual enlightenments.' || char(13) || '
 ' || char(13) || '
To put no finer point on it, when the goatmen find him a soft, pink human or two as divine sacrifice... he eats them. Meat, soul and all.' || char(13) || '
 ' || char(13) || '
Well, that''s what the legends say.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Bestel/B03_12.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[191]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1471, 'BestelAberrathReward', '[]', 'The old goat''s turned up his tootsies, has he? Oh wait... I feel a poem coming on.' || char(13) || '
 ' || char(13) || '
Through the bleating flock' || char(13) || '
Our exile did wade' || char(13) || '
Over hoof and horn and goat blood sprayed' || char(13) || '
Until at last an audience with Old King Billy' || char(13) || '
Or The Cloven One' || char(13) || '
Or Abberath' || char(13) || '
And other names, just as silly' || char(13) || '
"Dine with me, friend."' || char(13) || '
Old Billy did growl.' || char(13) || '
"Feed me your soul."' || char(13) || '
"Feed me it, now!"' || char(13) || '
Our exile just smiled and gutted that goat.' || char(13) || '
So that not one more soul' || char(13) || '
Would get stuffed down his old throat.' || char(13) || '
 ' || char(13) || '
Honestly, you wouldn''t believe how hard it is to find a good rhyme for ''goat'', exile.' || char(13) || '
', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Bestel/B03_13.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[191]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1472, 'BestelManuscriptQuest', '[]', 'Now, I''m sure you''ve noticed that Lioneye''s Watch has seen better days. Our once bubbling township has, alas, become a brooding quagmire of gloom and despair. I blame the unrelenting weather.' || char(13) || '
 ' || char(13) || '
As you know, I am both a humanitarian and a strong believer in the soul-sustaining power of story. Back when I was still Captain of the Merry Gull, many days at sea afforded me time to work on my thespian aspirations. I wrote a theatrical epic, a one man show entitled "Cedric and the Buxom Stranger". ' || char(13) || '
 ' || char(13) || '
I sealed the manuscript inside a roll of oiled leather and stashed it in the hold for safekeeping. Perhaps you could salvage it for me from that Tidal Island upon which my poor ship came to rest? Who knows, maybe we can bring some joy back to Lioneye''s Watch with a bit of live entertainment?' || char(13) || '
', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Bestel/B03_18.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[191]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1473, 'BestelManuscriptReward', '[]', 'Marvelous! Ah yes, yes, it''s all here. Ahem, Act One, Scene One:' || char(13) || '
 ' || char(13) || '
"Along the shoreline, the beach grass sways, A blazing sun sinks neath sparkling bays. O'' strange be the night when the drowned dead rise, And a pale moon ascends upon cold skies. The Stranger still is lost to me, those silken pillows upon which I lay at sea..."' || char(13) || '
 ' || char(13) || '
Moody, atmospheric... not as funny as I remember, but I''m sure it gets better in Act Two. Regardless, you have my thanks. Please, take something for your efforts.' || char(13) || '
 ' || char(13) || '
And next time you''re in town, do come and see the show. I''ll leave your name at the door... if I can salvage a door from somewhere, that is.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Bestel/B03_19.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[191]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1474, 'BestelOnFishNessa', '[]', 'You do know it''s cruel to make jests of an addled mind, don''t you? Nessa alive, and turned into a bloody cod? Hah! That said, you''ve never been wrong before so seems like I''m going to have to stare this fanciful tale in its fishy face.' || char(13) || '
 ' || char(13) || '
She talked of the Brine King, did she? Now there''s a name what can trouble the breeches off even the most jaded of poets. Though Merveil might be dead, the sea still has its seductive songs, and this time it''s a big, briny baritone doing the wailing.' || char(13) || '
', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Bestel/B03_05.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[191]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1475, 'BestelOnOldGods', '[]', 'Yes, we live in curious times indeed. A time when old stories are being birthed, mewling and puking, into our world of dirt and blood.' || char(13) || '
 ' || char(13) || '
It''s all a bit inspiring really, hence I''ve written a little something.' || char(13) || '
 ' || char(13) || '
Ancient anecdotes' || char(13) || '
Now wake from their beds' || char(13) || '
Looming in our fears' || char(13) || '
Towering above our heads' || char(13) || '
Age-old lusts' || char(13) || '
And bygone greeds' || char(13) || '
Walking and wreaking' || char(13) || '
As humanity bleeds' || char(13) || '
Rivers of history' || char(13) || '
Lakes of blood' || char(13) || '
The gods stand upon us' || char(13) || '
As we cower in the mud' || char(13) || '
', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Bestel/B03_07.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[191]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1476, 'BestelOnBlackCrest', '[]', 'You''ve the deck of the mighty Black Crest under your feet and old Weylam hisself to man the helm? Well I''ll be a pirate''s monkey-mate. You sure do know how to travel in style, exile!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Bestel/B03_16.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[191]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1477, 'TarkleighIntroduction2', '[]', 'First we hear that Oriath has lost its bloody mind, and then you turn up. Doesn''t take a scholar to work out how those two events might be connected.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
I don''t know what''s going on out there, and I probably wouldn''t understand it even if I saw it with my own two eyes. What I do know is this. The world we knew... it''s gone. Now we have to do our damndest to make sure we don''t go with it.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Tarkleigh/TA6_01.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[190]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1478, 'TarkleighNessaQuest', '[]', 'Nessa... I saw her one night, running out across the Coast, headed in the direction of the Mud Flats. Called out to her... but she didn''t even turn her head. Maybe she couldn''t hear me, maybe she didn''t want to, I don''t bloody know. I tried to run after her but she''d vanished into the darkness before my feet had barely touched the sand.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
So I tracked her, all the way to the Mud Flats, and that''s when her tracks... they just stopped. No sign of meeting someone or something, no sign of a struggle. It''s like one moment she was running and the next... gone. ' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Look, I''ve heard some things, about what you''ve done. Things that beggar belief. Now, you can do this. Please, find Nessa. Bring her back to us.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Tarkleigh/TA6_02.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[190]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1479, 'TarkleighNessaMermaid', '[]', 'You''ve seen Nessa? Talked to her? That''s more than I had dared hope for, truth be told.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
This... change... she''s going through, this curse the so-called ''Brine King'' has put on her... it can be broken. I know it!' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
You''ve got to keep going, follow her trail before it gets any colder. Make your way along the Coast, the Ship Graveyard, even Merveil''s Cave if you must.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
By my reckoning, this King''s not the sort to venture far from his briny bed.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Tarkleigh/TA6_05.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[190]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1480, 'TarkleighOnLilly', '[]', 'I wonder how much Lilly squeezed out of those refugees from Oriath. Yes, she did risk her life and ship to save them, but I knew the Lilly of old. A damn fine smuggler, and that Lilly never did a good deed that didn''t also turn a profit.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Tarkleigh/TA6_03.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[190]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1481, 'TarkleighOnShavronne', '[]', 'Axiom Prison has been fairly quiet since you saw fit to retire its warden. Afraid that''s no longer the case.' || char(13) || '
 ' || char(13) || '
Shavronne of Umbra, the very witch that made Brutus the man he was. I don''t know if she''s a ghost, a ghoul or some other death-scorning creature I''ve never heard of, but she''s up there, tinkering away with her black arts and twisting nature around her bony old fingers.' || char(13) || '
 ' || char(13) || '
Honestly, I don''t care why she''s come back or what cruelty she''s brewing up there. She''s a boil that needs lancing before the infection spreads.' || char(13) || '
', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Tarkleigh/TA6_08.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[190]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1482, 'TarkleighOnShavronneDead', '[]', 'Good work clearing another path through Axiom Prison. I''m starting to think those stories I''ve heard about you might be true.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Tarkleigh/TA6_09.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[190]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1483, 'TarkleighOnShipGraveyard', '[]', 'The Ship Graveyard''s blocked off? Dammit... that means that Brine King bastard knows you''re coming after Nessa.' || char(13) || '
 ' || char(13) || '
In that case, you''ll have to pass through Prisoner''s Gate, follow the mountains, and make your way back to the sea by way of Merveil''s Caverns.' || char(13) || '
 ' || char(13) || '
From the sound of it, Nessa''s in no condition to venture far from the coast, so she has to be around there somewhere.' || char(13) || '
', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Tarkleigh/TA6_10.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[190]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1484, 'TarkleighOnBlackFlag', '[]', 'If Nessa thinks you can use that old rag of a banner to rustle up a phantom ship, who am I to argue? I don''t need to understand how she comes back to us, only that she can.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Tarkleigh/TA6_11.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[190]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1485, 'TarkleighTukohamaQuest', '[]', 'The Submerged Passage... it''s underwater again and there''s no sign of those shells you used to drain it.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Fortunately, there''s another way to reach Axiom Prison and beyond, a path I scouted out myself, through what was once the Fetid Pool and then along the Ridge above it.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Problem is, whatever''s brought those Karui revenants to life has also sealed the pool entranceway with a bloody great totem.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Tarkleigh/TA6_04.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[190]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1486, 'TarkleighFortressOpen', '[]', 'The Fetid Pool''s lost its stink. Washed clean, like the Autumn rain that gives Theopolis its only decent bath for the year.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
And turns out, when you scrub away the fetid filth, there''s a Karui fortress underneath. Probably built by King Kaom himself. Now home to... I don''t even know what. Needless to say, I didn''t get too close, but looks like it''s big, Karui, and right royally pissed off about something.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Tarkleigh/TA6_06.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[190]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1487, 'TarkleighTukohamaReward', '[]', 'You''ve killed the Karui war god? Can you kill a god?' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Look, I can''t even begin to understand what you''ve just done. Bestel will be able to put our gratitude into words more fitting of a legend. Me, I''ll work with what I know. A solid reward for a damn fine deed.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Tarkleigh/TA6_07.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[190]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1488, 'TarkleighNessaQuestComplete', '[]', 'I''d hoped for a chance to see Nessa again, dreamed it like some poor bloody child believing in fairytales.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
No, she''s not one of us anymore, but at least she''s not like Merveil either. Can''t overlook a mercy like that. Who knows, perhaps Nessa is better off this way. Not like this is much of a home to come back to, anyway.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Look, I know you did what you could, and for that, you''ll always have my thanks.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Tarkleigh/TA6_12.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[190]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1489, 'TarkleighPuppetMasterQuest', '[]', 'With the road to the Phrecian Forest clear again, I trekked through to the forests beyond, to see if the strangeness we''re seeing on the coast is also happening inland. What I saw nearly froze my heart solid.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
The animals there, poor wretches... overtaken by some sort of parasite. As close as I can reckon they''re like termites, burrowing into flesh and mind instead of wood. If I''m right, there''ll be a nest somewhere, and a queen. If you can find it, destroy it. Those parasites aren''t something we want to see around here any time soon.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Tarkleigh/TA6_13.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[190]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1490, 'TarkleighPuppetMasterReward', '[]', 'Another damned god, you say? Yeah, that figures. A primitive deity from a primitive time, crawling up out of the dirt with a view to enslaving us all with its creepy bloody offspring.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
I think we could all do without gods like that. So here, take something for the road ahead. The way things are going, it''ll be a tough one.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Tarkleigh/TA6_14.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[190]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1491, 'TarkleighOnKaruiEye', '[]', 'That Karui relic you''re carrying... looks bloody familiar. Yeah, I''ve seen it''s twin stuck in that totem guarding Tukohama''s doorstep. If I were you... and in this case I''m glad I''m not... I''d see about putting that eye back where it belongs. It might do nothing at all, but it''s at least worth a shot, I reckon.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Tarkleigh/T6-04a.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[190]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1492, 'TarkleighOnBrineKing', '[]', 'Never took much stock in the stories Lilly told. Didn''t sit right, those full moon sacrifices her and her ilk would do out on the open water. But now, in light of everything, I''m obliged to reconsider. ' || char(13) || '
 ' || char(13) || '
If it meant Nessa might be spared the attentions of that wretched Brine King, I''d even be inclined to slit a mutineering throat or two myself. ' || char(13) || '
', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Tarkleigh/TA6_16.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[190]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1493, 'TarkleighOnOriathanZombies', '[]', 'Those shambling ''nobles'' out there on the strand? They left Oriath to die a bloody death. Rats fleeing a sinking ship. Seems they learned a bit of a hard truth though. Doesn''t matter how much money you have, you can''t outrun death when it comes for you.' || char(13) || '
 ' || char(13) || '
Can''t say they''ve actually noticed though. They''re still the same flesh-eating bastards they''ve always been. Just a bit more obvious about it now.' || char(13) || '
', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Tarkleigh/TA6_18.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[190]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1494, 'TarkleighOnLillyPast', '[]', 'I had a life before Lioneye''s Watch. Not much of one by some people''s standards, but it was good enough for me. ' || char(13) || '
 ' || char(13) || '
Lilly and I, we''d smuggle a bit of booze to keep our purses full. We were good at it too. Made us a fine partnership, her quick mind and my steady nerves, right up until the day she left me drunk and trussed on Penance Quay. By the time the Blackguards unwrapped their present, she was halfway to Trarthus. ' || char(13) || '
 ' || char(13) || '
That''s how I ended up here. Yes, it smarts a bit to look at her, but what right have I to say where the flotsam finally washes up?', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Tarkleigh/T6-17.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[190]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1495, 'TarkleighOnRevenants1', '[0]', 'Seems Tukohama''s raised up a host out of whatever afterlife you Karui believe in. I feel for those poor bastards, if I''m to be honest. You Karui haven''t had an easy history. Colonised, enslaved, used as pawns in many a war, and now abused in death by your own bloody god. ' || char(13) || '
 ' || char(13) || '
This is why I don''t follow any deity. They''re all as bad as each other.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Tarkleigh/TA6_20.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[190]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1496, 'TarkleighOnRevenants2', '[]', 'Seems Tukohama''s raised up a host out of whatever afterlife the Karui believe in. I feel for those poor bastards, if I''m to be honest. The Karui haven''t had an easy history. Colonised, enslaved, used as pawns in many a war, and now abused in death by their own bloody god. ' || char(13) || '
 ' || char(13) || '
This is why I don''t follow any deity. They''re all as bad as each other.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Tarkleigh/TA6_19.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[190]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1497, 'NessaMermaidMudFlats', '[]', 'He did this to me... the King of Brine, and he wants me to be... oh god... his... Please... I don''t know how I am doing this, nor if I may again. Help me... help us... before he... before...', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/NessaFishwife/Ne_A6_01.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[202]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1498, 'NessaMermaidPrisonersGate', '[]', 'What are you doing?! God drag you to damnation if you''re going to stand by and let this happen to me! To us! Because believe me, the Brine King has far greater appetites than one nothing of a girl from Oriath. It doesn''t matter what he''ll do to me now... it''s what he''ll do to Wraeclast. Yet there''s hope. There''s always hope... if only you can reach Merveil''s cave. If only...', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/NessaFishwife/Ne_A6_02.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[203]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1499, 'NessaMermaidMerveilsCaverns', '[]', 'The Brine King... his time has almost come. Then hope will be... I will be gone. Please... take the Black Flag. It once fluttered from the mast of the Black Crest, Weylam Roth''s ship. Throw it into the flames of the Beacon. It''s your only chance of reaching me, of turning this tide. The King can''t keep secrets like this from me any longer. It''s just... the way of things. Find me, please, before...', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/NessaFishwife/Ne_A6_03.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[204]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100);
INSERT INTO "NPCTextAudio" ("_row", "Id", "Characters", "Text", "Mono_AudioFile", "Stereo_AudioFile", "HasStereo", "__col6", "Video", "__col8", "__col9", "__col10", "NPCs", "NPCPortrait", "__col13", "__col14", "Cooldown", "__col16") VALUES
(1500, 'NessaMermaidCallOut', '[]', 'Over here! Hurry!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/NessaFishwife/Ne_A6_04.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[205]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1501, 'NessaMermaidFightIntro1', '[0]', 'So strong, so dedicated. A man like you would never disappoint a lady in need. You''re a gift, don''t you see? A sumptuous feast for his majesty on his wedding day. Really, we are both so touched by your generosity.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/NessaFishwife/Ne_A6_05.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[205]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1502, 'NessaMermaidFightIntro2', '[4]', 'So strong, so dedicated. A man like you would never disappoint a lady in need. You''re a gift, don''t you see? A sumptuous feast for his majesty on his wedding day. Really, we are both so touched by your generosity.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/NessaFishwife/Ne_A6_05.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[205]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1503, 'NessaMermaidFightIntro3', '[6]', 'So strong, so dedicated. A man like you would never disappoint a lady in need. You''re a gift, don''t you see? A sumptuous feast for his majesty on his wedding day. Really, we are both so touched by your generosity.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/NessaFishwife/Ne_A6_05.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[205]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1504, 'NessaMermaidFightIntro4', '[5]', 'So strong, so dedicated. A man like you would never disappoint a lady in need. You''re a gift, don''t you see? A sumptuous feast for his majesty on his wedding day. Really, we are both so touched by your generosity.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/NessaFishwife/Ne_A6_05.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[205]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1505, 'NessaMermaidFightIntro5', '[3]', 'So courageous, such a fine example of womanhood. I simply knew you wouldn''t disappoint me. Or my husband. You see, his majesty could never be satiated on his wedding day by one bride alone. Thank you, my new sister. I shall always treasure your company.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/NessaFishwife/Ne_A6_06.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[205]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1506, 'NessaMermaidFightIntro6', '[1]', 'So courageous, such a fine example of womanhood. I simply knew you wouldn''t disappoint me. Or my husband. You see, his majesty could never be satiated on his wedding day by one bride alone. Thank you, my new sister. I shall always treasure your company.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/NessaFishwife/Ne_A6_06.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[205]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1507, 'NessaMermaidFightIntro7', '[2]', 'So courageous, such a fine example of womanhood. I simply knew you wouldn''t disappoint me. Or my husband. You see, his majesty could never be satiated on his wedding day by one bride alone. Thank you, my new sister. I shall always treasure your company.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/NessaFishwife/Ne_A6_06.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[205]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1508, 'SinShavronneQuest', '[]', 'Despite your best efforts, Beast Slayer, a splinter of hope remains. The very seed that brought my Beast into existence. The Dark Ember.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Never again shall it birth a life so magnificent as the Beast, yet a residue of that power still lingers. Enough to give us a fighting chance against the ravenous Kitava.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
How do we obtain this Dark Ember? Three hearts were silenced, three hearts must sing again, one last time. In that final flickering of life, our saviour seed shall be born. All I need are three fine souls with which to stoke the flames.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Shavronne of Umbra. Inquisitor Maligaro. Doedre the Darktongue. Three spirits of near unfathomable resilience and vigour, freed with the Beast''s final exhalation. So let us begin the harvest!' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Shavronne has come home, to Axiom. We shall give her the warm welcome she sincerely deserves.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Sin/S11.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[196]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1509, 'SinShavronneReward', '[]', 'And so it begins. My aetherial veins now run with dark ambition. Let''s turn that trickle into a torrent. Let''s harvest ourselves a Grand Inquisitor.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Just as Shavronne''s spirit chose to return to comfortable climes, Maligaro''s essence once again dwells in his very own Chamber of Sins. Though I hasten to add that Maligaro''s sins are not my sins. I prefer transgressions of a more natural order than does he.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
I''d carry you to Phrecia if I could, yet I expended too much of myself when I snatched you from the jaws of Kitava. You will need to find your own path, as will I. Make the journey, and please survive it. We two have much work left to do.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Sin/S14.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[199]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1510, 'SinOnShavronne', '[]', 'If she is to be of any use to us, the Umbra''s spirit must be wrenched from her mortal manifestation and lashed to our greater cause. That is your task.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
For my part, I shall negotiate the terms of her cooperation. With a tragic kiss and lasting embrace, her essence shall pass into me as if she were sweet breath from the mouth of my lover.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
It is a sacrosanct sacrifice for all involved. Thankfully for you, all I ask is that you do what you clearly do best. Kill.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Sin/S12.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[196]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1511, 'SinOnShavronneSoul', '[]', 'Ambition is the bane of mortality. It was through ambition that we gods transcended the thick mud and thin blood of our mundane birthrights. Ambition that drove us to sustain our divine selves through the subjugation of others.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Shavronne''s soul is made up of one part ambition and two parts raw, unbounded passion. Such a volatile spark shall burn briefly and brightly in even the most deadened of hearts.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Sin/S13.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[196]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1512, 'SinOnGods', '[]', 'I shall put this simply, for in truth, everything comes down to the simple act of planting a seed in the ground. The gods are rising because you slew the one creature that prevented them from doing so. Your name for it is "The Beast."' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
It was I who planted the seed in the rich soil beneath Highgate, who nurtured it, who watched it bloom into maturity, even as I succumbed to its mollifying powers. We gods, we were driven into slumbering darkness, to dream away eternity whilst the gentle Beast watched over us.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
I would desire that we return to that blissful state, but my brothers and sisters of deism shall never submit to banishment. They have tasted freedom once more and they shall not let go of this world until it is pried from their cold, dead hands.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Sin/S15.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[196]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1513, 'SinOnBeast', '[]', 'The Beast was never a cruel master. It didn''t want to destroy, to corrupt, to terrorise. It simply existed to exist. I made it that way.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Unfortunately, in neglecting to provide it with ambition, I made it vulnerable to the ambitions of others. Queen Atziri and Doryani. Emperor Chitus and Malachai. Others even before them.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
I created a Beast that would free humanity from the tyranny of the gods. Yet all I really did was provide the perfect tool with which humanity could tyrannise itself.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Sin/S16.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[196]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1514, 'SinOnTukohamaQuest', '[]', 'From here to the Beast, the journey is long and arduous. You are strong, for a mortal, yet the beating of this war drum shall burst your human heart. So we must fortify it with something a little more divine in nature.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
While a god may fall, their essence lingers, a quiet cacophony outside of your perception. That essence can be yours, to galvanise your will and invigorate your body.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
I have the perfect first donor for us. Tukohama, the Father of War. In a pool once foul and fetid, he has raised a fortress now ferocious and fearsome. Best you pay him a visit before he also raises that ugly son of his, and unleashes him upon what remains of Wraeclast.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Sin/S17.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[196]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1515, 'SinOnTukohamaOrigin', '[]', 'The Karui were a peaceful culture of farmers and fishermen, before fate thrust the great Tukohama upon them. It was he who put the stone axes in their hands and the hunger for conquest in their bellies.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Farmers quenched their dry fields in blood. Fishermen emptied their holds of fish and filled them with land-greedy hordes.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Battle by battle, war by war, Tukohama carved the steps that would carry him up a mountain of severed heads, and into immortality. Tukohama''s axe is called Anger, his spear is called Greed, and their victims are the minds and hearts of all Karui.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Sin/S18.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[196]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1516, 'SinTukohamaReward', '[]', 'I am Sin, Thief of Virtue, and it is mine to take what I will from the defeated, to make a gift of it to the victorious.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Alas, your mortal frame cannot withstand the unfettered fire of deism. It would turn your blood to mist and scorch your precious flesh black. So choose modestly and choose wisely, for there is much more at stake here than your little hopes and dreams.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Sin/S20.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[196,197]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1517, 'SinOnAberrathQuest', '[]', 'I''ve another deity in mind who could be persuaded to donate a little essence to your ongoing edification.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Abberath, a deranged old goat with a thirst for human souls whose cloven hooves now stand astride the old prisoners road.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Have you ever tasted a soul, Beast Slayer? No, I imagine not. The poets all speak of sweet souls, bitter souls, enlightened souls and twisted souls. You know what most of them taste like, really? Regret, with a lingering aftertaste of ''should''ve known better''.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Sin/S21.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[196]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1518, 'SinOnAberrathOrigin', '[]', 'A renowned alchemist, eroded by his lust for distilled spirits - and not the alcoholic kind. Abberath the Scholar King, dancing upon a stage of chemicals and fire.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
He used his knowledge to burn away the flesh so as to liquidate the life force within, a libation he consumed with both frequency and alacrity.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
It started with animals, goats specifically, and thus his own cruelty became his curse. The Scholar King became the Cloven One, Quaffer of Souls. Some say he turned to the dram of Man in order to cure himself. I believe his thirst simply grew with his burgeoning immortality.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
And perhaps he still retained some of his scholarly nature, for he seemed fair determined to share his hard won wisdom. He took himself a princess, a lovely thing from a local tribe, and nine months later she gave birth to something rather unlovely.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
The Faun, as wild and wicked as the shaggy god himself. Schooled in his father''s ways, the Faun would carry off many more virgins in his time, and thus, the race of goatmen found their footing.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Sin/S22.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[196]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1519, 'SinAberrathReward', '[]', 'Good souls were hard enough to come by without that parched old goat drinking his fill. You have done humanity a noble service.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Sin/S24.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[196,198]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1520, 'SinOnRyslathaQuest', '[]', 'The Puppet Mistress was a revered matriarch who nurtured her tribe into greatness through love, peace and fecundity. That is, until her children were slaughtered by Tukohama''s brave warriors.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Dissolution and desperation, they do troubling things to the spirit. And given enough time, what one believes, one becomes.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Sin/S26.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[196]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1521, 'SinOnRyslathaOrigin', '[]', 'A maggot that festers and writhes in the fetid mud of the wettest lands. Ryslatha, the white worm that corrupts the very earth while her heart yearns to replenish her slaughtered brood. ' || char(13) || '
 ' || char(13) || '
Hers was a prolific tribe once, fat with peace and fecund with love. Then Tukohama''s fire swept across her sacred land and her children were butchered by the madness of war.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Now the immortal mother has one waking thought. She will also ensure that her children are never harmed again. How? By making everyone''s children, her children.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Sin/S28.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[196]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1522, 'SinRyslathaReward', '[]', 'The Azmeri believed that, one day, this world of ours would collapse under the weight of Ryslatha''s offspring. A frightening thought, and thankfully, a mistaken one.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Sin/S29.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[196,200]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1523, 'SinOnBrineKingQuest', '[]', 'Old, salty Tsoagoth, pickled in a thick brine of ignominious carnality. Vanity was Tsoagoth''s downfall, and I think he grew his shell just to shield himself from the shame of it all.' || char(13) || '
 ' || char(13) || '
It''s time you sailed out to that reef refuge of his, cracked his carapace, and dined on the divine meat beneath.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Sin/S30.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[196]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1524, 'SinOnBrineKingOrigin', '[]', 'When I first met Tsoagoth, he was a seafaring chieftain, the beloved leader of a prosperous and sprawling fisher tribe. It was the curse of legacy that made him into the blasphemous Brine King. An endless madness of propagation and disappointment. All in the vain hope of recreating himself.' || char(13) || '
 ' || char(13) || '
Fishwife after fishwife he took, and every one of them spawned a monster. A truly noble king would have surrendered his kingdom to cleaner blood. Alas, although Tsoagoth had many fine qualities, generosity was not one of them.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Sin/S31.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[196]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1525, 'SinBrineKingReward', '[]', 'And thus the Lord of Salt and Scale sinks to feed the fishes that flit amongst the ruins of Tsoatha. Come, ingest of his divine juices while they are all washed away.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Sin/S33.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[196,201]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1526, 'TukohamaIntro', '[]', 'Let me teach you the laws of war.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/TukohamaIntro/A01_Introduction.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[207]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1527, 'ShavronneTwoIntro', '[]', 'Not you! Upon my life and my work, I shall not suffer this humiliation again!', '', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[199]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1528, 'WeylamBeaconIntro', '[]', 'So you''re the shite that''s gone and summoned me to the beacon, eh? Dammit all... rules is rules and now I''m bound to you, the legendary Weylam Roth, Captain of the Black Crest, cursed to be the undead slave of some lowly... outcast, by the looks of it.' || char(13) || '
 ' || char(13) || '
You got an arse for a brain in that thick skull of yours? Of course I''ll ferry you to the Brine King''s bloody reef. I be wanting to discharge this accursed duty and get back to me afterlife. It''s not right, not natural, being above water without a beating heart in me chest. ' || char(13) || '
 ' || char(13) || '
So get yourself aboard and be quick about it!' || char(13) || '
', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Weylam/W_01.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[193]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1529, 'WeylamSailToReef', '[]', 'Don''t think I''m going to be balling and chaining after your sorry arse once our journey to the reef is done.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Weylam/W_02.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[193]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1530, 'WeylamArrivedAtReef', '[]', 'Right, well on with it then. Go find yourself a salty sovereign to dethrone. Fools'' errand if you ask me. Old Briny will gut you like a fish, but at least with you dead in the water I''ll be free to get on with me own voyage. So off you go, matey.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Weylam/W_03.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[194]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1531, 'WeylamOnBrineKing', '[]', 'Lord of Salt and Scale''s what we used to call him. They say when the gods got the boot from our lands, that monstrosity went to sleep down in the deep. Dreamed the kinda dreams that cause all sorts of gilled abominations to rise up, to plague and hunt us for what he thinks we must''ve done to him.' || char(13) || '
 ' || char(13) || '
Was a time we got ordered to hunt them things near extinction. Free the trade routes from Old Briny''s tyranny. Even so, not a sailor worth his salt who won''t sacrifice a lousy deckhand or two by light of the full moon, just to keep that overgrown crab slumbering in the Oriathan trench.' || char(13) || '
 ' || char(13) || '
If he''s risen again, you bet your bloody arse we''re all buggered. ' || char(13) || '
', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Weylam/W_04.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[194]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1532, 'WeylamOnBrineKingDead', '[]', 'How did you...? You still breathing? Bloody barnacles on me arse! You, my new friend, are a legend of the high seas to behold! Tell you what, I''ve already done my bit getting you here, but if you''re looking to sail on to Phrecia, me and the Black Crest would be honoured to take you.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Weylam/W_05.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[195]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1533, 'WeylamSailToAct7', '[]', 'Hold on to yer cockles, me hearty! The sea betwixt here and Phrecia be the most ill-tempered there is. Here''s hoping you''ve as much steel in yer gizzard as ye seem to in yer heart.' || char(13) || '
 ' || char(13) || '
Cast off!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Weylam/W_06.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[195]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1534, 'WeylamOnBrokenBridge', '[]', 'What''ll I do now? This here Broken Bridge speaks to me some. A fair place to rest me old bones for a bit. And tell you what, with all this sunlight and fresh air, I can feel the calling forth of the poetic muse beneath me trousers! ' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Been a long time since I''ve felt this here compass point in any direction.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Weylam/W_07.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[225]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1535, 'WeylamOnMerveil', '[]', 'It''s a bit of an embarrassing affair, truth be told. ' || char(13) || '
 ' || char(13) || '
Thought I could return to the golden days, you know? Be a terror of the high seas like in me youth. Problem was, they''d all forgotten me. Those young blighters sailing about, they had no clue who I even were! Figured if I could complete another great feat, like slaying that sea-bitch Merveil, maybe that''d earn me my respect back.' || char(13) || '
 ' || char(13) || '
Arr, suppose I don''t need to tell you; that girlie''s stronger than she looks. All it took were one slip of the old hands and next I knew, the Black Crest were wrecked against the coast and I''m getting meself eaten alive by that hag.' || char(13) || '
 ' || char(13) || '
Peeled each separate muscle from my bones, she did. I''ll tell you, it weren''t pretty.' || char(13) || '
', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Weylam/W_11.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[225]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1536, 'WeylamOnLilly', '[]', 'Aye, I know Lilly be missing me something great, and it cuts me deep not to go visit the lass. Thing is, I reckon she should remember me as I was, not retch at the sight of this spectre I be now. Let the legend live on in her mind, I say.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Weylam/W_10.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[225]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1537, 'WeylamOnYeena', '[]', 'Yeena''s a pretty young thing ain''t she. Bosoms to eclipse the sun, she has! Might be that I spend some time here, get to know the lass a tad more. Never mind that she''s young and alive and I be... argh, old and dead. Once she hears me poetry, that is. Not a girlie alive who won''t want for a bit of ol'' rot tooth once he breaks out the... heh, tongue twisters and... word plays!' || char(13) || '
 ' || char(13) || '
Not that she''d likely hold much interest in an old ghost like me. Still, a man can dream. Even a dead one.' || char(13) || '
', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Weylam/W_12.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[225]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1538, 'WeylamOnHelena', '[]', 'Arr, that lassie. Pretty on the eyes I reckon, but she''s got her knickers pulled up far too high. Bit uptight if ye ask me.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Weylam/W_13.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[225,311]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1539, 'WeylamOnEramir', '[]', 'Eramir? He''s a tad dull, tends to ramble on a bit. Still, he''s a few interesting stories of his own, so might be worth chewing the fat with from time to time.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Weylam/W_14.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[225]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1540, 'WeylamLocketQuest', '[]', 'Now speaking of navigations and the like, a long time ago, I had me a nice collection of riches stuffed away in a lockbox. Being the stupid arse that I am, I buried the thing one eve when I was high in me cups. Can''t for the death of me remember where I... except, I know it was near this broken bridge.' || char(13) || '
 ' || char(13) || '
The box has a silver locket in it, holds the portrait of me late wife, Meredith. It''s the last thing I have in this world to remember her by. If you happen across me lockbox in your travels, I''d be appreciating of its return.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Weylam/W_15.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[225]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1541, 'WeylamLocketReward', '[]', 'Me locket! Ohoh! Oh, me darling, my beautiful Meredith. How I miss your shuddering bosoms, your quivering thighs. She had a heart to melt an iceberg, and teats the size of... well, anyway, I thank you greatly.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Please, whatever else be in that lockbox, take your pick from it. This locket be the only treasure I need.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Weylam/W_16.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[225]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1542, 'WeylamStarQuest', '[]', 'I be missing me granddaughter something terrible. You know, I used to tell Lilly bedtime stories till she fell asleep in me arms. She loved the ones about Kishara, a tough-as-nails Vaal lassie said to have explored every coast, cove and bay of this blasted continent with the help of her Star, some nifty artefact she nabbed from somewhere on her first voyage. Young Lilly, she were fascinated by Kishara''s Star. Said to be fair humming with thaumaturgy, able to guide its mistress wherever she be fixing to journey.' || char(13) || '
 ' || char(13) || '
Methinks me granddaughter liked to imagine that one day she''d hold the Star in her hands and explore the outer reaches of this world. I''d dearly love to see her again, but there ain''t no way I''m making that journey with nothing to show for it. She looks up to me, does Lilly. So I''m reckoning that Star might put a smile on her pretty face. With such a gift in hand, I''d maybe have the guts to go visit me granddaughter instead of skulking here like some craven ghost... that''s if some kind and brave soul fetched it for me.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Weylam/W_17.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[225]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1543, 'WeylamStarReward', '[]', 'So this is Kishara''s famed Star. Hmmm, just as I reckoned, it won''t point me in any one direction, it can''t make up its mind I suspect due to me not being able to make up mine. I feel a tremor of prophecy coming over me, like some scallywag''s just stomped over me grave. If I go see Lilly, there''s to be only disappointment and sorrow.' || char(13) || '
 ' || char(13) || '
If that''s what the future has in store then it can keep it. I wish a long and vibrant life for the girly, one free of the trouble that an old, dead buccaneer like I might bring upon her.' || char(13) || '
', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Weylam/W_19.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[225]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1544, 'WeylamOnKisharaStar', '[]', 'Legend has it, Kishara got herself in some hot water with a certain Queen Atziri. Details are vague as to exactly how, but by all accounts, Atziri weren''t the most understanding of lasses. Kishara, being the free spirited sort probably just pricked the royal arse with some spiky facts from the outside world. Almost lost her head for her trouble, Kishara. Atziri took her ship and made sacrifices of her crew. Forced the poor girlie into hiding. ' || char(13) || '
 ' || char(13) || '
Still, Kishara being of a wily inclination like meself, she slipped through Atziri''s talons and right out of the empire. But before she left, Kishara hid the Star somewhere near the Causeway that leads into the old Vaal city up north, just in case she got caught, I suppose. Something like that in the hands of a tyrant like Atziri... who knows what trouble she might''ve found with it.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Weylam/W_18.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[225]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1545, 'WeylamOnPondium', '[]', 'Think of the worst place ye can imagine. That''s Pondium. Now think of the gods-be-damned best whore house you''ve ever had the pleasure of. That''s Pondium. A ''pirate paradise'' full of bodies to stab, holes to fill, and devious liquor to imbibe.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Brinerots control the whole island, and make sure it lives up to the lowest of expectations.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Can''t imagine much has changed since I was there last. Still, it''s a good place to swash your buckle and make love to a bawdy buxom bunter out back of a boozy bar!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Weylam/W_20.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[225]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1546, 'WeylamOnBrinerots', '[]', 'Aye, them Brinerots be a nasty bunch. Led by me very own flesh and blood. Me baby sister, Lussi! The "Rotmother" they call her now. Used to be that I were their leader, back when the Brinerots were about one thing and one thing only - raiding, pillaging and plundering their scrawny black guts out!' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Old Lussi were me first mate for years, but she got a whiff of the power that being Captain could gain her, and mutineered me! Me own sister! Dropped me on some deserted island off the coast of somewhere, the bitch. Took months to make it back to the mainland.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
That Brinerot clan''s been trouble ever since. Used to have some good old fashioned pirate honour, and now they''re raving mad lunatics out for their next fix of fear and fortune.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Weylam/W_21.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[225]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1547, 'YeenaGreetingsA7', '[]', 'You arrive! The great Spirit spoke in my dreams, told me that darkness would again drown our lands. And you, exile, would walk before the flood. ' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
But what is this? You are not alone. A shade, a memory, older even than... no... older than Spirit? Fear grips my throat, I shake, but the Spirit drapes a warming cloak upon my shoulders. ' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
This ancient ghost that follows you, it has the trust of the Spirit, and if the Spirit trusts then I trust.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Yeena/Yeena7_01.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[226]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1548, 'YeenaOnForestEncampment', '[]', 'My heart weeps for our old home, but what the Spirit gives, we must embrace. The Spirit, it claims who it needs to, when it needs to. There is no sense in sadness.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Yeena/Yeena7_02.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[226]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1549, 'YeenaOnSilkMissing', '[]', 'I watch Silk for many days, scurrying to this old Vaal stone, scurrying to that old Vaal ruin, always muttering. He talked and talked and talked yet I heard no one answer. The Spirit warned that I should stay away from him. It pained me. Silk is my friend, yet I must listen to Spirit. I go from Silk''s side and now he is gone from mine.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
I do not know where Silk go, but I see him in dreams. He is caught in great spider web that stretch into darkness. And that spider web, it is full of bones, more bones from more people than I ever see in my life.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
If you find Silk, please, free him from the web. Don''t let him become bones like the rest.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Yeena/Yeena7_04.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[226]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1550, 'YeenaOnSilkFound', '[]', 'What you tell me of Silk, this I understand, though I do not want to. I have spent many nights pondering Silk''s journey, why he has stepped from the Spirit path. Now I know. He has walked into the eight arms of blind lust. Arakaali.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Silk is a warning to us all. He is trying to take the short trail to greatness, to the story Spirit has made for him. Silk tries to steal his story but now he holds only a lie.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Please, you must find the place where this Arakaali sleeps in her web of shadow. You must stop Silk before he wakes her, a mistake that we all will come to regret. The Spirit tells me this is so.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Yeena/Yeena7_05.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[226]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1551, 'YeenaOnSilkDead', '[]', 'I miss my friend. Silk knew the Spirit as I did. We would talk, understand it, together. Now there is no one but me.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Yeena/Yeena7_11.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[226]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1552, 'YeenaOnWraeclast', '[]', 'Wraeclast has changed. Once, I knew my place in this world. I knew my place within the Spirit. Now, doorways have opened. Doorways I can neither see, nor touch, but through which the spiritless ones pass all the same. The spiritless ones must be driven back, their doors must be closed. May the Great Spirit guide you in your battles against these ancients that mean us nothing but ill.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Yeena/Yeena7_12.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[226]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1553, 'YeenaOnArakaali', '[]', 'I have asked questions of Spirit and it has answered in dreams that wake me with screaming. Arakaali will suck all life from this land, leave only empty husks and dusty bones. There will be no Spirit, no us, no thing left to love and laugh.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Only husks and dust... and Arakaali.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Yeena/Yeena7_10.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[226]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1554, 'YeenaOnGreustDead', '[]', 'Greust hunted too far from the lands of Spirit and fell prey to a spiritless one. I am sad at how he passed. An ugly death. Yet I am thankful that he suffers no more, that he has now found his way back to the Spirit. That he can rest now.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Yeena/Yeena7_03.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[226]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1555, 'YeenaOnWeylam', '[]', 'I belong to no one but the Spirit, I have no need for the sweet words and caresses of a ghost. Weylam, he makes me laugh, and he hears the voice of the Spirit. Not in the same way I do. His Spirit speaks of the great waters beyond this land. He pays heed to the Spirit and the Spirit loves him for it. I do not.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
It is better to speak to the dead than no one at all. Weylam knows the Spirit but he will not know me.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Yeena/Yeena7_13.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[226]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1556, 'YeenaFireflyQuest', '[]', 'You have found the resting place of this Arakaali? Good, though Spirit tells me that we will not reach her, not without help. Webs she weaves with fibres of faith and fear. Too strong to break. Too strong to cut.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Yet there is an Azmeri potion, most ancient. ''Fire Dew''. It might be enough to burn a path, make way for us to pass into heart of spider web. I could brew it for you, but there is one ingredient I do not possess. The blazing blood of the firefly that lives in the most dreaded of thickets. ' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Travel I shall to Arakaali, to sit on her doorstep until you bring me seven flames that flit and fly. Then I make you a Fire Dew and together we go talk to this bride of foolish Silk.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Yeena/Yeena7_06.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[226]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1557, 'YeenaFireflyQuest2', '[]', 'Webs she weaves with fibres of faith and fear. Too strong to break. Too strong to cut.' || char(13) || '
 ' || char(13) || '
Yet there is an Azmeri potion, most ancient. ''Fire Dew''. It might be enough to burn a path, make way for us to pass into heart of spider web. I could brew it for you, but there is one ingredient I do not possess. The blazing blood of the firefly that lives in the most dreaded of thickets. ' || char(13) || '
 ' || char(13) || '
Bring me seven flames that flit and fly. Then I make you a Fire Dew and together we go talk to this bride of foolish Silk.' || char(13) || '
', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Yeena/Yeena7_06V2.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[227]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1558, 'YeenaFireflyClue', '[]', 'You are like the frog that strikes the fly faster than eye can see! No, carry your bright bugs to Arakaali''s gate. We will meet there and brew our Fire Dew. Not here. Too much to burn. Too many to make blind!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Yeena/Yeena7_08.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[226]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1559, 'YeenaFirefliesDelivered', '[]', 'Fireflies! So bright and juicy with flame. Now for the rite. I warn you, stand back and be not afraid of what you see. And be not afraid for me. The Spirit guides and protects. Though I may change, I shall still be, will always be, Yeena.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Yeena/Yeena7_07.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[227]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1560, 'YeenaOnArakaaliDead', '[]', 'You hear that? No? It is Spirit singing as does the fly who escapes the web. Yes, it is most happy with us... and with your strange friend there too.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
He is a god, yes I can see that much. But why he helps you? Of all questions, that one you must have answer to. ' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Now I must return to Broken Bridge... so tired now. We will speak more of Silk and sorrow then.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Yeena/Yeena7_09.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[317]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1561, 'SilkIntro', '[]', 'Hello to you, Great Dreamer!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Silk3D/SA7_01.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[230]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1562, 'SilkBlackDeathQuest', '[]', 'We have woven a tale together in days past. Perhaps we shall again? We make mighty stories, you and I, and now I have daunting task before me... the last in my great journey. ' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Near to us, cast in shadow, a monster awaits. Black Death is his name, a beauteous eight-leg, twisted grotesque by the master of these loathsome halls. I wish to give this eight-leg the merciful peace he deserves, and to save what is still beautiful, the elixir that only Black Death can make.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Please, will you find him, kill this Black Death, take the eight-leg''s venom for me? I may be fearsome warrior but Black Death''s master has made him into a thing more monstrous than even I can best. Who knows? Perhaps Black Death is too strong even for you?', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Silk2/SA7_02.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[230]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1563, 'SilkBlackDeathReward', '[]', 'The Black Venom! Oh, Great Dreamer who has done great deeds, I shall see to it that my queen rewards you with honour and mercy when she rises up to claim what is hers. Yes, this elixir, so aged and potent, shall be life-giving draught that she sips upon first waking. It is my gift to her... my wedding gift!' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Great Dreamer, you be wrapped in silken finery and made welcome at our wedding feast. Guest of honour, and oh what a feast we all shall enjoy!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Silk2/SA7_05.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[230]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1564, 'SilkOnBlackDeath', '[]', 'I have climbed the great eight-leg web. I know the eight-legs like no other. This eight-leg, this Black Death, is one of the oldest and most fearsome eight-legs in all this land and beyond. To its shame, it was made pet, plaything, by the malicious master of this place. For years countless it grew in pain. Pain is all it knows, all it can understand, all it can give.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
End Black Death''s pain, for all and once.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Silk2/SA7_03.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[230]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1565, 'SilkOnJourney', '[]', 'My great journey led me to places of great power beyond even your stories, Great Dreamer. I am carried on legs and webs and shadows. That is all you can know for now.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Silk2/SA7_04.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[230]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1566, 'SilkPreBoss', '[]', 'My bride has arrived, exile! I hope you brought a wedding gift!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Silk3D/SA7_07.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[231]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1567, 'SilkArakaaliGlyph', '[]', 'Your soft whispers beneath earth tingle my skin, like breath of lover against my loins. I sleep not. I hear your name inside my skull. Arakaali. No name tasted so sweet on my tongue.' || char(13) || '
 ' || char(13) || '
Stories I have heard, tales of cursed beauty. Visage of woman, jewel that walks the streets in final days of a great empire. Heard tell you sought victims, but I know truth. You sought man to love you, to break spell. You hoped true love might allow you to shed eight-leg body, to become goddess of love once more.' || char(13) || '
 ' || char(13) || '
I pledge myself to you, my lady of Vaal. I promise love, for I am that man you have waited on. Corrupt corpse-lovers claim to worship you, call you Spinner of Shadows, but you have spun only shadows of desire about my heart.' || char(13) || '
 ' || char(13) || '
Sweet Arakaali, I have found your altar. I will speak the call. I will return you to beauty. I will raise you from black pits of despair and together we shall rule Wraeclast in glory... forever.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/SilkGlyph/SA7_09.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[244]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1568, 'EramirGreetingsA7', '[]', 'Ah yes, you do seem to have a penchant for presenting yourself when times are at their most... perplexing.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
It would seem that our Almighty has forsaken us. False deities from ages past now rise and ravage while our blessed Innocence remains as silent as the stones at my feet. So much for Templar propaganda, eh?' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Well, I suppose if we are to fend for ourselves, then I should answer your troubling arrival with our own most pressing tribulation.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Eramir/EA7_01.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[228]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1569, 'EramirOnRalakesh', '[]', 'Yes, Ralakesh, the god of many faces. I read about this god when I looked after the museum in Theopolis. It''s said he was obsessed with governance, in particular, the control of humanity through our base, animal instincts. He ruled over the citizens of one unfortunate Vaal city. Alas, the name escapes me.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Yet I do recall that his experiments brought his subjects to the brink of extinction and that he was forced to enslave many a primitive Azmerian of the time so as to repopulate his domain.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Though I shudder at the thought, I can only imagine that Ralakesh has rather similar plans now.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Eramir/EA7_07.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[228]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1570, 'EramirOnWeylam', '[]', 'A fascinating case that flies in the face of all that is natural. Weylam is undead for sure, something we have in spades in Wraeclast, but a sentient, reasonable ghost? Now that is rare indeed.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
When we talk, I feel as if I am staring into the breach, witnessing that which man was not meant to know. I have theorised about what animates the pirate''s essence, how he manages to manifest on this earth once again. I think I shall compile my observations and speculations into a book. Yes... Eramir''s Elucidations of Undeath. Has a nice ring to it, don''t you think?', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Eramir/EA7_08.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[228]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1571, 'EramirOnArakaaliTemple', '[]', 'Unfortunately, Arakaali''s temple lies beyond that which now belongs to Ralakesh. To reach the many-legged goddess you must first draw to some conclusion with the many-faced god.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Eramir/EA7_10.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[228]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1572, 'EramirOnArakaali', '[]', 'From what I can recall, Arakaali was a Vaal fertility goddess, a rather unsettling union of sexuality and mortality. Whilst usually presenting herself as a large arachnid, Arakaali would often assume human form, a ruse intended to lure mortals into the act of copulation. The entries were vague about the gender of her prey.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
After satiating her carnal desires, she would then quench her divine thirst, draining her erstwhile lover of all bodily fluid. Her acolytes would then collect the dessicated husk and give it a decorative placement in Arakaali''s unholy temple.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
I fear that Silk knows not the true nature of the ''marriage'' he so desperately seeks.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Eramir/EA7_11.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[228]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1573, 'EramirOnVaalCity', '[]', 'While they were highly advanced in their technology, the Vaal were rather brutish in their social practices. I find it rather baffling to think of the Vaal as a people who believed in science and progress and yet constructed elaborate sacrificial altars in the centers of their cities.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Judging by the construction of this particular ruin, I would say that the city rose to prominence during the reign of Queen Tetzlapokal who some scholars refer to as a ''waif of disturbing proclivities''. She was a devotee of Arakaali and according to the literature, had a deep fascination with mortality and the inert human form.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
The histories tell how the queen would request her subjects to deposit the bodies of their deceased loved ones upon the steps of her palace. The corpses would be promptly taken inside to be used for... unfortunately most scholars fell into hysterical conjecture at that point. At least I hope it was conjecture.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Eramir/EA7_12.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[228]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1574, 'EramirRalakeshQuestGreust', '[]', 'The relic that washed ashore and started all the chaos, it was covered in ancient Vaal inscriptions. The symbols were much weathered, making them challenging to translate, yet I did my best.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
The inscriptions spoke of the god, Ralakesh. If this object somehow housed the spirit of that many faced monstrosity, then I fear we are all in danger. Ralakesh was renowned for his penchant for subjugation and control. Please, I urge you to destroy this god before his strength and dominance grow insurmountable. Nip this divine threat in the bud, as it were.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Our poor friend, Greust, has likely become Ralakesh''s avatar in this world. At least his recent behaviour would indicate as much. If you could see to Greust''s... passing... Ralakesh will be forced to retreat into the relic. Destroy the relic and perhaps you will also destroy the god.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Eramir/EA7_02.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[228]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1575, 'EramirRalakeshQuestOak', '[]', 'The relic that washed ashore and started all the chaos, it was covered in ancient Vaal inscriptions. The symbols were much weathered, making them challenging to translate, yet I did my best.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
The inscriptions spoke of the the god, Ralakesh. If this object somehow housed the spirit of that many faced monstrosity, then I fear we are all in danger. Ralakesh was renowned for his penchant for subjugation and control. Please, I urge you to destroy this god before his strength and dominance grow insurmountable. Nip this divine threat in the bud, as it were.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Now, it would seem that Oak has been unfortunate enough to become Ralakesh''s manifest avatar in this world. At least his recent appearance and behaviour would suggest as much. If you could see to Oak''s untimely passing, Ralakesh will be forced to retreat into the relic. Destroy the relic and perhaps you will also destroy the god.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Eramir/EA7_03_04.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[228]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1576, 'EramirRalakeshQuestKraityn', '[]', 'The relic that washed ashore and started all the chaos, it was covered in ancient Vaal inscriptions. The symbols were much weathered, making them challenging to translate, yet I did my best.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
The inscriptions spoke of the the god, Ralakesh. If this object somehow housed the spirit of that many faced monstrosity, then I fear we are all in danger. Ralakesh was renowned for his penchant for subjugation and control. Please, I urge you to destroy this god before his strength and dominance grow insurmountable. Nip this divine threat in the bud, as it were.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Now, it would seem that Kraityn has earned his comeuppance in the form of divine possession by Ralakesh. At least his recent appearance and behaviour would suggest as much. If you could see to Kraityn''s merciful demise, Ralakesh will be forced to retreat into the relic. Destroy the relic and perhaps you will also destroy the god.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Eramir/EA7_03_05.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[228]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1577, 'EramirRalakeshQuestAlira', '[]', 'The relic that washed ashore and started all the chaos, it was covered in ancient Vaal inscriptions. The symbols were much weathered, making them challenging to translate, yet I did my best.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
The inscriptions spoke of the the god, Ralakesh. If this object somehow housed the spirit of that many faced monstrosity, then I fear we are all in danger. Ralakesh was renowned for his penchant for subjugation and control. Please, I urge you to destroy this god before his strength and dominance grow insurmountable. Nip this divine threat in the bud, as it were.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Now, it would seem that Alira has found herself rather consumed by Ralakesh''s divine ego. At least her recent appearance and behaviour would suggest as much. If you could see to Alira''s corporeal conclusion, Ralakesh will be forced to retreat into the relic. Destroy the relic and perhaps you will also destroy the god.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Eramir/EA7_03_06.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[228]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1578, 'EramirRalakeshReward', '[]', 'You truly are a hero of the modern age, succeeding where even the ancient Vaal could not!' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
I must say, I''m really quite relieved. For a while there I feared we were headed towards another theocratic dictatorship. Exile allowed me to be free of one. I had no wish to experience another.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
You deserve to be rewarded for your efforts. Here, something with a little insight would suit your purposes nicely.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Eramir/EA7_13.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[228]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1579, 'EramirOnGruthkul', '[]', 'Yes, I know of Gruthkul, the grieving mother. She featured quite prominently in some of the Vaal texts I restored during my time at the museum in Theopolis. ' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
After the deaths of her children, Queen Gruthkul fled north, eventually finding respite amongst the refugee of her own shattered realm. Yet these loyalists saw their own queen as a weapon, a tool for vengeance. They nurtured her pain, transfiguring sorrow into hatred, hatred into violence. Like a grizzled bear, Gruthkul descended into animalism and ferocity. Yet her caretakers foolishly underestimated the agony their bereaved queen harboured in her heart. Like a bear caught in a trap, Gruthkul wrenched free of her human loyalties and slew her followers to the last woman and child. It was through devastation Gruthkul ascended to divinity. ' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Gruthkul''s pain has transcended ages and she will vent that pain upon any and all she encounters until her grief is finally laid to rest.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Eramir/EA7_15.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[228]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1580, 'EramirGruthkulReward', '[]', 'So the grieving mother sleeps once more. Her story has come to fascinate me, and your conquest of her makes for a satisfying dramatic climax, don''t you think? I''m but an old man, living vicariously through your life. As history seems intent on repeating itself, I shall record it in a book, "A Historical Account Of The Goddess Gruthkul And The Legendary Champion Who Defeated Her." Yes, the title needs a bit of work, but it will suffice for now. Here, consider this offering as an advance on the royalties we shall reap post-publication... that is, if there is anyone in Wraeclast who can read.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Eramir/EA7_16.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[228]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1581, 'EramirOnSilkMissing', '[]', 'It started with a few mumblings in his slumber, then long forays into the wilds, searching for relics of a distinctly arachnid nature. I thought it a natural extension of Silk''s eccentric persona at first. Then came the sleepless nights studying those relics, the fevered recitations in broken Vaalish, the strange eight phase rituals...' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Then one night Silk gathered his collection and scuttled off into the darkness without a word. Silk has always been susceptible to fine fictions. Perhaps he has finally shunned reality altogether.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Eramir/EA7_08b.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[228]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1582, 'EramirOnSilkFound', '[]', 'What? He''s intending to make matrimony with Arakaali? My word, that''s quite a story even for Silk!' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Yes, I know that name, and the place to which it is purportedly attached. A temple to the north, now in ruins. If Silk intends unholy congress with this Arakaali, that is the most likely place we would seek it.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Eramir/EA7_09.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[228]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1583, 'EramirOnSilkDead', '[]', 'Poor Silk. Like so many before him, Silk succumbed to a most insidious disease. Ambition. That craving for greatness. An irresistible compulsion to leave one''s mark on the world. There''s another name for marks like that. Scars.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Eramir/EA7_14.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[228]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1584, 'HelenaGreetingsA7', '[]', 'Turn your back for the barest moment and Wraeclast bites you in the proverbial. I imagine that''s how you''re feeling upon visiting us this time. It''s how I feel about now.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Helyna/H7_A.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[229]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1585, 'HelenaOnGreustQuest', '[]', 'My poor Greust. A kind man. A strong man. And now... I begged him not to meddle with that relic. It washed ashore after the earthquake and Greust simply had to know whether it was a danger to us... to me.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
The unholy thing within that device... it possessed Greust. Turned him into a monstrosity. We fled the village, and as I turned back... I saw... he was killing them, the stragglers, killing them all! Even the children!' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
My Greust is dead. That thing that has stolen his body... please, destroy it.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Helyna/H7_B.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[229]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1586, 'HelenaOnAliraQuest', '[]', 'My poor Greust... a good man blinded by bravery and hope. I guess that''s why I loved him. He truly believed that if he stood against Alira that courage would triumph. Even he should have seen it to be hopeless when they descended upon the village, enslaved us all. They cut his head clean from his body... stuck it on a pike, paraded it before us. ' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Then it was as if the very rocks cried out against this cruelty. The earth shook and that blasphemous relic emerged from the water. Whatever was inside, it transformed Alira, turned her into... well, I suppose she simply became what she had been in her heart all along.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Helyna/H7_C.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[229]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1587, 'HelenaOnKraitynQuest', '[]', 'My poor Greust... a good man blinded by bravery and hope. I guess that''s why I loved him. He truly believed that if he stood against Kraityn that courage would triumph. Even he should have seen it to be hopeless when they descended upon the village, enslaved us all. They cut his head clean from his body... stuck it on a pike, paraded it before us. ' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Then it was as if the very rocks cried out against this cruelty. The earth shook and that blasphemous relic emerged from the water. Whatever was inside, it transformed Kraityn, turned him into... well, I suppose he simply became what he had been in his heart all along.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Helyna/H7_D.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[229]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1588, 'HelenaOnOakQuest', '[]', 'My poor Greust... a good man blinded by bravery and hope. I guess that''s why I loved him. He truly believed that if he stood against Oak that courage would triumph. Even he should have seen it to be hopeless when they descended upon the village, enslaved us all. They cut his head clean from his body... stuck it on a pike, paraded it before us. ' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Then it was as if the very rocks cried out against this cruelty. The earth shook and that blasphemous relic emerged from the water. Whatever was inside, it transformed Oak, turned him into... well, I suppose he simply became what he had been in his heart all along.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Helyna/H7_E.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[229]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1589, 'HelenaOnTrading', '[]', 'I''m aware that you and Greust had something of a commercial relationship prior to his... accident. As is the Azmeri custom, Greust''s few possessions have now passed to me. I''m by no means the warrior he was, yet I know my blades and bows well enough.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
At least it''s something I can do to honour his memory, and to keep my mind off things.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Helyna/H7_F.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[229]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1590, 'HelenaOnWeylam', '[]', 'Don''t get me wrong, I''ve witnessed many unsettling things in my lifetime, but a spectral corsair living next door to me? We reside in dark times indeed when the living need share their quarters with the dead.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Helyna/H7_G.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[229]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1591, 'HelenaOnSilk', '[]', 'I didn''t think it possible for Silk to grow any more peculiar, but then I''ve been wrong about so many things since coming to Wraeclast that I shouldn''t have been at all surprised.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Still, it''s interesting that his behaviour of late has mirrored that of certain Templar zealots I had the dubious pleasure of meeting back in Theopolis. Like them, Silk appeared obsessed with finding answers to this reality in some ethereal realm of divinity.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
For my part, I prefer to keep faith in this world. The answers that come from ''beyond'' are seldom the ones we want.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Helyna/H7_H.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[229]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1592, 'HelenaOnMaligaroA7', '[]', 'I''m afraid that the Inquisitor''s spirit has indeed returned to the Chamber of Sins, yet while you won''t encounter Maligaro by wandering his halls, I do perhaps know how you can find him. ' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Whilst investigating the Fellshrine, I learned of the existence of a map, forged by Maligaro from his own viscera. This map allowed him to transfer his spirit into another form of existence, an existential safe house to which he could retreat should death ever attempt to take him. Understanding the map''s purpose, Voll tried to destroy it, to no avail, so he locked it away deep within the ruins of Phrecia Cathedral. ' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Find that map and place it upon the Reverie Device in Maligaro''s old laboratory. And when you step over that threshold, expect the very worst.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Helyna/H7_I.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[229]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1593, 'HelenaOnMaligaroMap', '[]', 'I imagine it was no easy feat, removing that abomination from its tomb. The horrors that must still lurk beneath the Fellshrine...' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Well, I suppose you''ll be meeting abominations aplenty where you''re going next. Place that map upon Maligaro''s Reverie Device and remember... hope for the worst. At least then you''ll be partially prepared for what''s to come.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Helyna/H7_J.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[229]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1594, 'HelenaOnMaligaroDead', '[]', 'One less twisted intellect perverting our world. There is still much to be done, but at least we can rest easier in the knowledge that Maligaro and his foul creations will trouble Wraeclast no longer.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Here. I know that you and Greust didn''t see eye to eye, but I''m sure he would have wanted to recognise this deed. It''s the act of a warrior, after all.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Helyna/H7_K.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[229]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1595, 'HelenaOnDenPassage', '[]', 'When I was part of Piety''s expedition into the Chamber of Sins, I stumbled upon a secret passage. It appears to have been constructed by the Inquisitor for the purpose of conveying his creations from his laboratory, via an ancient cave system, to the surrounding countryside without detection. These caves seem to feed out into what was once farmland near our former village. ' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
It may prove a useful route for you, although the passage was locked when I last stood before it. Let us hope that the key remains somewhere nearby.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Helyna/H7_L.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[229]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1596, 'HelenaOnGreustDead', '[]', 'Yes... I thank you. Though I loved him, I know Greust was lost to me the very moment he touched that Vaal abomination. I will weep over his passing for many more nights to come, but I am... happy that you avenged his honour, and freed him from his torment.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Helyna/H7_M.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[229]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1597, 'HelenaOnBanditDead', '[]', 'I''m a woman of science, not vengeance, yet in this case I''m willing to make an exception. I will continue to weep for Greust until time takes the pain from my heart. Your actions won''t speed that process yet I know, wherever he is now, my gentle warrior would appreciate the honour you''ve restored to him.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Helyna/H7_N.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[229]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1598, 'HelenaNecklaceQuest', '[]', 'There''s an Azmeri shrine, tucked away in the Northern Forest. Greust took me there, told me it was a memorial to those who had gone before him, a place where their spirits could rest. When he passed, he wanted his remains to be laid to rest with the bones of his people. His body... I find it difficult to even think about it... but I doubt it will ever be recovered. Yet there might still be a way. He gave me his necklace, the fangs he earned when he rose from boyhood to manhood, handed it to me for safekeeping only moments before, before Ralakesh... it''s almost as if he knew what was to come. ' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Please, could you deliver this necklace to the shrine for me? Put Greust''s spirit to rest? I would do it myself, but the journey to the Northern Forest is not what it was. These lands have changed, and not for the better.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Helyna/H7_O.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[229]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1599, 'HelenaNecklaceReward', '[]', 'I feel I have failed my poor Greust, not being able to return his bones to the resting place of his people. Still, we have done all we could, considering the circumstances. Greust was a practical man at heart. He would understand.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
You deserve our thanks. Here are some of Greust''s most treasured possessions. I''m sure he would have wanted you to have one.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Helyna/H7_P.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[229]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1600, 'SolarisIntro', '[]', 'Let''s get rid of this mortal.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Solaris/Intro.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[480]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1601, 'LunarisIntro', '[]', 'For once we agree, sister', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Lunaris/Intro.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[481]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1602, 'SinMaligaroQuest', '[]', 'Judging by that rather curious ship and its aberrant captain, I imagine you had rather an interesting voyage here.' || char(13) || '
 ' || char(13) || '
Now, Inquisitor Maligaro... we must have his soul. He has most certainly returned to his old haunt, yet his manifestations are like wisps on the wind: there one moment, gone the next. While I am familiar with the phantasmal trails and tributaries that filigree this reality, Maligaro''s exact whereabouts eludes me. ' || char(13) || '
 ' || char(13) || '
You should speak with these desperates who cling to this broken bridge, that young Templar scholar in particular. Their mundane knowledge must provide where my enlightened sapience cannot.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Sin/S34.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[220]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1603, 'SinMaligaroReward', '[]', 'Our brutal construction nears completion and now only the wretched Doedre Darktongue remains.' || char(13) || '
 ' || char(13) || '
Unlike her compeers who, in undeath, have yearned for the familiar, Doedre appears drawn to the old wounds of calamity. The cataclysm took Sarn and left much that a parasite like Doedre might enjoy.' || char(13) || '
 ' || char(13) || '
I shall meet you in Sarn, where I hope you shall make swift and bloody work of that foul hag.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Sin/S35.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[220,224]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1604, 'SinOnGodOrigins', '[]', 'There was a time before the Beast, bathed in the shadows of lost memory, when men and women like you could ascend. Through rareness of quality and the adoration of their people, these few could reach out into the quickening mists of immortality and grasp the power of godhood. ' || char(13) || '
 ' || char(13) || '
Mind you, transcendence is never easy. Like the pains of childbirth, it reeks of agony, tragedy and sacrifice. The sacrifice most often being of one''s humanity. That is simply the way of it. Those of us who seek the immortal throne live long enough to see ourselves become truly monstrous.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Sin/S36.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[220]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1605, 'SinOnRalakeshQuest', '[]', 'Let us go hunting. This time amongst the ruins of an encampment most familiar to you... once inhabited by your friends, the Azmeri.' || char(13) || '
 ' || char(13) || '
Hmmm... Ralakesh. He''s ruthless and cruel, with cunning unfathomable. Yet he bears one defining weakness. A fear he forged into chains of his own keeping. His is the terror of grasping too much and having it all slip through his fingers. It makes him irrational, and therefore vulnerable.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Sin/S37.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[220]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1606, 'SinOnRalakeshOrigin', '[]', 'Ralakesh, the illustrious "Master of a Million Faces". I call him the God of Hide and Seek.' || char(13) || '
 ' || char(13) || '
While other deities waged wars, spread their seed, and laid waste to whole empires, Ralakesh perched on his throne in a dark palace of ebony, choked with incense, blinded by obedience and deafened by a senseless cacophony of brass gongs.' || char(13) || '
 ' || char(13) || '
Thankfully, he never had the courage to peek over the high walls he''d built, else the world might have been in trouble.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Sin/S38.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[220]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1607, 'SinRalakeshReward', '[]', 'When you try to control everything, you ultimately control nothing. Ralakesh has never quite been able to grasp that concept.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Sin/S40.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[220,221]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1608, 'SinOnGruthkulQuest', '[]', 'Into the most dreaded of thickets you must go, I''m afraid. For there, Gruthkul the Despairing sulks and schemes. ' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
The Vaal laid waste to her kingdom and placed her slaughtered children at her feet. Grief enveloped Gruthkul, transformed her, flooded her mind with a singular thought. To share her suffering with those who had murdered her daughters.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Though she has returned, her sanity has not. There is no fury like a mother bereaved.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Sin/S41.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[220]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1609, 'SinOnGruthkulOrigin', '[]', 'I wonder if Gruthkul would still grieve for her children if she knew the truth.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
The Spinner of Shadows had no aspirations until Gruthkul''s daughters plotted against her. They saw her power over the people, her miraculous potions, her intoxicating lusts.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
They feared Arakaali, thought she might threaten their legacy. Yet that''s the curious thing about spiders. They only leave their web when you force them to.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Sin/S42.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[220]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1610, 'SinGruthkulReward', '[]', 'The tragedy is that our world, our kind, may turn something as pure and honourable as a mother''s love into such a vicious weapon of wrath and butchery.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
I only hope that Gruthkul will find her children, happy in her arms, in the realms beyond.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Sin/S44.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[220,222]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1611, 'SinOnArakaaliQuest', '[]', 'A temptress and a predator. Vaal legends say she crawled up from the blackest of pits during the creation of the world.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
No, her beginnings were far more mundane, a mortal harlot whose endless lust for loin and lecherous delight saw her transformed into the very image of her dark desires.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
''The Spinner of Shadows'' they once called her. She sees herself as a regular goddess of love, and has the romantically forged temple to prove it.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
That''s where you''ll find her. Yet there''s little romance to the lady herself. At least, I doubt the corpses that now embrace her carapace would think so.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Sin/S49.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[220]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1612, 'SinOnArakaaliOrigin', '[]', 'Answering the call of a royal invitation, I visited the Spinner of Shadows as an emissary for a small and fragile alliance of gods. Mostly weak deities huddling together in terror of being consumed by their greaters. At this time, Queen Arakaali ruled an empire, and so invited me to gaze upon her mighty works with appropriate wonder. ' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
If I''d looked past this pretense, I may have chanced to see her hidden desire to have me share her bed. For years I lay trapped in her webbed sheets. Some days she enjoyed my prowess, other days we enjoyed each other.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Yet, this illusion of love and leisure simply veiled the morbid reality that I was not free to leave. I languished under her bewitching spell until the day the spider was betrayed by her own flies, and sealed within that temple of her own fevered making.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Sin/S50.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[220]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1613, 'SinArakaaliReward', '[]', 'Many an artist of Azmerian descent has engaged in the sad worship of that sultry arachnid, but you looked her in those hypnotic eyes, and then ripped them out. She lies in her bed of sordid memory... alone.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
A little of this spider yet creeps and crawls in my palm. A touch more power for my subduer of gods?', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Sin/S52.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[220,223]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1614, 'MaramoaWelcomeBack', '[]', 'Good to see you in Sarn once again. I wish that we could be greeting under fairer skies, yet this city remains clouded in strife.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Lunaris, Eternal goddess of the Moon and her sister, Solaris of the Sun, have risen to reclaim what was once their own. Siblings equal in strength, mighty twin rivers converging, sweeping all before them. ' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
We are cornered animals, awaiting the deluge that will surely drown us. Yet there exists a pair of ancient treasures, the Sun Orb and the Moon Orb. They are our hope... our desperation.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Maramoa/M801.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[233]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1615, 'MaramoaOnSunOrb', '[]', 'These owl eyes of mine have been watching the sun goddess from afar. The Sun Orb lies within her temple, guarded by her most ardent devotee. An exile who, in his insanity, has taken to calling himself ''The Dawn''. ' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
That orb is the seed that must be stolen from this new son of hers, and planted at the feet of his ancient mother.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Maramoa/M802.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[233]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1616, 'MaramoaOnMoonOrb', '[]', 'I''ve been keeping a close eye on that exile-turned-sycophant who calls himself, ''The Dusk''. Dusk carried the Moon Orb into the Lunaris Temple and has not returned with it, not as far as I have seen.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
No doubt he clings to that orb like it''s his adopted mother''s own nurturing breast. If you were to wean him from the teat, and place that orb at the bereft mother''s feet, we may yet see the moon itself fall.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Maramoa/M804.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[233]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1617, 'MaramoaOnOrbs', '[]', 'By the earth and sky, the power of the goddesses lies in your hands. Take these seeds and plant them in the fertile stone at their feet. From what I have learned, It is my hope that the orbs will force Solaris and Lunaris to grow limbs and flesh, to engage you in mortal battle. ' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
May this come to pass, and may you cut down these goddesses as a forester might fell a pair of stubborn old trees.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Maramoa/M806.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[233]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1618, 'MaramoaOnLunSolDead', '[]', 'You have offered us the greatest of gifts. Freedom. With these divine tyrants gone, we are free to live our lives as we wish, not as is ordained. ' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
In time, all of Sarn will thank you. For now, let it simply be me.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Maramoa/M807.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[233]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1619, 'MaramoaOnGrigorGone', '[]', 'Grigor is the butterfly that has lost its wings to a cruel child, and this place of respite has become a cage for his pain, a breeding ground of bad memory. We spoke and Grigor shared his resolve with me. He can no longer live with the torment that Piety has injected into his heart. ' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Like the warrior-poet he is, Grigor has ventured into the unknown, to find a cure for his body and mind, or die in the attempt.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Maramoa/M808.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[233]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1620, 'MaramoaOnClarissaZombie', '[]', 'The dead do not love the living and the living cannot love the dead. People fear what they do not understand. I understand Clarissa. I am not frightened of her. I am frightened for her.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Maramoa/M809.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[233]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1621, 'MaramoaOnClarissaZombieDead', '[]', 'If I am a watchful owl then you are the courageous hawk, swooping with sharpened talons to wrench the serpent from the child''s neck. Clarissa will bear that wound for the rest of her life, but I am glad you were there to save her from following poor Tolman into the dirt. ' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Perhaps now that Clarissa has lost her love of death, she will finally be able to embrace life.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Maramoa/M810.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[233]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1622, 'MaramoaGemlingQuest', '[]', 'I was out hunting food for our encampment. Like a prowling cat I was, but what I saw marching across the ruins made me feel like a little mouse.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Gem-studded warriors pounding the earth, lead by their strongest... a Captain. I''ve known of these gemling legionnaires, how they were once the personal swords of Emperor Chitus. But now they rise again, with this Captain at their fore. Swallowing my fear, I followed the Captain and found a force being gathered within the Grain Gate.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Exile, I know it''s not fair for me to ask, you have done so many things for us, but if you were to find the Captain and slay him and his men, I would honour you greatly.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Our little town would not survive an onslaught such as the Captain is likely to enact upon us.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Maramoa/M811.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[233]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1623, 'MaramoaOnGemlings', '[]', 'They walked our earth in the times of great strife, cruel and hideous shadows, cast against the clay wall of ruined abode. Thaumaturge Malachai grew them out of the vain ambitions of his dark imaginings. ' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Emperor Chitus believed the legionnaires belonged to him, that gemling men would beat to the drum of his own crystalline heart. But as the silhouette of the emperor faltered and fell, burned out by the light of true men, some of the legion remained. ' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
The cataclysm turned legionnaire into monster, another mindless man of undeath. Yet this Captain seems to have regained his faculties, some of his old warrior intelligence.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
I worry for the rest of his soldiers, how they may grow from mindless killing machines into something far worse.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Maramoa/M812.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[233]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1624, 'MaramoaGemlingReward', '[]', 'My courageous hawk removes yet another snake from the long grass. I offer you a reward, but my mind remains unsettled. The Captain lies rotting in the ground, buzzing with flies, but if gemling legionnaires can regain their sentience, then can all of the monstrosities of the Undying do the same?' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
My thoughts turn to the burrows and chambers beneath the earth of Sarn. Could there be some new undead civilisation growing and preparing itself underground at this very moment? Such thoughts do not make for easy sleeping.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Maramoa/M813.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[233]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1625, 'ClarissaGreetingsA8', '[]', 'Sarn is changing and so are we who live here.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
There there, Tolman, don''t you worry. I love you. I''ll think of something.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Clarissa/C8_00.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[234]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1626, 'ClarissaAnkhQuestTown', '[]', 'Exile... you''ve helped me before. You can help me again, can''t you? My hope waits for me to the east, tucked away in a shrine in the Quay.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
The Ankh of Eternity. Veruso, Prima Imperialus, placed it there himself at the dawn of the Empire. If the legends are correct, the Ankh has powers over life and death... when paired with the correct Azmerian ritual.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
I''ve learned the ritual. All I need is the Ankh of Eternity and I know I can bring Tolman back... properly this time. ' || char(13) || '
 ' || char(13) || '
Will you retrieve the artefact for us? I''ve tried but the creatures around the shrine... simply too dangerous.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Yes, yes, Tolman, I''m getting to that.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
I''ve already prepared a site for the ritual, out in the Quay. Please, meet us there with the Ankh so that I may yet breathe life into my dearest love.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Clarissa/C8_01_Town.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[234]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1627, 'ClarissaAnkhQuestQuay', '[]', 'Exile... you''ve helped me before. You can help me again, can''t you?' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
The Ankh of Eternity. If the legends are correct, the Ankh has powers over life and death... when paired with the correct Azmerian ritual.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
I''ve learned the ritual. All I need is the Ankh of Eternity and I know I can bring Tolman back.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Will you retrieve the artefact for us?', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Clarissa/C8_01_Quay.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[235]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1628, 'ClarissaAnkhReward', '[]', 'Poor Tolman... he was never really with me, was he. Just the shell of a man I loved. Wherever he is now, I hope he is at peace, and that he can forgive me for not being able to let go. ' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Here, take something, for at least helping me. And thank you, for... for everything.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Clarissa/C8_07.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[234]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1629, 'ClarissaOnTolmanZombie', '[]', 'You told me Tolman was gone. You were wrong! I found him... ' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
No, Tolman, I never gave up on you. ' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
His soul remains, flickering deep down inside.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Oh, Tolman, I know you''re in pain, but it''ll be over soon. I promise.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Clarissa/C8_02.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[234]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1630, 'ClarissaOnAnkh', '[]', 'As I understand it, the Ankh of Eternity was somehow able to return the dead to the full bloom of life. There was nothing necromantic about it, rather it was a source of true resurrection.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
How it came to exist, I honestly don''t know. A couple of inscriptions I read treated the ankh as some sort of gift to Veruso from the Vaal. But surely the Vaal were long gone by Veruso''s time... weren''t they?' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
No matter. Despite the vagaries of the Ankh''s origins, Veruso used the Ankh to return his young wife from the death bed to the wedding bed. The accounts are unanimous on that point.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
As it was for Veruso''s love, so shall it be for mine.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Clarissa/C8_03.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[234]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1631, 'ClarissaOnVeruso', '[]', 'By all accounts, Tarcus Veruso was a ruthless despot, a man to rival even the likes of Dominus. Yet his heart of stone contained one precious seam, his love for his wife, Chiara.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
So when the poor young woman died giving birth to Veruso''s son, the grieving emperor threw aside his great convictions and placed his last hope in thaumaturgy, in the Ankh of Eternity.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Perhaps it was shame that drove Tarcus to lock the ankh away, to steal such hopes from his descendents. It was he who had asked his people to turn their backs on the ancient arts, so what right had he to enjoy that which he forbade? Love gave him that right.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Clarissa/C8_04.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[234]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1632, 'ClarissaOnGrigorGone', '[]', 'My heart aches for Grigor. I know the battle in which he is engaged. It''s like my own, a fight to make sense of life in a land that deems life to be worthless. ' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
I don''t know where he''s gone, but I do know he''s looking to find himself, his true self, as we all must do in our own time.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Clarissa/C8_08.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[234]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1633, 'ClarissaReceiveAnkh', '[]', 'Give it to me, quickly! Finally, Tolman, we can be together as before.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Alright... let''s begin.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Suffering will besiege us and yet love will prevail.' || char(13) || '
Pain will imprison us and yet love will prevail.' || char(13) || '
Grief will engulf us and yet love will prevail.' || char(13) || '
Death will surely take us and love... will...' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
No... this isn''t right. This is... oh, Tolman, please... forgive me.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Exile! Look out!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Clarissa/C8_05.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[235]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1634, 'ClarissaOnTolmanZombieDead', '[]', 'How could I have been so stupid? Veruso didn''t hide the ankh out of shame. He hid it out of fear, out of... oh my, what did the ankh really do to his wife? Everything I saw, that I read... lies to cover the truth of what Chiara had really become.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Alright, I''ll destroy the ankh. We''ve come a long way since Veruso''s day so I''m thinking I can manage where he so sorely failed. At least that''s something I know I can do right. ' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
I''ll meet you back at the encampment soon. For now I need to... look, I''ll just see you there. I promise.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Clarissa/C8_06.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[235]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1635, 'HarganGreetingsA8', '[]', 'Good to see you''re still soldiering on. With all these gods and past horrors wandering around Sarn, I don''t assume anyone''s alive and kicking these days.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Hargan/HA8_01.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[232]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1636, 'HarganOnClarissaTolmanZombie', '[]', 'Quite the pretty pair, aren''t they? Yes, pretty bloody disturbing.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
That girl was once the sweetest lass I could name. Nowadays she''s barking as batshite over that living corpse of hers. All it''d take is a quick, hard bash with a rock and Tolman would no longer be a problem. Tempting, don''t you think?', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Hargan/HA8_02.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[232]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1637, 'HarganDoedreQuest', '[]', 'If Sarn wasn''t mad enough, now we''ve got some whip-tongued hag cooking up a stinking curse in the sewers. Took her for my mother-in-law at first. But no, based on my meagre historical knowledge, I reckon we''ve a certain Doedre Darktongue to contend with.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Where in blazes she''s hiding, I''ve no idea. So the only way we''re going to catch this witch is by getting our hands, and possibly a lot more, well and truly dirty. By ''we'', I mean ''you'', of course. The sewers are no place for a simple businessman like me. ' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Do us all a favour. Head into them sewers and track that old hag down. Get her to reveal herself and put her down. Hah... better your eyes than mine, eh?', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Hargan/HA8_03.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[232]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1638, 'HarganDoedreReward', '[]', 'You''d suppose someone as crafty as Doedre would''ve kept her ugly head under wraps, soon as she saw you coming. I guess death robs us of many things, including our common sense. ' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
In any case, thank you. The sewers can run clear now that there''s no fetid witch clogging up the pipes.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Here, have a little something to commemorate your fine clean-up job.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Hargan/HA8_04.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[232]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1639, 'HarganOnHighGardens', '[]', 'If you''re going to be in the antiquities business, it pays to take note of whatever history you can. High Gardens and the great Emperor Izaro, for instance. Have you heard of the Lord''s Labyrinth? The High Gardens were designed by Izaro as a test run for his great work.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
He turned his personal garden into a maze and filled it with all sorts of traps and nasty beasties. Convicted criminals were then given a choice. Death or the Garden. If they got through, an imperial pardon was theirs.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Weren''t no pardons on record as far as I could see. That''s what happens when people have too much time and gold on their hands.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Hargan/HA8_05.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[232]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1640, 'HarganOnAnkh', '[]', 'A word of caution. That ankh, it might have had some miraculous powers but I bet there''s a nasty reason why Veruso hid the bloody thing away. I''ve tried to warn Clarissa, but her ears seem as dead as that boyfriend of hers.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Hargan/HA8_06.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[232]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1641, 'HarganOnSolarisLunaris', '[]', 'Needing my eclectic expertise again, are we? Solaris and Lunaris got front and center stage among them folks of the Eternal Empire. ' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Solaris was thought to be the light of leadership, guiding and enlightening each emperor that sat the throne. In practice, most of them emperors turned out to be a bit dim, but then history and theology have never quite seen eye to eye.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
As for Lunaris, a goddess of the moon and earth, the mother of dreams and inspiration. Doesn''t sound like a bad lady until you consider that dreams harbour nightmares and that inspiration is just one notion shy of insanity.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Hargan/HA8_09.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[232]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1642, 'HarganOnSolarisLunarisDead', '[]', 'I''d thank the gods, but you seem to be taking them out at an alarming rate.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Not that I''m complaining! In my experience, theocracy''s never been great for entrepreneurs like me, unless you''re in the holy relics business. It''s too single-minded. Too orderly. Give me chaos any old day, for it is in chaos that opportunity is bred.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Sarn can get back to its usual state of mayhem and I can get back down to business. Everyone''s a winner!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Hargan/HA8_11.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[232]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1643, 'HarganOnSunMoonOrbs', '[]', 'Powerful baubles them orbs are. As old as the Azmerians themselves, maybe even older. I''ve read all there is on them little beauties. The Sun Orb''s said to contain all that has been, while its sister, the Moon Orb, holds all that will be. Past and future, packed up neat behind glass and thaumaturgy. Shudder to think what might happen if all that got out one day.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Hargan/HA8_10.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[232]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1644, 'HarganOnGrigorGone', '[]', 'Grigor left without a single word to me, rude bugger, but I suspect his poetic soul has been drawn back home, to Ezomyr. A long journey, but a trek worth taking to find solace among one''s own people. Of course, they''ll get quite the shock when they see him. Let''s hope familial love is as nearsighted as they say! ' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
There''re the fine tales Grigor will be able to tell them, of course. Come to think of it, now that Dominus has been knocked off his perch, there''s nothing to stop the Ezomytes from learning a thing or two from Grigor''s stories. They might even consider invading this jewel in Wraeclast''s tarnished crown. I certainly hope they have just such an eye for opportunity... a man could make a tidy sum helping said invaders navigate Sarn and its many hazards.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Hargan/HA8_12.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[232]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1645, 'HarganOnTitucius', '[]', 'What little humanity General Titucius was born with, he traded in for strength. Went as far as to have Malachai replace his joints with virtue gems... mad bastard. Afterwards, Emperor Chitus charged Titucius with subduing the Maraketh, a job he took a little too much pleasure in, if you ask me.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Hargan/HA8_21.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[232]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1646, 'HarganYugulQuest', '[]', 'I heard tell of an ancient Vaal scholar who bore the name ''Yugul''. He''d conduct these grisly experiments in pursuit of some piece of nasty wisdom tucked into the nether regions of human terror. Practiced on young kiddies no less, scaring the living shite out of Vaal toddlers and then nabbing their fear within a hall of thaumaturgical mirrors.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Could be the whole story''s a crock, and here''s where it gets even hazier. Seems old Yugul found something in that fear, enough to scare a whole swag of Vaal into worshipping him.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Honestly, some people will worship anything for a bit of spiritual peace of mind.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Hargan/HA8_13.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[232]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1647, 'HarganYugulReward', '[]', 'So it was that bloody scholar after all, was it? Sick bastard. Well, he''s gone now, and I hope you made sure he suffered like those poor kids he tormented. I''d''ve toasted him nice and slow like a spitted pig, see how he''d like them apples stuffed in his mouth. ' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Here, have something for keeping us safe from the divine undesirables in this world.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Hargan/HA8_14.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[232]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1648, 'HarganTituciusQuest', '[]', 'Tell me something. Any chance you might be willing to join forces and turn a healthy profit with old Hargan? You ever heard of the Wings of Vastiri? Not just another damned artefact. This one was the highest symbol of office for the Maraketh, held by the "Sekhema of Sekhemas". History books say the Wings were last worn by Sekhema Asenath, the Golden Sekhema... the one who went and got herself murdered by Hector Titucius.' || char(13) || '
 ' || char(13) || '
The only problem is that Titucius himself is up and guarding his pretties once more. Still, if you can recover those Wing of Vastiri then I''m confident I can sell them back to the Maraketh for a fair sum. They''re a cultural icon after all, dripping with sentimental value.' || char(13) || '
 ' || char(13) || '
What do ya say?', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Hargan/HA8_19.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[232]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1649, 'HarganTituciusReward', '[]', 'You found them! No easy feat, I''ll bet. How''s old Hector these days? Not so good after you crossed paths with him, am I right? I''ll polish these wings up and get them back to their owners just as soon as my Maraketh friend can get her folks to pay the ransom... ahem, price, I mean. ' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
In the meantime, take a little something from my stock as payment.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Hargan/HA8_20.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[232]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1650, 'HarganOnWingsOfVastiri', '[]', 'Well, they''re forged from solid gold, I can tell you that much. But I suppose that''s not really what you''re asking about. ' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
The wings are a treasured piece of the Maraketh heritage. Back when the tribes quit their squabblings and joined hands to battle the Eternal Empire, the wings were seen as a symbol of their unity. The Golden Sekhema wore them as she led the whole bloody Maraketh horde against Sarn. She was the single greatest hope for the Maraketh, was that Asenath. ' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Hector Titucius crushed both their hopes and their precious sekhema.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Hargan/HA8_22.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[232]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1651, 'SinDoedreQuest', '[]', 'Doedre Darktongue is the insidious infection that threatens to make septic the great and terrible wound that is Sarn.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
However, any certainty that I had as to her exact whereabouts has been sundered by the sheer stench of her presence. We shall have to deduce her location from those who know the area best, these locals that cling to Sarn like hungry maggots.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Sin/S53.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[237]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1652, 'SinDoedreReward', '[]', 'Once more into the breach, and once more we return victorious. Although, I have to admit, I did not relish the sensation of imbibing that foul witch''s soul. I felt decidedly... unclean.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Still, our journey nears completion. To the north lies Highgate and the cessation of our efforts to extract the Dark Ember from my dearly departed Beast.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
And none too soon. Every hour Kitava''s strength grows, and the longer he and the other gods dwell in this land, the less is humanity''s chance of survival.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Sin/S54.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[237,238]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1653, 'SinYugulQuest', '[]', 'In Izaro''s grotesque little garden, you''ll find an old friend of mine.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
The yawning maw that is Yugul... but a self-portrait of what that pathetic creature has come to believe about the nature of fear. Those who look upon him see their own fears reflected in his horrifying visage.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Sin/S59.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[237]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1654, 'SinOnYugulOrigin', '[]', 'Vaal scholars seemed compelled to answer all manner of strange and troubling questions. Yugul was one such scholar. Whilst plumbing the depths of humanity, he came to believe that there was no truer expression of humanity than pure terror.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
He would induce terror in children and then capture their reactions within eldritch mirrors, devices of his own creation that could petrify fear for extended study.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Through his gallery of reflected terror, Yugul came to understand human nature so well that he was able to manipulate his way into the Vaal halls of leadership, and eventually grew so feared and renowned that he ascended into godhood.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Sin/S60.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[237]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1655, 'SinYugulReward', '[]', 'Yugul was a cautionary tale. The only way to truly understand fear is to become it.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Sin/S62.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[237,239]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1656, 'SinOnSolaris', '[]', 'If we are to see the dawn of a new era for humankind, the sun must be taught to behave herself.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Upon that mighty span between Sarn''s left hand and its right, Solaris burns to consume every single moment of existence. Sparing no thought for life and its needs, she would see the world parched barren before she yields to reason.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
The sun must be allowed to set so that it may rise again as a blessing, not a curse.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Sin/S69.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[237]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1657, 'SinOnSolarisOrigin', '[]', 'Self-loving Solaris. All the light in the world, yet blinded by her own pride.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Not once did she pause to question the truth of her sister''s betrayal. Instead, she gloated over her sister''s transgressions, proclaiming herself greater and more honourable than Lunaris could ever be.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
I suppose one shouldn''t be surprised when a sun deity takes the higher ground.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Sin/S70_A8.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[237]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1658, 'SinOnLunaris', '[]', 'We approach the zenith of our divine hunt, upon the bridge that chokes the great, wet throat of Sarn.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Lunaris, in her cold fury, has forgotten that the warming sun of morning is as life-giving as the cooling damp of evening.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
The empire Lunaris dreams of shall be lit by moon and twinkling stars, and life itself shall wither away in the perpetual night.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Sin/S67_A8.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[237]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1659, 'SinOnLunarisOrigin', '[]', 'One of two sisters who ruled the most populous and powerful of the ancient Azmerian tribes. Solaris, was thought to guide the sun across the sky with threads of shimmering gold, whilst Lunaris saw to the wax and wane of moon with a sickle of purest silver. ' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
It was a peaceful partnership, until the trickster, Tangmazu, happened upon their domain. In turning sister against sister he saw to the massacre of thousands whilst concealing the source of their futile feud beyond all reckoning.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Feel no pity for the moon. She is a cold and distant fool, far less radiant than she would suppose.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Sin/S68_A8.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[237]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1660, 'SinSolarisLunarisReward', '[]', 'Sun and Moon return to their rightful places, leaving our path now clear. Highgate lies ahead, Beast Slayer, and a debt that is long overdue. ' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
On this road, there are the goddesses of Maraketh to be reckoned with, and they will not take kindly to our endeavour. Regardless, I must enter the corpse of my beloved Beast and wrest our sliver of hope from the life you so blindly took. ' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
There is no prophecy nor portent, no epic nor allegory that can promise your survival in this great journey of ours. For despite your trappings, you remain most certainly, irrevocably, mortal.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Sin/S72_A8.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[237,240]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1661, 'DominusPrisonOrders', '[]', 'My loyal Declan,' || char(13) || '
Give our Lady Piety your absolute support and watch her with absolute scrutiny. There is much to learn from the likes of the Inquisitor, the Umbra and the Soulless One. I would hate for Piety to feel that she need shoulder such perilous wisdom alone.' || char(13) || '
- Dominus', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/DominusGlyph/Dom_SG_OrdersFromDominus.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[254]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1662, 'MaligaroManifesto', '[]', 'My interest in this world is dwindling. Most children begin their lives wide-eyed, amazed at what this world has to offer. I have always been different. Since the day I was born I''ve been searching for the new, the surprising, that which disturbs both senses and mind.' || char(13) || '
 ' || char(13) || '
Oh to be an artist! What a lamentable task. Not seeing the world as it is, but as it should be.' || char(13) || '
 ' || char(13) || '
Peace is the worst of it! A disgusting state of stagnation, fit only for the weak and vapid. War, confusion, terror. Love and passion, these things are closest the world gets to being interesting and alas, I have felt them all. Yet all these pale in comparison to the delightful chaos I have envisioned for this poor, dull world.', '', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[245]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1663, 'RalakeshGlyph', '[]', 'High Lord Ralakesh, I am but lowly outlaw scum, yet you, a god of a thousand faces, have looked at me and deemed me worthy of your cause!' || char(13) || '
 ' || char(13) || '
I''ve offered willingly my flesh and blood. You shall now have my thoughts to use as you see fit. I only ask that you let me serve forever as one of your Holy Claws. Allow me to bring the light of your belonging to this whole bloody continent. My greatest desire is to see your ancient kingdom remade and your enemies cower at your feet.', '', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[243]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1664, 'ArakaaliGlyph1', '[]', 'Our great goddess, we worship her, and in so doing, we may become her. Healer of Hearts, Arakaali, with the juices of lust and venoms of the spider, she brought many back from the brink of death. Only she was worthy to rule. The Porcelain Queen, Gruthkul, disgraced my ancestors, drained them with drought, starved them with famine, blighted them with plague. It was with justice and truth that my ancestors shattered the Porcelain Queen''s reign, and brought our Messiah to power. ' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
The Widow', '', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[246]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1665, 'ArakaaliGlyph2', '[]', 'Our Temple of Decay was built so that we, her chosen, might sustain our great goddess in her pursuit of the secrets that lust and life would keep from us. We, her followers, brought all assortments of venomous creatures and laid them at her feet, yet it was the spider she most coveted, and as the divine energies wove their destinies about her body, our Queen, Arakaali, was reborn. Arakaali the Miracle, Arakaali the mighty Arachnophage, a beauteous creature of immortal power and unfathomable wisdom.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
The Widow', '', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[247]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1666, 'ArakaaliGlyph3', '[]', 'As our Queen''s body was reborn, so too was her mind. Awash with visions of future and past, she burst from the deluge, gasping with terror. She had seen her empire in ruins, her people ground into the dust. And atop her throne sat the children of Gruthkul, their long white hair fluttering in the winds of victory, their laughter as saw-blades in Arakaali''s heart.' || char(13) || '
 ' || char(13) || '
Yet as the vision poisoned her dreams, Arakaali poisoned the vision. Once, twice, thrice, the children of Gruthkul fell, crying their crimson tears. And how their mother grieved.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
The Widow', '', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[248]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1667, 'ArakaaliGlyph4', '[]', 'As her fury grew to blot out the sun, the mother''s grief grew to eclipse the land. Gruthkul and her horde stampeded across the realms of Arakaali, crushing her subjects, blood and bone, into the trembling earth. With her empire on the brink of ruination, our Queen, our Spinner of Shadows, hatched a desperate plan. Feigning injury and defeat, Arakaali lured Gruthkul into the heart of a great cavern. There she entwined her enemy in unyielding silk and then, with prodigious bravery and strength, brought the very stones tumbling down upon Gruthkul''s antlered head.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
The Widow', '', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[249]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1668, 'ArakaaliGlyph5', '[]', 'Even as our courageous Arakaali forged the foundations of a new empire within the ruination of the old, a fresh threat was born in the shadow of the mountains. A creature so devoid of divinity, so beyond humanity, that it drew the very essence from Arakaali as the spider imbibes the life of the trapped moth. Our Queen''s medicines had once sustained us. Now famine and plague ravaged what little remained of our lands.' || char(13) || '
 ' || char(13) || '
As the Beast of the Mountains grew, our Arakaali waned until, helpless as a child, she lost even the faith of her most devoted, the Temple of Decay. I feel the shame for my ancestors as the spider''s venom burns in my belly. When our Queen needed them most, her people betrayed her, bound her in silk and left her to languish in the bowels of a pyramid, just as Arakaali had done to Gruthkul so many years before. ' || char(13) || '
 ' || char(13) || '
Now she has returned, but it is not vengeance she wants. She is no mindless Gruthkul. Arakaali, Goddess of Love, wishes only to embrace the world as she wishes she had been embraced.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
The Widow', '', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[250]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1669, 'UtulaGlyph1', '[]', 'Arohongui, Daughter of the Moon, was preparing for a feast to celebrate Tukohama''s return from his war on the First Ones of the Ezomytes. Tawhoa, Son of the Forest, asked each of the birds to sacrifice one of their kind for the feast. He gave these offerings to Arohongui who cooked them in a great fire-stone pit. ' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Seeing all of those plump birds cooking made Kitava very hungry, and he offered to watch them, to make sure they didn''t burn while Arohongui rested during the heat of the day. Arohongui thanked Kitava for his kindness, but while she slept, Kitava ate the cooking birds, flesh, bones, gizzards and all.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Upon waking, Arohongui was furious to find Kitava had lied to her, for saying that he would watch the birds when he truly intended to eat them all up. When Tukohama arrived home in his mighty canoe, Arohongui asked him to punish Kitava for his selfish gluttony.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Tukohama, our Father of War, agreed and pulled the sharpest tooth from his own mouth. He then asked Arohongui and Tawhoa to hold Kitava fast while he cut Kitava''s face with the tooth. Two slashes that blinded Kitava and formed a bleeding cross upon his face.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
From that day forth, Kitava would never be able to promise to watch that which he truly intended to consume.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Narrated by Slave Utula ' || char(13) || '
Transcribed by Irwen of Theopolis', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/UtulaGlyph/U22_Glyph.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[251]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1670, 'UtulaGlyph2', '[]', 'To replace the feast of birds that Kitava had greedily consumed, Tukohama, our Father of War, and Valako, Father of Storm, went fishing. ' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Although Kitava was blind, he could still cast his line and feel when a fish took his bait. So Tukohama and Valako took him with them on Tukohama''s mighty canoe. ' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
But while they fished, Kitava grew hungry and secretly ate all of their bait of grubs and worms. Disgusted and angry, Tukohama and Valako decided to use Kitava as bait instead. Valako used his own jawbone as a hook, impaled Kitava on it, and cast both into the sea.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Kitava sank to the bottom of the sea, but instead of the fish eating Kitava, it was Kitava who ate all of the fish that nibbled at him, flesh, scales, guts and all. ' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
When Tukohama and Valako hauled a fat-bellied Kitava back up from the sea, they were even more furious, and knew that Kitava must be punished one final time.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Narrated by Slave Utula ' || char(13) || '
Transcribed by Irwen of Theopolis', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/UtulaGlyph/U23_Glyph.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[252]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1671, 'UtulaGlyph3', '[]', 'Tukohama, our Father of War, and Valako, Father of Storm, took Kitava to Hinekora, Mother of Death.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
They asked her to kill the greedy Kitava, for surely their tribe would starve if Kitava continued to live among them. But Hinekora refused, for death would not teach Kitava the lesson he needed to learn. ' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Instead, Hinekora beat Kitava with a whip woven of her own hair. To Kitava, each strand was a searing lash, and so he wore thousands and thousands of blistering lashes across his back as Hinekora drove him relentlessly into the darkest corner of the underworld. There she left him to suffer, without water or food, for the rest of eternity.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
And there Kitava remained, in the darkness of Hinekora''s night-clad island for time beyond measure. There he suffered, waiting for the day that he could return to the world of light to slake his scorching thirst and satiate his ravening hunger.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Narrated by Slave Utula ' || char(13) || '
Transcribed by Irwen of Theopolis', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/UtulaGlyph/U24_Glyph.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[253]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1672, 'ShavronneManifesto', '[]', 'This world is dull and ugly, an imperfect feast of sights, feelings and smells that repulse and depress. Yet amongst this deformity I have found my sublime calling. This world may be abominable, but to an extent, I can be its savior.' || char(13) || '
 ' || char(13) || '
I have been gifted with a special sight. Before me lies a blueprint of perfection, a kind of hidden beauty within skin, muscles, tendons and organs. With a tempered hand and a sharpened blade, I will refashion, reshape and rebirth this world.' || char(13) || '
 ' || char(13) || '
My obligation is immense, something that will, in all likelihood, consume my life. I cannot rest! My calling energises me. Such is an artist''s curse and compulsion.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/ShavronneGlyph/S6-08.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[255]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1673, 'AbberathGlyph', '[]', 'Soul prepared, Soul be mine. O'' Abberath, goat lord of the fallen race, rise up and take this, my offering of delectable essence.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
As it is known, with the consumption of souls, comes the ecstasy of true enlightenment. For the cloven ones shall subjugate every creature on this earth, and as such, all creatures need be consumed.', '', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[256]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1674, 'RyslathaGlyph', '[]', 'Mother Matriarch, Ryslatha, white worm that corrupts the earth, long may I rest in the sweetness of your breast, and suckle deep from the teat of your nurturing juices.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
O'' Mighty mother, for yours is an unstoppable fecundity, it is power and fertility. I would straddle the walls of your fruitful womb and watch as our children disciple this decaying world. That I should lie sleeping amongst the folds of your flesh, replete, as the loving consort of your queendom come.', '', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[257]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1675, 'TukohamaGlyph', '[]', 'By command of fallen blood, leave your habitat and fill the cup of Tukohama. Cleave the heads of our enemies from shoulders unworthy, and adorn the belt of Tukohama.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
And to the Lord of War, I kneel, with boldness at your feet and demand to be drowned in your Valour. Let me look upon my foes without fear, drive me to kill without hesitation, and sear that sinful voice of conscience so I will not feel remorse. For this is war and you, my lord, are its father.', '', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[258]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1676, 'BrineKingGlyph1', '[]', 'If God wills it, the final account of First Mate Piken, castaway on the rock somewhere off the Twilight Strand. ' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Near as I can tell, the rest of the crew, along with Captain Caruso, be dead... or worse. What happened? I''d not have believed it myself had I not seen it with me own two eyes. ' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
At dawn, a light, green and dark, rose from ''neath the waves and into the sky. While most of us stood back in awe, I heard a cry rise up from the lower deck. Casting me eyes in that direction, I saw the waves upchuck, and a swarm of ocean crabs cover the vessel. Ravenous and of countless numbers they were, making quick work of the sailors about them. Nothing but bones and tatters of cloth! ' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
We fled to the longboats as fast we could, hoping to leave them ungodly crustaceans behind us, but lo, from within that green pillar of light, I saw him! The Brine King, like a bloated whale he breached the familiar waters and turned the ship beneath our feet to match-wood. I was flung into the sea, yet managed to cling to some flotsam and make my way to rest on this damnable rock. ' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Seems that ancient Tsoagoth has a mind to take dominion of these seas once more. Captain Caruso was right to drown those mutineers in the old king''s name. A shame we''d not found more. For now, beneath the waves, I hear the whispers of me own passing in a thousand clicking pincers. May God have mercy on me, and may someone benefit from this warning.', '', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[259]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1677, 'BrineKingGlyph2', '[]', 'My motley crew, neither fit to lick my boots nor curl my moustache, have bloody well betrayed me. And I was only trying to save them, those that remained true. Even now, floating prostrate upon a plank of wood, bathed in the dying embers of the evening sun, I hear the clitter-clatter of a million tiny claws. If I close my eyes, I see those tentacles reaching up to me out of the deep.' || char(13) || '
 ' || char(13) || '
I don''t know why the Brine King chose me. For weeks I''ve heard the voices, whispering of his return, gurgling of doom and slavery to us all. I tried to warn the simple men of my ship, made examples of those more violent disbelievers. Yet my prophecies only served to drive the rest into obstinate ignorance. They cast me overboard, perhaps in the vain hope that in my death, none of my utterances would come true.' || char(13) || '
 ' || char(13) || '
Alas, as the morning sun peeked over the horizon, a pillar of green light rose up from the waves, vindicating my darkest fears. The old god ascended from the depths and laid waste to my ship and all aboard her. Now, without food nor water, I shan''t last the night. My bones shall be plucked clean by the pincered multitude that haunts me even now. ' || char(13) || '
 ' || char(13) || '
May this message find land, and by the unholy revelation that Tsoagoth has risen, may my reputation be restored.' || char(13) || '
- Captain Caruso of the Lady in Waiting', '', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[260]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1678, 'BrineKingGlyph3', '[]', '...I beg of you, Mercutio, if you have any care for the friendship we once had, grant me this one favour. It is true I have my own boat, but that is for hauling in fish! It is not fit to travel the waters I must navigate. My wife needs me, my friend. I know it reeks of madness, but Abi has been taken, kidnapped by the King of Brine himself. I fear too that he intends to make her one of his fishwives, just as the old stories warned us! ' || char(13) || '
 ' || char(13) || '
Please, Mercutio, I''ve heard tell of your success as a merchant in recent years. Surely you can spare one ship? Let me voyage out and rescue her, or at least, bring her body back to rest on dry land. Help me silence the insanity in my own mind. ' || char(13) || '
 ' || char(13) || '
Every night, I dream of pale, slime-slick creatures that pursue my boat through the thick, dark waters. I try not to look at them, but I also do. And they look back, their eyes wide with sadness and longing. They are not eyes born of the sea, Mercutio. God help me... they are Abi''s eyes.' || char(13) || '
- Benric of Gulton', '', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[261]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1679, 'BrineKingGlyph4', '[]', 'General Marcovius, ' || char(13) || '
Commander of the Templar Fleet' || char(13) || '
Operation Ocean Blades' || char(13) || '
 ' || char(13) || '
An urgent Report on:' || char(13) || '
The Massacre of Pondium Strait.' || char(13) || '
 ' || char(13) || '
"We were sent here to crush the Brinerot pirates, but something far more troubling has occupied our attentions. Of the surviving men, a few of the older, more superstitious types call it the Brine King. Apparently some false deity of the sea we''ve long since scoured from our holy scriptures. ' || char(13) || '
 ' || char(13) || '
Whatever the damned thing is, it''s big. I''ve seen it myself, though as little more than a vast shadow far below us, veritably dwarfing the hulls of our fleet. ' || char(13) || '
 ' || char(13) || '
Most of our ships are gone, dragged beneath the waves by this malevolent leviathan. We could do little but watch in horror as the waters about us blossomed red. We are nearing the Beacon, what''s left of us, and the wind blows strongly towards home.' || char(13) || '
 ' || char(13) || '
High Templar Avarius, please understand that I am not a man cut from the coward''s cloth, but this situation... this game of cat and mouse has gone on too long. There is nothing to be gained in continuing on to Pondium. We shall turn our sails and catch the trade wind back to Oriath. I only pray we can outrun this thalassic fiend.' || char(13) || '
 ' || char(13) || '
May Innocence guide and protect us.' || char(13) || '
 ' || char(13) || '
General Marcovius', '', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[262]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1680, 'BrineKingGlyph5', '[]', 'O'' Lord of Salt and Scale, your servants attend to thee.' || char(13) || '
Praise thee Tsoagoth!' || char(13) || '
Without life yet living, the Brine King sleeps.' || char(13) || '
We send our prayers to thee, so that you might eternally slumber.' || char(13) || '
 ' || char(13) || '
O'' great one, we offer up this human soul as slave for you in your drowned city.' || char(13) || '
Take this life and bid the seas be calm and plentiful.' || char(13) || '
 ' || char(13) || '
Woe to the Sailor who does not offer tribute to thee!' || char(13) || '
Such a man is cast off from our ocean kingdom!' || char(13) || '
He shall be made pariah, with neither captain nor commission.' || char(13) || '
Judge us not by unworthy sails,' || char(13) || '
Look to us as your servants.' || char(13) || '
Your kin of salt and scale.' || char(13) || '
 ' || char(13) || '
O'' praise thee Tsoagoth, praise thee!', '', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[263]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1681, 'DoedreManifesto', '[]', 'Peel back the skin, for there are secrets in sinew. Mysteries in muscle. Plunder the intestinal fortress, reach deep into bowels of power. The esoterica of kings lies not in the mind, but in the beating walls of a bloodied heart!' || char(13) || '
 ' || char(13) || '
The wonders of the universe are screamed from the ramparts of our fleshly fortresses. Shall the meat show us holiness? Oh, how I feel the tingling of our sacred bodies pressed together, tight and fluid.' || char(13) || '
 ' || char(13) || '
Let the meat show us the way. Hail the meat, praise the meat. The meat is both debasement and divinity alike. The meat shall lead us down the path to true enlightenment.', '', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[264]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1682, 'YugulGlyph', '[]', 'So many have scrutinised the inner workings of the heart, written entire books on sadness, love and hate. Yet terror is the truest, purest of all human emotions. Terror is what we have once our earthly facades are stripped away, once we are naked, vulnerable savages in a vast and uncaring wilderness. ' || char(13) || '
 ' || char(13) || '
Civilisation is a costume, worn to conceal our truest natures. Oh, that we could all become terrified children once again! That we could understand in an instant that everything is hopeless, everything is death. There is no next step, no reprieve. Life is terror and terror is life.' || char(13) || '
- Forbidden Texts of Yugul', '', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[265]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1683, 'SolarisGlyph1', '[]', 'The sister gods of sun and moon, hand in hand did rule. ' || char(13) || '
A guide for day and one for night, their people blessed in full.' || char(13) || '
Then sister sun, as daylight broke, awakened bound in cord.' || char(13) || '
Her flames were quenched, her life laid bare, her passion ripped and gored.' || char(13) || '
Who?" she cried, "Who torments me so? And tears me from the day?"' || char(13) || '
Her captor smiled, behind a mask they wore of bloodless grey.' || char(13) || '
- The Azmeri Verses, 1:20-23', '', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[266]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1684, 'SolarisGlyph2', '[]', 'For many days, the sun did hide, no hand to guide it home' || char(13) || '
And icy moon hung in the sky, a queen perched on her throne.' || char(13) || '
Beneath the earth, Solaris cried, her pain too great to bare.' || char(13) || '
As instruments of sharpened steel caused skin and flesh to tear.' || char(13) || '
In the rarest slice of rest and respite, faithful Kulric came. ' || char(13) || '
He cut her bonds and dressed her wounds and freed her from her pain.' || char(13) || '
Rising from beneath the hills, Solaris sprang a trap. ' || char(13) || '
Her sister snared in flaming nets, Solaris brought her back.' || char(13) || '
A vow she made, a promise struck, to repay her kin in kind. ' || char(13) || '
A sharpened blade, and broken luck, she''d rend her sister blind.' || char(13) || '
 - The Azmeri Verses, 2:10-14', '', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[267]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1685, 'SolarisGlyph3', '[]', 'Solaris upon the horizon stood and gazed upon the moon.' || char(13) || '
Any army of swords and shields and bows, a war to begin at noon.' || char(13) || '
Frustration of her sister''s escape was killed and eaten up.' || char(13) || '
Replaced by the wrath and fear and grief that poured to fill her cup.' || char(13) || '
As Moon and rays marched on the Sun, Solaris eyed her prey. ' || char(13) || '
"Sweet sister," she vowed with love and hate, "You shall never rule this day." ' || char(13) || '
- The Azmeri Verses 5:19-21', '', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[268]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1686, 'LunarisGlyph1', '[]', 'In chains of flame and glowing ore. ' || char(13) || '
A silver moon did strike the floor. ' || char(13) || '
And a sister''s eyes now forged in rage.' || char(13) || '
Silenced her cries with lock and cage.' || char(13) || '
Lunaris wept with betrayal''s lash strike.' || char(13) || '
As her followers were slaughtered by sword and pike' || char(13) || '
Forever a prisoner, a moon buried in the earth. ' || char(13) || '
Burned by a sun and a love felt since birth. ' || char(13) || '
- The Azmeri Verses 3:1-4', '', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[269]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1687, 'LunarisGlyph2', '[]', 'Her heart did languish and her mind did fray.' || char(13) || '
As she bore the pain of each terrible day.' || char(13) || '
Solaris sharpened tools for sure and true caress.' || char(13) || '
As she drew her confessions from her sister''s pallid fairness.' || char(13) || '
Lunaris spoke not a word to her sister insane.' || char(13) || '
While her blood did flow and her hope did wane.' || char(13) || '
Until the stranger she came to set the moon free. ' || char(13) || '
Kulina, the last follower, and the last faithful deed."' || char(13) || '
- The Azmeri Verses 3:9-13', '', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[270]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1688, 'LunarisGlyph3', '[]', 'Hid ''neath the ice and shimmering snow.' || char(13) || '
Lunaris healed from her wounds and pondered her woe.' || char(13) || '
Solaris was mad, it was frighteningly clear.' || char(13) || '
Yet what had so filled her heart with such fear?' || char(13) || '
At the urgings of Kulina, the moon rose for war.' || char(13) || '
She world might fear their Sun no more.' || char(13) || '
Lunaris would crest the star-filled night.' || char(13) || '
And the Sun, rightly chained, would temper her light.' || char(13) || '
To war she marched, with her creatures of the moon.' || char(13) || '
With a hunger for justice and her bright sister''s doom.' || char(13) || '
- The Azmeri Verses 3:20-25', '', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[271]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1689, 'VaalLetter13', '[]', 'The artefacts which High Templar Dominus returned to our city have finally offered up to me one of their secrets. Though, I am certain there is much to be found within the relics, I''m exhilarated and brought to awe by what I have discovered as of yesterday''s studies. I have uncovered a hidden frequency of corruption within the relics - oh, how they now sing to me! They are as mirrors, dimly reflecting shadows and echoings of the past.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
I have seen signs of blood and ancient sacrifice in the ghostings of our precious city! Such as what the Vaal would commit in their homelands. Could it be that these echoes point to Vaal culture having extended all the way to the shores of Oriath? Perhaps we are not the first empire to pull itself up from the mire of this land?' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
I must listen to the relics further, I need to understand, but the singing, it pains me to listen for very long. My work must progress slowly, but it shall progress. Much is at stake here. I can feel it!' || char(13) || '
 ' || char(13) || '
- Templar Davaro of Theopolis', '', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[272]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1690, 'VaalLetter14', '[]', 'I am Templar Thaumaturgist Davaro, the ecstatic, the knower of hidden things, the key to ancient wonder! ' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
In such a short time, everything has changed. The singing of the relics to me no longer pains my ears, in fact, I hear music in them, songs revealing great truths to me. My theory that the Vaal once dwelt in this land has proven fruitful, one of their ancient sites lies not far from here. There is great power dormant in the ruins, one that I am yet to tap fully, but it will come soon enough.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Through my thaumaturgy, I was granted special sight, I saw the ancient Vaal city that once stood in this place. All around me were signs of the legendary Queen Atziri ruling from afar. I saw, as I stood at the base of a great pyramid, the sacrifice of new harvest unfold. The steps ran red with a river of blood, a crimson tide, cascading towards me and washing over my skin. In it, I felt my being shake, as if lightning was reverberating through my body. I felt the strength of that blood ritual, and then returning to my senses, I found myself once more standing in ancient ruins. I thought it to be all a dream, only, when I reached up to touch my face, I found it both horrifyingly and marvelously, pelted with that same salted vermillion.' || char(13) || '
 ' || char(13) || '
- Templar Davaro of Theopolis, Key to Ancient Wonder', '', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[273]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1691, 'VaalLetter15', '[]', 'I have been plagued by a sickness as of late. A kind of blood marking. This curse stalks me in both waking life and the world of dream. The relics no longer sing to me of power, they scream to me of hunger and the ruins call out like needy children for blood, oh, so much more blood! Now that I am aware of their ancient existence, they will not remain silent!' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
What was - at first - revitalising, is now a torment. I can''t, no matter how hard I try, clean the blood from my face and hands. Nobody ever sees the red, but for me, yet this does not mean it doesn''t exist!' || char(13) || '
 ' || char(13) || '
I purchased three Karui slaves from the marketplace the other morning. Strapping young lads of seventeen. At the blood site in the ancient ruins, they pleaded with me. Something about the place, the corruption engrained in the stonework... it spoke to them, and they knew. The powers demand blood, so I gave it to them. I opened the throats of those Karui lads and poured out their essence onto Atziri''s altar. As the sanguine liquid was sucked up by the stone, my mind frayed and I saw the Queen herself, naked and aroused, bathing in a pool of blood while her hand reached between her thighs.' || char(13) || '
 ' || char(13) || '
I... I can''t shake her image from my mind, even now as I lay on my bed, I shiver with fear and anticipation. I have never felt lust for a woman in this magnitude. I fear the Queen shall be the death of me. When I close my eyes I see her, reaching out to embrace me.' || char(13) || '
 ' || char(13) || '
- Templar Davaro', '', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[274]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1692, 'VaalLetter16', '[]', 'My beautiful Queen is all I see. She dwells in another world, I know this now. Our worlds are separate realities, but not entirely ones without doors and bridges to offer transport. In our dreams we make love amidst the coagulation of our victims'' blood. The red is our passion and the gore has become our wedding bed.' || char(13) || '
 ' || char(13) || '
Soon, I will be with my love, she will be closer to me than my own flesh. I have learnt a spell. Blood Thaumaturgy - forbidden by the Templars, but they have no idea as to the power they have ignored...' || char(13) || '
 ' || char(13) || '
In the streets outside, Theopolis is in a panic. Two children belonging to noble families have gone missing in the night. As I look out my window, I see the guards questioning beggars and citizens alike. They will not find the boy or the girl. Such precious beings, they were. The young girl passed from consciousness before I took her. The boy, so brave, never screamed once, not even as my blade cut into the soft of his belly.' || char(13) || '
 ' || char(13) || '
They are both silent now. Unmoving. And shortly I will join them, and together we shall unite with my queen - a happy family. Husband, Wife, Daughter, Son. My knife still drips beside me. I leave this final account in hopes that those who may find us will yearn for the same pleasures I have found, and join us in eternity.' || char(13) || '
 ' || char(13) || '
- Templar Thaumaturgist, Davaro', '', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[275]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1693, 'TriumphOfInnocence', '[]', 'Waves crashed upon the shores of Oriath.' || char(13) || '
Waves of Hunger.' || char(13) || '
Waves of Desire.' || char(13) || '
The Ravenous God and His starving multitude,' || char(13) || '
Rising with the tide,' || char(13) || '
Flooding our streets with death and depravity.' || char(13) || '
Until Innocence cried out, "No more!"' || char(13) || '
Bathing our city in fire,' || char(13) || '
Scorching the wicked to ash and bone.' || char(13) || '
The Ravenous God fled,' || char(13) || '
Into the embrace of our glorious Saviour.' || char(13) || '
Driven down He was, into soil, stone and beyond,' || char(13) || '
Into damnation,' || char(13) || '
By the Will and Light of our Innocence.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
- High Templar Avarius', '', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[276]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1694, 'StainedGlassWindow1', '[]', 'On that day two were born of their mother''s womb. Innocence, with eyes of burning red. Sin, with eyes of clearest blue.', '', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[277]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1695, 'StainedGlassWindow2', '[]', 'Innocence lived with an honest and pure heart, never straying from his mother''s word. Sin filled his heart with lies and indulgence, and deafened his ears to his mother''s pleas.', '', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[278]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1696, 'StainedGlassWindow3', '[]', 'When the Mother of Two broke bread, she allowed Innocence to eat his fill, as reward for his virtuous nature. Sin was cast the scraps to remind him of his worthless ways.', '', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[279]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1697, 'StainedGlassWindow4', '[]', 'Yet the punishment only served to feed Sin''s lusts. Before his brother''s eyes, Sin stole a fish from the market and lied to the watchmen who caught him. Sin then beat his brother until a promise of silence was extracted.', '', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[280]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1698, 'StainedGlassWindow5', '[]', 'Innocence could not keep a promise made in fear. He bore witness and testimony to the Mother of Two, and it was decided, between mother and son, that Sin was beyond rule and redemption. That only purification could cleanse his burgeoning corruption.', '', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[281]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1699, 'StainedGlassWindow6', '[]', 'The village gathered to watch Sin become ash, and breathed deeply of the smoke that poured from his screaming mouth. Sin filled their lungs, their minds and their hearts.', '', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[282]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1700, 'StainedGlassWindow7', '[]', 'Innocence watched Sin take root in the bodies of men and women and children. He witnessed them turn on each other, first with words, then with fists. Friends and kin embraced in mortal struggles, their skin weaving with skin, flesh bonding with flesh, bone entwining with bone, until the village had become one writhing giant, forged of strife and hatred.', '', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[283]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1701, 'StainedGlassWindow8', '[]', 'As this titan of Sin rose to its many feet, Innocence knew that the village was lost. With an anguished cry he committed it to flame. As town and titan burned, the sky turned dark with the ash of Sin. There, amongst the raging ruins of his home, Innocence swore an oath. No matter where the ashes of Sin fell, his purifying flames would rise to meet them.', '', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[284]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1702, 'KitavaCultistTract1', '[]', 'Relish hunger, dear faithful. For hunger is the one true state of spiritual abundance. When one is hungry, they desire more, and therefore align themselves with the will of the mighty Kitava. Beware, my followers, of the satisfied man, for he is the very pattern and image of blasphemy.' || char(13) || '
 - The Holy Book of Hunger by High Priest Utula', '', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[318]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1703, 'KitavaCultistTract2', '[]', 'And our father, the great Kitava, will split asunder the rocks of the earth, pulling himself out of the miry clay. He shall lay a banquet table before us and we shall feast on his divine bounty.' || char(13) || '
 - The Holy Book of Hunger by High Priest Utula', '', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[319]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1704, 'KitavaCultistTract3', '[]', 'This is how it shall end. Kitava will rise, and a great cloud of black smoke will cover the sky. The glorious smell of cooking flesh shall entice even the most ardent of unbelievers to the faith, and together we will celebrate and eat at Kitava''s table.' || char(13) || '
 - The Holy Book of Hunger by High Priest Utula', '', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[320]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1705, 'PetarusVanjaIntroA9', '[]', 'Vanja: You can gripe all you want lover, we can''t stay here. Not with all this blood...' || char(13) || '
 ' || char(13) || '
Petarus: Where do you expect us to go, Vanja? We have our whole lives here in Highgate.' || char(13) || '
 ' || char(13) || '
Vanja: I don''t know... west, perhaps? The Ezomyte lands. I don''t care, just somewhere that has unpoisoned water...' || char(13) || '
 ' || char(13) || '
Petarus: Oh, ah Beast Slayer!' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Vanja: Good to see you again!' || char(13) || '
 ' || char(13) || '
Petarus: Even if you have happened upon us in a rather unruly time...' || char(13) || '
 ' || char(13) || '
Vanja: Shush now sweetie, there''s no need to bother them with our woes.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/PetarusAndVanja/A9_PetAndVan_01.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[285]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1706, 'PetarusVanjaOnOyunKidnapped', '[]', 'Petarus: Oh, they don''t know! I can see on your face, you haven''t heard...' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Vanja: It''s Kira, she''s gone mad!' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Petarus: Absolutely bonkers.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Vanja: She''s abducted Oyun...' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Petarus: Stolen off with her into the desert. And, to make matters worse...' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Vanja: ...The whole of Highgate is in a state of disarray. There''s Beast blood in the water!' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Petarus: ...Usurpers are eyeing up the throne...' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Vanja: And the old gods have risen! If you want my advice, get out of Highgate...' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Petarus: ...Or save us...' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Vanja: ...While you still can.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/PetarusAndVanja/A9_PetAndVan_02.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[285]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1707, 'PetarusVanjaOnKiraKidnap', '[]', 'Petarus: Please, Vanja, don''t say it.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Vanja: Say what? I told you so? Well, I never trusted Kira. Her need to control everything, no matter the cost, was never a trait I held much faith in.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Petarus: Yes, but ambition is not the problem. I have ambition, do you not...' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Vanja: Of course I trust you, sweetie, but you''re not about to go killing everything that moves in exchange for a bit of power now, are you?' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Petarus: Well, I''d trade dreams of power for dreams of you, my sweets, any day!' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Vanja: Oh Petarus...', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/PetarusAndVanja/A9_PetAndVan_03.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[285]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1708, 'PetarusVanjaOnIrasha', '[]', 'Petarus: Irasha? Well, she''s the best we''ve got. Strong, purposeful, an honourable warrior...' || char(13) || '
 ' || char(13) || '
Vanja: I think the description you''re failing to provide, love, is "stick in the mud".' || char(13) || '
 ' || char(13) || '
Petarus: Stick in the mud?' || char(13) || '
 ' || char(13) || '
Vanja: Yes. As stubborn and serious as they come.' || char(13) || '
 ' || char(13) || '
Petarus: You just don''t like her because she treats you differently.' || char(13) || '
 ' || char(13) || '
Vanja: Irasha is a stuck-up elitist. She refuses to see me as a woman.' || char(13) || '
 ' || char(13) || '
Petarus: Oh, sweets. You''re more woman to me than all of them put together.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/PetarusAndVanja/A9_PetAndVan_04.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[285]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1709, 'PetarusVanjaStormBladeQuest', '[]', 'Petarus: You must''ve encountered men and women like us before...' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Vanja: Relic hunters!' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Petarus: ...Ahem, Collectors of rare antiquities. Anyway, Vanja and I are the best in the business.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Vanja: And we need your help locating a particularly rare item.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Petarus: Sweets, I was working them into it...' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Vanja: It''s an ancient sword, belonging to the Maraketh goddess Garukhan!' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Petarus: The Storm Blade some call it. A weapon carved from crystal, capable of capturing even the most powerful of storms within its rigid edge.' || char(13) || '
 ' || char(13) || '
Vanja: The goddess lost it, somewhere in the eastern desert during her ancient battle against the necromancer Saresh and his undead horde.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Petarus: ...According to our research.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Vanja: Find the blade for us, and we will make it worth your while.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Petarus: We''d do this ourselves, but what with the political unrest in Highgate as of late...' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Vanja: We fear leaving, lest we find the gateways barred and ourselves without a home.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/PetarusAndVanja/A9_PetAndVan_05.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[285]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1710, 'PetarusVanjaStormBladeReward', '[]', 'Vanja: You did it! They found it, Petarus, they found it!' || char(13) || '
 ' || char(13) || '
Petarus: By the gods, Garukhan''s famed Storm blade...' || char(13) || '
 ' || char(13) || '
Vanja: Do you know what this means, my sweets? Once we find the right collector...' || char(13) || '
 ' || char(13) || '
Petarus: ...we can go anywhere, have anything. We will be like royalty!' || char(13) || '
 ' || char(13) || '
Vanja: But the storm inside is a problem. It''s too volatile in its current state.' || char(13) || '
 ' || char(13) || '
Petarus: You''re right, we can''t trade away a weapon of such apocalyptic nature.' || char(13) || '
 ' || char(13) || '
Vanja: This will require some pondering, my love. In the meantime, thank you, exile. Take your pick of our stock.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/PetarusAndVanja/A9_PetAndVan_06.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[285]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1711, 'PetarusVanjaOnBottledStorm', '[]', 'Petarus: Well, it took some time, but thanks to our Maraketh neighbors...' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Vanja: ...and their ancient traditions...' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Petarus: ...We managed a strain of thaumaturgy, to remove the storm from Garukhan''s blade.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Vanja: We even bottled it for safekeeping.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Petarus: We''d rather not trust anyone with this sort of power, but perhaps you can use it to clear away that sandstorm in the desert?' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Vanja: Find out what sort of nasties are hiding out there in the desert and put a stop to them!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/PetarusAndVanja/A9_PetAndVan_07.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[285]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1712, 'PetarusVanjaOnOldGods', '[]', 'Petarus: I''ll let Vanja take this one.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Vanja: Thank you, love. I trained in Oriath...' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Petarus: As a witch! Imagine that!' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Vanja: I thought I was telling this story, Petarus?' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Petarus: Yes, sorry sweets.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Vanja: I learned all about the old gods. They were supposed to be our idols, beings of divinity that guided us through our mortal lives.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Petarus: But they aren''t like that at all, are they love?' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Vanja: Hardly. The gods''re no better than we are! And nobody that is as bad as us should ever wield that much power!' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Petarus: As bad as us? Speak for yourself. I''m positively delightful!' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Vanja: Yes, yes, you''re so sweet, they dipped you in a barrel of sugar as a babe. We know!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/PetarusAndVanja/A9_PetAndVan_08.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[285]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1713, 'PetarusVanjaOnOyunDead', '[]', 'Vanja: Oyun was my friend. To depart this world in the manner she did is...' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Petarus: ...Barbaric. And without a protector for the tribe, we''re sitting ducks here. Tasuni thinks he can rule, but he is seduced by all manner of dark things.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Vanja: There is no easy fix here. I''ll be awake for many nights to come.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Petarus: I''ll be right beside you, my love.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Vanja: Let''s not fool ourselves love. You''ll be sleeping.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Petarus: In any case, it''ll be time to crown a new chieftainess soon.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Vanja: Or chieftain. Tasuni is next in the bloodline. Sure, he doesn''t mind breaking a few rules, but at least he''s no Dominus.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Petarus: I do hope you''re joking, sweets! The Maraketh are a matriarchy! The men here aren''t used to being in charge. Tasuni would ruin everything the Mother stands for.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Vanja: You would have them crown Irasha?' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Petarus: She''s strong, stable and traditional. I don''t see why she shouldn''t rule.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Vanja: Because, ironically, Tasuni has the one thing that Irasha lacks.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Petarus: What''s that?' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Vanja: Vision.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/PetarusAndVanja/A9_PetAndVan_09.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[285]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1714, 'PetarusVanjaOnTasuniFeather', '[]', 'Vanja: Tasuni has the feather? Then Highgate is saved. It''s about time they gave the men of the tribe a chance to prove themselves. Tasuni will usher in a new dawn for the Maraketh.' || char(13) || '
 ' || char(13) || '
Petarus: For all our sakes, I hope you''re right, sweets.' || char(13) || '
 ' || char(13) || '
Vanja: Have you not got anything between those legs of yours, my dear? One would suppose that man would like another man to rule more than he would a woman.' || char(13) || '
 ' || char(13) || '
Petarus: Well one would suppose wrong then. Tasuni may benefit me simply because I was born of the same sort as he, but it''s the future of this fascinating tribe that worries me - he''s reckless and flippant of their sacred traditions. I fear with him at the front of their <i>{dekhara}, they will lose what makes them sacred. They will become like the bloody savages that wander the wastelands, or worse - a Blackguard!' || char(13) || '
 ' || char(13) || '
Vanja: Being a Blackguard wasn''t that bad, surely?' || char(13) || '
 ' || char(13) || '
Petarus: ...never again.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/PetarusAndVanja/A9_PetAndVan_10.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[285]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1715, 'PetarusVanjaOnIrashaFeather', '[]', 'Petarus: Irasha holds the feather? Then Highgate has been saved. She may not be in the bloodline, but she holds fast to their traditions, and that''s all that matters. Just think, Tasuni may have steered the tribe into dangerous and unknown territory.' || char(13) || '
 ' || char(13) || '
Vanja: The beast you know is not always better than the one you don''t, my love.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/PetarusAndVanja/A9_PetAndVan_11.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[285]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1716, 'PetarusVanjaOnBeastQuake', '[]', 'Petarus: What was that earthquake caused by? Some sort of death shudder from that volatile Beast? I''ve no thaumaturgical bone in my body, yet still I can sense the corruption seeping out of the cracks in that mountain. This can''t be! Why would you disturb its rest?' || char(13) || '
 ' || char(13) || '
Vanja: Hush now sweetie, the situation is more complex than you would first think.' || char(13) || '
 ' || char(13) || '
Petarus: The Maraketh sat under the curse of the Beast for thousands of years, they had just gotten free, yet now you do... something... to bring the source of its darkness into our very presence? This is unconscionable, it''s...' || char(13) || '
 ' || char(13) || '
Vanja: ...the right choice. Would you rather a hostile reign of warring immortals? Our hero obviously has some kind of plan in mind. If this shift in the mountain can remove the gods from Wraeclast, then I for one am happy to be shook up a little.' || char(13) || '
 ' || char(13) || '
Petarus: Well, whatever the case, at least we have each other.' || char(13) || '
 ' || char(13) || '
Vanja: And we are strongest when we stand together.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/PetarusAndVanja/A9_PetAndVan_12.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[285]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1717, 'PetarusVanjaCalendarQuest', '[]', 'Petarus: Have you ever heard much of the Maraketh legends?' || char(13) || '
 ' || char(13) || '
Vanja: A truly unique cosmology of strange creatures, pagan gods and powerful treasures.' || char(13) || '
 ' || char(13) || '
Petarus: One such story talks of a magical stone dial...' || char(13) || '
 ' || char(13) || '
Vanja: A Maraketh Calendar, said to detail important events in the future of our world.' || char(13) || '
 ' || char(13) || '
Petarus: General Adus, a war hero of the Empire, reported in his diaries of discovering a dial meeting that description at a dig site somewhere in the Foothills.' || char(13) || '
 ' || char(13) || '
Vanja: It appears the war hero had a secret penchant for archaeologies...' || char(13) || '
 ' || char(13) || '
Petarus: But the cataclysm wiped the land clean, and buried the dig site in rocks and sand. No one has been able to locate it since, nor the stone dial.' || char(13) || '
 ' || char(13) || '
Vanja: Seems that with everything that''s been going on of late, knowing what''s due to happen in the future, could be a fairly profitable ability...' || char(13) || '
 ' || char(13) || '
Petarus: We know you would never have use for such a gift...' || char(13) || '
 ' || char(13) || '
Vanja: It would remove all the enjoyment out of adventure for someone like you!' || char(13) || '
 ' || char(13) || '
Petarus: Yet, In times such as these, us small folk could do well with a heads up if something particularly nasty were to occur. Besides, a relic like that should sit in a museum...' || char(13) || '
 ' || char(13) || '
Vanja: ...Or our collection...' || char(13) || '
 ' || char(13) || '
Petarus: ...Not be lost beneath the rubble where it benefits no one.' || char(13) || '
 ' || char(13) || '
Vanja: If you were to track the Calendar down for us, we would pay you handsomely, exile.' || char(13) || '
 ' || char(13) || '
Petarus: Yes, we are traders of antiquities after all.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/PetarusAndVanja/A9_PetAndVan_13.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[285]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1718, 'PetarusVanjaCalendarReward', '[]', 'Vanja: Ah, our relic hunter returns!' || char(13) || '
 ' || char(13) || '
Petarus: You could make a regular go at this.' || char(13) || '
 ' || char(13) || '
Vanja: How about it, hero? Leave behind your warmongering ways and work for us...' || char(13) || '
 ' || char(13) || '
Petarus: ...No? Well, nevermind. In any case...' || char(13) || '
 ' || char(13) || '
Vanja: Here''s that reward we promised.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/PetarusAndVanja/A9_PetAndVan_14.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[285]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1719, 'PetarusVanjaOnGeneralAdus', '[]', 'Vanja: A noble Legionnaire... ' || char(13) || '
 ' || char(13) || '
Petarus: ...but a Legionnaire all the same.' || char(13) || '
 ' || char(13) || '
Vanja: Petarus and I did our research on Adus.' || char(13) || '
 ' || char(13) || '
Petarus: We needed to know as much about him and his dig site as possible...' || char(13) || '
 ' || char(13) || '
Vanja: ...to make sure he was worth our while.' || char(13) || '
 ' || char(13) || '
Petarus: The General was an eternal commander of the Highgate Legion...' || char(13) || '
 ' || char(13) || '
Vanja: He ran a mining camp up here in the mountains. The bastard was the one responsible for controlling Karui, Maraketh and Ezomyte slaves, forcing them into the black bowels of rock fissures in search of gems...' || char(13) || '
 ' || char(13) || '
Petarus: ...At least he treated them fairly and as human beings.' || char(13) || '
 ' || char(13) || '
Vanja: A slave is still a slave my sweets.' || char(13) || '
 ' || char(13) || '
Petarus: For all his faults, the general appears to have been a good man for his time. It''s a shame what happened to him... an even greater shame that by the sounds of things, he''s come back.' || char(13) || '
 ' || char(13) || '
Vanja: Yes, we''d advise steering clear of his old camp.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/PetarusAndVanja/A9_PetAndVan_15.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[285]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1720, 'TasuniIntroA9', '[]', 'The nightmares are but whispers now, yet like prophets, cowering within crevice and crack, they speak of old gods returned, and the reprisal of an exile to our beleaguered land.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Tasuni/T9_01.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[286]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1721, 'TasuniOyunQuest', '[]', 'My sister, Kira has grown obsessed with the Vulture of the Wastes, our goddess Garukhan. Kira has taken Oyun and plans to sacrifice her, imagining she can re-forge herself as a Red Sekhema, a warlord destined to unite the Maraketh under her bloody banner.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
My sister''s betrayal is too great for forgiveness. Like a rabid dog wandering the mountain pass, she must be put down. I ask this of you, for you are familiar with such barbarism and will not feel the pangs of mercy that I would.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
On her person, I suspect you will find Oyun''s royal mandate. The Sekhema Feather. If Kira truly wishes to take the throne, she would need such an item to be considered more than a simple usurper. Bring it to me for safekeeping.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
And please, return our Sekhema Oyun to us, if you can... if she still lives, that is. But don''t risk your life for hers. I know her mind. She would not want that.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Tasuni/T9_02.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[286]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1722, 'TasuniTakeFeather', '[]', 'The shadows are lifting at last! Hand in hand, you and I, we have guided my people towards a brighter future. I suppose you wonder why I do not mourn? For my sister. For Oyun.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Why should I? There is no sense in shedding a tear for those who stand in the way of progress. They have passed from this coil, and that is the best thing either could have done for their people.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
With our poor sekhema removed from her saddle, the way is clear. In lieu of a worthy leader, I shall step up, and with the backing of my followers, claim the throne of Highgate.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Irasha may spit and curse, yet her duty shall overcome her distaste. She will bow to the one who bears the feather as high custom dictates.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Tasuni/T9_04.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[286]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1723, 'TasuniLostFeather', '[]', 'It seems as though fate shan''t be content with just the taking of my eyes. It is pernicious enough to steal my vision from me as well! ' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
I had planned to lead my people into a brighter, better future with the passing of our dear Oyun, but fate uses you to torment me. Still, I must not despair, time is on my side, and in Wraeclast, nobody remains as Sekhema for long.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Tasuni/T9_05.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[286]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1724, 'TasuniOnSin', '[]', 'Yes, I know of that dark god perched atop your shoulder. His image comes forth in my mind''s eye, and I hear the sound of his breath crackle against the coldness of our mountain air.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
He has a different energy to the other gods revealed in my dreams. Less hostile, more empathetic to the plight which humanity suffers... should his brethren be left to roam free.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
It seems, Lord Sin, as if you are on our side.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Tasuni/T9_06.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[286]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1725, 'TasuniOnBeastPower', '[]', 'In the twisting, shifting black smoke of my dreaming, I saw the Beast, lying slain at your feet. I saw the rise of the old gods, their rigid, dusty remains, springing in sudden haste to life. I saw the growing of their power as the corruption began to fade.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
I felt utter anguish, the madness of the Beast''s last, rabid breath, yet my sight, my power, still remains. It would appear that I was permanently marked by its corruption, even as I was birthed from my mother''s womb.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Well now my mother is no longer around to protect me, and the Beast lies rotting in the bowels of that wretched mountain.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Tasuni/T9_07.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[286]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1726, 'TasuniOnBeastQuake', '[]', 'By the gods and by the death of gods! You still live! I don''t know what you did, but I can sense something has shifted. A weapon has been discovered perhaps, to turn the tide of bloodshed brought on by these sickening gods? Tell me, what did you find?' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
No, I mustn''t enquire, for fear of losing my mind as well as my eyes... Oh, I am struck by a peculiar yearning, exile. It is as if I am a man stood on the precipice of a cliff, with an insatiable longing for the ground.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Please, leave me, before the frenzied voices inside my head devour my body and soul.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Tasuni/T9_08.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[286]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1727, 'TasuniOnIrasha', '[]', 'Why ask me about her? That woman doesn''t like me very much and I can''t say I''m particularly fond of her either.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
She seems to have gotten it into her head somehow that I''m the epitome of all evil - a selfish, blind villain. Nothing could be further from the truth - other than the blind part of course.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
I suppose Irasha has good intentions - she truly wishes to see our tribe flourish, however she is too caught up in ancient traditions to see that for us to truly flourish, we must transcend tradition, we must become progressors of the future, not attendants to dry, dusty history.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Tasuni/T9_03.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[286]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1728, 'IrashaIntroduction', '[]', 'You must be the outsider, the "Beast Killer". I am Irasha, and while our soft-hearted chieftainess is gone wandering, it falls to me to make sure this <i>{akhara} doesn''t suffer for it. ' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
I''ve heard the stories they tell of you, and I know better than to pluck the feathers from a sleeping roc. Yet, for the sake of my people, I ask that you keep your peace while among us. Our customs have too often been threatened. Your ways are not our ways. Let''s keep it like that.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Irasha/IR01.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[287]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1729, 'IrashaOyunQuest', '[]', 'Oyun is gone for but a few days and already Tasuni sniffs at the throne like it''s a bitch in heat. Ruled by a man... You need only walk amongst the ruins of Sarn to understand that folly. Well, his desires are but wanton lusts while Oyun still lives.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
One of my scouts saw Kira and her <i>{dekhara} near the foothills. They had Oyun bound to the back of a rhoa like a hunter''s prize, and the Sekhema Feather, our symbol of leadership, worn by her captor. Whether Kira works alone or in pact with her brother Tasuni, I know not. Yet I fear she means to sacrifice our Sekhema to the Vulture of the Wastes. Garukhan. ' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Please, this <i>{akhara} has helped you in the past. Return our kindness. Free Oyun and return her safely to us. And if this quest is lost... remove the traitorous bitch, Kira, from this world and retrieve our Feather. As long as we have that, the throne of Maraketh will remain safe.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Irasha/IR02.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[287]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1730, 'IrashaTakeFeather', '[]', 'Not since the fall of Deshret has this <i>{akhara} seen so sad a moment. Our gods are false. Our Sekhema is dead. But you, Outsider, you offer hope. ' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Without the Feather, Tasuni will be unable to take control of Highgate, no matter how much he lies and whines. My people will never allow it.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
And Oyun''s passing leaves me with only one course of action. I will take the Sekhema Feather and mount the saddle of Highgate. It will be a difficult journey ahead. Our faith has died with the gods you have slain, yet I know in my heart that we will find a way to go on.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
For your troubles, outsider. Perhaps I was wrong, and good can come from beyond our borders.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Irasha/IR04.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[287]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1731, 'IrashaLostFeather', '[]', 'My poor Oyun... Tell me, exile, did she suffer? No, I don''t desire to know. She was a good ruler, wise and benevolent. Our people will miss her, and I shall grieve her as if she were my own flesh and blood.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
But now, Tasuni, with feather in hand, moves to take Highgate for himself. His followers are as blind as he, and so must you be, for it''s clear to my eyes that Tasuni desires but one wish. To rise up as a god. ' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
We have seen our old gods born anew from the sand, flesh and blood where once there was only song and story. Tasuni would turn his weak flesh and watery blood into law and legend. To think that Highgate might fall to the whims of that shriveled cock! ' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
You have brought me grief... then, that is typical of outsiders, is it not?', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Irasha/IR03.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[287]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1732, 'IrashaOnMarakethTradition', '[]', 'No matter where you come from, or who you might be, we were all birthed by a mother. Our mothers protected us and gave us nourishment. It is our duty in life to honour that great task. Without a mother, none would tread this dirt today.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
The most important commandment in our people''s tradition is this: Honour the Mother, Honour the Life.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Irasha/IR05.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[287]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1733, 'IrashaOnTasuni', '[]', 'Arrogant men always seek to control that which they should not, as if that dangling piece of meat between their legs is somehow meant to lead them to power and glory. ' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Men don''t have the mind for leadership. Without guidance, they destroy all they touch. Leave the trials of power to women, we who know how to nurture, how to grow, how to protect.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Irasha/IR06.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[287]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1734, 'IrashaOnPetarusVanja', '[]', 'Two of a very few outsiders I''ve met worth a lick of salt.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
I''m not saying I think they should have as much sway in the <i>{akhara} as they do, but the fact is, the people like them. Oyun liked them, and despite their clumsy attempts to adopt some of our traditions, I like them as well.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Irasha/IR07.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[287]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1735, 'IrashaOnKira', '[]', 'My head is still reeling from what Kira has done to Oyun. That bitch looked at me day in and day out and proclaimed herself loyal unto death. She has shown her true face in the end. ' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Once I thought the old gods were worthy of honour, and I can still see how one might think there are boons to be gained courting their favour, but if such favour comes at the price of Maraketh lives, then I spit on the old gods and Kira as well. May they all rot in the endless desert.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Irasha/IR08.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[287]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1736, 'IrashaOnGarukhan', '[]', 'I would offer prayers up to the goddess of the breeze as a child, and listen to her voice sing and whisper as she danced through my family''s windchimes. She was my favourite, but in light of recent time, I can only believe that some immortal madness has laid waste to her mind.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Irasha/IR11.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[287]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1737, 'IrashaOnGarukhanDead', '[]', 'As a child, my mother told me stories of the old gods, that they were to be feared and venerated, that they embodied the everlasting spirit of the Maraketh people. But this false queen, Garukhan, she was nothing but a goddess of lies. ' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
By accepting Kira''s slaughter of Oyun as a sacrifice of worth, the goddess has played her part in forsaking our most sacred tenet. Honour the Mother, Honour the Life. The bones of our tribe-mother, have been ground into the dust by this divine insanity.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
If the old gods can''t follow the very traditions they themselves set forth, then how can we? Perhaps the time has come to forge our customs anew, in our image, not those of false and selfish gods.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Irasha/IR12.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[287]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1738, 'IrashaOnDialla', '[]', 'Through treacherous deeds and blind love, the Gemling Queen has taught us much. Her body remains here, surrounded by flowers, a reminder to all of us that we ought to tread lightly when chasing desire.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Who can say, after all, where the line is drawn between bold ambition and foolish pride?', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Irasha/IR13.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[287]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1739, 'IrashaOnMarakethJustice', '[]', 'When I was twelve, three men came out of the Vastiri plains and set their eyes upon me. They asked me for water, but took much more.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
When the women of Highgate finally caught them, I was given an opportunity to enact the execution myself, an offer I gladly took. Even at twelve, I knew the price for betraying the <i>{akhara}.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Tasuni knew Oyun was to perish at the hands of that overreaching bitch, yet he did nothing to save her. Should I ever be in a position to punish such treachery, I shall do so... with pleasure.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Irasha/IR14.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[287]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1740, 'IrashaOnTrading', '[]', 'My <i>{dekhara} and I have vowed to protect our people, and so we keep our eyes sharp, and our blades even sharper. As such, I have plenty of weapons on hand. If you perhaps needed to replenish your arsenal, I''m sure we can come to some agreement.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Irasha/IR15.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[287]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1741, 'IrashaOnBeastQuake', '[]', 'There I was, tending to the animals when the ground moved beneath me. It was like the whole earth groaned in pain, a cry unlike I''ve ever heard. The mountain trembled, and for a moment it seemed as if Death was due to visit us, here in Highgate...' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
I don''t know what you did, Outsider, but I hope you did not hurt the Mountain, she is our mother and if a stranger were to wound her, I would slit their throat myself.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Irasha/IR16.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[287]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1742, 'IrashaOnBeastBlood', '[]', 'Though you showed a mighty bravery when you slew that horrendous Beast, by the thoughtlessness of your actions, you have caused great trouble to fall upon our home. The water runs red with toxic, corrupted blood.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Now our people must travel far to fill their flasks and feed their livestock. It''s as if we are in the midst of a great drought, while the water mocks us from within our own village...', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Irasha/IR17.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[287]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1743, 'IrashaShakariQuest', '[]', 'When I received my first flower of blood, I was given to the ritual of womanhood. All young Maraketh women have to dance with the scorpion, to prove themselves worthy of carrying the <i>{dekhara''s} spear. ' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
It is no easy task, to catch a black Maraketh Scorpion. Their tails are swift, their stingers sharp, their poison lethal. I made my way through the trial unscathed, but my sister... We shared a womb, came into this world together. She left it, thrashing and foaming at the mouth. ' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Since that day, I have slept with one eye open, for fear of the scorpion''s sting. And now Shakari, the mother of all black bugs rises from the sands! ' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Find that scuttling bitch and kill her for me... and for every child, every little girl who has suffered and died by the barb of her countless poisoned tails.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Irasha/IR09.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[287]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1744, 'IrashaShakariReward', '[]', 'You killed Shakari? My sister''s death has finally been avenged. Shakari was supposed to be our divine teacher, said to guide us into womanhood. All she ever gave was death. ' || char(13) || '
 ' || char(13) || '
I suppose it''s fitting that the teacher has learned that mortal lesson for herself. Our whole lives, we have lived for the blessings of our goddesses, yet here they are, in the flesh, proving to us that they are only monsters.' || char(13) || '
 ' || char(13) || '
Please, let me reward you for your efforts.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Irasha/IR10.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[287]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1745, 'SinBeastQuest', '[]', 'The Dark Ember remains nestled deep within the putrid flesh of my dead Beast. With many of Highgate''s tunnels now collapsed, we must forge another way inside. I have divined one weak point in the Beast''s flank, an ancient wound wrought by that Vaalish overreacher, Doryani.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
The wound was healed shut by a thick membrane but the right decoction should dissolve the tissue and allow us inside. Of course, for a cordial of such potency I shall require two ingredients of utmost rarity.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
First, our viscous concoction shall require Basilisk Acid, a princely poison which drips from the caustic heart of the Basilisk, and Trarthan Powder, an explosive substance oft used in the mining of Virtue gems.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
With these two bitter harvests, I shall brew something worthy of eroding the membrane of my decaying pet.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Sin/S71.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[288]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1746, 'SinBeastClue', '[]', 'Now that I have both ingredients, I shall brew us a nice cup of what we need. There has never been a substance more corrosive than this, apart from my dear Garukhan''s sarcastic wit.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Let us meet soon at the blood pools surrounding the Lesion, and from there we shall burn ourselves a pathway into the Belly of the Beast.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Sin/S77.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[288]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1747, 'SinOnAcid', '[]', 'Basilisk Acid drips from the hearts of those venomous monsters, though I cannot blame them for their disposition.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
They are tragic creatures. Theirs is a sorry tale more closely tied to my own than I care to dwell upon. Alas, the forging of my Dark Ember produced some rather unfortunate byproducts.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
But we shall not see any success if I am to dwell on those past errors.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Sin/S73.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[288]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1748, 'SinOnPowder', '[]', 'Within the ruins of Highgate Refinery you shall find it. Trarthan Powder, a slightly more unstable blend to the kind found within the celebratory rockets and illuminations of Trarthus, this devious mixture of crumbled chemistry was once used to blast holes through even the thickest mountainsides. It will ensure that our mixture has the brute force required.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Though one should tread carefully within the refinery, for General Adus and his elite legionnaires sought refuge there during the first moments of Malachai''s Cataclysm. If they remain, they will be creatures of darkest discipline. Strong men in health and life made even stronger in corruption and death.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Sin/S74.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[288]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1749, 'SinOnGarukhan', '[]', 'I weep for my poor Garukhan. Together we experienced the loftiest moments that this world could offer.' || char(13) || '
 ' || char(13) || '
Alas, it was my heavy heart that she could no longer bear. I knew her pride would one day be the storm that would ravage my precious humanity. In truth, it was for Garukhan that I sowed the Dark Ember within the depths of Highgate.' || char(13) || '
 ' || char(13) || '
When love cannot be slain, it must be laid down to sleep.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Sin/S84.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[288]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1750, 'SinOnGarukhanQuest', '[]', 'A traveler on the winds, Garukhan pridefully plundered the sky for its secrets. To her mind, wisdom could be found in the eye of a hurricane. ' || char(13) || '
 ' || char(13) || '
Please understand that Garukhan is not an evil being. She was once my friend and companion. Her beauty astonished me as her aspirations inspired me. Yet I must forgo my sentiments for the sake of humankind.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Like winds erode the sandstone, Garukhan has been warped by the same powers she enslaved. This is not my goddess that you shall slay. And if I continue to say it, I might very well come to believe it.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Sin/S83.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[288]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1751, 'SinTakeIngredient', '[]', 'You have done well, but our concoction requires both Acid and Powder. Return to me when you have collected the second partner in our corrosive duo.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Sin/S75.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[288,289]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1752, 'SinTakeIngredients', '[]', 'And so my mistakes are put to rest and the mighty General has fallen. We honour them both with this brew...', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Sin/S76.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[288,289]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1753, 'SinDivineVessel', '[]', 'Come, little spirit, quieten your rage, become one with this exile, be strength on their journey into the dark realms of this world...', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Sin/S110.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[196,198,200,220,222,237,239,288,290,291,300,315]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1754, 'SinBeastQuestQuarry', '[]', 'The Dark Ember remains nestled deep within the putrid flesh of my dead Beast. With many of Highgate''s tunnels now collapsed, we must forge another way inside. Before us lies a weak point in the Beast''s flank. It is an ancient wound wrought by that Vaalish overreacher, Doryani.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
The wound was healed shut by a thick membrane but the right decoction should dissolve the tissue and allow us inside. Of course, for a cordial of such potency I shall require two ingredients of utmost rarity.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
First, our viscous concoction shall require Basilisk Acid, a princely poison which drips from the caustic heart of the Basilisk, and Trarthan Powder, an explosive substance oft used in the mining of Virtue gems.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
With these two bitter harvests, I shall brew something worthy of eroding the membrane of my decaying pet.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Sin/S72_A9.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[289]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1755, 'SinEnterBeast', '[]', 'Here we stand, amidst the coagulating remnants of my creation... Funny isn''t it? Once I placed my Beast on a pedestal as my pride and joy, yet now I send you to breach the hull of my pet''s fouling black core.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
I have brewed for us a potion from the remnants of our harvesting hunt. I shall apply this fermentation to the weakened membrane and meet you within the black core where we shall further our agenda.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Sin/S87.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[289]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1756, 'SinOnSouls', '[]', 'Those souls we now harbor, as individuals, they cannot hope to provide the onslaught of power that birthing our Dark Ember will require.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
But together... together each soul shall shift and change, they shall be knit into one creature, filled with animosity. Our unholy union will excite the Beast, and bring forth our Dark Ember from its rotten womb.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
You should steel yourself, dear friend, for once the cork is plucked from the bottle, the whole world will change.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Sin/S88.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[289]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1757, 'SinOnDarkEmber', '[]', 'The Ember is a seed... the black core of the Beast''s heart. It is the pure, undiluted essence of corruption. Everything my pet once was, all of its power, the stupefying effect it had on us gods, it all dwells within this Dark Ember.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
With this we shall lay Kitava to waste. The once starved god shall fill his gut and pass on into oblivion. Kitava will fall and the Ember shall disperse into nothing more than ash dancing across the cobbled rooftops of Oriath.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Sin/S89.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[289]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1758, 'SinOnCataclysm', '[]', 'It was never meant to transpire this way... ' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
My Beast was born to be a thing of beauty. A crowning jewel to rest upon humanity''s head. I... I wanted to give your kind a chance for peace, a chance to play atop the great stage. No longer pawns to a pantheon of petty, slavering gods...' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
It was only ever defending itself, the fault lies within the twisted hearts of those who would betray their own humanity. ' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Not even I could anticipate the cataclysms my pet wrought on Wraeclast. Both Vaal and Eternal. Ruins in the pages of history. And the others... trailing back across the aeons.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
There is blood on my hands, exile, the innocent blood of millions, and try as I might, the stains just won''t wash off.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Sin/S90.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[289]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1759, 'SinGarukhanReward', '[]', 'It shames me to know the horrors wrought by our hands, here and now. Garukhan was... complicated, but she was also stubborn and never would have thought to change her ways.' || char(13) || '
 ' || char(13) || '
We have given her a sky burial; that is the best that we can do. Even in the old times, she was vain beyond comparison. It was her ambition that corrupted her, despite all my warning words.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Well, look now, where ambition has gotten you, my love...', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Sin/S86.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[288,290]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1760, 'SinShakariQuest', '[]', 'In the Maraketh desert, an Oasis lies to the east, its waters shielded from prying eyes by a preternatural storm. The sand will rip the very flesh from your bones, should you be so foolish as to enter into its dark shroud. Yet, enter you must.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
The goddess Shakari hides within that golden blizzard, festering with revenge as she resurrects and rebuilds her ancient army - an army that once threatened to shake the very balance of these lands.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Should she be allowed to revitalise her troops, the whole of Maraketh will finally fall under the cruelty of her selfish reign. The storm is impenetrable for now, even to the likes of me, but there must be a way in.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
These Highgate locals, they have an affinity for the desert and harsh weather. One of them may know of a way to disperse the storm.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Sin/S67_A9.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[288]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1761, 'SinShakariReward', '[]', 'A mother''s keen heart shall bleed into the dreams of her daughter. Once a beauty who held captive the hearts of men and women alike, Shakari''s splendour decayed into lust... for the power possessed by her skyborn mother.' || char(13) || '
 ' || char(13) || '
My daughter once sought out such power within the great sands of this desert. Ever determined, she found it, and it made of her the twisted creature you so mercifully dispatched.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Driven by agony and shame, she built an army out here in these sweltering lands and would have conquered the very sky had not the Beast soothed her into peaceful oblivion. A babe once more sleeping in her cradle.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Sin/S70_A9.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[288,291]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1762, 'SinOnShakari', '[]', 'It is not something I deign to speak of often, but this goddess, this creature, she was once the flesh of my flesh, blood of my blood. I rose into the clouds and fell into the arms of their queen, the beautiful Garukhan.' || char(13) || '
 ' || char(13) || '
Now if you think that mortal marriages are difficult to navigate, try an immortal one. We parted ways, yet not before my young Queen of the Sands was born into this world of filth and horror.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Now you see how I must suffer for the sake of humanity, to lay mine own daughter upon the sacrificial altar.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Sin/S68_A9.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[288]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1763, 'SinTrioRelease', '[]', 'Something doesn''t seem right. Yes, it would appear our old friend Malachai has one final trick to play. A thaumaturgical wound to the hearts of my precious Beast.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
This complicates things, but not perhaps so much that there is nothing we can do.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Exile, listen to me. I am about to release the souls of our unholy trinity from their decanter.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Their anger will exude more power than you have experienced ever before. You must defeat them, one by one, to fuse their remnants into something volatile enough to coax the Dark Ember from its womb.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Ready yourself.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Sin/S94.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[292]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1764, 'SinOnHeartPortals', '[]', 'The souls of these three continue to surprise us! Quickly now, the hearts have become doorways. Enter in, complete your mission, though I cannot say exactly what you will find on the other side.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Sin/S95.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[292]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1765, 'SinOnTrio', '[]', 'At last, our trio joins to become one foul spirit. Destroy that creature of darkness and let us be rid of this place!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Sin/S96.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[292]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1766, 'ZanaGoToLab', '[]', 'Before Kitava tore this city apart, the Templar kept many artefacts hidden deep beneath the city streets. The only surviving remnants of the Templar theocracy are what they hoped to hide forever.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
I think it''s time to pull back the veil. There''s an entrance to the Templar Laboratory not far from here. My father used to sneak me inside as a child. He never could stand the long work days apart...' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Come, there''s something there I think you need to see.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Zana/ZanaA10_03.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[125,177,178,180,323,324,379,385,386,416,417]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1767, 'WeylamCallOut', '[]', 'If it ain''t our favourite scallywag! What''re you doing out there in that bloody drink?', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Weylam/W2_01.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[193,194,195,225,294,299,311,312]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1768, 'WeylamOnRescue', '[]', 'I ain''t gonna lie to yer, friend, you look like actual shite! Like a real big steamy pile of goat droppings. What in the bloody hell happened to yer since we last crossed compasses?' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Well, never fear, your favourite captain, ol'' Rot-Tooth is here to save the day. I guess I owes yer a bit on account o'' bringing Lilly and I back together.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Weylam/W2_02.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[294]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1769, 'WeylamOnReunited', '[]', 'Arr, as yer can see, finally found the missing powder in me shot-pouch - by that I mean me courage. Managed to make me way over to Lioneye''s Watch to see me grandaughter finally. Tell yer, I don''t know what in the blazes I was fretting about. She took to me like a fish to water and ''twas as if no time had passed at all.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Anyhow, it be lucky for you that we did so, as we were out looking fer ya, to offer our thanks. Followed me compass, listened to the thaumaturgical whisperings of me ship, next we know, we be following a trail of blood and guts, leading straight to you, wasting yer time in the middle of god-knows-where!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Weylam/W2_03.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[294]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1770, 'LillyCallOut', '[]', 'Get yer soggy arse aboard ''fore we stick ya with a fishing spear!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Lilly/LR_17.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[189,192,293,298,313,314]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1771, 'LillyOnRescue', '[]', 'You''re questioning me? The great sea-mistress Lilly Roth, about how she so happened to find you, failing at drowning, on some godforsaken fleshy piece of land?' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Thought it''d be obvious. Grandfather and I, we came to thank you for our little reunion here, you started. Caught wind that you were playing around up here with that dead beast from the locals.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
So we followed yer trail, dreaden we''d be findn'' yer body bits strewn all over this godforsaken mountain. But lo and behold, what do we get? Our favourite exile, twiddling their thumbs.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Yer lucky ol'' Weylam''s still got some thaumaturgical prowess in his bones. How the hell did you end up here anyhow?', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Lilly/LR_18.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[293]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1772, 'LillyOnTravelToOriath', '[]', 'Well, I suppose you''ll be wanting us to ferry you over to Oriath... take care of that nasty cannibal god, Kitava, once and for all?' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Well, we''d be glad to oblige. There be plenty of treasures in ruined Theopolis just sitting there for the taking, I''m sure.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Say the words and we''ll set the sails.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Lilly/LR_19.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[293]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1773, 'LillyTravelToOriath', '[]', 'Ready to go? Just in time as well. Granddad says there be a good thaumaturgical headwind blowing our way.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Lilly/LR_20.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[293]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1774, 'LillyOnSkillGems', '[]', 'While you be skulking about, I''ve managed to do a bit of hunting on me own. Got a hull-full of baubles and trinkets here. Which I managed to... "procure."' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Take a look, you might find something particularly naughty to help you on yer life''s voyage.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Lilly/LR_31.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[192,298]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1775, 'LillyA10Intro', '[]', 'Well, once more, you owe me... for letting ya sail around on me ship. But that''s okay, I''m the kinda gal who can play the long game.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Sometime in the future I''ll be in need of yer services once more. You can pay me back then...' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Alright, come on, you''ve got a job ta do. Lives to save, gods ta kill, better get to it.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Lilly/LR_21.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[298]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1776, 'LillyOnBannon', '[]', 'That Bannon''s a real siren if yer ask me. Even after the beating he''s taken! Bulging muscles, pretty yella hair... I be willing to bet the barrel of his piece''s longer than a ship''s mast as well, if you be understanding me drift...' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
It''s a shame in all honesty that he''s one of them foolish holy men. Though even that ain''t so bad, Lilly Roth loves herself a challenge.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Lilly/LR_22.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[298]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1777, 'LillyOnInnocence', '[]', 'Ol'' Bannon, I''d stake my bets on being a mighty fine demon in the sack. Can''t go wrong with a man in uniform!' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Only now, he''s gone and transformed into that pesky ''God of Light''! I''ve gotta believe that the man is still in there somewhere, but finding my way into his bedsheets at this stage is proving more difficult than I first thought. Don''t seem to be anything that''ll budge him from wherever he''s hiding, not even an enrapturing roll in the hay with this future pirate queen!' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Seems to me that by lettin'' ol'' Innocence take him over completely, it''s like a leech sucking the life right out of him. He''s gonna lose out on all them lusty joys of this world, and that ain''t something I''d ever think fondly about.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Lilly/LR_23.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[298]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1778, 'LillyOnKitava', '[]', 'Not much I can say about that raving monster. While he still breathes, it fares ill for all of us. There ain''t no amount of ocean we can put between us and him that Kitava won''t see as simply an extra dreg of wine in his cup.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Lilly/LR_24.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[298]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1779, 'LillyOnTeardrop', '[]', 'Were a long time ago now, but them Privateers, took the Teardrop, threw it in the Reliquary, then took yers truly, and threw me in those goddamn slave pens. Far as I can tell, they never did work out what the Teardrop were for. Lucky me I suppose.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
It were tough, but with the help of a few other undesirables, I managed to find me way out of them pens and into the Reliquary, made an attempt to burgle back what was burgled from me.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Boy, did we sure underestimate the size of them guards the Templars had on the place. Only I managed to escape unscathed. Me accomplices weren''t to be so lucky... they ended up in Wraeclast, much like yerself.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Fact, I believe you may''ve crossed paths. Kraityn, Alira... Oak.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Lilly/LR_29.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[298]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1780, 'LillyOnTsoatha', '[]', 'Every sell-dwelling lad or lass knows of Tsoatha. They call it a city, but it were more of a slaughterhouse than anything else.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Old Salty himself ruled over the place, treating its citizens as morsels from his own personal pantry. Those who weren''t devoured outright were picked to try continue his family line - they became fish wives, like that pretty young Nessa near ended up being.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Well, the Brine King, as you know was forced into a slumber ''neath the ocean, and the city was said to have joined him there as well. A few folk managed to flee from the collapsing coral shards, start new lives for themselves, but I''ll be reckoning they left all their valuables behind.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Lilly/LR_28.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[298]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1781, 'LillyTeardropQuest', '[]', 'Now that the Brine King is nothing but crab meat, his sunken domain, the ancient city of Tsoatha, is ripe for the plundering.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Me grandaddy once dedicated a good portion of his sailing life, trying ta hunt down the location of that monolithic city. Then, while he were... otherwise indisposed, yers truly tried to follow in his gnarled footsteps, track down the Teardrop - a pearl as big as your head, carved with the clues to the city''s subaquatic location.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
I were this close to completing me grandfather''s legacy, when those damn Templar privateers raided me ship and took off with the Teardrop, threw it in their Reliquary, here in Theopolis. As it were, now''s the perfect time to retrieve that dazzling pearl.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Think you can nab it for me? I''ll make it worth yer while, maybe tick it off the list of things you owe me?', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Lilly/LR_27.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[298]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1782, 'LillyTeardropReward', '[]', 'Exile, you''re a giant among men! You got no idea how long I have yearned to have this beauty once more in me hands. The Teardrop is surprisingly still in pretty good condition - not too typical of the baubles them Templars like to steal.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
We''ll stick around a while longer, but once things settle down, my grandfather and I, we''ll be setting sail with Tsoatha firm in our sights.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Lilly/LR_30.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[298]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1783, 'LaniA10Intro', '[]', 'The prodigal returns... have you brought with you a weapon to free us? The Ravenous One has only grown more hungry since you left us, and I fear your efforts may be too little, too late.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Kitava has all but destroyed us here, and our poor departed Utula''s cultists have taken hold of the city. There''s little ground left to tread that won''t cause the grasping claws of Hinekora to reach out and wring our pretty little necks.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Lani/L21.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[295]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1784, 'LaniBannonQuest', '[]', 'I see your eyes, exile. You wonder why I am here instead of at the Overseer''s Tower. I''ll tell you the horrible truth. The tower has fallen to the infernal devices of Kitava. That witch, Vilenta, is to blame. She lowered a secret ladder and led Kitava''s cultists right to our very beds.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Bannon and I barely escaped with our lives. Together, we cut through the hordes but it was no use. They had us surrounded. Bannon created a distraction which allowed me flee. When I last saw him, he was perched atop the rooftops, holding off our enemies, though how long he will last, I cannot say.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
If you are going that way, perhaps you can find him and return him to me. I have grown... fond of that Templar, the fire of Ngamahu burns within his belly, it would not fare well for us in this war if that fire were lost.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Lani/L22.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[295]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1785, 'LaniBannonReward', '[]', 'Bannon is alive and well, in no small way thanks to you I would be willing to guess. Without him being here, I would have lost my sanity or my life a long time ago. Take this gift as a token of both our appreciation.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Lani/L25.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[295]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1786, 'LaniOnVilentaGone', '[]', 'I believe Vilenta was not of sound mind. At night, we often heard her cry out in sleep, fearing unseen things. I wanted to toss her out on the streets, let the beasts of this fallen city tend to her madness, but Bannon refused to leave behind one of his own. Would that he had''ve listened to me...' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Vilenta thought that if she gave us up to Kitava, the Ravenous One would look kindly upon her. Well, look upon her, he did, but what he saw and what she became is the thing of nightmares - her nightmares perhaps?', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Lani/L23.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[295]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1787, 'LaniVilentaQuest', '[]', 'Now that you have returned and we have managed to sturdy ourselves once more abreast this mighty ship, I ask of you one more favour - find that traitor Vilenta and kill her. Though I wish to see her dead as revenge for her insurrection, Vilenta has become something far worse under the radiation of Kitava''s gaze. She must be stopped.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Lani/L26.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[295]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1788, 'LaniVilentaReward', '[]', 'You return from your hunt triumphant! Then Vilenta is dead. I wish I could say that a celebration is in order, but in our current existence, I have had all I can stomach of banquets and feasts. Here.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Lani/L27.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[295]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1789, 'LaniOnCultists', '[]', 'Before their god rose from the depths, Utula and his cultists had direction. They wished to see Kitava free to stage his horrifying banquet. I was foolish enough to believe these theological mumblings as symbols for Karui freedom. Now that their prophecies have come to fruition, the cultists have lost their minds!' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
It''s hard enough to believe the end times of your chosen religion will ever happen, let alone to last longer than the final pages of your holy book...', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Lani/L24.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[295]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1790, 'LaniOnLilly', '[]', 'In another life, perhaps Lilly and I would have sailed the oceans together. I enjoy her presence and the conversations she brings. She has a call for adventure, coupled with a kind of optimism I rarely see. I hope that once all of this settles down, we might remain friends.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Lani/L31.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[295,310]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1791, 'LaniOnWeylam', '[]', 'I don''t quite enjoy Weylam as much as I do his granddaughter, but Lilly favours him, and so I will too, unless he does something truly horrid that forces me to revoke my opinion.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Lani/L32.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[295,310]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1792, 'LaniOnInnocence', '[]', 'Bannon was a man whom I greatly admired, possibly even loved. My heart is grieved to see him depart from us and journey to the home of Hinekora. Yet, he sacrificed himself so that we might live, and stood true to his convictions. This god, this born-again Innocence fills me with unease. Though he appears repentant of his past transgressions, I do not believe he should be forgiven, nor that he should tread this earth any longer than is required.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Lani/L33.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[295]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1793, 'LaniOnSin', '[]', 'A dark angel on your shoulder perhaps? In another time the presence of this god would trouble me, perhaps even frighten me, but in these days, I cannot afford the sensation of surprise. If he has helped you this far as you say, then one might expect he will help you all the way to the bitter end, and that is good enough for me.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Lani/L34.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[295]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1794, 'LaniOnKitavaTrough', '[]', 'Kitava''s appetite has grown bigger than even his devotees had expected. His hunger moves faster now than his followers can keep up. I suppose the canals were the perfect answer to their problem really. They converted them into one giant feeding trough to bring food to his mouth at a speedier rate.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Lani/L28.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[295]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1795, 'WeylamA10Welcome', '[]', 'Welcome ye ter Oriath! Smell that fresh, landlubber air. Ain''t nothing like the air in Theopolis, full of debauchery and pollution, hidden neath the garb of them holy templars... Seems the place has changed a fair bit since last I were here, a lot more blood and entrails than what I remember. Well, best Lilly and I stay here where it be safe. You journey on ahead matey, see what blimey buggers you get to kill next.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Weylam/W2_04.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[299]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1796, 'WeylamOnLani', '[]', 'Now there''s a woman who can hold her own! Look at her! A marvelous specimen of the female persuasion.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Arr, reminds me of Meredith, me long lost sweetheart... Would it be that I could have a woman like that at me side once more. Someone to stare out over the bow into the salt spray of the sea with, someone to warm the cockles of me heart - and a few other things, in me bed; at night... Ah, now that''d be the dream...', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Weylam/W2_05.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[299,311]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1797, 'WeylamOnBannon', '[]', 'Lousy good for nothing blackguard. In all me years at sea, never have I ever serviced a filthy blackguard on my lovely ship. If the Brine King still drew breath, I''d tell you having this Bannon aboard would be an affront to the lord of salt and scale... Him and his kind have hung drawn and quartered too many of ours. I don''t rightly trust him. Not at all.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Weylam/W2_06.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[299]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1798, 'WeylamA10OnLilly', '[]', 'Methinks Lilly is fixing to have her way with that damn Blackguard. Well, I''ll tell you, not if I have anything to say about it. Look at me! Never thought I''d see the day where old Weylam were to be the prudish grandfather, yet here we are. Damn conscience''ll be the death of me.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Weylam/W2_07.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[299]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1799, 'WeylamOnTrading', '[]', 'Say, yer not in the market for a new cutlass or anything are yer? Recently unlocked the Black Crest''s old armoury, found a whole shite load of weaponry down there from another time. If you fancy it, be glad to show yer me stock, see if there''s anything in there you''d like to pick up.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Weylam/W2_11.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[299]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1800, 'WeylamLovePotionQuest', '[]', 'Was a time where the ladies''d be begging for a bit of ol'' Weylam. But I ain''t felt the warm caress of a woman in a long time and it wounding me dreadful. During me time on the sea, I heard tale of Queen Atziri and her penchant fer using this land as a kinda vault for all her special shinies.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
One such shiny be her famed love potion - s''posed to attract the drinker''s ideal mate to their loins, even if that mate be far across the sea. Ol'' Queen Atziri kept the liquid in the skull of her favourite lover.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Them damned Templars probably got their hands on it by now and the potion''s bizarre container has me thinking they probably went and tossed it in the Ossuary along with the rest of the bones they got lying around.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Exile, be yer the friend I believe you to be, then find the potion for me, so that I can experience true love once more.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Weylam/W2_09.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[299]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1801, 'WeylamLovePotionReward', '[]', 'Yer found it! Bless yer boots exile! Me lady problems will be over at last! Let''s give her a go then...' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Hmm, hmmmm... I feel nothing... Blast it all to the ocean depths! Ruined! All them years sitting ''round in that damned Ossuary, the love magic''s fizzled right outta the damn thing.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Ah well... can''t blame a man fer trying. Anyway, here''s a little something for yer effort...', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Weylam/W2_10.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[299]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1802, 'BannonRescuedA10', '[]', 'Phew! I would thank God for you my friend, if that weren''t too on the nose. I felt for sure that this time it was my turn to depart our world.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Kitava''s cultists surrounded Lani and I a while back... We split up and I lead a distraction so she could make best her escape. Funny, I really should have considered my own plan for evasion once I''d allowed her hers...' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
In any case, it is good to see you again, exile. Let us talk more in a safer space. I shall meet you back at the docks.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Bannon/B2_02.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[297]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1803, 'BannonIntroA10', '[]', 'Ah, good to see you made it back.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
You look at me with suspicious eyes... Yes, I know you have your apprehensions about me and my new indwelling spirit. But if it helps a little, I feel Innocence stirring inside me, awakening with an odd sense of... gratitude towards you.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
It was, after all, your bite that returned him to humility, allowed the scales to drop from his eyes.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Bannon/B2_03.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[296]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1804, 'BannonOnCultists', '[]', 'While they had me trapped, I heard those cultists'' mad gibberings. Their words were akin to that of the Wraeclast cannibals, nonsensical sentences accompanied by the most unsettling of cackles. I fear that they have indulged too deeply into Kitava''s famed habit and caught the laughing plague that so often accompanies men and women who choose to engage in the consumption of human flesh.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Bannon/B2_04.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[296]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1805, 'BannonOnKitavaA10', '[]', 'As I''m sure you''ve noticed, that damnable god, Kitava no longer resides on the rooftops as last you were here. No, the monster has acclimatised himself to Theopolis. He has set up quite the banqueting table for himself. It appears he believes he has a lot of... consumption to catch up on. Best I can tell, his new residence lies through the ravaged Oriath Square and past the canals, now the feeding troughs...' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Heed my warning friend, tread lightly through that area, for those cultists are out and about, once more, actively seeking food for Kitava to devour...', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Bannon/B2_05.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[296]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1806, 'BannonOnInnocenceA10', '[]', 'I wouldn''t blame you for being curious about the god now dwelling within me. In truth, I''m honoured to have been chosen to be Innocence''s vessel. You may hear this and think I sound like a pious Templar fool, but it is hard to remain an unbeliever when the gods walk around you, and indeed one, sleeps inside you.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
No need to fear however, our poor purity god surely regrets the actions of his past. I can''t see him, but I can feel his spirit, wounded and cowering somewhere inside me. At night, I hear him whimpering over his wounds - I must say, you hurt him good! But, as much as I feel his pain, I also feel a budding newness in his heart, he is growing again and relearning the compassion for humanity that he had long since lost.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Bannon/B2_08.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[296]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1807, 'BannonOnChamberOfInnocence', '[]', 'The Chamber of Innocence is exactly where you left it, though cultists and vandals may have had their way with it since last you visited. Innocence himself no longer cares for the place, in fact, I feel a pained revulsion for it, hence why I cannot go myself. But I''m certain you are more than capable of forging a path through that broken temple once again.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Bannon/B2_09.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[296]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1808, 'BannonStaffOfAvariusQuest', '[]', 'If you are to go wandering the city in its current state, be careful where you step. Kitava''s cultists are constantly on the prowl, actively seeking food for their god. What''s worse, the passage to Kitava''s feast is blocked off by two large black gates. We call them ''Kitava''s Horns'' and they are utterly impenetrable to the motions of man.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
There is but one way in which we can reach Kitava and deprive him of his eternal meal. The Staff of Avarius lies somewhere amongst the rubble of the Chamber of Innocence, still billowing with holy power. If you were to find it and return it to me, I believe the power in the staff will act as power enough to break through the horned gates.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Bannon/B2_06.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[296]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1809, 'BannonTransformation', '[]', 'I fear I have not been entirely honest with you, my friend.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
While it is true that this staff can forge a path for us through Kitava''s Horns, it has the ability to revitalise Innocence into waking fully, and that is where the staff''s true power resides.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
In this act, I will become his host in the fullest sense, and together he and his brother Sin will be able to ally with you against the forces of darkness.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
I bid you farewell, Exile, for where my spirit is set to travel, there is no return. Win this battle. Defeat Kitava. Free our people.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Bannon/B2_10.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[296]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1810, 'BannonOnKitavaGate', '[]', 'Back when the cultists took control of the city, the very ground itself shook as if pained by some dark abomination. The gnarled horns of Kitava erupted from the earth, like spiraling pillars of corruption, weaving together a barrier impeding travellers from moving through the city.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Bannon/B2_07.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[296]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1811, 'BannonCallOutA10', '[]', 'You there, exile! I am in need of your services once more! Help me!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Bannon3D/B2_01.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[297]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1812, 'InnocenceTransform', '[]', 'Innocence: I am reborn! A new god in a troubled land...' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Sin: Brother! You have seen better days, I am sure, but for now, you must rouse yourself. We have work to do. If ever you wish to make right the wrongs of your past, help me now, as once I asked you in the early days of mankind. Do this for me, and I shall consider our quarrel to be at its end.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Sin/S103.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[301]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1813, 'InnocenceDestroyHorns', '[]', 'Bone and corruption shall not impede the path of purity!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Innocence/Innocence_02.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[302]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1814, 'InnocenceKitavaQuest', '[]', 'Go, do battle, anointed exile. Though my brother and I will aid you, I sense the universe conspires for you to be the saviour of our world on this day.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Innocence/Innocence_03.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[301,302]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1815, 'InnocenceBubbleRandom', '[]', 'Purity shall be your shield!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/InnocenceCombat/Innocence_04a.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[304]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1816, 'InnocenceBubble2', '[]', 'Purity shall be your shield!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/InnocenceCombat/Innocence_04b.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[304]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1817, 'InnocenceBubble3', '[]', 'Purity shall be your shield!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/InnocenceCombat/Innocence_04c.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[304]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1818, 'InnocenceCapturedRandom', '[]', 'Aid me, exile!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/InnocenceCombat/Innocence_05a.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[304]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1819, 'InnocenceCaptured2', '[]', 'Aid me, exile!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/InnocenceCombat/Innocence_05b.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[304]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1820, 'InnocenceCaptured3', '[]', 'Aid me, exile!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/InnocenceCombat/Innocence_05c.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[304]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1821, 'InnocenceSinCapturedRandom', '[]', 'Stay strong brother, freedom is at hand!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/InnocenceCombat/Innocence_06a.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[304]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1822, 'InnocenceSinCaptured2', '[]', 'Stay strong brother, freedom is at hand!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/InnocenceCombat/Innocence_06b.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[304]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1823, 'InnocenceSinCaptured3', '[]', 'Stay strong brother, freedom is at hand!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/InnocenceCombat/Innocence_06c.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[304]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1824, 'SinInnocenceReconciliation', '[]', 'Sin: Innocence, you see now, don''t you?' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Innocence: Little brother... Please, forgive me. It''s as if I have been dreaming the most horrid nightmare... and now, at last, the haze of sleep lifts from my eyes. My vision is clear... oh, by the gods, forgive me...' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Sin: It is as true now as it was when we began. You and I are of the same flesh, cleaved from the same womb. You ask for my forgiveness. I give it to you freely.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Innocence: But the things I''ve done... the countless millions I''ve murdered...' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Sin: There will be time for all of that later, but for now, your people need you. Oriath needs you...' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Innocence: ...No. I cannot remain here amongst these ruins. Amongst the corpses of my own making... These people, they need you, brother, and your hero - not me.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Sin: Then what? Where will you go? What will you do?' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Innocence: Isolation. I shall go south. As far south as one can travel in such a fleshly form. There are things I must think on, a redemption I need plan, if my conscience decides I am worthy of such a gift.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Sin: You would seek forgiveness in the ice at the bottom of the world?' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Innocence: I would, should you let me.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Sin: Go. Seek out that which you need. Find who you are, make pilgrimage. Journey on your path, brother, only return to us one day.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Innocence: Thank you, brother.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Sin/S107.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[315,316,300,301]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1825, 'InnocenceOnExile', '[]', 'You have heard my admission of guilt and my plea for forgiveness, yet I sense in the glowing embers of your eyes that you will be glad to be rid of me. I don''t blame you, mortal, nor do I begrudge you for your continual anger. The sins I''ve committed, although bad enough, are made worse by the lens of pride I once viewed this world through.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
I agree with your judgement, and though I wish never to return from my banishment, I have made a promise to Sin that I shall one day rejoin this world.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
But until that day I will remain in the furthest south, in a place of ice and ash, of blistering seas and abysmal storms. I shall meditate on my wrong doings, until a way of making amends to the millions of lives I have murdered and ruined, reveals itself to me.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Innocence/Innocence_09.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[316,301]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1826, 'SinOnLilly', '[]', 'Lilly Roth is a noble... hm, how do you say it... scallywag?' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
I have witnessed the rise and fall of many great men and women over the aeons, and Lilly is well on her way to being amongst the very best of them. I suspect one day her name shall be sung in salty taverns the world around.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
I must remember to keep on her good side now that she can see me. The beautiful pirate princess, hunting down the great god Sin would make for a fantastic tale, I''m sure, but one I would rather have remain in the pages of fiction.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Sin/S99.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[300]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1827, 'SinIntroA10', '[]', 'It is good to see that you survived my friend, but then, you have fared far worse - the froth of a violent ocean should be no problem for you!' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
While we have been absent, Oriath has become a necropolis, aswarm with Kitava''s wretched servants. The situation looks more dire than I had first anticipated.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Before we make our move, we must know what we are dealing with. I send you, exile, as a scout, as the only scout that would stand a chance moving through the shifting forms of this nightmare. You must discover where Kitava resides, only then can we issue our final blow.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Sin/S98.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[300]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1828, 'SinOnBannon', '[]', 'Before we proceed, I feel I must confide something in you. Bannon wishes me not to speak of it, as he is willing for the sacrifice, however, I feel you should know...' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Once we invoke Innocence, once we dredge him up from his cocoon inside the soul of Bannon, the man shall cease to be. Only the god shall remain.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Do you understand what I say, exile? If we take this path, Bannon will die... excruciatingly so - burnt with purity from the inside out. As I said, Bannon is willing to commit his life to this cause, but perhaps you should say your farewells before we move past the point of no return?', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Sin/S102.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[300]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1829, 'SinOnKitava', '[]', 'Then it is as I feared. Kitava''s strength has grown insurmountable in our absence, and his horns now deny us entry to his feeding trough. Evidently the hungry god has grown picky about what crumbs now travel towards his burgeoning throat...' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
It is this strength that concerns me. I have spoken with our friend Bannon over there, a wilful vessel of my misguided brother. I knew eventually we would need to enlist my brother''s services, though I had hoped we need not do so this soon, yet it seems that we have no other choice.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
We must invoke my dormant brother, slumbering within Bannon''s frame. Kitava''s horns are a thing of great corruption which only Innocence''s purity can dispel.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Sin/S101.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[300]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1830, 'SinOnDarkEmberA10', '[]', 'You needn''t fret, the Dark Ember is still safely in my possession and will remain so until our final confrontation with Kitava.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
That carnivorous blasphemy will fall like a log cut from the darkest of forests, and we shall watch him burn as Oriath, and the rest of this world breathes a sigh of relief.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Sin/S100.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[300]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1831, 'SinPreKitavaFight', '[]', 'This is it. It all comes down to this moment to finally put an end to Kitava. Go exile, together we will save humankind!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Sin/S104a.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[303]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1832, 'SinKitavaFightIntro', '[]', 'I shall strike you down!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Sin/S104b.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[303]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1833, 'SinKitavaDeath', '[]', 'May a new dawn arise!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Sin/S105.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[303]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1834, 'SinOnKitavaDead', '[]', 'It''s over... We emerge victorious... It was always a fool''s errand, yet somehow, your courage has carried us through.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
I congratulate you, my friend. Your world may have exiled you, but there will always be a place for you at my table. You have given humanity a fighting chance. Though darkness still covers the face of the earth, there is now a ray of light to pierce it. The insatiable appetite of Kitava has been ruined, and you, you are no exile! Why, you are a hero, worthy of praise. May your legend live on, into eternity.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Come, let us return to the others, they will be needing as many hands as possible for cleaning up this city...', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Sin/S106.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[325]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1835, 'SinOnGodsDead', '[]', 'Aside from my own presence, I no longer feel the vibrations of other gods. Though there may yet be more out there, for now, Wraeclast can breathe a sigh of relief.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
However, we must turn our sights to Kitava who still gorges himself on those poor souls trapped in Oriath. You have drunk your fill of my kind, the essence of deity courses through your veins, waiting to be expunged upon a chosen victim. We can only hope it will be strength enough to face that demoniac of a god.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Sin/S108.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[300]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1836, 'WeylamOnKitavaDead', '[]', 'Thank the sea! That bloody sod is gone from our world! Can''t tell ya how many times I''ve heard them Karui savages gibbering in fear over that cannibal god.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
And of course, there''s ah... all of this horror to account for as well. Aye, don''t think there''s a man, woman or child in the world that won''t be praising yer name tonight over a glass of their finest grog.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Speaking of which, where''s a man to go to find a little fire water around these parts?', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Weylam/W2_08.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[311,299]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1837, 'LaniKitavaReward', '[]', 'By the light of Ramako, you did it! You, a mortal, have crossed the threshold between god and man and struck the ravenous one asunder!' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
I''d always held out hope that you would succeed, but at night, I would stay awake worrying that perhaps that hope was a foolish dream, but you''ve done it! You are no longer an Exile, my friend. I honour you, and I''m certain the rest of the world will honour you as well.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Please, I was saving this for something special, it''s not much, but it''s yours.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Lani/L29.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[295,310]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1838, 'LillyOnKitavaDead', '[]', 'I suspect you''re about ready for a flagon of ale and a pretty wench or swain, whatever it be that''s yer persuasion.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
The great exile of Oriath, returns to a Theopolis in chaos and ends the life of a raving cannibal god... now that''s a story worth the songs of many an ancient muse.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Well, alls I can rightly say is congratulations my friend. A year ago, I wouldn''t have dreamt I''d be someday soon in the company of a killer of gods. My advice, you better get while the getting''s good and have yourself a holiday before Oriath or Wraeclast or whoever else has need for your unique services once more.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Lilly/LR_25.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[298,313]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1839, 'ShaperMemoryFragment1', '[]', 'I am Valdo Caeserius, chief Arkhon of the Oriath academy in Theopolis. Servant of the High Templar Venarius.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
I begin these writings as a record of events transpired, in hopes that the penning of such horrors will help bring sense to the matters at present. Some time ago, I was commissioned in the repairing of a strange device delivered into my hands. A golden machine found broken in the ruins of Wraeclast. Believing it to contain some dark infernal secret, the High Templar asked that I restore it and weaponize whatever powers it might contain.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Though I saw it as mostly inconsequential at the time, it is worth noting, my daughter, a quiet young thing of five, suffered nightmares and tantrums unlike any I''d seen, during those former weeks I spent working on the device. I''d assumed that she missed her mother and was going through a rough patch grieving. Now, however, I can''t help but wonder if perhaps it was a sign.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
I''d considered refusing Venarius, though not in any serious nature. Though my personal politics remain my own, I''ve often struggled to follow his instructions and rule – filled with such malice and hunger. Regretfully, I accepted his orders, for I know of many families who have refused the High Templar before. They have all vanished now.', '', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[321]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1840, 'ShaperMemoryFragment2', '[]', 'The device lay on my work table, shattered and in pieces. I''m ashamed to admit now that not once did I ask of what design it belonged to. Rather, I busied myself on all the little pieces, ignoring the sum of its parts. I pondered on how it had been structured for days on end, until at last, a creeping dread submerged me.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
I was unable to rebuild this relic – whatever it was. Though it seemed to be mostly functioning, something... important appeared to be missing. Worse still, it seemed as if the part required, well... it didn''t exist. Not in our reality anyhow. The thing that made it tick, the thing that was mysteriously vacant, I could only conceive of in the half-baked imaginings of my own mind.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
My thoughts felt like a fleeting dream during the first few minutes of waking. I worked tirelessly in search of answers, exhausting myself beyond what I''d ever done before, until finally, at the base of that cruel device, I fell into a deep, deep sleep.', '', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[321]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1841, 'ShaperMemoryFragment3', '[]', 'I awoke in the most beautiful of places. The skies were blue, unlike the greyness of Oriath. Birds fluttered through the air, singing pleasantly. Around me, a warm wind brushed my face, and tall grass tickled playfully against my skin. I couldn''t know where I was, though even then I suspected the place was somehow connected to the infernal mechanism lying dormant on my workbench.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
As I wandered this strange new land, I felt a growing sense of realization that I was not alone. Exploring the fields of tall grass, I sought a peace within the brush. It was in that moment that I met a fellow wanderer. It was a Shade - a whisper of embodied smoke, barely heard or seen amongst the vegetation. It rose and spoke to me not through language, but through thoughts and pictures, colours and emotions, bursting into my mind like water, billowing up through cracks in the earth.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
The Shade welcomed me to its land and asked how it was that I arrived. Eager for answers, I found myself enthusiastically volunteering information in detail of Oriath, of my daughter and of course, the strange and mysterious device I suspected had lead me to this place.', '', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[321]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1842, 'ShaperMemoryFragment4', '[]', 'The Shade nodded thoughtfully. It knew of the device. The machine was a doorway between my world and the dreamlands, I was told. The device had been lost. Broken and torn apart by villains and thieves. The Shade was overjoyed to hear it found, and offered to help me rebuild that final missing part.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
It seemed too good to be true. We would open the gateway between worlds, and then, all the goodness of these lands would flow out into Oriath leading us into a new age of prosperity. I agreed wholeheartedly – for I feared, and I still do fear, what will become of my daughter under High Templar Venarius'' reign. All that the Shade asked of me was to return the favour, when the time came.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
And as I lay down in the cool grass bathing myself in the soothing sun, I found that sleep once more took my body, only this time, when I closed my eyes there, I also opened them in the cold, empty darkness of my study...', '', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[321]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1843, 'ShaperMemoryFragment5', '[]', 'Weeks passed. The sun set and the moon rose countless times. And every night, I found myself asleep at the foot of the strange device, awoken to the reality of another world inside my own. I would transition into the dreamlands.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
In my sleep, I would apprentice myself to the Shade, allowing it to teach me the ways of this strange place. I learnt how to shape and build things from my imagination, forming them in thin air as if by some great, thaumaturgical marvel. It was through this tempering of the mind that I, under its instructions began rebuilding the missing component of the device. And most exciting of all, how to transport such phantasmagorical treasures back into the world of man. ' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
When High Templar Venarius visited during Oriath hours, I''d lie to him and make excuses. Arrogantly, I didn''t want him to know of the power I''d uncovered. I wanted these dreamlands to be my secret, to belong to me and me alone. Not even my daughter could know...', '', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[321]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1844, 'ShaperMemoryFragment6', '[]', 'The day came when the missing part of the great device had finally been formed. A bizarre segment meant to hold mystical images of ancient maps. It was on this day that the Shade requested its one favour.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
I was shown suddenly images of the past, of the Shade''s once proud rule as King of all the dreamlands. I saw his good and noble kingdom, and the shadow that fell upon his domain. A sect of hateful men and women – The Watchers of Decay rose up to destroy the Shade. Questing to control the land, these terrorists fashioned a powerful blade meant to divorce the King''s spirit from his body and curse it to wander his former kingdom while his body blistered in stone.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
I was mortified! How could people do such cruel things to this humble creature? And where were these villains now? Had they been the same ones whom had made off with the device? Had they been the ones who severed the connection between worlds and ruined its function?' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
The Shade led me deep into a dark forest and revealed to me in the depths of a forgotten cave, a statue, cast from black marble, pierced by what I assumed to be the very same sword from my visions. The effigy was frightening. Utterly terrifying to behold. The creature it depicted – a violent and abhorrent thing, stood amidst an altar of ancient wood and bone. I felt a chill go up my spine as in that moment, the Shade closed in behind...', '', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[321]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1845, 'ShaperMemoryFragment7', '[]', '"Pull the blade from my chest." the Shade imposed upon my mind in both image and thought, "remove the sword. Free me." But as I found myself reaching out to do as asked, a great horror came upon me and for the first time, doubt entered my mind. I wondered if this creature was who it had told me. I resolved to hold off for a moment, to ask more questions and discover a greater understanding of the Shade, and so in trepidation, I refused.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
At merely the suggestion of rebellion, the Shade flew into a fury! It flamed red, full of rage! And though it could not speak, it made its intentions very clear. I felt my mind torn asunder as images of murder and mutilation were forced upon me. I was... doing things. Terrible things to the ones I loved... to my daughter.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
I fled in a panic, running from the cave, through the dark forest, cursing myself for ever trusting such a strange creature so blindly. At last, in desperation, I found a small, abandoned fox-hole and burrowed inside. The Shade passed by, still flaming in anger, searching desperately for me. It was in that dark damp hole that I trembled with revulsion and terror, weeping in silence until at last I fell into sleep returning once more to my laboratory.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Once back, I fled into the streets, arriving home in the dead of night. Bursting through my daughter''s bedroom, I woke her and hugged her tight, shaking and crying as I did so. Promising that I would never, ever, let her go again.', '', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[321]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1846, 'ShaperMemoryFragment8', '[]', 'Months have now passed since my horrifying descent into that fox-hole, since the Shade revealed its true nature. Every day, the slimed and poisoned tendrils of fear grip ever tighter into my flesh, and each morning, I lock myself inside my study, delving into the darkest tomes one can find, searching for some infernal, occult knowledge that might save us from the thing I fled.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
I''d almost given up hope, so little did I really know about the Shade and its "dreamlands". That is, until this morning when a shipment arrived for me from Eramir, a scholar whom I greatly admire. Sifting through the countless fragments of parchments and books he has sent me, I have found at last, some information which could be of some use.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
These Watchers of Decay did indeed exist at one time in our world''s distant past, and now, I''ve some of their work! The truth of their history... it''s... it is so unutterable that I hesitate even now, to write it down, to put the words to my own journal. Yet I am an Arkhon and us Arkhons record all...', '', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[321]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1847, 'ShaperMemoryFragment9', '[]', 'They called it the Elder. A creature of malignant madness, born of that oblivion from before time itself began. Once only an abstract expression, the Elder was given physical form. It entered our realm. It fashioned for itself a bauble of chaos and secret worlds to use as a kind of... hunting ground. This "bauble" is undoubtedly the dreamlands I''ve uncovered. ' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
The Elder came here out of hunger. Preferring victims of a younger flesh, it became the bogeyman, dragging our children off into the night, casting them into its realm of shadow and feasting upon their nightmares undisturbed, for it was imagination that truly satiated it.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
With such sustenance, the Elder deigned to cultivate something. To... sustain and birth forth its true goal. Its true self. The Oblivion from outside time and space. The Decay. ' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
By the gods... Even now as I write this, I feel my hand trembling, and I struggle to keep my mind on the task ahead... The Elder. It cannot be killed. The Watchers, they built the device, so as to travel to and lock tight its kingdom of torment, bringing with them the blade I saw – Starforge – it was called. A weapon capable of divorcing agency from form, to give the Elder a kind of eternal rest... There in its den, amongst the gibbering nightmares of child victims, the Elder became trapped. Starved. Unable to hunt. Held in ungodly chains. ' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
The Elder''s form may be trapped in stone. But its agency roams free. I have met it. What if someone else were to enter the dreamlands and encounter the Shade? What if Venarius...? My meeting with the Elder, must have invigorated and refreshed its fervour. I must find a way to put a stop to it, before it finds a path to freedom. If not for my own sake, then for that of my daughter...', '', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[321]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1848, 'ShaperMemoryFragment10', '[]', 'Time has passed since my last entry, of that I am aware. I''ve spent every waking hour since, trying to find a way to end this unholy Elder, though nothing has, yet, fit.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Within my secret study, I''ve begun work on a device of my own. Whereas the Watcher''s map device was designed to enter and lock tight the Elder''s pocket dimension, my machine is of a different nature, though not entirely dissimilar.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Day and night, I have toiled away, tinkering and shaping this invention. When I''m finished, this Elder will never bother our world again. The creature cannot be killed, and divorcing its spirit from its body has not kept it silent, but maybe... just maybe... It can be exiled...', '', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[321]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1849, 'ShaperMemoryFragment11', '[]', 'How could I have been so stupid? So caught up in this whole nightmare that I forgot my work as an Arkhon! My "supposed" lack of progress on the Map Device has given the High Templar cause for suspicion.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
At noon, as I neared the completion of my work, he and his guards interrupted my tinkering with a furious rage! Tossing my machine to the ground, he destroyed much of my research, demanding to know why I no longer focused on the task given to me. Clapped in irons I was led off to the Theopolis prisons for my insubordination.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
I write this now, due only to the kindness of a friend in the Templar guard, he knows of my partiality to journaling and so as soon as he heard of my capture, managed to sneak in a diary for me scribble upon.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
I don''t know what Venarius plans to do with me. I''ve heard whispers of public shaming and lashes, but none of that is certain. What is certain, is that the Elder is coming for us. It''s coming for us all. No matter whether you are High Templar or the lowest of the Karui slaves, the Elder knocks at the threshold. Bringing Decay... I must find my way from these chains at all costs. Only I can save us from this blasphemy that has fallen upon Oriath...', '', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[321]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1850, 'ShaperMemoryFragment12', '[]', 'My daughter... My darling daughter... By the gods. So much has transpired since last I wrote. So much horror... I''ve not a moment to lose, but I need to... I have to... I must write down what has occurred. It''s the only way I shall keep my sanity. I believe I''m safe for the moment, so I shall rest and reflect, in the hope that it will give me new insight on how to proceed in this current disaster.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Venarius, that bastard... Enraged by my lack of progress on his occult weaponry, he marched me through the streets. "This man has betrayed me!" he shouted as his men stripped me of my robes and beat me with sticks. When I was but an inch from death, he took me aside once more, demanding to know why I''d failed him. In my... in my foolishness, I... I told him everything. ' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
I''d hoped to appeal to his better nature, to his higher self, that he might rally the Templar army behind me. Together we could defeat the Elder once and for all! But you should never appeal to a man''s better nature. He may not have one. Venarius... he... he took Zana! Held her at knife point. Demanded... demanded that I take all of us through, into the dreamlands - to meet with the Elder!' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Please, whoever you are, reading this – do not think wrong of me. If it were your daughter''s life at risk, would you have done this any differently? I... I did as I was asked. Using the Map Device, we stepped through a gateway and I found myself once more setting foot in this atlas of worlds...', '', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[321]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1851, 'ShaperMemoryFragment13', '[]', 'The land was as beautiful as it''d been when last I''d visited. The breeze rippled across the meadows and the sun beat affectionately down on our necks. The High Templar and his men marvelled at such wonders. My daughter cried in fear. I felt sick to my bones.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
As we trampled through the wilderness, it wasn''t long before we were met by the overwhelming presence of the Shade itself. The very essence of the Elder stood silently before us. I felt its eyes bore deep into my skin. Demanding of me in visions to tell it why I had returned. But before I could answer, Venarius stepped forward and greeted the phantom, offering his words up into the air:' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
"He tells me you are King of this land," he said, "My poor, poor scholar says that you are imprisoned, that you need a key." ' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
As he spoke, the shade stayed quiet, listening and smouldering smugly.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
"I can be that key for you." The High Templar announced.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
For a moment more, the Shade did not respond. A perverse, pensive, pregnant pause lay heavily upon us all. Then finally, casting an image at once upon all of our minds, we felt it ask of Venarius:' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
"What dost thou want?"' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
The High Templar smiled. "Why, power, of course." He replied.', '', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[321]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1852, 'ShaperMemoryFragment14', '[]', 'The shade spluttered into a great shimmering blaze, moving rapidly forward into trees up ahead. The High Templar gave chase, his soldiers dragging my daughter and I along behind. I recognized where we were headed. The forest was as dark as I remembered, and the cave, just as terrible. Before we knew it, we stood at the base of that blasphemous effigy seated atop its crude pagan altar.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
"Pull the sword from my chest."' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
The Elder imposed and the man, in all his vanity, didn''t hesitate for a second. He took the sword and yanked it forward. A great earthquake shook the land! It was as if the very ground itself was cowering in the face of the Elder''s reunion with its frigid body. ' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Bursting forth from cold stone, the Elder approached us all. The blade dropped from Venarius'' quivering hand and clattered to the ground, a white light in the hilt flickered and shrank until it at last was put out by the great darkness of a tentacular void.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Realizing what it meant to look upon its face, I turned and shielded my daughter''s eyes, and as the true scope of the Elder befell the High Templar and his men. I could hear screaming and mad gibbering! The Elder did not speak. Visions no longer left its mind. It was free. It had no need to communicate with mankind any longer.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
As the richness of life fled from the quickly shrivelling bodies of the High Templar and his men, I readied myself and my daughter to flee. While the Elder began to feed, starved from millennium upon millennium of constraint, I took up the Map Device Venarius had dropped and together, we ran...', '', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[321]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1853, 'ShaperMemoryFragment15', '[]', 'I fear this to be the end. Not just the end for me, but the end of all things. The Elder has been freed. Soon it will feast on me and then, my daughter. Once it has finished with us, it will turn its sights on the rest of the world.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Times will become as they were in the days of old, when the Watchers of Decay were formed. Children will go missing from their beds. Parents will mourn, darkness will descend, and then birthed from that carnage, the Decay will arrive, finding its physical form in our dimension – for that is the Elder''s true master! The fungal monstrosity will manifest and spread forth its mighty tendrils. The mould from before time and space began, will seek out the destruction of all things...' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
As we fled through the forest, I focused my resolve. It was too late for me. I knew of the shaping powers. Only I could have a hope at defeating the Elder. Preoccupied with its feast, the eldritch abomination had somehow forgotten us, and as we made our way back, retracing our steps, I found myself standing once more before the portal home. Not even stopping to look behind, I dove through the shimmering window, and together, we collapsed into Oriath.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
With not a minute to waste, I took a nearby tool and jammed it into the infernal device, where it hummed, ominously entrenched in my laboratory floor. The Elder had to be stopped, and so... I left her there, bidding her to hide in a closet or beneath a work table. Then, with the portal flickering and shrinking steadily, I turned back and stepped forward into the dreamlands, one final time.', '', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[321]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1854, 'ShaperMemoryFragment16', '[]', 'My dearest Zana,' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Where are you now? I hope, as a father often does, that you are happy and tucked away in the safest of places. I hope you grow up kind and strong, that you love and are loved. It is my life''s greatest regret that I will not see you again, but I must do what I can to protect you from the evils of this outer dark.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
I have failed against the Elder. To be honest, I never had a chance. The creature was too strong, too well versed in the shaping ways. If Venarius had not damaged the weapon I built, that day he arrested me in my study, then perhaps I could''ve opened a void, forced it from its physical shell and out of this reality. But I no longer possess such a device and the Elder has suckled at my mind so many times now, that I fear I could not remember how to rebuild it, even if I tried.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
My war with the creature is far from over however. I''ve no upper hand. But like a cornered animal, I will bite until I am gone. I''ve attempted to sleep and awaken in Oriath, many times. Hoped that one night I might get to hold you in my arms once again. But instead of my study, I dream of nothing. ' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
I know this letter might never reach you, but I write it anyway – if not for you, then for the sake of my own fragile wits. I love you my darling daughter, and hope the best for you, far away from all this... cosmic darkness. You''ve made me very proud, and I''ve considered each day a blessing that I''ve been able to call you my daughter...' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
I must keep moving. I must keep fighting. Perhaps one day, if the gods allow it, we shall see each other once more. I love you greatly.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Your Papa, Valdo Caeserius', '', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[321]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1855, 'ZanaArchitectQuest', '[]', 'These worlds, they''ve changed since last I remember. They''ve become darker, more... twisted in a way that betrays their true origin.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
I no longer believe these are realms of chance, rather, they must have been formulated by a sentient mind... a designer or architect. Every shadow in this place creeps about with an unforeseen purpose.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Whatever is out there forming these worlds concerns me. We should find the source of the darkness and put an end to it before something leaks out into our reality.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Zana/Z3_04.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[125,177,178,180,323,324,379,385,386,416,417]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1856, 'ZanaArchitectComplete', '[]', 'I''ve not been entirely honest... I''d suspected my father was involved in all this, now this memory fragment proves his engagement in ways I hadn''t anticipated... I''m sorry for keeping the truth from you. I was worried that, had you known the truth, you would not have followed me into this nightmare... ' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Let''s start over. I need your help. My memory is cloudy, but I''ll tell you all I can recall. When I was a child, my father and I, we were... separated. I was told he was lost to that unearthly realm when the Atlas closed, and the men who feared it took it apart. I spent my whole life trying to track down its pieces and repair his machine. A few years ago, I did just that. But now that we''ve found him, something is not right... My father was a kind, temperate man. A good person and a loving human being. Nothing like that... thing you just saw!' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Please, take this. I found it while exploring. Hopefully it will help smooth things over... and if you continue to help me, I promise I''ll find a way to make it all worth your while.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Zana/Z3_06.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[125,177,178,180,323,324,379,385,386,416,417]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1857, 'ZanaShaperClue', '[]', 'That creature you encountered out in the maps, he was... shaping things. Perhaps he''s the architect we seek.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
There was something off about him exile, something I can''t place... Perhaps... no. This "Shaper" may have the answers.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Continue in your explorations, track this mystery man down once more and question him, so that we might be able to learn what exactly these worlds are for.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Zana/Z3_05.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[125,177,178,180,323,324,379,385,386,416,417]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1858, 'ZanaOnWatchersOfDecay', '[]', 'I''m sure you''ve noticed as much as I have, exile, that you, me, and my father... we are not the first people to have set foot in this world. There are signs of the Elder''s victims everywhere, as well as memories and references to those who first stood against it.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
The Watchers of Decay. A sect we could perhaps learn a great deal from. While you''ve busied yourself cutting through the swarms of abominations, I took some time to explore my Father''s Laboratory once more in search of any references he might have collected regarding these "Watchers." Though I couldn''t ascertain anything relating to them in our modern age, there were some remaining scrolls hidden beneath the floorboards that detailed this group as having existed far back in the smoke of history.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
The Watchers claim to have gotten their start when a nameless god of Wraeclast endowed an Azmeri mother with knowledge of the Elder''s existence. She had lost her boy to it months before, you see, and sought revenge. Somehow the god saw it fit to help the woman in her quest. Perhaps he took pity on her? Or did he consider the knowledge a curse?', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Zana/Z3_11.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[125,177,178,180,323,324,379,385,386,416,417]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1859, 'ZanaMemoryEaterQuest', '[]', 'This... thing, it appears to have been feeding on my father''s memories. Should it eat its fill, he will be merely a hollowed out husk... A wraith and nothing more. Unless... If we were to locate more of these memory fragments, then perhaps we could restore his mind to him and free him from this nightmare. ' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
This other creature complicates things however... It is alien, yet to me, it seems somehow familiar, like a bad dream once forgotten. All I remember is a sense of malevolent dread... ' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
It must be stopped, whatever it is. It seems to bleed Decay into the surrounding areas. If that voracious... mould that grows from its very shadow were to ever find its way into Oriath or Wraeclast... We cannot let that happen.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Zana/Z3_08.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[125,177,178,180,323,324,379,385,386,416,417]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1860, 'ZanaMemoryEaterComplete', '[]', 'This... this should be enough. If he is to remember anything that might help, the story of how he got here is what we require. Thank you for finding these, exile. I can''t imagine it was an easy task.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
We must now try restore them to my father''s mind. In the meantime, here - take this. I found it while doing my own investigations into this world. See it as a reward for your labour.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Zana/Z3_10.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[125,177,178,180,323,324,379,385,386,416,417]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1861, 'ZanaOnElder', '[]', 'It appears my Father encountered this "Elder" sometime before his entrapment in its lair. Many of his most recent diaries make reference to the creature and his learnings around it. There wasn''t much, just second-hand myths from the research journals of the Watchers of Decay. ' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
One concept however, came up time and time again. This Elder is not a lord unto itself. It serves a greater master, or... a greater purpose... I''m unsure. It''s confusing; both my father and the Watchers refer to the Elder as "coming from the nothing" while also being "a carrier for the nothing." There are also mentions of an unholy desire to spoil and decay... perhaps it all relates somehow to those fungal growths we''ve seen in the maps...', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Zana/Z3_12.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[125,177,178,180,323,324,379,385,386,416,417]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1862, 'ZanaOnVictims', '[]', 'I''ve been doing more research into the Elder and its battle with the Watchers of Decay. It''s truly mortifying the things they''ve endured at the creature''s hands. ' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
These Watchers, they were all... parents. It seems the Elder prefers its prey young. These men and women fought tooth and nail to avenge their children, perhaps even succeeding for a time... But the Elder has been free for the better part of two decades. Its taste in food could explain the steady disappearance of children in the upper class of Oriath.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
What if those children are still here, in this place? Twisted, tormented creatures, clinging to whatever fragments of happy memories they''ve left... We must alleviate their sufferings.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Zana/Z3_16.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[125,177,178,180,323,324,379,385,386,416,417]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1863, 'ZanaRequiemQuest', '[]', 'Exile, it is time to make our move. We must save my father. These memories were sundered from his mind in a moment of great violence. I fear only great violence will provide us the opportunity to return them.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
I''ve scouted these worlds and I''m certain my father lies deep within the centre of the Atlas, but as suspected, he does not reside there unguarded. Four great brutes surround him, unpassable by me. If you were to go on ahead and remove those threats, then we will have a clear path to my father, and our little "operation" can begin.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Zana/Z3_15.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[125,177,178,180,323,324,379,385,386,416,417]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1864, 'ZanaRequiemQuestUpdate', '[]', 'The way is clear. Though our agenda won''t be without difficulty, exile. My father was a kind but stubborn man. If any of that stubbornness has survived, then restoring his memories will be no easy task. ' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
We must enter this new realm of shadows at the centre of the Atlas and beat his madness into submission. Only then will his mind be pliable enough to remember these fragments as they are returned to his flesh.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Zana/Z3_17.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[125,177,178,180,323,324,379,385,386,416,417]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1865, 'ZanaOnDeliveredMemoryFragment2', '[]', 'A fragment of my Father''s memory! Even then, the Atlas called to him. Please, take this for your help...', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Zana/Z3_34.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[125,177,178,180,323,324,379,385,386,416,417]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1866, 'ZanaOnDeliveredMemoryFragment3', '[]', 'Another fragment! So, like a temptress, the dreamlands seduced him... Oh, yes - forgive me. For you, Exile.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Zana/Z3_35.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[125,177,178,180,323,324,379,385,386,416,417]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1867, 'ZanaOnDeliveredMemoryFragment4', '[]', 'More memories! What is this Shade? Such things can''t exist in the real world, can they? Thank you Exile - here''s a little something for you.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Zana/Z3_36.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[125,177,178,180,323,324,379,385,386,416,417]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1868, 'ZanaOnDeliveredMemoryFragment5', '[]', 'This fragment, I remember! I saw how his work consumed him... Please, take this, and don''t be overwhelmed by this place.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Zana/Z3_37.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[125,177,178,180,323,324,379,385,386,416,417]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1869, 'ZanaOnDeliveredMemoryFragment6', '[]', 'Another memory! Could this Shade be the creature we saw? Here''s your bounty, now let''s continue our search!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Zana/Z3_38.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[125,177,178,180,323,324,379,385,386,416,417]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1870, 'ZanaOnDeliveredMemoryFragment7', '[]', 'A fragment I hold in memorial. I thought my bones would break, he held me so tight, whimpering into the night... Oh yes, here, for your efforts.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Zana/Z3_39.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[125,177,178,180,323,324,379,385,386,416,417]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1871, 'ZanaOnDeliveredMemoryFragment8', '[]', 'Ah yes, another memory. Uncle Eramir. I wonder, what ever happened to him? Perhaps with you in my pocket, we''ll soon find out?', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Zana/Z3_40.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[125,177,178,180,323,324,379,385,386,416,417]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1872, 'ZanaOnDeliveredMemoryFragment9', '[]', 'A memory I''m sure he would''ve preferred to forget. Ugh, a cold fear creeps through my very veins... Please, take this and let us be done with our quest!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Zana/Z3_41.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[125,177,178,180,323,324,379,385,386,416,417]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1873, 'ZanaOnDeliveredMemoryFragment10', '[]', 'A hopeful memory perhaps? I wonder what this invention of my fathers could be? Oh yes, here''s your reward.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Zana/Z3_42.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[125,177,178,180,323,324,379,385,386,416,417]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1874, 'ZanaOnDeliveredMemoryFragment11', '[]', 'Another sad fragment. Venarius was a cruel and petty master. Here''s a gift for a job well done.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Zana/Z3_43.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[125,177,178,180,323,324,379,385,386,416,417]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1875, 'ZanaOnDeliveredMemoryFragment12', '[]', 'More memories! I remember these things, as if they were half-painted images on canvas... Here, take your reward, now let''s get back to work.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Zana/Z3_44.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[125,177,178,180,323,324,379,385,386,416,417]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1876, 'ZanaOnDeliveredMemoryFragment13', '[]', 'Another fragment... That bastard... Here is what you are owed Exile, now let''s end this already. I am sick of remembering.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Zana/Z3_45.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[125,177,178,180,323,324,379,385,386,416,417]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1877, 'ZanaOnDeliveredMemoryFragment14', '[]', 'An important memory. It''s as if my mind has blacked out the horrific truth of these events... Your reward. Hopefully you''ll get some use out of this.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Zana/Z3_46.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[125,177,178,180,323,324,379,385,386,416,417]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1878, 'ZanaOnDeliveredMemoryFragment15', '[]', 'This... this should be enough. If he is to remember anything that might help, the story of how he got here is what we require. Thank you for finding these, exile. I can''t imagine it was an easy task.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
We must now try restore them to my father''s mind. In the meantime, here - take this. I found it while doing my own investigations into this world. See it as a reward for your labour.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Zana/Z3_10.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[125,177,178,180,323,324,379,385,386,416,417]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1879, 'ZanaOnTheShaper', '[]', 'It''s all a blur... My father was the chief Arkhon for High Templar Venarius - a cruel and pernicious ruler. Venarius wished to hold the world ransom with his occult relics from the rubble of Wraeclast, he believed they could venerate him even higher in his status. ' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
My father was forced to experiment on the map device for him, in hopes that he would uncover some kind of weapon. I don''t need to tell you that my father found something worthy of attention. And instead of handing it over, he made sure its power could not be misused, a surety that cost him his freedom and me... my childhood.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Zana/Z3_07.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[125,177,178,180,323,324,379,385,386,416,417]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1880, 'ZanaOnBookOfMemories', '[]', 'My father''s memories litter this place, like the first leaves of autumn. They may very well be the last precious things I have from him. I''ve stored them for safe keeping in a Book Of Memories back in the Laboratory. That way, even if we fail in our quest, I shall always have a record of his last acts. Feel free to have a look through them, should you find yourself there.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Zana/Z3_09.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[125,177,178,180,323,324,379,385,386,416,417]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1881, 'ZanaInTheShapersRealm', '[]', 'I think I understand it now... This Atlas, these maps... they aren''t so much worlds as they are like the performance stage in the Theopolis Amphitheatre. These worlds are merely disguises for what truly lies behind the curtain. ' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
This place... this is the nexus of the Elder''s worlds, the place from which all its hunting grounds are formed... We are close to the void from which it was birthed, yet my Father has chosen this as his home. Curious indeed. Hiding in plain sight perhaps? Though, what captain regularly frequents the bowels of his ship? Maybe the Elder rarely visits this place. It is busy, I suppose, hunting and feasting elsewhere in the maps... ' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Exile, I will ready my Father''s memories. You go on ahead, scout this place, find my Father, but be wary of what horrors might lurk down here in the belly of this evil machine.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Zana/Z3_18.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[180]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1882, 'ZanaInTheShapersRealmWithoutAllMemories', '[]', 'I think I understand now. This Atlas, these maps... they aren''t so much worlds as they are like the performance stage in the Theopolis Amphitheatre. These worlds are merely disguises for what truly lies behind the curtain. And here we are, brave explorers, peeking backstage. What treasures might we find here? What horrors?', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Zana/Z3_19.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[125,177,178,180,323,324,379,385,386,416,417]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1883, 'ZanaKillingShaperWithoutMemories', '[]', 'He''s been forced back for now, but without all the fragments of my father''s memories, he''ll never free him from his mental prison. Exile, please, let''s continue on this path. My father doesn''t deserve this. He should be at peace.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Zana/Z3_20.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[323]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1884, 'ZanaOnFathersMemories', '[]', 'His memories... of me... gone. Devoured by that abomination! Curse it! My Father will... he''ll never know me again. ' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
At least... At least I got to speak with him one last time. He recognized me. Did you see that, Exile? He knew my face! ...and now he''s in torment once again. ' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
If we cannot restore his memories, then we must free him from this prison. I can''t believe I am to ask this of you, but we must defeat this Elder. Perhaps with it gone, my Father will give up his ghost and be finally laid to rest.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Zana/Z3_26.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[125,177,178,180,323,324,379,385,386,416,417]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1885, 'ZanaShaperKeyQuest', '[]', 'What did you discover, exile? Ah! The key to his private study back in Oriath! If what he said is true, then there must be some kind of weapon inside that can stop this "Elder". And stop it, we must. ' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
I know I ask more than you''ve signed on for, but this creature - we''ve both seen the effects it has had on the maps. The Decay it spreads... that it births from its victims. If that Decay were to reach out of the maps, as I''m certain is its intention, all the world would be lost to those malignant spores! ' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Let us depart now, back to Theopolis and investigate this lead. Please, if there''s decency in you exile, meet me there when you''re ready and we shall begin to plot our attack.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Zana/Z3_27.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[125,177,178,180,323,324,379,385,386,416,417]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1886, 'ZanaShaperKeyQuestReward', '[]', 'You''re fast on your feet exile. I''m glad you have decided to stick through this with me. Look, it seems my concerns were... justified. The Decay we''ve seen throughout the Atlas, it''s here. Perhaps our activities in the Atlas might have weakened the barriers between this world and the maps. Without my Father''s full strength to keep it at bay, the Elder''s true master - Decay - is seeping through.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
I promised you a reward for helping me find my father, well here it is - an item from my Father''s secret study. Please, take it and stay on this journey with me - there is yet more we can accomplish together.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Zana/Z3_28.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[125,177,178,180,323,324,379,385,386,416,417]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1887, 'ZanaCosmicArcanaQuest', '[]', 'This is it. The device that can save us. "The Cosmic Arcana." With it, we can force the Elder from the maps and into the abstract of non-reality. The only catch? We must use it at the Atlas center. The nexus of worlds where the veil is the thinnest. ' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
That''s where you come in, Exile. I need you to lure the Elder into that place. I will use the weapon to remove it from our world. Keep your wits about you though, my father is still at large. He was weakened in that last battle, but knowing his current lunacy, I doubt he''s stopped fighting against the Elder. We must conduct this final effort with considerable care...', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Zana/Z3_29.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[125,177,178,180,323,324,379,385,386,416,417]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1888, 'ZanaOnCosmicArcana', '[]', 'I remember almost everything now about my Father''s studies into the map device. I remember how he locked himself away to work on this weapon. I''ve managed to read his notes on the weapon while I was waiting for you to arrive. The science is... incomprehensible at best. Nearest I can tell, the Arcana exhibits a blast of wrath once it has been fully charged, and when directed at the Elder will force it to take on the form it held before it entered our dimension. ' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
We know that form to be, as my father puts it, non-corporeal. In short - that which is not physical cannot exist in a dimension of physics. It will be forced out and back to where it belongs, hopefully unable to return. As I said, it is tenuous, but I trust my father, and this is the only hope we have.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Zana/Z3_30.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[125,177,178,180,323,324,379,385,386,416,417]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1889, 'ZanaBeforeFinalFight', '[]', 'It''s happening, isn''t it? The Elder is on its way. We are at the end of the road, Exile. Does it look off into success? Or does the horizon hold nothing but death and decay? I hope you''re ready, my friend.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
We need to weaken the creature before the Cosmic Arcana can do its job. I wish you luck, and should we not meet again... it''s been an honour to fight by your side.' || char(13) || '
', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Zana/Z3_31.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[178]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1890, 'ZanaAfterBanishingElder', '[]', 'We did it... It''s over... it''s finally over. My father, wherever he is, I can sense him. He''s at peace... Thank you, exile.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
The Arcana! It worked! And I wasn''t worried for a second! Though... The Elder and the Decay... Although we have banished them both, the encounter has... changed me somehow. I feel the creature, scratching at the skin between our dimensions. It''s desperate. It''s hungry. It''s... trying to find a way back in.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
I don''t think I''ll sleep again for a long while. I need to make sure we are prepared in case it returns. Perhaps I''ll restore the Watchers of Decay to guard our world... This place - the Atlas, is of the Elder. With more research it could give us further clues to the exact nature of the Decay. If you wish to, you''re free to study and explore these worlds alongside me. Perhaps you could still do some good in this place - the Elder''s victims - all those children... there must be thousands of them, wandering these lands, twisted and corrupted, alone - perhaps even afraid. Like my Father, they beg to be set free from their torment. Killing them would be an act of mercy. You could be an agent of that mercy, my friend.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
For now, I must leave you. I need to prepare for my next expedition.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Zana/Z3_33.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[324]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1891, 'ZanaOnResearch', '[]', 'I first started exploring the Atlas as a way to grow closer to my estranged father. I had no idea just how close I would get to him, though there was not much left of his mind by then...' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Looking back, I think I was overly optimistic about what the Atlas could mean for... well, for everyone. Imagine limitless worlds, limitless resources, limitless open space in which to live.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
But now I understand that it all comes at an insurmountable price. To dwell there is to leave yourself vulnerable to unspeakable madness. It''s inescapable and insidious. It taps into your greatest desires, offering you a glimpse of what might be, and that temptation... it''s all I could do to stop myself from falling into the same patterns as my friends...' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
The work we''re doing is important, but it''s also risky. Please, if you start to feel your sanity slip away, you need to tell me.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Zana/Z_Nov_25.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[133,306]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1892, 'ZanaOnReturnToOriath', '[]', 'I returned to Oriath with one of the early survivor fleets, excited to finally have the opportunity to put my knowledge to good use. During the rebuilding effort, we stumbled across the golden device -- a device I later learned once belonged to my father. ' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
I''d hoped that it might be useful in the resettlement effort at first, but when we discovered the Elder, it became clear that what lay beyond the device''s portals was more likely to harm than help. I assembled a team in absolute secrecy, comprised of exiles who had proved their combat know-how in Wraeclast, and set to work sealing the Elder away. We were successful. The relief I felt... it was indescribable. But...' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
The Atlas is a dangerous place. It assaults both body and mind. It makes Wraeclast seem positively tame. My team, my friends, they were deeply affected by the journey. The allure of power finally caused them to lose their grip on reality.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
And it was only a matter of time until I joined them.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Zana/Z_Nov_12.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[133,306]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1893, 'ZanaOnCorruption', '[]', 'I long thought corruption a phenomenon unique to Wraeclast, but you need only a passing glance at any one of the lands in the Atlas to see that something frighteningly similar, if not identical, has taken hold there. ' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Is it the corruption that is unique to Wraeclast, or is it the apparent lack of corruption elsewhere that''s truly the rarity? Instead of lamenting the cursed continent, perhaps we should be counting our uncorrupted blessings.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Zana/Z_Nov_26.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[133]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1894, 'ZanaMissionFindTheBreach', '[]', 'As if we didn''t have enough problems already, there''s something trying to tear a literal hole in the fabric of reality in this map. You need to stop it, or else I think our problems will continue to multiply.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Zana/Z_Nov_19.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[125]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1895, 'ZanaMissionKillHarbingers', '[]', 'This map contains certain inexplicable entities that we Elderslayers faced a few times. They appear to be the advance scouts of an invasion from some unknown realm. I strongly suggest you do not give them time to gain a foothold in the Atlas.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Zana/Z_Nov_20a.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[125]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1896, 'ZanaMissionCompleteAbyss', '[]', 'The area I''m sending you to was displaying some curious seismic activity. At first I thought it was a quirk of the location, but I could hear... movement... below my feet. Exile, please stabilise this location by destroying whatever it is that''s causing those tremors.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Zana/Z_Nov_21.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[125]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1897, 'ZanaMissionExtraShaperInfluence', '[]', 'Alas, though my father is no more, some of the maps continue to resonate with echoes of his presence. I know not what shape it may take, so be ready for anything.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Zana/Z_Nov_22.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[125]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1898, 'ZanaMissionExtraElderInfluence', '[]', 'We may have defeated the Elder, but there are still traces of whatever cosmic force it served. Be careful of the Decay. It lingers in this map, germinating unknown dangers, so stay on high alert.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Zana/Z_Nov_23.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[125]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1899, 'ZanaElderBossWarning', '[]', 'To me, exile! Quickly!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/ZanaCombat/Za92a.dialogue.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[178]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1900, 'ZanaElderBossComplete', '[]', 'So that was the Elder... what terrible, monstrous power! We must find a way to defeat it, exile. We seem to have driven it from this world. There must be a way to defeat it for good...', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Zana/Z3_14.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[125,177,178,180,323,324,379,385,386,416,417]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1901, 'ZanaShaperDefeat0_AudioOnly', '[]', '', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Zana/Z3_25.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[125,177,178,180,323,324,379,385,386,416,417]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1902, 'ZanaShaperDefeat1_NoAudio', '[]', 'Father! Are you alright?', '', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[180]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1903, 'ZanaShaperDefeat2_NoAudio', '[]', 'We''ll stop it. You and I...', '', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[180]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1904, 'ZanaShaperDefeat3_NoAudio', '[]', 'Father!', '', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[180]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1905, 'ZanaUberElderMid', '[]', 'Father, no!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/ZanaCombatNarrator/UberZana1.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[324]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1906, 'ZanaUberElderIntro', '[]', 'Exile, do something!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/ZanaCombatNarrator/UberZana2.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[324]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1907, 'ShaperUberElderMid', '[]', 'I may not remember... Ah!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/ShaperCombatNarrator/UberShaper1.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[181]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1908, 'ShaperUberElderIntro', '[]', 'Putrefy, rot, spoil and fester!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/ShaperCombatNarrator/UberShaper2.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[181]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1909, 'SinFinisher1_Innocence', '[]', 'Innocence!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Sin/S01a.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[187]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1910, 'SinFinisher2_Innocence', '[]', 'You and only you, I shall save.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Sin/S01b.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[187]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1911, 'SinFinisher1_Tukohama', '[]', 'Tukohama!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Sin/S19c_01.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[197]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1912, 'SinFinisher2_Tukohama', '[]', 'The soil wants for your blood no more.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Sin/S19c_02.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[197]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1913, 'SinFinisher1_Abberath', '[]', 'Abberath!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Sin/S23a.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[198]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1914, 'SinFinisher2_Abberath', '[]', 'At last your thirst is quenched.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Sin/S23b.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[198]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1915, 'SinFinisher1_Ryslatha', '[]', 'Ryslatha!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Sin/S27a.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[200]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1916, 'SinFinisher2_Ryslatha', '[]', 'Release this land to the will of its true children.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Sin/S27b.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[200]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1917, 'SinFinisher1_BrineKing', '[]', 'Tsoagoth!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Sin/S32a.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[201]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1918, 'SinFinisher2_BrineKing', '[]', 'Born of ocean''s mire, in death washed clean of dark desire.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Sin/S32b.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[201]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1919, 'SinFinisher1_Ralakesh', '[]', 'Ralakesh!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Sin/S39a.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[221]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1920, 'SinFinisher2_Ralakesh', '[]', 'Turn away the tyrant''s face and kingdom end without a trace.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Sin/S39b.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[221]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1921, 'SinFinisher1_Gruthkul', '[]', 'Gruthkul!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Sin/S43a.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[222]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1922, 'SinFinisher2_Gruthkul', '[]', 'Thus I release you from motherhood''s rage.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Sin/S43b.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[222]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1923, 'SinFinisher1_Arakaali', '[]', 'Arakaali!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Sin/S51a.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[223]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1924, 'SinFinisher2_Arakaali', '[]', 'Death is the true climax of perverted lust.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Sin/S51b.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[223]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1925, 'SinFinisher1_Yugul', '[]', 'Yugul!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Sin/S61a.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[239]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1926, 'SinFinisher2_Yugul', '[]', 'In death the mirrors are thus shattered.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Sin/S61b.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[239]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1927, 'SinFinisher1_SolarisLunaris', '[]', 'Solaris! Lunaris!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Sin/S71a.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[240]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1928, 'SinFinisher2_SolarisLunaris', '[]', 'Eclipse cold pride, flaming rage, and pass beyond this human age.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Sin/S71b.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[240]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1929, 'SinFinisher1_Shakari', '[]', 'Daughter!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Sin/S69a.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[291]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1930, 'SinFinisher2_Shakari', '[]', 'Rest, my child. Be free from the torments of immortality.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Sin/S69b.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[291]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1931, 'SinFinisher1_Garukhan', '[]', 'My love...', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Sin/S85a.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[290]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1932, 'SinFinisher2_Garukhan', '[]', 'You were too beautiful for this ugly world. I shall find you in the next.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Sin/S85b.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[290]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1933, 'EinharIntroductionQuest', '[]', 'That look in your eye... I recognise it. A survivor, just like Einhar.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
That is my name, exile. Einhar. In my native tongue it means ''lone fighter''. That is what Einhar was for many years.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
But it is dangerous now to fight alone. Too dangerous, even for the mighty Einhar. We are in the final days of this world, exile. Of that, I am sure. We survivors must unite, prepare for the end, and delay its arrival as long as we can. ' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
For that we will need supplies. Weapons. Shelter. Food. ' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
The others here do not understand me the way you do. Meet me in the Riverways, and Einhar will explain what must be done.', '', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[174]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1934, 'EinharIntroduction', '[]', 'That look in your eye... I recognise it. A survivor, just like Einhar.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
That is my name, exile. Einhar. In my native tongue it means ''lone fighter''. That is what Einhar was for many years.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
But it is dangerous now to fight alone. Too dangerous, even for the mighty Einhar. We are in the final days of this world, exile. Of that, I am sure. We survivors must unite, prepare for the end, and delay its arrival as long as we can. ' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
For that we will need supplies. Weapons. Shelter. Food. This is where you come in.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Einhar/EF_01.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[174,172,175]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1935, 'EinharFirstMissionStart', '[]', 'This land is dying. But even a rotting carcass has its uses, yes? ' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Then it is settled. We will make rotting carcasses, and use them to produce the tools we will need to survive.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
But only the finest rotting carcasses will do. Einhar is not picky, but I cannot say the same for the First Ones. There are a few beasts nearby, exile. Special beasts. We will find them. We will fight them. I will catch them. You will enjoy the fruits of my labour. We will be best friends!' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Now, let''s hunt. Together!', '', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[174]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1936, 'EinharFirstMissionComplete', '[]', 'You have shown Einhar that you are indeed a survivor, and you have given the First Ones their first gift. So now, a gift for you. ' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
I do not look like an artist, but I am an artist all the same. Look. When you catch a beast, Einhar will note it down. A little picture. Some words. When the world ends, we will need to have books. Information is needed to survive. To stave off the boredom and madness. To learn how to rebuild. You will help me fill it out, yes?', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Einhar/EF-V2.15.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[172,173,174,175,176]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1937, 'EinharOozebackBloom', '[]', 'Shh. Einhar has something important to tell you. You will listen carefully, yes?' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
There are many rhoas here, but there is only one Oozeback Bloom. He is a mighty rhoa. Old. And strong. And dangerous. He reeks. He will make a fine gift for the First Ones.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Find Oozeback Bloom. Weaken him. Capture him. I will take him to the Menagerie. I will find a use for his back ooze. Maybe it is explosive. Maybe it is hallucinogenic.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Remember, Exile, a strong beast will escape. A weak beast may join our Menagerie.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Einhar/EF-17.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[172,173,174,175,176]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1938, 'EinharOozebackBloomComplete', '[]', 'Great job, exile! Oozeback Bloom now sits in his cage in the Menagerie. Come with me to the Menagerie. I will show you.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Einhar/EF-V2.1.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[172,173,174,175,176]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1939, 'EinharThirdMission', '[]', 'I knew you would pass this way, Exile. Einhar is smarter than he looks, yes?' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
There are more powerful beasts nearby. The Burning Menace. A hellion like no other. I will need a special cage for this one, maybe. She is surely explosive. I hope.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
But there is another as well. Ungulath. Beware, survivor. It commands the very skies. ' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
These beasts make Oozeback look like Dryback. You will need special nets for these. Strong nets. Here. I have made them. Einhar is well prepared. ' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Use these strong nets. Catch these strong beasts. Perform strong rituals. Gain strong blessings!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Einhar/EF-V2.6.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[172,173,174,175,176]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1940, 'EinharOnBurningMenace', '[]', 'The menace is now mine to worry about... At least until you wish to sacrifice it. This Hellion will be waiting for you in the Menagerie. Visit it before you kill it, if you want.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Einhar/EF-V2.7.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[172,173,174,175,176]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1941, 'EinharOnUngulath', '[]', 'Einhar does not like the goats that walk like men. I will be glad to see this one sacrificed. So will the First Ones. It will be waiting in the Menagerie for you.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Einhar/EF-V2.8.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[172,173,174,175,176]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1942, 'EinharMission1', '[]', 'Einhar is pleased to see you again, survivor. I have tracked another beast. It is time to catch it. I will help. You are ready, yes?', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Einhar/EF-09a.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[172,173,174,175,176]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1943, 'EinharMission2', '[]', 'Einhar''s trap is baited and the animal is close. Help me catch it. The First Ones are watching, Survivor. Show them you are ready.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Einhar/EF-09b.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[172,173,174,175,176]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1944, 'EinharOnMenagerie', '[]', 'It will surprise you to learn that I am not popular. The others here are ignorant. They do not see the end coming. They are not survivors like me... Or you.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Before we met, I kept beasts in the encampment. They got into the grain, then the meat. They were not as picky as Einhar about where they did their business. I learned that Rhoas do not digest Rhoa meat very well.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
So I moved them to a new location. The Menagerie. Far away. It is a secret place. This is where we will perform the ritual for the First Ones. I have built a Blood Altar for such a purpose.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Do you wish to see it? Tell Einhar. You will be taken there.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Einhar/EF-10.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[174,172,175,173]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1945, 'EinharOnBestiary', '[]', 'I do not look like an artist, but I am an artist all the same. Look. When you catch a beast, Einhar will write about it. A little picture. Some words. When the world ends, we will need to have books. Information is needed to survive. To stave off the boredom and madness. To learn how to rebuild. You will help me fill it out.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Einhar/EF-11.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[172,173,174,175,176]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1946, 'EinharBloodAltarQuest', '[]', 'The arena just north... That is the Blood Altar. It is where you will perform the ritual of Sacrifice by Combat. ' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Once you have captured a few beasts, go to the altar in the middle and begin the ritual! The First Ones are watching. Show them you are worthy!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Einhar/EF-V2.4.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[176]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1947, 'EinharBloodAltarComplete', '[]', 'Hahaha! The crunch of bone, the splatter of blood... Is there anything as satisfying? You have proved you are a survivor, and the First Ones have rewarded you. ' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Capture more beasts. Perform more rituals. This is what we will do, yes?' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
The First Ones have many blessings to bestow. We will discover them.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Now go, survivor. More beasts await.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Einhar/EF-V2.5.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[176]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1948, 'EinharOnBloodAltar', '[]', 'The end is coming, exile. Of that, I am sure.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
...Just not so sure when. Maybe tomorrow? Maybe three years from now. No more than three years from now. ' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
When the end arrives, we must be ready. The First Ones will return. They will bring the survivors with them to the Great Grove. We must prove we are worthy. We must sacrifice the beasts we find at the Blood Altar. ' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Feed the altar the blood of these beasts, and the First Ones will bless us. And, perhaps, reveal to us their secrets.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Einhar/EF-12.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[176]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1949, 'EinharOnEinhar', '[]', 'You want to know Einhar''s past? That is Einhar''s business. No one else''s.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Einhar/EF-13.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[174,172,176]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1950, 'EinharOnFirstOnes', '[]', 'They were the first survivors. The First Ones showed my people that to win, you must outlast. They left this world long ago to seek other survivors, but they will return. And when they do, I will join them in the Great Grove. And you will join Einhar, yes? Yes.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Einhar/EF-14.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[174,172,176]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1951, 'EinharOnReward', '[]', 'You want me to give you a reward? You misunderstand, exile. This <i>{is} the reward. You have a beast now! That is reward enough, yes?', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Einhar/EF-V2.17.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[172,173,174,175,176]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1952, 'EinharOnTrading', '[]', 'Not all beasts were born equal, survivor. The First Ones look upon some captures and sacrifices more fondly than others. You may not even deem some beasts worthy of sacrifice! ' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Do not worry. Einhar has imbued some Orbs with powerful blood magic. You can use these Bestiary Orbs on any beast in the Menagerie and the beast will be bound to the Orb. Then you can do whatever you want with it. Give it to a handsome man like Einhar, maybe? You cannot tell, but I am very handsome under this mask.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Once a Bestiary Orb contains a beast, you can use it again to release the creature to the Menagerie. Be careful, though, it will break the Orb.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Einhar/EF-V2.18.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[174,172,176]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1953, 'EinharOnFishing', '[]', 'Exile, this is a beautiful catch indeed. But Einhar cannot keep this one. Krillson would kill me in my sleep. He seems so gentle, but you know what they say about still waters. They will kill you in your sleep.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Einhar/EF-V2.16.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[172,173,174,175,176]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1954, 'EinharOnSaqawal', '[]', 'During a cold winter, Einhar camped on a mountain. I have many furs to keep me warm in the cold. ... I did not bring them. But I did have Rhoa ooze. While sipping warm ooze, Einhar had a vision. A lizard, feathered and crimson, watching from shadows of shadows. ' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
An avatar of the First Ones. A test. Saqawal, First of the Sky. In my cup, ooze swirled. Another vision, in the blood of the birds and reptiles. It is lucky I had so much to drink that night, or else this secret may have remained a secret.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Find many birds and reptiles, Exile. The path to the First of the Sky is in their blood.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Einhar/EF-V2.9.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[174,172,175,176]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1955, 'EinharOnFarrul', '[]', 'Years ago, Einhar was wandering the fields near Sarn in search of a worthy Survivor. I did not find one. Then I did not find water. Then I did not find shelter. This was a learning moment for Einhar. ' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Beneath the hot sun, Einhar saw a swirl of red and white. A flash of teeth. Farrul, First of the Plains, an Avatar of the First Ones. I pursued it, and as night fell, so did I... right into a Hellion pit. I drank my fill of Hellion blood that night. That is how I learned I do not like Hellion blood. ' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
It is also how I learned that Farrul''s secrets lie in the blood of hounds, cats, and others of warm blood. Go, find many, and we will find Farrul.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Einhar/EF-V2.10.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[174,172,175,176]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1956, 'EinharOnCraiceann', '[]', 'Einhar has many talents. You will learn. I sailed to Wraeclast alone, a risky and brave feat. You are impressed, yes?' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
My boat was small and not well prepared for the journey. Then my ship ran aground... but there was no ground. Very confusing. Water all around, but the ship could not move. My food spoiled quickly. I am very good at fishing. I will have to show you how some time... maybe. I caught many fish. And crabs. And squid. I ate very well, but there was little water. I had booze. I threw the scraps to the sea.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Then... the ship moved. Lifted. I looked aft. A crab, massive and red, stood on a lone rock, covered in my scraps. It was Craiceann, an Avatar of the First ones.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Einhar knows the secret of Craiceann. It lies in the bellies of the sea creatures. Find them, and we will see Craiceann again.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Einhar/EF-V2.11.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[174,172,175,176]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1957, 'EinharOnFenumus', '[]', 'Einhar is a brave explorer. The secret to my bravery? I do not think. One day I did not think as I went into a cave. It was very brave. But then I got lost. It was dark. I did not think, so I did not think to bring a torch.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
I walked in total darkness by touch until... a light. Then two. Then many! So many lights! I got closer and closer. The lights got brighter and brighter. Then... I slipped. I fell very far. Einhar was sure he was dead. But then I was caught... in a web. The lights moved and swirled. Insects. And in front of them was a shadow of a spider. Fenumus... An Avatar of the First Ones. ' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Her web was strong, but Einhar''s blade was stronger. I cut myself free. Into the river below. Washed to shore. A fun adventure.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
The path to Fenumus is in the blood of bugs. Spiders. Insects. Carrion queens. Get them, and Fenumus will follow.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Einhar/EF-V2.12.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[174,172,175,176]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1958, 'EinharMenagerieUnlocked', '[]', 'You have collected many beasts. Einhar is pleased. Now we must please the First Ones. We will go to the Menagerie. Come.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Einhar/EF-15.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[172,173,174,175,176]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1959, 'EinharWildAttentionA', '[]', 'Exile! You are a welcome omen.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Einhar/EF-03a.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[174]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1960, 'EinharWildAttentionB', '[]', 'We are at the end of days, exile.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Einhar/EF-03b.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[172,173,174,175,176]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1961, 'EinharBeastCapture1', '[]', 'Haha! You are captured, stupid beast.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Einhar/EF-20a.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[172,173,174,175,176]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1962, 'EinharBeastCapture2', '[]', 'You have been captured, beast. You will be a survivor, or you will be food.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Einhar/EF-20b.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[172,173,174,175,176]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1963, 'EinharBeastCapture3', '[]', 'This one is captured. Einhar will take it.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Einhar/EF-20c.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[172,173,174,175,176]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1964, 'EinharSpecialBeastCapture1', '[]', 'Great job, Exile! Einhar will take the captured beast to the Menagerie.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Einhar/EF-21a.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[172,173,174,175,176]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1965, 'EinharSpecialBeastCapture2', '[]', 'The First Ones look upon this capture with pride, Exile. You hunt well.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Einhar/EF-21b.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[172,173,174,175,176]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1966, 'EinharSpecialBeastCapture3', '[]', 'Survivor! You are well prepared for the end. This is a fine capture.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Einhar/EF-21c.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[172,173,174,175,176]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1967, 'EinharBeastcraftStart1', '[]', 'The First Ones are watching, survivor. Don''t disappoint them!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Einhar/EF-22a.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[172,173,174,175,176]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1968, 'EinharBeastcraftStart2', '[]', 'Prove to the First Ones you are worthy, Exile!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Einhar/EF-22b.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[172,173,174,175,176]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1969, 'EinharBeastcraftSuccess1', '[]', 'The ritual... is complete!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Einhar/EF-23a.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[172,173,174,175,176]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1970, 'EinharBeastcraftSuccess2', '[]', 'You are truly a survivor!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Einhar/EF-23b.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[172,173,174,175,176]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1971, 'EinharDismiss', '[]', 'You know where to find Einhar.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Einhar/EF-19.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[172,173,174,175,176]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1972, 'EinharEpicPoem', '[]', 'Some beasts are yellow, ' || char(13) || '
Some beasts are red, ' || char(13) || '
All beasts are stupid,' || char(13) || '
But useful when dead.', '', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[174]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1973, 'AlvaIntroduction', '[]', 'Thank the gods! You''re no saint, I can see that. Though who am I to question what form divine providence comes in?' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
I am the great Alva Valai! Reliquarian extraordinaire, seeker of mysteries, explorer of the unknown, lover of all things that glitter - and I need your help.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
The lost Temple of Atzoatl; Halls lined with finery, boxes stuffed with glimmering riches and relics touched by insurmountable power! For eons lost to history... until now.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Alva/AV_00.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[329]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1974, 'AlvaTemplePortalRandom', '[]', 'Let''s begin.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Alva/AV21_A_1.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[328,329,331,344,330]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1975, 'AlvaTemplePortal2', '[]', 'Let''s begin.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Alva/AV21_A_2.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[328,329,331,344]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1976, 'AlvaTemplePortal3', '[]', 'Let''s go.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Alva/AV21_B_1.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[328,329,331,344]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1977, 'AlvaTemplePortal4', '[]', 'Let''s go.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Alva/AV21_B_2.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[328,329,331,344]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1978, 'AlvaTemplePortal5', '[]', 'Get ready.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Alva/AV21_C_1.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[328,329,331,344]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1979, 'AlvaTemplePortal6', '[]', 'Get ready.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Alva/AV21_C_2.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[328,329,331,344]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1980, 'AlvaTemplePortal7', '[]', 'Let''s make history.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Alva/AV21_D_1.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[328,329,331,344]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1981, 'AlvaTemplePortal8', '[]', 'Let''s make history.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Alva/AV21_D_2.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[328,329,331,344]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1982, 'AlvaTimeLoop', '[]', 'We found the temple, but our job isn''t done. Vaal corruption has tangled time and space, and there''s much to be gained by delving deeper.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
We could learn vast amounts by experiencing more time cycles and seeing every possible outcome! We''re back where we started, but that also means we have a fresh opportunity to forge Atzoatl exactly as we please - and reap its rewards.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Alva/AV24.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[328]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1983, 'AlvaWildAttention', '[]', 'Just in time.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Alva/AV14_C.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[328,329,331,344,330]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1984, 'AlvaWrongCharacter', '[]', 'Sorry, exile. I''m busy.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Alva/AV27_A.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[328,329]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1985, 'AlvaNotifyHideout', '[]', 'You''ve found yourself a hideout! Could be a good staging ground once we''ve found the temple in the present-day. Let me know if you''ve got space for me.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Alva/AV33_A.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[344,328]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1986, 'AlvaJoinHideout', '[]', 'Great! I''ll see you there.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Alva/AV33_B.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[344,328]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1987, 'AlvaDismissHideout', '[]', 'Another time, perhaps?', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Alva/AV34.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[328,329,331,344]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1988, 'AlvaGeneralFailure', '[]', 'Something''s not right. Come back later?', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Alva/AV28.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[328,329,331,344]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1989, 'AlvaPortalRandom', '[]', 'It''s time!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Alva/AV29_A_1.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[328,329,331,344,330]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1990, 'AlvaPortal2', '[]', 'It''s time!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Alva/AV29_A_2.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[328,329,331,344]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1991, 'AlvaPortal3', '[]', 'Let''s go.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Alva/AV29_B_1.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[328,329,331,344]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1992, 'AlvaPortal4', '[]', 'Let''s go.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Alva/AV29_B_2.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[328,329,331,344]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1993, 'AlvaPortal5', '[]', 'Time to go.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Alva/AV29_C_1.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[328,329,331,344]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1994, 'AlvaPortal6', '[]', 'Time to go.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Alva/AV29_C_2.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[328,329,331,344]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1995, 'AlvaIncursionCongratsRandom', '[]', 'Good job.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Alva/AV14_A.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[328,329,331,344,330]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1996, 'AlvaIncursionCongrats2', '[]', 'Good job, exile.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Alva/AV14_B.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[328,329,331,344]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1997, 'AlvaTempleArrival', '[]', 'No wonder it''s lost. It''s in the middle of the jungle! Shouldn''t be too far from here though.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/AlvaModern/AV30.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[331]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1998, 'AlvaTempleArrivalRepeat', '[]', 'Hmm... dust and rot. Smells like... treasure. We''re close. Time to make history!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/AlvaModern/AV25.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[331]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(1999, 'AlvaTempleEntranceArrival', '[]', 'At last... Atzoatl.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/AlvaModern/AV31.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[331]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100);
INSERT INTO "NPCTextAudio" ("_row", "Id", "Characters", "Text", "Mono_AudioFile", "Stereo_AudioFile", "HasStereo", "__col6", "Video", "__col8", "__col9", "__col10", "NPCs", "NPCPortrait", "__col13", "__col14", "Cooldown", "__col16") VALUES
(2000, 'AlvaBossFightRandom', '[]', 'Time to fight!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/AlvaModern/AV32_A.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[331]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2001, 'AlvaBossFight2', '[]', 'No risk, no reward!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/AlvaModern/AV32_B.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[331]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2002, 'AlvaBossFight3', '[]', 'This better be worth it!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/AlvaModern/AV32_C.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[331]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2003, 'AlvaBossFight4', '[]', 'You better be filled with gold!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/AlvaModern/AV32_D.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[331]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2004, 'AlvaAboutAlva', '[]', 'When I was young, my father gave me my first call to adventure by enlisting me in the employ of Dominus'' navy. I used to love the sea. The way it smelled. The freshness of the air... but, some ''stuff'' happened and I returned to Theopolis, intent on living a ladies life. Ha, it was not to be, obviously. ' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
My lust for excitement brought me to the Reliquarians - a secret society of treasure hunters, funded by those cold and greedy societal uppercrusts. I had my father pull some strings and before I knew it, I was amongst it all, raiding temples and tombs across the land. But, well... you''re an exile, you know how the Templars are. Untrustworthy is one way to describe them. When I came across a manual of Vaal blood thaumaturgy, I knew I couldn''t let it fall into their hands. And it never did. ' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Though that damned High Templar knew I was keeping something secret... And so, no longer welcome amongst the nobility, here I am. Luckily there''s a fortune to be made here and a few of my old clients still remain loyal to me when it comes to spending what they have inside their purses.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Alva/AV36.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[344,328,329]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2005, 'AlvaAboutTemple', '[]', 'The lost Temple of Atzoatl is said to be the most famed in all Vaal history and myth. Best I can tell, the Temple began its construction in the final years of the Vaal Empire. The exact date of its completion has been hard to ascertain as it occurred shortly before the events which brought about the civilisation''s extinction.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Perhaps it is the fragility of the timeline that has made Atzoatl such a staple of Vaal mythology. Some say it was a place of darkness, home to the most vile of sacrifices. But there are others who claim the temple to be the birthplace of technology - even our own is said to pale in comparison to what was being forged within those walls.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Scholars today have even suggested that it was the treasure house for Queen Atziri herself. Whichever is true, it was bound to have been fiercely protected by fanatics and royalty alike. And if something''s worth protecting, well, then it''s worth bloody taking!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Alva/AV37.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[344,328,329]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2006, 'AlvaAboutOriath', '[]', 'Well, most of my market no longer exists... but, I''m an adaptable type, and there are plenty of pirates, thieves, tyrants and nutters who will pay good coin for my finds.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
I may just have to do a little extra legwork to find ''em.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Alva/AV38.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[344,328,329]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2007, 'AlvaTempleFeature_PoisonRoomIII', '[]', 'Maybe they''d not have killed so many of each other if they''d grown fruit instead.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/AlvaModern/AV119.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[328]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2008, 'AlvaTempleFeature_SacrificeRoomIII', '[]', 'So many dead... Let''s please not end up like that.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/AlvaModern/AV121.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[328]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2009, 'AlvaTempleFeature_StormRoomIII', '[]', 'There was so much potential for good here. What a waste.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/AlvaModern/AV122.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[328]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2010, 'AlvaTempleFeature_TrapRoomIII', '[]', 'Remind me again why you let them fill this place with traps?', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/AlvaModern/AV123.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[328]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2011, 'AlvaTempleFeature_CartographyRoomIII', '[]', 'Madness spread. These maps, all the places on them... None of them exist!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/AlvaModern/AV108.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[328]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2012, 'AlvaTempleFeature_QueensChambersIII', '[]', 'How is this possible!? She should be long dead!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/AlvaModern/AV120.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[328]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2013, 'AlvaTempleFeature_ChestsIII', '[]', 'What a pack-rat! These relics will fetch a pretty penny back home!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/AlvaModern/AV109.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[328]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2014, 'AlvaTempleFeature_CorruptionRoomIII', '[]', 'Ugh... Something about this place feels... wrong.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/AlvaModern/AV110.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[328]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2015, 'AlvaTempleFeature_ExplosivesRoomIII', '[]', 'I suppose they wanted to use these explosives to mine more gems.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/AlvaModern/AV116.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[328]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2016, 'AlvaTempleFeature_ArmourRoomIII', '[]', 'You must''ve really shaken them, Exile. Look how much they wanted to protect themselves.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/AlvaModern/AV105.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[328]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2017, 'AlvaTempleFeature_WeaponRoomIII', '[]', 'For a relatively peaceful empire they sure made a lot of weapons.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/AlvaModern/AV125.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[328]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2018, 'AlvaTempleFeature_BreedingRoomIII', '[]', 'They trained an army. But why? To protect from you?', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/AlvaModern/AV107.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[328]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2019, 'AlvaTempleFeature_BreachRoomIII', '[]', 'From crimson blood to purple flame, this cult must be put to rest.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/AlvaModern/AV106.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[328]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2020, 'AlvaTempleFeature_GemRoomIII', '[]', 'Goodness, if Chitus had ever found these... he''d have been unstoppable.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/AlvaModern/AV117.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[328]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2021, 'AlvaTempleFeature_CurrencyVaultIII', '[]', 'By the gods... Exile, you''re a genius.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/AlvaModern/AV111.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[328]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2022, 'AlvaTempleFeature_TrinketRoomIII', '[]', 'I''m not one for stereotypes, but damn, I do love jewellery.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/AlvaModern/AV124.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[328]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2023, 'AlvaTempleFeature_WorkshopIII', '[]', 'Colour me impressed, Exile. This is elaborate.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/AlvaModern/AV126.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[328]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2024, 'AlvaTempleFeature_EmpoweringRoomIII', '[]', 'I just got goosebumps.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/AlvaModern/AV115.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[328]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2025, 'AlvaTempleFeature_HealingRoomIII', '[]', 'The waters look clean enough. Couldn''t pay me to drink it, though.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/AlvaModern/AV118.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[328]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2026, 'AlvaTempleFeature_BossMinionsIII', '[]', 'Oh gods, eggs everywhere! Why would you want this, exile!?', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/AlvaModern/AV112.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[328]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2027, 'AlvaTempleFeature_BossFireIII', '[]', 'Whew... I''m sweating like a hog in heat.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/AlvaModern/AV113.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[328]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2028, 'AlvaTempleFeature_BossLightningIII', '[]', 'What on earth did they need this much energy for?', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/AlvaModern/AV114.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[328]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2029, 'AlvaTempleFeature_LegionRoomIII', '[]', 'Careful Exile... Something unseen still dwells here.', '', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[328]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2030, 'NikoIntro', '[]', 'Seems like the rain''s brought out a few worms! Don''t think I''m an easy mark, exile. I''ve spent more than enough time around exiles to know which way the dagger''s pointing, and I''ll happily give it a shove in your direction if you try anything... wormy. ' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
I''m conducting a little dig... The sort of enterprise that could make someone with your particular ''skill set'' a very handsome living. Don''t worry, you''ll not be moving much dirt. No, no... Why smash rocks when you could smash skulls, eh?', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Niko/Nk03.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[332,333,334,335]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2031, 'NikoFindFirstOre', '[]', 'Before I can take you to my mining operation I need a little something from you. Mining''s dangerous at the best of times, but it''s suicidal without a proper source of light. I''ve got lights, just ain''t got no power. Run on Voltaxic Sulphite, they do. Nasty rocks. Stink like a dozen eggs rotting in the summer sun on the back of a whale carcass, and they''re less stable than the High Templar on a bad day. Bloody toxic too. ' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
I can smell some nearby, actually. How ''bout you follow your nose and find it, eh?', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Niko/Nk60.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[333,334]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2032, 'NikoFirstOreFound', '[]', 'Ah, this is the stuff. Good nose, exile. You find more and I''ll come right over. Don''t touch it though. Stuff''ll send you mad without the right precautions. You think I want to be dressed like this?' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Tell you what - how about we take a look around my mine. Talk to me when you''re ready to go.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Niko/Nk04.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[332,333,334]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2033, 'NikoMineIntro', '[]', 'Looks like shite, eh? Well, don''t judge a mine by its entrance. Eternals used to pull all sorts of goodies out of these rocks, and they never had my secret weapon. ' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Just inside the mineshaft is my creaky little Crawler. Took one of the ol'' Eternal torture devices and... repurposed it. Oh, it can still tear your skin off like peeling a fruit, but hopefully it won''t try to. Instead, it can lay down a daisy chain of lights powered by that Voltaxic Sulphite. You''ll want to be on the lookout for more of that, mind you.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
This big beauty next to me? My pride and joy. Feeds Crawler with refined and purified sulphite. And it''s capable of taking all sorts of the raw materials strewn below ground and turning ''em into sources of light and explosives.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
How ''bout you head underground and follow the mechanical little bugger to an azurite vein, eh?', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Niko/Nk05.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[335]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2034, 'NikoActivateCrawler', '[]', 'This is Crawler. Capable of scouting out a few of the valuables hidden down here, but needs your muscle to get to ''em. Tell it where you want to go, and try to stay alive ''til you get there. Crawler will burn through sulphite on the way, and we ain''t made of sulphite, so choose carefully.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
How about you follow it to a nearby Azurite vein, eh? Make sure you stick near Crawler''s light. Believe me... you don''t want to get dragged into the darkness.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Niko/Nk62.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[336]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2035, 'NikoAzuriteAcquired', '[]', 'Beauty. Look at it sparkle. Glows like blue embers in the dark. My machine here can turn these rocks into something a little more useful. You might need some extra light down there, so how ''bout you put a few flares together. ' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Mine''s also full of dead ends and things that oughta be dead themselves, so get a blasting stick while you''re at it. Should have enough for both on ya.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Niko/Nk06.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[335]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2036, 'NikoFlares', '[]', 'Hot little pair of sticks you got. Mind you don''t get ''em mixed up. Don''t want to have to mop you up... though I suppose blowing yourself to bits is better than getting lost in the dark down there. ' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
I suggest you bring a few sticks of dynamite and a few flares when you venture down there. Crawler will guide you to some large ore veins, but tossing a flare into the gloom might reveal some very pretty little treasures. ' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Since the mine''s been around for so long, all the easy pickings have already been pinched. Might have to do some excavating of your own if you want something truly precious. ' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
There''re some fragile-looking walls down there. Reckon a well-placed stick of dynamite will turn those walls to rubble. Why don''t you give that a go, eh? I''ll let you keep whatever you find on the other side.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Niko/Nk07.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[335]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2037, 'NikoMine1', '[]', 'Not the prettiest spot in Wraeclast, but relatively dry and safe as long as you stay in the light. Never cared about a good view anyway. Much prefer a cozy spot indoors. Not many of those on Wraeclast that aren''t filled with bloody flesheaters though, eh?', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Niko/Nk08.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[332,335,337]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2038, 'NikoCongrats', '[]', 'Blew up a wall, did you? And you''re back in one piece! Impressive. Hope you found something nice on the other side. ' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Well, exile, that''s all there really is to it. Simple, really. So... bugger off to find more ore for us, eh?', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Niko/Nk64.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[332,335,337]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2039, 'NikoClaimOreFirstRandom', '[]', 'Good find, exile.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Niko/Nk61_A_1.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[333,334]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2040, 'NikoClaimOreFirst2', '[]', 'Good find, exile.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Niko/Nk61_A_2.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[333,334]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2041, 'NikoClaimOreFirst3', '[]', 'This''ll do nicely, exile.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Niko/Nk68_A_1.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[332,335]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2042, 'NikoClaimOreFirst4', '[]', 'This''ll do nicely, exile.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Niko/Nk68_A_2.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[333,334]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2043, 'NikoClaimOreFirst5', '[]', 'This''ll do nicely, exile.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Niko/Nk68_A_3.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[333,334]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2044, 'NikoClaimOreFirst6', '[]', 'Another good find.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Niko/Nk68_C_3.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[333,334]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2045, 'NikoClaimOreFirst7', '[]', 'Another good find.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Niko/Nk68_C_2.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[333,334]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2046, 'NikoClaimOreFirst8', '[]', 'Another good find.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Niko/Nk68_C_1.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[333,334]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2047, 'NikoDarkness1', '[]', 'The darkness within those walls is unnatural. It does not fade in the presence of light... It retreats. Like a living beast. I''d not wander too far from the lamps if I were you.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Niko/Nk09.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[332,335,337]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2048, 'NikoAboutSulphite1', '[]', 'Used to mine the stuff for the Templar. Dunno why they needed all that power. Didn''t really care to find out, neither. Less I know about their business, the better. Stopped mining it for a while when my brain turned to mush. Heard and saw things that weren''t really there. All better now, though.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Niko/Nk10.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[333,334]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2049, 'NikoBackground1', '[]', 'Grew up in Oriath. Used to love the city... Spent my youth combing the woods around it for Sulphite. No one else knew how to handle the stuff, but the Templar had a voracious appetite for it. Needed it to power whatever god-forsaken machines they were building. Made a very healthy living for myself until... ' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Well, let''s just say, for a while I thought I was a... a prophet. The Templar don''t take so kindly to people calling themselves prophets. Locked me up in a madhouse, but I dug my way out. The Templar like escapees even less than they like false prophets, so here I am, digging around in Eternal rubble.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Niko/Nk11.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[332,333,334,335,337]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2050, 'NikoGenerator1', '[]', 'Been working on this machine on and off for years. Hard to really test it without the raw materials from the mine. You''re here now, though, so maybe that''ll change. ' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
This beauty can take the azurite you find in there and turn it into flares and dynamite. Enough azurite, and I can make this thing more efficient than it already is. Able to hold a lot more sulphite, and able to make better flares and dynamite.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Niko/Nk12.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[332,335]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2051, 'NikoCities1', '[]', 'Whole Eternal Empire was built on the ruins of the Vaal, so it ain''t surprising that we''d run up against Vaal ruins down there. Seen some other traces, though. People who weren''t Eternals or Vaal. Thought I''d just hit an old Vaal burial ground, ''til I realised just how many bones there were... and that they were used to build. Ain''t a historian, but never heard of the Vaal using human bones to make buildings.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Niko/Nk13.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[332,335,337]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2052, 'NikoProspero1', '[]', 'Piles of gold, eh? Ain''t a goldmine, so sounds like you stumbled across an old shrine to Prospero. Any miner worth his rocksalt knows Prospero. Might''ve even tried to make a deal with him for riches or life. Prospero''s followers think the two are more or less interchangeable. If you believe in that stuff, I''ve got a flying rhoa to sell you.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Niko/Nk14.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[332,335,337]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2053, 'NikoFullGeneratorFirstRandom', '[]', 'Beautiful find, Exile. Generator''s full-up though. Might be a good time to go for a dig, eh?', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Niko/Nk15_A_1.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[333,334]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2054, 'NikoFullGeneratorFirst2', '[]', 'Beautiful find, Exile. Generator''s full-up though. Might be a good time to go for a dig, eh?', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Niko/Nk15_A_2.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[333,334]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2055, 'NikoMine2', '[]', 'Huh... Thought I heard you in there earlier. Went to check because I didn''t see you, and sure enough, you weren''t there. Could''ve sworn I heard something down there in the shafts though.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Niko/Nk18.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[332,335,337]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2056, 'NikoClaimOreSecondRandom', '[]', 'This... This is good stuff.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Niko/Nk19_A_1.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[333,334]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2057, 'NikoClaimOreSecond2', '[]', 'This... This is good stuff.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Niko/Nk19_A_2.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[333,334]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2058, 'NikoClaimOreSecond3', '[]', 'Packed with energy, exile. Packed with energy.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Niko/Nk19_B_1.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[333,334]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2059, 'NikoClaimOreSecond4', '[]', 'Packed with energy, exile. Packed with energy.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Niko/Nk19_B_2.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[333,334]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2060, 'NikoClaimOreSecond5', '[]', 'Another nice vein eh? Heheh.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Niko/Nk19_C_1.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[333,334]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2061, 'NikoClaimOreSecond6', '[]', 'Another nice vein eh? Heheh.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Niko/Nk19_C_2.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[333,334]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2062, 'NikoClaimOreSecond7', '[]', 'Whew. Whiff that.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Niko/Nk68_B_1.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[333,334]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2063, 'NikoClaimOreSecond8', '[]', 'Whew. Whiff that.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Niko/Nk68_B_2.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[333,334]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2064, 'NikoClaimOreSecond9', '[]', 'Whew. Whiff that.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Niko/Nk68_B_3.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[333,334]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2065, 'NikoDarkness2', '[]', 'The deeper we go, the more the darkness scares me. I''ve seen nothing like it before, and I hope to see nothing like it again. Stay in the light, exile, unless you wish to die.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Niko/Nk20.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[332,335,337]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2066, 'NikoAboutSulphite2', '[]', 'You''ll get used to the smell after a bit. Might even start to miss it. Curious rock, that sulphite. Only found near the surface. Can''t think of any other rock quite like it.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Its... interesting properties make it tricky to handle. Not many people want or need it. Not many people can stomach the smell. Kept me in business for a good long while ''til I ended up in the madhouse. Mostly better now, though. Mostly.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Niko/Nk21.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[333,334]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2067, 'NikoGenerator2', '[]', 'Impressive ain''t she? It''s where Crawler gets its power, and what keeps the lights down there lit. ' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Find some Azurite down there, you can toss it in this, and out comes something a little more deadly. Or bright, if that''s your style.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Niko/Nk22.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[332,335]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2068, 'NikoBackground2', '[]', 'If you knew how to handle Voltaxic Sulphite without blowing your arms off, you could make a lot of money in Oriath. As you can see, I still have my arms. Sold piles of Sulphite to the Templar. Knew better than to ask what they needed it for. But when people who weren''t really there started talking to me, I didn''t know better than to ask the Templar for help.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Ever break out of a Templar-run mental-asylum? Easier than ya think. Easier than hiding from the Templar when they go looking for ya. They shipped me off to Wraeclast as soon as they found me. Easier to forget I exist than to help me get rid of the voices, eh?', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Niko/Nk23.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[332,333,334,335,337]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2069, 'NikoCities2', '[]', 'Don''t be surprised if you find yourself surrounded by Vaal ruins when you get deep enough. Whole Eternal Empire was built on their ruins. Might even see some of their cursed dead wandering the halls. But if you see... other ruins... best watch yourself. Nothin'' collects that many bones peacefully.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Niko/Nk24.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[332,335,337]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2070, 'NikoProspero2', '[]', 'Thought most of the old cults died with the Eternal Empire, but it sounds like you found a shrine to Prospero. He was supposedly in charge of all things that came out of the earth. Miners left him tributes. Guess they were hoping Prospero would protect them from a cave-in. Or an explosion. Or toxic gases.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Have I mentioned how dangerous this job is?', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Niko/Nk25.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[332,335,337]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2071, 'NikoFullGeneratorSecondRandom', '[]', 'Plenty of energy in this one, but the generator is at capacity. How about you visit the mine?', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Niko/Nk26_A_1.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[333,334]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2072, 'NikoFullGeneratorSecond2', '[]', 'Plenty of energy in this one, but the generator is at capacity. How about you visit the mine?', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Niko/Nk26_A_2.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[333,334]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2073, 'NikoMine3', '[]', 'I think they''re back, exile. The voices. I can hear them talking to me down there. Just whispers, here and there. Whispers, and scratching. Like they''re buried somewhere deep. Can''t make out any words, but I can feel their emotions. They''re not happy. Not happy at all.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Niko/Nk29.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[332,335,337]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2074, 'NikoClaimOreThirdRandom', '[]', 'Heheheh... Good eye, exile...', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Niko/Nk30_A_1.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[333,334]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2075, 'NikoClaimOreThird2', '[]', 'Heheheh... Good eye, exile...', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Niko/Nk30_A_2.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[333,334]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2076, 'NikoClaimOreThird3', '[]', 'Heheheh... Good eye, exile...', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Niko/Nk30_A_3.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[333,334]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2077, 'NikoClaimOreThird4', '[]', 'Food for the machine, heheh!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Niko/Nk30_B_1.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[333,334]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2078, 'NikoClaimOreThird5', '[]', 'Food for the machine, heheh!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Niko/Nk30_B_2.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[333,334]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2079, 'NikoClaimOreThird6', '[]', 'Pretty little rocks, just for me...', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Niko/Nk30_C_1.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[333,334]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2080, 'NikoClaimOreThird7', '[]', 'Pretty little rocks, just for me...', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Niko/Nk30_C_2.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[333,334]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2081, 'NikoClaimOreThird8', '[]', 'Pretty little rocks, just for me...', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Niko/Nk30_C_3.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[333,334]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2082, 'NikoDarkness3', '[]', 'It''s out there, exile. Watching us. It''s all around us. Can you feel it? The darkness wants our flesh. Wants to devour us like all that came before. Something is fuelling it. Something... Or someone.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Niko/Nk31.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[332,335,337]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2083, 'NikoAboutSulphite3', '[]', 'Love the stuff, really. The weight, the roughness... The way it makes my hands and brain tingle, like they''re covered in hundreds of tiny little ants. Need more and more to keep the lights in the mine going, which is fine by me.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Niko/Nk32.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[333,334]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2084, 'NikoGenerator3', '[]', 'With the right materials, you can make some very nice things with my machine. Put a lot of work into making it do what it does.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Honestly... Think someone''s been tampering with it. Might be trying to steal my designs.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Over my dead and rotting body, eh?', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Niko/Nk33.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[332,335]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2085, 'NikoBackground3', '[]', 'Probably heard about all the weird experiments the Templar were doin'' back in Oriath, eh? Probably seen some of the results around here. Need a lot of power to do something like that, I imagine... It just so happens I used to be the supplier of that power. Knew no one else who could handle Voltaxic Sulphite in Oriath. Made a lot of money selling the stuff to the Templar.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
When I started hearing things... people... I went to the Templar for help. Thought they''d do a favour for their favourite miner. Locked me up instead! Me! In a bloody mental asylum! Should''ve bought them off, but I dug out instead. Should''ve bought them off when they caught up to me and tried to ship me off to Wraeclast, but my head wasn''t right. Still might not be.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Niko/Nk34.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[332,333,334,335,337]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2086, 'NikoCities3', '[]', 'You''ll run across plenty of ruins down there. Eternal, Vaal, and... others. You''d know if you''d seen them. Bones everywhere. Walls of bones. Pillars. Piles and piles and piles. All different sizes. Child sized bones. The Vaal were bloody and merciless, but they were better than what came before. Went no deeper once I saw that. Wish I''d not gone that deep in the first place.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Niko/Nk35.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[332,335,337]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2087, 'NikoProspero3', '[]', 'A dirty deal made deep in the dirt. That''s what the gold piles down there mean. A bargain with the God of Wealth and the Underworld, Prospero. That it remains there is proof that Prospero is no more. Or... maybe the offering was recent. Hope you left it undisturbed. Wouldn''t want to tempt a god''s wrath, would you? Eh?', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Niko/Nk36.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[332,335,337]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2088, 'NikoFullGeneratorThirdRandom', '[]', 'No room for this right now with the generator as full as it is, but better I take it than someone else.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Niko/Nk37_A_1.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[333,334]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2089, 'NikoFullGeneratorThird2', '[]', 'No room for this right now with the generator as full as it is, but better I take it than someone else.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Niko/Nk37_A_2.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[333,334]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2090, 'NikoMine4', '[]', 'Layers on layers on layers. That''s how we build. Sarn built over the ruins of the Vaal. The Vaal built over an abyss of bones. What''s below the bones, exile? ' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
I can still hear them down there, rattling around, pawing at the rocks. They want out. Want what we have. Want to take our lives over. Want to take our minds over.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Niko/Nk40.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[332,335,337]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2091, 'NikoClaimOreFourthRandom', '[]', 'Come, come, pretty little rocks.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Niko/Nk41_A_1.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[333,334]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2092, 'NikoClaimOreFourth2', '[]', 'Come, come, pretty little rocks.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Niko/Nk41_A_2.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[333,334]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2093, 'NikoClaimOreFourth3', '[]', 'Gotta grab ''em before someone else does, eh?', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Niko/Nk41_B_1.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[333,334]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2094, 'NikoClaimOreFourth4', '[]', 'Gotta grab ''em before someone else does, eh?', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Niko/Nk41_B_2.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[333,334]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2095, 'NikoClaimOreFourth5', '[]', 'Heheheheheheheheh...', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Niko/Nk41_C_1.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[333,334]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2096, 'NikoClaimOreFourth6', '[]', 'Heheheheheheheheh...', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Niko/Nk41_C_2.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[333,334]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2097, 'NikoClaimOreFourth7', '[]', 'Heheheheheheheheh...', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Niko/Nk41_C_3.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[333,334]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2098, 'NikoDarkness4', '[]', 'Can you hear them, exile? They''re locked away down there. The darkness has them imprisoned... Bait, trying to coax us out of the light. But we''re not so dumb, are we, exile? No no no... We''ll not be lured into the darkness so easily.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Niko/Nk42.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[332,335,337]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2099, 'NikoAboutSulphite4', '[]', 'Been a long time since I was around this much sulphite. Forgot how it made me feel. Strong! But... Forgot how many others want it. How loud they are. They''re after it. Might try to kill me to get it. Tear me apart, squeeze the dust from my skin. Might try to do the same to you, exile.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Niko/Nk43.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[333,334]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2100, 'NikoGenerator4', '[]', 'Tell me, what do you think is worth more: this machine, or the power and light it can create? Suppose you know the answer already. Wouldn''t be stupid enough to try and take it from me, would they? ' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Couldn''t use it even if they did. Needs azurite ores, and they''re deep in the darkness. Even they''d not be stupid enough to wander in there... Ha! Love to see them try.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Niko/Nk44.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[332,335]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2101, 'NikoBackground4', '[]', 'Made myself very rich selling Voltaxic Sulphite to the Templar. Didn''t know what they were doing with it, but it wasn''t hard to guess. Was a couple years ago that I started hearing... them. The voices. Talking to me. Telling me things about the people around me. Things I shouldn''t know. Secrets. Wonderful, violent secrets.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Went to the Templar and told ''em what I knew. What I was getting told. Who was telling it. Templar didn''t bloody believe me. Locked me up in a... in a prison! But my little messenger told me how to escape. Told me to dig. Dig, dig, dig. Dug my way to freedom. Templar didn''t like that, no no. Sent an army after me. Tossed me on a slaver''s ship and sent me to Wraeclast to rot. But I''m not rotting, am I, exile? I''m healthier than I''ve ever been, heheheh.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Niko/Nk45.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[332,333,334,335,337]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2102, 'NikoCities4', '[]', 'Can you hear ''em walking around down there? The Vaal, holed up in their ruins, still scrabbling at the walls and floors. Empire''s been dead for thousands of years, but they ain''t. Not dead enough for me, anyway. They''re below us, but what''s below them? I know... Can you hear them rattling their bones, exile? Beckoning us deeper and deeper, into their pit of bones? What''s below the bones, exile? What''s below the bones?', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Niko/Nk46.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[332,335,337]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2103, 'NikoProspero4', '[]', 'Tried to make a trade with Prospero, they did. That''s why you saw gold down there. Someone wanted to avoid a dark fate. Gave away all their wealth. But it''s still there, so... the God of Wealth must be full-up. Or the god never existed. Bunch of myths and stories to scare children and sap money from the mad and stupid. I''m not stupid though, am I? No... Not stupid.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Niko/Nk47.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[332,335,337]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2104, 'NikoFullGeneratorFourthRandom', '[]', 'Trying to overload the generator, are ya? Thing''s full-up. Full to the tippy top! How about you use some of this sulphite we''ve collected.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Niko/Nk48_A_1.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[333,334]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2105, 'NikoFullGeneratorFourth2', '[]', 'Trying to overload the generator, are ya? Thing''s full-up. Full to the tippy top! How about you use some of this sulphite we''ve collected.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Niko/Nk48_A_2.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[333,334]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2106, 'NikoMine5', '[]', 'Got to keep digging, exile. Got to keep digging! Need to let them out. Need to stop the chatter. They''re too loud, exile. And they''re all angry. Shouting at us. Can''t understand a word. Probably get more done if they would be quiet for just one moment.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
How do you stand the noise, exile? Can''t even think with the bloody racket they''re making. Wish someone would make ''em... disappear.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Niko/Nk51.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[332,335,337]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2107, 'NikoClaimOreFifthRandom', '[]', 'We need more of this, exile. A lot more.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Niko/Nk52_A_1.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[333,334]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2108, 'NikoClaimOreFifth2', '[]', 'We need more of this, exile. A lot more.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Niko/Nk52_A_2.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[333,334]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2109, 'NikoClaimOreFifth3', '[]', 'More, exile. Go find more.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Niko/Nk52_B_1.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[333,334]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2110, 'NikoClaimOreFifth4', '[]', 'More, exile. Go find more.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Niko/Nk52_B_2.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[333,334]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2111, 'NikoClaimOreFifth5', '[]', 'Quickly, Niko, quickly... they''re waiting!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Niko/Nk52_C_1.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[333,334]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2112, 'NikoClaimOreFifth6', '[]', 'Quickly, Niko, quickly... they''re waiting!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Niko/Nk52_C_2.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[333,334]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2113, 'NikoClaimOreFifth7', '[]', 'Good good good good.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Niko/Nk52_D_1.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[333,334]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2114, 'NikoClaimOreFifth8', '[]', 'Good good good good.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Niko/Nk52_D_2.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[333,334]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2115, 'NikoDarkness5', '[]', 'They''re calling us... They''re calling us again, exile. And we have to answer. Need to get to them. Free them. They need us, exile. You need to hurry. The darkness is crowding around us, exile. It''s so hungry. It licks at our minds, tasting our fear. Lick lick lick! Only a taste though, exile. Only a taste for now.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Niko/Nk53.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[332,335,337]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2116, 'NikoAboutSulphite5', '[]', 'They''re definitely after it, exile. Want our pretty little rocks. Circling us like a pack of wolves. Like the darkness deep down in the mine. They want to swallow us both up and take our rocks. But we will have the last laugh. "HA!" We''ll say. HA! HA! ' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
The sulphite''s ours. Pumping light into the darkness with our pretty little rocks. Carrying us deeper and deeper into the unknown and unknowable. ' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Closer and closer... to them.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Niko/Nk54.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[333,334]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2117, 'NikoGenerator5', '[]', 'Machine''s worth more than my life. Or yours, should it come to that, exile. No man or woman alive today could replicate it. They''ll try, though. Oh, they''ll try. They''ll crack her open like an egg. Let her goo run across the ground and back into the mines. Back into the darkness. Gobbled up. ' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Won''t let that happen. Would kill anyone who tries to take her in a heartbeat. Even you, exile. Even you.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Niko/Nk55.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[332,335]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2118, 'NikoBackground5', '[]', 'Heheheh, they thought they could put ol'' Niko to rest. Thought I''d die out here. Thought I''d keep the Templar''s dirty little secret to myself! But I''m still breathin''. Still digging their beautiful rocks out of the ground, just like I was back in Oriath. But they ain''t getting a single. Bloody. One. ' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
They thought they''d lock me away from the angry voices in that dark room, but I got out. Ran through the square in my bloody prison garb. Hands bleeding everywhere. Must''ve tracked my blood to find me. Couldn''t kill me though, could they. Had to send me to the cursed continent to die. Think they''re still trying to get me, exile? Sending their ugly little spies my way?' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Maybe we''ll feed them to the darkness.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Niko/Nk56.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[332,333,334,335,337]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2119, 'NikoCities5', '[]', 'Eternal relics on Vaal ruins. Vaal ruins on a living graveyard. Down and down and down. Layers and layers. Years and years. Never stopped building up so we never stop digging down, eh? Only a matter of time until we''re buried too, exile. What secrets will be buried with us? What secrets remain to be dug up? heeheehee... I know a secret, exile. Do you?', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Niko/Nk57.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[332,335,337]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2120, 'NikoProspero5', '[]', 'What good is gold to the dead? Can''t spend if you can''t move or breath. Can''t line the pockets of your betters, can you? Prospero, God of the Shining Rocks! He''ll keep you alive down there... for a price. That''s what they say, anyway. That''s what they keep saying. Keep telling me to give more. Give away my beauties. But what do I get for it? Can''t prove I didn''t die already, can they? Can''t prove we''re not all already dead! Until I''m dead, the rocks are mine. ' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Prospero can come and get them if he wants them so badly... Heheheheheh... Wonder what the blood of a god tastes like.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Niko/Nk58.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[332,335,337]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2121, 'NikoFullGeneratorFifthRandom', '[]', 'Lovely sulphite, all for me. Brimming with sulphite already, the generator is. Couldn''t fit more if I wanted to! Come and see, exile! Come and see!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Niko/Nk59_A_1.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[333,334]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2122, 'NikoFullGeneratorFifth2', '[]', 'Lovely sulphite, all for me. Brimming with sulphite already, the generator is. Couldn''t fit more if I wanted to! Come and see, exile! Come and see!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Niko/Nk59_A_2.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[333,334]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2123, 'NikoLightRadiusLow1', '[]', 'Deeper you go, the more claustrophobic it feels. Like the darkness is closing in. Might be, exile. Might be trying to strangle ya. Might be time we try to squeeze a little more juice out of those lights. If you''ve got any Azurite spare, could be worth upgrading the lights at the generator.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Niko/Nk65.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[335]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2124, 'NikoDarknessResistLow1', '[]', 'The depths you''re exploring are dangerous, exile. Not talking about the bloody monsters - if you stray into the darkness in your state, you''ll be torn to shreds. Reckon you should use a little Azurite to insulate yourself from the darkness. Won''t completely protect you, but... well, you won''t die quite so fast. Generator ought to be able to take care of it for you, if you have the ore. Well... Go on.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Niko/Nk66.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[335]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2125, 'NikoGetMoreAzurite', '[]', 'Beauty. Look at it sparkle. Glows like blue embers in the dark. My machine here can turn these rocks into something a little more useful, but you''ll need more than you''ve currently got. Come back once you''ve found more Azurite, eh?', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Niko/Nk67.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[335]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2126, 'NikoErrorRandom', '[]', 'Eh? Oh. I''m busy right now.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Niko/Nk69_A_1.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[336,335,337]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2127, 'NikoError2', '[]', 'Eh? Oh. I''m busy right now.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Niko/Nk69_A_2.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[336,335,337]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2128, 'NikoError3', '[]', 'Eh? Oh. I''m busy right now.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Niko/Nk69_A_3.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[336,335,337]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2129, 'NikoLightRadiusLow2', '[]', 'Thought I was imagining things the first time I saw it. The darkness... squeezing in. Wish I was just imagining it, but... The deeper you go, the harder it squeezes. You oughta put some of your azurite towards making our lights a bit brighter at the generator.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Niko/Nk70.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[335]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2130, 'NikoDarknessResistLow2', '[]', 'Wasn''t long ago I went too deep into the mine too quickly. Chasing glittering riches, I was. Lost track of me light. Strayed into the dark. Felt as if my skin was being eaten from the inside of my body. I was lucky to make it back. The deeper you go, the quicker the darkness will kill you. You need to insulate yourself at the generator. No amount of Azurite''s worth your life.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Niko/Nk71.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[335]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2131, 'NikoLightRadiusLow3', '[]', 'You''ve seen it. I know you have. The darkness deep down there... it''s growing stronger. Squeezing the light. Can''t survive without the light though, can ya? Need to give it a kick up the arse. Use some of the azurite you''ve collected to make the lights shine brighter, else you''ll have no room to bloody move.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Niko/Nk72.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[335]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2132, 'NikoDarknessResistLow3', '[]', 'It''s angry now, exile. The darkness is angry. Angry that you are walking among it, alive. It wants you dead, and the deeper you go, the stronger it gets. Don''t let it get you. Use some azurite at the generator to insulate yourself from it. Didn''t hire you just to feed you to the bloody darkness.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Niko/Nk73.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[335]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2133, 'NikoLightRadiusLow4', '[]', 'You''ve done it now, exile. You''ve really done it now. Look how the darkness crowds around the light, waiting to pounce on you. The deeper you go, the stronger it gets. Pushes in towards the light. Only one way to fight back, exile. More light. Brighter light! Upgrade it at the generator with your ore. See how the darkness feels about that, eh? Heheheheh.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Niko/Nk74.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[335]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2134, 'NikoDarknessResistLow4', '[]', 'Look at yourself. Think you''re ready to face whatever lies deeper in those mines, do ya? Think the equipment you''re wearing will keep you alive? Ha! The darkness will eat right through that. It''s strong, exile. Stronger than you. Only thing that might keep you standing is using some azurite to insulate yourself. I''d do that if I were you. Generator can take care of it for ya. Or if you''d rather, you can just submit to the darkness like all the others, heheheheh.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Niko/Nk75.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[335]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2135, 'NikoLightRadiusLow5', '[]', 'The darkness is coming for you, exile. The deeper you go, the stronger it pushes in towards the light. Can''t stop it, either. Can only slow it down by making the lights shine brighter. Brighter and brighter they shine with the generator''s help. Will it be enough? No way of knowing!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Niko/Nk76.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[335]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2136, 'NikoDarknessResistLow5', '[]', 'Felt the sting of the hungering gloom yet? All in due time. It''s hungrier than it has ever been, the darkness. Hungrier than it''s ever been, and there''s nothing that will sate it. You can only try to make yourself taste rotten to it. Use some of your ore at the generator, and maybe, just maybe, you''ll live a little longer. Heheheh.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Niko/Nk77.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[335]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2137, 'NikoMysteriousMan', '[]', 'You... didn''t happen to see him did you? Masked man, reeking of blood and beasts. Walked right up to me. Told me the end was coming, like I didn''t already know. Laughed right in his face. Called me stupid, so I left to get some dynamite... show him just how stupid I am. Only left for a moment but he was gone by the time I got back.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
He comes back, I''ll be here. Ready for him. Boom! Hahahaha.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Niko/Nk78.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[333,334]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2138, 'NikoDismissedFromHideout', '[]', 'See you later!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Niko/Nk02_B_2.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[333,334]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2139, 'NikoMineOpened', '[]', 'Oooooooh! Look at that!', '', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[332]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2140, 'RiddleQuest1', '[]', 'Even the simplest person may grow wise, given enough time. To do so as quickly as you did is no small feat. Very impressive, exile.', '', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[482]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2141, 'RiddleQuest2', '[]', 'I have witnessed the rise and fall of empires. I have seen the sun set on this world more times than you could fathom. Yet never have I seen something so graceful as your movements in the face of overwhelming odds. You are truly something special, exile.', '', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[482]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2142, 'RiddleQuest3', '[]', 'To face such an evil is a worthy feat unto itself. To do so in the manner you did... That is truly divine. You have the gratitude of all who died defending this world, and all who yet live. Thank you, exile.', '', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[482]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2143, 'NinjaCopIntro', '[]', 'I am Jun Ortoi, of the sun-scorched plains of Vastiri. I am investigating the disappearance of several prominent exiles. I have surreptitiously been observing your movements since you washed ashore. The way you handled the blacksmith showed me you are suitable for the task I must ask of you. ' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Wraeclast is lawless, but it is not without justice, and some here are more deserving of death than others. The missing were good people. Capable fighters doing what they could to bring light to a situation mired in darkness. I believe they were taken by a group calling themselves the Immortal Syndicate, and I fear they will not be the last.', '', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[338]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2144, 'NinjaCopFirstTraitor', '[]', 'Cannibals roam the shores here, but hidden amongst them is a small fortification I believe to be an Immortal Syndicate outpost. They have posted guards along the perimeter, so we must be cautious. Seek it out. I will meet you there, and together we will infiltrate it.', '', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[338]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2145, 'NinjaCopUndergroundLab', '[]', 'This is no beast den. Through these tunnels lies an Immortal Syndicate shelter. I fear they are in the process of dismantling, leaving us with no evidence. Together, we must rush inside and stop them as best we can. We are certain to find important information within.', '', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[338]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2146, 'EinharArrives', '[]', 'I love hunting!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Einhar/EF-24a.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[172,173,174,175,176]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2147, 'EinharArrives2', '[]', 'Bring the beast in my sights, exile!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Einhar/EF-26a.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[172,173,174,175,176]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2148, 'EinharArrives3', '[]', 'Ready, exile? It is time to hunt!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Einhar/EF-32b.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[172,173,174,175,176]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2149, 'EinharArrives4', '[]', 'Hunt or be hunted, exile!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Einhar/EF-32c.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[172,173,174,175,176]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2150, 'JunOrtoiIntroduction', '[]', 'I am Jun Ortoi, of the sun-scorched plains of Vastiri. I am investigating the disappearance of several prominent exiles. I have surreptitiously been observing your movements since you washed ashore. The way you handled the blacksmith showed me you are suitable for the task I must ask of you. ' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Wraeclast is lawless, but it is not without justice, and some here are more deserving of death than others. The missing were good people. Capable fighters doing what they could to bring light to a situation mired in darkness. I believe they were taken by a group calling themselves the Immortal Syndicate, and I fear they will not be the last.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/JunOrtoi/JO_05.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[343]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2151, 'JunOrtoiFirstFortMission', '[]', 'Cannibals roam the shores here, but hidden amongst them is a small fortification I believe to be an Immortal Syndicate outpost. They have posted guards along the perimeter, so we must be cautious. Seek it out. I will meet you there, and together we will infiltrate it.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/JunOrtoi/JO_06.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[343]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2152, 'JunOrtoiCloseToFort', '[]', 'Here, exile! I will follow your lead. Be careful.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/JunOrtoi/JO_07.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[343]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2153, 'JunOrtoiFirstEncounterComplete', '[]', 'This person... they were dead. I saw their body, cold and blue as the sea. Yet here they are, as alive as you or I.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/JunOrtoi/JO_08.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[343]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2154, 'JunOrtoiFirstEncounter2', '[]', 'We must decide what we will do with our captive. What you choose to do will impact our ability to investigate further. Talk to our captive. I will watch your back.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/JunOrtoi/JO_08_A.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[343]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2155, 'JunOrtoiIfBargain', '[]', 'Catch and release? You may scare the other fish away, but you may also follow it to a hidden reef. Information is important, and can be gathered by force or by politics. Go now. It is risky to be seen with each other.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/JunOrtoi/JO_09.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[343]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2156, 'JunOrtoiIfRelease', '[]', 'So be it. I will take them to a secret location and extract what information I can about their co-conspirators. Go, I will seek you out again soon.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/JunOrtoi/JO_10.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[343]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2157, 'JunOrtoiFirstCartMission', '[]', 'Exile! I have found another member of this Immortal Syndicate not far from here. They appear to be loading strange cargo. I fear if we do not act quickly, they will escape. I will join you once you near them.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/JunOrtoi/JO_11.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[343]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2158, 'JunOrtoiCloseToCart', '[]', 'Exile, they are trying to escape. We must defeat them quickly!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/JunOrtoi/JO_12.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[343]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2159, 'JunOrtoiOnCompletionCart', '[]', 'Great work, exile. What do you want to do with our captive?', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/JunOrtoi/JO_13.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[343]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2160, 'JunOrtoiOnFailureCart', '[]', 'We were too slow. They have escaped with the cargo and any hope of discovering more about them. Perhaps we will run into them again soon.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/JunOrtoi/JO_14.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[343]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2161, 'JunOrtoiFirstLabMission', '[]', 'This is no beast den. Through these tunnels lies an Immortal Syndicate shelter. I fear they are in the process of dismantling, leaving us with no evidence. Together, we must rush inside and stop them as best we can. We are certain to find important information within.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/JunOrtoi/JO_15.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[339]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2162, 'JunOrtoiOnCompletionLab', '[]', 'Excellent. I knew you could do it. What shall we do with our captive?', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/JunOrtoi/JO_16.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[343]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2163, 'JunOrtoiOnFailureLab', '[]', 'We were too slow. They have destroyed everything, and on top of that, they have escaped. It may be some time before another opportunity such as this arises. We should make sure that next time we are ready for it.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/JunOrtoi/JO_17.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[343]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2164, 'JunOrtoiAfterSecondMission', '[]', 'Exile, I want to show you something. I have been carefully tracking the Syndicate members we have encountered. Understanding how they interrelate will help us paint a picture of the rest of the organisation, and eventually, lead us to whoever is in charge.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
I believe we can manipulate and take advantage of their relationships to bring us closer to the head of the Syndicate, and I have made this chart to keep track of all the details. I believe you will find it useful.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/JunOrtoi/JO_18.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[343]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2165, 'JunOrtoiDuringFirstAssassination', '[]', 'Exile! I came as quickly as I could - be careful!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/JunOrtoi/JO_19.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[343]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2166, 'JunOrtoiAfterFirstAssassination', '[]', 'I am so sorry, exile. It seems we have raised the ire of the Syndicate, and now they wish us dead. I too was attacked, and I sought you out as soon as I was safe, but I was too late. I brought this on us. I hope you can forgive me.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
At least we can make the most of a bad situation... Every defeated Syndicate member is a new opportunity for information and manipulation.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/JunOrtoi/JO_20.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[343]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2167, 'JunOrtoiSyndicateMembers', '[]', 'Some of the members we have come across... well... they have come back from the dead. I don''t have any better way of putting it. ' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
They are no mindless zombies. Somehow they are returning... whole. This must be why they call themselves the Immortal Syndicate. Immortality is dangerous, even in the hands of those with good intentions.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/JunOrtoi/JO_21.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[338,340]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2168, 'JunOrtoiWhyJunFights', '[]', 'Do I really need a reason? For what reason did you help the sick and dying in Lioneye''s Watch? We do these things because no one else will. We do these things because the world has enough pain in it already. Would you have me sit idly by, watching the few good souls left on this wretched stretch of land fall into the shadows? ' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Creation cannot occur without destruction, nor destruction without creation. Light and darkness. The two must coexist. One cannot be without the other. But forces work to break Wraeclast''s already precarious balance. And who but us can put it right?', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/JunOrtoi/JO_22.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[338,340]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2169, 'JunOrtoiCatarina', '[]', 'At last, we have a name; Catarina. I know of her. She was a powerful necromancer whose talents were... misdirected. I do not know for certain how she learned to raise the dead back to true life, but... I have my suspicions. And I have reason to believe that such power does not come without a great price. ' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
It is likely she is paying that price in very inhumane ways.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
We must find out where she is hiding. Too much is at stake to let her continue.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/JunOrtoi/JO_23.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[338,340]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2170, 'JunOrtoiAtTheVault', '[]', 'Exile, I fear I have not been entirely honest with you. This dusty pit was once the Forbidden Vault, and I its guardian. That you have not heard of it is not surprising; it was kept in absolute secrecy for countless generations, known only to my <i>{akhara}, the-... the Order of the Djinn. ' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
It feels so strange to tell someone. To speak so plainly would have been a sin of the highest order, punishable by death. It seems harsh to an outsider like yourself, but you do not know the importance of what we did...', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/JunOrtoi/JO2_27.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[363]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2171, 'JunOrtoiTheForbiddenVault', '[]', 'My <i>{akhara}, my people, were long ago tasked with protecting the people of Wraeclast from themselves. Many artefacts of great power exist - you have come across some such in your travels. But there are some artefacts whose power is so great that to use them would put the world in jeopardy. Artefacts like the Horns of Kulemak. We, the Order of the Djinn, existed to keep such power sealed away and secret. Better that the world forget that it, and we, exist, than fight for control of a power they have no hope of controlling.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/JunOrtoi/JO2_28.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[338,340,363]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2172, 'JunOrtoiTheOrderOfTheDjinn', '[]', 'You have not heard of us because you were never meant to hear of us. I say us... in truth, it is just me left. We came from all walks of life, but we were all orphans, taken in and raised by the Order, and taught never to speak of it under punishment of death. It sounds harsh, I understand, but such was the importance of our duty that a life of solitude and secrecy was necessary. ' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
For hundreds, maybe thousands of years, we remained secret, until Janus Perandus... that... that imbecile... He sold us out. Reaching for the last vestiges of his ancestral glory. Just like his great grandfather Chitus, he may have doomed us all.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/JunOrtoi/JO_26.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[338,340,363]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2173, 'JunOrtoiCatarinaAfterVault', '[]', 'The picture is at last clear. Catarina has obtained the Horns of Kulemak, an artefact capable of shifting the very energies of life freely. She sought power, not just magical, but political power. To be able to grant immortality is a powerful bargaining tool indeed. ' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Wraeclast is fractured. Many little societies separated by vast tracts of land. But it will not always be so, and Catarina knows this. She is playing the long game. She sees herself as an immortal Queen just biding her time. ' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Her subordinates dare not cross her, for she has the power to gift them immortality, but also to take it away. ' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
There is a reason my Order hid the Horns for so long, and we are seeing it play out before our very eyes.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/JunOrtoi/JO_27.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[338,340]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2174, 'JunOrtoiTheHornsOfKulemak', '[]', 'We were only taught what was passed down for generations. We believed the Horns to be the ultimate tool of life and death; capable of siphoning the very breath of life from any living thing. We do not know where it came from. Perhaps the remains of a powerful, long-dead animal. Perhaps a creation of the gods themselves.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Regardless of its provenance, I believe the Horns are what have given the Immortal Syndicate their miraculous ability to return from the dead unscathed.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/JunOrtoi/JO_28.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[338,340,363]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2175, 'JunOrtoiSafehouse', '[]', 'Thanks to your hard work, we have at last pinpointed the location of a Syndicate safehouse. I believe a leader to be sending orders from there.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
When you are ready, I can take us close. Together we will infiltrate and dismantle it. If we can capture the leader, they may be able to get us closer to the one they call "The Lifegiver".', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/JunOrtoi/JO_29.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[338,343,340]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2176, 'JunOrtoiAssassinationOngoingArrival', '[]', 'Exile, I''m here. Keep fighting!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/JunOrtoi/JO_30.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[343]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2177, 'JunOrtoiAssassinationOverIntro', '[]', 'I came to warn you of a plot on your life, but clearly you have a handle on the situation. Let''s use this as an opportunity to extract some information.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/JunOrtoi/JO_31.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[343]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2178, 'JunOrtoiInviteToHideout', '[]', 'My home died with my <i>{akhara}. Already, I cannot repay you for all you have done, but if you have room for me in your hideout, I would gladly accept a place.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/JunOrtoi/JO2_29.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[343]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2179, 'JunOrtoiJoinHideout', '[]', 'I cannot thank you enough.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/JunOrtoi/JO_33.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[343]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2180, 'JunOrtoiFightCatarina', '[]', 'Thanks to our continued, fastidious work, we now know Catarina leads the Immortal Syndicate. We also know exactly where she is hiding.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Exile, we must defeat her, but we must be ready for anything. Catarina has not only an army at her disposal, but some of the most powerful artefacts ever known, including the Horns of Kulemak.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
You must be prepared to face her. When you are ready, I will open a way.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/JunOrtoi/JO_34.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[343]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2181, 'JunOrtoiJanusPerandus', '[]', 'You have heard of the famed Perandus family, I have no doubt. Wealthy and powerful and responsible for putting Malachai in position to bring Wraeclast to ruin all those centuries ago. Though Emperor Chitus is the most famous of the Perandus family, some remnants of his vile bloodline linger even still.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Janus was one such remnant. He too was orphaned, but with the Perandus coffers dry and the Perandus name worth its weight in gold, no one took him in. No one except my <i>{akhara}. ' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
That he is the only other survivor, and is now a powerful member of the Immortal Syndicate leaves no doubt in my mind that it was he who sold us out.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
If there is but one silver lining in all of this, it is that I may get to sink my blades into his flesh over, and over, and over again.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/JunOrtoi/JO2_26.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[338,340,363]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2182, 'JunOrtoiAboutEinhar', '[]', 'Anyone who believes the world is coming to an end raises some red flags. He has that unusual accent, but he claims to be from Oriath. I think Einhar is hiding more than just his face.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
But... who am I to talk?', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/JunOrtoi/JO_49.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[340]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2183, 'JunOrtoiAboutAlva', '[]', 'Greed has spilled more blood than all the other vices combined, and Alva is one of the greediest people I have ever met. That you have aligned with her makes me question your own motives.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/JunOrtoi/JO_50.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[340]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2184, 'JunOrtoiAboutNavali', '[]', 'Navali can see the future, yet she does nothing to prevent malicious acts. Am I just supposed to act like that is fine?', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/JunOrtoi/JO_51.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[340]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2185, 'JunOrtoiAboutHelena', '[]', 'Helena looked within herself and chose to turn her back on what she was made to believe, even under fear of death. She is a woman worthy of admiration.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/JunOrtoi/JO_52.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[340]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2186, 'JunOrtoiAboutNiko', '[]', 'Niko is... a strange one. I believe there is a good person buried within him somewhere, but he is lost within his own darkness, struggling to climb out.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/JunOrtoi/JO_53.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[340]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2187, 'JunOrtoiAboutZana', '[]', 'The rules of my <i>{akhara} forbid women ever feeling the touch of a man. No families, no loose lips, no loose ends. But it makes no mention of two women... When our jobs are done at last, I believe I would like a stronger bond with her. Perhaps we could find some orphans of our own to take in.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/JunOrtoi/JO2_30.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[340]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2188, 'JunOrtoiGenericMissionIntro', '[]', 'I''ve been tracking a member of the Immortal Syndicate. They''re near here. We need to move quickly and quietly and dismantle their operation before they can seek reinforcements. I will follow your lead, exile.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/JunOrtoi/JO_55.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[343]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2189, 'JunOrtoiAssassinationOverArrival', '[]', 'Exile! Carefu-... Oh. It seems I''m late.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/JunOrtoi/JO_56.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[343]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2190, 'JunOrtoiOriathAfterFirstKitava', '[]', 'I''d not believe you if I had not witnessed the boats lurching onto the shores of Wraeclast myself. So... The gods have returned, and Oriath has fallen. This complicates things, to say the least. ' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Exile, I believe the Syndicate has been planning to form a new government. The Templar were cruel, but at least they were mortal. If the Syndicate''s power continues to grow, they will be able to rule Wraeclast and beyond without fear of reprisal, and we mere mortals will have no choice but to serve, or fuel their cycle of death and rebirth.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/JunOrtoi/JO_74.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[338,340]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2191, 'JunOrtoiOriathAfterSecondKitava', '[]', 'Kitava is slain, and you are the saviour of Oriath. In any other era, such an act would etch your name into the pages of history, but...' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
The Immortal Syndicate remains, positioned to wrest control of the few remaining survivors, and you are the only one with the might to tear them down. Please, for the sake of those that still live, we must push onwards. Oriath has seen too much horror as it is.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/JunOrtoi/JO_75.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[338,340]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2192, 'JunOrtoiWildGreetingRandom', '[]', 'Akh''salla, exile!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/JunOrtoi/JO_01_A.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[343]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2193, 'JunOrtoiWildGreeting2', '[]', 'Akh''salla, exile!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/JunOrtoi/JO_01_B.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[343]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2194, 'JunOrtoiWildGreeting3', '[]', 'Akh''salla, exile!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/JunOrtoi/JO_01_C.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[343]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2195, 'JunOrtoiWildGreeting4', '[]', 'Exile, we must speak.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/JunOrtoi/JO_02_A.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[343]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2196, 'JunOrtoiWildGreeting5', '[]', 'Exile, we must speak.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/JunOrtoi/JO_02_B.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[343]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2197, 'JunOrtoiWildGreeting6', '[]', 'Exile, we must speak.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/JunOrtoi/JO_02_C.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[343]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2198, 'JunOrtoiStealthedGreetingRandom', '[]', 'Over here!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/JunOrtoi/JO_03_A.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[343]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2199, 'JunOrtoiStealthedGreeting1', '[]', 'Over here!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/JunOrtoi/JO_03_B.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[343]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2200, 'JunOrtoiStealthedGreeting2', '[]', 'Over here!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/JunOrtoi/JO_03_C.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[343]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2201, 'JunOrtoiStealthedGreetingAltRandom', '[]', 'Quickly and quietly, exile.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/JunOrtoi/JO_04_A.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[343]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2202, 'JunOrtoiStealthedGreetingAlt1', '[]', 'Quickly and quietly, exile.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/JunOrtoi/JO_04_B.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[343]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2203, 'JunOrtoiStealthedGreetingAlt2', '[]', 'Quickly and quietly, exile.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/JunOrtoi/JO_04_C.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[343]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2204, 'HelenaFirstHideout', '[]', 'The Blackguards will never stop pursuing someone they consider a traitor. I''m a danger to everyone around me, and not long for this world if I can''t find a place to hide. Based on what the Azmeri have told me of this region, the Dread Thicket is rumoured to be a terribly dangerous and wild place. The Blackguards will never search there. Let''s travel separately to avoid detection, and I''ll meet you there.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Helena/HEL_01.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[27]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2205, 'HelenaFirstHideoutRushed', '[]', 'The Blackguards will never stop pursuing someone they consider a traitor. I''m a danger to everyone around me, and not long for this world if I can''t find a place to hide. This seems like a good area to build a hideout, but it''s filled with monsters. Can you clear it of everything dangerous?', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Helena/HEL_02.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[341]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2206, 'HelenaHideoutHasMonsters', '[]', 'This seems like a good area to build a hideout, but it''s filled with monsters. Can you clear it of everything dangerous?', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Helena/HEL_03.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[341]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2207, 'HelenaCongrats', '[]', 'Curious... with the death of the last monster here, the very air itself feels different. I wouldn''t use the word ''purified,'' but you''ve definitely negated the pall over this place. I''ll stay here for now and make sure nothing dangerous re-emerges.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Helena/HEL_04.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[341]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2208, 'HelenaClaimHideout', '[]', 'Welcome to our new hideout, exile. I''ll start getting it set up.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Helena/HEL_05.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[341]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2209, 'HelenaCrafting', '[]', 'I retrieved the Transmutia Device from the Chamber of Sins, and I believe I can rig it to imbue equipment with magical modifications. This may involve minor meddling with dark forces we don''t understand, but we''ll have to take that risk. Wraeclast is a dangerous place, and we''ll never get anywhere by playing it safe.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
As long as we treat the process scientifically and approach it methodically, we should be able to craft equipment to our needs.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Helena/HEL_06.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[342]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2210, 'HelenaCraftingQuest', '[]', 'Alright, I''ve taken the liberty of performing a few tests. There are a few magical modifications the Transmutia Device can make that are safe every time. Try enhancing a piece of equipment now. Let''s see if my results hold.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Helena/HEL_07.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[342]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2211, 'HelenaOtherHideouts', '[]', 'While you''re out there, try to remain vigilant for other possible locations for hideouts. The Blackguards never give up, and they may eventually stray close to this place. I want to have a backup location ready to go in the event we need to make a quick exit.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Helena/HEL_08.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[342]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2212, 'HelenaOutsideOtherHideouts', '[]', 'I believe I''ve found another location that could make a good hideout. Once you rid the area of its current residents, we can move in. Can you take care of it with that particular skillset of yours?', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Helena/HEL_09.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[341,342,368]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2213, 'HelenaOnNiko', '[]', 'He''s well-intentioned. That''s the foremost thing I can say about him. I''ve never seen any trace of hostility in his actions, but his words sometimes stray from the path he set for them, and his laughter can be a little too gleeful. I fear that Voltaxic Sulphite exposure is poisoning his mind.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
But despite that, he may be the most qualified person on Wraeclast when it comes to the mysteries under the earth - and under the earth is exactly where thousands of years of history have sunk over time.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Helena/HEL_10.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[342]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2214, 'HelenaOnAlva', '[]', 'With that book on Vaal blood thaumaturgy, Alva has accessed a power scholars have only dreamed of for centuries. Travelling back in time sounds both insane and absurd, yet I''ve seen her incursions myself.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
It is both a curse and a blessing that she chooses to employ those incursions solely for personal gain. Yes, we could do so much more with the power to visit the past, but her focused interests also keep the timeline stable. I can''t imagine what would happen to us here and now if, for example, we tried to go back and assassinate Malachai to prevent the Cataclysm.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Would we cease to exist? Or would we simply create a second Wraeclast, one in which the Cataclysm never happened? One could go insane thinking about it...', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Helena/HEL_11.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[342]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2215, 'HelenaOnEinhar', '[]', 'When I first met him, I underestimated Einhar. Coming from the poorest of Ezomytes, themselves already a battered people in this region of the world, Einhar struck me as someone who could contribute brawn to our cause, but not much else.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
How wrong I was. If anyone can decipher the dark design afflicting the creatures of Wraeclast, it''s him. I''ve been looking for the source of all this, an equation or overall pattern, but he''s unknowingly taken an empirical approach. By learning about and understanding every single corrupted animal - and the energies their blood contains - he''s done more to advance our understanding of the problem than I could ever have done myself.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
One day, he may even solve the symptoms of Corruption without ever understanding the root cause. Make no mistake, exile, that''s... impressive. A humanistic brute force approach to a cosmic problem.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Helena/HEL_12.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[342]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2216, 'HelenaOnZana', '[]', 'I heard of Zana, back in Oriath. I even experienced some of the contempt for her and people like her that Dominus wanted the "church-approved" scientific community to feel. With those lies broken, now I see that she is a woman of science like me, and utterly dedicated to her cause.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
The forces she faces are orthogonal to the concerns of this life. I must worry about the real-world logistical and political concerns of Wraeclast first and foremost, but I recognize that she is protecting us in her own way.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Helena/HEL_13.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[342]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2217, 'HelenaOnNavali', '[]', 'I find Navali''s state of existence curious. She is present, sapient, and capable of self-directed action. In a land where the dead continually rise as mindless monsters intent on nothing but destruction, Navali stands as a stark outlier. I suspect that she is trustworthy only because of some Karui essence that still remains from her life before, carrying with it honor, duty, and respect. Were it Piety or Dominus returning in such a form, the consequences would be unthinkable.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Helena/HEL_14.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[342]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2218, 'HelenaOnJun', '[]', 'Jun keeps to herself. It''s clear that she''s not used to trusting strangers. From watching her, I think she is dealing with the loss of her <i>{akhara} by pouring everything she is into her mission. That''s admirable, but dangerous. Keep her safe, exile.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Helena/HEL_15.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[342]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2219, 'HelenaOnOrderOfTheDjinn', '[]', 'The Order of the Djinn is real? You have no idea how much that means to me as an archaeologist. I was in an apprentice position, yes, but my colleagues still refused to listen to a degree I found absurd. I was convinced that there was a pattern behind the absence of artefacts of myth. My conviction reached a certainty so strong that, if a colleague told me about an expedition they had in mind, and if the sought after artefact was one of sufficient mythological renown, I would bet a month''s pay that it would not be found at its supposed resting place.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
I never lost those bets, and now I know I was right, even though I didn''t know the name of my theorized secret organisation of relic keepers until now. The Order of the Djinn found and sequestered all of those powerful artefacts long ago, and good they did. Power like that in the hands of men like Dominus would be catastrophic.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Helena/HEL_16.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[342]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2220, 'HelenaOnThesePeople', '[]', 'While asleep, while dreaming, I felt I was on the verge of a brilliant revelation. In one hand, I held one of Navali''s little purple orbs, and in the other, I had cut my palm for one of Alva''s blood thaumaturgy incursions. In my dream, I was a scale, balancing these two forces.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
No, they were one and the same, and I was caught inside their eternal vortex.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
And with me in that vortex, above, was the shouting, screaming, clawing, and cawing web of life as taught to me by Einhar. Below me, quiet, magmatic, frozen, and grasping, were all the nightmares beneath the earth that Niko has revealed with his delving.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
I thought I was the center of a strange balancing act, but no, exile, it was not me. For I was dreaming; Zana was there, ahead, forging the dream, the unreal. Where she was ahead, I now saw that I was behind, creating the physical, the real. I was not the center. You were.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Do you understand this dream, exile? Even if it means nothing, it''s still reflective of the truth. Each of us carries one end of an impossible axis, and you unite all these forces.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
And together we face the storm.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Helena/HEL_17.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[342,368]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2221, 'HelenaInviteToHideout', '[]', 'Perhaps it''s just paranoia, but I fear those loyal to the High Templar may still be after me. Could you spare some space for me in your hideout?', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Helena/HEL_18.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[341,342,368]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2222, 'HelenaDismissFromHideout', '[]', 'Farewell for now, exile.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Helena/HEL_19.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[341,342,368]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2223, 'HelenaOnOriath', '[]', 'Many of the Blackguard are still alive and scattered across Wraeclast, but the organisation has had its back broken after what happened in Oriath. I wouldn''t want to run into a random knot of them, especially as they start to get hungry and desperate, but I believe their concerted search for us has ended. That''ll give us some breathing room to face new problems.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Helena/HEL_20.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[342]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2224, 'HelenaTransmutiaDevice', '[]', 'Malachai himself gave this Transmutia Device to Maligaro. It makes me incredibly uncomfortable to think about the horrors that it helped bring into being.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
But I must remind myself that science is not responsible for what happened in the Chamber of Sins. Science provides tools for mankind to manipulate the world. It is up to each of us to choose to do good or evil with the power so provided.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Maligaro was the evil responsible, and Malachai before him. Together, you and I are going to start using this Device to undo the damage they did.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Helena/HEL_21.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[342]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2225, 'HelenaEducation', '[]', 'I was no wonder child back in Oriath, but I prided myself on what junior accomplishments I managed to put together within the strict set of allowed sciences. Archaeology was my specialty, and Dominus and his ilk had an uncommon fascination with artefacts from the past. And I... I was told I was crucial. That I was important, because I could tell whether an artefact was truly Vaal simply by running my hand along faded stone patterns.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
I may have had a head slightly too big for my shoulders. When the Ebony Legion made available an archaeologist position on their expedition to Wraeclast and nobody volunteered, I thought my colleagues were all simply afraid of continental dangers.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
No. They knew better. None were allowed to speak it openly, but they knew. I didn''t find out what kind of society I was truly a part of until I saw Piety''s aspirations. I studied the Vaal. I knew all about their downfall, or at least our Templar-twisted perception of it. Piety''s ocean of slaughter... the Vaal called their hubris the Apex of Sacrifice. The Eternal Empire called theirs the Purity Rebellion. We call ours the Temple of Lunaris.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
And I know nothing, exile. Nothing at all.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Save that we are doomed to repeat the mistakes of the past unless we learn the hard way.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Helena/HEL_22.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[342,368]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2226, 'HelenaPostKitava', '[]', 'We are all in your debt for what you''ve done. Oriath stands today only because of your heroism. For my part, I will continue to help you whatever way I can.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Helena/HEL_24.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[368]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2227, 'HelenaCraftingComplete', '[]', 'I could hardly hope for better results. Do note the device needs special reagents to perform, so not all uses will be so easy.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Helena/HEL_25.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[342]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2228, 'BetrayalNikoMinesInaccesible', '[]', 'Hey, mate, what''s going on? Came all the way here to see what''s what in this famous mine, but there''s a bloody big glowing wall blocking it. Can''t squeeze through!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Niko/NK_01.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[332]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2229, 'BetrayalNikoMagicalBarrier', '[]', 'Oooooooh! Look at that!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Niko/NK_02.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[333,334]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2230, 'BetrayalNikoQuestFromTown', '[]', 'See that? One moment, big blades, next moment, gone! Should be able to go in there now. Heard this place reeked of Voltaxic Sulphite back in the day. I was planning on having a wander down there, only... I think I can hear things shuffling around down there, and I''m more of a lover than a fighter. ' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Actually, if you''re headed in there, maybe you could do us a favour. See, I run a little mining operation of my own. Mining''s dangerous at the best of times, but it''s suicidal without a proper source of light. I''ve got lights, just ain''t got no power. Run on Voltaxic Sulphite, they do. Nasty rocks. Stink like a dozen eggs rotting in the summer sun on the back of a whale carcass, and they''re less stable than the High Templar on a bad day. Bloody toxic too. ' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Keep your nostrils peeled for some Voltaxic Sulphite while you''re down there, or anywhere really.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Niko/NK_03.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[332]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2231, 'BetrayalNikoVeinOutOfTown', '[]', 'My, my! Good nose, exile. Know what you''ve found here? This is Voltaxic Sulphite. My name''s Niko and I run a little mining operation of my own. Mining''s dangerous at the best of times, but it''s suicidal without a proper source of light. I''ve got lights, just ain''t got no power. Run on Voltaxic Sulphite, they do. Nasty rocks. Stink like a dozen eggs rotting in the summer sun on the back of a whale carcass, and they''re less stable than the High Templar on a bad day. Bloody toxic too. ' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
You find more and I''ll come right over. Don''t touch it though. Stuff''ll send you mad without the right precautions. You think I want to be dressed like this?' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Tell you what - how about we take a look around my mine.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Niko/NK_04.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[333,334]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2232, 'BetrayalNikoAct9Intro', '[]', 'Quite liked it here, you know, right up until the bloody mountainside started bloody... well... bleedin''. Thought for sure I was hallucinating, ''til the others started screaming and scrambling. Always nice to get a little reassurance about your sanity, eh?', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Niko/NK_05.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[332]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2233, 'BetrayalNikoAct9Gossip1', '[]', 'Well, this nice little outpost here''s been, shall we say, marred. Don''t get me wrong, I love a splash of colour, I just don''t love that colour splashing on me and my friends here. Why do I get the feeling you were involved...?', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Niko/NK_06.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[332]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2234, 'BetrayalNikoAct9Gossip2', '[]', 'Blood everywhere around here... Startin'' to remind me of my time in that little room back in Oriath. All that digging really made a mess of me hands. The mitts ain''t just for protecting me against the sulphite you know.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Niko/NK_07.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[332]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2235, 'BetrayalNikoAct9Gossip3', '[]', 'How can there be this much blood, exile? Where''s it coming from? Where''s it going? Know what I think? I think it''s going back into the mountain. One big loop, exile. One bloody big loop, and someone''s down there pumpin it.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Niko/NK_08.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[332]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2236, 'BetrayalNikoAct9Gossip4', '[]', 'This is a bad omen, exile. A real baaaad sign. What if all the water''s turning to blood, eh? They say the Cataclysm did all sorts of strange things. This seems pretty strange to me! Been having a lot of dreams where I drink all that blood up. My body swells up like a big grape. Can''t hold it in. BANG! I''m gone. What do you think that means, eh? Maybe I''m the only one who can stop it... Maybe I''m the reason it''s here in the first place.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Niko/NK_09.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[332]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2237, 'BetrayalNikoAboutAlva1', '[]', 'I''m plenty familiar with her type. Sniffin'' around for treasure but doing anything they can to make sure it''s not their own nose that gets dirty. No thank you.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Niko/NK_10.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[337]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2238, 'BetrayalNikoAboutAlva2', '[]', 'I know ''er, sure. Don''t care much for her. She''s the type of person that gets others to do the hard work. Rather just do me own work, thank you.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Niko/NK_11.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[337]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2239, 'BetrayalNikoAboutAlva3', '[]', 'Seen her sniffin'' around my mine... Reckon she was looking for some unguarded goods. Lucky for me I own nothing of value!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Niko/NK_12.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[337]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2240, 'BetrayalNikoAboutAlva4', '[]', 'Oh yes... The time traveller. Says she can go back in time. Must mean she''s from the future, eh? Yet when I asked her what I was gonna do next, she couldn''t tell me. Very suspicious.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Niko/NK_13.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[337]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2241, 'BetrayalNikoAboutAlva5', '[]', 'That girl... She''s been eyeing my machine. I know she''s after it. Greedy little-... She can''t have it. Can''t even touch it. She tries, and I''ll bury her alive.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Niko/NK_14.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[337]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2242, 'BetrayalNikoAboutJun1', '[]', 'Somethin'' about masks just put me on the defensive. Probably has something to do with my less-than-pleasant run-ins with the Templar. But she seems like an alright sort. Not exactly one to mess with, what with those bloody big blades of hers.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Niko/NK_15.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[337]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2243, 'BetrayalNikoAboutJun2', '[]', 'She''s hiding her face, but her eyes tell you everything you need to know, don''t they. Curious. A thinker. The type of person who looks you in the eye but sees every other movement too. Dangerous.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Niko/NK_16.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[337]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2244, 'BetrayalNikoAboutJun3', '[]', 'The thing about her is... she''s so... normal. It''s like she''s trying to blend in so hard that she sticks out. Suspicious if you ask me... very, very suspicious. Not that I''d tell her that. I''ve seen what she can do with a knife.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Niko/NK_17.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[337]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2245, 'BetrayalNikoAboutJun4', '[]', 'Ooooh, she''s up to something. Nobody with those darty little eyes and massive blades is completely innocent. Dunno what she''s hidin'', but I''m sure I''ll find out soon enough.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Niko/NK_18.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[337]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2246, 'BetrayalNikoAboutJun5', '[]', 'Nice girl, she is. Very nice indeed. Too nice. Whatever it is she''s hiding with that little performance, its big, exile. Big and heavy. A boulder-sized secret that threatens to sink our nice little ship.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Niko/NK_19.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[337]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2247, 'BetrayalNikoAboutEinhar1', '[]', 'Einhar... Bloody Einhar won''t leave me alone! "We are best friends yes? We will survive the bloody first ones yes?" No, Einhar, none of that is true and you''re bloody crazy. And wash yourself once in a bloody while, will ya!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Niko/NK_20.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[337]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2248, 'BetrayalNikoAboutEinhar2', '[]', 'That Einhar keeps lugging skins and organs over to me, like they''re bloody gifts. What am I supposed to do with half a hellion kidney, Einhar? Eh? I don''t want it. No one wants it. No one wants you. Just stay in your little zoo!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Niko/NK_21.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[337]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2249, 'BetrayalNikoAboutEinhar3', '[]', 'You know, me and him have spent a little time together now, and I must say... I really don''t like him. He smells and he talks too much. I told him to piss off and he laughed and slapped me on the back! I wasn''t bloody joking.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Niko/NK_22.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[337]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2250, 'BetrayalNikoAboutEinhar4', '[]', 'Einhar''s a bloody lunatic. But you know what? He''s growing on me. I don''t want to actively hit him in the face with a rock, so that''s something. Weird thing is, when he''s not around, I still hear his laugh. Or someone''s laugh... Might be my laugh.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Niko/NK_23.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[337]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2251, 'BetrayalNikoAboutEinhar5', '[]', 'My beasty mate. What a guy. Heck of a shot. Loves a laugh. Rips animals apart and brings me all sorts of odd giblets. Can''t believe I used to hate him! Dunno what changed if I''m honest, but since we''re all stuck together, I ain''t complaining.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Niko/NK_24.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[337]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2252, 'BetrayalNikoAboutZana1', '[]', 'Zana''s bright. Brighter than anyone else I can think of, actually, and since I live surrounded by literal darkness, I know a thing or two about bright. When I hit a wall with my own machinery, she''s the one I talk to.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Niko/NK_25.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[337]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2253, 'BetrayalNikoAboutZana2', '[]', 'There aren''t many people worthy of praise left in this world, but Zana is one of them. She outwitted the Templar, built a magnificent device, and hasn''t tried to kill anyone in front of me yet. A rare gem indeed.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Niko/NK_26.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[337]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2254, 'BetrayalNikoAboutZana3', '[]', 'Clever and ambitious, that Zana. And with a kind heart! That''s a particularly rare find in this day and age. Still... I can''t shake the feeling there''s something she''s not telling me. Something... important.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Niko/NK_27.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[337]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2255, 'BetrayalNikoAboutZana4', '[]', 'Zana''s hiding something. She''s very clever, so it''s not obvious, but I''ve seen her... fidgeting. And fretting. What is there to fret about? Something she hasn''t told us, that''s what. She''s lucky I like her...', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Niko/NK_28.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[337]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2256, 'BetrayalNikoAboutZana5', '[]', 'Shh. Don''t want her hearing. I think she''s found something she doesn''t want the rest of us to know about. Know what I think it is?... That''s right, exile... another mine. A secret load of Azurite. And she''s keeping it all for herself. But her secret''s safe with me! ...err... Us, I guess.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Niko/NK_29.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[337]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2257, 'BetrayalNikoAboutNavali1', '[]', 'Dunno how I feel about Navali. Seems to me like the power to see the future could make someone very prosperous, but she''s keeping tight-lipped about anything that could help me! Seems pretty selfish, if you ask me.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Niko/NK_30.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[337]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2258, 'BetrayalNikoAboutNavali2', '[]', 'I want to like Navali. I really do. But... did you know she''s bloody undead?! I''ve seen what the undead can do, exile, and let me tell you, it''s hard to trust someone who might eat your face at any moment.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Niko/NK_31.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[337]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2259, 'BetrayalNikoAboutNavali3', '[]', 'Sometimes Navali looks over at me and just... frowns. Not an angry frown, more like... pity? I know she''s seeing my future... Doesn''t exactly fill me with hope. If my future''s looking grim, I''d quite frankly rather not know.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Niko/NK_32.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[337]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2260, 'BetrayalNikoAboutNavali4', '[]', 'How can Navali sit there, knowing what''s going to happen to all of us, keeping those lips tightly sealed, eh? She knows exactly where and when each of us is going to die. That''s creepy. And she won''t bloody tell us? That''s... evil.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Niko/NK_33.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[337]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2261, 'BetrayalNikoAboutNavali5', '[]', 'She knows too much, exile. Too much! And there''s nothing we can do about it! Can''t kill her, since she''s already bloody dead. Can''t make her tell us what she knows, because even if we know, we can''t bloody do a thing to change it. What''s the point? What''s the point in anything!?', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Niko/NK_34.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[337]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2262, 'BetrayalNikoAboutHelena1', '[]', 'She''s smart enough to know that the blackguards are bad news... Though she did join ''em in the first place. Well, we''ve all made bad decisions, eh? Couldn''t have been easy deciding to leave ''em neither. They''re not exactly the most forgiving lot.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Niko/NK_35.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[337]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2263, 'BetrayalNikoAboutHelena2', '[]', 'Helena''s a good egg. Her moral compass was a little bent, but Oriath''ll do that to ya, as we both know all too well. Got a pretty good brain in her too. Not quite as knowledgeable as me about rocks, but who is, eh?', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Niko/NK_36.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[337]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2264, 'BetrayalNikoAboutHelena3', '[]', 'Been thinkin'' that maybe I oughta keep an eye on that girl. She seems pretty desperate to stay hidden. Gotta ask yourself why... She says she''s worried about blackguards, but who knows how true that really is, eh?', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Niko/NK_37.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[337]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2265, 'BetrayalNikoAboutHelena4', '[]', 'She says she''s still on the run from the blackguards, but... how do we really know where her loyalties lie? Wish we could crack her head open and see what her brain''s doing. She looks like a fighter though. Not really much of a fighter, myself. Just gonna keep an eye on her for now.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Niko/NK_38.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[337]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2266, 'BetrayalNikoAboutHelena5', '[]', 'Helena... Clever, kind, polite... seems too good to be true, if you ask me. You ask me, I think it IS too good to be true. Reckon she''s got some sinister plans... Oh, she hasn''t done anything... untoward... yet, but why would she blow her cover like that, eh? No, she''s biding her time. Well I''m biding mine too. Let''s see who lasts longer. Let''s just wait and see, eh?', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Niko/NK_39.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[337]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2267, 'BetrayalNikoInviteToHideout', '[]', 'You got space for me? Do you?', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Niko/NK_40.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[333,334]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2268, 'BetrayalNikoDismissFromHideout', '[]', 'Cruel, exile. Very cruel.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Niko/NK_41.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[333,334]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2269, 'BetrayalEinharRiverwaysIntro', '[]', 'That look in your eye... I recognise it. A survivor, just like Einhar.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
That is my name, exile. Einhar. In my native tongue it means ''lone fighter''. That is what Einhar was for many years.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
But it is dangerous now to fight alone. Too dangerous, even for the mighty Einhar. We are in the final days of this world, exile. Of that, I am sure. We survivors must unite, prepare for the end, and delay its arrival as long as we can. ' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
For that we will need supplies. Weapons. Shelter. Food. This is where you come in.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Einhar/EF_01.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[173]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2270, 'BetrayalEinharRiverwaysFirstMission', '[]', 'This land is dying. But even a rotting carcass has its uses, yes? ' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Then it is settled. We will make rotting carcasses, and use them to produce the tools we will need to survive.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
But only the finest rotting carcasses will do. Einhar is not picky, but I cannot say the same for the First Ones. There are a few beasts nearby, exile. Special beasts. We will find them. We will fight them. I will catch them. You will enjoy the fruits of my labour. We will be best friends!' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Now, let''s hunt. Together!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Einhar/EF_02.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[173]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2271, 'BetrayalEinharTownIntro', '[]', 'That look in your eye... I recognise it. A survivor, just like Einhar.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
That is my name, exile. Einhar. In my native tongue it means ''lone fighter''. That is what Einhar was for many years.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
But it is dangerous now to fight alone. Too dangerous, even for the mighty Einhar. We are in the final days of this world, exile. Of that, I am sure. We survivors must unite, prepare for the end, and delay its arrival as long as we can. ' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
For that we will need supplies. Weapons. Shelter. Food. ' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
The others here do not understand me the way you do. Meet me in the Riverways, and Einhar will explain what must be done.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Einhar/EF_03.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[174,176]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2272, 'BetrayalEinharMenagerieIntro', '[]', 'Welcome to Einhar''s menagerie, exile. This is where I keep the beasts we capture. Do not worry about their wellbeing - I do not think they will worry about yours!! Haha! A little humour for you.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
But seriously, exile, Einhar takes very good care of the beasts we capture. I feed them, clean them, and read them the poems I write. Then, when you are ready, we slaughter them at the blood altar, to prove to the First Ones that we are worthy of survival. That part is not so friendly to the beasts, but if you read my poetry, you may consider it an act of mercy. Hahaha! Again, humour! My poetry is great.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Please, look around! Take your time! But do not feed the animals. That is Einhar''s job.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Einhar/EF_04.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[176]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2273, 'BetrayalEinharAboutAlva', '[]', 'I love Alva! She is a student of blood thaumaturgy, just like Einhar. And she is collecting things, just like Einhar. But where I collect things so that we may survive the end of the world, Alva collects things from people who did not survive the end of the world already! It is as if we are two heads on the same hound, but her head is where the butt should be!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Einhar/EF_05.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[172]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2274, 'BetrayalEinharAboutNiko', '[]', 'Ohhhh... Niko... I love Niko! Einhar digs around in the bellies of beasts for signs from the First Ones, and Niko digs around in the ground with a big metal spike! And he talks to the First Ones just like I do. Or... I think he does. He talks to someone! And what a voice! He is very skinny though. I am not sure he will be a survivor.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Einhar/EF_06.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[172]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2275, 'BetrayalEinharAboutZana', '[]', 'Einhar loves Zana! Her hair reminds me of the inside of a Devourer, all red and stringy. She says many things that I do not understand, and marks down locations of places I have never been, even though I have been everywhere! So mysterious! Einhar loves mystery and locations. She has not seen her father in a very long time, so I try to be her father. I try to feed her meat as red as her hair. "This will keep it red and stringy!" I say, and she tells me to close my eyes while she eats it. It is so red and stringy, it must be working!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Einhar/EF_07.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[172]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2276, 'BetrayalEinharAboutNavali', '[]', 'Oh yes, the revenant. Well... I love her. She reminds Einhar of the great, feathered Saqawal. I like to sneak up behind her as if she was Saqawal and I were Einhar, and I try to pounce like Einhar would pounce. Every time she steps out of the way and I fall on the ground like a silly Einhar! Even when I am as quiet as dead cat! How does she do it?', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Einhar/EF_08.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[172]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2277, 'BetrayalEinharAboutHelena', '[]', 'The blackguard girl? Einhar hates blackguards... but I loooooove Helena! She is great at finding places to hide. I like to try to find her and then I hide and wait for her to find me! And she never can! Always I win! ...Now that I think about it, I do not think she knows to look for me. Maybe next time I should tell her before I hide.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Einhar/EF_09.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[172]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2278, 'BetrayalEinharAboutJun', '[]', 'She is so mysterious, exile. And I love mysterious! She told me all her friends disappeared, which also happened to Einhar! She thinks her friends are dead, but I don''t think my friends are dead. They disappeared after I cracked open a buck''s skull while we were eating and plucked out its brain. We weren''t even eating venison! I don''t even remember where I found the buck! That was a wonderful birthday.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Einhar/EF_10.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[172]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2279, 'BetrayalEinharOriath', '[]', 'You killed Kitava? Einhar is proud of you, exile! You are not just a survivor, you are a saviour! But... I wish you had at least tried to capture it.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Einhar/EF_11.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[172,173,174,175,176]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2280, 'BetrayalEinharInviteToHideout', '[]', 'Exile! Einhar has heard that you have a little hideout! I will come, and bring only my favourite animal carcasses, yes?', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Einhar/EF_12.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[172,173,174,175,176]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2281, 'BetrayalEinharDismissFromHideout', '[]', 'You want some alone time? I get it. I will go!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Einhar/EF_13.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[172,173,174,175,176]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2282, 'BetrayalEinharOnCaptureSpecial', '[]', 'What? Do you not have nets, exile?', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Einhar/EF_14_A.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[172,173,174,175,176]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2283, 'BetrayalEinharOnCapture1', '[]', 'Ohhh... That was a juicy one, exile.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Einhar/EF_14_B.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[172,173,174,175,176]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2284, 'BetrayalEinharOnCapture2', '[]', 'Do not worry little beast! We are friends now!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Einhar/EF_14_C.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[172,173,174,175,176]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2285, 'BetrayalEinharOnCapture3', '[]', 'Off you go, little beast! Away!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Einhar/EF_14_D.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[172,173,174,175,176]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2286, 'BetrayalEinharOnCapture4', '[]', 'We will be best friends beast! Until we slaughter you!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Einhar/EF_14_E.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[172,173,174,175,176]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2287, 'BetrayalEinharMissionEndsOne', '[]', 'That was a great hunt, exile! Einhar will write a mighty poem about it.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Einhar/EF_15.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[172,173,174,175,176]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2288, 'BetrayalEinharMissionEndsTwo', '[]', 'There are no more worthy beasts nearby, so Einhar will go feed the ones we caught.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Einhar/EF_16.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[172,173,174,175,176]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2289, 'BetrayalEinharMissionEndsThree', '[]', 'An exhilarating hunt, exile! Now it is time for Einhar to go do Einhar business.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Einhar/EF_17.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[172,173,174,175,176]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2290, 'BetrayalEinharMissionEndsFour', '[]', 'That was a hunt you will not soon forget! You''re welcome! Goodbye!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Einhar/EF_18.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[172,173,174,175,176]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2291, 'BetrayalEinharMask', '[]', 'Yes, this is Einhar''s mask. Great job, exile!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Einhar/EF_19.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[172]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2292, 'VaganPrimaryDefenderStartsFightZero', '[]', 'Ho, exile! Care for a scrap?', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Vagan/VAG_1.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[349]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2293, 'VaganPrimaryDefenderStartsFightOne', '[]', 'Exile! You invade, we defend. Have at it!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Vagan/VAG_2.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[349]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2294, 'VaganPrimaryDefenderStartsFightTwo', '[]', 'I''ll defend the cargo as I would a king or queen!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Vagan/VAG_3.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[349]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2295, 'VaganPrimaryDefenderStartsFightThree', '[]', 'I''m no fan of this proving ground, but I still have to do my job.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Vagan/VAG_4.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[349]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2296, 'VaganPrimaryDefenderStartsFightFour', '[]', 'Mmm, surprise tussle!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Vagan/VAG_5.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[349]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2297, 'VaganPrimaryDefenderStartsFightFive', '[]', 'Interrogation was not pleasant. Consider me miffed.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Vagan/VAG_6.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[349]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2298, 'VaganPrimaryDefenderStartsFightSix', '[]', 'Let''s keep it simple this time, exile. Try to best me.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Vagan/VAG_7.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[349]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2299, 'VaganPrimaryDefenderStartsFightSeven', '[]', 'I''m ashamed of what I did last time, exile. Don''t think I''ll be repeating it again!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Vagan/VAG_8.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[349]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2300, 'VaganPrimaryDefenderStartsFightEight', '[]', 'With this new power, this time I''ve got the upper hand!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Vagan/VAG_9.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[349]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2301, 'VaganPrimaryDefenderStartsFightNine', '[]', 'Ah, back for more knocking around?', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Vagan/VAG_10.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[349]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2302, 'VaganPrimaryDefenderStartsFightTen', '[]', 'Let''s see how you weather my blows now!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Vagan/VAG_11.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[349]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2303, 'VaganPrimaryDefenderStartsFightEleven', '[]', 'This ability is... erm... new.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Vagan/VAG_12.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[349]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2304, 'VaganPrimaryDefenderStartsFightTwelve', '[]', 'Let''s see how you fight when you can hardly move!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Vagan/VAG_13.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[349]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2305, 'VaganPrimaryDefenderStartsFightThirteen', '[]', 'A bit of elemental protection should change the balance of this struggle.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Vagan/VAG_14.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[349]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2306, 'VaganPrimaryDefenderStartsFightFourteen', '[]', 'Let''s see you handle a bit of cold!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Vagan/VAG_15.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[349]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2307, 'VaganSafehouseLeaderIntroZero', '[]', 'Let''s see how you fare in my arena.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Vagan/VAG_16.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[349]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2308, 'VaganSecondaryDefenderArrivalZero', '[]', 'Let''s make this a team defense match!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Vagan/VAG_17.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[349]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2309, 'VaganSecondaryDefenderArrivalOne', '[]', 'A running battle? Glorious!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Vagan/VAG_18.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[349]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2310, 'VaganSecondaryDefenderArrivalTwo', '[]', 'Let''s get this one over with.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Vagan/VAG_19.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[349]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2311, 'VaganSecondaryDefenderArrivalThree', '[]', 'A right toss-up. This was meant to be quick and clean!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Vagan/VAG_20.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[349]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2312, 'VaganSecondaryDefenderArrivalFour', '[]', 'I feel like jumping in.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Vagan/VAG_21.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[349]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2313, 'VaganSecondaryDefenderArrivalFive', '[]', 'Well, we certainly can''t let this place fall.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Vagan/VAG_22.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[349]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2314, 'VaganSecondaryDefenderArrivalSix', '[]', 'Come on old chap, put those Ancestors to work!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Vagan/VAG_23.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[349]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2315, 'VaganSecondaryDefenderArrivalSeven', '[]', 'Don''t scratch me, Tora... well, until we''re done, that is.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Vagan/VAG_24.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[349]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2316, 'VaganSecondaryDefenderArrivalEight', '[]', 'Let''s see if you can earn an honourable kill, Vorici.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Vagan/VAG_25.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[349]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2317, 'VaganSecondaryDefenderArrivalNine', '[]', 'Ha, Guff, I''ll go high, you go low!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Vagan/VAG_26.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[349]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2318, 'VaganSecondaryDefenderArrivalTen', '[]', 'May the best man win, Thane. That is where we agree.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Vagan/VAG_27.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[349]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2319, 'VaganSecondaryDefenderArrivalEleven', '[]', 'I''ve been itching for a good fight! Mind if I jump in?', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Vagan/VAG_28.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[349]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2320, 'VaganSecondaryDefenderArrivalTwelve', '[]', 'I''m going to mix this one up a bit.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Vagan/VAG_29.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[349]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2321, 'VaganSecondaryDefenderArrivalThirteen', '[]', 'A moving target! I love a challenge.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Vagan/VAG_30.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[349]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2322, 'VaganSecondaryDefenderArrivalFourteen', '[]', 'I am not a fan of what goes on here. Time for a ruckus.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Vagan/VAG_31.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[349]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2323, 'VaganSecondaryDefenderArrivalFifteen', '[]', 'Free for all!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Vagan/VAG_32.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[349]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2324, 'VaganSecondaryDefenderArrivalSixteen', '[]', 'I promise there''s nothing personal about this.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Vagan/VAG_33.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[349]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2325, 'VaganSecondaryDefenderArrivalSeventeen', '[]', 'You''ll have to earn this kill, ol'' stabby.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Vagan/VAG_34.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[349]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2326, 'VaganSecondaryDefenderArrivalEighteen', '[]', 'Guff.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Vagan/VAG_35.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[349]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2327, 'VaganSecondaryDefenderArrivalNineteen', '[]', 'Show me some of that Redblade swagger!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Vagan/VAG_36.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[349]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2328, 'VaganSecondaryDefenderArrivalTwenty', '[]', 'Let me see some of that Mutewind cunning.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Vagan/VAG_37.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[349]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2329, 'VaganSecondaryDefenderArrivalTwentyOne', '[]', 'Oh, I can''t miss this!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Vagan/VAG_38.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[349]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2330, 'VaganReplyToSecondaryDefenderArrivalZero', '[]', 'I''ll hold this base against all forces.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Vagan/VAG_39.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[349]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2331, 'VaganReplyToSecondaryDefenderArrivalOne', '[]', 'You''re responsible for the consequences!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Vagan/VAG_40.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[349]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2332, 'VaganReplyToSecondaryDefenderArrivalTwo', '[]', 'You are aware we need to do our jobs, right?', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Vagan/VAG_41.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[349]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2333, 'VaganReplyToSecondaryDefenderArrivalThree', '[]', 'Daresso''s arse, you can''t be serious!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Vagan/VAG_42.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[349]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2334, 'VaganReplyToSecondaryDefenderArrivalFour', '[]', 'Always enjoy a bloody good tussle!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Vagan/VAG_43.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[349]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2335, 'VaganReplyToSecondaryDefenderArrivalFive', '[]', 'You knew what this was, Tora. I never made any promises!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Vagan/VAG_44.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[349]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2336, 'VaganReplyToSecondaryDefenderArrivalSix', '[]', 'I''m sorry, what? And no! Absolutely not!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Vagan/VAG_45.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[349]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2337, 'VaganReplyToSecondaryDefenderArrivalSeven', '[]', 'Why me?', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Vagan/VAG_46.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[349]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2338, 'VaganReplyToSecondaryDefenderArrivalEight', '[]', 'Keep trying, Riker. You''ll never measure up!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Vagan/VAG_47.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[349]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2339, 'VaganReplyToSecondaryDefenderArrivalNine', '[]', 'This fight just got interesting!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Vagan/VAG_48.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[349]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2340, 'VaganReplyToSecondaryDefenderArrivalTen', '[]', 'We''ll certainly lock this down now.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Vagan/VAG_49.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[349]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2341, 'VaganReplyToSecondaryDefenderArrivalEleven', '[]', 'Your chances are shrinking, exile.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Vagan/VAG_50.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[349]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2342, 'VaganReplyToSecondaryDefenderArrivalTwelve', '[]', 'Not the prettiest job, but not one I''m willing to lose!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Vagan/VAG_51.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[349]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2343, 'VaganReplyToSecondaryDefenderArrivalThirteen', '[]', 'The challenge of your life, exile!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Vagan/VAG_52.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[349]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2344, 'VaganReplyToSecondaryDefenderArrivalFourteen', '[]', 'Come on Leo, show me that Redmane style!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Vagan/VAG_53.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[349]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2345, 'VaganReplyToSecondaryDefenderArrivalFifteen', '[]', 'Now I''m the one on top, Tora!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Vagan/VAG_54.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[349]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2346, 'VaganReplyToSecondaryDefenderArrivalSixteen', '[]', 'Show them some Brinerot lightning!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Vagan/VAG_55.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[349]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2347, 'VaganReplyToSecondaryDefenderArrivalSeventeen', '[]', 'Unleash that Redblade fire!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Vagan/VAG_56.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[349]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2348, 'VaganReplyToSecondaryDefenderArrivalEighteen', '[]', 'Freeze them in terror, Mutewind!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Vagan/VAG_57.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[349]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2349, 'VaganReplyToSecondaryDefenderArrivalNineteen', '[]', 'You there. Look alive, rouse to battle!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Vagan/VAG_58.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[349]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2350, 'VaganKillPlayerZero', '[]', 'Ah, over too soon!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Vagan/VAG_59.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 8, 0, 1, '[349]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2351, 'VaganKillPlayerOne', '[]', 'A fight for the ages!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Vagan/VAG_60.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 8, 0, 1, '[349]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2352, 'VaganKillPlayerTwo', '[]', 'Ugh. Sorry you had to fall here, among all this.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Vagan/VAG_61.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 8, 0, 1, '[349]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2353, 'VaganKillPlayerThree', '[]', 'A rousing success!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Vagan/VAG_62.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 8, 0, 1, '[349]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2354, 'VaganEscapeZero', '[]', 'A good death never hurt anyone!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Vagan/VAG_63.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 4, 0, 1, '[349]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2355, 'VaganEscapeOne', '[]', 'Exhilarating conflict, exile!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Vagan/VAG_64.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 4, 0, 1, '[349]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2356, 'VaganEscapeTwo', '[]', 'Done at last. So long, exile!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Vagan/VAG_65.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 4, 0, 1, '[349]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2357, 'VaganDefeatedZero', '[]', 'A good strike... and a painful one.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Vagan/VAG_66.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 9, 0, 1, '[349]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2358, 'VaganDefeatedOne', '[]', 'Uggggh...', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Vagan/VAG_67.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 9, 0, 1, '[349]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2359, 'VaganDefeatedTwo', '[]', 'Please... not... here...', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Vagan/VAG_68.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 9, 0, 1, '[349]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2360, 'VaganDefeatedThree', '[]', 'Only fair... I suppose...!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Vagan/VAG_69.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 9, 0, 1, '[349]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2361, 'VaganDefeatedFour', '[]', 'Be a friend... don''t lock me up... again.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Vagan/VAG_70.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 9, 0, 1, '[349]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2362, 'VaganDefeatedFive', '[]', 'A spot more... wheeling and dealing...?', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Vagan/VAG_71.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 9, 0, 1, '[349]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2363, 'VaganDefeatedSix', '[]', 'Bitter justice... for my betrayal...', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Vagan/VAG_72.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 9, 0, 1, '[349]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2364, 'VaganDefeatedSeven', '[]', 'One death... is as good as another.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Vagan/VAG_73.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 9, 0, 1, '[349]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2365, 'VaganDefeatedEight', '[]', 'I see... you''ve been training!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Vagan/VAG_74.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 9, 0, 1, '[349]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2366, 'VaganDefeatedNine', '[]', 'A proper good turnabout...', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Vagan/VAG_75.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 9, 0, 1, '[349]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2367, 'VaganDefeatedTen', '[]', 'Well this... is embarrassing...', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Vagan/VAG_76.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 9, 0, 1, '[349]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2368, 'VaganOfferBargainZero', '[]', 'Exile, you''re taking all of this far too personally! But I must confess, I''d rather not be the next on the chopping block. Go on then... what do you need from me?', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Vagan/VAG_77.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[349]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2369, 'VaganOfferBargainOne', '[]', 'A fair fight''s fine and all, but it''s not exactly a challenge, is it? Putting aside your goals here, have you considered the joys of duelling duos? Pick a partner, and we can start some on-the-job training.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Vagan/VAG_78.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[349]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2370, 'VaganOfferBargainTwo', '[]', 'You know, I know a thing or two that might tickle your fancy. I just need to verify with a confederate of mine that I do in fact know what I know, you know?', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Vagan/VAG_79.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[349]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2371, 'VaganOfferBargainThree', '[]', 'A fighter doesn''t just swing a sword. Combat is a complex dance that tests every muscle. Meanwhile, I''m stuck here doing the same things over and over. A waste, if you ask me! I think this loss is a surefire sign that I need to stretch some other muscles. Let me go, and that''s exactly what I''ll do.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Vagan/VAG_80.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[349]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2372, 'VaganOfferBargainFour', '[]', 'There''s no ''I'' in teamwork. There''s also no glory in teamwork. But there is an ''I'' in glory if you spell it wrong. I think it''s time I explored my options solo. Free me, and the next time you encounter the Syndicate, it won''t include me.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Vagan/VAG_81.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[349]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2373, 'VaganOfferBargainFive', '[]', 'I may have a reputation for loquaciousness, but I''m a keen listener, too. If you spare my life, I might be convinced to merge these two hobbies of mine into a tight little info package.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Vagan/VAG_82.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[349]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2374, 'VaganOfferBargainSix', '[]', 'Victory must be rewarded, I always say, and while beheading me might be reward for some, I think you''d prefer something more useful.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Vagan/VAG_83.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[349]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2375, 'VaganBargainAcceptedZero', '[]', 'Until next time!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Vagan/VAG_84.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[349]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2376, 'VaganBargainAcceptedOne', '[]', 'I''m a man of my word.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Vagan/VAG_85.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[349]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2377, 'VaganBargainAcceptedTwo', '[]', 'Feeling more limber already!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Vagan/VAG_86.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[349]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2378, 'VaganBargainAcceptedThree', '[]', 'Glory, here I come.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Vagan/VAG_87.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[349]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2379, 'VaganBargainAcceptedFour', '[]', 'Good choice. Now listen up!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Vagan/VAG_88.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[349]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2380, 'VaganBargainAcceptedFive', '[]', 'All that glitters is gold... or steel.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Vagan/VAG_89.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[349]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2381, 'VaganOfferBetrayalZero', '[]', 'What''s a man to do when his blunderous immediate superior continually forces him into unwinnable situations? Take down the immediate superior. Care to lend a hand?', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Vagan/VAG_90.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[349]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2382, 'VaganOfferBetrayalOne', '[]', 'My team here has been nothing but dead weight dragging me into the mire. Time to get back to my roots! Let me claim what I will from them, and be on my way, and you can do with them what you like.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Vagan/VAG_91.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[349]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2383, 'VaganOfferBetrayalTwo', '[]', 'When your team has a dud on the roster, you don''t keep them around. You give them a kick up the arse and send them packing. Which one here deserves the boot?', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Vagan/VAG_92.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[349]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2384, 'VaganOfferBetrayalThree', '[]', 'A fighter never goes into a fight without knowing everything about his enemies and his allies. I know enough about my friends here to fill a small novel. Care to flick through the pages?', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Vagan/VAG_93.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[349]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2385, 'VaganOfferBetrayalFour', '[]', 'Leo''s a tough one. He''ll understand if we work together to undermine him a bit.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Vagan/VAG_94.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[349]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2386, 'VaganOfferBetrayalFive', '[]', 'I''m a fighter, but I fight you face to face. Vorici won''t even let you get a weapon out! Best to deal with him now, eh?', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Vagan/VAG_95.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[349]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2387, 'VaganOfferBetrayalSix', '[]', 'Guff''s greatest achievement is keeping all his rum down. Not exactly one for the history books. A kick in the rear should provide the encouragement he needs.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Vagan/VAG_96.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[349]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2388, 'VaganOfferBetrayalSeven', '[]', 'The Redblade''s a bit of a firebug, if you hadn''t noticed. Arson''s not the most constructive of pastimes. With a little encouragement from us, perhaps we can instigate some change.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Vagan/VAG_97.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[349]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2389, 'VaganOfferBetrayalEight', '[]', 'I don''t trust that Mutewind, and neither should you. Let''s put her in her place while she''s... otherwise preoccupied.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Vagan/VAG_98.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[349]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2390, 'VaganOfferBetrayalNine', '[]', 'A rough tussle, but I''d rather not lose my head over it. I could, however, bear the loss of another head.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Vagan/VAG_99.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[349]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2391, 'VaganOfferExecuteZero', '[]', 'Death''s the only option here, I''m afraid.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Vagan/VAG_100.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[349]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2392, 'VaganOfferExecuteOne', '[]', 'In front of my leader, I can only choose to die.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Vagan/VAG_101.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[349]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2393, 'VaganOfferExecuteTwo', '[]', 'Stay strong. Death''s not that painful... I hope.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Vagan/VAG_102.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[349]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2394, 'VaganOfferExecuteThree', '[]', 'Better than being interrogated, I suppose.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Vagan/VAG_103.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[349]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2395, 'VaganReplyToBetrayalAcceptedZero', '[]', 'Deeply unkind.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Vagan/VAG_104.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[349]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2396, 'VaganReplyToBetrayalAcceptedOne', '[]', 'Leo, you unabashed rascal!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Vagan/VAG_105.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[349]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2397, 'VaganReplyToBetrayalAcceptedTwo', '[]', 'Fear a woman scorned, exile.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Vagan/VAG_106.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[349]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2398, 'VaganReplyToBetrayalAcceptedThree', '[]', 'You''d be amazed what a little oil will get you out of.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Vagan/VAG_107.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[349]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2399, 'VaganReplyToBetrayalAcceptedFour', '[]', 'She and I could raise some hell together, exile - if only she weren''t insane.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Vagan/VAG_108.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[349]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2400, 'VaganReplyToBetrayalAcceptedFive', '[]', 'Riker''s just jealous.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Vagan/VAG_109.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[349]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2401, 'VaganReplyToBetrayalAcceptedSix', '[]', 'A dirty move, but you won''t catch me whining.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Vagan/VAG_110.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[349]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2402, 'VaganInterrogatedZero', '[]', 'I call foul!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Vagan/VAG_111.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[349]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2403, 'VaganInterrogatedOne', '[]', 'This is right out of bounds!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Vagan/VAG_112.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[349]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2404, 'VaganInterrogatedTwo', '[]', 'Can''t we bargain again instead? No?', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Vagan/VAG_113.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[349]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2405, 'VaganReplyToExecutionZero', '[]', 'Was that really necessary?', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Vagan/VAG_114.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[349]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2406, 'VaganReplyToExecutionOne', '[]', 'That was my friend!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Vagan/VAG_115.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[349]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2407, 'VaganReplyToExecutionTwo', '[]', 'I''m trying hard to summon up a bit of sorrow here.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Vagan/VAG_116.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[349]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2408, 'VaganSafehouseLeaderDefeatedZero', '[]', 'A surprise upset!... good show...', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Vagan/VAG_117.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 10, 0, 1, '[349]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2409, 'VaganPrimaryDefenderStartsFightFifteen', '[]', 'This one smiles, but his eyes are deadly serious.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/JunOrtoi/JO2_46.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[343]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2410, 'VaganEscapeThree', '[]', 'Since when does a warrior run from a fight?', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/JunOrtoi/JO2_73.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 4, 0, 1, '[343]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2411, 'VaganDefeatedEleven', '[]', 'An impressive display, warrior, but not enough.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/JunOrtoi/JO2_63.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 9, 0, 1, '[343]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2412, 'VaganBargainAcceptedSix', '[]', 'I expect you will come at us with a new strategy next time, Vagan. I look forward to it.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/JunOrtoi/JO2_84.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[343]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2413, 'VaganInterrogatedThree', '[]', 'I will be cruel in my methods, because he can take it.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/JunOrtoi/JO2_101.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[343]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2414, 'VaganSecondaryDefenderArrivalTwentyTwo', '[]', 'Vagan, are you so desperate to win?', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/JunOrtoi/JO_61.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[343]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2415, 'VaganSecondaryDefenderArrivalTwentyThree', '[]', 'Surely you want the thrill of a free for all, warrior!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/JunOrtoi/JO2_119.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[343]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2416, 'VaganReplyToSecondaryDefenderArrivalTwenty', '[]', 'Warrior, how do you stand for this?', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/JunOrtoi/JO2_136.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[343]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2417, 'VaganReplyToSecondaryDefenderArrivalTwentyOne', '[]', 'I was hoping to avoid clashing with the warrior here.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/JunOrtoi/JO2_170.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[343]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2418, 'VaganReplyToSecondaryDefenderArrivalTwentyTwo', '[]', 'Come on, warrior, you don''t need help!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/JunOrtoi/JO2_153.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[343]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2419, 'VaganReplyToBetrayalAcceptedSeven', '[]', 'Best sleep in your armour from now on, warrior.', '', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[343]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2420, 'HakuPrimaryDefenderStartsFightZero', '[]', 'Tala moana, warrior! Flee if you do not wish to die.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Haku/HAK_1.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[346]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2421, 'HakuPrimaryDefenderStartsFightOne', '[]', 'Brave of you to attack a Karui in his fortress. Brave, and foolish.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Haku/HAK_2.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[346]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2422, 'HakuPrimaryDefenderStartsFightTwo', '[]', 'Keep moving! I''ll handle the exile.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Haku/HAK_3.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[346]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2423, 'HakuPrimaryDefenderStartsFightThree', '[]', 'Exile, you''ve just walked into your tomb.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Haku/HAK_4.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[346]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2424, 'HakuPrimaryDefenderStartsFightFour', '[]', 'Hinekora, I will send you a gift!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Haku/HAK_5.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[346]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2425, 'HakuPrimaryDefenderStartsFightFive', '[]', 'Did you think I would crumble in that prison? My ancestors spent centuries in shackles.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Haku/HAK_6.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[346]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2426, 'HakuPrimaryDefenderStartsFightSix', '[]', 'I stayed true to my word, exile. Did you?', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Haku/HAK_7.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[346]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2427, 'HakuPrimaryDefenderStartsFightSeven', '[]', 'My ancestors will forgive my transgressions. Will yours?', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Haku/HAK_8.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[346]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2428, 'HakuPrimaryDefenderStartsFightEight', '[]', 'The Mother of Death did not return me empty-handed.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Haku/HAK_9.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[346]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2429, 'HakuPrimaryDefenderStartsFightNine', '[]', 'Back from the dead? You are nothing but a child of Kitava.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Haku/HAK_10.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[346]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2430, 'HakuPrimaryDefenderStartsFightTen', '[]', 'I will crush you.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Haku/HAK_11.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[346]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2431, 'HakuPrimaryDefenderStartsFightEleven', '[]', 'A true warrior need only hit you once.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Haku/HAK_12.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[346]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2432, 'HakuPrimaryDefenderStartsFightTwelve', '[]', 'Nothing can stop a true Karui warrior.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Haku/HAK_13.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[346]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2433, 'HakuPrimaryDefenderStartsFightThirteen', '[]', 'We Karui were born in a volcano.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Haku/HAK_14.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[346]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2434, 'HakuPrimaryDefenderStartsFightFourteen', '[]', 'You have no concept of what you truly face.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Haku/HAK_15.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[346]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2435, 'HakuSafehouseLeaderIntroZero', '[]', 'I will hang your head on my belt, as Kaom did Lioneye''s.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Haku/HAK_16.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[346]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2436, 'HakuSecondaryDefenderArrivalZero', '[]', 'We will push the invader back together!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Haku/HAK_17.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[346]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2437, 'HakuSecondaryDefenderArrivalOne', '[]', 'We cannot lose this cargo!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Haku/HAK_18.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[346]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2438, 'HakuSecondaryDefenderArrivalTwo', '[]', 'Strength in numbers, friend!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Haku/HAK_19.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[346]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2439, 'HakuSecondaryDefenderArrivalThree', '[]', 'The Ancestors forgive. The Syndicate does not.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Haku/HAK_20.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[346]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2440, 'HakuSecondaryDefenderArrivalFour', '[]', 'I lend you my strength, ally.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Haku/HAK_21.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[346]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2441, 'HakuSecondaryDefenderArrivalFive', '[]', 'The Syndicate fights as one!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Haku/HAK_22.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[346]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2442, 'HakuSecondaryDefenderArrivalSix', '[]', 'Stop wasting time, Leo. We have more important tasks.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Haku/HAK_23.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[346]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2443, 'HakuSecondaryDefenderArrivalSeven', '[]', 'Talamoana, holy man. Did your god not show up?', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Haku/HAK_24.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[346]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2444, 'HakuSecondaryDefenderArrivalEight', '[]', 'Talamoana, son of stone.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Haku/HAK_25.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[346]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2445, 'HakuSecondaryDefenderArrivalNine', '[]', 'Rin, let me show you how a Karui fights.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Haku/HAK_26.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[346]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2446, 'HakuSecondaryDefenderArrivalTen', '[]', 'You put too much faith in your gadgetry, Riker.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Haku/HAK_27.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[346]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2447, 'HakuSecondaryDefenderArrivalEleven', '[]', 'Ancestors, guide us to victory.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Haku/HAK_28.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[346]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2448, 'HakuSecondaryDefenderArrivalTwelve', '[]', 'I have come to claim what is mine.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Haku/HAK_29.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[346]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2449, 'HakuSecondaryDefenderArrivalThirteen', '[]', 'Your failure will be my finest hour.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Haku/HAK_30.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[346]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2450, 'HakuSecondaryDefenderArrivalFourteen', '[]', 'You will all be buried down here.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Haku/HAK_31.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[346]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2451, 'HakuSecondaryDefenderArrivalFifteen', '[]', 'I will bring you all into Hinekora''s domain.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Haku/HAK_32.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[346]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2452, 'HakuSecondaryDefenderArrivalSixteen', '[]', 'Let''s see if my attacks draw out that god of yours, holy man.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Haku/HAK_33.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[346]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2453, 'HakuSecondaryDefenderArrivalSeventeen', '[]', 'I am sorry huntress, but we must be enemies this day.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Haku/HAK_34.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[346]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2454, 'HakuSecondaryDefenderArrivalEighteen', '[]', 'Exile, know that when that creature dies, it will not go to Hinekora. It will go nowhere at all.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Haku/HAK_35.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[346]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2455, 'HakuSecondaryDefenderArrivalNineteen', '[]', 'Your spirit will be the plaything of the Ancestors, slavemaster.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Haku/HAK_36.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[346]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2456, 'HakuSecondaryDefenderArrivalTwenty', '[]', 'You go too far, Aisling. Violence is a necessity, not an idle pastime.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Haku/HAK_37.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[346]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2457, 'HakuSecondaryDefenderArrivalTwentyOne', '[]', 'Hinekora demands many sacrifices this day. Consider it an honour.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Haku/HAK_38.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[346]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2458, 'HakuReplyToSecondaryDefenderArrivalZero', '[]', 'Scoundrel! I will break you, too!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Haku/HAK_39.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[346]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2459, 'HakuReplyToSecondaryDefenderArrivalOne', '[]', 'I am not yet dead, vulture!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Haku/HAK_40.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[346]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2460, 'HakuReplyToSecondaryDefenderArrivalTwo', '[]', 'You have just buried yourself.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Haku/HAK_41.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[346]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2461, 'HakuReplyToSecondaryDefenderArrivalThree', '[]', 'I will show you no mercy, traitor.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Haku/HAK_42.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[346]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2462, 'HakuReplyToSecondaryDefenderArrivalFour', '[]', 'I think my gods are stronger than yours, crusader.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Haku/HAK_43.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[346]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2463, 'HakuReplyToSecondaryDefenderArrivalFive', '[]', 'I won''t need my ancestors'' aid for this one, abomination.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Haku/HAK_44.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[346]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2464, 'HakuReplyToSecondaryDefenderArrivalSix', '[]', 'You will answer to the Ancestors, Gravicius - with screams.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Haku/HAK_45.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[346]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2465, 'HakuReplyToSecondaryDefenderArrivalSeven', '[]', 'The dead belong to Hinekora, defiler. I will send you to her.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Haku/HAK_46.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[346]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2466, 'HakuReplyToSecondaryDefenderArrivalEight', '[]', 'So be it. Karui jade will cleave you just as easily as this exile.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Haku/HAK_47.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[346]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2467, 'HakuSecondaryDefenderArrivalTwentyTwo', '[]', 'Steel yourself. For Tukohama!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Haku/HAK_48.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[346]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2468, 'HakuSecondaryDefenderArrivalTwentyThree', '[]', 'Ancestors, witness this!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Haku/HAK_49.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[346]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2469, 'HakuSecondaryDefenderArrivalTwentyFour', '[]', 'Feel the walls tremble with our combined might!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Haku/HAK_50.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[346]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2470, 'HakuSecondaryDefenderArrivalTwentyFive', '[]', 'Can you hear it, exile? Hinekora is calling your name.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Haku/HAK_51.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[346]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2471, 'HakuSecondaryDefenderArrivalTwentySix', '[]', 'Tora, I''d no sooner taunt a wolf than give you an order. Just remember: I''m the alpha.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Haku/HAK_52.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[346]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2472, 'HakuSecondaryDefenderArrivalTwentySeven', '[]', 'Assassin! Do not forget who is in charge.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Haku/HAK_53.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[346]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2473, 'HakuSecondaryDefenderArrivalTwentyEight', '[]', 'I protect all my men, even ones that aren''t.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Haku/HAK_54.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[346]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2474, 'HakuSecondaryDefenderArrivalTwentyNine', '[]', 'A Karui in command over Gravicius. Hinekora is laughing.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Haku/HAK_55.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[346]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2475, 'HakuSecondaryDefenderArrivalThirty', '[]', 'Direct your gadgetry as I command, Maloney, and those traps of yours might just accomplish something.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Haku/HAK_56.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[346]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2476, 'HakuSecondaryDefenderArrivalThirtyOne', '[]', 'To face a Karui''s men is to face the Karui.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Haku/HAK_57.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[346]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2477, 'HakuKillPlayerZero', '[]', 'A worthy foe.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Haku/HAK_58.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 8, 0, 1, '[346]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2478, 'HakuKillPlayerOne', '[]', 'You will feed the worms.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Haku/HAK_59.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 8, 0, 1, '[346]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2479, 'HakuKillPlayerTwo', '[]', 'A glorious fight!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Haku/HAK_60.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 8, 0, 1, '[346]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2480, 'HakuKillPlayerThree', '[]', 'Mother of Death, a gift.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Haku/HAK_61.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 8, 0, 1, '[346]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2481, 'HakuEscapeZero', '[]', 'A warning. Do not cross me again.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Haku/HAK_62.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 4, 0, 1, '[346]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2482, 'HakuEscapeOne', '[]', 'A nesting bird gets no worms. So long, exile.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Haku/HAK_63.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 4, 0, 1, '[346]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2483, 'HakuEscapeTwo', '[]', 'You have not earned the Ancestors'' favour. That is why you are destined to fail.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Haku/HAK_64.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 4, 0, 1, '[346]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2484, 'HakuDefeatedZero', '[]', 'Tukohama... how did I fail?', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Haku/HAK_65.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 9, 0, 1, '[346]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2485, 'HakuDefeatedOne', '[]', 'No... the cart must... ugh...', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Haku/HAK_66.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 9, 0, 1, '[346]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2486, 'HakuDefeatedTwo', '[]', 'Ancestors... I - forgive me.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Haku/HAK_67.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 9, 0, 1, '[346]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2487, 'HakuDefeatedThree', '[]', 'Hinekora... I am sorry.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Haku/HAK_68.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 9, 0, 1, '[346]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2488, 'HakuDefeatedFour', '[]', 'Don''t... lock me up again...', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Haku/HAK_69.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 9, 0, 1, '[346]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2489, 'HakuDefeatedFive', '[]', 'Ugh... exile... another deal...?', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Haku/HAK_70.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 9, 0, 1, '[346]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2490, 'HakuDefeatedSix', '[]', 'I strayed too far... from the Way.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Haku/HAK_71.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 9, 0, 1, '[346]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2491, 'HakuDefeatedSeven', '[]', 'Ancestors... I will see you again.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Haku/HAK_72.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 9, 0, 1, '[346]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2492, 'HakuDefeatedEight', '[]', 'You... have learned much...', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Haku/HAK_73.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 9, 0, 1, '[346]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2493, 'HakuDefeatedNine', '[]', 'This was... a cursed task.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Haku/HAK_74.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 9, 0, 1, '[346]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2494, 'HakuDefeatedTen', '[]', 'I was a fool... to follow my fury.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Haku/HAK_75.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 9, 0, 1, '[346]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2495, 'HakuOfferBargainZero', '[]', 'I do not wish to join my ancestors just yet, exile. In Ngamakanui, our treaties mandated that an offering of peace be witnessed by a third. I wish for peace. Will you choose our witness?', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Haku/HAK_76.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[346]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2496, 'HakuOfferBargainOne', '[]', 'Enough blood has been shed today, warrior. Put down your weapon, and I will offer you an opportunity. There is one in my new tribe I would deceive. Give me a reason to, and I will tell you that which I know about them.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Haku/HAK_77.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[346]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2497, 'HakuOfferBargainTwo', '[]', 'Conquerors don''t just win fights, they put people in positions where it benefits them most. I think I would benefit you better elsewhere.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Haku/HAK_78.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[346]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2498, 'HakuOfferBargainThree', '[]', 'I do not wish to be here any longer, exile. The Ancestors whisper in my ear. They tell me that I am needed back home in Ngamakanui. Have you the mercy to let a man return to his family?', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Haku/HAK_79.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[346]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2499, 'HakuOfferBargainFour', '[]', 'I know when I am defeated. Not every fight must end with death, nor should it. In my tribe, the victor claims their prize, and the slate is wiped clean. I will tell you what you want to know in exchange for my safety.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Haku/HAK_80.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[346]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100);
INSERT INTO "NPCTextAudio" ("_row", "Id", "Characters", "Text", "Mono_AudioFile", "Stereo_AudioFile", "HasStereo", "__col6", "Video", "__col8", "__col9", "__col10", "NPCs", "NPCPortrait", "__col13", "__col14", "Cooldown", "__col16") VALUES
(2500, 'HakuOfferBargainFive', '[]', 'I know my histories. You conquerors are all the same. You seek only two things: my head, or my goods. So take one and leave the other.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Haku/HAK_81.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[346]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2501, 'HakuOfferBargainSix', '[]', 'I must confess, I believed you to be bluffing. I see now how little regard for life you truly have. Whatever it is you want, it''s yours.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Haku/HAK_82.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[346]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2502, 'HakuBargainAcceptedZero', '[]', 'A wise choice indeed.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Haku/HAK_83.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[346]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2503, 'HakuBargainAcceptedOne', '[]', 'Then it is subterfuge.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Haku/HAK_84.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[346]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2504, 'HakuBargainAcceptedTwo', '[]', 'So be it. I will fulfill my duties there.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Haku/HAK_85.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[346]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2505, 'HakuBargainAcceptedThree', '[]', 'It will be good to see my family again.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Haku/HAK_86.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[346]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2506, 'HakuBargainAcceptedFour', '[]', 'Consider us even.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Haku/HAK_87.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[346]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2507, 'HakuBargainAcceptedFive', '[]', 'Take your prize and go.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Haku/HAK_88.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[346]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2508, 'HakuOfferBetrayalZero', '[]', 'It is the Karui way to give leadership to the victor. In this situation, I believe that means that you could choose a new leader in place of the old one. If you choose me, I will honour that choice.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Haku/HAK_89.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[346]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2509, 'HakuOfferBetrayalOne', '[]', 'Among the Karui, conflict often results in changes in rank and respect. In this situation, I believe that means you could demote some and promote others. If you choose me, I will honour that choice.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Haku/HAK_90.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[346]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2510, 'HakuOfferBetrayalTwo', '[]', 'The Syndicate does not follow the Karui Way, but I do, and a victory like yours gives you a choice over our fates. If you so choose, you could have one of us exiled from the Syndicate entirely. If you make that choice here and now, I will make sure they honour it.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Haku/HAK_91.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[346]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2511, 'HakuOfferBetrayalThree', '[]', 'A victory like yours demands a prize. I have nothing to give except information - not typically considered a prize by the Karui, but, in this situation, I believe information is your most valuable weapon against the Syndicate.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Haku/HAK_92.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[346]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2512, 'HakuOfferBetrayalFour', '[]', 'There is a fine line between belief and madness. I believe Elreon is long past it.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Haku/HAK_93.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[346]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2513, 'HakuOfferBetrayalFive', '[]', 'The huntress has lost her path. Let''s help her find it together.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Haku/HAK_94.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[346]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2514, 'HakuOfferBetrayalSix', '[]', 'I bear no kinship with that... thing. It is not of this world and is entirely without honour.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Haku/HAK_95.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[346]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2515, 'HakuOfferBetrayalSeven', '[]', 'Our conflict aside, exile, Gravicius must be made to answer for his atrocities. You''ll find no better chance than this to provide the Ancestors a sliver of justice.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Haku/HAK_96.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[346]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2516, 'HakuOfferBetrayalEight', '[]', 'Aisling is a monster hidden in a pleasing form. You must hear me.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Haku/HAK_97.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[346]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2517, 'HakuOfferBetrayalNine', '[]', 'The Karui Way is sometimes bitingly cold, but it is still the Way.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Haku/HAK_98.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[346]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2518, 'HakuOfferExecuteZero', '[]', 'I choose an honourable death.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Haku/HAK_99.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[346]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2519, 'HakuOfferExecuteOne', '[]', 'I am honoured to die for my cause.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Haku/HAK_100.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[346]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2520, 'HakuOfferExecuteTwo', '[]', 'I would sooner die than betray my friends.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Haku/HAK_101.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[346]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2521, 'HakuOfferExecuteThree', '[]', 'I seek only the darkness that death brings. Not the inside of a cell.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Haku/HAK_102.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[346]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2522, 'HakuReplyToBetrayalAcceptedZero', '[]', 'The Ancestors will remember your actions!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Haku/HAK_103.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[346]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2523, 'HakuReplyToBetrayalAcceptedOne', '[]', 'My ''trees and ghosts'' will be waiting for you after death, old man.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Haku/HAK_104.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[346]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2524, 'HakuReplyToBetrayalAcceptedTwo', '[]', 'I don''t need your gentle arrow in my back, huntress.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Haku/HAK_105.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[346]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2525, 'HakuReplyToBetrayalAcceptedThree', '[]', 'I always expect the worst from you, Janus, and you always over-deliver.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Haku/HAK_106.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[346]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2526, 'HakuReplyToBetrayalAcceptedFour', '[]', 'And I will have no qualms cutting your head from your shoulders for this, slavemaster.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Haku/HAK_107.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[346]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2527, 'HakuReplyToBetrayalAcceptedFive', '[]', 'How noble of you, vile Redblade.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Haku/HAK_108.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[346]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2528, 'HakuReplyToBetrayalAcceptedSix', '[]', 'This Syndicate makes traitors of us all.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Haku/HAK_109.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[346]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2529, 'HakuInterrogatedZero', '[]', 'You dishonour me. Imprisonment is for slaves, not warriors!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Haku/HAK_110.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[346]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2530, 'HakuInterrogatedOne', '[]', 'I cannot abide this continual dishonour, exile! You spit in my face...', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Haku/HAK_111.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[346]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2531, 'HakuInterrogatedTwo', '[]', 'Ancestors, give me strength to withstand the shame and dishonour this exile casts upon me.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Haku/HAK_112.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[346]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2532, 'HakuReplyToExecutionZero', '[]', 'You honour the Way by swiftly delivering death to warriors who fought well.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Haku/HAK_113.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[346]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2533, 'HakuReplyToExecutionOne', '[]', 'You show honour by delivering clean deaths.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Haku/HAK_114.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[346]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2534, 'HakuReplyToExecutionTwo', '[]', 'That one did not deserve an honourable death.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Haku/HAK_115.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[346]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2535, 'HakuSafehouseLeaderDefeatedZero', '[]', 'Ancestors, have you forsaken me?', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Haku/HAK_116.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 10, 0, 1, '[346]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2536, 'HakuPrimaryDefenderStartsFightFifteen', '[]', 'Care, exile... a Karui and his fortress are not easily separated.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/JunOrtoi/JO2_32.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[343]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2537, 'HakuPrimaryDefenderStartsFightSixteen', '[]', 'Did Hinekora reject you, Karui?', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/JunOrtoi/JO2_33.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[343]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2538, 'HakuEscapeThree', '[]', 'A truce, Karui... for now.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/JunOrtoi/JO2_70.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 4, 0, 1, '[343]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2539, 'HakuDefeatedEleven', '[]', 'Stay down, Haku.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/JunOrtoi/JO2_52.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 9, 0, 1, '[343]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2540, 'HakuInterrogatedThree', '[]', 'Your body is strong, Karui... but the cell will test your mind.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/JunOrtoi/JO2_90.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[343]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2541, 'HakuSecondaryDefenderArrivalThirtyTwo', '[]', 'You''re better than this, Karui!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/JunOrtoi/JO_57.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[343]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2542, 'HakuSecondaryDefenderArrivalThirtyThree', '[]', 'Have you come to your senses at last, Karui?', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/JunOrtoi/JO2_115.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[343]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2543, 'HakuReplyToSecondaryDefenderArrivalNineteen', '[]', 'Witness the Syndicate''s treachery, Karui.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/JunOrtoi/JO2_132.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[343]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2544, 'HakuReplyToSecondaryDefenderArrivalTwenty', '[]', 'The Karui will make this much harder.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/JunOrtoi/JO2_166.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[343]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2545, 'HakuReplyToSecondaryDefenderArrivalTwentyOne', '[]', 'They clearly don''t trust you, Karui.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/JunOrtoi/JO2_149.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[343]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2546, 'HakuReplyToBetrayalAcceptedSeven', '[]', 'You made the right choice, Karui.', '', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[343]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2547, 'ItThatFledPrimaryDefenderStartsFightZero', '[]', 'Why does It wear its skin like that? Surely It must be in pain? It will help It feel better.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/ItThatFled/ITF_1.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[355]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2548, 'ItThatFledPrimaryDefenderStartsFightOne', '[]', 'It is no Lord, but this is still its domain, and It will protect it!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/ItThatFled/ITF_2.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[355]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2549, 'ItThatFledPrimaryDefenderStartsFightTwo', '[]', 'It can''t have it! No no no no!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/ItThatFled/ITF_3.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[355]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2550, 'ItThatFledPrimaryDefenderStartsFightThree', '[]', 'It climbs into its burrow! The Lords will not be pleased!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/ItThatFled/ITF_4.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[355]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2551, 'ItThatFledPrimaryDefenderStartsFightFour', '[]', 'Snip, snip, stab!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/ItThatFled/ITF_5.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[355]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2552, 'ItThatFledPrimaryDefenderStartsFightFive', '[]', 'It hates the metal room. It hates it!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/ItThatFled/ITF_6.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[355]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2553, 'ItThatFledPrimaryDefenderStartsFightSix', '[]', 'Bargain, bargain, bargain-bargain...', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/ItThatFled/ITF_7.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[355]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2554, 'ItThatFledPrimaryDefenderStartsFightSeven', '[]', 'It gave this, It got that, It gave this, It got that...', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/ItThatFled/ITF_8.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[355]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2555, 'ItThatFledPrimaryDefenderStartsFightEight', '[]', 'Bargain, bargain, It gave this, It got that...', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/ItThatFled/ITF_9.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[355]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2556, 'ItThatFledPrimaryDefenderStartsFightNine', '[]', 'It was punished for its gifts. It will not listen again!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/ItThatFled/ITF_10.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[355]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2557, 'ItThatFledPrimaryDefenderStartsFightTen', '[]', 'Friend! It so enjoyed dying. It will return the favour!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/ItThatFled/ITF_11.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[355]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2558, 'ItThatFledPrimaryDefenderStartsFightEleven', '[]', 'It awoke with a gift! Does It want to see what it does?', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/ItThatFled/ITF_12.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[355]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2559, 'ItThatFledPrimaryDefenderStartsFightTwelve', '[]', 'It wriggles again! Is It ready to play some more?', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/ItThatFled/ITF_13.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[355]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2560, 'ItThatFledPrimaryDefenderStartsFightThirteen', '[]', 'It is draped in the Dreamer''s energy. Can It feel it?', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/ItThatFled/ITF_14.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[355]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2561, 'ItThatFledPrimaryDefenderStartsFightFourteen', '[]', 'Esh circles It now! Its thoughts break like its bones!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/ItThatFled/ITF_15.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[355]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2562, 'ItThatFledPrimaryDefenderStartsFightFifteen', '[]', 'The ice crawls across its skin now. Slowly. Does It see? Does It feel the avalanche?', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/ItThatFled/ITF_16.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[355]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2563, 'ItThatFledPrimaryDefenderStartsFightSixteen', '[]', 'Cook! Sizzle and fry like its kin and kith on the Red Pyre!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/ItThatFled/ITF_17.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[355]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2564, 'ItThatFledPrimaryDefenderStartsFightSeventeen', '[]', 'It looks weary. It will shake away the burden of its flesh.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/ItThatFled/ITF_18.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[355]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2565, 'ItThatFledSafehouseLeaderIntroZero', '[]', 'It was not a Lord before. Now this domain is its own. Advance, taste.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/ItThatFled/ITF_19.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[355]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2566, 'ItThatFledSecondaryDefenderArrivalZero', '[]', 'It serves the domain!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/ItThatFled/ITF_20.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[355]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2567, 'ItThatFledSecondaryDefenderArrivalOne', '[]', 'So jealous, It is, but it is not for It!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/ItThatFled/ITF_21.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[355]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2568, 'ItThatFledSecondaryDefenderArrivalTwo', '[]', 'Put away its happy kin, quickly!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/ItThatFled/ITF_22.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[355]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2569, 'ItThatFledSecondaryDefenderArrivalThree', '[]', 'It is here to help with the surgery!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/ItThatFled/ITF_23.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[355]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2570, 'ItThatFledSecondaryDefenderArrivalFour', '[]', 'It is going to fix It. Don''t struggle.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/ItThatFled/ITF_24.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[355]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2571, 'ItThatFledSecondaryDefenderArrivalFive', '[]', 'Lord of this domain, command It!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/ItThatFled/ITF_25.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[355]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2572, 'ItThatFledSecondaryDefenderArrivalSix', '[]', 'It That Boasts dances and squawks but accomplishes nothing...', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/ItThatFled/ITF_26.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[355]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2573, 'ItThatFledSecondaryDefenderArrivalSeven', '[]', 'It That Once Glittered needs a friend, doesn''t It?', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/ItThatFled/ITF_27.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[355]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2574, 'ItThatFledSecondaryDefenderArrivalEight', '[]', 'It That Bashes needs its help!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/ItThatFled/ITF_28.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[355]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2575, 'ItThatFledSecondaryDefenderArrivalNine', '[]', 'It fights for love! It fights for its Queen!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/ItThatFled/ITF_29.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[355]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2576, 'ItThatFledSecondaryDefenderArrivalTen', '[]', 'It That Dismembers is a monster just like It! It likes It.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/ItThatFled/ITF_30.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[355]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2577, 'ItThatFledSecondaryDefenderArrivalEleven', '[]', 'It came to fight! It came to cut, to impale, to rend!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/ItThatFled/ITF_31.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[355]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2578, 'ItThatFledSecondaryDefenderArrivalTwelve', '[]', 'It wants this domain... It needs it!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/ItThatFled/ITF_32.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[355]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2579, 'ItThatFledSecondaryDefenderArrivalThirteen', '[]', 'It takes the toys. It doesn''t get any.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/ItThatFled/ITF_33.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[355]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2580, 'ItThatFledSecondaryDefenderArrivalFourteen', '[]', 'It undoes its hard work! It is an enemy of It!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/ItThatFled/ITF_34.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[355]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2581, 'ItThatFledSecondaryDefenderArrivalFifteen', '[]', 'It hears the Lords telling It to kill!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/ItThatFled/ITF_35.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[355]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2582, 'ItThatFledSecondaryDefenderArrivalSixteen', '[]', 'It That Protects will soon meet its ancestors...', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/ItThatFled/ITF_36.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[355]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2583, 'ItThatFledSecondaryDefenderArrivalSeventeen', '[]', 'It will take its other arm! And leg! And face!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/ItThatFled/ITF_37.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[355]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2584, 'ItThatFledSecondaryDefenderArrivalEighteen', '[]', 'It wants the face of It That Boasts. Give It its face?', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/ItThatFled/ITF_38.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[355]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2585, 'ItThatFledSecondaryDefenderArrivalNineteen', '[]', 'It That Is Hairy calls It weak. It is not weak. It will prove it.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/ItThatFled/ITF_39.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[355]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2586, 'ItThatFledSecondaryDefenderArrivalTwenty', '[]', 'It will show its Queen love! Slashing, piercing, biting love!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/ItThatFled/ITF_40.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[355]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2587, 'ItThatFledSecondaryDefenderArrivalTwentyOne', '[]', 'All Its look the same. It will impale all of them!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/ItThatFled/ITF_41.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[355]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2588, 'ItThatFledReplyToSecondaryDefenderArrivalZero', '[]', 'Get out, get out, get out!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/ItThatFled/ITF_42.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[355]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2589, 'ItThatFledReplyToSecondaryDefenderArrivalOne', '[]', 'It will make It into splinters.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/ItThatFled/ITF_43.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[355]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2590, 'ItThatFledReplyToSecondaryDefenderArrivalTwo', '[]', 'It is bad, very bad, misbehaving!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/ItThatFled/ITF_44.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[355]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2591, 'ItThatFledReplyToSecondaryDefenderArrivalThree', '[]', 'It is confused. It That Arrived is not meant to kill It That Fled.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/ItThatFled/ITF_45.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[355]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2592, 'ItThatFledReplyToSecondaryDefenderArrivalFour', '[]', 'It doesn''t want to go nowhere! It wants to go somewhere!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/ItThatFled/ITF_46.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[355]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2593, 'ItThatFledReplyToSecondaryDefenderArrivalFive', '[]', 'The Red Pyre...! It will show It That Prays.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/ItThatFled/ITF_47.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[355]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2594, 'ItThatFledReplyToSecondaryDefenderArrivalSix', '[]', 'Lies! Nature yearns for It That Fled with grasping fingers!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/ItThatFled/ITF_48.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[355]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2595, 'ItThatFledReplyToSecondaryDefenderArrivalSeven', '[]', 'It That Dismembers is not going to like what It reveals...', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/ItThatFled/ITF_49.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[355]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2596, 'ItThatFledReplyToSecondaryDefenderArrivalEight', '[]', 'It still has emotions... hurting, writhing, hungry emotions...', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/ItThatFled/ITF_50.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[355]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2597, 'ItThatFledReplyToSecondaryDefenderArrivalNine', '[]', 'It likes It and hates It, why can''t It get along?', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/ItThatFled/ITF_51.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[355]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2598, 'ItThatFledSecondaryDefenderArrivalTwentyTwo', '[]', 'It comes to aid It That Fights!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/ItThatFled/ITF_52.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[355]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2599, 'ItThatFledSecondaryDefenderArrivalTwentyThree', '[]', 'Faster, faster! Fast as It fled!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/ItThatFled/ITF_53.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[355]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2600, 'ItThatFledSecondaryDefenderArrivalTwentyFour', '[]', 'Quicker, quicker! Many pieces! Many splinters!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/ItThatFled/ITF_54.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[355]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2601, 'ItThatFledSecondaryDefenderArrivalTwentyFive', '[]', 'Many organs for It to hold and whisper to...', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/ItThatFled/ITF_55.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[355]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2602, 'ItThatFledSecondaryDefenderArrivalTwentySix', '[]', 'It is the Lord of the Many with such joy and violence!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/ItThatFled/ITF_56.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[355]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2603, 'ItThatFledSecondaryDefenderArrivalTwentySeven', '[]', 'It That Glows must do what It commands!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/ItThatFled/ITF_57.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[355]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2604, 'ItThatFledSecondaryDefenderArrivalTwentyEight', '[]', 'It That Laughs will be absorbed in the new order!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/ItThatFled/ITF_58.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[355]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2605, 'ItThatFledSecondaryDefenderArrivalTwentyNine', '[]', 'Lord of the Many, It is, and It tells It what to do now! It must kill Its and bring It bone splinters!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/ItThatFled/ITF_59.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[355]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2606, 'ItThatFledSecondaryDefenderArrivalThirty', '[]', 'Its Queen must now recognize its Lord!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/ItThatFled/ITF_60.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[355]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2607, 'ItThatFledSecondaryDefenderArrivalThirtyOne', '[]', 'It That Disassembles will have a special place in its domain now that It is in charge.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/ItThatFled/ITF_61.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[355]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2608, 'ItThatFledKillPlayerZero', '[]', 'It did it! It defended its domain!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/ItThatFled/ITF_62.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 8, 0, 1, '[355]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2609, 'ItThatFledKillPlayerOne', '[]', 'Its bones will make crisp white splinters.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/ItThatFled/ITF_63.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 8, 0, 1, '[355]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2610, 'ItThatFledKillPlayerTwo', '[]', 'Time now, with It gone.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/ItThatFled/ITF_64.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 8, 0, 1, '[355]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2611, 'ItThatFledKillPlayerThree', '[]', 'Why is It still? Play with It! Play!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/ItThatFled/ITF_65.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 8, 0, 1, '[355]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2612, 'ItThatFledEscapeZero', '[]', 'Just like home. One It dies, one It rises.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/ItThatFled/ITF_66.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 4, 0, 1, '[355]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2613, 'ItThatFledEscapeOne', '[]', 'It can''t have it. So says the Eternal It!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/ItThatFled/ITF_67.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 4, 0, 1, '[355]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2614, 'ItThatFledEscapeTwo', '[]', 'It won''t be caught!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/ItThatFled/ITF_68.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 4, 0, 1, '[355]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2615, 'ItThatFledDefeatedZero', '[]', 'Its domain! Noooo!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/ItThatFled/ITF_69.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 9, 0, 1, '[355]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2616, 'ItThatFledDefeatedOne', '[]', 'It doesn''t understand...', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/ItThatFled/ITF_70.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 9, 0, 1, '[355]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2617, 'ItThatFledDefeatedTwo', '[]', 'Why... why does It want its friends!?', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/ItThatFled/ITF_71.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 9, 0, 1, '[355]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2618, 'ItThatFledDefeatedThree', '[]', 'It... was only playing...', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/ItThatFled/ITF_72.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 9, 0, 1, '[355]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2619, 'ItThatFledDefeatedFour', '[]', 'No no no no, not the Lonely Place again!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/ItThatFled/ITF_73.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 9, 0, 1, '[355]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2620, 'ItThatFledDefeatedFive', '[]', 'Bargain... bargain... bargain-bargain...', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/ItThatFled/ITF_74.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 9, 0, 1, '[355]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2621, 'ItThatFledDefeatedSix', '[]', 'Such agony! It can share with It if It wants...', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/ItThatFled/ITF_75.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 9, 0, 1, '[355]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2622, 'ItThatFledDefeatedSeven', '[]', 'Does It get to go through the Dark Place again?', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/ItThatFled/ITF_76.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 9, 0, 1, '[355]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2623, 'ItThatFledDefeatedEight', '[]', 'Now It is It That Lost, too. Its are even... Its are fair...', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/ItThatFled/ITF_77.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 9, 0, 1, '[355]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2624, 'ItThatFledDefeatedNine', '[]', 'It has failed the Lords. It seeks mercy! Give It mercy!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/ItThatFled/ITF_78.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 9, 0, 1, '[355]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2625, 'ItThatFledDefeatedTen', '[]', 'It... lost...? It hurts within It. Dull and sharp... still and moving...', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/ItThatFled/ITF_79.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 9, 0, 1, '[355]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2626, 'ItThatFledOfferBargainZero', '[]', 'It does not want to go to the Dark Place... the Lords whisper to It there. It needs to stay! It will do anything!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/ItThatFled/ITF_80.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[355]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2627, 'ItThatFledOfferBargainOne', '[]', 'The hive buzzes with voices but It is all alone! Let It go. It wants to bring a friend from the Many.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/ItThatFled/ITF_81.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[355]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2628, 'ItThatFledOfferBargainTwo', '[]', 'A gift! Leave It in the Bright Place. Give strength to the Many. Give It a friend. Yes. That is the way to find It That Never Dies.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/ItThatFled/ITF_82.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[355]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2629, 'ItThatFledOfferBargainThree', '[]', 'It is jealous. It does not like this place. It wants to be in another. Such pain and movement here. Does It allow It to go to another place? It will bring one of the Many back.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/ItThatFled/ITF_83.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[355]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2630, 'ItThatFledOfferBargainFour', '[]', 'It wants to flee! Just let It flee!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/ItThatFled/ITF_84.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[355]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2631, 'ItThatFledOfferBargainFive', '[]', 'It hears words It does not understand. The Lords nod and show their teeth when they hear the words. It can repeat them for It. Does it want to hear the words?', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/ItThatFled/ITF_85.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[355]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2632, 'ItThatFledOfferBargainSix', '[]', 'Such beautiful skins and claws It has collected. So sharp and shimmering. It will be sad to give such gifts to It, but It does not want to go to the Dark Place. Save It from the Dark Place and It can have its beauties.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/ItThatFled/ITF_86.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[355]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2633, 'ItThatFledBargainAcceptedZero', '[]', 'The hive grows.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/ItThatFled/ITF_87.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[355]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2634, 'ItThatFledBargainAcceptedOne', '[]', 'It moves to be close yet grows no closer.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/ItThatFled/ITF_88.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[355]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2635, 'ItThatFledBargainAcceptedTwo', '[]', 'It will remember the pain of separation.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/ItThatFled/ITF_89.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[355]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2636, 'ItThatFledBargainAcceptedThree', '[]', 'Fleeeeeeeeeee!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/ItThatFled/ITF_90.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[355]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2637, 'ItThatFledBargainAcceptedFour', '[]', 'Listen and do not blink.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/ItThatFled/ITF_91.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[355]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2638, 'ItThatFledBargainAcceptedFive', '[]', 'Its gifts were chosen so carefully. It will miss them.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/ItThatFled/ITF_92.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[355]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2639, 'ItThatFledOfferBetrayalZero', '[]', 'It has watched and listened to the Lords for an eternity. It can mimic them. It can sow many untruths about them. It will do this if It promises not to send It to the Dark Place.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/ItThatFled/ITF_93.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[355]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2640, 'ItThatFledOfferBetrayalOne', '[]', 'Others think It cannot tell untruths, but It knows that many untruths are elsewhere truths. It can bring the truths to It That Never Dies, and the Lords would be punished. What does It think?', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/ItThatFled/ITF_94.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[355]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2641, 'ItThatFledOfferBetrayalTwo', '[]', 'When It tries to befriend one of the Many, they leak from their skin. Such moisture! It thinks it is liquid fear. It can make the others feel fear until they flee, wet and shimmering, just like It did! Then It will let It go free?', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/ItThatFled/ITF_95.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[355]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2642, 'ItThatFledOfferBetrayalThree', '[]', 'It listens. It is always listening. Does it want to know what It has heard? It can repeat the words of the Many here.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/ItThatFled/ITF_96.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[355]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2643, 'ItThatFledOfferBetrayalFour', '[]', 'It wants It to help It instead? It doesn''t want to die. It was born flawed upon the Red Pyre, and did not rejoice like its siblings to be pulp and bone for the Lords. It would do anything not to go back to the blood and the dirt...', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/ItThatFled/ITF_97.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[355]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2644, 'ItThatFledOfferBetrayalFive', '[]', 'It hates its glow. Do you not see it? Blinding, burning, horrible! It must act against It!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/ItThatFled/ITF_98.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[355]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2645, 'ItThatFledOfferBetrayalSix', '[]', 'It hates It That Is Hairy''s brood. No thoughts, brood-mouths open, drooling power for the hated enemies from Before All. Animals, Its are. Diseased animals. It hates hates hates hates!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/ItThatFled/ITF_99.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[355]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2646, 'ItThatFledOfferBetrayalSeven', '[]', 'Its Queen did not love the gifts It gave Its Queen. Not It of Many Legs. Not It of Sharp Claws. Always its Queen is angry. So It gives its Queen more anger.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/ItThatFled/ITF_100.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[355]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2647, 'ItThatFledOfferBetrayalEight', '[]', 'It That Dismembers breaks so many things! Turns bones to splinters and the splinters to dust! Leaves no splinters for It, even when It asks! It That Dismembers is so mean to It.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/ItThatFled/ITF_101.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[355]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2648, 'ItThatFledOfferBetrayalNine', '[]', 'It That Disassembles tries to put the pieces back together. Always wrong. It can''t make the pieces stay. Arms and faces and skin, a big pile. It wants to help, but It That Disassembles threatens It. So It gives up. Do whatever It wants with It That Disassembles.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/ItThatFled/ITF_102.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[355]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2649, 'ItThatFledOfferExecuteZero', '[]', 'Yes, yes, send it to the Dark Place!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/ItThatFled/ITF_103.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[355]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2650, 'ItThatFledOfferExecuteOne', '[]', 'It will die for its Lord!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/ItThatFled/ITF_104.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[355]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2651, 'ItThatFledOfferExecuteTwo', '[]', 'It is just one of the Many. End It and another will come.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/ItThatFled/ITF_105.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[355]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2652, 'ItThatFledOfferExecuteThree', '[]', 'No! It won''t go back to the Lonely Place. It will have to kill It!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/ItThatFled/ITF_106.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[355]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2653, 'ItThatFledReplyToBetrayalAcceptedZero', '[]', 'Its suffering will be legendary!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/ItThatFled/ITF_107.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[355]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2654, 'ItThatFledReplyToBetrayalAcceptedOne', '[]', 'Betray It. Do anything to It that It pleases. It grovels and begs and serves. All It asks is not to go back to the Dark Place, where the Lords whisper and laugh at It, mocking It, hurting It...', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/ItThatFled/ITF_108.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[355]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2655, 'ItThatFledReplyToBetrayalAcceptedTwo', '[]', 'It That Protects would not squawk so if It knew what the Red Pyre teaches Its at birth...', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/ItThatFled/ITF_109.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[355]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2656, 'ItThatFledReplyToBetrayalAcceptedThree', '[]', 'It hates It That Prays! Such glowing! Hideous glowing...', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/ItThatFled/ITF_110.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[355]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2657, 'ItThatFledReplyToBetrayalAcceptedFour', '[]', 'It That Boasts is stupid. It has a creator. It fled from It.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/ItThatFled/ITF_111.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[355]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2658, 'ItThatFledReplyToBetrayalAcceptedFive', '[]', 'It looks and sees and listens and does not understand.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/ItThatFled/ITF_112.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[355]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2659, 'ItThatFledReplyToBetrayalAcceptedSix', '[]', 'It is so happy! It That Disassembles has made its heart awaken like warm muscle laid bare under the Broken Sun!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/ItThatFled/ITF_113.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[355]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2660, 'ItThatFledInterrogatedZero', '[]', 'Why is It doing this to It?!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/ItThatFled/ITF_114.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[355]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2661, 'ItThatFledInterrogatedOne', '[]', 'No! Not the Lonely Place!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/ItThatFled/ITF_115.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[355]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2662, 'ItThatFledInterrogatedTwo', '[]', 'No bargain?', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/ItThatFled/ITF_116.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[355]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2663, 'ItThatFledReplyToExecutionZero', '[]', 'It plays too rough!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/ItThatFled/ITF_117.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[355]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2664, 'ItThatFledReplyToExecutionOne', '[]', 'The Many become The Few.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/ItThatFled/ITF_118.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[355]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2665, 'ItThatFledReplyToExecutionTwo', '[]', 'It smiles.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/ItThatFled/ITF_119.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[355]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2666, 'ItThatFledSafehouseLeaderDefeatedZero', '[]', 'But... It was a Lord!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/ItThatFled/ITF_120.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 10, 0, 1, '[355]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2667, 'ItThatFledPrimaryDefenderStartsFightEighteen', '[]', 'Whatever the Syndicate is telling you, monster, you should not listen.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/JunOrtoi/JO2_39.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[343]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2668, 'ItThatFledDefeatedEleven', '[]', 'Don''t get back up, fiend.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/JunOrtoi/JO2_58.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 9, 0, 1, '[343]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2669, 'ItThatFledBargainAcceptedSix', '[]', 'We have come to an accord... I think.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/JunOrtoi/JO2_79.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[343]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2670, 'ItThatFledInterrogatedThree', '[]', 'Beasts belong behind bars.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/JunOrtoi/JO2_96.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[343]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2671, 'ItThatFledReplyToExecutionThree', '[]', 'Did you see that, fiend? Talk.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/JunOrtoi/JO2_112.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[343]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2672, 'ItThatFledSecondaryDefenderArrivalThirtyTwo', '[]', 'The Syndicate knows no limits, no law. Look at what they fight with!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/JunOrtoi/JO_65.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[343]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2673, 'ItThatFledSecondaryDefenderArrivalThirtyThree', '[]', 'Have you had enough of your new family, creature?', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/JunOrtoi/JO2_123.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[343]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2674, 'ItThatFledReplyToSecondaryDefenderArrivalTwenty', '[]', 'That poor creature doesn''t even understand.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/JunOrtoi/JO2_140.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[343]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2675, 'ItThatFledReplyToSecondaryDefenderArrivalTwentyOne', '[]', 'This is not your hive, creature. Begone!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/JunOrtoi/JO2_174.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[343]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2676, 'ItThatFledReplyToSecondaryDefenderArrivalTwentyTwo', '[]', 'The Syndicate... helping that creature...?', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/JunOrtoi/JO2_157.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[343]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2677, 'ItThatFledReplyToBetrayalAcceptedSeven', '[]', 'You''d do well to return to wherever it is you came from.', '', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[343]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2678, 'JorginPrimaryDefenderStartsFightZero', '[]', 'Ehh, what''s this? A new challenger!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Thane/TJ_01.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[357]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2679, 'JorginPrimaryDefenderStartsFightOne', '[]', 'Yea! Storm the keep, exile!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Thane/TJ_02.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[357]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2680, 'JorginPrimaryDefenderStartsFightTwo', '[]', 'Ohh, logistics is boring. Let''s fight!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Thane/TJ_03.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[357]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2681, 'JorginPrimaryDefenderStartsFightThree', '[]', 'Ugh, please, do try and get this blooddy mess off ma mitts!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Thane/TJ_04.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[357]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2682, 'JorginPrimaryDefenderStartsFightFour', '[]', 'Surprise test of strength exile! Hope you''re prepared.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Thane/TJ_05.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[357]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2683, 'JorginPrimaryDefenderStartsFightFive', '[]', 'Our encounter will end very differently this time, exile.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Thane/TJ_06.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[357]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2684, 'JorginPrimaryDefenderStartsFightSix', '[]', 'Let''s solve this like men. With conflict, not cooperation!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Thane/TJ_07.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[357]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2685, 'JorginPrimaryDefenderStartsFightSeven', '[]', 'Here to play politics again, exile?', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Thane/TJ_08.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[357]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2686, 'JorginPrimaryDefenderStartsFightEight', '[]', 'Just who I was hoping to see today!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Thane/TJ_09.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[357]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2687, 'JorginPrimaryDefenderStartsFightNine', '[]', 'Back for more punishment, child?', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Thane/TJ_10.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[357]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2688, 'JorginPrimaryDefenderStartsFightTen', '[]', 'Ahhh! Gurhh... the Ursine Maw... it hungers!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Thane/TJ_11.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[357]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2689, 'JorginPrimaryDefenderStartsFightEleven', '[]', 'I am of Craiceann, solid against the tide!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Thane/TJ_12.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[357]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2690, 'JorginPrimaryDefenderStartsFightTwelve', '[]', 'I am of Saqawal, crushing my enemies!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Thane/TJ_13.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[357]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2691, 'JorginPrimaryDefenderStartsFightThirteen', '[]', 'I am of Fenumus, dragging you down to your death!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Thane/TJ_14.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[357]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2692, 'JorginPrimaryDefenderStartsFightFourteen', '[]', 'I am of Farrul, swift as an arrow!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Thane/TJ_15.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[357]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2693, 'JorginSafehouseLeaderIntroZero', '[]', 'The strength of the First Ones runs in my veins. You will fall here and now.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Thane/TJ_16.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[357]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2694, 'JorginSecondaryDefenderArrivalZero', '[]', 'Let this siege be savage.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Thane/TJ_17.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[357]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2695, 'JorginSecondaryDefenderArrivalOne', '[]', 'First Ones, protect this caravan!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Thane/TJ_18.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[357]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2696, 'JorginSecondaryDefenderArrivalTwo', '[]', 'I''ll help defend this disgusting place only because I must.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Thane/TJ_19.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[357]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2697, 'JorginSecondaryDefenderArrivalThree', '[]', 'I try never to miss a good ambush!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Thane/TJ_20.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[357]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2698, 'JorginSecondaryDefenderArrivalFour', '[]', 'I never back down from a fight!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Thane/TJ_21.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[357]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2699, 'JorginSecondaryDefenderArrivalFive', '[]', 'Strength in numbers is still strength!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Thane/TJ_22.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[357]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2700, 'JorginSecondaryDefenderArrivalSix', '[]', 'The First Ones have called me to your aid, wild one.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Thane/TJ_23.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[357]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2701, 'JorginSecondaryDefenderArrivalSeven', '[]', 'Cannah let you die, Grenn. I might need a ship back home someday!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Thane/TJ_24.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[357]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2702, 'JorginSecondaryDefenderArrivalEight', '[]', 'You''re no Emperor, Janus, but my line will assist you again regardless.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Thane/TJ_25.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[357]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2703, 'JorginSecondaryDefenderArrivalNine', '[]', 'Let us prove that the Syndicate has the might to make right.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Thane/TJ_26.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[357]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2704, 'JorginSecondaryDefenderArrivalTen', '[]', 'Gadgets won''t do the trick, Maloney. Allow me to lend ya some raw might.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Thane/TJ_27.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[357]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2705, 'JorginSecondaryDefenderArrivalEleven', '[]', 'I want to see a proper siege!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Thane/TJ_28.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[357]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2706, 'JorginSecondaryDefenderArrivalTwelve', '[]', 'I think I''ll send these souls to the First Ones rather than the Lifegiver.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Thane/TJ_29.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[357]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2707, 'JorginSecondaryDefenderArrivalThirteen', '[]', 'This horrible place deserves to fall!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Thane/TJ_30.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[357]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2708, 'JorginSecondaryDefenderArrivalFourteen', '[]', 'Even the mightiest warrior will fall against overwhelming numbers.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Thane/TJ_31.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[357]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2709, 'JorginSecondaryDefenderArrivalFifteen', '[]', 'I''m more than just ''Ezomyte,'' Janus. I''ll show ya.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Thane/TJ_32.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[357]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2710, 'JorginSecondaryDefenderArrivalSixteen', '[]', 'I don''t know what the hell you are, but I much prefer the exile.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Thane/TJ_33.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[357]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2711, 'JorginSecondaryDefenderArrivalSeventeen', '[]', 'The strongest deserve to rise, but you''re too dumb to count.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Thane/TJ_34.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[357]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2712, 'JorginSecondaryDefenderArrivalEighteen', '[]', 'An Eternal General stood against the Ezomyte clans once before. Recall how that ended?', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Thane/TJ_35.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[357]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2713, 'JorginSecondaryDefenderArrivalNineteen', '[]', 'Violence should be a test, Cameria, not a pastime.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Thane/TJ_36.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[357]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2714, 'JorginSecondaryDefenderArrivalTwenty', '[]', 'Only the strongest deserve to rise.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Thane/TJ_37.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[357]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2715, 'JorginReplyToSecondaryDefenderArrivalZero', '[]', 'I welcome your challenge!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Thane/TJ_38.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[357]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2716, 'JorginReplyToSecondaryDefenderArrivalOne', '[]', 'And I thought today would be boring.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Thane/TJ_39.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[357]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2717, 'JorginReplyToSecondaryDefenderArrivalTwo', '[]', 'When a situation gets complicated, I tend to resort to violence.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Thane/TJ_40.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[357]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2718, 'JorginReplyToSecondaryDefenderArrivalThree', '[]', 'Don''t ya see? We''re in the middle of a test of strength here!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Thane/TJ_41.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[357]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2719, 'JorginReplyToSecondaryDefenderArrivalFour', '[]', 'Big words big guy, but can you back them up?', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Thane/TJ_42.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[357]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2720, 'JorginReplyToSecondaryDefenderArrivalFive', '[]', 'We have about as much claim over these lands as your ilk, Eternal!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Thane/TJ_43.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[357]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2721, 'JorginReplyToSecondaryDefenderArrivalSix', '[]', 'You''ve got your shot, creature. Show me that otherworldly might of yours.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Thane/TJ_44.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[357]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2722, 'JorginReplyToSecondaryDefenderArrivalSeven', '[]', 'Aye and your skin will make a fine new cloak, Redblade!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Thane/TJ_45.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[357]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2723, 'JorginReplyToSecondaryDefenderArrivalEight', '[]', 'Then I guess it stops with me, eh?', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Thane/TJ_46.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[357]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2724, 'JorginReplyToSecondaryDefenderArrivalNine', '[]', 'You better hope you have the strength to follow through, traitor!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Thane/TJ_47.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[357]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2725, 'JorginSecondaryDefenderArrivalTwentyOne', '[]', 'Let''s see just how much this exile can handle, eh?', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Thane/TJ_48.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[357]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2726, 'JorginSecondaryDefenderArrivalTwentyTwo', '[]', 'This caravan is better protected than you thought!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Thane/TJ_49.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[357]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2727, 'JorginSecondaryDefenderArrivalTwentyThree', '[]', 'I won''t let knowledge of my involvement here just walk out alive.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Thane/TJ_50.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[357]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2728, 'JorginSecondaryDefenderArrivalTwentyFour', '[]', 'Ohh, exile, you''ve quite the test now.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Thane/TJ_51.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[357]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2729, 'JorginSecondaryDefenderArrivalTwentyFive', '[]', 'Let''s try my way for this one, Tora.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Thane/TJ_52.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[357]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2730, 'JorginSecondaryDefenderArrivalTwentySix', '[]', 'It''s the Ezomyte in charge of the Perandus this time, eh Janus?', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Thane/TJ_53.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[357]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2731, 'JorginSecondaryDefenderArrivalTwentySeven', '[]', 'Serve me well, Redblade. When I''m at the top, I won''t forget it.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Thane/TJ_54.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[357]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2732, 'JorginSecondaryDefenderArrivalTwentyEight', '[]', 'Support my rise through the ranks, Mutewind, and I''ll use my power to get you what you truly desire.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Thane/TJ_55.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[357]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2733, 'JorginSecondaryDefenderArrivalTwentyNine', '[]', 'Aye, you''re certainly strong, Cameria, but! I''m stronger.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Thane/TJ_56.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[357]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2734, 'JorginSecondaryDefenderArrivalThirty', '[]', 'As I am the strongest, I claim my right to lead this fight.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Thane/TJ_57.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[357]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2735, 'JorginKillPlayerZero', '[]', 'I was hoping for a bigger storm.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Thane/TJ_58.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 8, 0, 1, '[357]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2736, 'JorginKillPlayerOne', '[]', 'The prize remains in the hands of the strongest.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Thane/TJ_59.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 8, 0, 1, '[357]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2737, 'JorginKillPlayerTwo', '[]', 'Eh, I was really hoping you''d burn this place.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Thane/TJ_60.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 8, 0, 1, '[357]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2738, 'JorginKillPlayerThree', '[]', 'And the strongest remains the victor, ha ha ho!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Thane/TJ_61.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 8, 0, 1, '[357]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2739, 'JorginEscapeZero', '[]', 'The weak fall. The strongest live to fight another day!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Thane/TJ_62.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 4, 0, 1, '[357]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2740, 'JorginEscapeOne', '[]', 'A good clash. I like you, exile.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Thane/TJ_63.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 4, 0, 1, '[357]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2741, 'JorginEscapeTwo', '[]', 'Your strength was not enough to lift this rock. Maybe next time you''ll send the bugs scattering.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Thane/TJ_64.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 4, 0, 1, '[357]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2742, 'JorginDefeatedZero', '[]', 'I am... conquered... and impressed...', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Thane/TJ_65.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 9, 0, 1, '[357]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2743, 'JorginDefeatedOne', '[]', 'The caravan... is yours...', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Thane/TJ_66.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 9, 0, 1, '[357]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2744, 'JorginDefeatedTwo', '[]', 'The ultimate disgrace...', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Thane/TJ_67.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 9, 0, 1, '[357]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2745, 'JorginDefeatedThree', '[]', 'Well... you''ve passed ma test...', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Thane/TJ_68.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 9, 0, 1, '[357]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2746, 'JorginDefeatedFour', '[]', 'I don''t... want to be... caged again...', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Thane/TJ_69.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 9, 0, 1, '[357]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2747, 'JorginDefeatedFive', '[]', 'I guess, uh, we should... talk?', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Thane/TJ_70.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 9, 0, 1, '[357]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2748, 'JorginDefeatedSix', '[]', 'Might... politics... two sides of the same coin...', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Thane/TJ_71.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 9, 0, 1, '[357]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2749, 'JorginDefeatedSeven', '[]', 'Kill me yet again... I''ll return stronger. Thus, we evolve.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Thane/TJ_72.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 9, 0, 1, '[357]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2750, 'JorginDefeatedEight', '[]', 'Good show, exile. A real comeback.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Thane/TJ_73.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 9, 0, 1, '[357]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2751, 'JorginDefeatedNine', '[]', 'Numbers alone... can''t be counted on...', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Thane/TJ_74.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 9, 0, 1, '[357]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2752, 'JorginDefeatedTen', '[]', 'It seems... I have... failed... my own test.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Thane/TJ_75.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 9, 0, 1, '[357]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2753, 'JorginOfferBargainZero', '[]', 'I''ve seen your strength. Take from me what ya will.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Thane/TJ_76.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[357]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2754, 'JorginOfferBargainOne', '[]', 'Aye, you beat me fair and square, and I can respect that. But to beat the odds, to beat someone with friends in high places, that demands respect and awe. Free me, and select from my cohorts an ally, and we will see what you are truly made of.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Thane/TJ_77.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[357]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2755, 'JorginOfferBargainTwo', '[]', 'Might makes right, which means I work for you now, in a small fashion. You''ve only got hold over me worth one fight, which we all know is just one grain of sand in the desert of warfare. But it isn''t nothing, and in warfare, information is as good as might. I''ve a friend in the Syndicate who is privy to key information, and I offer you this as your well-earned plunder.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Thane/TJ_78.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[357]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2756, 'JorginOfferBargainThree', '[]', 'If I have a moment for last words, I''d like to say, above all, this job they have me doing is beyond boring. Now you''re a strong one, so I value your input. Assuming you let me live, what do you think I should do instead?', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Thane/TJ_79.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[357]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2757, 'JorginOfferBargainFour', '[]', 'I have been soundly defeated. I''m man enough to admit that. It''s my neck on the line here. But, if you let me go back to the green hills of Ogham, I''d certainly be hung for imagined crimes. How about you save yourself the bother and let my clan do what they will?', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Thane/TJ_80.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[357]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2758, 'JorginOfferBargainFive', '[]', 'This Syndicate is full of boring nonsense. Ya care to have a pint and talk it over? Or perhaps since you''ve got me dead to rights and all, skip the pint, and we''ll go right to me blabbin'' secrets like I''m drunk.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Thane/TJ_81.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[357]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2759, 'JorginOfferBargainSix', '[]', 'To the victor go the spoils. Take this as your reward... and let me go.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Thane/TJ_82.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[357]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2760, 'JorginBargainAcceptedZero', '[]', 'Consider it done, and consider the challenge begun!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Thane/TJ_83.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[357]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2761, 'JorginBargainAcceptedOne', '[]', 'They''ll never even suspect, boss.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Thane/TJ_84.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[357]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2762, 'JorginBargainAcceptedTwo', '[]', 'Let''s hope for some entertainment.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Thane/TJ_85.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[357]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2763, 'JorginBargainAcceptedThree', '[]', 'I wonder if they''ll even remember my face back home. Hard to forget with all the wanted posters I expect, heh heh heh.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Thane/TJ_86.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[357]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2764, 'JorginBargainAcceptedFour', '[]', 'Strong and reasonable. I like you, exile!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Thane/TJ_87.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[357]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2765, 'JorginBargainAcceptedFive', '[]', 'And the strong get stronger.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Thane/TJ_88.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[357]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2766, 'JorginOfferBetrayalZero', '[]', 'Impressive strength you''ve got there. You should use it to mold the Syndicate''s hierarchy to your whims. Let me live, and you can install a leader here that sees eye to eye with you: me. You can''t solve the Syndicate by killing, exile, but perhaps you can fundamentally change it for the better.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Thane/TJ_89.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[357]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2767, 'JorginOfferBetrayalOne', '[]', 'Death changes nothing, exile. Only philosophy, held true, alters the world. Here I say to you: the strongest should absorb the might of the weak and make it their own. For you, that means lettin'' me live, so that I can maneuver within the organisation, stripping back the strength of others, making it my own. We do not stay dead, which means changing thoughts and minds is the only way you''ll ever save the world from the Syndicate!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Thane/TJ_90.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[357]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2768, 'JorginOfferBetrayalTwo', '[]', 'You''ve won the battle, exile, but the war will be long. You have the opportunity to select who it is you face. Now killin'' me is an option, but you know already that I can be defeated. Who else here poses a threat? This is your chance to rig the game!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Thane/TJ_91.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[357]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2769, 'JorginOfferBetrayalThree', '[]', 'Hah hah, I like you, exile! There''s no need to slay me, by the way. Let''s just talk about the others here. I''ve got much to say.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Thane/TJ_92.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[357]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2770, 'JorginOfferBetrayalFour', '[]', 'Tora, she''s a swift one. Now I don''t think I can outpace her with force alone. Lend me your might and your mind for this, and the huntress will be forced to bow.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Thane/TJ_93.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[357]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2771, 'JorginOfferBetrayalFive', '[]', 'That''s him, that''s the bastard assassin that killed my brother! The Brotherhood of Silence!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Thane/TJ_94.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[357]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2772, 'JorginOfferBetrayalSix', '[]', 'A Perandus betrayed my people long ago, yet the scars are still raw today. It''s time I returned the favour!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Thane/TJ_95.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[357]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2773, 'JorginOfferBetrayalSeven', '[]', 'The General''s particular brand of might does not just raise the strong. It purges the weak and hopeless. This is not might. It''s tyranny.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Thane/TJ_96.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[357]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2774, 'JorginOfferBetrayalEight', '[]', 'Rin is pompous and uppity and... worst of all, she won''t shut up about how she misses ''fresh mountain air,'' like we don''t all miss our homes! Now please, handle her before I do.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Thane/TJ_97.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[357]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2775, 'JorginOfferBetrayalNine', '[]', 'Allegiance is earned by might, be it muscle, magic, or maneuvering. This one''s earned none of those.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Thane/TJ_98.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[357]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2776, 'JorginOfferExecuteZero', '[]', 'There''s only one fate for the weak, exile. I have earned no exception.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Thane/TJ_99.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[357]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2777, 'JorginOfferExecuteOne', '[]', 'Let the Syndicate witness the true path: strength of arm, strength of will!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Thane/TJ_100.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[357]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2778, 'JorginOfferExecuteTwo', '[]', 'If I should not return, bury me in Ogham, next to my brother.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Thane/TJ_101.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[357]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2779, 'JorginOfferExecuteThree', '[]', 'This time, do what must be done, exile.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Thane/TJ_102.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[357]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2780, 'JorginReplyToBetrayalAcceptedZero', '[]', 'Strength is not merely muscle.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Thane/TJ_103.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[357]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2781, 'JorginReplyToBetrayalAcceptedOne', '[]', 'Aye, weak, through and through! A coward, just like your poisoning pretender, Chitus!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Thane/TJ_104.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[357]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2782, 'JorginReplyToBetrayalAcceptedTwo', '[]', 'And I''ll wager a guess: the First Ones hate ya too. And whatever serves as your mother, for good measure.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Thane/TJ_105.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[357]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2783, 'JorginReplyToBetrayalAcceptedThree', '[]', 'Keep pushing me, Oriathan. My clan''s itching for some Bloody Flowers of our own!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Thane/TJ_106.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[357]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2784, 'JorginReplyToBetrayalAcceptedFour', '[]', 'I didn''t kill my brother, you bastard!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Thane/TJ_107.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[357]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2785, 'JorginReplyToBetrayalAcceptedFive', '[]', 'Ah, ya fool Mutewind. I was framed and exiled here. Strange how quickly the Syndicate snapped me up once I arrived, yes?', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Thane/TJ_108.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[357]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2786, 'JorginReplyToBetrayalAcceptedSix', '[]', 'Thus the weak seek to undermine the mighty.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Thane/TJ_109.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[357]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2787, 'JorginInterrogatedZero', '[]', 'I''ve nothin'' to hide. Only strength matters.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Thane/TJ_110.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[357]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2788, 'JorginInterrogatedOne', '[]', 'You can starve the beast, but you will not break it.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Thane/TJ_111.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[357]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2789, 'JorginInterrogatedTwo', '[]', 'Exile, exile, ya really must learn!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Thane/TJ_112.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[357]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2790, 'JorginReplyToExecutionZero', '[]', 'The weak deserve death.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Thane/TJ_113.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[357]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2791, 'JorginReplyToExecutionOne', '[]', 'So it must be.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Thane/TJ_114.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[357]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2792, 'JorginReplyToExecutionTwo', '[]', 'Aye, the strong climb on the backs of the weak.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Thane/TJ_115.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[357]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2793, 'JorginSafehouseLeaderDefeatedZero', '[]', 'Good, exile. The strongest wins. I knew one day it would not be me.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Thane/TJ_116.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 10, 0, 1, '[357]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2794, 'JunVeiledMods', '[]', 'I''ve spent some time around powerful magical objects. There are some whose magical properties are obscured and tangled, trapped and restricted by a curse placed upon it. I cannot restore such items to their original glory, but I can at least break the curse and release some of its power, if you bring it to me.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/JunOrtoi/JO2_01.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[338,343,340]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2795, 'JunCatarinaEncounterOne', '[]', 'It can''t be! This... this... it''s the Forbidden Vault!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/JunOrtoi/JO2_02.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[343]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2796, 'JunZombiesRaisedOne', '[]', 'No! Why...? My - my family! Please, no!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/JunOrtoi/JO2_03.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[343]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2797, 'JunZombiesRaisedTwo', '[]', 'No more games, Catarina. I''m going to kill you.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/JunOrtoi/JO2_04.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[343]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2798, 'JunZombiesRaisedThree', '[]', 'We can''t let her escape!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/JunOrtoi/JO2_05.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[343]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2799, 'JunCatarinaGauntletOne', '[]', 'Ignore her, exile. We need to get closer. We need to stop her!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/JunOrtoi/JO2_06.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[343]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2800, 'JunCatarinaGauntletTwo', '[]', 'I would rather die than join her.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/JunOrtoi/JO2_07.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[343]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2801, 'JunCatarinaEncounterTwo', '[]', 'I wouldn''t be here if I didn''t.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/JunOrtoi/JO2_08.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[343]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2802, 'JunCatarinaEncounterPOne', '[]', 'You''re no immortal. You''re a thief. Nothing more.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/JunOrtoi/JO2_09.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[343]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2803, 'JunCatarinaEncounterPTwo', '[]', 'We must persevere! Too much hinges on this!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/JunOrtoi/JO2_10.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[343]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2804, 'JunCatarinaEncounterPThree', '[]', 'My cause fuels me!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/JunOrtoi/JO2_11.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[343]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2805, 'JunCatarinaEncounterPFour', '[]', 'Then come, take it from me.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/JunOrtoi/JO2_12.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[343]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2806, 'JunOnKillingCatarinaOne', '[]', 'Shut up.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/JunOrtoi/JO2_13.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[343]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2807, 'JunOnKillingCatarinaTwo', '[]', 'They wouldn''t want that... not if it took the life of another.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/JunOrtoi/JO2_14.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[343]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2808, 'JunOnKillingCatarinaThree', '[]', 'No deal.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/JunOrtoi/JO2_15.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[343]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2809, 'JunTalkAfterKillingCatarina', '[]', 'Then... it is done. Catarina is dead. The Syndicate is fractured. My <i>{akhara} can at last find peace.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
The road to justice is long and bloody, exile, and is best travelled with friends. I am glad we travelled this road together. ' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
From the bottom of my heart... for all that you''ve done... thank you.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/JunOrtoi/JO2_16.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[365]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2810, 'JunAct9TownIntro', '[]', 'I am Jun Ortoi, of the sun-scorched plains of Vastiri. I am investigating the disappearance of several prominent exiles. I have surreptitiously been observing your movements for some time. The way you slew the monster beneath this mountain tells me you are suitable for what I must ask of you. ' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Wraeclast is lawless, but it is not without justice, and some here are more deserving of death than others. The missing were good people. Capable fighters doing what they could to bring light to a situation mired in darkness. I believe they were taken by a group calling themselves the Immortal Syndicate, and I fear they will not be the last.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/JunOrtoi/JO2_17.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[338]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2811, 'JunAct9QuestIntro', '[]', 'Scattered across the plains and mountains are small fortifications I believe to be Immortal Syndicate outposts. They have posted guards along their perimeters, so we must be cautious. Seek one out. I will meet you there, and together we will infiltrate it.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/JunOrtoi/JO2_18.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[338]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2812, 'JunPetarusAndVanja', '[]', 'I am not overly fond of relic hunters. Some things should stay buried.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/JunOrtoi/JO2_19.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[343]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2813, 'JunSiegeHealersRandom', '[]', 'Something is healing them!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/JunOrtoi/JO2_20_A.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[343]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2814, 'JunSiegeHealersOne', '[]', 'Something is healing them!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/JunOrtoi/JO2_20_B.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[343]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2815, 'JunSiegeHealersTwo', '[]', 'Something is healing them!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/JunOrtoi/JO2_20_C.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[343]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2816, 'JunSiegeHealersThree', '[]', 'We must destroy whatever is healing them!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/JunOrtoi/JO2_21_A.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[343]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2817, 'JunSiegeHealersFour', '[]', 'We must destroy whatever is healing them!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/JunOrtoi/JO2_21_B.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[343]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2818, 'JunSiegeHealersFive', '[]', 'We must destroy whatever is healing them!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/JunOrtoi/JO2_21_C.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[343]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2819, 'JunSiegeHealersSix', '[]', 'Destroy the source of the healing, exile!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/JunOrtoi/JO2_22_A.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[343]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2820, 'JunSiegeHealersSeven', '[]', 'Destroy the source of the healing, exile!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/JunOrtoi/JO2_22_B.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[343]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2821, 'JunSiegeHealersEight', '[]', 'Destroy the source of the healing, exile!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/JunOrtoi/JO2_22_C.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[343]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2822, 'JunUndergroundLabHintRandom', '[]', 'We must hurry! They''re destroying vital evidence!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/JunOrtoi/JO2_23_A.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[343]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2823, 'JunUndergroundLabHintOne', '[]', 'We must hurry! They''re destroying vital evidence!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/JunOrtoi/JO2_23_B.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[343]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2824, 'JunUndergroundLabHintTwo', '[]', 'We must hurry! They''re destroying vital evidence!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/JunOrtoi/JO2_23_C.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[343]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2825, 'JunUndergroundLabHintThree', '[]', 'Quickly, we must stop them from destroying evidence!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/JunOrtoi/JO2_24_A.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[343]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2826, 'JunUndergroundLabHintFour', '[]', 'Quickly, we must stop them from destroying evidence!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/JunOrtoi/JO2_24_B.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[343]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2827, 'JunUndergroundLabHintFive', '[]', 'Quickly, we must stop them from destroying evidence!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/JunOrtoi/JO2_24_C.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[343]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2828, 'JunCatarinaBeforeVault', '[]', 'The picture is at last clear. Catarina has obtained an artefact capable of shifting the very energies of life freely. She sought power, not just magical, but political power. To be able to grant immortality is a powerful bargaining tool indeed. ' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Wraeclast is fractured. Many little societies separated by vast tracts of land. But it will not always be so, and Catarina knows this. She is playing the long game. She sees herself as an immortal Queen just biding her time. ' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Her subordinates dare not cross her, for she has the power to gift them immortality, but also to take it away. ' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
She is a tyrant in the making, and the longer we let her accumulate power, the harder it will be to depose her.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/JunOrtoi/JO2_25.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[338,340]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2829, 'BetrayalAlvaIntro', '[]', 'Thank the gods! You''re no saint, I can see that. Though who am I to question what form divine providence comes in?' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
I am the great Alva Valai, Reliquarian extraordinaire! A seeker of mysteries, explorer of the unknown, lover of all things that glitter - and I need your help.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
The lost Temple of Atzoatl; Halls lined with finery, boxes stuffed with glimmering riches and relics touched by insurmountable power! For eons lost to history... until now.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Alva/AV_00.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[344,328]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2830, 'BetrayalAlvaPreSilkTown', '[]', 'I believe the secret of its location lies in the Vaal City which, until very recently, was submerged and completely unreachable. But with all that''s going on, the city has risen from the depths, and... well, it''s still completely unreachable. It seems the only way to get even close is across the river, and the only crossing is overrun with bandits. I''ve a plan that could make both of us unbelievably wealthy, but... perhaps one day...', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Alva/AV_01.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[344]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2831, 'BetrayalAlvaTown', '[]', 'I believe the secret of its location lies in the Vaal City which, until very recently, was submerged and completely unreachable. It''s a tale that beggars belief - some devil coated the land in darkness, but a hero banished it and raised the city from the riverbed! Then some bandits swept in, claiming invaluable artefacts and blocking the only entrance until an even mightier hero sent them packing. If they were around I''d ask them to help me achieve unfathomable wealth, but... you''ll do I suppose.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Alva/AV_02.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[344]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2832, 'BetrayalAlvaWild', '[]', 'I believe the secret of its location lies here in the Vaal City which, until very recently, was submerged and completely unreachable. It''s a tale that beggars belief - some devil coated the land in darkness, but a hero banished it and raised the city from the riverbed! Then some bandits swept in, claiming invaluable artefacts and blocking the only entrance until an even mightier hero sent them packing. If they were around I''d ask them to help me achieve unfathomable wealth, but... you''ll do I suppose.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Alva/AV_03.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[328]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2833, 'BetrayalAlvaQuest', '[]', 'I''ve found a way to blaze a trail to the legendary Temple of Atzoatl. A spell cast upon these ancient waystones, triggered by the blood of the Vaal. I''ve got some in me, you see. This spell will take you into days past. Once there, keep the portal open by slitting a few deserving throats. The longer you stay, the more I learn about the location of the present day temple. ' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Once we find it, we''ll have all the time in the world to collect its many treasures. That''s why we need to find the temple in the here and now. Be careful what you do while you''re there, however. Any move you make ripples through time, changing things in this day and age. Well, what are you waiting for? Go make history!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Alva/AV_04.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[328,329,331,344]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2834, 'BetrayalAlvaTempleFoundRandom', '[]', 'We should be quite close, exile.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Alva/AV_05_A.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[328,329,331,344]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2835, 'BetrayalAlvaTempleFound1', '[]', 'We should be quite close, exile.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Alva/AV_05_B.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[328,329,331,344]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2836, 'BetrayalAlvaTempleFound2', '[]', 'We should be quite close, exile.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Alva/AV_05_C.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[328,329,331,344]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2837, 'BetrayalAlvaTempleFound3', '[]', 'I believe if we follow this path, it will take us where we need to be.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Alva/AV_06_A.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[328,329,331,344]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2838, 'BetrayalAlvaTempleFound4', '[]', 'I believe if we follow this path, it will take us where we need to be.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Alva/AV_06_B.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[328,329,331,344]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2839, 'BetrayalAlvaTempleFound5', '[]', 'Hmm... must be around here somewhere.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Alva/AV_07_A.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[328,329,331,344]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2840, 'BetrayalAlvaTempleFound6', '[]', 'Hmm... must be around here somewhere.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Alva/AV_07_B.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[328,329,331,344]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2841, 'BetrayalAlvaTempleFound7', '[]', 'Hmm... must be around here somewhere.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Alva/AV_07_C.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[328,329,331,344]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2842, 'BetrayalAlvaTempleFound8', '[]', 'Not far now! Lead the way, exile.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Alva/AV_08_A.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[328,329,331,344]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2843, 'BetrayalAlvaTempleFound9', '[]', 'Not far now! Lead the way, exile.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Alva/AV_08_B.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[328,329,331,344]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2844, 'BetrayalAlvaTempleFound10', '[]', 'Not far now! Lead the way, exile.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Alva/AV_08_C.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[328,329,331,344]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2845, 'BetrayalAlvaAboutNiko', '[]', 'Niko''s a bit of an... oddball... yes, but if you can put up with his quirks, he''s not without his uses. The mine he so passionately guards is simply filled to the brim with glittering goodies. I''ve been trying to cozy up to him in the hopes that when he hits the motherlode, I''ll be right there next to him.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Alva/AV_17.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[329]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2846, 'BetrayalAlvaAboutEinhar', '[]', 'Einhar would have fit into Atziri''s empire quite nicely. The man''s no stranger to ritual sacrifice, though thankfully he limits his bloodletting to beasts. He doesn''t seem to have much of an interest in opulence, which is great news for me. As long as Einhar sticks to what he''s best at, we''ll get along fine.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Alva/AV_18.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[329]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2847, 'BetrayalAlvaAboutNavali', '[]', 'I''ve not spoken to Navali about it yet, but I have to wonder how our little forays into the past affect her visions of the future. I also wonder why she isn''t using that little power of hers to make us all unbelievably wealthy. Imagine all the Grand Arena matches we could bet on! I''d much rather watch some disemboweling than do the disemboweling myself, if it''s all the same to her. I guess, when you really think about it, all that Vaal blood is on her conscience!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Alva/AV_19.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[329]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2848, 'BetrayalAlvaAboutHelena', '[]', 'What a lovely woman she is. Had a few run-ins with her back in Oriath but I don''t think she remembers... probably best, since I was hawking some forged heirlooms at the time, and she''s got a knack for spotting forgeries. Now that I''m running an above-board operation - more or less - I''m looking forward to getting to know her.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Alva/AV_20.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[329]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2849, 'BetrayalAlvaAboutZana', '[]', 'I''ve never met anyone as protective of their creations as Zana. It''s not like her astrolabe thing can send us back in time... wait, can it? What does that thing do, anyway? I''ve seen the places it takes her. Some of them are truly horrifying! They make the Vaal look tame as kittens. Not Zana though... she''s a lion with a kitten''s face.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Alva/AV_21.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[329]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2850, 'BetrayalAlvaAboutJun', '[]', 'I''m trying to stay on Jun''s good side. She''s not aggressive or anything - not to me anyway - but I''ve seen her polishing daggers, staring off into the distance. That''s a look I recognise from my days around some less-than-reputable treasure-hunters. A killer''s look. She''s out for someone''s blood.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Alva/AV_22.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[329]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2851, 'BetrayalAlvaOrderOfTheDjinn', '[]', 'So Jun''s people snuck about history stashing powerful artefacts, did they? Do you happen to know if any such artefacts were stashed in the Temple of Atzoatl at any point... no? Fine. Just a thought.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Alva/AV_23.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[329]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2852, 'JorginPrimaryDefenderStartsFightEighteen', '[]', 'Watch yourself exile... this one''s feral.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/JunOrtoi/JO2_35.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[343]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2853, 'JorginDefeatedEleven', '[]', 'Where are your First Ones now, Ezomyte?', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/JunOrtoi/JO2_54.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 9, 0, 1, '[343]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2854, 'JorginEscapeThree', '[]', 'How brave, Thane. How brave.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/JunOrtoi/JO2_72.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 4, 0, 1, '[343]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2855, 'JorginInterrogatedThree', '[]', 'I wonder how much more of an animal you will be when we''re through...', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/JunOrtoi/JO2_92.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[343]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2856, 'JorginDefeatedTwelve', '[]', 'You''re not the strongest here. We are. Tell us what we want to know.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/JunOrtoi/JO2_110.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 9, 0, 1, '[343]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2857, 'JorginSecondaryDefenderArrivalThirtyOne', '[]', 'You are nothing but a wild animal, Thane.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/JunOrtoi/JO_68.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[343]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2858, 'JorginSecondaryDefenderArrivalThirtyTwo', '[]', 'Ezomyte, test your strength against your own allies!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/JunOrtoi/JO2_126.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[343]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2859, 'JorginReplyToSecondaryDefenderArrivalTwenty', '[]', 'Ezomyte, they don''t care about your code!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/JunOrtoi/JO2_143.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[343]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2860, 'JorginReplyToSecondaryDefenderArrivalTwentyOne', '[]', 'We''ll take your test of strength, Ezomyte, and surpass you.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/JunOrtoi/JO2_177.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[343]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2861, 'JorginReplyToSecondaryDefenderArrivalTwentyTwo', '[]', 'It''s not a true test of strength now, is it, Ezomyte?', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/JunOrtoi/JO2_160.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[343]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2862, 'JorginReplyToBetrayalAcceptedSeven', '[]', 'Brave, Ezomyte. Brave and foolish.', '', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[343]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2863, 'AislingPrimaryDefenderStartsFightZero', '[]', 'By the time we''re through, no one will be able to tell you were even human.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Aisling/AL_01.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[361]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2864, 'AislingPrimaryDefenderStartsFightOne', '[]', 'Do you know what happens to the lamb that wanders into the lion''s den?', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Aisling/AL_02.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[361]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2865, 'AislingPrimaryDefenderStartsFightTwo', '[]', 'Keep the cargo rolling. I''ll be back soon enough.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Aisling/AL_03.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[361]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2866, 'AislingPrimaryDefenderStartsFightThree', '[]', 'No one will find your body down here, exile. No one.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Aisling/AL_04.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[361]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2867, 'AislingPrimaryDefenderStartsFightFour', '[]', 'Savour these last breaths!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Aisling/AL_05.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[361]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2868, 'AislingPrimaryDefenderStartsFightFive', '[]', 'I spent every moment behind those bars picturing what I''d do to you when I got out.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Aisling/AL_06.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[361]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2869, 'AislingPrimaryDefenderStartsFightSix', '[]', 'This time it''ll be you beggin'' for your life.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Aisling/AL_07.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[361]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2870, 'AislingPrimaryDefenderStartsFightSeven', '[]', 'Don''t think it''ll be like the last time, exile. No one''s coming to save you.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Aisling/AL_08.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[361]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2871, 'AislingPrimaryDefenderStartsFightEight', '[]', 'My death was quick. Yours won''t be.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Aisling/AL_09.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[361]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2872, 'AislingPrimaryDefenderStartsFightNine', '[]', 'You really don''t get it, do you? I''m faster. I''m stronger.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Aisling/AL_10.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[361]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2873, 'AislingPrimaryDefenderStartsFightTen', '[]', 'I have never felt so free, exile. Can you say the same?', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Aisling/AL_11.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[361]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2874, 'AislingPrimaryDefenderStartsFightEleven', '[]', 'Nothing is quite so invigorating as carnage.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Aisling/AL_12.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[361]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2875, 'AislingPrimaryDefenderStartsFightTwelve', '[]', 'Breathe deep the aromas of death.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Aisling/AL_13.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[361]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2876, 'AislingPrimaryDefenderStartsFightThirteen', '[]', 'I usually prefer to work alone, but my pack is hungry.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Aisling/AL_14.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[361]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2877, 'AislingPrimaryDefenderStartsFightFourteen', '[]', 'Feel the cold creep of death, exile? Give in to it!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Aisling/AL_15.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[361]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2878, 'AislingSafehouseLeaderIntroZero', '[]', 'Look around you! This is the end of your journey, exile. The final stop!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Aisling/AL_16.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[361]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2879, 'AislingSecondaryDefenderArrivalZero', '[]', 'Keep ''em busy. Don''t let them escape!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Aisling/AL_17.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[361]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2880, 'AislingSecondaryDefenderArrivalOne', '[]', 'You should''ve just minded your own business!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Aisling/AL_18.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[361]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2881, 'AislingSecondaryDefenderArrivalTwo', '[]', 'You aren''t leaving here alive.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Aisling/AL_19.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[361]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2882, 'AislingSecondaryDefenderArrivalThree', '[]', 'You''re only delaying the inevitable, exile.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Aisling/AL_20.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[361]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2883, 'AislingSecondaryDefenderArrivalFour', '[]', 'I''ve been looking for someone to kill.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Aisling/AL_21.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[361]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2884, 'AislingSecondaryDefenderArrivalFive', '[]', 'Shall we carve some fountains of blood to wet this thirsty ground, Vorici?', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Aisling/AL_22.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[361]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2885, 'AislingSecondaryDefenderArrivalSix', '[]', 'Show me what beautiful cruelty your kind are capable of, demon!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Aisling/AL_23.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[361]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2886, 'AislingSecondaryDefenderArrivalSeven', '[]', 'What I can do, dear General, will make you question your faith.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Aisling/AL_24.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[361]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2887, 'AislingSecondaryDefenderArrivalEight', '[]', 'The quickest way to this woman''s heart, Korell, is by carving out another''s.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Aisling/AL_25.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[361]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2888, 'AislingSecondaryDefenderArrivalNine', '[]', 'So clumsy, Cameria, but I love your enthusiasm.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Aisling/AL_26.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[361]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2889, 'AislingSecondaryDefenderArrivalTen', '[]', 'Watch carefully. You might learn a thing or two.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Aisling/AL_27.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[361]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2890, 'AislingSecondaryDefenderArrivalEleven', '[]', 'Sorry exile. End of the road.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Aisling/AL_28.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[361]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2891, 'AislingSecondaryDefenderArrivalTwelve', '[]', 'Now that everyone''s here, the real fun can begin.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Aisling/AL_29.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[361]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2892, 'AislingSecondaryDefenderArrivalThirteen', '[]', 'Not so fast. I''m taking over.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Aisling/AL_30.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[361]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2893, 'AislingSecondaryDefenderArrivalFourteen', '[]', 'When this is over, there won''t be any bodies left to revive.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Aisling/AL_31.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[361]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2894, 'AislingSecondaryDefenderArrivalFifteen', '[]', 'Sorry, but I''m the only one leaving here alive.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Aisling/AL_32.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[361]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2895, 'AislingSecondaryDefenderArrivalSixteen', '[]', 'I think I''ll preserve your skin, Haku. Wouldn''t want to waste those tattoos.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Aisling/AL_33.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[361]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2896, 'AislingSecondaryDefenderArrivalSeventeen', '[]', 'Your scars are so beautiful, Redmane. Allow me to add a few.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Aisling/AL_34.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[361]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2897, 'AislingSecondaryDefenderArrivalEighteen', '[]', 'You''re simply too hideous to live, aberration.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Aisling/AL_35.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[361]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2898, 'AislingSecondaryDefenderArrivalNineteen', '[]', 'Such a large canvas to work upon, Hillock. I must thank you in advance.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Aisling/AL_36.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[361]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2899, 'AislingSecondaryDefenderArrivalTwenty', '[]', 'You had your chance to impress me, Cameria. You didn''t.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Aisling/AL_37.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[361]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2900, 'AislingSecondaryDefenderArrivalTwentyOne', '[]', 'Don''t you know? You should never anger an assassin.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Aisling/AL_38.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[361]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2901, 'AislingReplyToSecondaryDefenderArrivalZero', '[]', 'Spineless, slimy coward. I''ll paint the walls red with your blood.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Aisling/AL_39.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[361]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2902, 'AislingReplyToSecondaryDefenderArrivalOne', '[]', 'Ah, I''ve been looking for a reason to kill you. Thanks.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Aisling/AL_40.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[361]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2903, 'AislingReplyToSecondaryDefenderArrivalTwo', '[]', 'So be it. You can join the other cadavers.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Aisling/AL_41.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[361]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2904, 'AislingReplyToSecondaryDefenderArrivalThree', '[]', 'I''m gonna tear you apart and feed you to the wolves.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Aisling/AL_42.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[361]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2905, 'AislingReplyToSecondaryDefenderArrivalFour', '[]', 'None of my subjects have ever objected, Vorici. Neither will you.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Aisling/AL_43.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[361]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2906, 'AislingReplyToSecondaryDefenderArrivalFive', '[]', 'At least I wait until they''re dead to defile the body.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Aisling/AL_44.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[361]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2907, 'AislingReplyToSecondaryDefenderArrivalSix', '[]', 'Then why just witness? Be my next muse.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Aisling/AL_45.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[361]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2908, 'AislingReplyToSecondaryDefenderArrivalSeven', '[]', 'Ha! Jealous?', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Aisling/AL_46.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[361]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2909, 'AislingReplyToSecondaryDefenderArrivalEight', '[]', 'At least you recognize greatness when you see it.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Aisling/AL_47.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[361]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2910, 'AislingReplyToSecondaryDefenderArrivalNine', '[]', 'Even I feel ill at the thought of what I plan to do to you.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Aisling/AL_48.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[361]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2911, 'AislingSecondaryDefenderArrivalTwentyTwo', '[]', 'I love watching the hope fade from your eyes.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Aisling/AL_49.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[361]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2912, 'AislingSecondaryDefenderArrivalTwentyThree', '[]', 'Did you really think it would be that easy?', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Aisling/AL_50.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[361]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2913, 'AislingSecondaryDefenderArrivalTwentyFour', '[]', 'And just like that, your fate is sealed.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Aisling/AL_51.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[361]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2914, 'AislingSecondaryDefenderArrivalTwentyFive', '[]', 'Don''t be sad, exile. Your death will be very entertaining.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Aisling/AL_52.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[361]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2915, 'AislingSecondaryDefenderArrivalTwentySix', '[]', 'I think you''ve secretly hoped to have me in charge, assassin.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Aisling/AL_53.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[361]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2916, 'AislingSecondaryDefenderArrivalTwentySeven', '[]', 'Don''t fail me, demon. You know what I do to failures.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Aisling/AL_54.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[361]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2917, 'AislingSecondaryDefenderArrivalTwentyEight', '[]', 'I think you know my orders already, Gravicius.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Aisling/AL_55.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[361]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2918, 'AislingSecondaryDefenderArrivalTwentyNine', '[]', 'Is that sweat I smell, Korell? Can you not handle your own heat?', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Aisling/AL_56.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[361]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2919, 'AislingSecondaryDefenderArrivalThirty', '[]', 'My turn to lead the dance, Cameria.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Aisling/AL_57.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[361]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2920, 'AislingSecondaryDefenderArrivalThirtyOne', '[]', 'Far too many moving parts. Let''s start removing ''em.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Aisling/AL_58.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[361]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2921, 'AislingKillPlayerZero', '[]', 'Good. Get this cleaned up.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Aisling/AL_59.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 8, 0, 1, '[361]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2922, 'AislingKillPlayerOne', '[]', 'Keep moving.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Aisling/AL_60.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 8, 0, 1, '[361]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2923, 'AislingKillPlayerTwo', '[]', 'Let''s finish up and get out of here.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Aisling/AL_61.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 8, 0, 1, '[361]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2924, 'AislingKillPlayerThree', '[]', 'Too easy.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Aisling/AL_62.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 8, 0, 1, '[361]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2925, 'AislingEscapeZero', '[]', 'Satisfying.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Aisling/AL_63.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 4, 0, 1, '[361]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2926, 'AislingEscapeOne', '[]', 'Your death will have to wait.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Aisling/AL_64.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 4, 0, 1, '[361]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2927, 'AislingEscapeTwo', '[]', 'We''re done here. See you soon.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Aisling/AL_65.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 4, 0, 1, '[361]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2928, 'AislingDefeatedZero', '[]', 'What!? No!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Aisling/AL_66.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 9, 0, 1, '[361]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2929, 'AislingDefeatedOne', '[]', 'It can''t be...!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Aisling/AL_67.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 9, 0, 1, '[361]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2930, 'AislingDefeatedTwo', '[]', 'No, not possible...!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Aisling/AL_68.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 9, 0, 1, '[361]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2931, 'AislingDefeatedThree', '[]', 'But... I can''t...!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Aisling/AL_69.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 9, 0, 1, '[361]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2932, 'AislingDefeatedFour', '[]', 'All that plannin''... for what?!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Aisling/AL_70.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 9, 0, 1, '[361]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2933, 'AislingDefeatedFive', '[]', 'Wait... another deal!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Aisling/AL_71.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 9, 0, 1, '[361]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2934, 'AislingDefeatedSix', '[]', 'No, not again!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Aisling/AL_72.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 9, 0, 1, '[361]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2935, 'AislingDefeatedSeven', '[]', 'Ugh... gets no easier, does it?', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Aisling/AL_73.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 9, 0, 1, '[361]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2936, 'AislingDefeatedEight', '[]', 'You... got... lucky...!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Aisling/AL_74.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 9, 0, 1, '[361]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2937, 'AislingDefeatedNine', '[]', 'How... unprofessional.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Aisling/AL_75.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 9, 0, 1, '[361]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2938, 'AislingDefeatedTen', '[]', 'Ugh... careless!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Aisling/AL_76.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 9, 0, 1, '[361]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2939, 'AislingOfferBargainZero', '[]', 'I can appreciate a killer when I see one. You''re a killer, but I think you''ll get more out of keeping me alive. Just tell me what you want.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Aisling/AL_77.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[361]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2940, 'AislingOfferBargainOne', '[]', 'You could end my life. I would, were I in your position. But I have a better idea. Leave me alive, and I''ll make sure certain Syndicate resources are... reallocated. Move enough bricks and perhaps the tower will come crashing down.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Aisling/AL_78.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[361]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2941, 'AislingOfferBargainTwo', '[]', 'Are you gonna kill me? No... you''re after someone higher up. Problem is, no single person has the information you need. Let me reunite with a colleague of mine, and I''ll make sure you get closer to the top.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Aisling/AL_79.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[361]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2942, 'AislingOfferBargainThree', '[]', 'I know you want to kill me. I would, too. But we are like the mythical hydra: cut off one head, two more will grow. But get those long necks in a tangle... well, you get the idea. I walk out of here alive, and maybe I find myself a new job.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Aisling/AL_80.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[361]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2943, 'AislingOfferBargainFour', '[]', 'You know, I''ve been considerin'' an early retirement. Tired of this cat and mouse game. Tired of fightin''. Aren''t you? How about we call it even, and go our separate ways?', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Aisling/AL_81.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[361]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2944, 'AislingOfferBargainFive', '[]', 'Look, I know what you''re really after. You''re not after some lackey. That''s all I am. You want the boss. I can give them to you, but not if I''m dead. How ''bout it?', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Aisling/AL_82.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[361]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2945, 'AislingOfferBargainSix', '[]', 'You''ve won the battle, exile, but the war rages on. Do you want to know what wins wars? Weapons. Let me go, and I''ll give you the tools you so desperately need.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Aisling/AL_83.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[361]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2946, 'AislingBargainAcceptedZero', '[]', 'The foundations are shiftin'', exile, but I doubt you''ll bring the tower down.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Aisling/AL_84.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[361]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2947, 'AislingBargainAcceptedOne', '[]', 'You''re startin'' to figure it out, aren''t you? I can see it in your eyes. But there''s more going on than you could possibly fathom.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Aisling/AL_85.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[361]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2948, 'AislingBargainAcceptedTwo', '[]', 'The Syndicate was in dire need of a shake-up anyway, exile. You''ve achieved nothing.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Aisling/AL_86.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[361]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2949, 'AislingBargainAcceptedThree', '[]', 'You know, now that I think about it, I''m too young to retire. But I could certainly use a break! See you soon, exile.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Aisling/AL_87.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[361]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2950, 'AislingBargainAcceptedFour', '[]', 'The question now, exile, is whether or not you''re foolish enough to face ''em down. I think you just might be.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Aisling/AL_88.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[361]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2951, 'AislingBargainAcceptedFive', '[]', 'Take them. They''re yours. There''s plenty more where that came from, but I don''t expect you''ll be getting them.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Aisling/AL_89.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[361]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2952, 'AislingOfferBetrayalZero', '[]', 'You won fair and square, even with my boss here. I happen to know that they''ve been pocketing some of the Syndicate''s more valuable acquisitions. What do you think will happen when I tell the Lifegiver?', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Aisling/AL_90.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[361]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2953, 'AislingOfferBetrayalOne', '[]', 'Executin'' us brings you no closer to the Lifegiver. But let us live, and I will ensure those at the top ''ear about the many failings of those who''ve fought here today... excludin'' myself, of course.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Aisling/AL_91.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[361]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2954, 'AislingOfferBetrayalTwo', '[]', 'The Syndicate deals with its failures itself, but sometimes it takes an outsider''s perspective to see where we went wrong. Tell me, who do you think is deserving of our... punishment? I promise you will not be seeing their face again anytime soon.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Aisling/AL_92.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[361]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2955, 'AislingOfferBetrayalThree', '[]', 'Well, this was clearly a mistake. I was... misinformed about the suitability of this mission by my allies. But I know some things they don''t know I know. Would you like to know them? Let me go, and that information is all yours.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Aisling/AL_93.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[361]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2956, 'AislingOfferBetrayalFour', '[]', 'I ''ave no qualms whatsoever about betrayin'' Leo, if that is what you desire.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Aisling/AL_94.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[361]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2957, 'AislingOfferBetrayalFive', '[]', 'Tora sees the necessity in violence, but not the beauty. Allow me to re-educate her.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Aisling/AL_95.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[361]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2958, 'AislingOfferBetrayalSix', '[]', 'Vagan is all show and no substance. I think he needs to experience a hardship or two, and I want to deliver them to him.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Aisling/AL_96.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[361]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2959, 'AislingOfferBetrayalSeven', '[]', 'You want me to betray that... thing? I''ll do it. Even if you weren''t askin''. But since you are...', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Aisling/AL_97.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[361]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2960, 'AislingOfferBetrayalEight', '[]', 'Hillock has very little idea as to what is going on at any given moment. That makes him dangerous.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Aisling/AL_98.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[361]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2961, 'AislingOfferBetrayalNine', '[]', 'Cold-blooded betrayal. That''s what I offer.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Aisling/AL_99.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[361]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2962, 'AislingOfferExecuteZero', '[]', 'Go on, do it. You''re no stranger to murder. Just make it quick.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Aisling/AL_100.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[361]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2963, 'AislingOfferExecuteOne', '[]', 'Some promises are stronger than death, exile. Make it quick.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Aisling/AL_101.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[361]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2964, 'AislingOfferExecuteTwo', '[]', 'You think I''ll beg for my life in front of a fellow member? Ha. Make it quick.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Aisling/AL_102.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[361]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2965, 'AislingOfferExecuteThree', '[]', 'I''ll sooner die than let you lock me up again. If you won''t kill me, I will.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Aisling/AL_103.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[361]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2966, 'AislingReplyToBetrayalAcceptedZero', '[]', 'Pathetic. Shoulda killed you first.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Aisling/AL_104.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[361]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2967, 'AislingReplyToBetrayalAcceptedOne', '[]', 'Nothing you do can bother me, Haku, but thank you for the compliment.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Aisling/AL_105.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[361]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2968, 'AislingReplyToBetrayalAcceptedTwo', '[]', 'Haha haha haha haha ha-hah!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Aisling/AL_106.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[361]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2969, 'AislingReplyToBetrayalAcceptedThree', '[]', 'I''ve seen your work, Vorici. I''m not sure you know what ''worse'' means.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Aisling/AL_107.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[361]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2970, 'AislingReplyToBetrayalAcceptedFour', '[]', 'Everyone''s a critic.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Aisling/AL_108.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[361]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2971, 'AislingReplyToBetrayalAcceptedFive', '[]', 'I know exactly where I want to mount your scalp, traitor.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Aisling/AL_109.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[361]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2972, 'AislingReplyToBetrayalAcceptedSix', '[]', 'Maloney, I think it''s time I put you in better contact with your own fleshy pink humanity.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Aisling/AL_110.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[361]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2973, 'AislingInterrogatedZero', '[]', 'If you think I''ll talk, you''re sorely mistaken.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Aisling/AL_111.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[361]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2974, 'AislingInterrogatedOne', '[]', 'No... not again! Please! Not again!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Aisling/AL_112.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[361]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2975, 'AislingInterrogatedTwo', '[]', 'What? No! No, we had a deal!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Aisling/AL_113.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[361]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2976, 'AislingReplyToExecutionZero', '[]', 'I''da made a little more show of it.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Aisling/AL_114.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[361]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2977, 'AislingReplyToExecutionOne', '[]', 'This wasn''t personal until just now.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Aisling/AL_115.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[361]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2978, 'AislingReplyToExecutionTwo', '[]', 'Good riddance.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Aisling/AL_116.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[361]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2979, 'AislingSafehouseLeaderDefeatedZero', '[]', 'You may have claimed this victory, but we will rise again. You cannot win, exile. Not forever.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Aisling/AL_117.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 10, 0, 1, '[361]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2980, 'AislingPrimaryDefenderStartsFightEighteen', '[]', 'Growing tired of dying yet? We''re not growing tired of killing you.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/JunOrtoi/JO2_37.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[343]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2981, 'AislingDefeatedEleven', '[]', 'You''re done, Aisling.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/JunOrtoi/JO2_56.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 9, 0, 1, '[343]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2982, 'AislingInterrogatedThree', '[]', 'Death''s too kind for a monster like you.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/JunOrtoi/JO2_94.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[343]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2983, 'AislingDefeatedTwelve', '[]', 'Your reign of terror''s over. Talk.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/JunOrtoi/JO2_109.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 9, 0, 1, '[343]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2984, 'AislingSecondaryDefenderArrivalThirtyTwo', '[]', 'Have you no conscience, assassin?', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/JunOrtoi/JO_72.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[343]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2985, 'AislingSecondaryDefenderArrivalThirtyThree', '[]', 'Have you finally snapped, Aisling?', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/JunOrtoi/JO2_130.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[343]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2986, 'AislingReplyToSecondaryDefenderArrivalTwenty', '[]', 'I can''t say you don''t deserve this, Aisling.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/JunOrtoi/JO2_147.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[343]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2987, 'AislingReplyToSecondaryDefenderArrivalTwentyOne', '[]', 'Aisling, keep your corpse-art far from us!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/JunOrtoi/JO2_181.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[343]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2988, 'AislingReplyToSecondaryDefenderArrivalTwentyTwo', '[]', 'Why do you put up with this coddling, Aisling?', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/JunOrtoi/JO2_164.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[343]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2989, 'AislingReplyToBetrayalAcceptedSeven', '[]', 'You''re a monster, Aisling, but at least you''re not a fool as well.', '', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[343]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2990, 'CameriaPrimaryDefenderStartsFightZero', '[]', 'Don''t try running. It''ll just make things worse for you.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Cameria/CAM_01.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[360]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2991, 'CameriaPrimaryDefenderStartsFightOne', '[]', 'Looks like our guest of honour has finally arrived...', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Cameria/CAM_02.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[360]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2992, 'CameriaPrimaryDefenderStartsFightTwo', '[]', 'I was hoping you''d find us out here.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Cameria/CAM_03.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[360]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2993, 'CameriaPrimaryDefenderStartsFightThree', '[]', 'Oh no! They found us! What ever will we do?', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Cameria/CAM_04.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[360]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2994, 'CameriaPrimaryDefenderStartsFightFour', '[]', 'I usually like to draw this out, but orders is orders.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Cameria/CAM_05.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[360]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2995, 'CameriaPrimaryDefenderStartsFightFive', '[]', 'Left you a little present in the cell. Not that you''ll live to see it...', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Cameria/CAM_06.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[360]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2996, 'CameriaPrimaryDefenderStartsFightSix', '[]', 'Think I prefer killing over negotiating.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Cameria/CAM_07.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[360]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2997, 'CameriaPrimaryDefenderStartsFightSeven', '[]', 'Though I enjoyed our little cooperation, I think this time I''ll just snap you in half.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Cameria/CAM_08.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[360]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2998, 'CameriaPrimaryDefenderStartsFightEight', '[]', 'Funny what you learn to do while you''re dead...', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Cameria/CAM_09.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[360]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(2999, 'CameriaPrimaryDefenderStartsFightNine', '[]', 'Thought I killed you. Must''ve just been a pleasant dream.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Cameria/CAM_10.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[360]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100);
INSERT INTO "NPCTextAudio" ("_row", "Id", "Characters", "Text", "Mono_AudioFile", "Stereo_AudioFile", "HasStereo", "__col6", "Video", "__col8", "__col9", "__col10", "NPCs", "NPCPortrait", "__col13", "__col14", "Cooldown", "__col16") VALUES
(3000, 'CameriaPrimaryDefenderStartsFightTen', '[]', 'Darkness will consume you!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Cameria/CAM_11.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[360]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3001, 'CameriaPrimaryDefenderStartsFightEleven', '[]', 'Acid will make this fun.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Cameria/CAM_12.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[360]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3002, 'CameriaPrimaryDefenderStartsFightTwelve', '[]', 'I wonder what I can rip apart with this new find...', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Cameria/CAM_13.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[360]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3003, 'CameriaPrimaryDefenderStartsFightThirteen', '[]', 'I''m going to turn you to stone and see how you break.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Cameria/CAM_14.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[360]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3004, 'CameriaPrimaryDefenderStartsFightFourteen', '[]', 'I am the plague!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Cameria/CAM_15.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[360]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3005, 'CameriaSafehouseLeaderIntroZero', '[]', 'My, my, usually I have to go looking for my victims. How wonderful.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Cameria/CAM_16.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[360]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3006, 'CameriaSecondaryDefenderArrivalZero', '[]', 'Weren''t planning to have a party without me, were you?', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Cameria/CAM_17.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[360]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3007, 'CameriaSecondaryDefenderArrivalOne', '[]', 'Oh good! Still plenty of fun to be had.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Cameria/CAM_18.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[360]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3008, 'CameriaSecondaryDefenderArrivalTwo', '[]', 'This does bring back some wonderful memories.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Cameria/CAM_19.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[360]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3009, 'CameriaSecondaryDefenderArrivalThree', '[]', 'Guess who!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Cameria/CAM_20.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[360]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3010, 'CameriaSecondaryDefenderArrivalFour', '[]', 'This? This is personal, exile.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Cameria/CAM_21.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[360]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3011, 'CameriaSecondaryDefenderArrivalFive', '[]', 'I usually prefer to do this alone, but for you I''ll make an exception.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Cameria/CAM_22.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[360]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3012, 'CameriaSecondaryDefenderArrivalSix', '[]', 'Show me what kind of goodies that hook can rip out of a man, freak.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Cameria/CAM_23.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[360]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3013, 'CameriaSecondaryDefenderArrivalSeven', '[]', 'Save some for me, big man.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Cameria/CAM_24.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[360]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3014, 'CameriaSecondaryDefenderArrivalEight', '[]', 'I should help, huh?', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Cameria/CAM_25.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[360]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3015, 'CameriaSecondaryDefenderArrivalNine', '[]', 'Let me see how you move, Rin...', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Cameria/CAM_26.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[360]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3016, 'CameriaSecondaryDefenderArrivalTen', '[]', 'A delicate flower like yourself shouldn''t be fightin'' all alone...', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Cameria/CAM_27.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[360]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3017, 'CameriaSecondaryDefenderArrivalEleven', '[]', 'It''s my turn to rip the exile limb from limb!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Cameria/CAM_28.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[360]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3018, 'CameriaSecondaryDefenderArrivalTwelve', '[]', 'This party needs a bit of... chaos!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Cameria/CAM_29.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[360]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3019, 'CameriaSecondaryDefenderArrivalThirteen', '[]', 'I feel like seizing some property. Don''t care what... or whose...', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Cameria/CAM_30.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[360]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3020, 'CameriaSecondaryDefenderArrivalFourteen', '[]', 'Now why would we want to go and destroy a funhouse like this?', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Cameria/CAM_31.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[360]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3021, 'CameriaSecondaryDefenderArrivalFifteen', '[]', 'Eenie, meenie, miney, mo... you!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Cameria/CAM_32.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[360]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3022, 'CameriaSecondaryDefenderArrivalSixteen', '[]', 'I''m taking that hook.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Cameria/CAM_33.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[360]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3023, 'CameriaSecondaryDefenderArrivalSeventeen', '[]', 'I''m going to tear you open just to see what you''re made of, freak.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Cameria/CAM_34.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[360]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3024, 'CameriaSecondaryDefenderArrivalEighteen', '[]', 'Gravicius, I''ve had enough of your lectures!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Cameria/CAM_35.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[360]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3025, 'CameriaSecondaryDefenderArrivalNineteen', '[]', 'I''ll make a flesh sculpture in your style - out of you! An homage.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Cameria/CAM_36.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[360]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3026, 'CameriaSecondaryDefenderArrivalTwenty', '[]', 'I''ll rip that mask off - along with your head!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Cameria/CAM_37.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[360]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3027, 'CameriaSecondaryDefenderArrivalTwentyOne', '[]', 'I don''t really care who I''m ripping apart, as long as limbs go flying.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Cameria/CAM_38.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[360]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3028, 'CameriaReplyToSecondaryDefenderArrivalZero', '[]', 'I''m gonna smear you across the walls for this.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Cameria/CAM_39.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[360]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3029, 'CameriaReplyToSecondaryDefenderArrivalOne', '[]', 'I''ll make sure we run you over on the return trip.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Cameria/CAM_40.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[360]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3030, 'CameriaReplyToSecondaryDefenderArrivalTwo', '[]', 'Well I guess we''ll just clean up your corpse, too.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Cameria/CAM_41.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[360]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3031, 'CameriaReplyToSecondaryDefenderArrivalThree', '[]', 'Need to team up with the exile? No bloody balls.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Cameria/CAM_42.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[360]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3032, 'CameriaReplyToSecondaryDefenderArrivalFour', '[]', 'What, fun''s not reason enough?', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Cameria/CAM_43.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[360]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3033, 'CameriaReplyToSecondaryDefenderArrivalFive', '[]', 'Since when do you ask permission?', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Cameria/CAM_44.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[360]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3034, 'CameriaReplyToSecondaryDefenderArrivalSix', '[]', 'I wish you''d stayed dead.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Cameria/CAM_45.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[360]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3035, 'CameriaReplyToSecondaryDefenderArrivalSeven', '[]', 'We''re more alike than you think, Mutewind.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Cameria/CAM_46.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[360]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3036, 'CameriaReplyToSecondaryDefenderArrivalEight', '[]', 'I couldn''t care about impressing you, Aisling.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Cameria/CAM_47.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[360]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3037, 'CameriaReplyToSecondaryDefenderArrivalNine', '[]', 'Just more limbs to add to my pile.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Cameria/CAM_48.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[360]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3038, 'CameriaSecondaryDefenderArrivalTwentyTwo', '[]', 'I love it when my minions decide to share.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Cameria/CAM_49.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[360]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3039, 'CameriaSecondaryDefenderArrivalTwentyThree', '[]', 'Nobody messes with the Syndicate and keeps their head.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Cameria/CAM_50.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[360]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3040, 'CameriaSecondaryDefenderArrivalTwentyFour', '[]', 'Let me show you how to do ripping and killing proper.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Cameria/CAM_51.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[360]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3041, 'CameriaSecondaryDefenderArrivalTwentyFive', '[]', 'This ragdoll is mine!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Cameria/CAM_52.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[360]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3042, 'CameriaSecondaryDefenderArrivalTwentySix', '[]', 'What''s a crusade without the slaughtering of infidels?', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Cameria/CAM_53.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[360]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3043, 'CameriaSecondaryDefenderArrivalTwentySeven', '[]', 'They said I''m in charge here, Vagan.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Cameria/CAM_54.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[360]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3044, 'CameriaSecondaryDefenderArrivalTwentyEight', '[]', 'Hey Janus, I''m the boss now!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Cameria/CAM_55.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[360]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3045, 'CameriaSecondaryDefenderArrivalTwentyNine', '[]', 'I''ll take the lead on this dance, my little flower.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Cameria/CAM_56.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[360]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3046, 'CameriaSecondaryDefenderArrivalThirty', '[]', 'Riker! I''m leading now! You do what I say!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Cameria/CAM_57.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[360]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3047, 'CameriaSecondaryDefenderArrivalThirtyOne', '[]', 'Those who stand in my way will be ripped limb from limb.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Cameria/CAM_58.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[360]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3048, 'CameriaKillPlayerZero', '[]', 'Your bones will rot in these walls for all time.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Cameria/CAM_59.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 8, 0, 1, '[360]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3049, 'CameriaKillPlayerOne', '[]', 'I think I''ll drag you behind this caravan just for fun.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Cameria/CAM_60.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 8, 0, 1, '[360]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3050, 'CameriaKillPlayerTwo', '[]', 'So many limbs, so little time!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Cameria/CAM_61.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 8, 0, 1, '[360]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3051, 'CameriaKillPlayerThree', '[]', 'Aww, over too soon!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Cameria/CAM_62.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 8, 0, 1, '[360]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3052, 'CameriaEscapeZero', '[]', 'Woulda preferred to stay and play, but this still worked out well.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Cameria/CAM_63.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 4, 0, 1, '[360]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3053, 'CameriaEscapeOne', '[]', 'I did the job. They can''t say I didn''t.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Cameria/CAM_64.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 4, 0, 1, '[360]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3054, 'CameriaEscapeTwo', '[]', 'Shame we''re in such a hurry. Would''ve loved to peel your skin off.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Cameria/CAM_65.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 4, 0, 1, '[360]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3055, 'CameriaDefeatedZero', '[]', 'I had you!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Cameria/CAM_66.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 9, 0, 1, '[360]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3056, 'CameriaDefeatedOne', '[]', 'Urgh... not possible...', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Cameria/CAM_67.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 9, 0, 1, '[360]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3057, 'CameriaDefeatedTwo', '[]', 'How? You are weak!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Cameria/CAM_68.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 9, 0, 1, '[360]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3058, 'CameriaDefeatedThree', '[]', 'But I had the upper hand!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Cameria/CAM_69.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 9, 0, 1, '[360]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3059, 'CameriaDefeatedFour', '[]', 'No, not the questions again!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Cameria/CAM_70.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 9, 0, 1, '[360]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3060, 'CameriaDefeatedFive', '[]', 'Pretty good... for a talker...', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Cameria/CAM_71.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 9, 0, 1, '[360]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3061, 'CameriaDefeatedSix', '[]', 'What... gonna make me hurt my little friends again?', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Cameria/CAM_72.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 9, 0, 1, '[360]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3062, 'CameriaDefeatedSeven', '[]', 'Kill me once, shame on you...', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Cameria/CAM_73.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 9, 0, 1, '[360]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3063, 'CameriaDefeatedEight', '[]', 'Is this... is this a bloody prank?', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Cameria/CAM_74.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 9, 0, 1, '[360]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3064, 'CameriaDefeatedNine', '[]', 'Why did I come here?', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Cameria/CAM_75.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 9, 0, 1, '[360]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3065, 'CameriaDefeatedTen', '[]', 'I don''t understand how I lost.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Cameria/CAM_76.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 9, 0, 1, '[360]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3066, 'CameriaOfferBargainZero', '[]', 'You''re my kind of murderer, exile! My favourite part''s when their head first hits the ground. Glad it wasn''t my head, if I''m honest. So, what can I do to keep it that way?', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Cameria/CAM_77.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[360]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3067, 'CameriaOfferBargainOne', '[]', 'I was a naughty little boy back in my day. Used to make friends with the rich and proper, get nice and close to them, before killin'' em and taking everything they had. I can be very persuasive - and patient - when I have to be. I could even let you choose my target, just for fun.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Cameria/CAM_78.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[360]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3068, 'CameriaOfferBargainTwo', '[]', 'I''m not afraid to admit to a core of cowardice underneath my callous exterior. That''s what you want to hear, isn''t it? Don''t kill me, and I''ll... I''ll befriend another member of the Syndicate and give you information about their job. I know how to say the right words. They''ll never suspect me.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Cameria/CAM_79.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[360]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3069, 'CameriaOfferBargainThree', '[]', 'I get bored easy, exile, and when I get bored, I get the... craving. Maybe with a little change of scenery I won''t feel the urge to tear your scalp off with my teeth the way I do right now.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Cameria/CAM_80.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[360]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3070, 'CameriaOfferBargainFour', '[]', 'I''m tired of the Syndicate. I''m going to give going solo a try. That''s how I used to be, you know, before falling in with Aisling and Hillock and Gravicius here. They''ve been bad influences on me. I''ll be good once I''m away from them, I promise.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Cameria/CAM_81.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[360]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3071, 'CameriaOfferBargainFive', '[]', 'You want to know what we''ve been doing here? Sure, I''ll tell ya, as long as it gets me back on the battlefield faster. I''m already feeling cooped up.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Cameria/CAM_82.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[360]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3072, 'CameriaOfferBargainSix', '[]', 'Killing and stealing stuff. That''s what got me locked up the first time. Truth is, I only stole the stuff so it looked like that''s why I did the killing! I don''t even want the stuff. You want the stuff? Take the stuff and piss off.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Cameria/CAM_83.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[360]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3073, 'CameriaBargainAcceptedZero', '[]', 'Just like the old days.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Cameria/CAM_84.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[360]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3074, 'CameriaBargainAcceptedOne', '[]', 'Deal''s a deal.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Cameria/CAM_85.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[360]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3075, 'CameriaBargainAcceptedTwo', '[]', 'I knew we could see eye to eye. Here, I''ve even got an eye in my pocket you can have. No? Alright, I''ll keep it then.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Cameria/CAM_86.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[360]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3076, 'CameriaBargainAcceptedThree', '[]', 'I''ll find people to rip up in my own time!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Cameria/CAM_87.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[360]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3077, 'CameriaBargainAcceptedFour', '[]', 'Don''t tell the Syndicate I told you. Or do, I don''t care.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Cameria/CAM_88.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[360]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3078, 'CameriaBargainAcceptedFive', '[]', 'Great. Can we hurry this up?', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Cameria/CAM_89.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[360]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3079, 'CameriaOfferBetrayalZero', '[]', 'I''ve been itching to backstab the boss, if you catch my meaning. I''m quite literally wanting to stab them in the back with a big bloody knife. Put ''em out of business for a bit. Long enough to put myself in charge. You can watch if you want. I don''t really care, honestly.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Cameria/CAM_90.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[360]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3080, 'CameriaOfferBetrayalOne', '[]', 'The Syndicate''s a social machine, exile, and if there''s one thing I understand, it''s faking my way through social machines. If you let me live, I can steal the ranks of those around me and promote myself! It might just be to your benefit.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Cameria/CAM_91.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[360]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3081, 'CameriaOfferBetrayalTwo', '[]', 'I don''t tell them to their faces, but I despise the other members of the Syndicate. In fact, I''ve been working on a way to get someone kicked out using a carefully-crafted frame job. If you''ll allow me to live, you could even pick who goes.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Cameria/CAM_92.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[360]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3082, 'CameriaOfferBetrayalThree', '[]', 'Traitor''s just a word, exile. I know a lot of words. How about I tell you all the words I know about all of my brethren here, and you let me go?', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Cameria/CAM_93.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[360]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3083, 'CameriaOfferBetrayalFour', '[]', 'Reckon Leo can take a beating? I reckon he can. Been dying to try, actually. Let me go and I''ll do what I do best. Give you a well-earned break from all this delicious violence.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Cameria/CAM_94.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[360]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3084, 'CameriaOfferBetrayalFive', '[]', 'Aren''t you sick of Elreon''s preaching? God this, God that, bless this mess... let''s close that mouth of his.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Cameria/CAM_95.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[360]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3085, 'CameriaOfferBetrayalSix', '[]', 'I am so tired of hearing Tora go on and on about nature. Let me go and I''ll knock her down a peg.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Cameria/CAM_96.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[360]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3086, 'CameriaOfferBetrayalSeven', '[]', 'Vorici really pisses me off. He''s a killer, no better than you or me, but he tries to hide it like a dirty little secret. I don''t. I kill out in the open, like a man. Give him what he deserves.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Cameria/CAM_97.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[360]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3087, 'CameriaOfferBetrayalEight', '[]', 'Don''t look at me. Look at that monster. Thing doesn''t even sleep! That''s who we should be fighting!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Cameria/CAM_98.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[360]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3088, 'CameriaOfferBetrayalNine', '[]', 'I''m supposed to offer to betray here. That''s what he taught me.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Cameria/CAM_99.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[360]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3089, 'CameriaOfferExecuteZero', '[]', 'I just can''t bring myself to care. It''s death for me.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Cameria/CAM_100.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[360]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3090, 'CameriaOfferExecuteOne', '[]', 'The boss here will have my hide unless I act stoic.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Cameria/CAM_101.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[360]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3091, 'CameriaOfferExecuteTwo', '[]', 'Wouldn''t want to appear weak in front of my brethren.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Cameria/CAM_102.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[360]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3092, 'CameriaOfferExecuteThree', '[]', 'No interrogation this time. Just murder.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Cameria/CAM_103.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[360]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3093, 'CameriaReplyToBetrayalAcceptedZero', '[]', 'Everyone in this Syndicate''s a bastard, apparently.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Cameria/CAM_104.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[360]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3094, 'CameriaReplyToBetrayalAcceptedOne', '[]', 'Can''t please everyone.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Cameria/CAM_105.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[360]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3095, 'CameriaReplyToBetrayalAcceptedTwo', '[]', 'I will eat you, huntress!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Cameria/CAM_106.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[360]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3096, 'CameriaReplyToBetrayalAcceptedThree', '[]', 'Honestly, most of what that thing says goes in one ear and out the other. Ain''t got time to decipher that.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Cameria/CAM_107.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[360]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3097, 'CameriaReplyToBetrayalAcceptedFour', '[]', 'Stop punishing me!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Cameria/CAM_108.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[360]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3098, 'CameriaReplyToBetrayalAcceptedFive', '[]', 'Riker, when I catch you, expect your suffering to be legendary.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Cameria/CAM_109.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[360]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3099, 'CameriaReplyToBetrayalAcceptedSix', '[]', 'I will rip your traitorous bones from your still-living body one by one!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Cameria/CAM_110.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[360]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3100, 'CameriaInterrogatedZero', '[]', 'Crude choice. I approve.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Cameria/CAM_111.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[360]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3101, 'CameriaInterrogatedOne', '[]', 'You''re getting on my nerves!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Cameria/CAM_112.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[360]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3102, 'CameriaInterrogatedTwo', '[]', 'Finally, you''ve shown some mettle.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Cameria/CAM_113.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[360]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3103, 'CameriaReplyToExecutionZero', '[]', 'Absolutely brutal! More!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Cameria/CAM_114.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[360]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3104, 'CameriaReplyToExecutionOne', '[]', 'Hahaha that''s the best!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Cameria/CAM_115.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[360]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3105, 'CameriaReplyToExecutionTwo', '[]', 'Hahahahahaha ahh hahahahahaha!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Cameria/CAM_116.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[360]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3106, 'CameriaSafehouseLeaderDefeatedZero', '[]', 'This is a lie...', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Cameria/CAM_117.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 10, 0, 1, '[360]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3107, 'CameriaPrimaryDefenderStartsFightEighteen', '[]', 'Beware, the ogre has new tricks.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/JunOrtoi/JO2_34.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[343]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3108, 'CameriaDefeatedEleven', '[]', 'See? Even nightmares may be defeated.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/JunOrtoi/JO2_53.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 9, 0, 1, '[343]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3109, 'CameriaInterrogatedThree', '[]', 'A big tough man like you should be fine in solitary, Cameria.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/JunOrtoi/JO2_91.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[343]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3110, 'CameriaEscapeThree', '[]', 'Run away, scared little child. We''ll get him next time...', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/JunOrtoi/JO2_71.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 4, 0, 1, '[343]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3111, 'CameriaSecondaryDefenderArrivalThirtyTwo', '[]', 'One as cruel as you does not deserve to breathe, Cameria.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/JunOrtoi/JO_71.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[343]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3112, 'CameriaSecondaryDefenderArrivalThirtyThree', '[]', 'Dismember indiscriminately, ogre!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/JunOrtoi/JO2_129.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[343]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3113, 'CameriaReplyToSecondaryDefenderArrivalTwenty', '[]', 'Some beasts should be betrayed.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/JunOrtoi/JO2_146.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[343]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3114, 'CameriaReplyToSecondaryDefenderArrivalTwentyOne', '[]', 'This battlefield is about to get bloodier.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/JunOrtoi/JO2_180.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[343]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3115, 'CameriaReplyToSecondaryDefenderArrivalTwentyTwo', '[]', 'The Syndicate''s trying to restrain your baser impulses, ogre.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/JunOrtoi/JO2_163.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[343]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3116, 'CameriaReplyToBetrayalAcceptedSeven', '[]', 'You can go, ogre. Your past will catch up to you soon enough.', '', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[343]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3117, 'LeoPrimaryDefenderStartsFightZero', '[]', 'Ah, good stuff. I was dying for a bit of biffo.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Leo/LEO_1.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[352]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3118, 'LeoPrimaryDefenderStartsFightOne', '[]', 'Welcome to the fun house!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Leo/LEO_2.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[352]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3119, 'LeoPrimaryDefenderStartsFightTwo', '[]', 'Get outta here, bloody pest!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Leo/LEO_3.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[352]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3120, 'LeoPrimaryDefenderStartsFightThree', '[]', 'Oi! You''re not allowed down here!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Leo/LEO_4.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[352]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3121, 'LeoPrimaryDefenderStartsFightFour', '[]', 'Hate to pick an unfair fight, but...', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Leo/LEO_5.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[352]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3122, 'LeoPrimaryDefenderStartsFightFive', '[]', 'Leaving a fighter to die in a cage? Not nice.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Leo/LEO_6.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[352]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3123, 'LeoPrimaryDefenderStartsFightSix', '[]', 'No more deals. Just good, clean violence.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Leo/LEO_7.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[352]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3124, 'LeoPrimaryDefenderStartsFightSeven', '[]', 'Forget the past. New day, new fight.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Leo/LEO_8.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[352]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3125, 'LeoPrimaryDefenderStartsFightEight', '[]', 'You gave my pride a bloody nose. Now the greave''s on the other leg.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Leo/LEO_9.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[352]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3126, 'LeoPrimaryDefenderStartsFightNine', '[]', 'Back for a grudge match, eh?', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Leo/LEO_10.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[352]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3127, 'LeoPrimaryDefenderStartsFightTen', '[]', 'Strength in numbers!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Leo/LEO_11.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[352]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3128, 'LeoPrimaryDefenderStartsFightEleven', '[]', 'Daresso would have been jealous!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Leo/LEO_12.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[352]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3129, 'LeoPrimaryDefenderStartsFightTwelve', '[]', 'My favourite thing''s watching the colour drain from a foe''s face.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Leo/LEO_13.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[352]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3130, 'LeoPrimaryDefenderStartsFightThirteen', '[]', 'This''ll chill you to the bone, and beyond.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Leo/LEO_14.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[352]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3131, 'LeoPrimaryDefenderStartsFightFourteen', '[]', 'Dodge this.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Leo/LEO_15.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[352]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3132, 'LeoSafehouseLeaderIntroZero', '[]', 'Stormin'' in here like that, completely disrespectful. I need to show you some manners.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Leo/LEO_16.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[352]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3133, 'LeoSecondaryDefenderArrivalZero', '[]', 'Tag me in, mate!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Leo/LEO_17.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[352]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3134, 'LeoSecondaryDefenderArrivalOne', '[]', 'Stick together! What a ruckus.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Leo/LEO_18.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[352]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3135, 'LeoSecondaryDefenderArrivalTwo', '[]', 'Why''s this bloody invader still alive?', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Leo/LEO_19.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[352]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3136, 'LeoSecondaryDefenderArrivalThree', '[]', 'Seriously? You got the jump and you still need backup?', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Leo/LEO_20.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[352]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3137, 'LeoSecondaryDefenderArrivalFour', '[]', 'Yes! Finally, a brawl!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Leo/LEO_21.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[352]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3138, 'LeoSecondaryDefenderArrivalFive', '[]', 'Been dyin'' to slap each other around a bit.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Leo/LEO_22.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[352]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3139, 'LeoSecondaryDefenderArrivalSix', '[]', 'Need a hand sweetie? I''ve only got the one.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Leo/LEO_23.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[352]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3140, 'LeoSecondaryDefenderArrivalSeven', '[]', 'Not so easy when it''s a fair fight, is it Vorici?', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Leo/LEO_24.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[352]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3141, 'LeoSecondaryDefenderArrivalEight', '[]', 'I''m here to blow a little wind into your sails, mate!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Leo/LEO_25.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[352]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3142, 'LeoSecondaryDefenderArrivalNine', '[]', 'You weren''t going to leave me out of this brawl, were you, Thane?', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Leo/LEO_26.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[352]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3143, 'LeoSecondaryDefenderArrivalTen', '[]', 'Leave some for me this time ya big bloody bastard.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Leo/LEO_27.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[352]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3144, 'LeoSecondaryDefenderArrivalEleven', '[]', 'What bloody ruckus have you got us into?!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Leo/LEO_28.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[352]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3145, 'LeoSecondaryDefenderArrivalTwelve', '[]', 'Mates, you''re all screwed.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Leo/LEO_29.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[352]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3146, 'LeoSecondaryDefenderArrivalThirteen', '[]', 'Let''s turn this into a free for all.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Leo/LEO_30.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[352]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3147, 'LeoSecondaryDefenderArrivalFourteen', '[]', 'Never take your eyes off the brawler.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Leo/LEO_31.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[352]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3148, 'LeoSecondaryDefenderArrivalFifteen', '[]', 'Hook''s dying to tear into some sinew and I don''t much care whose.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Leo/LEO_32.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[352]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3149, 'LeoSecondaryDefenderArrivalSixteen', '[]', 'Sorry huntress, but time''s come to put you down.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Leo/LEO_33.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[352]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3150, 'LeoSecondaryDefenderArrivalSeventeen', '[]', 'Vagan, this beating''s for old-time''s sake.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Leo/LEO_34.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[352]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3151, 'LeoSecondaryDefenderArrivalEighteen', '[]', 'Look at me! Now I''m a bloody backstabbing ponce. Not very fair, eh, Vorici?', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Leo/LEO_35.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[352]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3152, 'LeoSecondaryDefenderArrivalNineteen', '[]', 'Back in the day I''d''ve given my left arm to take a swing at a Perandus.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Leo/LEO_36.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[352]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3153, 'LeoSecondaryDefenderArrivalTwenty', '[]', 'Everyone loves an underdog, Hillock. And you''re never the underdog.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Leo/LEO_37.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[352]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3154, 'LeoSecondaryDefenderArrivalTwentyOne', '[]', 'This ain''t my first battle royale, mates.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Leo/LEO_38.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[352]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3155, 'LeoReplyToSecondaryDefenderArrivalZero', '[]', 'Cage match then, is it?', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Leo/LEO_39.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[352]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3156, 'LeoReplyToSecondaryDefenderArrivalOne', '[]', 'Great, another body I''ll have to lug around.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Leo/LEO_40.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[352]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3157, 'LeoReplyToSecondaryDefenderArrivalTwo', '[]', 'So much for this place being secret.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Leo/LEO_41.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[352]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3158, 'LeoReplyToSecondaryDefenderArrivalThree', '[]', 'Free for all brawl!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Leo/LEO_42.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[352]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3159, 'LeoReplyToSecondaryDefenderArrivalFour', '[]', 'Oh, how bloody kind.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Leo/LEO_43.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[352]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3160, 'LeoReplyToSecondaryDefenderArrivalFive', '[]', 'I mean, I get why you''d want a new face.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Leo/LEO_44.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[352]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3161, 'LeoReplyToSecondaryDefenderArrivalSix', '[]', 'Taking it to the spleen, maybe.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Leo/LEO_45.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[352]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3162, 'LeoReplyToSecondaryDefenderArrivalSeven', '[]', 'Somehow I don''t think you''re hitting on me.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Leo/LEO_46.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[352]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3163, 'LeoReplyToSecondaryDefenderArrivalEight', '[]', 'Go on, then. Just try it.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Leo/LEO_47.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[352]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3164, 'LeoSecondaryDefenderArrivalTwentyTwo', '[]', 'This defense has become a bloody siege.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Leo/LEO_48.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[352]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3165, 'LeoSecondaryDefenderArrivalTwentyThree', '[]', 'Looks like you could use another hand. Just the one though.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Leo/LEO_49.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[352]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3166, 'LeoSecondaryDefenderArrivalTwentyFour', '[]', 'Let''s get this handled and get out.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Leo/LEO_50.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[352]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3167, 'LeoSecondaryDefenderArrivalTwentyFive', '[]', 'Gotta swing the odds in our favour.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Leo/LEO_51.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[352]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3168, 'LeoSecondaryDefenderArrivalTwentySix', '[]', 'I know you''re bloody dangerous, Haku, so let''s aim that intensity in the right direction.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Leo/LEO_52.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[352]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3169, 'LeoSecondaryDefenderArrivalTwentySeven', '[]', 'Care to get swept up in my crusade, old man?', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Leo/LEO_53.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[352]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3170, 'LeoSecondaryDefenderArrivalTwentyEight', '[]', 'I''ve got my eye on victory, Vagan. Let''s do this.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Leo/LEO_54.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[352]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3171, 'LeoSecondaryDefenderArrivalTwentyNine', '[]', 'It seems I''m your captain, Guff!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Leo/LEO_55.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[352]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3172, 'LeoSecondaryDefenderArrivalThirty', '[]', 'Just keep swinging, Hillock.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Leo/LEO_56.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[352]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3173, 'LeoSecondaryDefenderArrivalThirtyOne', '[]', 'The champ is here! What, no roaring crowd?', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Leo/LEO_57.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[352]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3174, 'LeoKillPlayerZero', '[]', 'Match: Leo.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Leo/LEO_58.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 8, 0, 1, '[352]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3175, 'LeoKillPlayerOne', '[]', 'I guess it''s back to work then.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Leo/LEO_59.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 8, 0, 1, '[352]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3176, 'LeoKillPlayerTwo', '[]', 'Not a nice place to die, is it exile?', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Leo/LEO_60.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 8, 0, 1, '[352]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3177, 'LeoKillPlayerThree', '[]', 'Didn''t even get to use my signature one-handed throw!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Leo/LEO_61.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 8, 0, 1, '[352]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3178, 'LeoEscapeZero', '[]', 'Don''t worry, exile, this was a grudge match.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Leo/LEO_62.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 4, 0, 1, '[352]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3179, 'LeoEscapeOne', '[]', 'Thanks for the excitement, exile!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Leo/LEO_63.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 4, 0, 1, '[352]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3180, 'LeoEscapeTwo', '[]', 'Missed it by that much.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Leo/LEO_64.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 4, 0, 1, '[352]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3181, 'LeoDefeatedZero', '[]', 'How did I lose a bloody cage match?', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Leo/LEO_65.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 9, 0, 1, '[352]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3182, 'LeoDefeatedOne', '[]', 'Urgh... too much of a ruckus.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Leo/LEO_66.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 9, 0, 1, '[352]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3183, 'LeoDefeatedTwo', '[]', 'Gotta be honest. My heart wasn''t in this one.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Leo/LEO_67.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 9, 0, 1, '[352]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3184, 'LeoDefeatedThree', '[]', 'Fair. Fair fight. Not bad.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Leo/LEO_68.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 9, 0, 1, '[352]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3185, 'LeoDefeatedFour', '[]', 'No more time-outs, please...', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Leo/LEO_69.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 9, 0, 1, '[352]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3186, 'LeoDefeatedFive', '[]', 'Even better with a weapon than with words...', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Leo/LEO_70.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 9, 0, 1, '[352]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3187, 'LeoDefeatedSix', '[]', 'I''m really building a damaged reputation here.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Leo/LEO_71.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 9, 0, 1, '[352]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3188, 'LeoDefeatedSeven', '[]', 'This one''s going to hurt, isn''t it?', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Leo/LEO_72.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 9, 0, 1, '[352]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3189, 'LeoDefeatedEight', '[]', 'Hah! I knew you''d get me back for killing you.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Leo/LEO_73.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 9, 0, 1, '[352]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3190, 'LeoDefeatedNine', '[]', 'I shouldn''t have jumped in like I did!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Leo/LEO_74.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 9, 0, 1, '[352]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3191, 'LeoDefeatedTen', '[]', 'Sure can pick ''em, can''t ya Leo?', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Leo/LEO_75.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 9, 0, 1, '[352]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3192, 'LeoOfferBargainZero', '[]', 'You should have given them the Redmane treatment. Make a statement! So what do you want from me?', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Leo/LEO_76.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[352]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3193, 'LeoOfferBargainOne', '[]', 'You won, so congratulations are in order. But the Syndicate''s still going strong. Want to really hit us where it hurts? Then you''ve gotta let us team up. Take us down as a group! I''ll even let you choose my teammate. Up for the challenge?', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Leo/LEO_77.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[352]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3194, 'LeoOfferBargainTwo', '[]', 'Don''t snuff my candle just yet. I''ve got access to information you might find valuable. Just let me get in contact with a mate of mine, get a little drink in ''em. A little palling around and whammo, gossip galore. What do you say?', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Leo/LEO_78.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[352]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3195, 'LeoOfferBargainThree', '[]', 'I''m a man of limited talents, as you can see. Only so much you can do with a hook, and apparently this wasn''t one of ''em. You don''t need to kick a man while he''s down. Just let me figure out a plan B.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Leo/LEO_79.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[352]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3196, 'LeoOfferBargainFour', '[]', 'What if - and bear with me here - what if instead of gutting me, you just let me go? And I mean really go. Gone. Out of the Syndicate. Interested?', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Leo/LEO_80.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[352]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3197, 'LeoOfferBargainFive', '[]', 'You hear a lot of things when you spend enough time at one job. The sort of things someone like you might get some use out of. Only, there''s no bloody way I''m telling you anything if you''re just going to slice me to bits.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Leo/LEO_81.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[352]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3198, 'LeoOfferBargainSix', '[]', 'To the victor go the spoils. As in, actual treasure. Stuff you can swing and wear! Interested?', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Leo/LEO_82.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[352]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3199, 'LeoBargainAcceptedZero', '[]', 'Dunno about you, but I''m excited for the next round.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Leo/LEO_83.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[352]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3200, 'LeoBargainAcceptedOne', '[]', 'I guess it''s time to play at spying.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Leo/LEO_84.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[352]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3201, 'LeoBargainAcceptedTwo', '[]', 'Next time you see me, I''ll be a new man. With a new plan.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Leo/LEO_85.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[352]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3202, 'LeoBargainAcceptedThree', '[]', 'Good choice, exile. I guess I''m off!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Leo/LEO_86.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[352]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3203, 'LeoBargainAcceptedFour', '[]', 'You''re a smart one, exile.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Leo/LEO_87.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[352]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3204, 'LeoBargainAcceptedFive', '[]', 'And the strong get stronger.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Leo/LEO_88.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[352]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3205, 'LeoOfferBetrayalZero', '[]', 'I preferred being the Pitmaster than a pit dog in my proverbial past life. Getting bloodied for money was never much fun. I reckon a few sneaky maneuvers and I could knock a Syndicate chump down a peg, leaving me to take their place. Might piss ''em off, but I think somehow you''ll be fine with that.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Leo/LEO_89.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[352]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3206, 'LeoOfferBetrayalOne', '[]', 'Back in my arena-master days, I learned the power of prestige. To rise in the eyes of the crowd, others must fall. That''s somethin'' I''ve made sure to keep ready myself. Bloody the noses of my comrades-in-arms here and elevate myself. It''s a power play.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Leo/LEO_90.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[352]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3207, 'LeoOfferBetrayalTwo', '[]', 'A bad apple spoils the bunch. Put bluntly, one monkey''s arse can damage the whole crowd''s enthusiasm. Get what I''m gettin'' at? I make it my business to retain the ability to kick someone out of the rosters entirely.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Leo/LEO_91.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[352]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3208, 'LeoOfferBetrayalThree', '[]', 'If it''s information you''re after, no better to converse with than Leo Redmane. I''ve befriended all of my comrades-in-arms, and I can tell you all about their roles and fighting strategies... if you''ll spare me a certain amount of pain in exchange.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Leo/LEO_92.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[352]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3209, 'LeoOfferBetrayalFour', '[]', 'Hate to double-cross an old mate, but Vagan''s man enough to deal with it. Plus, I owe him one.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Leo/LEO_93.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[352]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3210, 'LeoOfferBetrayalFive', '[]', 'Look, I get why you want to kill me. I do. But Perandus! Bloody Perandus! Doesn''t that name just make you... Rrrrg! Perandus!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Leo/LEO_94.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[352]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3211, 'LeoOfferBetrayalSix', '[]', 'A professional like myself knows that when the fight''s over, the fight''s over. Hillock... well, the fight''s never really over in his head. Put the poor bastard out of his misery.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Leo/LEO_95.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[352]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3212, 'LeoOfferBetrayalSeven', '[]', 'I love a bit of violence. Who among us doesn''t? But there''s a time and a place. For Cameria, the time is always and the place is wherever he happens to bloody be. I just can''t stand it.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Leo/LEO_96.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[352]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3213, 'LeoOfferBetrayalEight', '[]', 'When a fight''s over, the fighter''s job is done. We go home, tend to our wounds, and train for the next round. When Aisling''s done fighting, well, that''s just the beginning. The things she does to the bodies... I''m intimidating, but she''s scary.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Leo/LEO_97.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[352]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3214, 'LeoOfferBetrayalNine', '[]', 'An arena fighter knows, once the fight is over, respect is what counts. Think anyone else in the Syndicate would say the same?', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Leo/LEO_98.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[352]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3215, 'LeoOfferExecuteZero', '[]', 'Always hoped I''d get a warrior''s death.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Leo/LEO_99.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[352]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3216, 'LeoOfferExecuteOne', '[]', 'Look at the situation you''ve put me in. The only way you''ll get me to spill my guts is literally.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Leo/LEO_100.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[352]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3217, 'LeoOfferExecuteTwo', '[]', 'I''ll take this one for the team.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Leo/LEO_101.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[352]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3218, 'LeoOfferExecuteThree', '[]', 'My days in the cage are over. End our conflict, and make a good show of it.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Leo/LEO_102.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[352]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3219, 'LeoReplyToBetrayalAcceptedZero', '[]', 'Knew you were weak. Bloody knew it.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Leo/LEO_103.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[352]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3220, 'LeoReplyToBetrayalAcceptedOne', '[]', 'Next time it''ll be you, old friend.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Leo/LEO_104.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[352]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3221, 'LeoReplyToBetrayalAcceptedTwo', '[]', 'Go neck yourself, mate.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Leo/LEO_105.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[352]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3222, 'LeoReplyToBetrayalAcceptedThree', '[]', 'Righto, Redblade. You''re on my list.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Leo/LEO_106.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[352]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3223, 'LeoReplyToBetrayalAcceptedFour', '[]', 'You really are a bastard, aren''t you.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Leo/LEO_107.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[352]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3224, 'LeoReplyToBetrayalAcceptedFive', '[]', 'Must be nice, having absolutely no conscience whatsoever.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Leo/LEO_108.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[352]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3225, 'LeoReplyToBetrayalAcceptedSix', '[]', 'Is it really in your best interests to piss off a bloody arena fighter?', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Leo/LEO_109.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[352]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3226, 'LeoInterrogatedZero', '[]', 'You say prison cell, I hear ''holiday.''', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Leo/LEO_110.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[352]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3227, 'LeoInterrogatedOne', '[]', 'You know what she does to me in there? Please. Please no.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Leo/LEO_111.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[352]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3228, 'LeoInterrogatedTwo', '[]', 'Wait, what about a deal? What about last time?', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Leo/LEO_112.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[352]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3229, 'LeoReplyToExecutionZero', '[]', 'You should have given them the Redmane treatment. Make a statement.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Leo/LEO_113.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[352]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3230, 'LeoReplyToExecutionOne', '[]', 'Death is what separates the wolves from the pups.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Leo/LEO_114.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[352]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3231, 'LeoReplyToExecutionTwo', '[]', 'If you hadn''t done it, I probably would''ve.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Leo/LEO_115.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[352]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3232, 'LeoSafehouseLeaderDefeatedZero', '[]', 'Bugger. How about a rematch, eh?', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Leo/LEO_116.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 10, 0, 1, '[352]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3233, 'LeoPrimaryDefenderStartsFightEighteen', '[]', 'You must miss the cell, gladiator.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/JunOrtoi/JO2_31.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[343]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3234, 'LeoDefeatedEleven', '[]', 'Talk, or else I will make you talk.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/JunOrtoi/JO2_51.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 9, 0, 1, '[343]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3235, 'LeoEscapeThree', '[]', 'Go on then, coward. Run away.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/JunOrtoi/JO2_69.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 4, 0, 1, '[343]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3236, 'LeoInterrogatedThree', '[]', 'You fight well in a cage. Let''s see how you live in one.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/JunOrtoi/JO2_89.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[343]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3237, 'LeoDefeatedTwelve', '[]', 'It''s over, Leo. Where''s the Lifegiver?', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/JunOrtoi/JO2_111.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 9, 0, 1, '[343]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3238, 'LeoSecondaryDefenderArrivalThirtyTwo', '[]', 'Gladiator, where do your loyalties truly lie?', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/JunOrtoi/JO2_116.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[343]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3239, 'LeoReplyToSecondaryDefenderArrivalNine', '[]', 'You should be leading the Syndicate, arena master!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/JunOrtoi/JO2_133.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[343]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3240, 'LeoReplyToSecondaryDefenderArrivalTen', '[]', 'No respect, gladiator. Not from them.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/JunOrtoi/JO2_150.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[343]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3241, 'LeoReplyToSecondaryDefenderArrivalEleven', '[]', 'Arena master, why do you step into the fight yourself?', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/JunOrtoi/JO2_167.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[343]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3242, 'LeoSecondaryDefenderArrivalThirtyThree', '[]', 'Leo. You used to fight with honour.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/JunOrtoi/JO_58.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[343]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3243, 'LeoReplyToBetrayalAcceptedEight', '[]', 'Not every conflict must end with death, gladiator.', '', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[343]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3244, 'ElreonPrimaryDefenderStartsFightZero', '[]', 'Well met, exile. Know that we must purify those who stand in the way of our crusade.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Elreon/EL_01.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[347]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3245, 'ElreonPrimaryDefenderStartsFightOne', '[]', 'This bastion will not fall as long as our faith remains strong.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Elreon/EL_02.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[347]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3246, 'ElreonPrimaryDefenderStartsFightTwo', '[]', 'Logistics is the key to any crusade, and we''ll defend it with our lives.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Elreon/EL_03.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[347]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3247, 'ElreonPrimaryDefenderStartsFightThree', '[]', 'Behind every crusade is a bloody legacy the public never sees.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Elreon/EL_04.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[347]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3248, 'ElreonPrimaryDefenderStartsFightFour', '[]', 'Your purification has been ordered, heretic.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Elreon/EL_05.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[347]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3249, 'ElreonPrimaryDefenderStartsFightFive', '[]', 'I withstood your Inquisition, exile. And I am stronger for it.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Elreon/EL_06.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[347]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3250, 'ElreonPrimaryDefenderStartsFightSix', '[]', 'I''d prefer peace if I had the choice, but I don''t.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Elreon/EL_07.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[347]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3251, 'ElreonPrimaryDefenderStartsFightSeven', '[]', 'You made me question my faith last time we met. I have found new resolve.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Elreon/EL_08.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[347]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3252, 'ElreonPrimaryDefenderStartsFightEight', '[]', 'It is the highest calling to die for one''s crusade.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Elreon/EL_09.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[347]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3253, 'ElreonPrimaryDefenderStartsFightNine', '[]', 'Exile, you know how this ends.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Elreon/EL_10.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[347]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3254, 'ElreonPrimaryDefenderStartsFightTen', '[]', 'Purity is mine to wield against the unworthy.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Elreon/EL_11.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[347]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3255, 'ElreonPrimaryDefenderStartsFightEleven', '[]', 'The sacred bones of centuries of Templar are an unstoppable tide.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Elreon/EL_12.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[347]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3256, 'ElreonPrimaryDefenderStartsFightTwelve', '[]', 'God, lend me your might to smite the wicked!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Elreon/EL_13.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[347]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3257, 'ElreonPrimaryDefenderStartsFightThirteen', '[]', 'God, lend me your speed to confront the wicked!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Elreon/EL_14.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[347]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3258, 'ElreonPrimaryDefenderStartsFightFourteen', '[]', 'Purification through fire!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Elreon/EL_15.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[347]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3259, 'ElreonSafehouseLeaderIntroZero', '[]', 'This is a place of sanctuary, one which I cannot allow you to defile.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Elreon/EL_16.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[347]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3260, 'ElreonSecondaryDefenderArrivalZero', '[]', 'Take heart, crusader! God aids our defense!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Elreon/EL_17.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[347]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3261, 'ElreonSecondaryDefenderArrivalOne', '[]', 'We must protect these sorely needed supplies together!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Elreon/EL_18.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[347]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3262, 'ElreonSecondaryDefenderArrivalTwo', '[]', 'A holy crusade is still a war, and war comes with necessary evils.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Elreon/EL_19.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[347]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3263, 'ElreonSecondaryDefenderArrivalThree', '[]', 'Sometimes, crusading is bloody work. Let''s get it done.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Elreon/EL_20.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[347]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3264, 'ElreonSecondaryDefenderArrivalFour', '[]', 'Strength in faith, and strength in numbers.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Elreon/EL_21.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[347]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3265, 'ElreonSecondaryDefenderArrivalFive', '[]', 'I will not fail the cause!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Elreon/EL_22.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[347]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3266, 'ElreonSecondaryDefenderArrivalSix', '[]', 'I''m here to save your sorry arse, Vagan.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Elreon/EL_23.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[347]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3267, 'ElreonSecondaryDefenderArrivalSeven', '[]', 'Couldn''t buy your way out of this one, could you.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Elreon/EL_24.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[347]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3268, 'ElreonSecondaryDefenderArrivalEight', '[]', 'God helps even the most nauseatingly ugly of creatures.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Elreon/EL_25.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[347]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3269, 'ElreonSecondaryDefenderArrivalNine', '[]', 'The bigger they are, the more help they need.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Elreon/EL_26.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[347]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3270, 'ElreonSecondaryDefenderArrivalTen', '[]', 'General Gravicius, your reinforcements are here.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Elreon/EL_27.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[347]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3271, 'ElreonSecondaryDefenderArrivalEleven', '[]', 'Worry not, crusader! Your saviour has arrived.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Elreon/EL_28.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[347]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3272, 'ElreonSecondaryDefenderArrivalTwelve', '[]', 'Iniquity breeds in safety. This keep must be cleansed.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Elreon/EL_29.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[347]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3273, 'ElreonSecondaryDefenderArrivalThirteen', '[]', 'I''ll not stand idly by and let you fail our brethren!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Elreon/EL_30.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[347]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3274, 'ElreonSecondaryDefenderArrivalFourteen', '[]', 'Wickedness and sin. That''s all I see here.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Elreon/EL_31.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[347]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3275, 'ElreonSecondaryDefenderArrivalFifteen', '[]', 'God has called for a purge! None of you are without sin.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Elreon/EL_32.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[347]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3276, 'ElreonSecondaryDefenderArrivalSixteen', '[]', 'Sorry, friend, but God''s got another plan for this fight!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Elreon/EL_33.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[347]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3277, 'ElreonSecondaryDefenderArrivalSeventeen', '[]', 'You''ve earned a special place in God''s heart, Vorici. Let me send you there.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Elreon/EL_34.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[347]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3278, 'ElreonSecondaryDefenderArrivalEighteen', '[]', 'You''re no part of God''s plan. What ghastly thing made you?', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Elreon/EL_35.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[347]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3279, 'ElreonSecondaryDefenderArrivalNineteen', '[]', 'You may be a fellow Templar, but your unhallowed crusade is yours alone.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Elreon/EL_36.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[347]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3280, 'ElreonSecondaryDefenderArrivalTwenty', '[]', 'One thing I learned from the Templars: never trust a man in a mask.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Elreon/EL_37.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[347]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3281, 'ElreonSecondaryDefenderArrivalTwentyOne', '[]', 'Funny thing about the crusades. They start focused, but end up consuming all.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Elreon/EL_38.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[347]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3282, 'ElreonReplyToSecondaryDefenderArrivalZero', '[]', 'Only a fool brings a fight to God''s doorstep.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Elreon/EL_39.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[347]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3283, 'ElreonReplyToSecondaryDefenderArrivalOne', '[]', 'For the crusade, I''ll defend this to the death.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Elreon/EL_40.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[347]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3284, 'ElreonReplyToSecondaryDefenderArrivalTwo', '[]', 'It seems we are all sinners, here.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Elreon/EL_41.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[347]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3285, 'ElreonReplyToSecondaryDefenderArrivalThree', '[]', 'I''ll smite all comers!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Elreon/EL_42.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[347]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3286, 'ElreonReplyToSecondaryDefenderArrivalFour', '[]', 'God is everywhere, warrior. Even in you.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Elreon/EL_43.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[347]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3287, 'ElreonReplyToSecondaryDefenderArrivalFive', '[]', 'I think you''ve been spending too much time wearing black and sitting alone in the dark, Vorici.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Elreon/EL_44.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[347]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3288, 'ElreonReplyToSecondaryDefenderArrivalSix', '[]', 'Power is a false idol, Janus. It has led you astray.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Elreon/EL_45.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[347]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3289, 'ElreonReplyToSecondaryDefenderArrivalSeven', '[]', 'Not at all. Let us see who He sides with, false Templar.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Elreon/EL_46.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[347]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3290, 'ElreonReplyToSecondaryDefenderArrivalEight', '[]', 'And in the way I shall remain!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Elreon/EL_47.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[347]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3291, 'ElreonReplyToSecondaryDefenderArrivalNine', '[]', 'Good thing I''m in a smiting mood!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Elreon/EL_48.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[347]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3292, 'ElreonSecondaryDefenderArrivalTwentyTwo', '[]', 'We shall stand impregnable.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Elreon/EL_49.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[347]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3293, 'ElreonSecondaryDefenderArrivalTwentyThree', '[]', 'Fight with renewed vigor, crusaders!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Elreon/EL_50.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[347]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3294, 'ElreonSecondaryDefenderArrivalTwentyFour', '[]', 'We do what we must for the greater good.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Elreon/EL_51.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[347]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3295, 'ElreonSecondaryDefenderArrivalTwentyFive', '[]', 'Exile, you leave us no choice.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Elreon/EL_52.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[347]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3296, 'ElreonSecondaryDefenderArrivalTwentySix', '[]', 'Can my God borrow you from Hinekora for this fight, honored warrior?', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Elreon/EL_53.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[347]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3297, 'ElreonSecondaryDefenderArrivalTwentySeven', '[]', 'Will you answer the call, Vorici?', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Elreon/EL_54.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[347]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3298, 'ElreonSecondaryDefenderArrivalTwentyEight', '[]', 'About time your family fought in a war, rather than just fund them, Janus.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Elreon/EL_55.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[347]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3299, 'ElreonSecondaryDefenderArrivalTwentyNine', '[]', 'Crusaders take all shapes, I suppose. Can you follow orders, Hillock?', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Elreon/EL_56.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[347]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3300, 'ElreonSecondaryDefenderArrivalThirty', '[]', 'Great emperors have become trapped by their own machines, Riker. Take care not to make the same mistake.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Elreon/EL_57.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[347]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3301, 'ElreonSecondaryDefenderArrivalThirtyOne', '[]', 'Let''s get this crusade in shape.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Elreon/EL_58.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[347]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3302, 'ElreonKillPlayerZero', '[]', 'I told you this bastion would not fall.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Elreon/EL_59.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 8, 0, 1, '[347]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3303, 'ElreonKillPlayerOne', '[]', 'You should never have come here, child.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Elreon/EL_60.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 8, 0, 1, '[347]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3304, 'ElreonKillPlayerTwo', '[]', 'Add one more sin to the pile - and burn it.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Elreon/EL_61.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 8, 0, 1, '[347]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3305, 'ElreonKillPlayerThree', '[]', 'When you see him, exile, shrink not from God.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Elreon/EL_62.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 8, 0, 1, '[347]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3306, 'ElreonEscapeZero', '[]', 'God''s worthy are saved, but heretics are punished.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Elreon/EL_63.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 4, 0, 1, '[347]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3307, 'ElreonEscapeOne', '[]', 'I was right to have faith.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Elreon/EL_64.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 4, 0, 1, '[347]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3308, 'ElreonEscapeTwo', '[]', 'Only God knows what we have done, now.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Elreon/EL_65.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 4, 0, 1, '[347]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3309, 'ElreonDefeatedZero', '[]', 'Agh... my faith was not strong enough...', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Elreon/EL_66.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 9, 0, 1, '[347]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3310, 'ElreonDefeatedOne', '[]', 'Not here!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Elreon/EL_67.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 9, 0, 1, '[347]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3311, 'ElreonDefeatedTwo', '[]', 'Expose our sins, exile. It is what we deserve.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Elreon/EL_68.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 9, 0, 1, '[347]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3312, 'ElreonDefeatedThree', '[]', 'I''ve... failed...', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Elreon/EL_69.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 9, 0, 1, '[347]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3313, 'ElreonDefeatedFour', '[]', 'Back... to the Inquisition...', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Elreon/EL_70.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 9, 0, 1, '[347]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3314, 'ElreonDefeatedFive', '[]', 'We should solve this with words.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Elreon/EL_71.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 9, 0, 1, '[347]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3315, 'ElreonDefeatedSix', '[]', 'God certainly keeps testing me.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Elreon/EL_72.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 9, 0, 1, '[347]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3316, 'ElreonDefeatedSeven', '[]', 'To fall, perhaps to die again, but pure I remain.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Elreon/EL_73.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 9, 0, 1, '[347]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3317, 'ElreonDefeatedEight', '[]', 'Perhaps I deserve this vengeance.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Elreon/EL_74.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 9, 0, 1, '[347]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3318, 'ElreonDefeatedNine', '[]', 'God''s eyes are not upon us this day.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Elreon/EL_75.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 9, 0, 1, '[347]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3319, 'ElreonDefeatedTen', '[]', 'Lord, did I err?', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Elreon/EL_76.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 9, 0, 1, '[347]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3320, 'ElreonOfferBargainZero', '[]', 'You remind me why I left the Templars. Consider me intimidated, Exile. I''ll bargain.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Elreon/EL_77.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[347]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3321, 'ElreonOfferBargainOne', '[]', 'If you wish to change minds, Exile, it is better to raise people up than cut them down. Crusades are not won and lost on the battlefield alone. If you have someone in mind, I will put them at my right hand, and expose them to new ideas.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Elreon/EL_78.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[347]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3322, 'ElreonOfferBargainTwo', '[]', 'Dominus exiled me too, you know. Thought I were too soft for Templar leadership, and that my radical ideas might turn others against him. He was right! I have a knack for bringing others ''round to my way of thinking without too much blood. Perhaps you should consider using such a talent yourself.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Elreon/EL_79.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[347]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3323, 'ElreonOfferBargainThree', '[]', 'It''s hard working for a group when you don''t like their methods. Reminds me of some dark days under the Templar. I''d rather find something less grim to do. Would you consider sparing this old man''s life? Never too old for a second chance.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Elreon/EL_80.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[347]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3324, 'ElreonOfferBargainFour', '[]', 'All this time, all this bloodshed, I kept telling myself that the ends justify the means. But I can''t stop asking myself: what if I''m wrong? Have I damned myself? Reckon it''s time I took a sabbatical. I''ll retreat from all this and wait for a divine sign.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Elreon/EL_81.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[347]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3325, 'ElreonOfferBargainFive', '[]', 'If only you could see the bigger picture Exile! If only you could understand what we''re trying to build! Are you in a listening mood? Stay your blade and perhaps, once you''ve heard what we are doing here, you will change your mind.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Elreon/EL_82.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[347]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3326, 'ElreonOfferBargainSix', '[]', 'How about some old-fashioned bribery?', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Elreon/EL_83.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[347]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3327, 'ElreonBargainAcceptedZero', '[]', 'The ranks of the faithful swell!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Elreon/EL_84.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[347]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3328, 'ElreonBargainAcceptedOne', '[]', 'I''ll let you know what I find out.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Elreon/EL_85.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[347]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3329, 'ElreonBargainAcceptedTwo', '[]', 'Consider it done!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Elreon/EL_86.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[347]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3330, 'ElreonBargainAcceptedThree', '[]', 'Go with peace, Exile. And if you see God somewhere on your journey, tell him I''m waiting to hear from him.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Elreon/EL_87.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[347]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3331, 'ElreonBargainAcceptedFour', '[]', 'Alright then, listen closely.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Elreon/EL_88.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[347]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3332, 'ElreonBargainAcceptedFive', '[]', 'Not all Templar''s old tactics are without their uses here.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Elreon/EL_89.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[347]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3333, 'ElreonOfferBetrayalZero', '[]', 'Personally, I believe this whole thing''s being mismanaged. Devotion starts at the top. If you''d like, I can leverage my supporters in the Syndicate to depose our current leader and take up the role myself.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Elreon/EL_90.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[347]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3334, 'ElreonOfferBetrayalOne', '[]', 'In my Templar days, men that failed as hard as these would have been demoted. I''m in a position to reimplement that policy, if it suits your interests.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Elreon/EL_91.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[347]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3335, 'ElreonOfferBetrayalTwo', '[]', 'Sometimes, Exile, excommunication is the right tool to send a message. I do have some sway in this organisation, and I could get someone removed from the Syndicate, if that''s what you''re after.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Elreon/EL_92.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[347]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3336, 'ElreonOfferBetrayalThree', '[]', 'No need for an Inquisition. I''ll tell you everything I know about my fellow crusaders.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Elreon/EL_93.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[347]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3337, 'ElreonOfferBetrayalFour', '[]', 'You can''t really trust someone who worships trees and ghosts, can you?', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Elreon/EL_94.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[347]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3338, 'ElreonOfferBetrayalFive', '[]', 'Perandus serves no power above his own. He''s no ally of mine, nor of anyone who cannot help him achieve whatever foul fantasies he has cooked up.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Elreon/EL_95.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[347]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3339, 'ElreonOfferBetrayalSix', '[]', 'That creature is no creation of God. Whatever power it serves, we''d do well to do what we can to stop it. Together.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Elreon/EL_96.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[347]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3340, 'ElreonOfferBetrayalSeven', '[]', 'I don''t know what God''s plan is, Exile, but I know that Gravicius is not part of it.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Elreon/EL_97.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[347]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3341, 'ElreonOfferBetrayalEight', '[]', 'Maloney fills me with doubt. The worst atrocities of the Templar were ordered by men in masks. Just think about why that might be for a moment, and you''ll see why he''s a far bigger threat than I.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Elreon/EL_98.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[347]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3342, 'ElreonOfferBetrayalNine', '[]', 'God welcomes all into his arms, but I can''t say the reverse is true. Some people need a little nudge.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Elreon/EL_99.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[347]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3343, 'ElreonOfferExecuteZero', '[]', 'I''m no traitor or trader. I choose to die for the cause.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Elreon/EL_100.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[347]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3344, 'ElreonOfferExecuteOne', '[]', 'In front of my commander, I''ll choose death every time.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Elreon/EL_101.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[347]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3345, 'ElreonOfferExecuteTwo', '[]', 'Stay strong, crusader. This Exile can do no worse than the Syndicate.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Elreon/EL_102.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[347]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3346, 'ElreonOfferExecuteThree', '[]', 'This old crusader has reached his limit for Inquisitions. Just end it.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Elreon/EL_103.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[347]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3347, 'ElreonReplyToBetrayalAcceptedZero', '[]', 'Some have less faith than others. They are to be pitied.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Elreon/EL_104.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[347]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3348, 'ElreonReplyToBetrayalAcceptedOne', '[]', 'Madness is putting one''s faith in long-lost ancestors. They were human, and flawed, and they''ll betray you just like you''ve betrayed me.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Elreon/EL_105.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[347]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3349, 'ElreonReplyToBetrayalAcceptedTwo', '[]', 'Oh assassin, how expected.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Elreon/EL_106.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[347]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3350, 'ElreonReplyToBetrayalAcceptedThree', '[]', 'Not the first time I''ve been betrayed for my faith. As always, I remain resolute.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Elreon/EL_107.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[347]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3351, 'ElreonReplyToBetrayalAcceptedFour', '[]', 'Gravicius, what happened to you to make you this way?', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Elreon/EL_108.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[347]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3352, 'ElreonReplyToBetrayalAcceptedFive', '[]', 'Shut my mouth and I''ll preach by humming, fiend.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Elreon/EL_109.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[347]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3353, 'ElreonReplyToBetrayalAcceptedSix', '[]', 'I won''t judge you for this, but God will.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Elreon/EL_110.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[347]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3354, 'ElreonInterrogatedZero', '[]', 'The Templars had a habit of questioning their own, forcefully. You can''t frighten me.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Elreon/EL_111.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[347]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3355, 'ElreonInterrogatedOne', '[]', 'The Inquisition never ends. I learned that a long time ago.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Elreon/EL_112.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[347]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3356, 'ElreonInterrogatedTwo', '[]', 'From diplomacy to torture. I see.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Elreon/EL_113.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[347]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3357, 'ElreonReplyToExecutionZero', '[]', 'Your methods are brutal. God will not watch you kindly.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Elreon/EL_114.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[347]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3358, 'ElreonReplyToExecutionOne', '[]', 'Why do you inflict such violence?', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Elreon/EL_115.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[347]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3359, 'ElreonReplyToExecutionTwo', '[]', 'Even my rivals deserve better.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Elreon/EL_116.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[347]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3360, 'ElreonSafehouseLeaderDefeatedZero', '[]', 'I thought God was working through me...', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Elreon/EL_117.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 10, 0, 1, '[347]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3361, 'ElreonPrimaryDefenderStartsFightFifteen', '[]', 'Others say you''ve long helped this land, holy man. Why turn your back on it now?', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/JunOrtoi/JO2_49.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[343]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3362, 'ElreonEscapeThree', '[]', 'I underestimated Elreon. That won''t happen again.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/JunOrtoi/JO2_76.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 4, 0, 1, '[343]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3363, 'ElreonDefeatedEleven', '[]', 'I''m sorry, holy man, but you''ve chosen the wrong crusade.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/JunOrtoi/JO2_67.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 9, 0, 1, '[343]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3364, 'ElreonBargainAcceptedSix', '[]', 'Better a deal than having to kill you, old man.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/JunOrtoi/JO2_87.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[343]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3365, 'ElreonInterrogatedThree', '[]', 'I will not be too hard on him, Exile... as long as he talks.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/JunOrtoi/JO2_104.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[343]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3366, 'ElreonSecondaryDefenderArrivalThirtyTwo', '[]', 'Elreon, have you become so blind to the light?', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/JunOrtoi/JO_59.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[343]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3367, 'ElreonSecondaryDefenderArrivalThirtyThree', '[]', 'Did your God send you to us, holy man?', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/JunOrtoi/JO2_117.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[343]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3368, 'ElreonReplyToSecondaryDefenderArrivalTen', '[]', 'You''re too good for the Syndicate, holy man.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/JunOrtoi/JO2_134.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[343]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3369, 'ElreonReplyToSecondaryDefenderArrivalEleven', '[]', 'Be careful! The crusader fights with conviction!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/JunOrtoi/JO2_168.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[343]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3370, 'ElreonReplyToSecondaryDefenderArrivalTwelve', '[]', 'They''re keeping a close eye on you, holy man.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/JunOrtoi/JO2_151.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[343]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3371, 'ToraPrimaryDefenderStartsFightZero', '[]', 'Don''t make me hunt you down.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Tora/TOR_01.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[348]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3372, 'ToraPrimaryDefenderStartsFightOne', '[]', 'Never provoke a wild animal in its den.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Tora/TOR_02.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[348]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3373, 'ToraPrimaryDefenderStartsFightTwo', '[]', 'Don''t interfere, Exile. This isn''t your business.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Tora/TOR_03.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[348]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3374, 'ToraPrimaryDefenderStartsFightThree', '[]', 'You''ll have to be swift if you hope to stop the Syndicate.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Tora/TOR_04.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[348]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3375, 'ToraPrimaryDefenderStartsFightFour', '[]', 'The hunt is on!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Tora/TOR_05.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[348]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3376, 'ToraPrimaryDefenderStartsFightFive', '[]', 'There is no deeper cruelty than caging a wild animal.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Tora/TOR_06.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[348]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3377, 'ToraPrimaryDefenderStartsFightSix', '[]', 'Don''t expect our previous dealings to save you now.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Tora/TOR_07.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[348]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3378, 'ToraPrimaryDefenderStartsFightSeven', '[]', 'You won''t get me to betray the Syndicate this time, Exile.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Tora/TOR_08.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[348]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3379, 'ToraPrimaryDefenderStartsFightEight', '[]', 'The cycle of life and death continues, and the fittest grow fitter!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Tora/TOR_09.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[348]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3380, 'ToraPrimaryDefenderStartsFightNine', '[]', 'You failed in the past, Exile. You''ll fail again.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Tora/TOR_10.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[348]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3381, 'ToraPrimaryDefenderStartsFightTen', '[]', 'Death feeds life in the grand cycle.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Tora/TOR_11.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[348]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3382, 'ToraPrimaryDefenderStartsFightEleven', '[]', 'The earth is eager to meet you.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Tora/TOR_12.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[348]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3383, 'ToraPrimaryDefenderStartsFightTwelve', '[]', 'Be like the earth. Become stone.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Tora/TOR_13.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[348]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3384, 'ToraPrimaryDefenderStartsFightThirteen', '[]', 'I was born with a bow in my hands.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Tora/TOR_14.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[348]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3385, 'ToraPrimaryDefenderStartsFightFourteen', '[]', 'Swift like the wind!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Tora/TOR_15.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[348]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3386, 'ToraSafehouseLeaderIntroZero', '[]', 'A mother bear will fight to the death to protect her cubs.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Tora/TOR_16.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[348]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3387, 'ToraSecondaryDefenderArrivalZero', '[]', 'This den is ours, Exile.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Tora/TOR_17.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[348]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3388, 'ToraSecondaryDefenderArrivalOne', '[]', 'We are no helpless prey!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Tora/TOR_18.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[348]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3389, 'ToraSecondaryDefenderArrivalTwo', '[]', 'This cycle of life and death needs time to finish.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Tora/TOR_19.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[348]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3390, 'ToraSecondaryDefenderArrivalThree', '[]', 'Wolves hunt in packs for a reason.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Tora/TOR_20.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[348]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3391, 'ToraSecondaryDefenderArrivalFour', '[]', 'On the prowl!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Tora/TOR_21.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[348]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3392, 'ToraSecondaryDefenderArrivalFive', '[]', 'You should know better than to wander into strange dens.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Tora/TOR_22.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[348]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3393, 'ToraSecondaryDefenderArrivalSix', '[]', 'Shall we wait for your God, Elreon, or shall we snare this Exile ourselves?', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Tora/TOR_23.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[348]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3394, 'ToraSecondaryDefenderArrivalSeven', '[]', 'Oh, Vagan, it''s you... shall we fight together?', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Tora/TOR_24.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[348]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3395, 'ToraSecondaryDefenderArrivalEight', '[]', 'Prove your worth, unnatural one. Let''s take down this Exile.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Tora/TOR_25.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[348]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3396, 'ToraSecondaryDefenderArrivalNine', '[]', 'Allow me to help you channel a bit of that Ezomyte savagery, Thane.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Tora/TOR_26.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[348]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3397, 'ToraSecondaryDefenderArrivalTen', '[]', 'Some prey must be caught with carefully laid traps. Are you ready, Riker?', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Tora/TOR_27.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[348]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3398, 'ToraSecondaryDefenderArrivalEleven', '[]', 'Let''s put this animal down.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Tora/TOR_28.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[348]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3399, 'ToraSecondaryDefenderArrivalTwelve', '[]', 'This failing den needs to be rooted out.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Tora/TOR_29.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[348]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3400, 'ToraSecondaryDefenderArrivalThirteen', '[]', 'You''ve forgotten nature''s most important lesson. Protect your resources!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Tora/TOR_30.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[348]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3401, 'ToraSecondaryDefenderArrivalFourteen', '[]', 'Nothing about this place is natural!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Tora/TOR_31.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[348]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3402, 'ToraSecondaryDefenderArrivalFifteen', '[]', 'Sometimes rabid animals must be culled.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Tora/TOR_32.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[348]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3403, 'ToraSecondaryDefenderArrivalSixteen', '[]', 'You know why you deserve my arrows, Vagan.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Tora/TOR_33.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[348]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3404, 'ToraSecondaryDefenderArrivalSeventeen', '[]', 'You''re not above the natural order, Vorici. I shall remind you.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Tora/TOR_34.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[348]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3405, 'ToraSecondaryDefenderArrivalEighteen', '[]', 'Nature rejects you, thing!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Tora/TOR_35.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[348]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3406, 'ToraSecondaryDefenderArrivalNineteen', '[]', 'Killing might be for a purpose.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Tora/TOR_36.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[348]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3407, 'ToraSecondaryDefenderArrivalTwenty', '[]', 'Care for a clash, Riker?', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Tora/TOR_37.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[348]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3408, 'ToraSecondaryDefenderArrivalTwentyOne', '[]', 'All of you must be put down.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Tora/TOR_38.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[348]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3409, 'ToraReplyToSecondaryDefenderArrivalZero', '[]', 'This won''t end well for you.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Tora/TOR_39.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[348]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3410, 'ToraReplyToSecondaryDefenderArrivalOne', '[]', 'Your place is with the pack... or in the dirt.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Tora/TOR_40.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[348]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3411, 'ToraReplyToSecondaryDefenderArrivalTwo', '[]', 'You''re undercutting the success of our entire organisation!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Tora/TOR_41.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[348]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3412, 'ToraReplyToSecondaryDefenderArrivalThree', '[]', 'I''ve more than enough arrows for all.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Tora/TOR_42.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[348]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3413, 'ToraReplyToSecondaryDefenderArrivalFour', '[]', 'When you''re bleeding out in the dirt, remember this was your decision.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Tora/TOR_43.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[348]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3414, 'ToraReplyToSecondaryDefenderArrivalFive', '[]', 'Really? What do you think happens to wild animals that lose a limb?', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Tora/TOR_44.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[348]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3415, 'ToraReplyToSecondaryDefenderArrivalSix', '[]', 'Small consolation, Vagan. Tiny.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Tora/TOR_45.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[348]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3416, 'ToraReplyToSecondaryDefenderArrivalSeven', '[]', 'I saw your approach, Guff - I just didn''t care.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Tora/TOR_46.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[348]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3417, 'ToraReplyToSecondaryDefenderArrivalEight', '[]', 'I will never let you catch me, brute.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Tora/TOR_47.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[348]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3418, 'ToraReplyToSecondaryDefenderArrivalNine', '[]', 'This world existed long before Man or gods and it will live on long after you are dust.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Tora/TOR_48.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[348]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3419, 'ToraReplyToSecondaryDefenderArrivalTen', '[]', 'Then let the chase begin!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Tora/TOR_49.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[348]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3420, 'ToraReplyToSecondaryDefenderArrivalEleven', '[]', 'It seems only Nature itself is trustworthy.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Tora/TOR_50.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[348]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3421, 'ToraSecondaryDefenderArrivalTwentyTwo', '[]', 'Enrage the pack, face the alpha.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Tora/TOR_51.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[348]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3422, 'ToraSecondaryDefenderArrivalTwentyThree', '[]', 'This hunt has only just begun.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Tora/TOR_52.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[348]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3423, 'ToraSecondaryDefenderArrivalTwentyFour', '[]', 'We shall surely succeed.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Tora/TOR_53.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[348]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3424, 'ToraSecondaryDefenderArrivalTwentyFive', '[]', 'Careful. A cornered animal is twice as dangerous.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Tora/TOR_54.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[348]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3425, 'ToraSecondaryDefenderArrivalTwentySix', '[]', 'Be ready to use that hook, Leo.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Tora/TOR_55.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[348]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3426, 'ToraSecondaryDefenderArrivalTwentySeven', '[]', 'Do as I say, Vagan, and I might not stick you with an arrow.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Tora/TOR_56.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[348]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3427, 'ToraSecondaryDefenderArrivalTwentyEight', '[]', 'You might not follow the rules of Nature, thing, but you''ll follow mine if you want to survive.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Tora/TOR_57.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[348]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3428, 'ToraSecondaryDefenderArrivalTwentyNine', '[]', 'Let''s try my way for this one, Thane.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Tora/TOR_58.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[348]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3429, 'ToraSecondaryDefenderArrivalThirty', '[]', 'We''ll use your traps for this hunt, Riker.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Tora/TOR_59.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[348]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3430, 'ToraSecondaryDefenderArrivalThirtyOne', '[]', 'I''m leading this hunt now.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Tora/TOR_60.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[348]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3431, 'ToraKillPlayerZero', '[]', 'The weak perish. Such is life.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Tora/TOR_61.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 8, 0, 1, '[348]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3432, 'ToraKillPlayerOne', '[]', 'You should have stayed out of this.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Tora/TOR_62.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 8, 0, 1, '[348]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3433, 'ToraKillPlayerTwo', '[]', 'The Syndicate''s death toll climbs.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Tora/TOR_63.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 8, 0, 1, '[348]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3434, 'ToraKillPlayerThree', '[]', 'A successful hunt.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Tora/TOR_64.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 8, 0, 1, '[348]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3435, 'ToraEscapeZero', '[]', 'Like I always say, only the fittest survive.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Tora/TOR_65.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 4, 0, 1, '[348]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3436, 'ToraEscapeOne', '[]', 'A hunter hides their trail.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Tora/TOR_66.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 4, 0, 1, '[348]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3437, 'ToraEscapeTwo', '[]', 'Like the bird escaping the cat, I can fly. You can''t.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Tora/TOR_67.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 4, 0, 1, '[348]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3438, 'ToraDefeatedZero', '[]', 'Nest invader!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Tora/TOR_68.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 9, 0, 1, '[348]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3439, 'ToraDefeatedOne', '[]', 'Damn your lust for wreckage.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Tora/TOR_69.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 9, 0, 1, '[348]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3440, 'ToraDefeatedTwo', '[]', 'Nature.. is wounded... here...', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Tora/TOR_70.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 9, 0, 1, '[348]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3441, 'ToraDefeatedThree', '[]', 'Only fair...', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Tora/TOR_71.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 9, 0, 1, '[348]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3442, 'ToraDefeatedFour', '[]', 'The cage beckons...', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Tora/TOR_72.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 9, 0, 1, '[348]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3443, 'ToraDefeatedFive', '[]', 'We''re not beasts... we can settle this other ways, like before.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Tora/TOR_73.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 9, 0, 1, '[348]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3444, 'ToraDefeatedSix', '[]', 'You''re making my life complicated, Exile.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Tora/TOR_74.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 9, 0, 1, '[348]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3445, 'ToraDefeatedSeven', '[]', 'The cycle of life and death is supposed to be general, not specific.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Tora/TOR_75.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 9, 0, 1, '[348]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3446, 'ToraDefeatedEight', '[]', 'It seems... you''ve evolved...', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Tora/TOR_76.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 9, 0, 1, '[348]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3447, 'ToraDefeatedNine', '[]', 'I was too slow...', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Tora/TOR_77.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 9, 0, 1, '[348]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3448, 'ToraDefeatedTen', '[]', 'I pounced too recklessly.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Tora/TOR_78.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 9, 0, 1, '[348]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3449, 'ToraOfferBargainZero', '[]', 'You are more savage than any animal. What do you want from me?', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Tora/TOR_79.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[348]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3450, 'ToraOfferBargainOne', '[]', 'Some beasts congregate for a mate. Some for food or warmth. Knowing how a relationship can better your quality of life is important out here. The relationship doesn''t necessarily even have to be your own. Do you understand what I''m getting at?', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Tora/TOR_80.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[348]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3451, 'ToraOfferBargainTwo', '[]', 'Crows are very interesting, Exile. Did you know that crows can not only build personal relationships with each other, but learn, retain and teach information to each other? Quite a useful skill, if I may say so...', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Tora/TOR_81.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[348]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3452, 'ToraOfferBargainThree', '[]', 'A species'' survival is only truly tested when its environment changes. If you want to kill me, then kill me. If you want to test me, well... I have an idea.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Tora/TOR_82.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[348]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3453, 'ToraOfferBargainFour', '[]', 'You''ve seen what the Syndicate is doing, have you not? ''Unnatural'' is the only way I feel it could accurately be described. I''m not about that life. Not now, anyway. I think it''s about time I migrated elsewhere.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Tora/TOR_83.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[348]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3454, 'ToraOfferBargainFive', '[]', 'A huntress who doesn''t know her environment is a dead huntress. I didn''t plan on dying today, so how about I tell you what I''ve learned here instead?', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Tora/TOR_84.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[348]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3455, 'ToraOfferBargainSix', '[]', 'I don''t care for material things, but perhaps you do?', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Tora/TOR_85.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[348]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3456, 'ToraBargainAcceptedZero', '[]', 'Ugh... people! Alright, alright...', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Tora/TOR_86.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[348]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3457, 'ToraBargainAcceptedOne', '[]', 'Here''s to practicing social skills.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Tora/TOR_87.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[348]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3458, 'ToraBargainAcceptedTwo', '[]', 'Adapt or die, Exile. Adapt or die.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Tora/TOR_88.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[348]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3459, 'ToraBargainAcceptedThree', '[]', 'They''ll never find me.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Tora/TOR_89.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[348]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3460, 'ToraBargainAcceptedFour', '[]', 'I appreciate it.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Tora/TOR_90.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[348]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3461, 'ToraBargainAcceptedFive', '[]', 'May your nest be shiny.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Tora/TOR_91.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[348]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3462, 'ToraOfferBetrayalZero', '[]', 'A wolf pack without its alpha is far less of a threat than one with a ferocious leader. Together, we can topple the alpha here, and put me in charge.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Tora/TOR_92.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[348]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3463, 'ToraOfferBetrayalOne', '[]', 'The strong eat the weak in nature, and so it can be here.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Tora/TOR_93.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[348]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3464, 'ToraOfferBetrayalTwo', '[]', 'I do have the capability to have someone rejected by the pack completely.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Tora/TOR_94.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[348]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3465, 'ToraOfferBetrayalThree', '[]', 'I''ll tell you all I know as long as I don''t have to go through the cold and dark torture that is resurrection by the Lifegiver.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Tora/TOR_95.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[348]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3466, 'ToraOfferBetrayalFour', '[]', 'Haku''s too trusting to be in the Syndicate. Allow me to betray him softly before someone else does far worse.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Tora/TOR_96.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[348]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3467, 'ToraOfferBetrayalFive', '[]', 'I''ve half a mind to turn against Vagan. He knows what he did.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Tora/TOR_97.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[348]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3468, 'ToraOfferBetrayalSix', '[]', 'Vorici unsettles me. His inclinations fall far outside the natural order. You and I could come to an agreement that might contain his violent excesses.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Tora/TOR_98.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[348]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3469, 'ToraOfferBetrayalSeven', '[]', 'That brute Hillock needs a few more arrows in his hide. If you''ve got any conscientious bone in your body, you''ll understand that someone who does what he does to women - and men, too - is not someone to have as an ally.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Tora/TOR_99.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[348]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3470, 'ToraOfferBetrayalEight', '[]', 'Cameria is more violent, more base than any beast I''ve come across. He does not kill for survival, he kills for pleasure. And he doesn''t stop getting his jollies once his victims are dead. If you have any sense of justice within you, please, help me handle him.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Tora/TOR_100.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[348]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3471, 'ToraOfferBetrayalNine', '[]', 'It''s survival of the fittest, especially in the Syndicate. And I don''t mean physical strength - this is a deadly game of cats and mice that covers all of Wraeclast. Are you a cat, or are you a mouse?', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Tora/TOR_101.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[348]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3472, 'ToraOfferExecuteZero', '[]', 'Death is a natural part of life. I''ve made my peace.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Tora/TOR_102.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[348]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3473, 'ToraOfferExecuteOne', '[]', 'In front of my leader, I can show no fear.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Tora/TOR_103.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[348]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3474, 'ToraOfferExecuteTwo', '[]', 'In front of my brethren, I can only be brave.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Tora/TOR_104.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[348]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3475, 'ToraOfferExecuteThree', '[]', 'No more cages! I''d rather die.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Tora/TOR_105.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[348]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3476, 'ToraReplyToBetrayalAcceptedZero', '[]', 'Animals turn on each other in times of scarcity.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Tora/TOR_106.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[348]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3477, 'ToraReplyToBetrayalAcceptedOne', '[]', 'At least my path is real, Karui, unlike your unseen ''Way.''', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Tora/TOR_107.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[348]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3478, 'ToraReplyToBetrayalAcceptedTwo', '[]', 'And what''s that, Guff? Are you planning to ask me on a date?', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Tora/TOR_108.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[348]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3479, 'ToraReplyToBetrayalAcceptedThree', '[]', 'Survival of the fittest versus might makes right - which of us shall eclipse the other in the end, Thane?', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Tora/TOR_109.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[348]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3480, 'ToraReplyToBetrayalAcceptedFour', '[]', 'I have a better idea, Cameria. How about you leave and never return?', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Tora/TOR_110.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[348]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3481, 'ToraReplyToBetrayalAcceptedFive', '[]', 'You are proof, Aisling, that sometimes Nature makes mistakes.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Tora/TOR_111.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[348]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3482, 'ToraReplyToBetrayalAcceptedSix', '[]', 'All part of the cycle. Today you rise and I fall, but tomorrow will be different.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Tora/TOR_112.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[348]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3483, 'ToraInterrogatedZero', '[]', 'Feel confident in your caging only if you believe the caged will never escape and come find you...', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Tora/TOR_113.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[348]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3484, 'ToraInterrogatedOne', '[]', 'You are truly a savage beast.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Tora/TOR_114.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[348]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3485, 'ToraInterrogatedTwo', '[]', 'When bargaining is no longer enough, you show your true colours!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Tora/TOR_115.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[348]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3486, 'ToraReplyToExecutionZero', '[]', 'Violence is part of the natural order.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Tora/TOR_116.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[348]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3487, 'ToraReplyToExecutionOne', '[]', 'You''ve accomplished nothing, Exile. Death is meaningless to the Syndicate.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Tora/TOR_117.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[348]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3488, 'ToraReplyToExecutionTwo', '[]', 'Sometimes violence is the only way.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Tora/TOR_118.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[348]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3489, 'ToraSafehouseLeaderDefeatedZero', '[]', 'Rise. If I must fall, respect the natural order by rising to your potential.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Tora/TOR_119.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 10, 0, 1, '[348]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3490, 'ToraPrimaryDefenderStartsFightFifteen', '[]', 'Deadly and swift, like a wild and beautiful animal.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/JunOrtoi/JO2_48.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[343]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3491, 'ToraEscapeThree', '[]', 'I''m sorry, Exile, I got distracted...', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/JunOrtoi/JO2_75.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 4, 0, 1, '[343]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3492, 'ToraDefeatedEleven', '[]', 'You forced us down this path, Tora.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/JunOrtoi/JO2_66.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 9, 0, 1, '[343]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3493, 'ToraBargainAcceptedSix', '[]', 'I''m glad we could come to an understanding.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/JunOrtoi/JO2_86.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[343]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3494, 'ToraInterrogatedThree', '[]', 'This one will be difficult to tame.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/JunOrtoi/JO2_103.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[343]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3495, 'ToraSecondaryDefenderArrivalThirtyTwo', '[]', 'Tora, this is not natural! Don''t you see?', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/JunOrtoi/JO_60.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[343]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3496, 'ToraSecondaryDefenderArrivalThirtyThree', '[]', 'Have you chosen to follow your own path once more, Tora?', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/JunOrtoi/JO2_118.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[343]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3497, 'ToraReplyToSecondaryDefenderArrivalTwelve', '[]', 'Tora, why are you working with them and not us?', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/JunOrtoi/JO2_135.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[343]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3498, 'ToraReplyToSecondaryDefenderArrivalThirteen', '[]', 'How can you take orders from them, Tora?', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/JunOrtoi/JO2_152.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[343]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3499, 'ToraSecondaryDefenderArrivalThirtyFour', '[]', 'Tora, our conflict is not with you!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/JunOrtoi/JO2_170.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[343]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100);
INSERT INTO "NPCTextAudio" ("_row", "Id", "Characters", "Text", "Mono_AudioFile", "Stereo_AudioFile", "HasStereo", "__col6", "Video", "__col8", "__col9", "__col10", "NPCs", "NPCPortrait", "__col13", "__col14", "Cooldown", "__col16") VALUES
(3500, 'VoriciPrimaryDefenderStartsFightZero', '[]', 'Another malcontent with a death wish... so be it.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Vorici/VOR_1.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[350]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3501, 'VoriciPrimaryDefenderStartsFightOne', '[]', 'It seems you possess bravery and foolishness in equal abundance.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Vorici/VOR_2.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[350]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3502, 'VoriciPrimaryDefenderStartsFightTwo', '[]', 'You are becoming a nuisance.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Vorici/VOR_3.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[350]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3503, 'VoriciPrimaryDefenderStartsFightThree', '[]', 'You''re early! No matter... loose threads must be severed.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Vorici/VOR_4.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[350]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3504, 'VoriciPrimaryDefenderStartsFightFour', '[]', 'We do not tolerate selfish malcontents.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Vorici/VOR_5.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[350]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3505, 'VoriciPrimaryDefenderStartsFightFive', '[]', 'Don''t worry, Exile, I won''t submit you to the same humiliation of imprisonment. A quick death will do.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Vorici/VOR_6.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[350]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3506, 'VoriciPrimaryDefenderStartsFightSix', '[]', 'Did you forget our deal so quickly, Exile? How disappointing.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Vorici/VOR_7.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[350]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3507, 'VoriciPrimaryDefenderStartsFightSeven', '[]', 'My conscience is still bloodied, malcontent. Soon my weapons will match.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Vorici/VOR_8.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[350]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3508, 'VoriciPrimaryDefenderStartsFightEight', '[]', 'I have experienced enough death. I believe I''d rather stay here.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Vorici/VOR_9.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[350]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3509, 'VoriciPrimaryDefenderStartsFightNine', '[]', 'I knew you were a fool, but you continue to disappoint.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Vorici/VOR_10.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[350]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3510, 'VoriciPrimaryDefenderStartsFightTen', '[]', 'I will answer the pain you inflicted tenfold!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Vorici/VOR_11.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[350]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3511, 'VoriciPrimaryDefenderStartsFightEleven', '[]', 'I see energy swimming within you. I will cut it free.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Vorici/VOR_12.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[350]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3512, 'VoriciPrimaryDefenderStartsFightTwelve', '[]', 'I''ve returned from the void. I brought a piece back with me.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Vorici/VOR_13.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[350]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3513, 'VoriciPrimaryDefenderStartsFightThirteen', '[]', 'I live once more. Does madness yet grip your mind?', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Vorici/VOR_14.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[350]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3514, 'VoriciPrimaryDefenderStartsFightFourteen', '[]', 'The stench of death... you''ll reek of it soon enough.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Vorici/VOR_15.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[350]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3515, 'VoriciSafehouseLeaderIntroZero', '[]', 'You have become tangled in our tapestry, Exile. Time to cut you free.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Vorici/VOR_16.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[350]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3516, 'VoriciSecondaryDefenderArrivalZero', '[]', 'You can''t weave a tapestry with just one thread.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Vorici/VOR_17.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[350]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3517, 'VoriciSecondaryDefenderArrivalOne', '[]', 'We can''t let our cargo fall into the hands of a malcontent.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Vorici/VOR_18.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[350]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3518, 'VoriciSecondaryDefenderArrivalTwo', '[]', 'No loose threads.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Vorici/VOR_19.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[350]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3519, 'VoriciSecondaryDefenderArrivalThree', '[]', 'Let''s keep this professional. Quick and clean.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Vorici/VOR_20.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[350]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3520, 'VoriciSecondaryDefenderArrivalFour', '[]', 'Need to keep the skills sharp. It''s nothing personal.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Vorici/VOR_21.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[350]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3521, 'VoriciSecondaryDefenderArrivalFive', '[]', 'Show me the might of those Ancestors you won''t shut up about.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Vorici/VOR_22.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[350]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3522, 'VoriciSecondaryDefenderArrivalSix', '[]', 'You might be uncouth and unclean, Tora, but I like the way you hunt.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Vorici/VOR_23.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[350]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3523, 'VoriciSecondaryDefenderArrivalSeven', '[]', 'Vagan, show some civility. Kill them quickly.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Vorici/VOR_24.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[350]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3524, 'VoriciSecondaryDefenderArrivalEight', '[]', 'I''ve half a mind to slay you myself, Gravicius - but not today.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Vorici/VOR_25.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[350]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3525, 'VoriciSecondaryDefenderArrivalNine', '[]', 'Show me what you''re capable of, Aisling.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Vorici/VOR_26.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[350]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3526, 'VoriciSecondaryDefenderArrivalTen', '[]', 'Let''s kill this selfish malcontent.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Vorici/VOR_27.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[350]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3527, 'VoriciSecondaryDefenderArrivalEleven', '[]', 'Did you think it would be that simple, Exile?', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Vorici/VOR_28.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[350]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3528, 'VoriciSecondaryDefenderArrivalTwelve', '[]', 'All my loose threads boxed in. How convenient.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Vorici/VOR_29.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[350]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3529, 'VoriciSecondaryDefenderArrivalThirteen', '[]', 'Bad apples must be plucked and disposed of.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Vorici/VOR_30.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[350]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3530, 'VoriciSecondaryDefenderArrivalFourteen', '[]', 'My, my, what a mess this is. You know I hate a mess.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Vorici/VOR_31.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[350]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3531, 'VoriciSecondaryDefenderArrivalFifteen', '[]', 'No. Loose. Threads.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Vorici/VOR_32.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[350]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3532, 'VoriciSecondaryDefenderArrivalSixteen', '[]', 'If it''s any consolation, Leo, I don''t expect you to die without a fight.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Vorici/VOR_33.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[350]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3533, 'VoriciSecondaryDefenderArrivalSeventeen', '[]', 'Your faith-blind eyes have deceived you, old man. Don''t worry, I''ll pluck them out for you.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Vorici/VOR_34.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[350]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3534, 'VoriciSecondaryDefenderArrivalEighteen', '[]', 'Consider this the Brotherhood collecting on an old debt, Perandus.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Vorici/VOR_35.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[350]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3535, 'VoriciSecondaryDefenderArrivalNineteen', '[]', 'Please beg for your life, Gravicius, so that I can have the pleasure of refusing you.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Vorici/VOR_36.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[350]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3536, 'VoriciSecondaryDefenderArrivalTwenty', '[]', 'You make a mockery of man''s finest moment, Aisling. The dead deserve respect.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Vorici/VOR_37.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[350]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3537, 'VoriciSecondaryDefenderArrivalTwentyOne', '[]', 'How fortunate, all my loose threads in one place!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Vorici/VOR_38.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[350]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3538, 'VoriciReplyToSecondaryDefenderArrivalZero', '[]', 'You selfish malcontent.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Vorici/VOR_39.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[350]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3539, 'VoriciReplyToSecondaryDefenderArrivalOne', '[]', 'You''re late. You know how I hate tardiness.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Vorici/VOR_40.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[350]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3540, 'VoriciReplyToSecondaryDefenderArrivalTwo', '[]', 'Another loose thread needing to be snipped.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Vorici/VOR_41.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[350]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3541, 'VoriciReplyToSecondaryDefenderArrivalThree', '[]', 'You were next on my list anyway.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Vorici/VOR_42.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[350]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3542, 'VoriciReplyToSecondaryDefenderArrivalFour', '[]', 'Fair? I''d have to give you one of my arms for this to be fair.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Vorici/VOR_43.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[350]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3543, 'VoriciReplyToSecondaryDefenderArrivalFive', '[]', 'I think I''ll pass.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Vorici/VOR_44.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[350]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3544, 'VoriciReplyToSecondaryDefenderArrivalSix', '[]', 'What''s more natural than the cycle of life and death? I''m just helping things along.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Vorici/VOR_45.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[350]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3545, 'VoriciReplyToSecondaryDefenderArrivalSeven', '[]', 'I told you to stop calling me that. Now I''ll make you stop.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Vorici/VOR_46.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[350]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3546, 'VoriciReplyToSecondaryDefenderArrivalEight', '[]', 'Oh, death''s not my weapon, General. It''s my closest ally. Allow me to introduce you!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Vorici/VOR_47.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[350]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3547, 'VoriciReplyToSecondaryDefenderArrivalNine', '[]', 'You''ll find me a most disagreeable mark.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Vorici/VOR_48.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[350]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3548, 'VoriciSecondaryDefenderArrivalTwentyTwo', '[]', 'What beautiful violence we will weave together.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Vorici/VOR_49.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[350]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3549, 'VoriciSecondaryDefenderArrivalTwentyThree', '[]', 'Come, noble ally. Let us cut this misfit down together.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Vorici/VOR_50.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[350]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3550, 'VoriciSecondaryDefenderArrivalTwentyFour', '[]', 'A partner of such enlightenment. How pleasant.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Vorici/VOR_51.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[350]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3551, 'VoriciSecondaryDefenderArrivalTwentyFive', '[]', 'Elegance and sophistication. Try to enjoy this, Exile.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Vorici/VOR_52.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[350]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3552, 'VoriciSecondaryDefenderArrivalTwentySix', '[]', 'Crusade all you like, Elreon, just follow my orders.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Vorici/VOR_53.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[350]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3553, 'VoriciSecondaryDefenderArrivalTwentySeven', '[]', 'I think I can rely on you to do some cutting, yes?', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Vorici/VOR_54.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[350]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3554, 'VoriciSecondaryDefenderArrivalTwentyEight', '[]', 'This time you''re working for an assassin. I do love irony.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Vorici/VOR_55.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[350]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3555, 'VoriciSecondaryDefenderArrivalTwentyNine', '[]', 'Your orders are simple, Cameria. Kill them all.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Vorici/VOR_56.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[350]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3556, 'VoriciSecondaryDefenderArrivalThirty', '[]', 'This situation needs a bit less cutting and a bit more intellect.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Vorici/VOR_57.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[350]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3557, 'VoriciSecondaryDefenderArrivalThirtyOne', '[]', 'Looks like this situation''s in need of some cutting intellect.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Vorici/VOR_58.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[350]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3558, 'VoriciKillPlayerZero', '[]', 'A nice, clean kill.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Vorici/VOR_59.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 8, 0, 1, '[350]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3559, 'VoriciKillPlayerOne', '[]', 'I do like a tidy ending.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Vorici/VOR_60.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 8, 0, 1, '[350]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3560, 'VoriciKillPlayerTwo', '[]', 'Secrets remain secret.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Vorici/VOR_61.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 8, 0, 1, '[350]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3561, 'VoriciKillPlayerThree', '[]', 'A shame. I rather liked that villain.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Vorici/VOR_62.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 8, 0, 1, '[350]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3562, 'VoriciEscapeZero', '[]', 'Consider this a warning, Exile.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Vorici/VOR_63.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 4, 0, 1, '[350]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3563, 'VoriciEscapeOne', '[]', 'We inch closer to utopia.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Vorici/VOR_64.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 4, 0, 1, '[350]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3564, 'VoriciEscapeTwo', '[]', 'A necessary loss.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Vorici/VOR_65.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 4, 0, 1, '[350]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3565, 'VoriciDefeatedZero', '[]', 'Defeated... within my own walls.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Vorici/VOR_66.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 9, 0, 1, '[350]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3566, 'VoriciDefeatedOne', '[]', 'A costly error.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Vorici/VOR_67.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 9, 0, 1, '[350]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3567, 'VoriciDefeatedTwo', '[]', 'How uncivilised...', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Vorici/VOR_68.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 9, 0, 1, '[350]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3568, 'VoriciDefeatedThree', '[]', 'Deeply disappointing.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Vorici/VOR_69.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 9, 0, 1, '[350]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3569, 'VoriciDefeatedFour', '[]', 'Perhaps my time in confinement had a larger impact than I anticipated.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Vorici/VOR_70.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 9, 0, 1, '[350]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3570, 'VoriciDefeatedFive', '[]', 'I... want another moment of your time...', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Vorici/VOR_71.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 9, 0, 1, '[350]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3571, 'VoriciDefeatedSix', '[]', 'I was a fool to work with you.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Vorici/VOR_72.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 9, 0, 1, '[350]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3572, 'VoriciDefeatedSeven', '[]', 'I faced death before... what''s once more?', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Vorici/VOR_73.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 9, 0, 1, '[350]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3573, 'VoriciDefeatedEight', '[]', 'You! You have improved!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Vorici/VOR_74.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 9, 0, 1, '[350]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3574, 'VoriciDefeatedNine', '[]', 'How inelegant...', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Vorici/VOR_75.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 9, 0, 1, '[350]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3575, 'VoriciDefeatedTen', '[]', 'Foiled by my own selfishness. Humiliating.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Vorici/VOR_76.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 9, 0, 1, '[350]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3576, 'VoriciOfferBargainZero', '[]', 'Even an ignoramus like yourself can see you have the upper hand. What do you want?', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Vorici/VOR_77.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[350]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3577, 'VoriciOfferBargainOne', '[]', 'If you kill me, another will take my place, and you will have made a target of yourself. The sensible action would be to sow the seeds of loyalty within the Syndicate. Whisper a name, and they will soon find themselves at my side.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Vorici/VOR_78.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[350]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3578, 'VoriciOfferBargainTwo', '[]', 'Killing me will bring you no closer to your precious artefacts. Not even I know where they have been secreted, but I may know who does, and I know how to ingratiate myself with them. All you have to do is free me.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Vorici/VOR_79.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[350]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3579, 'VoriciOfferBargainThree', '[]', 'It seems to me that no job is worth dying over, least of all this one. I propose that I leave here - alive - and find a task more suitable to my disposition. Of course, this would involve an exchange. What say you?', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Vorici/VOR_80.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[350]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3580, 'VoriciOfferBargainFour', '[]', 'I can see that you are more than capable of claiming my head. Don''t. I will see myself out of here - and out of the Syndicate - and I will not return.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Vorici/VOR_81.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[350]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3581, 'VoriciOfferBargainFive', '[]', 'Wars are not won on the battlefront, Exile. They''re won in the dimly lit rooms, over maps and dossiers. I hold information you may find valuable. Allow me to leave here alive, and that information is yours.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Vorici/VOR_82.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[350]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3582, 'VoriciOfferBargainSix', '[]', 'The Syndicate is not just a cluster of like-minded individuals. We have a very wealthy benefactor, who would be very sad to see me dead, but would most certainly look the other way if I were to offer you recompense.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Vorici/VOR_83.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[350]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3583, 'VoriciBargainAcceptedZero', '[]', 'I knew you were sharp. Consider it done.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Vorici/VOR_84.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[350]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3584, 'VoriciBargainAcceptedOne', '[]', 'So be it. But if word of our deal makes it to other ears, I will cut out your tongue.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Vorici/VOR_85.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[350]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3585, 'VoriciBargainAcceptedTwo', '[]', 'A wise decision. I do hope we cross paths again.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Vorici/VOR_86.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[350]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3586, 'VoriciBargainAcceptedThree', '[]', 'Then I am gone. With any luck, I will not be drawn into this mess again.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Vorici/VOR_87.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[350]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3587, 'VoriciBargainAcceptedFour', '[]', 'The tapestry we weave is complex indeed. What will you do with this information, I wonder...', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Vorici/VOR_88.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[350]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3588, 'VoriciBargainAcceptedFive', '[]', 'There could be no simpler exchange.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Vorici/VOR_89.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[350]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3589, 'VoriciOfferBetrayalZero', '[]', 'My immediate superior has many secrets, Exile. Secrets that would turn your stomach. Were I to reveal these secrets to the rest of the Syndicate I have no doubt that my ''esteemed'' leader here would be relegated to a much more menial position, and you would be forced to endure far less of their company. We are killers, but not all of us are monsters.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Vorici/VOR_90.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[350]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3590, 'VoriciOfferBetrayalOne', '[]', 'It seems clear to me that our failure is due to the machinations of other Syndicate members, and were you to let me go, I would make that crystal-clear. The others here will be punished for their part and I will be rewarded. The Syndicate does not value loyalty, they value results, and today, they didn''t get results.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Vorici/VOR_91.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[350]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3591, 'VoriciOfferBetrayalTwo', '[]', 'If it''s blood you want, I propose an exchange. Release me, and I will take the life of another. I hold no true loyalty to my Syndicate brethren. Is my blood any more valuable than that of another Syndicate member?', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Vorici/VOR_92.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[350]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3592, 'VoriciOfferBetrayalThree', '[]', 'You are after the crown. The Eternal One. The Lifegiver. I see the tapestry for what it is. Only information will bring you closer. Information I possess, taken from the mouths of the others here today. How much is this information worth to you, Exile?', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Vorici/VOR_93.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[350]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3593, 'VoriciOfferBetrayalFour', '[]', 'Faith, or perhaps age, has rotted away Elreon''s mind. The things he whispers in his sleep... they make me look positively devout.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Vorici/VOR_94.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[350]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3594, 'VoriciOfferBetrayalFive', '[]', 'I don''t think I need remind you what young Janus here has done. I think you''ll find a fitting punishment.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Vorici/VOR_95.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[350]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3595, 'VoriciOfferBetrayalSix', '[]', 'Few men deserve betrayal more than Gravicius. I am not one of them.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Vorici/VOR_96.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[350]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3596, 'VoriciOfferBetrayalSeven', '[]', 'Thane Jorgin was cast out of his homeland after the ''mysterious'' death of his brother. The implication is clear.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Vorici/VOR_97.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[350]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3597, 'VoriciOfferBetrayalEight', '[]', 'I''m an assassin, yes, but Aisling is something far worse.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Vorici/VOR_98.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[350]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3598, 'VoriciOfferBetrayalNine', '[]', 'Let''s make a deal.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Vorici/VOR_99.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[350]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3599, 'VoriciOfferExecuteZero', '[]', 'If you think I am going to say or do anything to further your pathetic cause, you are sorely mistaken.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Vorici/VOR_100.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[350]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3600, 'VoriciOfferExecuteOne', '[]', 'I''d sooner die than forsake my loyalty to the Syndicate.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Vorici/VOR_101.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[350]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3601, 'VoriciOfferExecuteTwo', '[]', 'I know what you want from me, malcontent. But as long as Syndicate eyes are cast upon us, I will give you nothing.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Vorici/VOR_102.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[350]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3602, 'VoriciOfferExecuteThree', '[]', 'I would rather rot on the ground here than in some filthy, uncivilised prison cell.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Vorici/VOR_103.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[350]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3603, 'VoriciReplyToBetrayalAcceptedZero', '[]', 'Well that is disappointing.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Vorici/VOR_104.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[350]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3604, 'VoriciReplyToBetrayalAcceptedOne', '[]', 'I''ve been nothing but a perfect gentleman, huntress - to your face, at least.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Vorici/VOR_105.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[350]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3605, 'VoriciReplyToBetrayalAcceptedTwo', '[]', 'We should have cut you loose long ago, Vagan.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Vorici/VOR_106.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[350]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3606, 'VoriciReplyToBetrayalAcceptedThree', '[]', 'Once a turncoat, always a turncoat.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Vorici/VOR_107.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[350]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3607, 'VoriciReplyToBetrayalAcceptedFour', '[]', 'For this, General, I will pluck you free of the tapestry myself.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Vorici/VOR_108.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[350]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3608, 'VoriciReplyToBetrayalAcceptedFive', '[]', 'It was not I who killed your brother, Thane. But I think you know that full well.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Vorici/VOR_109.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[350]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3609, 'VoriciReplyToBetrayalAcceptedSix', '[]', 'My retribution will be swift, invisible, and painful.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Vorici/VOR_110.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[350]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3610, 'VoriciInterrogatedZero', '[]', 'You will have to cut the words from my mouth.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Vorici/VOR_111.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[350]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3611, 'VoriciInterrogatedOne', '[]', 'Cruel. Truly cruel.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Vorici/VOR_112.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[350]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3612, 'VoriciInterrogatedTwo', '[]', 'What? I thought you were reasonable.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Vorici/VOR_113.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[350]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3613, 'VoriciReplyToExecutionZero', '[]', 'What a waste.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Vorici/VOR_114.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[350]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3614, 'VoriciReplyToExecutionOne', '[]', 'At least it was quick.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Vorici/VOR_115.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[350]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3615, 'VoriciReplyToExecutionTwo', '[]', 'I will savour that image.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Vorici/VOR_116.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[350]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3616, 'VoriciSafehouseLeaderDefeatedZero', '[]', 'You... only delay our inexorable rise.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Vorici/VOR_117.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 10, 0, 1, '[350]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3617, 'VoriciPrimaryDefenderStartsFightFifteen', '[]', 'You picked the wrong job, assassin.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/JunOrtoi/JO2_38.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[343]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3618, 'VoriciReplyToExecutionThree', '[]', 'What''s wrong Vorici? This is what you do.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/JunOrtoi/JO2_113.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[343]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3619, 'VoriciDefeatedEleven', '[]', 'Too easy, assassin.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/JunOrtoi/JO2_57.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 9, 0, 1, '[343]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3620, 'VoriciDefeatedTwelve', '[]', 'You''ve lost. Time to speak, silent brother.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/JunOrtoi/JO2_108.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 9, 0, 1, '[343]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3621, 'VoriciInterrogatedThree', '[]', 'You should have no trouble in that dark little cage, assassin.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/JunOrtoi/JO2_95.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[343]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3622, 'VoriciSecondaryDefenderArrivalThirtyTwo', '[]', 'Dishonourable, I''d expect nothing less from you Vorici.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/JunOrtoi/JO_62.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[343]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3623, 'VoriciSecondaryDefenderArrivalThirtyThree', '[]', 'You''re so skilled at murder, assassin. Why limit yourself?', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/JunOrtoi/JO2_120.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[343]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3624, 'VoriciReplyToSecondaryDefenderArrivalTen', '[]', 'An assassin betrayed by his masters. Inevitable.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/JunOrtoi/JO2_137.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[343]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3625, 'VoriciReplyToSecondaryDefenderArrivalEleven', '[]', 'What kind of cowardice is this, assassin?', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/JunOrtoi/JO2_154.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[343]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3626, 'VoriciReplyToSecondaryDefenderArrivalTwelve', '[]', 'Eyes sharp! Assassin on the scene!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/JunOrtoi/JO2_171.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[343]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3627, 'GuffPrimaryDefenderStartsFightZero', '[]', 'Now you face the biggest and baddest Brinerot basterd of ''em all!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Guff/GUF_1.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[353]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3628, 'GuffPrimaryDefenderStartsFightOne', '[]', 'Oi! You! Out! Now!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Guff/GUF_2.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[353]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3629, 'GuffPrimaryDefenderStartsFightTwo', '[]', 'Get ye gone from ''ere, nyaff!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Guff/GUF_3.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[353]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3630, 'GuffPrimaryDefenderStartsFightThree', '[]', 'Ol'' Guff ''ll hold the basterds off.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Guff/GUF_4.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[353]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3631, 'GuffPrimaryDefenderStartsFightFour', '[]', 'No disrespect, but ye gotta die now. Captain''s orders.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Guff/GUF_5.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[353]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3632, 'GuffPrimaryDefenderStartsFightFive', '[]', 'Yer not gonna send me back to the dark, not on my life.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Guff/GUF_6.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[353]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3633, 'GuffPrimaryDefenderStartsFightSix', '[]', 'Just crack that I got the best of ya? Too bad.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Guff/GUF_7.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[353]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3634, 'GuffPrimaryDefenderStartsFightSeven', '[]', 'I got a fair whippin'' for what you made me do last time. And for that, Exile, I aim to misbehave.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Guff/GUF_8.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[353]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3635, 'GuffPrimaryDefenderStartsFightEight', '[]', 'I mighta died, but oy, did I get a consolation prize. Get ready!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Guff/GUF_9.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[353]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3636, 'GuffPrimaryDefenderStartsFightNine', '[]', 'I walloped ya, and ya come back fer more? A glutton for punishment!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Guff/GUF_10.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[353]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3637, 'GuffPrimaryDefenderStartsFightTen', '[]', 'I''m unstoppable!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Guff/GUF_11.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[353]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3638, 'GuffPrimaryDefenderStartsFightEleven', '[]', 'Gonna cram my shield up your backside!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Guff/GUF_12.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[353]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3639, 'GuffPrimaryDefenderStartsFightTwelve', '[]', 'Just try an'' face Guff Grenn''s gorgon gaze!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Guff/GUF_13.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[353]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3640, 'GuffPrimaryDefenderStartsFightThirteen', '[]', 'I''m gonna go HILLOCK all over ya!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Guff/GUF_14.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[353]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3641, 'GuffPrimaryDefenderStartsFightFourteen', '[]', 'We Brinerots were born in the storm.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Guff/GUF_15.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[353]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3642, 'GuffSafehouseLeaderIntroZero', '[]', 'Can''t let you go any further, nyaff. Not while I''m captaining the place.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Guff/GUF_16.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[353]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3643, 'GuffSecondaryDefenderArrivalZero', '[]', 'This is gonna be just like that scrap in Pondium, I can already feel it.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Guff/GUF_17.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[353]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3644, 'GuffSecondaryDefenderArrivalOne', '[]', 'This cargo''s moving like a... drunk sloth! I''m jumpin'' in!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Guff/GUF_18.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[353]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3645, 'GuffSecondaryDefenderArrivalTwo', '[]', 'Ooze the raggabrash ''at ran this place?! Cleaning it up''ll take forever!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Guff/GUF_19.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[353]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3646, 'GuffSecondaryDefenderArrivalThree', '[]', 'Move over, ya doaty fopdoodle. Guff''ll take care of this!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Guff/GUF_20.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[353]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3647, 'GuffSecondaryDefenderArrivalFour', '[]', 'I''m bored, and pirates don''t do well with boredom. Let''s scrap!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Guff/GUF_21.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[353]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3648, 'GuffSecondaryDefenderArrivalFive', '[]', 'Guff''ll throw in with ya, gaffer.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Guff/GUF_22.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[353]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3649, 'GuffSecondaryDefenderArrivalSix', '[]', 'Need a hand? Of course ya do.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Guff/GUF_23.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[353]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3650, 'GuffSecondaryDefenderArrivalSeven', '[]', 'Alright! Let''s break some bones, ya freaky git.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Guff/GUF_24.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[353]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3651, 'GuffSecondaryDefenderArrivalEight', '[]', 'Course ye need me help ya meatheaded wanker.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Guff/GUF_25.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[353]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3652, 'GuffSecondaryDefenderArrivalNine', '[]', 'Oh, ya need a big boy''s help don''t ya, lassie?', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Guff/GUF_26.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[353]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3653, 'GuffSecondaryDefenderArrivalTen', '[]', 'Oi oi! Well, your captain has arrived.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Guff/GUF_27.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[353]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3654, 'GuffSecondaryDefenderArrivalEleven', '[]', 'So your big spooky mask didn''t scare ''em off Riker? What a bloody surprise.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Guff/GUF_28.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[353]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3655, 'GuffSecondaryDefenderArrivalTwelve', '[]', 'Gotta throw a wrench in the works here. Sorry. I got aims.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Guff/GUF_29.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[353]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3656, 'GuffSecondaryDefenderArrivalThirteen', '[]', 'I told ye this day would come, ya warthog-faced buffoon! Oh, hello, Exile.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Guff/GUF_30.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[353]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3657, 'GuffSecondaryDefenderArrivalFourteen', '[]', 'Someone is getting a beating, believe me!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Guff/GUF_31.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[353]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3658, 'GuffSecondaryDefenderArrivalFifteen', '[]', 'Add one blustering bloodthirsty Brinerot to the mix!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Guff/GUF_32.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[353]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3659, 'GuffSecondaryDefenderArrivalSixteen', '[]', 'All that time spent surveying the land, Tora, and the real threat was comin'' from the seas!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Guff/GUF_33.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[353]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3660, 'GuffSecondaryDefenderArrivalSeventeen', '[]', 'Ah, I could never be mad at ya Janus. This is nothing personal.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Guff/GUF_34.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[353]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3661, 'GuffSecondaryDefenderArrivalEighteen', '[]', 'Ogham ain''t gonna miss ya, Thane, and neither will I.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Guff/GUF_35.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[353]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3662, 'GuffSecondaryDefenderArrivalNineteen', '[]', 'Say yer prayers, ya sulfur-smellin'' sack o'' shite.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Guff/GUF_36.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[353]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3663, 'GuffSecondaryDefenderArrivalTwenty', '[]', 'Ya didn''t see this one comin'', did ya, ya hoity-toity trollop?', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Guff/GUF_37.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[353]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3664, 'GuffSecondaryDefenderArrivalTwentyOne', '[]', 'Guff here is makin'' a play, so have at ya!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Guff/GUF_38.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[353]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3665, 'GuffReplyToSecondaryDefenderArrivalZero', '[]', 'Oh, Exile, this one''s bum''s out the window. They''re right crazy.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Guff/GUF_39.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[353]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3666, 'GuffReplyToSecondaryDefenderArrivalOne', '[]', 'Piss off and boil yer head!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Guff/GUF_40.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[353]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3667, 'GuffReplyToSecondaryDefenderArrivalTwo', '[]', 'The Syndicate needs this done, and you''re gonna foozle the whole affair!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Guff/GUF_41.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[353]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3668, 'GuffReplyToSecondaryDefenderArrivalThree', '[]', 'Ah, well, ya know what they say: a numpty a day keeps victory away.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Guff/GUF_42.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[353]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3669, 'GuffReplyToSecondaryDefenderArrivalFour', '[]', 'Ahem. Vagan.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Guff/GUF_43.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[353]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3670, 'GuffReplyToSecondaryDefenderArrivalFive', '[]', 'Then you''re about to sink... like an anchor, ya plenary whiffle-whaffle!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Guff/GUF_44.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[353]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3671, 'GuffReplyToSecondaryDefenderArrivalSix', '[]', 'Wow! Bordering on potomania with that one. Or pyromania, I forget which. Off your hide, either way.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Guff/GUF_45.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[353]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3672, 'GuffReplyToSecondaryDefenderArrivalSeven', '[]', 'Oh and I''d find a way to drag you down with me, ya bloody scobberlotcher.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Guff/GUF_46.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[353]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3673, 'GuffReplyToSecondaryDefenderArrivalEight', '[]', 'Agh, why are ya pickin'' on Guff?', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Guff/GUF_47.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[353]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3674, 'GuffSecondaryDefenderArrivalTwentyTwo', '[]', 'It''s the one-two punch of doom!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Guff/GUF_48.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[353]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3675, 'GuffSecondaryDefenderArrivalTwentyThree', '[]', 'Now, we''ll get the job done for sure.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Guff/GUF_49.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[353]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3676, 'GuffSecondaryDefenderArrivalTwentyFour', '[]', 'Aw, quicker now, the gaffer''s here!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Guff/GUF_50.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[353]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3677, 'GuffSecondaryDefenderArrivalTwentyFive', '[]', 'This one''s knicked for sure now.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Guff/GUF_51.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[353]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3678, 'GuffSecondaryDefenderArrivalTwentySix', '[]', 'I command who? Ha-ku! That''s you!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Guff/GUF_52.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[353]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3679, 'GuffSecondaryDefenderArrivalTwentySeven', '[]', 'Oi Janus, guess what? I''m the baaawss!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Guff/GUF_53.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[353]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3680, 'GuffSecondaryDefenderArrivalTwentyEight', '[]', 'Ha hah! A Brinerot captainin'' a Redblade. Today''s the day!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Guff/GUF_54.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[353]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3681, 'GuffSecondaryDefenderArrivalTwentyNine', '[]', 'Don''t shoot me, but I do enjoy lording over a Mutewind.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Guff/GUF_55.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[353]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3682, 'GuffSecondaryDefenderArrivalThirty', '[]', 'Riker, if you goof here, you are showing me what''s under that mask.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Guff/GUF_56.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[353]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3683, 'GuffSecondaryDefenderArrivalThirtyOne', '[]', 'It''s Guff to friends, Captain to the rest!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Guff/GUF_57.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[353]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3684, 'GuffKillPlayerZero', '[]', 'Thank the gods... I mean, totally had that one under control the whole time.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Guff/GUF_58.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 8, 0, 1, '[353]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3685, 'GuffKillPlayerOne', '[]', 'Brinerot property remains Brinerot property!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Guff/GUF_59.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 8, 0, 1, '[353]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3686, 'GuffKillPlayerTwo', '[]', 'Oof, not a pretty place to fall. I know I wouldn''t want to rest here.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Guff/GUF_60.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 8, 0, 1, '[353]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3687, 'GuffKillPlayerThree', '[]', 'Never doubted... for a second... that I could do it!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Guff/GUF_61.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 8, 0, 1, '[353]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3688, 'GuffEscapeZero', '[]', 'Well this worked out rather nicely for Guff.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Guff/GUF_62.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 4, 0, 1, '[353]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3689, 'GuffEscapeOne', '[]', 'Captain Guff Gren escapes again!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Guff/GUF_63.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 4, 0, 1, '[353]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3690, 'GuffEscapeTwo', '[]', 'Ahahahah! Yes!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Guff/GUF_64.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 4, 0, 1, '[353]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3691, 'GuffDefeatedZero', '[]', 'Ohh, oh, me kidney...', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Guff/GUF_65.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 9, 0, 1, '[353]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3692, 'GuffDefeatedOne', '[]', 'My spleen, my poor spleen!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Guff/GUF_66.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 9, 0, 1, '[353]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3693, 'GuffDefeatedTwo', '[]', 'Acch, ya got me in the lung...', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Guff/GUF_67.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 9, 0, 1, '[353]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3694, 'GuffDefeatedThree', '[]', 'Ow! Ah ah ah ow! You hit me in the eyeball! Why the eyeball, Exile?', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Guff/GUF_68.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 9, 0, 1, '[353]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3695, 'GuffDefeatedFour', '[]', 'Not back to the bin? Ugh.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Guff/GUF_69.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 9, 0, 1, '[353]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3696, 'GuffDefeatedFive', '[]', 'Guess I was better as a merchant than a fighter.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Guff/GUF_70.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 9, 0, 1, '[353]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3697, 'GuffDefeatedSix', '[]', 'You gonna make me turn traitor again? ''Cause I - ''cause I will.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Guff/GUF_71.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 9, 0, 1, '[353]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3698, 'GuffDefeatedSeven', '[]', 'My head just keeps trying to leave me shoulders!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Guff/GUF_72.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 9, 0, 1, '[353]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3699, 'GuffDefeatedEight', '[]', 'Well, look as us aye! Back and forth, forth and back.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Guff/GUF_73.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 9, 0, 1, '[353]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3700, 'GuffDefeatedNine', '[]', 'I should never have jumped in like that. Aye... not great thinking.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Guff/GUF_74.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 9, 0, 1, '[353]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3701, 'GuffDefeatedTen', '[]', 'Well, this is what I get for sticking me nose in!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Guff/GUF_75.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 9, 0, 1, '[353]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3702, 'GuffOfferBargainZero', '[]', 'Whoah ha hah ho, hohoho, oh! No, no. No, I am ready to do whatever you say.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Guff/GUF_76.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[353]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3703, 'GuffOfferBargainOne', '[]', 'Lemme recruit a numpty to this job. It''s an old pirate trick. You attack when the worst man is on watch. Yeah. Yeah, makes it easy. So whaddya think?', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Guff/GUF_77.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[353]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3704, 'GuffOfferBargainTwo', '[]', 'Well, I can make friends, yeah, find things out. Everybody loves ol'' Guff! You get information, I get to live. Yeah. So whaddya say?', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Guff/GUF_78.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[353]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3705, 'GuffOfferBargainThree', '[]', 'Well I''m just no good at this job, so, how about you let me live, and I use me ''charm'' to switch with someone else? Yeah. Yeah, that would let you reorganise things for your own ends...', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Guff/GUF_79.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[353]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3706, 'GuffOfferBargainFour', '[]', 'That''s it! I''m done! I''m out! Yep. I''ve had enough! This whole damn Syndicate''s full of braindead... beetroots. Let me walk, Exile!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Guff/GUF_80.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[353]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3707, 'GuffOfferBargainFive', '[]', 'Now I''m no clipe, but sometimes, talking is better than, you know, dying. So just give lil'' ol'' Guff a chance to jabber and I guarantee you''ll learn a thing or two.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Guff/GUF_81.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[353]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3708, 'GuffOfferBargainSix', '[]', 'I got treasure for ya, you know, if you look the other way, friend...', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Guff/GUF_82.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[353]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3709, 'GuffBargainAcceptedZero', '[]', 'Good choice, Exile. Yep. You won''t regret this.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Guff/GUF_83.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[353]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3710, 'GuffBargainAcceptedOne', '[]', 'I am on the job!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Guff/GUF_84.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[353]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3711, 'GuffBargainAcceptedTwo', '[]', 'Next time you see me, I''ll be a new man.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Guff/GUF_85.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[353]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3712, 'GuffBargainAcceptedThree', '[]', 'Goodbye forever, friend - well, least ''til next time!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Guff/GUF_86.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[353]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3713, 'GuffBargainAcceptedFour', '[]', 'There it is, eh? That''s the sense I was hoping for. Now let''s talk.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Guff/GUF_87.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[353]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3714, 'GuffBargainAcceptedFive', '[]', 'All that glitters is gold...', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Guff/GUF_88.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[353]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3715, 'GuffOfferBetrayalZero', '[]', 'My gaffer''s in a weak position, mutiny-wise. If you take mercy on me, I might just manage to, uh, depose ''em. Keen?', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Guff/GUF_89.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[353]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3716, 'GuffOfferBetrayalOne', '[]', 'What if I told you I could spin a yarn and get all me mates demoted? That would be worth keeping me alive for that, right? Right?', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Guff/GUF_90.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[353]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3717, 'GuffOfferBetrayalTwo', '[]', 'Would ya care to kick one of me mates entirely out of the Syndicate? It''s a big lie I can tell, but one I will get away with, mostly. You know, as long as you don''t lop my head off!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Guff/GUF_91.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[353]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3718, 'GuffOfferBetrayalThree', '[]', 'They don''t call me gobermouch for nothing. I''ve got gossip and the low-down on everyone here. Just ah... just give me a chance to jabber on.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Guff/GUF_92.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[353]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3719, 'GuffOfferBetrayalFour', '[]', 'Tora''s so busy worrying about bloody trees and worms and... mice, she doesn''t even see the rest of us bustin'' our behinds to push the Syndicate forward. Let''s give Tora somethin'' to really worry about!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Guff/GUF_93.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[353]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3720, 'GuffOfferBetrayalFive', '[]', 'Jorgin is a murderer, or he hired one. He''s way worse than me. If you are punishing me over him, then you''re dumber than the barnacles on me backside.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Guff/GUF_94.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[353]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3721, 'GuffOfferBetrayalSix', '[]', 'Well! Can''t never trust a Redblade, I always say. And I alway mean it, too.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Guff/GUF_95.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[353]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3722, 'GuffOfferBetrayalSeven', '[]', 'Trustin'' a Mutewind ''ll get ya pincushioned by hidden blades, and I be speakin'' from experience here.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Guff/GUF_96.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[353]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3723, 'GuffOfferBetrayalEight', '[]', 'I like Maloney, okay, don''t get me wrong, but did ya ever have a mate who you could tell was just... after something? You know, makes me skin crawl, it does. Losing sleep over it! Really would rather not have to even think about it.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Guff/GUF_97.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[353]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3724, 'GuffOfferBetrayalNine', '[]', 'Haha awww, you know I didn''t mean nothing by it! I''m not even the one you really want, right?', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Guff/GUF_98.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[353]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3725, 'GuffOfferExecuteZero', '[]', 'Just do it, ya git.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Guff/GUF_99.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[353]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3726, 'GuffOfferExecuteOne', '[]', 'Watch carefully, gaffer. I give my life for the Syndicate.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Guff/GUF_100.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[353]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3727, 'GuffOfferExecuteTwo', '[]', 'I''m goin'' out first, let me show you how it''s done!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Guff/GUF_101.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[353]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3728, 'GuffOfferExecuteThree', '[]', 'I would rather die than go another round with your torture chamber.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Guff/GUF_102.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[353]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3729, 'GuffReplyToBetrayalAcceptedZero', '[]', 'Ooh, that is not good for my prospects.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Guff/GUF_103.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[353]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3730, 'GuffReplyToBetrayalAcceptedOne', '[]', 'Do you want to kick my rear, Vagan, or bend it?', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Guff/GUF_104.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[353]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3731, 'GuffReplyToBetrayalAcceptedTwo', '[]', 'Believe me, Janus, no one''s tryin'' to do nothing to your booty.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Guff/GUF_105.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[353]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3732, 'GuffReplyToBetrayalAcceptedThree', '[]', 'Ya know what? I think he could make a fence post out of me, too.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Guff/GUF_106.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[353]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3733, 'GuffReplyToBetrayalAcceptedFour', '[]', 'Keep your sedition to yourself, you overgrown gobermouch!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Guff/GUF_107.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[353]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3734, 'GuffReplyToBetrayalAcceptedFive', '[]', 'Oh, you done foozled it now, Mutewind!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Guff/GUF_108.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[353]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3735, 'GuffReplyToBetrayalAcceptedSix', '[]', 'Why do I always get the short end of the stick?', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Guff/GUF_109.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[353]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3736, 'GuffInterrogatedZero', '[]', 'I''m a talker, yes, but you will have to get me drunk first!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Guff/GUF_110.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[353]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3737, 'GuffInterrogatedOne', '[]', 'Stop locking me up!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Guff/GUF_111.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[353]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3738, 'GuffInterrogatedTwo', '[]', 'Wait, wait, what happened to our dealing? We - we were gettin'' on fine!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Guff/GUF_112.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[353]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3739, 'GuffReplyToExecutionZero', '[]', 'Ohh, not pretty. Ooh, that''s not pretty at all.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Guff/GUF_113.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[353]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3740, 'GuffReplyToExecutionOne', '[]', 'Auggh, was me best mate!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Guff/GUF_114.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[353]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3741, 'GuffReplyToExecutionTwo', '[]', 'Welp, no love lost there, let me tell ya.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Guff/GUF_115.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[353]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3742, 'GuffSafehouseLeaderDefeatedZero', '[]', 'Oh boy, hoo, Guff''s done it now.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Guff/GUF_116.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 10, 0, 1, '[353]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3743, 'GuffPrimaryDefenderStartsFightFifteen', '[]', 'Brinerot! Dead ahead!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/JunOrtoi/JO2_40.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[343]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3744, 'GuffPrimaryDefenderStartsFightSixteen', '[]', 'You Brinerots are as stupid as they say, aren''t you?', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/JunOrtoi/JO2_41.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[343]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3745, 'GuffDefeatedEleven', '[]', 'Fun''s over, Brinerot.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/JunOrtoi/JO2_59.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 9, 0, 1, '[343]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3746, 'GuffBargainAcceptedSix', '[]', 'Keep your word, or lose your head.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/JunOrtoi/JO2_80.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[343]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3747, 'GuffInterrogatedThree', '[]', 'Know where you''re going? I believe you know it as the brig.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/JunOrtoi/JO2_97.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[343]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3748, 'GuffSecondaryDefenderArrivalThirtyTwo', '[]', 'Brinerot, show the Syndicate you''re still your own man!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/JunOrtoi/JO2_121.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[343]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3749, 'GuffSecondaryDefenderArrivalThirtyThree', '[]', 'Villainous scoundrel. Slink back to the seas, Brinerot.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/JunOrtoi/JO_63.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[343]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3750, 'GuffReplyToSecondaryDefenderArrivalNine', '[]', 'Brinerot, you''ve been betrayed!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/JunOrtoi/JO2_138.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[343]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3751, 'GuffReplyToSecondaryDefenderArrivalTen', '[]', 'Since when does a Brinerot accept help?', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/JunOrtoi/JO2_155.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[343]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3752, 'GuffReplyToSecondaryDefenderArrivalEleven', '[]', 'You dare face us head on, Brinerot?', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/JunOrtoi/JO2_172.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[343]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3753, 'JanusPrimaryDefenderStartsFightZero', '[]', 'Witness the start of a new world order!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Janus/JP_01.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[354]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3754, 'JanusPrimaryDefenderStartsFightOne', '[]', 'Meddler! Leave this place or perish.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Janus/JP_02.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[354]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3755, 'JanusPrimaryDefenderStartsFightTwo', '[]', 'You would assault our goods? Barbaric!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Janus/JP_03.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[354]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3756, 'JanusPrimaryDefenderStartsFightThree', '[]', 'Did you wish to join the other corpses, Exile?', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Janus/JP_04.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[354]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3757, 'JanusPrimaryDefenderStartsFightFour', '[]', 'Don''t make this harder than it has to be.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Janus/JP_05.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[354]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3758, 'JanusPrimaryDefenderStartsFightFive', '[]', 'To think I just finished washing out the stench of prison.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Janus/JP_06.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[354]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3759, 'JanusPrimaryDefenderStartsFightSix', '[]', 'Our dirty little deal is over, Exile.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Janus/JP_07.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[354]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3760, 'JanusPrimaryDefenderStartsFightSeven', '[]', 'Think I feel bad about what I did? Please.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Janus/JP_08.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[354]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3761, 'JanusPrimaryDefenderStartsFightEight', '[]', 'I''ve long wanted to see how futile your cause truly is.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Janus/JP_09.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[354]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3762, 'JanusPrimaryDefenderStartsFightNine', '[]', 'Back for more? How wonderful.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Janus/JP_10.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[354]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3763, 'JanusPrimaryDefenderStartsFightTen', '[]', 'A Perandus is never alone.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Janus/JP_11.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[354]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3764, 'JanusPrimaryDefenderStartsFightEleven', '[]', 'Behold my machinery at maximum efficiency.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Janus/JP_12.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[354]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3765, 'JanusPrimaryDefenderStartsFightTwelve', '[]', 'There is no avoiding your fate, Exile.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Janus/JP_13.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[354]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3766, 'JanusPrimaryDefenderStartsFightThirteen', '[]', 'Relentless.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Janus/JP_14.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[354]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3767, 'JanusPrimaryDefenderStartsFightFourteen', '[]', 'I only have to hit you with this once...', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Janus/JP_15.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[354]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3768, 'JanusSafehouseLeaderIntroZero', '[]', 'Trespassing is a crime, and criminals must be punished.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Janus/JP_16.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[354]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3769, 'JanusSecondaryDefenderArrivalZero', '[]', 'This property belongs to the Perandus, interloper! And the Syndicate.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Janus/JP_17.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[354]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3770, 'JanusSecondaryDefenderArrivalOne', '[]', 'How dare you attack my... our path to wealth.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Janus/JP_18.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[354]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3771, 'JanusSecondaryDefenderArrivalTwo', '[]', 'What a dreadful mess.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Janus/JP_19.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[354]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3772, 'JanusSecondaryDefenderArrivalThree', '[]', 'This was meant to be done by now!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Janus/JP_20.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[354]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3773, 'JanusSecondaryDefenderArrivalFour', '[]', 'Gods, boredom will drive a man to do just about anything.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Janus/JP_21.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[354]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3774, 'JanusSecondaryDefenderArrivalFive', '[]', 'These grounds do not belong to you!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Janus/JP_22.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[354]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3775, 'JanusSecondaryDefenderArrivalSix', '[]', 'I''ve come to rescue you, savage. Thank me later.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Janus/JP_23.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[354]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3776, 'JanusSecondaryDefenderArrivalSeven', '[]', 'Tora, your mark still walks. This is a problem!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Janus/JP_24.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[354]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3777, 'JanusSecondaryDefenderArrivalEight', '[]', 'You debauched overgrown toddler! Why does the Exile yet live?', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Janus/JP_25.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[354]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3778, 'JanusSecondaryDefenderArrivalNine', '[]', 'I shouldn''t have to do your job for you, assassin.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Janus/JP_26.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[354]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3779, 'JanusSecondaryDefenderArrivalTen', '[]', 'Here we are, Thane, fighting side by side, just as our ancestors did in the Labyrinth.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Janus/JP_27.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[354]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3780, 'JanusSecondaryDefenderArrivalEleven', '[]', 'Typical. Just typical! Try not to cock this up.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Janus/JP_28.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[354]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3781, 'JanusSecondaryDefenderArrivalTwelve', '[]', 'Our territory needs better management.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Janus/JP_29.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[354]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3782, 'JanusSecondaryDefenderArrivalThirteen', '[]', 'This transport needs to be... redirected.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Janus/JP_30.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[354]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3783, 'JanusSecondaryDefenderArrivalFourteen', '[]', 'Such is my disdain for you, that I came down here.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Janus/JP_31.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[354]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3784, 'JanusSecondaryDefenderArrivalFifteen', '[]', 'Bad news, I''m afraid. The Exile''s no longer the primary target.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Janus/JP_32.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[354]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3785, 'JanusSecondaryDefenderArrivalSixteen', '[]', 'I respect your conviction, Elreon, but our goals are at odds.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Janus/JP_33.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[354]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3786, 'JanusSecondaryDefenderArrivalSeventeen', '[]', 'Sorry, Guff, but you''re out. Too untrustworthy.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Janus/JP_34.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[354]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3787, 'JanusSecondaryDefenderArrivalEighteen', '[]', 'You''re braindead, Hillock. It''s time your body caught up.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Janus/JP_35.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[354]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3788, 'JanusSecondaryDefenderArrivalNineteen', '[]', 'Gravicius, let me remind you just what the Perandus name means.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Janus/JP_36.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[354]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3789, 'JanusSecondaryDefenderArrivalTwenty', '[]', 'Shame you can''t go back to Ogham, Ezomyte. You don''t belong here.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Janus/JP_37.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[354]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3790, 'JanusSecondaryDefenderArrivalTwentyOne', '[]', 'I''m quite sorry, but the political landscape has changed.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Janus/JP_38.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[354]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3791, 'JanusReplyToSecondaryDefenderArrivalZero', '[]', 'You moron. You should be defending me!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Janus/JP_39.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[354]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3792, 'JanusReplyToSecondaryDefenderArrivalOne', '[]', 'When the Lifegiver hears about this, you''re done.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Janus/JP_40.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[354]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3793, 'JanusReplyToSecondaryDefenderArrivalTwo', '[]', 'Fine. We''ll handle your corpse, too.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Janus/JP_41.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[354]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3794, 'JanusReplyToSecondaryDefenderArrivalThree', '[]', 'This was supposed to be quick and easy.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Janus/JP_42.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[354]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3795, 'JanusReplyToSecondaryDefenderArrivalFour', '[]', 'I''m more than happy to defend my family''s name. Try me.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Janus/JP_43.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[354]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3796, 'JanusReplyToSecondaryDefenderArrivalFive', '[]', 'What? We''re on the same team!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Janus/JP_44.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[354]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3797, 'JanusReplyToSecondaryDefenderArrivalSix', '[]', 'Please don''t splash whatever it is you''re dripping with on me.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Janus/JP_45.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[354]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3798, 'JanusReplyToSecondaryDefenderArrivalSeven', '[]', 'Then perhaps you should do something that will help me remember your name.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Janus/JP_46.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[354]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3799, 'JanusReplyToSecondaryDefenderArrivalEight', '[]', 'You I can handle myself.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Janus/JP_47.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[354]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3800, 'JanusReplyToSecondaryDefenderArrivalNine', '[]', 'You should know better than to stand in the way of a Perandus.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Janus/JP_48.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[354]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3801, 'JanusSecondaryDefenderArrivalTwentyTwo', '[]', 'A Perandus never abandons good land.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Janus/JP_49.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[354]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3802, 'JanusSecondaryDefenderArrivalTwentyThree', '[]', 'We lose the carts, you lose your head.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Janus/JP_50.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[354]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3803, 'JanusSecondaryDefenderArrivalTwentyFour', '[]', 'Someone has some explaining to do.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Janus/JP_51.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[354]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3804, 'JanusSecondaryDefenderArrivalTwentyFive', '[]', 'How do you mess an ambush up this badly?', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Janus/JP_52.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[354]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3805, 'JanusSecondaryDefenderArrivalTwentySix', '[]', 'Do as I say, Karui, and we can keep the Eternal One out of this.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Janus/JP_53.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[354]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3806, 'JanusSecondaryDefenderArrivalTwentySeven', '[]', 'If my robes get ruined, Tora, you''re squarely to blame.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Janus/JP_54.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[354]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3807, 'JanusSecondaryDefenderArrivalTwentyEight', '[]', 'The Brotherhood of Silence has always served my family well.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Janus/JP_55.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[354]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3808, 'JanusSecondaryDefenderArrivalTwentyNine', '[]', 'Simple Hillock, all you had to do was bash what I said.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Janus/JP_56.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[354]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3809, 'JanusSecondaryDefenderArrivalThirty', '[]', 'Gravicius! You''re the Sentari to my Chitus. You know what to do!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Janus/JP_57.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[354]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3810, 'JanusSecondaryDefenderArrivalThirtyOne', '[]', 'You know how this goes. Do what you''re told and you''ll be rewarded.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Janus/JP_58.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[354]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3811, 'JanusKillPlayerZero', '[]', 'Well, it wasn''t like you were ever going to win.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Janus/JP_59.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 8, 0, 1, '[354]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3812, 'JanusKillPlayerOne', '[]', 'Nobody touches a Perandus'' wealth.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Janus/JP_60.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 8, 0, 1, '[354]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3813, 'JanusKillPlayerTwo', '[]', 'Wonderful. Can we hurry this up?', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Janus/JP_61.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 8, 0, 1, '[354]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3814, 'JanusKillPlayerThree', '[]', 'I did it! All by myself...!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Janus/JP_62.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 8, 0, 1, '[354]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3815, 'JanusEscapeZero', '[]', 'Remember this kindness, Exile.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Janus/JP_63.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 4, 0, 1, '[354]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3816, 'JanusEscapeOne', '[]', 'My growing wealth remains secure.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Janus/JP_64.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 4, 0, 1, '[354]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3817, 'JanusEscapeTwo', '[]', 'Time''s up, and you''ve got nothing to show for it.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Janus/JP_65.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 4, 0, 1, '[354]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3818, 'JanusDefeatedZero', '[]', 'No... I needed... this land...', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Janus/JP_66.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 9, 0, 1, '[354]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3819, 'JanusDefeatedOne', '[]', 'My... cargo...', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Janus/JP_67.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 9, 0, 1, '[354]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3820, 'JanusDefeatedTwo', '[]', 'This... is not good...', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Janus/JP_68.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 9, 0, 1, '[354]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3821, 'JanusDefeatedThree', '[]', 'Mortifying.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Janus/JP_69.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 9, 0, 1, '[354]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3822, 'JanusDefeatedFour', '[]', 'No more cells... you have to promise me...', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Janus/JP_70.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 9, 0, 1, '[354]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3823, 'JanusDefeatedFive', '[]', 'You win... let''s parlay.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Janus/JP_71.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 9, 0, 1, '[354]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3824, 'JanusDefeatedSix', '[]', 'To think... I worked with you...', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Janus/JP_72.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 9, 0, 1, '[354]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3825, 'JanusDefeatedSeven', '[]', 'Wait, let me think...!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Janus/JP_73.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 9, 0, 1, '[354]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3826, 'JanusDefeatedEight', '[]', 'I''ve never been so embarrassed.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Janus/JP_74.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 9, 0, 1, '[354]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3827, 'JanusDefeatedNine', '[]', 'What an absolute shambles.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Janus/JP_75.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 9, 0, 1, '[354]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3828, 'JanusDefeatedTen', '[]', 'You... went for the wrong person, Exile...', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Janus/JP_76.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 9, 0, 1, '[354]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3829, 'JanusOfferBargainZero', '[]', 'That was vivid. I see you''re not one to bluff. Well, I''m not one to gamble. Okay, that - that''s a lie, I love gambling, but not with my life. So, go on, what are you after?', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Janus/JP_77.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[354]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3830, 'JanusOfferBargainOne', '[]', 'A man of status has a way of bringing others up to his level, and what higher status is there than that of a Perandus? Yes, we''re at odds, but consider, really consider, the benefits to you of not just having one but two men on the inside. One of them could even be a woman!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Janus/JP_78.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[354]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3831, 'JanusOfferBargainTwo', '[]', 'If you cut a Perandus, and you definitely should not do so, but if you do, we bleed diplomacy. Don''t - don''t test it. It''s a metaphor. Put the knife away, and allow me to do what I was born to do: exchange information. If I whisper into the ear of a cohort, they will whisper into mine. And if you should overhear such whispers? Well, there''s simply nothing I could do about that!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Janus/JP_79.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[354]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3832, 'JanusOfferBargainThree', '[]', 'This work? This is grunt work. Look at me. Do I look like a grunt to you? Don''t answer that. I didn''t want to be doing this any more than you wanted me to. In fact, there''s a job I''ve had my eye on for some time that I think you''ll agree is much more suitable for a man of my stature.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Janus/JP_80.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[354]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3833, 'JanusOfferBargainFour', '[]', 'The Syndicate is wonderful. It really is. If you weren''t trying to kill all of us, I''d suggest you try it. Except I fear there''s no more room... hmm... I know! I''ll take a little leave of absence, and you can try it out for yourself! Might be tricky convincing the others, but, well, that won''t really be my problem, will it?', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Janus/JP_81.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[354]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3834, 'JanusOfferBargainFive', '[]', 'My family name was once synonymous with intelligence, both of the mind, and of the... what''s that ...thing called... espionage! Yes. Well, times may have changed, but we haven''t. In exchange for keeping my lovely blood where it''s meant to be, how about I tell you a few things you might find meaningful.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Janus/JP_82.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[354]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3835, 'JanusOfferBargainSix', '[]', 'The Perandus family is not quite the goldmine it once was, but I myself am not entirely without items of value. Nothing is more valuable than the wonderful sound of my own beating heart, of course, so how about a good old fashioned pay-off?', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Janus/JP_83.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[354]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3836, 'JanusBargainAcceptedZero', '[]', 'Not the one I''d have chosen, but sure.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Janus/JP_84.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[354]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3837, 'JanusBargainAcceptedOne', '[]', 'Thank you. Please put the knife down now.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Janus/JP_85.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[354]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3838, 'JanusBargainAcceptedTwo', '[]', 'Ah, nobleman''s work. Lovely!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Janus/JP_86.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[354]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3839, 'JanusBargainAcceptedThree', '[]', 'Just tell them I said it''s fine for you to join. I''m quite popular. They may still try and attack you on sight, but can you really blame them?', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Janus/JP_87.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[354]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3840, 'JanusBargainAcceptedFour', '[]', 'Time to espionagerate. Espionify? Espi - time to talk!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Janus/JP_88.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[354]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3841, 'JanusBargainAcceptedFive', '[]', 'Yes, yes... if anyone asks where you got such wondrous gifts, well, tell them it was me. Need to keep up appearances.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Janus/JP_89.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[354]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3842, 'JanusOfferBetrayalZero', '[]', 'Oh Janus, you''ve really done it this time! Look at the situation you''ve got yourself in. You''re an employee! Listen here, Exile. This whole organisation is flipped on its head. I should be running the thing! In fact... how about you let me go, and I put my silly little boss here in a more suitable role, and I take the plinth I was born to take.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Janus/JP_90.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[354]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3843, 'JanusOfferBetrayalOne', '[]', 'Do you know how my family got to be so wealthy so long ago? Blackmail. Probably blackmail. It was... wait, was it? Actually, I''m not sure. I should check that, but I really think it was very likely blackmail. Anyway, I have a truly shocking amount of dirt on everyone here. Let me go, and I''ll turn the Syndicate headquarters into a field... because of all the dirt.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Janus/JP_91.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[354]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3844, 'JanusOfferBetrayalTwo', '[]', 'If there''s one thing I simply can''t stand, it''s dying. I''d do almost anything to avoid it. I''d go so far as to kill someone! Or get someone to kill someone on my behalf, anyway. Not overly fond of blood. Let me go, and I''ll get the ol'' ball rolling on that murder.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Janus/JP_92.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[354]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3845, 'JanusOfferBetrayalThree', '[]', 'I love a bit of gossip, don''t you? Who''s rutting whom, who''s been swiping gold from the coffers - me - who''s been planning what where within the Syndicate... you know... gossip! Can''t gossip if you''re dead though. That is one of many things you cannot do when you''re dead.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Janus/JP_93.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[354]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3846, 'JanusOfferBetrayalFour', '[]', 'Haku is incorruptible, and that makes him extremely dangerous in a world of compromises and grey outcomes.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Janus/JP_94.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[354]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3847, 'JanusOfferBetrayalFive', '[]', 'Leo''s the kind of scrappy fighter who just won''t give up. It''s as impressive as it is dangerous. A clever individual like yourself would take any opportunity to force him to give in, I''m sure.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Janus/JP_95.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[354]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3848, 'JanusOfferBetrayalSix', '[]', 'How often do you find yourself with an assassin from the Brotherhood of Silence at your whim? If you don''t take advantage of such an opportunity, well, I simply can''t be held responsible for whatever viciously sharp object ends up in your spine later.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Janus/JP_96.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[354]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3849, 'JanusOfferBetrayalSeven', '[]', 'Look, Guff''s a nice guy, for a pirate. Have you ever met a nice pirate? A pirate who wasn''t just waiting to ''plunder'' the old ''booty'' as they say? I certainly haven''t.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Janus/JP_97.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[354]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3850, 'JanusOfferBetrayalEight', '[]', 'General Gravicius still demands that we call him General. Anyone who cares that much about status makes my Perandus blood boil over. Please, show him just how much his rank is worth.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Janus/JP_98.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[354]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3851, 'JanusOfferBetrayalNine', '[]', 'Yes, I''m a Perandus, but how much does that really mean anymore? Other Immortal Syndicate members are far more dangerous. I''m just charming.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Janus/JP_99.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[354]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3852, 'JanusOfferExecuteZero', '[]', 'I really do hate the idea of dying, but... oh, go on then. Get it over with.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Janus/JP_100.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[354]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3853, 'JanusOfferExecuteOne', '[]', 'A good nobleman will always die for their king or queen. Or boss.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Janus/JP_101.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[354]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3854, 'JanusOfferExecuteTwo', '[]', 'I never thought I''d put my life before that of a friend, but here we are.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Janus/JP_102.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[354]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3855, 'JanusOfferExecuteThree', '[]', 'No. I will not go back to the cells. I refuse. You''ll have to kill me. I''m serious.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Janus/JP_103.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[354]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3856, 'JanusReplyToBetrayalAcceptedZero', '[]', 'Ha! Brilliant. Awful, really awful for me in particular, but brilliant.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Janus/JP_104.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[354]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3857, 'JanusReplyToBetrayalAcceptedOne', '[]', 'Sometimes I wonder if my last name is a blessing or a curse.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Janus/JP_105.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[354]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3858, 'JanusReplyToBetrayalAcceptedTwo', '[]', 'Religion is for fools, holy man. At least power is real.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Janus/JP_106.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[354]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3859, 'JanusReplyToBetrayalAcceptedThree', '[]', 'What? I''m innocent! Other than - oh.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Janus/JP_107.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[354]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3860, 'JanusReplyToBetrayalAcceptedFour', '[]', 'I''d rather be a pathetic excuse for a man, Gravicius, than the monster you are.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Janus/JP_108.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[354]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3861, 'JanusReplyToBetrayalAcceptedFive', '[]', 'Old grudges die hard, I guess. The brothers of Thanes, on the other hand...', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Janus/JP_109.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[354]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3862, 'JanusReplyToBetrayalAcceptedSix', '[]', 'You''ll regret this. A Perandus always, always comes out on top.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Janus/JP_110.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[354]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3863, 'JanusInterrogatedZero', '[]', 'Time to see how the paupers live I s''pose.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Janus/JP_111.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[354]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3864, 'JanusInterrogatedOne', '[]', 'Absolutely not. No. No! Damn you, no!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Janus/JP_112.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[354]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3865, 'JanusInterrogatedTwo', '[]', 'What? Not even going to try to make another deal?', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Janus/JP_113.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[354]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3866, 'JanusReplyToExecutionZero', '[]', 'Gruesome.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Janus/JP_114.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[354]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3867, 'JanusReplyToExecutionOne', '[]', 'That was really, really, really, really mean.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Janus/JP_115.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[354]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3868, 'JanusReplyToExecutionTwo', '[]', 'Yuck! Damn. I got some on me.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Janus/JP_116.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[354]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3869, 'JanusSafehouseLeaderDefeatedZero', '[]', 'You... shouldn''t even be here! This shouldn''t be allowed!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Janus/JP_117.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 10, 0, 1, '[354]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3870, 'JanusPrimaryDefenderStartsFightFifteen', '[]', 'At last, a chance to drive a sword through that Perandus skull.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/JunOrtoi/JO2_45.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[343]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3871, 'JanusDefeatedEleven', '[]', 'In the dirt, worm.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/JunOrtoi/JO2_62.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 9, 0, 1, '[343]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3872, 'JanusDefeatedTwelve', '[]', 'Beg for your life, Perandus.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/JunOrtoi/JO2_106.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 9, 0, 1, '[343]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3873, 'JanusBargainAcceptedSix', '[]', 'I''m going to kill you Janus... Just not yet.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/JunOrtoi/JO2_83.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[343]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3874, 'JanusInterrogatedThree', '[]', 'Rot in that cage, bastard.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/JunOrtoi/JO2_100.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[343]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3875, 'JanusSecondaryDefenderArrivalThirtyTwo', '[]', 'A vile devil of lies and greed betrays his own.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/JunOrtoi/JO2_122.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[343]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3876, 'JanusSecondaryDefenderArrivalThirtyThree', '[]', 'Janus... You-... You-...! You are going to pay for what you did to my- to OUR family.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/JunOrtoi/JO_64.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[343]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3877, 'JanusReplyToSecondaryDefenderArrivalTen', '[]', 'Nothing you don''t deserve, Janus.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/JunOrtoi/JO2_139.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[343]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3878, 'JanusReplyToSecondaryDefenderArrivalEleven', '[]', 'Be careful how you help Janus... He may stab you in the back too.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/JunOrtoi/JO2_156.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[343]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3879, 'JanusReplyToSecondaryDefenderArrivalTwelve', '[]', 'Janus! I''m going to enjoy killing you.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/JunOrtoi/JO2_173.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[343]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3880, 'HillockPrimaryDefenderStartsFightZero', '[]', 'Hey...! Why do you look so familiar...?', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Hillock/HIL_01.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[351]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3881, 'HillockPrimaryDefenderStartsFightOne', '[]', 'This is MY house. You''re gonna DIE, little invaders.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Hillock/HIL_02.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[351]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3882, 'HillockPrimaryDefenderStartsFightTwo', '[]', 'My things, not yours! I''ll SMASH YOU TO BITS!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Hillock/HIL_03.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[351]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3883, 'HillockPrimaryDefenderStartsFightThree', '[]', 'You''re not meant to see this! I''ll KILL YOU TO DEATH!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Hillock/HIL_04.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[351]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3884, 'HillockPrimaryDefenderStartsFightFour', '[]', 'Found you, little Exile. Now I''m gonna kill you!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Hillock/HIL_05.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[351]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3885, 'HillockPrimaryDefenderStartsFightFive', '[]', 'Hate the dark. Hate YOU for putting me there!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Hillock/HIL_06.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[351]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3886, 'HillockPrimaryDefenderStartsFightSix', '[]', 'YOU! Confuse me you did. Snap your little neck for that.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Hillock/HIL_07.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[351]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3887, 'HillockPrimaryDefenderStartsFightSeven', '[]', 'You made me hurt my friends. Now I''ll hurt you!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Hillock/HIL_08.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[351]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3888, 'HillockPrimaryDefenderStartsFightEight', '[]', 'You killed me. Now, I kill you. Make this one last.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Hillock/HIL_09.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[351]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3889, 'HillockPrimaryDefenderStartsFightNine', '[]', 'I liked breaking you, little Exile. Glad I get to do it again.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Hillock/HIL_10.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[351]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3890, 'HillockPrimaryDefenderStartsFightTen', '[]', 'Bash you harder than I''ve ever bashed before!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Hillock/HIL_11.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[351]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3891, 'HillockPrimaryDefenderStartsFightEleven', '[]', 'The people I kill are still with me.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Hillock/HIL_12.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[351]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3892, 'HillockPrimaryDefenderStartsFightTwelve', '[]', 'One hit, Exile. All I need.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Hillock/HIL_13.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[351]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3893, 'HillockPrimaryDefenderStartsFightThirteen', '[]', 'Run, toy! Run!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Hillock/HIL_14.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[351]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3894, 'HillockPrimaryDefenderStartsFightFourteen', '[]', 'When I get mad, things burn. PEOPLE burn.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Hillock/HIL_15.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[351]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3895, 'HillockSafehouseLeaderIntroZero', '[]', 'You walk into my home. MY home. I''ll RIP your spine OUT!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Hillock/HIL_16.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[351]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3896, 'HillockSecondaryDefenderArrivalZero', '[]', 'I''ll help kill the little invaders!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Hillock/HIL_17.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[351]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3897, 'HillockSecondaryDefenderArrivalOne', '[]', 'They''re not your things little Exile!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Hillock/HIL_18.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[351]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3898, 'HillockSecondaryDefenderArrivalTwo', '[]', 'Mash the little invaders into GOO!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Hillock/HIL_19.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[351]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3899, 'HillockSecondaryDefenderArrivalThree', '[]', 'Kill them dead! Hahahaha!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Hillock/HIL_20.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[351]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3900, 'HillockSecondaryDefenderArrivalFour', '[]', 'I''ma hurt you for fun.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Hillock/HIL_21.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[351]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3901, 'HillockSecondaryDefenderArrivalFive', '[]', 'I''ll protect you! I''ll protect the family! Rip little Exile heads off!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Hillock/HIL_22.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[351]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3902, 'HillockSecondaryDefenderArrivalSix', '[]', 'I''ll help you smite.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Hillock/HIL_23.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[351]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3903, 'HillockSecondaryDefenderArrivalSeven', '[]', 'Arrows? I hate arrows.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Hillock/HIL_24.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[351]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3904, 'HillockSecondaryDefenderArrivalEight', '[]', 'I''ll help you stab.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Hillock/HIL_25.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[351]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3905, 'HillockSecondaryDefenderArrivalNine', '[]', 'I''ll help you tear.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Hillock/HIL_26.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[351]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3906, 'HillockSecondaryDefenderArrivalTen', '[]', 'I''ll help you, scary lady.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Hillock/HIL_27.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[351]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3907, 'HillockSecondaryDefenderArrivalEleven', '[]', 'I''ll help you bash.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Hillock/HIL_28.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[351]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3908, 'HillockSecondaryDefenderArrivalTwelve', '[]', 'You all hurt me. I''ll hurt you all!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Hillock/HIL_29.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[351]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3909, 'HillockSecondaryDefenderArrivalThirteen', '[]', 'These are my things now, stupid.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Hillock/HIL_30.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[351]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3910, 'HillockSecondaryDefenderArrivalFourteen', '[]', 'Gonna kill all of you down here.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Hillock/HIL_31.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[351]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3911, 'HillockSecondaryDefenderArrivalFifteen', '[]', 'Ha! You stupid idiot, you fell into my trap.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Hillock/HIL_32.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[351]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3912, 'HillockSecondaryDefenderArrivalSixteen', '[]', 'I''m gonna get you, wild one!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Hillock/HIL_33.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[351]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3913, 'HillockSecondaryDefenderArrivalSeventeen', '[]', 'You talk too much Vagan. I''m gonna shut that pretty little mouth.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Hillock/HIL_34.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[351]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3914, 'HillockSecondaryDefenderArrivalEighteen', '[]', 'Pretty Rin, I''m coming for ya!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Hillock/HIL_35.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[351]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3915, 'HillockSecondaryDefenderArrivalNineteen', '[]', 'Can I bash you, Cameria?', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Hillock/HIL_36.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[351]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3916, 'HillockSecondaryDefenderArrivalTwenty', '[]', 'Scary little Aisling... you''re mine now.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Hillock/HIL_37.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[351]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3917, 'HillockSecondaryDefenderArrivalTwentyOne', '[]', 'Bash Exile, bash Syndicate. Bash whoever.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Hillock/HIL_38.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[351]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3918, 'HillockReplyToSecondaryDefenderArrivalZero', '[]', 'You''re in my house though, stupid.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Hillock/HIL_39.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[351]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3919, 'HillockReplyToSecondaryDefenderArrivalOne', '[]', 'I''ll kill you too! I''ll break all of you to CRUMBS!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Hillock/HIL_40.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[351]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3920, 'HillockReplyToSecondaryDefenderArrivalTwo', '[]', 'Gonna keep your body. You''re not gonna wake up again.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Hillock/HIL_41.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[351]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3921, 'HillockReplyToSecondaryDefenderArrivalThree', '[]', 'I''ll paint with you later. A big red smear. Hahaha!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Hillock/HIL_42.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[351]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3922, 'HillockReplyToSecondaryDefenderArrivalFour', '[]', 'I''m gonna use your body to test my blades.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Hillock/HIL_43.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[351]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3923, 'HillockReplyToSecondaryDefenderArrivalFive', '[]', 'Hate pirates! Salty, smelly, rotten bunch.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Hillock/HIL_44.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[351]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3924, 'HillockReplyToSecondaryDefenderArrivalSix', '[]', 'Yeah? Well you''re gonna be DEAD-dead!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Hillock/HIL_45.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[351]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3925, 'HillockReplyToSecondaryDefenderArrivalSeven', '[]', 'Hey! Who are you calling dumb? Me? Hey!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Hillock/HIL_46.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[351]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3926, 'HillockReplyToSecondaryDefenderArrivalEight', '[]', 'I''ll snap off every limb that touches me, bitch.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Hillock/HIL_47.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[351]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3927, 'HillockReplyToSecondaryDefenderArrivalNine', '[]', 'Then I''ll bash you too.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Hillock/HIL_48.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[351]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3928, 'HillockSecondaryDefenderArrivalTwentyTwo', '[]', 'Don''t get in the way.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Hillock/HIL_49.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[351]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3929, 'HillockSecondaryDefenderArrivalTwentyThree', '[]', 'You protect the things! I''ll bash the little Exile.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Hillock/HIL_50.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[351]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3930, 'HillockSecondaryDefenderArrivalTwentyFour', '[]', 'The bashing will be legendary!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Hillock/HIL_51.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[351]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3931, 'HillockSecondaryDefenderArrivalTwentyFive', '[]', 'Grind the Exile''s bones into snuff.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Hillock/HIL_52.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[351]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3932, 'HillockSecondaryDefenderArrivalTwentySix', '[]', 'Bash good, Leo, and I''ll make you another hook.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Hillock/HIL_53.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[351]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3933, 'HillockSecondaryDefenderArrivalTwentySeven', '[]', 'Keep them arrows away from me. Point ''em at the Exile!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Hillock/HIL_54.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[351]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3934, 'HillockSecondaryDefenderArrivalTwentyEight', '[]', 'Little man with his blades, you stab what I say.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Hillock/HIL_55.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[351]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3935, 'HillockSecondaryDefenderArrivalTwentyNine', '[]', 'I am the strongest here, little Thane. I command.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Hillock/HIL_56.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[351]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3936, 'HillockSecondaryDefenderArrivalThirty', '[]', 'My turn to choose what we rip apart!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Hillock/HIL_57.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[351]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3937, 'HillockSecondaryDefenderArrivalThirtyOne', '[]', 'You know what I want. Bash. Bash! BASH!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Hillock/HIL_58.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[351]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3938, 'HillockKillPlayerZero', '[]', 'And stay out!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Hillock/HIL_59.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 8, 0, 1, '[351]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3939, 'HillockKillPlayerOne', '[]', 'What''s mine is mine.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Hillock/HIL_60.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 8, 0, 1, '[351]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3940, 'HillockKillPlayerTwo', '[]', 'Smushed.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Hillock/HIL_61.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 8, 0, 1, '[351]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3941, 'HillockKillPlayerThree', '[]', 'Easy easy easy.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Hillock/HIL_62.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 8, 0, 1, '[351]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3942, 'HillockEscapeZero', '[]', 'Huhuhahaha... HAHahahahahaha!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Hillock/HIL_63.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 4, 0, 1, '[351]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3943, 'HillockEscapeOne', '[]', 'See? Nobody takes my things!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Hillock/HIL_64.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 4, 0, 1, '[351]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3944, 'HillockEscapeTwo', '[]', 'Bash you to bits later, little invaders.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Hillock/HIL_65.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 4, 0, 1, '[351]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3945, 'HillockDefeatedZero', '[]', 'Arrrgh!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Hillock/HIL_66.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 9, 0, 1, '[351]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3946, 'HillockDefeatedOne', '[]', 'Uggggggh!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Hillock/HIL_67.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 9, 0, 1, '[351]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3947, 'HillockDefeatedTwo', '[]', 'My... toys...!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Hillock/HIL_68.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 9, 0, 1, '[351]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3948, 'HillockDefeatedThree', '[]', 'You cheated! Must have!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Hillock/HIL_69.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 9, 0, 1, '[351]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3949, 'HillockDefeatedFour', '[]', 'No... not in the dark again...', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Hillock/HIL_70.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 9, 0, 1, '[351]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3950, 'HillockDefeatedFive', '[]', 'My head still hurts!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Hillock/HIL_71.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 9, 0, 1, '[351]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3951, 'HillockDefeatedSix', '[]', 'Don''t make me... hurt my friends again...', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Hillock/HIL_72.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 9, 0, 1, '[351]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3952, 'HillockDefeatedSeven', '[]', 'No... don''t want to die... again..', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Hillock/HIL_73.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 9, 0, 1, '[351]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3953, 'HillockDefeatedEight', '[]', 'My turn... already...?', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Hillock/HIL_74.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 9, 0, 1, '[351]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3954, 'HillockDefeatedNine', '[]', 'Bad... bad... BAD!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Hillock/HIL_75.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 9, 0, 1, '[351]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3955, 'HillockDefeatedTen', '[]', 'Stupid Hillock! Stupid!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Hillock/HIL_76.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 9, 0, 1, '[351]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3956, 'HillockOfferBargainZero', '[]', 'You kill so good, Exile. Quick and splatty. You want to be friends just for today?', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Hillock/HIL_77.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[351]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3957, 'HillockOfferBargainOne', '[]', 'Want a friend, I do. Sit in my room, bashing my hammer, talking to myself... gettin'' ANGRY... with a friend maybe I wouldn''t hurt people no more. Will you help me find a friend?', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Hillock/HIL_78.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[351]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3958, 'HillockOfferBargainTwo', '[]', 'Making a new friend, I am. We was gonna eat dinner together. Bit of the drink. Talk about work. Told me a few things already you know. Let me go and I''ll tell you what they told me.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Hillock/HIL_79.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[351]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3959, 'HillockOfferBargainThree', '[]', 'I tried and tried to do this job but I don''t get it. It doesn''t make SENSE to me! Hurts my head! Makes me ANGRY. Makes me BREAK STUFF! Don''t make me stay here.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Hillock/HIL_80.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[351]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3960, 'HillockOfferBargainFour', '[]', 'Miss the forge, I do. Can''t make swords here the way I used to. Maybe you can tell the Lifegiver I burned to ashes and I can go back home. Back to the anvil, and the pub.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Hillock/HIL_81.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[351]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3961, 'HillockOfferBargainFive', '[]', 'I hate this job. Hate it! Makes no sense to me! My boss gave me some scribbled paper. Told me everything I need to know is on it, but I can''t make out the pictures. If you let me go, you can take a look. Maybe you can work out what it means.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Hillock/HIL_82.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[351]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3962, 'HillockOfferBargainSix', '[]', 'Miss making my swords, I do. Sometimes, I get pictures in my head from a long time ago. Making beautiful swords. Better than I can make now. Feels like a different man in those pictures. A smarter man. Quicker. Been collecting a few pieces here and there. Not like the ones I make, but still strong. Makes me think of home, makes me feel connected to that smarter man. You can have them if you promise you won''t hurt me anymore.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Hillock/HIL_83.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[351]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3963, 'HillockBargainAcceptedZero', '[]', 'Maybe this will make the bad thoughts go...', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Hillock/HIL_84.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[351]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3964, 'HillockBargainAcceptedOne', '[]', 'Hard to make new friends, it is...', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Hillock/HIL_85.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[351]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3965, 'HillockBargainAcceptedTwo', '[]', 'Oh no... this sounds hard, too!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Hillock/HIL_86.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[351]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3966, 'HillockBargainAcceptedThree', '[]', 'I feel... happy...!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Hillock/HIL_87.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[351]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3967, 'HillockBargainAcceptedFour', '[]', 'This make any sense to you?', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Hillock/HIL_88.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[351]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3968, 'HillockBargainAcceptedFive', '[]', 'Treat ''em good, okay?', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Hillock/HIL_89.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[351]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3969, 'HillockOfferBetrayalZero', '[]', 'Boss talks down to me. Like I''m stupid. I''m not stupid. I''m NOT! Makes me SO ANGRY. Angry enough to bash them over and over again! I should be the boss, not them!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Hillock/HIL_90.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[351]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3970, 'HillockOfferBetrayalOne', '[]', 'The people in the Syndicate are afraid of me, they are. Know how good I can bash them. They''ll give me whatever I want or else. Want to see?', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Hillock/HIL_91.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[351]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3971, 'HillockOfferBetrayalTwo', '[]', 'I''m so angry right now Exile. Everything''s RED. I need to hear bones SNAPPING. Need to feel it in my FISTS! I don''t care who I break. Just tell me who. Tell me who!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Hillock/HIL_92.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[351]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3972, 'HillockOfferBetrayalThree', '[]', 'I''ll give the Syndicate here an option. I bash and bash and bash until I''m happy, or they tell you what you want to know. Then you let me go, okay?', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Hillock/HIL_93.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[351]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3973, 'HillockOfferBetrayalFour', '[]', 'Vagan''s too wriggly. Tried to catch him but he slipped away. Don''t let him slip away again. Might not get another chance!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Hillock/HIL_94.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[351]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3974, 'HillockOfferBetrayalFive', '[]', 'I think I could smash Guff into the ground like a fence post. Bet he''d do anything to get out of that. What do you think, little Exile?', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Hillock/HIL_95.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[351]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3975, 'HillockOfferBetrayalSix', '[]', 'Found Korell in my room praying to my forge. In MY room. I didn''t say he could do that! Makes me so ANGRY! Learn respect, Redblade! Teach him respect, Exile!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Hillock/HIL_96.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[351]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3976, 'HillockOfferBetrayalSeven', '[]', 'I want to break the mask off Maloney''s face, just to see how his skull cracks. Bet there''s a lot of good knowledge inside that skull.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Hillock/HIL_97.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[351]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3977, 'HillockOfferBetrayalEight', '[]', 'You bash well, Exile! Today we are friends. Let''s bash another one shall we? Yeah?', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Hillock/HIL_98.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[351]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3978, 'HillockOfferExecuteZero', '[]', 'Hate myself. Hate the Syndicate. Rather be dead.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Hillock/HIL_99.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[351]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3979, 'HillockOfferExecuteOne', '[]', 'Kill me now, or the boss kills me later. Dead either way.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Hillock/HIL_100.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[351]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3980, 'HillockOfferExecuteTwo', '[]', 'I will miss you, friend.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Hillock/HIL_101.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[351]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3981, 'HillockOfferExecuteThree', '[]', 'Rather be dead than go back to the dark.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Hillock/HIL_102.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[351]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3982, 'HillockReplyToBetrayalAcceptedZero', '[]', 'You... rrggghh... rrrrRRAAAGGHHH!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Hillock/HIL_103.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[351]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3983, 'HillockReplyToBetrayalAcceptedOne', '[]', 'You''re not my friend anymore, Leo Redmane.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Hillock/HIL_104.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[351]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3984, 'HillockReplyToBetrayalAcceptedTwo', '[]', 'Sleep with your eyes open, wild woman.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Hillock/HIL_105.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[351]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3985, 'HillockReplyToBetrayalAcceptedThree', '[]', 'Oh, Mutewind. I will BURY you for this.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Hillock/HIL_106.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[351]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3986, 'HillockReplyToBetrayalAcceptedFour', '[]', 'You... are awful! Bash you so hard you need to be scraped up!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Hillock/HIL_107.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[351]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3987, 'HillockReplyToBetrayalAcceptedFive', '[]', 'You don''t scare me, little mask boy. I''ll break you and all your little machines.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Hillock/HIL_108.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[351]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3988, 'HillockReplyToBetrayalAcceptedSix', '[]', 'Bad! You''re bad! Gonna bash you into RED MILK for this.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Hillock/HIL_109.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[351]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3989, 'HillockInterrogatedZero', '[]', 'Hate the dark!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Hillock/HIL_110.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[351]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3990, 'HillockInterrogatedOne', '[]', 'No, no, stop sending me to the dark!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Hillock/HIL_111.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[351]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3991, 'HillockInterrogatedTwo', '[]', 'So confusing, this Exile.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Hillock/HIL_112.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[351]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3992, 'HillockReplyToExecutionZero', '[]', 'Bye bye!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Hillock/HIL_113.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[351]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3993, 'HillockReplyToExecutionOne', '[]', 'Friend, no! NO!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Hillock/HIL_114.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[351]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3994, 'HillockReplyToExecutionTwo', '[]', 'Bwahahaha. Very messy.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Hillock/HIL_115.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[351]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3995, 'HillockSafehouseLeaderDefeatedZero', '[]', 'I don''t... understand... I was the boss...', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Hillock/HIL_116.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 10, 0, 1, '[351]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3996, 'HillockPrimaryDefenderStartsFightFifteen', '[]', 'You''ll need more than brawn to best us, brute!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/JunOrtoi/JO2_47.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[343]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3997, 'HillockEscape0Three', '[]', 'How did we lose to that bowl of rocks on a body?', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/JunOrtoi/JO2_74.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 4, 0, 1, '[343]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3998, 'HillockDefeatedTwelve', '[]', 'Brains over brawn, every time.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/JunOrtoi/JO2_64.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 9, 0, 1, '[343]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(3999, 'HillockBargainAcceptedSix', '[]', 'You surprise me, Hillock.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/JunOrtoi/JO2_85.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[343]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100);
INSERT INTO "NPCTextAudio" ("_row", "Id", "Characters", "Text", "Mono_AudioFile", "Stereo_AudioFile", "HasStereo", "__col6", "Video", "__col8", "__col9", "__col10", "NPCs", "NPCPortrait", "__col13", "__col14", "Cooldown", "__col16") VALUES
(4000, 'HillockInterrogatedThree', '[]', 'I hope this one can tell us something!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/JunOrtoi/JO2_102.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[343]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4001, 'HillockSecondaryDefenderArrivalThirtyTwo', '[]', 'Brute, wouldn''t it be more fun to bash everyone?', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/JunOrtoi/JO2_124.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[343]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4002, 'HillockSecondaryDefenderArrivalThirtyThree', '[]', 'You should have stayed dead, brute.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/JunOrtoi/JO_66.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[343]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4003, 'HillockReplyToSecondaryDefenderArrivalTen', '[]', 'The brute clearly doesn''t care.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/JunOrtoi/JO2_141.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[343]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4004, 'HillockReplyToSecondaryDefenderArrivalEleven', '[]', 'A brute with backup is twice as fearsome.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/JunOrtoi/JO2_158.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[343]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4005, 'HillockReplyToSecondaryDefenderArrivalTwelve', '[]', 'Brute, you take on more than you can handle.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/JunOrtoi/JO2_175.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[343]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4006, 'GraviciusPrimaryDefenderStartsFightZero', '[]', 'I serve a new God now, Exile.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Gravicius/GG_01.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[356]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4007, 'GraviciusPrimaryDefenderStartsFightOne', '[]', 'Man the defenses! Bring me the Exile''s head!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Gravicius/GG_02.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[356]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4008, 'GraviciusPrimaryDefenderStartsFightTwo', '[]', 'You dare desecrate these sacred grounds?', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Gravicius/GG_03.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[356]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4009, 'GraviciusPrimaryDefenderStartsFightThree', '[]', 'God tests our mettle! Protect the cargo!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Gravicius/GG_04.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[356]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4010, 'GraviciusPrimaryDefenderStartsFightFour', '[]', 'Had you been a little earlier, you would have made a fine subject for these experiments.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Gravicius/GG_05.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[356]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4011, 'GraviciusPrimaryDefenderStartsFightFive', '[]', 'God''s judgement awaits you!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Gravicius/GG_06.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[356]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4012, 'GraviciusPrimaryDefenderStartsFightSix', '[]', 'No prison can hold a true servant of God.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Gravicius/GG_07.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[356]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4013, 'GraviciusPrimaryDefenderStartsFightSeven', '[]', 'Ah, the bargainer! Let steel taste blood once more.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Gravicius/GG_08.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[356]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4014, 'GraviciusPrimaryDefenderStartsFightEight', '[]', 'Perhaps we''ll politick again, Exile, if you survive!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Gravicius/GG_09.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[356]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4015, 'GraviciusPrimaryDefenderStartsFightNine', '[]', 'A true servant of God can never be defeated. Your efforts are futile.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Gravicius/GG_10.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[356]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4016, 'GraviciusPrimaryDefenderStartsFightTen', '[]', 'I slew you, yet you return! I wonder how many times I''ll get to kill you?', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Gravicius/GG_11.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[356]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4017, 'GraviciusPrimaryDefenderStartsFightEleven', '[]', 'God''s might is granted to a chosen few. Witness!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Gravicius/GG_12.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[356]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4018, 'GraviciusPrimaryDefenderStartsFightTwelve', '[]', 'My legions are immortal.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Gravicius/GG_13.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[356]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4019, 'GraviciusPrimaryDefenderStartsFightThirteen', '[]', 'I will crush you!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Gravicius/GG_14.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[356]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4020, 'GraviciusPrimaryDefenderStartsFightFourteen', '[]', 'Charge into the fray!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Gravicius/GG_15.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[356]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4021, 'GraviciusPrimaryDefenderStartsFightFifteen', '[]', 'I shall purify you in the flame of God''s wrath!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Gravicius/GG_16.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[356]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4022, 'GraviciusSafehouseLeaderIntroZero', '[]', 'You dare foul this sanctuary? To the death!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Gravicius/GG_17.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[356]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4023, 'GraviciusSecondaryDefenderArrivalZero', '[]', 'These grounds will not be defiled!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Gravicius/GG_18.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[356]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4024, 'GraviciusSecondaryDefenderArrivalOne', '[]', 'Do your work. Protect the cargo!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Gravicius/GG_19.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[356]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4025, 'GraviciusSecondaryDefenderArrivalTwo', '[]', 'The work of the chosen must not be delayed.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Gravicius/GG_20.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[356]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4026, 'GraviciusSecondaryDefenderArrivalThree', '[]', 'God''s judgement is swift and final.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Gravicius/GG_21.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[356]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4027, 'GraviciusSecondaryDefenderArrivalFour', '[]', 'Worry not Exile, your doom is certain!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Gravicius/GG_22.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[356]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4028, 'GraviciusSecondaryDefenderArrivalFive', '[]', 'Time for me to clean up yet another of your messes, Karui.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Gravicius/GG_23.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[356]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4029, 'GraviciusSecondaryDefenderArrivalSix', '[]', 'The crusade never ends, brother. Allow me to aid you.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Gravicius/GG_24.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[356]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4030, 'GraviciusSecondaryDefenderArrivalSeven', '[]', 'Protect the noble bloodline!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Gravicius/GG_25.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[356]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4031, 'GraviciusSecondaryDefenderArrivalEight', '[]', 'Cameria, remember your lessons.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Gravicius/GG_26.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[356]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4032, 'GraviciusSecondaryDefenderArrivalNine', '[]', 'My new God appreciates your cruelty. I offer aid.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Gravicius/GG_27.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[356]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4033, 'GraviciusSecondaryDefenderArrivalTen', '[]', 'Time for me to clean up yet another of your messes.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Gravicius/GG_28.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[356]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4034, 'GraviciusSecondaryDefenderArrivalEleven', '[]', 'This sanctuary will not fall as long as I remain standing.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Gravicius/GG_29.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[356]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4035, 'GraviciusSecondaryDefenderArrivalTwelve', '[]', 'Walls under the command of a fool are no more than sand shaped by a child.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Gravicius/GG_30.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[356]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4036, 'GraviciusSecondaryDefenderArrivalThirteen', '[]', 'If the Syndicate wanted this cargo stolen, they certainly chose their defender well.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Gravicius/GG_31.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[356]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4037, 'GraviciusSecondaryDefenderArrivalFourteen', '[]', 'The best way to take down multiple enemies is to strike when they are fighting each other!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Gravicius/GG_32.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[356]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4038, 'GraviciusSecondaryDefenderArrivalFifteen', '[]', 'This victory shall be mine.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Gravicius/GG_33.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[356]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4039, 'GraviciusSecondaryDefenderArrivalSixteen', '[]', 'I shall put you in your place, Karui.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Gravicius/GG_34.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[356]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4040, 'GraviciusSecondaryDefenderArrivalSeventeen', '[]', 'Can you feel God''s disappointment in you, heretic?', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Gravicius/GG_35.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[356]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4041, 'GraviciusSecondaryDefenderArrivalEighteen', '[]', 'This world was made to be bent to Man''s will. As were you, little girl!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Gravicius/GG_36.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[356]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4042, 'GraviciusSecondaryDefenderArrivalNineteen', '[]', 'You think death is your weapon alone, boy, but you are dearly mistaken.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Gravicius/GG_37.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[356]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4043, 'GraviciusSecondaryDefenderArrivalTwenty', '[]', 'I wish you had listened, Cameria.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Gravicius/GG_38.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[356]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4044, 'GraviciusSecondaryDefenderArrivalTwentyOne', '[]', 'You''ve had your chance. Now a real leader must step in.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Gravicius/GG_39.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[356]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4045, 'GraviciusReplyToSecondaryDefenderArrivalZero', '[]', 'Luckily I have the skill to destroy all comers!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Gravicius/GG_40.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[356]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4046, 'GraviciusReplyToSecondaryDefenderArrivalOne', '[]', 'This cargo will not be yours, traitor!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Gravicius/GG_41.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[356]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4047, 'GraviciusReplyToSecondaryDefenderArrivalTwo', '[]', 'Careful, traitor, lest you end up a test subject at our next lab.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Gravicius/GG_42.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[356]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4048, 'GraviciusReplyToSecondaryDefenderArrivalThree', '[]', 'Just more souls to deliver to God!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Gravicius/GG_43.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[356]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4049, 'GraviciusReplyToSecondaryDefenderArrivalFour', '[]', 'I think not.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Gravicius/GG_44.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[356]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4050, 'GraviciusReplyToSecondaryDefenderArrivalFive', '[]', 'God becomes what we want him to be, and thus we can do no wrong in his name.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Gravicius/GG_45.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[356]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4051, 'GraviciusReplyToSecondaryDefenderArrivalSix', '[]', 'Mercy is not in me, assassin. Neither given, nor receivable.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Gravicius/GG_46.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[356]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4052, 'GraviciusReplyToSecondaryDefenderArrivalSeven', '[]', 'I know full well the golden blood of your line of traitors!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Gravicius/GG_47.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[356]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4053, 'GraviciusReplyToSecondaryDefenderArrivalEight', '[]', 'Sentari was a fool. If I had been there, the Ezomytes would have been cut down to the last man.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Gravicius/GG_48.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[356]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4054, 'GraviciusReplyToSecondaryDefenderArrivalNine', '[]', 'Disappointing, but not unexpected. Let my final lesson begin!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Gravicius/GG_49.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[356]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4055, 'GraviciusReplyToSecondaryDefenderArrivalTen', '[]', 'Be quiet.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Gravicius/GG_50.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[356]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4056, 'GraviciusSecondaryDefenderArrivalTwentyTwo', '[]', 'Now we cannot fail!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Gravicius/GG_51.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[356]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4057, 'GraviciusSecondaryDefenderArrivalTwentyThree', '[]', 'This cargo will not be yours, Exile!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Gravicius/GG_52.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[356]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4058, 'GraviciusSecondaryDefenderArrivalTwentyFour', '[]', 'You''ll never succeed now, Exile.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Gravicius/GG_53.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[356]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4059, 'GraviciusSecondaryDefenderArrivalTwentyFive', '[]', 'You are doomed now, Exile!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Gravicius/GG_54.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[356]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4060, 'GraviciusSecondaryDefenderArrivalTwentySix', '[]', 'And so you find yourself in your destined role, Karui: under my command!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Gravicius/GG_55.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[356]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4061, 'GraviciusSecondaryDefenderArrivalTwentySeven', '[]', 'God promised immortality, Elreon, but the Eternal One delivered. This is my crusade now.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Gravicius/GG_56.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[356]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4062, 'GraviciusSecondaryDefenderArrivalTwentyEight', '[]', 'You were born a weapon, Hillock, and I will wield you on behalf of the Syndicate.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Gravicius/GG_57.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[356]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4063, 'GraviciusSecondaryDefenderArrivalTwentyNine', '[]', 'It is good that you believe ''might makes right,'' Thane. That means we agree I should be in charge here.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Gravicius/GG_58.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[356]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4064, 'GraviciusSecondaryDefenderArrivalThirty', '[]', 'Bend your carving to the will of warfare, Aisling.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Gravicius/GG_59.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[356]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4065, 'GraviciusSecondaryDefenderArrivalThirtyOne', '[]', 'This is my crusade to lead now.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Gravicius/GG_60.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[356]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4066, 'GraviciusKillPlayerZero', '[]', 'You will never achieve victory fighting only for yourself.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Gravicius/GG_61.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 8, 0, 1, '[356]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4067, 'GraviciusKillPlayerOne', '[]', 'Secure the cargo, and make sure that one is fully dead.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Gravicius/GG_62.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 8, 0, 1, '[356]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4068, 'GraviciusKillPlayerTwo', '[]', 'Pile this carcass with the others.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Gravicius/GG_63.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 8, 0, 1, '[356]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4069, 'GraviciusKillPlayerThree', '[]', 'You brought this on yourself.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Gravicius/GG_64.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 8, 0, 1, '[356]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4070, 'GraviciusEscapeZero', '[]', 'God''s plan continues apace. Until next time, Exile.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Gravicius/GG_65.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 4, 0, 1, '[356]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4071, 'GraviciusEscapeOne', '[]', 'There shall be no prize for you this day.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Gravicius/GG_66.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 4, 0, 1, '[356]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4072, 'GraviciusEscapeTwo', '[]', 'A pity, Exile. You were so close.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Gravicius/GG_67.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 4, 0, 1, '[356]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4073, 'GraviciusDefeatedZero', '[]', 'Is no defense enough?', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Gravicius/GG_68.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 9, 0, 1, '[356]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4074, 'GraviciusDefeatedOne', '[]', 'You brute!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Gravicius/GG_69.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 9, 0, 1, '[356]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4075, 'GraviciusDefeatedTwo', '[]', 'You are no thing of God!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Gravicius/GG_70.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 9, 0, 1, '[356]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4076, 'GraviciusDefeatedThree', '[]', 'How is this possible?', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Gravicius/GG_71.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 9, 0, 1, '[356]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4077, 'GraviciusDefeatedFour', '[]', 'The flesh can be bound and shackled, but faith will persevere in the end.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Gravicius/GG_72.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 9, 0, 1, '[356]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4078, 'GraviciusDefeatedFive', '[]', 'More deals, Exile?', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Gravicius/GG_73.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 9, 0, 1, '[356]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4079, 'GraviciusDefeatedSix', '[]', 'Wait, wait!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Gravicius/GG_74.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 9, 0, 1, '[356]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4080, 'GraviciusDefeatedSeven', '[]', 'I shall die a thousand times if needed!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Gravicius/GG_75.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 9, 0, 1, '[356]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4081, 'GraviciusDefeatedEight', '[]', 'Turnabout is fair play.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Gravicius/GG_76.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 9, 0, 1, '[356]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4082, 'GraviciusDefeatedNine', '[]', 'I don''t have to win every battle to win the war.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Gravicius/GG_77.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 9, 0, 1, '[356]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4083, 'GraviciusDefeatedTen', '[]', 'Just a small misstep on the inevitable path to salvation.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Gravicius/GG_78.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 9, 0, 1, '[356]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4084, 'GraviciusOfferBargainZero', '[]', 'You''ve made your show of force, savage. I submit, and entreat you to bargain in exchange for my life.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Gravicius/GG_79.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[356]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4085, 'GraviciusOfferBargainOne', '[]', 'You are clearly superior. I admit defeat. Perhaps you would wrest from me a political reward? I''ll bring on a fellow Syndicate member to this job at your behest. Perhaps someone weak, and easily exploitable.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Gravicius/GG_80.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[356]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4086, 'GraviciusOfferBargainTwo', '[]', 'I care not who I deceive in the pursuit of my goal. The Syndicate is full of Godless heretics seeking to evade eternal judgement.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Gravicius/GG_81.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[356]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4087, 'GraviciusOfferBargainThree', '[]', 'Ah, I see your plans, Exile. You want to reorganize the Syndicate for your own reasons. Perhaps our goals align? I wish to stay alive for the moment, and you - what do you want?', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Gravicius/GG_82.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[356]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4088, 'GraviciusOfferBargainFour', '[]', 'I''ve been blind to the Syndicate''s heresy for far too long. I am done with it. My only escape from the Eternal One is to remain alive. If you kill me, I''ll just rise again, deeper in the Syndicate''s clutches.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Gravicius/GG_83.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[356]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4089, 'GraviciusOfferBargainFive', '[]', 'Strategic knowledge is the key to warfare. Spare me this time and I''ll tell you what I know.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Gravicius/GG_84.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[356]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4090, 'GraviciusOfferBargainSix', '[]', 'I prefer not to rely overmuch on the Eternal One''s resurrection. Debts quickly become chains. Would you accept material reward in exchange for sparing me?', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Gravicius/GG_85.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[356]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4091, 'GraviciusBargainAcceptedZero', '[]', 'That serves my plans quite well.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Gravicius/GG_86.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[356]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4092, 'GraviciusBargainAcceptedOne', '[]', 'One heathen is as good as another.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Gravicius/GG_87.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[356]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4093, 'GraviciusBargainAcceptedTwo', '[]', 'You are a wonderful pawn, Exile.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Gravicius/GG_88.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[356]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4094, 'GraviciusBargainAcceptedThree', '[]', 'Solitary prayer shall guide me, in time.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Gravicius/GG_89.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[356]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4095, 'GraviciusBargainAcceptedFour', '[]', 'Now you know what I wish you to know.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Gravicius/GG_90.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[356]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4096, 'GraviciusBargainAcceptedFive', '[]', 'Drive the Syndicate into a corner and enrage it.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Gravicius/GG_91.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[356]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4097, 'GraviciusOfferBetrayalZero', '[]', 'I always make sure to keep watch for an advantage over my superior officers. I know something that the Eternal One would very much like to hear about...', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Gravicius/GG_92.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[356]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4098, 'GraviciusOfferBetrayalOne', '[]', 'You could kill me here and now, or I could spread certain rumors that would undermine the positions of my fellows.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Gravicius/GG_93.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[356]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4099, 'GraviciusOfferBetrayalTwo', '[]', 'I don''t see God after death, Exile. Not when the Eternal One brings me back. I''d prefer not to die if it can be avoided, and I have the political clout to lie to my superiors and get one of my fellows here excommunicated from the Syndicate. Care to make a deal?', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Gravicius/GG_94.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[356]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4100, 'GraviciusOfferBetrayalThree', '[]', 'I can''t afford to die right now. I can offer knowledge in exchange. I will tell you everything I know about my fellows.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Gravicius/GG_95.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[356]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4101, 'GraviciusOfferBetrayalFour', '[]', 'It is in my power to ruin another if you''ll let me live, and I have no qualms over the fate of a Karui.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Gravicius/GG_96.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[356]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4102, 'GraviciusOfferBetrayalFive', '[]', 'I have reason to doubt Elreon''s faith, and I have long worked to gather leverage over him. Let me live, and I shall show you.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Gravicius/GG_97.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[356]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4103, 'GraviciusOfferBetrayalSix', '[]', 'That pathetic excuse for a man is not worthy of the Perandus name. You and I must betray him before he turns on us.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Gravicius/GG_98.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[356]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4104, 'GraviciusOfferBetrayalSeven', '[]', 'That thing is no creation of God, Man, or Beast. Let me live, and we can both work against it.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Gravicius/GG_99.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[356]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4105, 'GraviciusOfferBetrayalEight', '[]', 'You would do wise not to kill me. Cameria is just like me, but without refinement. He is a greater threat.	 God''s plan does not include the weak or the corrupt. Let me live, and I can work against them.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Gravicius/GG_100.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[356]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4106, 'GraviciusOfferExecuteZero', '[]', 'Death holds no terror for me, Exile. It is you who should fear.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Gravicius/GG_101.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[356]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4107, 'GraviciusOfferExecuteOne', '[]', 'For the Syndicate, I give my life!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Gravicius/GG_102.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[356]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4108, 'GraviciusOfferExecuteTwo', '[]', 'Stay strong, comrade. This Exile can inflict no worse than death.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Gravicius/GG_103.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[356]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4109, 'GraviciusOfferExecuteThree', '[]', 'No more prisons. You will have to slay me.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Gravicius/GG_104.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[356]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4110, 'GraviciusReplyToBetrayalAcceptedZero', '[]', 'Traitorous scum!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Gravicius/GG_105.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[356]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4111, 'GraviciusReplyToBetrayalAcceptedOne', '[]', 'I didn''t think you had the nerve to risk my wrath - Haku.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Gravicius/GG_106.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[356]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4112, 'GraviciusReplyToBetrayalAcceptedTwo', '[]', 'It is always a turncoat who suffers the harshest of God''s punishments. I do not envy the fate that awaits you.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Gravicius/GG_107.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[356]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4113, 'GraviciusReplyToBetrayalAcceptedThree', '[]', 'Oh, Perandus, thy name is liar.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Gravicius/GG_108.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[356]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4114, 'GraviciusReplyToBetrayalAcceptedFour', '[]', 'I should have expected this from an Ezomyte heretic.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Gravicius/GG_109.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[356]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4115, 'GraviciusReplyToBetrayalAcceptedFive', '[]', 'We will talk about this later.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Gravicius/GG_110.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[356]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4116, 'GraviciusReplyToBetrayalAcceptedSix', '[]', 'I will enjoy breaking you.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Gravicius/GG_111.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[356]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4117, 'GraviciusInterrogatedZero', '[]', 'A true servant of God is no stranger to the Inquisition. I have nothing to hide.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Gravicius/GG_112.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[356]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4118, 'GraviciusInterrogatedOne', '[]', 'I shall stand strong no matter how many times I face an Inquisition.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Gravicius/GG_113.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[356]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4119, 'GraviciusInterrogatedTwo', '[]', 'No deal this time? I underestimated your resolve, Exile.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Gravicius/GG_114.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[356]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4120, 'GraviciusReplyToExecutionZero', '[]', 'Death is simply the way of this land. Get on with it, Exile.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Gravicius/GG_115.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[356]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4121, 'GraviciusReplyToExecutionOne', '[]', 'Fool! Do not disrupt God''s plan!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Gravicius/GG_116.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[356]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4122, 'GraviciusReplyToExecutionTwo', '[]', 'I cannot claim sorrow for that fool.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Gravicius/GG_117.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[356]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4123, 'GraviciusSafehouseLeaderDefeatedZero', '[]', 'Bring your Inquisition, Exile. I guarantee I''ve personally run far worse than your darkest imagining.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Gravicius/GG_118.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 10, 0, 1, '[356]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4124, 'GraviciusPrimaryDefenderStartsFightSixteen', '[]', 'Has failure taught you nothing, General?', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/JunOrtoi/JO2_36.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[343]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4125, 'GraviciusReplyToExecutionThree', '[]', 'Last chance, General...', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/JunOrtoi/JO2_114.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 4, 0, 1, '[343]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4126, 'GraviciusDefeatedTwelve', '[]', 'On your knees, General.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/JunOrtoi/JO2_55.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 9, 0, 1, '[343]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4127, 'GraviciusBargainAcceptedSix', '[]', 'A truce... for now.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/JunOrtoi/JO2_78.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[343]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4128, 'GraviciusInterrogatedThree', '[]', 'I will enjoy watching you break, Gravicius.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/JunOrtoi/JO2_93.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[343]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4129, 'GraviciusSecondaryDefenderArrivalThirtyTwo', '[]', 'The General is a renowned monster. This is no surprise.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/JunOrtoi/JO2_125.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[343]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4130, 'GraviciusSecondaryDefenderArrivalThirtyThree', '[]', 'Has death taught you nothing, General?', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/JunOrtoi/JO_67.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[343]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4131, 'GraviciusReplyToSecondaryDefenderArrivalEleven', '[]', 'Good, yes, good. Turn against the General.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/JunOrtoi/JO2_142.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[343]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4132, 'GraviciusReplyToSecondaryDefenderArrivalTwelve', '[]', 'The little General needs aid, does he?', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/JunOrtoi/JO2_159.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[343]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4133, 'GraviciusReplyToSecondaryDefenderArrivalThirteen', '[]', 'Exile, take out the General before he can rally these fools to order!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/JunOrtoi/JO2_176.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[343]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4134, 'RikerPrimaryDefenderStartsFightZero', '[]', 'More meddling in my marvelous machinations?', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Riker/RM_1.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[362]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4135, 'RikerPrimaryDefenderStartsFightOne', '[]', 'Look at what limps into my lovely lair.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Riker/RM_2.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[362]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4136, 'RikerPrimaryDefenderStartsFightTwo', '[]', 'Filthy fleshy failures. Follow this.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Riker/RM_3.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[362]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4137, 'RikerPrimaryDefenderStartsFightThree', '[]', 'Wanderer, what wonders you will witness...', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Riker/RM_4.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[362]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4138, 'RikerPrimaryDefenderStartsFightFour', '[]', 'Stop struggling and slip into silence...', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Riker/RM_5.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[362]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4139, 'RikerPrimaryDefenderStartsFightFive', '[]', 'I long for that cell. Such sweet silence. Silencing you will have to suffice.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Riker/RM_6.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[362]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4140, 'RikerPrimaryDefenderStartsFightSix', '[]', 'Our past partnership was a debacle I dare not duplicate.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Riker/RM_7.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[362]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4141, 'RikerPrimaryDefenderStartsFightSeven', '[]', 'Past sins are past. Dance with me, darling.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Riker/RM_8.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[362]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4142, 'RikerPrimaryDefenderStartsFightEight', '[]', 'Death was such a gift. Allow me to pay it forward.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Riker/RM_9.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[362]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4143, 'RikerPrimaryDefenderStartsFightNine', '[]', 'An Exile, slain, returns, reaping regret repeatedly.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Riker/RM_10.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[362]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4144, 'RikerPrimaryDefenderStartsFightTen', '[]', 'An Exile, slain, returns. Ugh, what a shame.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Riker/RM_11.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[362]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4145, 'RikerPrimaryDefenderStartsFightEleven', '[]', 'I am no brawler, but even I can browbeat the best of them with brawn like this!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Riker/RM_12.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[362]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4146, 'RikerPrimaryDefenderStartsFightTwelve', '[]', 'The ground shall grow a garden of gristle.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Riker/RM_13.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[362]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4147, 'RikerPrimaryDefenderStartsFightThirteen', '[]', 'No eloquence for this fight, exile. Just raw power!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Riker/RM_14.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[362]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4148, 'RikerPrimaryDefenderStartsFightFourteen', '[]', 'Swiftly shall I sweep this skirmish for the Syndicate!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Riker/RM_15.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[362]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4149, 'RikerPrimaryDefenderStartsFightFifteen', '[]', 'For the Syndicate, I shall sweep this skirmish swiftly!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Riker/RM_16.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[362]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4150, 'RikerPrimaryDefenderStartsFightSixteen', '[]', 'Relics render one rather robust, wouldn''t you say?', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Riker/RM_17.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[362]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4151, 'RikerSafehouseLeaderIntroZero', '[]', 'Impressive, interloper. But a fly does not flee the spider''s snare so swiftly.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Riker/RM_18.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[362]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4152, 'RikerSecondaryDefenderArrivalZero', '[]', 'Hold your head high, friend. Help is here.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Riker/RM_19.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[362]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4153, 'RikerSecondaryDefenderArrivalOne', '[]', 'Don''t dally. Duty calls!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Riker/RM_20.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[362]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4154, 'RikerSecondaryDefenderArrivalTwo', '[]', 'Eradicate the explorers, then seal this sanctum.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Riker/RM_21.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[362]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4155, 'RikerSecondaryDefenderArrivalThree', '[]', 'Let''s hasten this hatchet job!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Riker/RM_22.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[362]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4156, 'RikerSecondaryDefenderArrivalFour', '[]', 'Inspire me with your ichors.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Riker/RM_23b.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[362]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4157, 'RikerSecondaryDefenderArrivalFive', '[]', 'Each cog must turn if the machine is to work.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Riker/RM_24.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[362]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4158, 'RikerSecondaryDefenderArrivalSix', '[]', 'Careful around my traps, Leo, lest you lose the other limb!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Riker/RM_25.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[362]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4159, 'RikerSecondaryDefenderArrivalSeven', '[]', 'Only a Perandus could appreciate the complexity of my machinations.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Riker/RM_26.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[362]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4160, 'RikerSecondaryDefenderArrivalEight', '[]', 'Hillock! I''ll hem them in, you bash ''em!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Riker/RM_27.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[362]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4161, 'RikerSecondaryDefenderArrivalNine', '[]', 'Show ''em what Ogham men can do, Jorgin!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Riker/RM_28.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[362]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4162, 'RikerSecondaryDefenderArrivalTen', '[]', 'Korell, we''re even after this.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Riker/RM_29.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[362]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4163, 'RikerSecondaryDefenderArrivalEleven', '[]', 'A bear trap requires at least two jaws.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Riker/RM_30.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[362]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4164, 'RikerSecondaryDefenderArrivalTwelve', '[]', 'Time to reorganize some of the gears in this diabolic machine.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Riker/RM_31.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[362]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4165, 'RikerSecondaryDefenderArrivalThirteen', '[]', 'Such inefficiency cannot go unaddressed.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Riker/RM_32.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[362]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4166, 'RikerSecondaryDefenderArrivalFourteen', '[]', 'The Syndicate seeks to shroud its secrets, even from us.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Riker/RM_33.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[362]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4167, 'RikerSecondaryDefenderArrivalFifteen', '[]', 'Do you never pause to question the machine?', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Riker/RM_34.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[362]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4168, 'RikerSecondaryDefenderArrivalSixteen', '[]', 'Nothing against you, crusader, you''re just in the way.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Riker/RM_35.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[362]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4169, 'RikerSecondaryDefenderArrivalSeventeen', '[]', 'Tora! Time for another round!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Riker/RM_36.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[362]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4170, 'RikerSecondaryDefenderArrivalEighteen', '[]', 'Mind or might, Vagan? I wonder which will win.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Riker/RM_37.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[362]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4171, 'RikerSecondaryDefenderArrivalNineteen', '[]', 'I wonder what you could offer me to spare your life, Perandus.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Riker/RM_38.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[362]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4172, 'RikerSecondaryDefenderArrivalTwenty', '[]', 'How much can fury make up for skill, Redblade?', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Riker/RM_39.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[362]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4173, 'RikerSecondaryDefenderArrivalTwentyOne', '[]', 'Despise the machinist, not the machine.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Riker/RM_40.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[362]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4174, 'RikerReplyToSecondaryDefenderArrivalZero', '[]', 'My defense plans already included your betrayal.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Riker/RM_41.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[362]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4175, 'RikerReplyToSecondaryDefenderArrivalOne', '[]', 'Really? Here? Now? You could have chosen your move so much better.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Riker/RM_42.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[362]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4176, 'RikerReplyToSecondaryDefenderArrivalTwo', '[]', 'This is neither the time nor the place.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Riker/RM_43.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[362]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4177, 'RikerReplyToSecondaryDefenderArrivalThree', '[]', 'How can I get anything done with the constant infighting?', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Riker/RM_44.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[362]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4178, 'RikerReplyToSecondaryDefenderArrivalFour', '[]', 'And I''ve learned never to trust a former Templar.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Riker/RM_45.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[362]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4179, 'RikerReplyToSecondaryDefenderArrivalFive', '[]', 'Wouldn''t have it any other way, old friend.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Riker/RM_46.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[362]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4180, 'RikerReplyToSecondaryDefenderArrivalSix', '[]', 'It''s a fine free-floating gear, this Syndicate. Round and round we go, getting nowhere.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Riker/RM_47.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[362]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4181, 'RikerReplyToSecondaryDefenderArrivalSeven', '[]', 'We''ll match wits, Rin, but don''t be surprised at the outcome.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Riker/RM_48.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[362]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4182, 'RikerReplyToSecondaryDefenderArrivalEight', '[]', 'The mask isn''t for my protection. It''s for yours, Cameria.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Riker/RM_49.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[362]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4183, 'RikerReplyToSecondaryDefenderArrivalNine', '[]', 'If you want to kill me, you''ll have to catch me.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Riker/RM_50.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[362]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4184, 'RikerSecondaryDefenderArrivalTwentyTwo', '[]', 'The cogs turn, crushing exiles between their teeth.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Riker/RM_51.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[362]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4185, 'RikerSecondaryDefenderArrivalTwentyThree', '[]', 'Power shields itself rather wonderfully, wouldn''t you say?', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Riker/RM_52.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[362]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4186, 'RikerSecondaryDefenderArrivalTwentyFour', '[]', 'I doubt even our dear leader truly knows what happened here.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Riker/RM_53.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[362]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4187, 'RikerSecondaryDefenderArrivalTwentyFive', '[]', 'If the gears clash, apply more force.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Riker/RM_54.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[362]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4188, 'RikerSecondaryDefenderArrivalTwentySix', '[]', 'Flair is what marks the difference between artistry and mere competence.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Riker/RM_55.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[362]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4189, 'RikerSecondaryDefenderArrivalTwentySeven', '[]', 'The Syndicate has your back, Vagan.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Riker/RM_56.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[362]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4190, 'RikerSecondaryDefenderArrivalTwentyEight', '[]', 'You simply cannot stay out of trouble, can you Janus?', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Riker/RM_57.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[362]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4191, 'RikerSecondaryDefenderArrivalTwentyNine', '[]', 'Can you take orders, Hillock?', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Riker/RM_58.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[362]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4192, 'RikerSecondaryDefenderArrivalThirty', '[]', 'Do what you do Cameria. No orders needed.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Riker/RM_59.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[362]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4193, 'RikerSecondaryDefenderArrivalThirtyOne', '[]', 'It seems tactics and cunning are sorely needed here.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Riker/RM_60.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[362]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4194, 'RikerKillPlayerZero', '[]', 'Off the gears you fall, Exile, whipping into darkness, drained of life by the vampire Time.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Riker/RM_61.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 8, 0, 1, '[362]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4195, 'RikerKillPlayerOne', '[]', 'Your grand theft was automatically doomed to fail the moment you challenged me.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Riker/RM_62.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 8, 0, 1, '[362]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4196, 'RikerKillPlayerTwo', '[]', 'This house of splattered corpses masks the true terror of the Syndicate.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Riker/RM_63.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 8, 0, 1, '[362]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4197, 'RikerKillPlayerThree', '[]', 'You should never challenge an immortal to combat. I will finish you every time.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Riker/RM_64.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 8, 0, 1, '[362]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4198, 'RikerEscapeZero', '[]', 'The mechanism just keeps on grinding me toward the top.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Riker/RM_65.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 4, 0, 1, '[362]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4199, 'RikerEscapeOne', '[]', 'You rode close on your carousel, Exile, but you never actually had a chance to touch this treasure.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Riker/RM_66.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 4, 0, 1, '[362]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4200, 'RikerEscapeTwo', '[]', 'The plentiful perversions of this place will never be exposed now.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Riker/RM_67.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 4, 0, 1, '[362]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4201, 'RikerDefeatedZero', '[]', 'Defender... down...', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Riker/RM_68.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 9, 0, 1, '[362]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4202, 'RikerDefeatedOne', '[]', 'Do not... seek... the source...', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Riker/RM_69.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 9, 0, 1, '[362]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4203, 'RikerDefeatedTwo', '[]', 'Not in this place of filth!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Riker/RM_70.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 9, 0, 1, '[362]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4204, 'RikerDefeatedThree', '[]', 'I should have known better.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Riker/RM_71.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 9, 0, 1, '[362]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4205, 'RikerDefeatedFour', '[]', 'Back to the silence, I take it.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Riker/RM_72.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 9, 0, 1, '[362]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4206, 'RikerDefeatedFive', '[]', 'Wait... again, we can arrive at an accord...', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Riker/RM_73.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 9, 0, 1, '[362]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4207, 'RikerDefeatedSix', '[]', 'I''ll not become known as Riker the Betrayer.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Riker/RM_74.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 9, 0, 1, '[362]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4208, 'RikerDefeatedSeven', '[]', 'Every time you kill me I just come back stronger.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Riker/RM_75.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 9, 0, 1, '[362]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4209, 'RikerDefeatedEight', '[]', 'A leap of progress, unpredicted...', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Riker/RM_76.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 9, 0, 1, '[362]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4210, 'RikerDefeatedNine', '[]', 'It is possible to commit no mistakes and still lose.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Riker/RM_77.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 9, 0, 1, '[362]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4211, 'RikerDefeatedTen', '[]', 'It''s not like me to make mistakes.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Riker/RM_78.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 9, 0, 1, '[362]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4212, 'RikerOfferBargainZero', '[]', 'A savage slaying, if I say so. I seek to circumvent a similar sentence. Tell me what it is you desire.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Riker/RM_79.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[362]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4213, 'RikerOfferBargainOne', '[]', 'The more tightly fit the cogs, the more efficient the machine. Choose the right cogs, and the machine may work in your favour. Choose the wrong ones, and... well... just don''t choose the wrong ones.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Riker/RM_80.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[362]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4214, 'RikerOfferBargainTwo', '[]', 'There is much to be learned by watching the cogs turn. Even more with a little deconstruction. I have a certain cog in mind... allow me this, and in return, I will give you a glimpse of the machine''s inner workings.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Riker/RM_81.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[362]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4215, 'RikerOfferBargainThree', '[]', 'In this vast callous machine, one cog is indistinguishable from another. Switch two and soon you will see what I mean.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Riker/RM_82.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[362]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4216, 'RikerOfferBargainFour', '[]', 'There is only one escape from the Syndicate, Exile: staying alive. Let me go, so that I may flee, and in so doing escape this unending machine whose only product is human misery.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Riker/RM_83.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[362]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4217, 'RikerOfferBargainFive', '[]', 'Would you like to know how this cog fits into the grand machine, or do you plan on simply destroying it?', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Riker/RM_84.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[362]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4218, 'RikerOfferBargainSix', '[]', 'I wonder: what havoc could you wreak in these works with the right wrench?', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Riker/RM_85.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[362]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4219, 'RikerBargainAcceptedZero', '[]', 'The gears still rotate, but the pattern is new.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Riker/RM_86.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[362]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4220, 'RikerBargainAcceptedOne', '[]', 'Just a glimpse, Exile... just a glimpse.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Riker/RM_87.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[362]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4221, 'RikerBargainAcceptedTwo', '[]', 'Watch as the production of misery and pain continues unabated.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Riker/RM_88.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[362]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4222, 'RikerBargainAcceptedThree', '[]', 'To live free, to dream, only to return to the Syndicate upon death... goodbye for now, Exile.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Riker/RM_89.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[362]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4223, 'RikerBargainAcceptedFour', '[]', 'And now you see that I am but one piece in a relentless uncaring machine.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Riker/RM_90.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[362]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4224, 'RikerBargainAcceptedFive', '[]', 'Go, Exile. Wreak havoc.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Riker/RM_91.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[362]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4225, 'RikerOfferBetrayalZero', '[]', 'There''s an opportunity here. I could play this situation on my end to supplant my current overlord. That might alter - that might alter the Syndicate''s workings in your favour. What are your thoughts?', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Riker/RM_92.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[362]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4226, 'RikerOfferBetrayalOne', '[]', 'Push others down, promote myself. It''s the simple result of a complicated plan. Spare my life - I''m on the verge of implementing it.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Riker/RM_93.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[362]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4227, 'RikerOfferBetrayalTwo', '[]', 'Killing me now would not be ideal. I was just about to implement a plan to completely eject someone from the Syndicate machine and watch as it struggles to lurch onwards. Would you care to choose the victim in exchange for my survival?', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Riker/RM_94.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[362]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4228, 'RikerOfferBetrayalThree', '[]', 'I''ve made quite sure I know enough to save myself. Would you like large amounts of intelligence about each of my fellows? In exchange for my life, of course.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Riker/RM_95.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[362]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4229, 'RikerOfferBetrayalFour', '[]', 'Vagan is a buffoon. A blowhard. A brat. A baboon who''s never not in heat. He adds nothing of value to the Syndicate or this world. Get rid of him.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Riker/RM_96.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[362]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4230, 'RikerOfferBetrayalFive', '[]', 'You''re not truly going to punish me when Hillock could be brought to justice, are you?', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Riker/RM_97.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[362]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4231, 'RikerOfferBetrayalSix', '[]', 'The Redblade''s destructive tendencies stretch far beyond the Syndicate''s goals. We can contain him only as much as we can contain the fires he creates. Better to extinguish him now.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Riker/RM_98.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[362]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4232, 'RikerOfferBetrayalSeven', '[]', 'Cameria''s bloody slaughter needs to stop, and no one else has offered to take the necessary action. Allow me to do something about him.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Riker/RM_99.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[362]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4233, 'RikerOfferBetrayalEight', '[]', 'Aisling... no words can encapsulate the terrible things she is capable of. She is a truly terrifying sadist. You and I need to work together to put her down.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Riker/RM_100.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[362]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4234, 'RikerOfferBetrayalNine', '[]', 'All part of the grand game. It''s your move.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Riker/RM_101.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[362]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4235, 'RikerOfferExecuteZero', '[]', 'I''m afraid the only option here, for me, is execution.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Riker/RM_102.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[362]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4236, 'RikerOfferExecuteOne', '[]', 'The Syndicate must see that I am loyal enough to die for it.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Riker/RM_103.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[362]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4237, 'RikerOfferExecuteTwo', '[]', 'I die in front of my fellows, only to rise again in service to the Syndicate.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Riker/RM_104.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[362]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4238, 'RikerOfferExecuteThree', '[]', 'I think I''ll skip the interrogation and choose death instead.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Riker/RM_105.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[362]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4239, 'RikerReplyToBetrayalAcceptedZero', '[]', 'An expected maneuver!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Riker/RM_106.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[362]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4240, 'RikerReplyToBetrayalAcceptedOne', '[]', 'You forget that your Templar leaders wear masks, too, Elreon. Perhaps for the same reason?', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Riker/RM_107.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[362]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4241, 'RikerReplyToBetrayalAcceptedTwo', '[]', 'I apologise that that''s the impression you got, Guff. But for this, you understand, I must seek reprisal.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Riker/RM_108.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[362]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4242, 'RikerReplyToBetrayalAcceptedThree', '[]', 'I''ll get you back for this. Mark my words, Hillock.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Riker/RM_109.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[362]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4243, 'RikerReplyToBetrayalAcceptedFour', '[]', 'I had no plans in mind for you, Rin. That will change.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Riker/RM_110.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[362]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4244, 'RikerReplyToBetrayalAcceptedFive', '[]', 'Be careful where you step from now on, traitor. One trap is all it takes.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Riker/RM_111.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[362]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4245, 'RikerInterrogatedZero', '[]', 'You will only garner from me that which I wish you to know.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Riker/RM_112.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[362]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4246, 'RikerInterrogatedOne', '[]', 'This cycle of interrogation is as futile and fruitless as this foolish Syndicate.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Riker/RM_113.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[362]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4247, 'RikerInterrogatedTwo', '[]', 'Bargaining and interrogation are all the same, in the end.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Riker/RM_114.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[362]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4248, 'RikerReplyToExecutionZero', '[]', 'I am well acquainted with death, but I must admit there is still a visceral terror associated with witnessing it.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Riker/RM_115.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[362]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4249, 'RikerReplyToExecutionOne', '[]', 'I needed them. You''ve made a mistake.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Riker/RM_116.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[362]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4250, 'RikerReplyToExecutionTwo', '[]', 'Yes, Exile, you behaved exactly as I hoped.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Riker/RM_117.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[362]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4251, 'RikerSafehouseLeaderDefeatedZero', '[]', 'This... was not in the plan...!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Riker/RM_118.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 10, 0, 1, '[362]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4252, 'RikerPrimaryDefenderStartsFightSeventeen', '[]', 'Do I know you? You wear a mask, but your eyes...', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/JunOrtoi/JO2_50.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[343]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4253, 'RikerEscapeThree', '[]', 'He planned for this. He expected our interference!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/JunOrtoi/JO2_77.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 4, 0, 1, '[343]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4254, 'RikerDefeatedEleven', '[]', 'Leave the mask on. I don''t care who he is.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/JunOrtoi/JO2_68.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 9, 0, 1, '[343]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4255, 'RikerBargainAcceptedSix', '[]', 'Somehow, trusting this ''Riker Maloney'' feels like a mistake... but I see no better option right now.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/JunOrtoi/JO2_88.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[343]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4256, 'RikerInterrogatedThree', '[]', 'You may despise the machine, rogue, but you''ll hate my prison even more.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/JunOrtoi/JO2_105.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[343]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4257, 'RikerSecondaryDefenderArrivalThirtyTwo', '[]', 'Help us smash the machine you despise so much, rogue!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/JunOrtoi/JO2_131.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[343]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4258, 'RikerSecondaryDefenderArrivalThirtyThree', '[]', 'Humanity has left you, Riker. What is left to fight for?', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/JunOrtoi/JO_73.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[343]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4259, 'RikerReplyToSecondaryDefenderArrivalTen', '[]', 'You don''t seem surprised, rogue.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/JunOrtoi/JO2_148.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[343]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4260, 'RikerReplyToSecondaryDefenderArrivalEleven', '[]', 'All part of your machinations, rogue?', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/JunOrtoi/JO2_165.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[343]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4261, 'RikerReplyToSecondaryDefenderArrivalTwelve', '[]', 'The rogue eyes a new step in his plan. Let us disappoint him!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/JunOrtoi/JO2_182.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[343]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4262, 'KorellPrimaryDefenderStartsFightZero', '[]', 'So, you''re the Exile. I hope you can take some heat.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Korell/KG_1.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[358]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4263, 'KorellPrimaryDefenderStartsFightOne', '[]', 'Only a fool braves a Redblade''s encampment!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Korell/KG_2.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[358]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4264, 'KorellPrimaryDefenderStartsFightTwo', '[]', 'Lay a hand on this cargo, Exile, and you''ll pull it back blackened.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Korell/KG_3.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[358]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4265, 'KorellPrimaryDefenderStartsFightThree', '[]', 'The Exile approaches. Burn the evidence!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Korell/KG_4.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[358]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4266, 'KorellPrimaryDefenderStartsFightFour', '[]', 'Incinerating you will be as easy as snapping my fingers.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Korell/KG_5.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[358]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4267, 'KorellPrimaryDefenderStartsFightFive', '[]', 'Let''s be civil this time. No more imprisonment. Just death and politics.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Korell/KG_6.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[358]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4268, 'KorellPrimaryDefenderStartsFightSix', '[]', 'There''ll be no bargaining this time. Just you, silent... smoldering.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Korell/KG_7.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[358]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4269, 'KorellPrimaryDefenderStartsFightSeven', '[]', 'You''ll not make me betray my fellows this time!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Korell/KG_8.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[358]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4270, 'KorellPrimaryDefenderStartsFightEight', '[]', 'Don''t you see? Death just makes me stronger.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Korell/KG_9.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[358]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4271, 'KorellPrimaryDefenderStartsFightNine', '[]', 'I thought you were dead! No matter. This time, I''ll cremate you!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Korell/KG_10.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[358]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4272, 'KorellPrimaryDefenderStartsFightTen', '[]', 'The very ground burns at my touch!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Korell/KG_11.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[358]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4273, 'KorellPrimaryDefenderStartsFightEleven', '[]', 'Burn in the everlasting fires of the earth!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Korell/KG_12.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[358]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4274, 'KorellPrimaryDefenderStartsFightTwelve', '[]', 'Let''s see you get through my flames now, Exile.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Korell/KG_13.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[358]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4275, 'KorellPrimaryDefenderStartsFightThirteen', '[]', 'Fire is not a Redblade''s only skill. My sword seeks your blood.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Korell/KG_14.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[358]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4276, 'KorellPrimaryDefenderStartsFightFourteen', '[]', 'The sight of you makes my blood boil! I shall make yours boil in kind.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Korell/KG_15.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[358]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4277, 'KorellSafehouseLeaderIntroZero', '[]', 'This is no caldera-home, but you can believe I''ll defend it like any Redblade warlord.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Korell/KG_16.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[358]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4278, 'KorellSecondaryDefenderArrivalZero', '[]', 'Allow me to lend my flame to this battle.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Korell/KG_17.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[358]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4279, 'KorellSecondaryDefenderArrivalOne', '[]', 'There will be no theft on my watch.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Korell/KG_18.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[358]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4280, 'KorellSecondaryDefenderArrivalTwo', '[]', 'This will go quicker with fire.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Korell/KG_19.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[358]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4281, 'KorellSecondaryDefenderArrivalThree', '[]', 'Let''s up the heat.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Korell/KG_20.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[358]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4282, 'KorellSecondaryDefenderArrivalFour', '[]', 'Start running now and you might just escape my flames.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Korell/KG_21.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[358]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4283, 'KorellSecondaryDefenderArrivalFive', '[]', 'Those that face the smoke end up finding the fire.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Korell/KG_22.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[358]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4284, 'KorellSecondaryDefenderArrivalSix', '[]', 'It seems your God has forsaken you, old man. Lucky for you, I have not.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Korell/KG_23.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[358]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4285, 'KorellSecondaryDefenderArrivalSeven', '[]', 'Fight hard, Brinerot, or the Eternal One will hear of your weakness.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Korell/KG_24.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[358]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4286, 'KorellSecondaryDefenderArrivalEight', '[]', 'I admire you, Gravicius. Do not let me down.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Korell/KG_25.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[358]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4287, 'KorellSecondaryDefenderArrivalNine', '[]', 'Today we are allies, Mutewind. Do not waste this opportunity.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Korell/KG_26.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[358]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4288, 'KorellSecondaryDefenderArrivalTen', '[]', 'Solitude does not suit you, Laffrey.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Korell/KG_27.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[358]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4289, 'KorellSecondaryDefenderArrivalEleven', '[]', 'Together, we will annihilate you Exile, and scatter your ashes to the wind.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Korell/KG_28.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[358]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4290, 'KorellSecondaryDefenderArrivalTwelve', '[]', 'You''re an incompetent defender, and I am here to prove it.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Korell/KG_29.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[358]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4291, 'KorellSecondaryDefenderArrivalThirteen', '[]', 'I will not let you send our efforts up in smoke.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Korell/KG_30.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[358]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4292, 'KorellSecondaryDefenderArrivalFourteen', '[]', 'I''m here to clear this place out, present company included.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Korell/KG_31.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[358]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4293, 'KorellSecondaryDefenderArrivalFifteen', '[]', 'I will leave nothing here but scorched earth.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Korell/KG_32.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[358]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4294, 'KorellSecondaryDefenderArrivalSixteen', '[]', 'A simple burning is not sufficient for you, Brinerot. You will be incinerated.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Korell/KG_33.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[358]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4295, 'KorellSecondaryDefenderArrivalSeventeen', '[]', 'Your fur will make wonderful kindling, bear-man.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Korell/KG_34.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[358]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4296, 'KorellSecondaryDefenderArrivalEighteen', '[]', 'Oh, Mutewind, you always knew this day would come.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Korell/KG_35.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[358]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4297, 'KorellSecondaryDefenderArrivalNineteen', '[]', 'Aisling, there are no words for the horrors I have witnessed at your hand.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Korell/KG_36.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[358]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4298, 'KorellSecondaryDefenderArrivalTwenty', '[]', 'Allies one day, enemies the next.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Korell/KG_37.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[358]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4299, 'KorellSecondaryDefenderArrivalTwentyOne', '[]', 'Burn in the fires of Redblade vengeance!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Korell/KG_38.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[358]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4300, 'KorellReplyToSecondaryDefenderArrivalZero', '[]', 'You''re merely fanning my flames!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Korell/KG_39.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[358]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4301, 'KorellReplyToSecondaryDefenderArrivalOne', '[]', 'I''ll leave you in my burning wake.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Korell/KG_40.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[358]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4302, 'KorellReplyToSecondaryDefenderArrivalTwo', '[]', 'Flames don''t care. You''ll burn just the same.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Korell/KG_41.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[358]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4303, 'KorellReplyToSecondaryDefenderArrivalThree', '[]', 'More kindling for the fire.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Korell/KG_42.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[358]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4304, 'KorellReplyToSecondaryDefenderArrivalFour', '[]', 'Gladly.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Korell/KG_43.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[358]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4305, 'KorellReplyToSecondaryDefenderArrivalFive', '[]', 'Prayers? I don''t need the Molten God''s help to smite you.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Korell/KG_44.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[358]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4306, 'KorellReplyToSecondaryDefenderArrivalSix', '[]', 'The Syndicate makes past ties irrelevant. I understand.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Korell/KG_45.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[358]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4307, 'KorellReplyToSecondaryDefenderArrivalSeven', '[]', 'Bring on your little tricks!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Korell/KG_46.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[358]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4308, 'KorellReplyToSecondaryDefenderArrivalEight', '[]', 'I''m going to burn you.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Korell/KG_47.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[358]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4309, 'KorellSecondaryDefenderArrivalTwentyTwo', '[]', 'I''m here to add fuel to the fire.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Korell/KG_48.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[358]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4310, 'KorellSecondaryDefenderArrivalTwentyThree', '[]', 'This transport is too crucial to leave to anyone but a Redblade.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Korell/KG_49.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[358]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4311, 'KorellSecondaryDefenderArrivalTwentyFour', '[]', 'Burn this travesty immediately!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Korell/KG_50.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[358]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4312, 'KorellSecondaryDefenderArrivalTwentyFive', '[]', 'Let''s burn this battlefield from both ends.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Korell/KG_51.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[358]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4313, 'KorellSecondaryDefenderArrivalTwentySix', '[]', 'Vagan! Show me your fighting spirit!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Korell/KG_52.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[358]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4314, 'KorellSecondaryDefenderArrivalTwentySeven', '[]', 'My command over you was only ever a matter of time.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Korell/KG_53.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[358]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4315, 'KorellSecondaryDefenderArrivalTwentyEight', '[]', 'Put our typical relations aside, Thane, and do as I say.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Korell/KG_54.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[358]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4316, 'KorellSecondaryDefenderArrivalTwentyNine', '[]', 'If you so much as harm a hair on her head, Exile, the gods themselves will shudder at what I do to you!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Korell/KG_55.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[358]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4317, 'KorellSecondaryDefenderArrivalThirty', '[]', 'Aisling, allow me to direct your deadly art.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Korell/KG_56.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[358]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4318, 'KorellSecondaryDefenderArrivalThirtyOne', '[]', 'Those who wish to live are wise to follow a Redblade warlord.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Korell/KG_57.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[358]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4319, 'KorellKillPlayerZero', '[]', 'Like I said, only a fool braves a Redblade''s encampment.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Korell/KG_58.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 8, 0, 1, '[358]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4320, 'KorellKillPlayerOne', '[]', 'Keep moving, there might be others!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Korell/KG_59.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 8, 0, 1, '[358]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4321, 'KorellKillPlayerTwo', '[]', 'Keep cleaning! There may be others.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Korell/KG_60.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 8, 0, 1, '[358]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4322, 'KorellKillPlayerThree', '[]', 'I will incinerate the carcass. No traces.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Korell/KG_61.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 8, 0, 1, '[358]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4323, 'KorellEscapeZero', '[]', 'All who challenge a Redblade: fools.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Korell/KG_62.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 4, 0, 1, '[358]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4324, 'KorellEscapeOne', '[]', 'Keep chasing. One day you might catch us, Exile.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Korell/KG_63.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 4, 0, 1, '[358]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4325, 'KorellEscapeTwo', '[]', 'You''ll have to be quicker than that.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Korell/KG_64.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 4, 0, 1, '[358]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4326, 'KorellDefeatedZero', '[]', 'Perhaps... I... was the fool... today...', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Korell/KG_65.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 9, 0, 1, '[358]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4327, 'KorellDefeatedOne', '[]', 'Some things... do not burn...', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Korell/KG_66.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 9, 0, 1, '[358]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4328, 'KorellDefeatedTwo', '[]', 'Up... in... smoke...', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Korell/KG_67.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 9, 0, 1, '[358]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4329, 'KorellDefeatedThree', '[]', 'Extinguished...', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Korell/KG_68.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 9, 0, 1, '[358]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4330, 'KorellDefeatedFour', '[]', 'Don''t... cage this flame... again.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Korell/KG_69.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 9, 0, 1, '[358]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4331, 'KorellDefeatedFive', '[]', 'Felled... by the bargainer!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Korell/KG_70.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 9, 0, 1, '[358]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4332, 'KorellDefeatedSix', '[]', 'This is what I get... for betraying my fellows...', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Korell/KG_71.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 9, 0, 1, '[358]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4333, 'KorellDefeatedSeven', '[]', 'Extinguish me again... and I will still burn...', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Korell/KG_72.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 9, 0, 1, '[358]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4334, 'KorellDefeatedEight', '[]', 'Our flames... ebb and flow, Exile.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Korell/KG_73.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 9, 0, 1, '[358]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4335, 'KorellDefeatedNine', '[]', 'This... was over before I even arrived. Foolish!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Korell/KG_74.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 9, 0, 1, '[358]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4336, 'KorellDefeatedTen', '[]', 'Hot-headed, I made an error.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Korell/KG_75.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 9, 0, 1, '[358]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4337, 'KorellOfferBargainZero', '[]', 'You are brutal! My clan would have liked you, if they didn''t want to throw you into the caldera. What would you have me do, murderer?', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Korell/KG_76.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[358]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4338, 'KorellOfferBargainOne', '[]', 'The Syndicate is built on trust, and trust cannot be broken by an outsider so easily. But if you were to choose someone on the inside, I could see my way into their circle of trust, and then... well, time will tell, won''t it?', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Korell/KG_77.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[358]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4339, 'KorellOfferBargainTwo', '[]', 'Let me act as your spy. Let me be the beacon that burns bright, sending signals from the distance. There is one in particular who casts an... interesting silhouette.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Korell/KG_78.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[358]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4340, 'KorellOfferBargainThree', '[]', 'The structure of this organisation is as fickle as a flame. I see the patterns. I''m uniquely positioned to cause a shift in Syndicate roles. Let me live, and I''ll put the right words in the right ears.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Korell/KG_79.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[358]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4341, 'KorellOfferBargainFour', '[]', 'To have been caught in this manner... absolute humiliation. For this to happen, I must have angered the Molten One. I must make a sacrifice before I become one. Let me go. I''ll return to my homeland and this - our conflict - will be done.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Korell/KG_80.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[358]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4342, 'KorellOfferBargainFive', '[]', 'You don''t want to kill me. You want intelligence about this job. Am I right? I think I am. There is no more potent a weapon against an organisation that hides in the shadows than the revealing light of knowledge.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Korell/KG_81.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[358]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4343, 'KorellOfferBargainSix', '[]', 'I had a job to do here, and I failed it. Treasures are not given for failure, they are given for victory. And you will have them, if you will let me go.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Korell/KG_82.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[358]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4344, 'KorellBargainAcceptedZero', '[]', 'Wise choice.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Korell/KG_83.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[358]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4345, 'KorellBargainAcceptedOne', '[]', 'Let us see what the light reveals...', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Korell/KG_84.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[358]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4346, 'KorellBargainAcceptedTwo', '[]', 'Consider it done.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Korell/KG_85.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[358]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4347, 'KorellBargainAcceptedThree', '[]', 'The flames will serve as penance.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Korell/KG_86.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[358]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4348, 'KorellBargainAcceptedFour', '[]', 'Good. Now listen closely.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Korell/KG_87.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[358]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4349, 'KorellBargainAcceptedFive', '[]', 'Remember, even steel may melt...', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Korell/KG_88.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[358]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4350, 'KorellOfferBetrayalZero', '[]', 'Heat rises. Yet here I am, burning with passion, serving a leader whose failures are evident. But I need only light a fuse within the Syndicate to bring them tumbling down.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Korell/KG_89.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[358]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4351, 'KorellOfferBetrayalOne', '[]', 'Ranks must be earned, and, by losing, my fellow soldiers here have failed to earn theirs. With the right move, you and I could have all these members demoted by the Syndicate. It could serve your plans.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Korell/KG_90.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[358]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4352, 'KorellOfferBetrayalTwo', '[]', 'You and I could cooperate to remove one of these members from the Syndicate altogether. It''s only possible because of a precarious political... situation, so the offer won''t last forever. What do you think? It''s not too different than burning a man at the stake.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Korell/KG_91.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[358]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4353, 'KorellOfferBetrayalThree', '[]', 'I am not above ratting on my fellows to stay alive... at least today.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Korell/KG_92.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[358]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4354, 'KorellOfferBetrayalFour', '[]', 'Haku plays politics... poorly. For his own sake, I must betray him, lest he make greater enemies.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Korell/KG_93.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[358]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4355, 'KorellOfferBetrayalFive', '[]', 'I''m no threat to you, but Leo needs a bit of knocking down.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Korell/KG_94.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[358]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4356, 'KorellOfferBetrayalSix', '[]', 'Guff''s a cheat and a thief, like any Brinerot. Let me live, so that I may be a thorn in his side.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Korell/KG_95.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[358]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4357, 'KorellOfferBetrayalSeven', '[]', 'Jorgin''s a Thane from a distant island. We know what he did to his brother. A crime of the highest order. If he did it in my home, he''d have been fed to the mountain. I''d settle for something simpler here.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Korell/KG_96.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[358]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4358, 'KorellOfferBetrayalEight', '[]', 'I do not want to do this, but I''ll betray her for you if you let me continue my plans unhindered.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Korell/KG_97.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[358]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4359, 'KorellOfferBetrayalNine', '[]', 'Not a Redblade, not my problem. Let''s talk.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Korell/KG_98.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[358]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4360, 'KorellOfferExecuteZero', '[]', 'Like the phoenix, I will rise once more.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Korell/KG_99.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[358]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4361, 'KorellOfferExecuteOne', '[]', 'In front of my warlord, I''ll die bravely.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Korell/KG_100.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[358]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4362, 'KorellOfferExecuteTwo', '[]', 'Burn boldly, friends. Let us act as beacons.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Korell/KG_101.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[358]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4363, 'KorellOfferExecuteThree', '[]', 'No more prison. That''s a coward''s option. You''ll have to slay me.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Korell/KG_102.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[358]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4364, 'KorellReplyToBetrayalAcceptedZero', '[]', 'I will enjoy watching your skin blister beneath my hands.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Korell/KG_103.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[358]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4365, 'KorellReplyToBetrayalAcceptedOne', '[]', 'Your bitingly cold Way will vanish under my Redblade flames.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Korell/KG_104.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[358]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4366, 'KorellReplyToBetrayalAcceptedTwo', '[]', '''Can''t never trust a Redblade,'' but Guff, you''re the one betraying.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Korell/KG_105.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[358]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4367, 'KorellReplyToBetrayalAcceptedThree', '[]', 'You could have been so much more, Thane.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Korell/KG_106.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[358]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4368, 'KorellReplyToBetrayalAcceptedFour', '[]', 'I expected no loyalty, but it still stings.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Korell/KG_107.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[358]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4369, 'KorellReplyToBetrayalAcceptedFive', '[]', 'I always expected you to betray me, Riker.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Korell/KG_108.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[358]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4370, 'KorellReplyToBetrayalAcceptedSix', '[]', 'I''ll burn loyalty into you yet.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Korell/KG_109.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[358]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4371, 'KorellInterrogatedZero', '[]', 'I won''t tell you a single word!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Korell/KG_110.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[358]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4372, 'KorellInterrogatedOne', '[]', 'You cannot... it''s inhumane... inhumane!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Korell/KG_111.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[358]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4373, 'KorellInterrogatedTwo', '[]', 'You''d have been better off bargaining with me again.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Korell/KG_112.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[358]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4374, 'KorellReplyToExecutionZero', '[]', 'Did you set out to become a monster, Exile, or was it an accident?', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Korell/KG_113.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[358]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4375, 'KorellReplyToExecutionOne', '[]', 'Bastard!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Korell/KG_114.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[358]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4376, 'KorellReplyToExecutionTwo', '[]', 'They''ll be back, and stronger. I''ll be ready.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Korell/KG_115.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[358]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4377, 'KorellSafehouseLeaderDefeatedZero', '[]', 'The flames... they don''t burn you... what manner of beast are you?', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Korell/KG_116.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 10, 0, 1, '[358]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4378, 'KorellPrimaryDefenderStartsFightSeventeen', '[]', 'Where there''s smoke, there''s a Redblade. Get ready.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/JunOrtoi/JO2_44.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[343]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4379, 'KorellDefeatedEleven', '[]', 'Don''t try anything stupid, Korell.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/JunOrtoi/JO2_61.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 9, 0, 1, '[343]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4380, 'KorellDefeatedTwelve', '[]', 'Your fight''s done, Redblade. Information. Now.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/JunOrtoi/JO2_107.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 9, 0, 1, '[343]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4381, 'KorellBargainAcceptedSix', '[]', 'Not as dumb as you seem, Redblade.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/JunOrtoi/JO2_82.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[343]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4382, 'KorellInterrogatedThree', '[]', 'We''ll let you smolder behind bars for a while.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/JunOrtoi/JO2_99.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[343]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4383, 'KorellSecondaryDefenderArrivalThirtyTwo', '[]', 'Redblade! Let your flames rage in every direction!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/JunOrtoi/JO2_127.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[343]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4384, 'KorellReplyToSecondaryDefenderArrivalNine', '[]', 'Burn them, Redblade. Set them aflame!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/JunOrtoi/JO2_144.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[343]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4385, 'KorellReplyToSecondaryDefenderArrivalTen', '[]', 'A Redblade sullies his pride by relying on numbers.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/JunOrtoi/JO2_161.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[343]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4386, 'KorellSecondaryDefenderArrivalThirtyThree', '[]', 'Go back to your volcano, Redblade!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/JunOrtoi/JO2_178.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[343]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4387, 'KorellSecondaryDefenderArrivalThirtyFour', '[]', 'There is no honour in this fight, Redblade. Turn back.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/JunOrtoi/JO_69.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[343]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4388, 'RinPrimaryDefenderStartsFightZero', '[]', 'You are a blight on this beautiful continent. We are the cure.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Rin/RY_1.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[359]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4389, 'RinPrimaryDefenderStartsFightOne', '[]', 'That you''ve made it this far is an insult, muckblood.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Rin/RY_2.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[359]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4390, 'RinPrimaryDefenderStartsFightTwo', '[]', 'Robbery, is it? Where I come from, we skin robbers alive.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Rin/RY_3.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[359]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4391, 'RinPrimaryDefenderStartsFightThree', '[]', 'It seems a rat has wandered into our hallowed halls.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Rin/RY_4.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[359]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4392, 'RinPrimaryDefenderStartsFightFour', '[]', 'The trap is sprung, little rat.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Rin/RY_5.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[359]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4393, 'RinPrimaryDefenderStartsFightFive', '[]', 'All that time in the darkness has only made me hate you more.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Rin/RY_6.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[359]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4394, 'RinPrimaryDefenderStartsFightSix', '[]', 'I can''t believe I debased myself by cutting a deal with you.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Rin/RY_7.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[359]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4395, 'RinPrimaryDefenderStartsFightSeven', '[]', 'My loyalties have been realigned, muckblood. Don''t expect a repeat of when last we met.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Rin/RY_8.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[359]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4396, 'RinPrimaryDefenderStartsFightEight', '[]', 'I can still feel the cold creep of death when I close my eyes. Don''t worry, you''ll feel it soon enough.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Rin/RY_9.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[359]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4397, 'RinPrimaryDefenderStartsFightNine', '[]', 'Do you remember your defeat at my hand? You will.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Rin/RY_10.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[359]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4398, 'RinPrimaryDefenderStartsFightTen', '[]', 'Run, run, little rat. My arrows will still find you.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Rin/RY_11.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[359]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4399, 'RinPrimaryDefenderStartsFightEleven', '[]', 'A riddle for you, Exile. How can one person be everywhere at once?', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Rin/RY_12.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[359]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4400, 'RinPrimaryDefenderStartsFightTwelve', '[]', 'Embrace the snow, or be buried.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Rin/RY_13.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[359]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4401, 'RinPrimaryDefenderStartsFightThirteen', '[]', 'The blizzard answers my call!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Rin/RY_14.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[359]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4402, 'RinPrimaryDefenderStartsFightFourteen', '[]', 'With these boots I can shrug off the elements, even though the cold never bothered me anyway!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Rin/RY_15.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[359]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4403, 'RinSafehouseLeaderIntroZero', '[]', 'We are born leaders. You? You were born to serve us.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Rin/RY_16.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[359]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4404, 'RinSecondaryDefenderArrivalZero', '[]', 'You''ve let them see too much. Slaughter them.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Rin/RY_17.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[359]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4405, 'RinSecondaryDefenderArrivalOne', '[]', 'Imbecile! Don''t neglect the cargo!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Rin/RY_18.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[359]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4406, 'RinSecondaryDefenderArrivalTwo', '[]', 'Feels as though the walls are closing in, doesn''t it Exile?', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Rin/RY_19.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[359]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4407, 'RinSecondaryDefenderArrivalThree', '[]', 'We are everywhere.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Rin/RY_20.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[359]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4408, 'RinSecondaryDefenderArrivalFour', '[]', 'Watch carefully, Exile. You won''t see much else.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Rin/RY_21.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[359]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4409, 'RinSecondaryDefenderArrivalFive', '[]', 'I''m honoured to serve such a noble cause.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Rin/RY_22.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[359]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4410, 'RinSecondaryDefenderArrivalSix', '[]', 'Can your people do nothing right, Karui?', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Rin/RY_23.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[359]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4411, 'RinSecondaryDefenderArrivalSeven', '[]', 'The sooner this is over, the sooner you can go back to the seas, pirate.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Rin/RY_24.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[359]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4412, 'RinSecondaryDefenderArrivalEight', '[]', 'Don''t make me regret this, disgusting demon.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Rin/RY_25.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[359]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4413, 'RinSecondaryDefenderArrivalNine', '[]', 'Disgusting. Fight like a nobleman, Ezomyte.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Rin/RY_26.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[359]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4414, 'RinSecondaryDefenderArrivalTen', '[]', 'Try not to get us killed, fire worshipper.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Rin/RY_27.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[359]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4415, 'RinSecondaryDefenderArrivalEleven', '[]', 'We fight for a pure future!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Rin/RY_28.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[359]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4416, 'RinSecondaryDefenderArrivalTwelve', '[]', 'I''d sooner kill you myself than lose our claim here.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Rin/RY_29.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[359]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4417, 'RinSecondaryDefenderArrivalThirteen', '[]', 'The others will be so sad to hear of your untimely demise...', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Rin/RY_30.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[359]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4418, 'RinSecondaryDefenderArrivalFourteen', '[]', 'You should never have crossed me.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Rin/RY_31.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[359]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4419, 'RinSecondaryDefenderArrivalFifteen', '[]', 'I''m here to clean up your mess, yourself included.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Rin/RY_32.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[359]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4420, 'RinSecondaryDefenderArrivalSixteen', '[]', 'Brinerot, I''ll make you wish you went down with your ship.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Rin/RY_33.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[359]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4421, 'RinSecondaryDefenderArrivalSeventeen', '[]', 'First, you, then the rest of your filthy little clan, Thane.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Rin/RY_34.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[359]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4422, 'RinSecondaryDefenderArrivalEighteen', '[]', 'Korell, it was only a matter of time. I''m just making the first move.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Rin/RY_35.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[359]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4423, 'RinSecondaryDefenderArrivalNineteen', '[]', 'The Syndicate would be better off without you or your sadism.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Rin/RY_36.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[359]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4424, 'RinSecondaryDefenderArrivalTwenty', '[]', 'You''re devious, Maloney. Think you can keep up with me?', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Rin/RY_37.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[359]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4425, 'RinSecondaryDefenderArrivalTwentyOne', '[]', 'Muckbloods, the purification begins now.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Rin/RY_38.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[359]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4426, 'RinReplyToSecondaryDefenderArrivalZero', '[]', 'You won''t live to regret this.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Rin/RY_39.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[359]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4427, 'RinReplyToSecondaryDefenderArrivalOne', '[]', 'You opportunistic little worm.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Rin/RY_40.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[359]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4428, 'RinReplyToSecondaryDefenderArrivalTwo', '[]', 'You''ll never see daylight again, scum.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Rin/RY_41.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[359]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4429, 'RinReplyToSecondaryDefenderArrivalThree', '[]', 'When this is through, you''ll be naught but meat for the ants.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Rin/RY_42.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[359]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4430, 'RinReplyToSecondaryDefenderArrivalFour', '[]', 'Oh, no, you won''t see it coming.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Rin/RY_43.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[359]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4431, 'RinReplyToSecondaryDefenderArrivalFive', '[]', 'Yuck. Your kind makes even the Brinerot seem appealing.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Rin/RY_44.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[359]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4432, 'RinReplyToSecondaryDefenderArrivalSix', '[]', 'Don''t you dare touch me, beast!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Rin/RY_45.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[359]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4433, 'RinReplyToSecondaryDefenderArrivalSeven', '[]', 'So that''s how it is. I''m just ''Mutewind'' again, like before.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Rin/RY_46.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[359]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4434, 'RinReplyToSecondaryDefenderArrivalEight', '[]', 'Don''t get caught in your own trap, beast.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Rin/RY_47.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[359]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4435, 'RinReplyToSecondaryDefenderArrivalNine', '[]', 'Hah!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Rin/RY_48.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[359]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4436, 'RinSecondaryDefenderArrivalTwentyTwo', '[]', 'The wolves are circling you now...', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Rin/RY_49.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[359]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4437, 'RinSecondaryDefenderArrivalTwentyThree', '[]', 'It''s over for you now, Exile.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Rin/RY_50.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[359]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4438, 'RinSecondaryDefenderArrivalTwentyFour', '[]', 'Bow to your betters, trespasser.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Rin/RY_51.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[359]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4439, 'RinSecondaryDefenderArrivalTwentyFive', '[]', 'We will tear you to shreds.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Rin/RY_52.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[359]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4440, 'RinSecondaryDefenderArrivalTwentySix', '[]', 'Try not to lose another limb, underling.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Rin/RY_53.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[359]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4441, 'RinSecondaryDefenderArrivalTwentySeven', '[]', 'Bossing around a Brinerot? This feels right.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Rin/RY_54.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[359]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4442, 'RinSecondaryDefenderArrivalTwentyEight', '[]', 'Your queen commands you to fight in her name, creature!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Rin/RY_55.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[359]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4443, 'RinSecondaryDefenderArrivalTwentyNine', '[]', 'Cunning, not might, will win the day here. Follow my orders to the letter, Thane.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Rin/RY_56.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[359]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4444, 'RinSecondaryDefenderArrivalThirty', '[]', 'Serve me well, Korell, or I will be forced to extinguish you.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Rin/RY_57.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[359]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4445, 'RinSecondaryDefenderArrivalThirtyOne', '[]', 'Do as I have instructed you, and victory is assured.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Rin/RY_58.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[359]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4446, 'RinKillPlayerZero', '[]', 'Good riddance.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Rin/RY_59.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 8, 0, 1, '[359]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4447, 'RinKillPlayerOne', '[]', 'Lowlife. Keep moving!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Rin/RY_60.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 8, 0, 1, '[359]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4448, 'RinKillPlayerTwo', '[]', 'Just another body, now.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Rin/RY_61.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 8, 0, 1, '[359]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4449, 'RinKillPlayerThree', '[]', 'Good. What''s next?', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Rin/RY_62.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 8, 0, 1, '[359]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4450, 'RinEscapeZero', '[]', 'Worthless.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Rin/RY_63.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 4, 0, 1, '[359]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4451, 'RinEscapeOne', '[]', 'Success was inevitable.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Rin/RY_64.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 4, 0, 1, '[359]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4452, 'RinEscapeTwo', '[]', 'You can''t win.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Rin/RY_65.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 4, 0, 1, '[359]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4453, 'RinDefeatedZero', '[]', 'How humiliating...!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Rin/RY_66.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 9, 0, 1, '[359]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4454, 'RinDefeatedOne', '[]', 'All is lost.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Rin/RY_67.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 9, 0, 1, '[359]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4455, 'RinDefeatedTwo', '[]', 'Unfathomable!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Rin/RY_68.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 9, 0, 1, '[359]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4456, 'RinDefeatedThree', '[]', 'Our chance... squandered...', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Rin/RY_69.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 9, 0, 1, '[359]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4457, 'RinDefeatedFour', '[]', 'No, no more prison!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Rin/RY_70.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 9, 0, 1, '[359]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4458, 'RinDefeatedFive', '[]', 'Gods... not again!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Rin/RY_71.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 9, 0, 1, '[359]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4459, 'RinDefeatedSix', '[]', 'I''m better than this!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Rin/RY_72.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 9, 0, 1, '[359]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4460, 'RinDefeatedSeven', '[]', 'I face death... again...', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Rin/RY_73.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 9, 0, 1, '[359]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4461, 'RinDefeatedEight', '[]', 'Thought it''d be as easy as last time...', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Rin/RY_74.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 9, 0, 1, '[359]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4462, 'RinDefeatedNine', '[]', 'Damn. Miscalculated.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Rin/RY_75.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 9, 0, 1, '[359]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4463, 'RinDefeatedTen', '[]', 'I was blinded by fury...', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Rin/RY_76.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 9, 0, 1, '[359]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4464, 'RinOfferBargainZero', '[]', 'Not even the Redblade are as... brutal as you. I will do as you ask, so long as you spare me.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Rin/RY_77.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[359]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4465, 'RinOfferBargainOne', '[]', 'Kill me and prove yourself to be the savage I know you are, or... surprise me. Set me free. I can bring someone into the fold on your behalf. Talk some respect into them. Please.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Rin/RY_78.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[359]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4466, 'RinOfferBargainTwo', '[]', 'Is my life really worth sacrificing your chance to know more? That is what you would be doing were you to kill me, Exile. Instead, let me show you how useful I could be to you. I am quick to make friends, and even quicker to learn what it is I wish to learn. Allow me the chance to prove my talents to you, and all I learn is yours.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Rin/RY_79.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[359]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4467, 'RinOfferBargainThree', '[]', 'I''m ill-fit for this duty. You''ve proven that quite clearly. Is that a crime worthy of death? I think not. Rather, I ought to look for more suitable work, don''t you think?', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Rin/RY_80.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[359]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4468, 'RinOfferBargainFour', '[]', 'My Mutewind brothers and sisters warned me that leaving them would bring me nothing but darkness. Perhaps they were right. I think, if you''ll allow me, I will take my leave of the Syndicate.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Rin/RY_81.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[359]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4469, 'RinOfferBargainFive', '[]', 'You are a bloodthirsty little beast, aren''t you? I almost admire it. I think if I called your bluff I''d wind up dead, so instead, I offer you this: knowledge. Knowledge of all I have learned in my post here.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Rin/RY_82.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[359]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4470, 'RinOfferBargainSix', '[]', 'I could offer you pure Mutewind blood, or I could offer you material compensation. Take your pick.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Rin/RY_83.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[359]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4471, 'RinBargainAcceptedZero', '[]', 'Consider me surprised. I''ll do as you asked.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Rin/RY_84.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[359]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4472, 'RinBargainAcceptedOne', '[]', 'I''ll keep my end of the deal. Just remember this in the future.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Rin/RY_85.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[359]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4473, 'RinBargainAcceptedTwo', '[]', 'You won''t regret this!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Rin/RY_86.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[359]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4474, 'RinBargainAcceptedThree', '[]', 'When you meet the Lifegiver, give my regards... with a blade.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Rin/RY_87.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[359]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4475, 'RinBargainAcceptedFour', '[]', 'I knew you could be... reasonable.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Rin/RY_88.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[359]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4476, 'RinBargainAcceptedFive', '[]', 'A fair trade. Until next time!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Rin/RY_89.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[359]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4477, 'RinOfferBetrayalZero', '[]', 'Know why the Immortal Syndicate failed here? Because they didn''t have Mutewind leadership. Instead they had some muckblood running the show. Well, how about we change that?', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Rin/RY_90.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[359]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4478, 'RinOfferBetrayalOne', '[]', 'This is what I get for putting my trust in foreign might. Free me, and I''ll show the others here how the Mutewind handle failures.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Rin/RY_91.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[359]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4479, 'RinOfferBetrayalTwo', '[]', 'If you think I go into battle without a plan for every possible situation, well, you don''t know me at all. My plan for this outcome? Shove the blame onto someone lesser-than. One of the nincompoops here will do, don''t you think?', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Rin/RY_92.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[359]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4480, 'RinOfferBetrayalThree', '[]', 'I''m not stupid. I know what you want. You want information. If you''ll leave me living, I can tell you a great deal about my crewmates here.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Rin/RY_93.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[359]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4481, 'RinOfferBetrayalFour', '[]', 'Gods, how I''ve wanted a reason to stick it to that Brinerot scoundrel. Don''t disappoint me, Exile.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Rin/RY_94.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[359]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4482, 'RinOfferBetrayalFive', '[]', 'Hillock''s little more than a walking, talking avalanche. We Mutewind know how dangerous an avalanche can be. You should be wary, too.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Rin/RY_95.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[359]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4483, 'RinOfferBetrayalSix', '[]', 'Wait! I may be a Syndicate lackey for the moment, but Jorgin has committed fratricide. Would you really let a brother-killer just walk?', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Rin/RY_96.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[359]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4484, 'RinOfferBetrayalSeven', '[]', 'I cannot even begin to describe how much I''d enjoy watching that fire-worshipping, muckblooded Redblade lowlife squirm.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Rin/RY_97.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[359]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4485, 'RinOfferBetrayalEight', '[]', 'Look at Maloney''s eyes. The cogs are turning. He''s planning something. Do you want to wait to find out what, or shall we put him in his place?', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Rin/RY_98.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[359]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4486, 'RinOfferBetrayalNine', '[]', 'I hate you, Exile, but only a little more than any of these other subservients. I''d harm any one of them to keep breath in my lungs.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Rin/RY_99.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[359]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4487, 'RinOfferExecuteZero', '[]', 'Death is not the deterrent it once was.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Rin/RY_100.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[359]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4488, 'RinOfferExecuteOne', '[]', 'In front of my captain, I''ll die bravely.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Rin/RY_101.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[359]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4489, 'RinOfferExecuteTwo', '[]', 'Let me demonstrate the proper way to die.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Rin/RY_102.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[359]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4490, 'RinOfferExecuteThree', '[]', 'Enough interrogation. You insult me. Death is the only choice I''ll give you this time.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Rin/RY_103.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[359]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4491, 'RinReplyToBetrayalAcceptedZero', '[]', 'You think I didn''t expect betrayal? I''m two steps ahead.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Rin/RY_104.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[359]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4492, 'RinReplyToBetrayalAcceptedOne', '[]', 'What did I ever do to you, Vagan?', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Rin/RY_105.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[359]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4493, 'RinReplyToBetrayalAcceptedTwo', '[]', 'You''ve lived down to your reputation, Brinerot.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Rin/RY_106.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[359]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4494, 'RinReplyToBetrayalAcceptedThree', '[]', 'Did... did you just betray me as a gift? You are the stupidest of stupid!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Rin/RY_107.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[359]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4495, 'RinReplyToBetrayalAcceptedFour', '[]', 'I do it simply to annoy you, Jorgin, because you can never return home.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Rin/RY_108.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[359]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4496, 'RinReplyToBetrayalAcceptedFive', '[]', 'I thought you said the Syndicate makes past ties irrelevant.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Rin/RY_109.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[359]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4497, 'RinReplyToBetrayalAcceptedSix', '[]', 'I already have plans in motion to account for this betrayal, believe me.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Rin/RY_110.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[359]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4498, 'RinInterrogatedZero', '[]', 'I''ll only tell you what I want to tell you.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Rin/RY_111.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[359]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4499, 'RinInterrogatedOne', '[]', 'No matter how many times you interrogate me, I will never break.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Rin/RY_112.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[359]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100);
INSERT INTO "NPCTextAudio" ("_row", "Id", "Characters", "Text", "Mono_AudioFile", "Stereo_AudioFile", "HasStereo", "__col6", "Video", "__col8", "__col9", "__col10", "NPCs", "NPCPortrait", "__col13", "__col14", "Cooldown", "__col16") VALUES
(4500, 'RinInterrogatedTwo', '[]', 'I thought we had an understanding!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Rin/RY_113.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[359]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4501, 'RinReplyToExecutionZero', '[]', 'The price of failure.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Rin/RY_114.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[359]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4502, 'RinReplyToExecutionOne', '[]', 'You... you savage!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Rin/RY_115.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[359]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4503, 'RinReplyToExecutionTwo', '[]', 'Silver linings!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Rin/RY_116.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[359]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4504, 'RinSafehouseLeaderDefeatedZero', '[]', 'I had it all planned out. How could I lose? I... I must have been sabotaged! But by who?', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Rin/RY_117.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 10, 0, 1, '[359]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4505, 'RinPrimaryDefenderStartsFightFifteen', '[]', 'I spy a Mutewind! Careful, Exile.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/JunOrtoi/JO2_42.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[343]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4506, 'RinPrimaryDefenderStartsFightSixteen', '[]', 'Your blood didn''t look that pure to me last time, Mutewind.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/JunOrtoi/JO2_43.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[343]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4507, 'RinDefeatedEleven', '[]', 'Pathetic. Stay, dog.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/JunOrtoi/JO2_60.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 9, 0, 1, '[343]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4508, 'RinBargainAcceptedSix', '[]', 'Don''t make us regret this, Mutewind.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/JunOrtoi/JO2_81.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[343]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4509, 'RinInterrogatedThree', '[]', 'We''ll get what we need from you one way or another, Rin.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/JunOrtoi/JO2_98.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[343]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4510, 'RinSecondaryDefenderArrivalThirtyTwo', '[]', 'Are you skilled enough to take us all on, Rin?', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/JunOrtoi/JO2_128.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[343]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4511, 'RinSecondaryDefenderArrivalThirtyThree', '[]', 'You fight for a lie, Mutewind. Go home.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/JunOrtoi/JO_70.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[343]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4512, 'RinReplyToSecondaryDefenderArrivalTen', '[]', 'Rin, you''re too cunning to fall for the Syndicate''s lies!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/JunOrtoi/JO2_145.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[343]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4513, 'RinReplyToSecondaryDefenderArrivalEleven', '[]', 'Clever, Rin, very clever.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/JunOrtoi/JO2_162.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[343]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4514, 'RinReplyToSecondaryDefenderArrivalTwelve', '[]', 'If Rin is here, she sees some advantage we don''t expect!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/JunOrtoi/JO2_179.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[343]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4515, 'CatarinaDowned', '[]', 'Don''t do this, Exile. You can still join us. It''s your chance to bring back anyone you''ve ever loved or cared about.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Catarina/CAT_18.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[345,366]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4516, 'CatarinaExecution', '[]', 'Stop... I can bring them back. Jun, I can bring your entire order back! Just give me-', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Catarina/CAT_19.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 5, 0, 1, '[345,366]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4517, 'CatarinaVaultIntro', '[]', 'You found me at last... Very resourceful, Jun. I too am resourceful. Witness.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Catarina/CAT_9.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[345,366]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4518, 'CatarinaVaultRevive', '[]', 'Give in, Jun!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Catarina/CAT_27.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[345,366]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4519, 'CatarinaVaultMiddle', '[]', 'See? We are no different, you and I. We''ve both slain your pathetic little order. Though, they put up more of a fight the second time around.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Catarina/CAT_10.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[345,366]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4520, 'CatarinaVaultFleeing', '[]', 'There''s nothing that makes you feel so alive as death, is there...? Now, come to me Jun. Let us see what your soul is made of.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Catarina/CAT_11.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[345,366]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4521, 'CatarinaVaultCemeteryIntro', '[]', 'Hundreds of dead, rotting soulless in the earth. What a meaningless waste. But your souls... yours will serve.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Catarina/CAT_12.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[345,366]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4522, 'CatarinaPhaseZero', '[]', 'You try and try and try to break us, and yet the Syndicate is immortal. Do you think this will end any differently?', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Catarina/CAT_13.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[345,366]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4523, 'CatarinaPhaseOne', '[]', 'Death will never come for an immortal.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Catarina/CAT_14.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[345,366]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4524, 'CatarinaPhaseTwo', '[]', 'Submit... Let our souls become entwined.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Catarina/CAT_15.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[345,366]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4525, 'CatarinaPhaseThree', '[]', 'Your hopeless cause will destroy you!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Catarina/CAT_16.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[345,366]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4526, 'CatarinaPhaseFour', '[]', 'I will imprison your soul forever!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Catarina/CAT_17.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[345,366]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4527, 'CatarinaGravicius', '[]', 'Your faith was a veil for your base desires. Hypocrite, you are lucky your soul isn''t going to your God.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Catarina/CAT_30.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[345,366]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4528, 'CatarinaThane', '[]', 'Any system of belief, taken too far, can end in tragedy. Go to your brother now, Thane.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Catarina/CAT_31.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[345,366]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4529, 'CatarinaAisling', '[]', 'Can you hear them, Aisling? The souls of those you mutilated scream for your death. At last, their wish is granted.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Catarina/CAT_32.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[345,366]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4530, 'CatarinaHaku', '[]', 'Your ancestors are waiting for you Haku, but you will not see them. For this, I am sorry, old friend.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Catarina/CAT_33.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[345,366]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4531, 'CatarinaLeo', '[]', 'The legions of men you slew died for mere entertainment. But you, Leo, you shall die for a cause greater than you could have ever hoped.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Catarina/CAT_34.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[345,366]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4532, 'CatarinaVorici', '[]', 'How many did you send to an unexpected death, assassin? Look into my eyes... Goodbye, Vorici.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Catarina/CAT_35.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[345,366]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4533, 'CatarinaRin', '[]', 'You believe yourself to be purer than the others. Better than them. But death... death is the great equaliser, Rin.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Catarina/CAT_36.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[345,366]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4534, 'CatarinaElreon', '[]', 'Such a long, faithful life you''ve lived. I''m sorry you will never get to see your God, Elreon.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Catarina/CAT_37.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[345,366]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4535, 'CatarinaTora', '[]', 'We were not so different, Tora. We both killed for the good of Wraeclast. But now your hunt is over.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Catarina/CAT_38.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[345,366]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4536, 'CatarinaVagan', '[]', 'You are owed a warrior''s death, but the needs of the cause outweigh your own, Vagan. I take no pleasure in this.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Catarina/CAT_39.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[345,366]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4537, 'CatarinaGuff', '[]', 'Guff, Your Brinerot took much of value from the people of Wraeclast. It is only fitting that you have something valuable taken from you.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Catarina/CAT_40.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[345,366]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4538, 'CatarinaJanus', '[]', 'Without you, Janus, the Syndicate would never have formed, and for that, I must thank you. But you will not be missed.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Catarina/CAT_41.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[345,366]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4539, 'CatarinaItThatFled', '[]', 'Have no fear, creature. Where you are going, the Lords have no hold over you.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Catarina/CAT_42.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[345,366]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4540, 'CatarinaHillock', '[]', 'Perhaps, Hillock, it was a mistake to bring you into the fold. One that can be fixed with ease.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Catarina/CAT_43.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[345,366]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4541, 'CatarinaKorell', '[]', 'How many did you fruitlessly feed to your molten god, Redblade? Yours is one soul that''ll remain out of its reach.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Catarina/CAT_44.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[345,366]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4542, 'CatarinaCameria', '[]', 'You were a potent soldier, Cameria, but our cause was never your cause. For your service, I give you what you never gave your victims - a quick death.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Catarina/CAT_45.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[345,366]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4543, 'CatarinaRiker', '[]', 'I''d high hopes for you, Riker. Of everyone, I thought you would see what we could achieve... But you became caught in your own twisted machine.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Catarina/CAT_46.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[345,366]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4544, 'CatarinaManifestoOne', '[]', 'The world is an ancient stone, rigid and immovable, and we are but water, rolling across its surface, leaving an ephemeral trail before we sink beneath its skin. So short are our lives that the stone seemingly remains unchanged.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Given enough time, the rain can shape a stone. Each drop''s minute contribution, adding up over time, hews the stone''s rough edges. But there is no grand design here. There is no individual guiding the stone into a useful form, only natural forces. Chaos.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
But what if that weren''t the case? What if there was someone guiding the rain? Someone able to plan far past the fleeting lives that limit us?' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
What new potential would we unlock?', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/CatarinaGlyph/CAT_47.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[370]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4545, 'CatarinaManifestoTwo', '[]', 'What new thing have you learned today? Or this week? How far have you come in your lifetime? If you died today, how much of what you have learned would be lost for all time?' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
We advance as a society by building upon previous knowledge. Bricks stacked atop bricks. Too often are key advances lost due to an unforeseen death, leaving a gap in the wall. How long until someone climbs high enough once more to continue to build?' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
We cannot all live forever. Sacrifices must be made. But with sufficient time to build our knowledge, what we fuel with the blood of our brothers and sisters today may come freely tomorrow. ' || char(13) || '
', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/CatarinaGlyph/CAT_48.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[371]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4546, 'CatarinaManifestoThree', '[]', 'Each great movement has detractors - the powers that be naturally fight against any threat to their dominance. But steel is not forged in cool air, it is forged in vicious heat. ' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
The heat is coming, brothers and sisters. They will try to destroy us, pit us against each other, and put us in impossible situations, but, throughout, we must stand united. ' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Though we crawl through the mud, acting in secrecy and silence, we are destined to become Wraeclast''s saviours. Each sacrifice we must make is but a twig in the flames of our forge, and the day will come when our blade has been tempered into a mighty weapon and we may slice through the spectre of death once and for all.' || char(13) || '
', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/CatarinaGlyph/CAT_49.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[372]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4547, 'CatarinaManifestoFour', '[]', 'We bury the dead. Insects feed on the flesh and bone... Rot takes hold... An entire lifetime reduced to feed for the grass above. A waste. But the soul, oh, the soul... The soul does not even feed the earth. It drifts invisibly into the ether, never harnessed, never used. Gone. ' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
What greater waste of life is there than to let the soul flutter away into nothingness? We hope and wish for something more, but here and now we have tools that will guarantee no afterlife be necessary. We have the tools to build a utopian life here, in Wraeclast, through thaumaturgy. The only thing we lacked was time, but the gift of the Horns has given us that too.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Brothers and sisters, there''s a new empire in the making, and we are its founders. Those that die for our cause will live on within us, and their names will be etched into the foundations of our utopia.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/CatarinaGlyph/CAT_50.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[373]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4548, 'CatarinaManifestoFive', '[]', 'People need a strong leader. As Oriath bubbles over and spills into Wraeclast, the ragged and the hungry will look to someone to keep them safe from harm. For now, it is merely a matter of survival, but it in time, a true society will form, and someone must step in to rule.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
A city is not built in a day, nor even a lifetime. Sarn was being cobbled together up to the day it burned. With so many hands involved in its construction, fractures and slips were inevitable. People would fall through the cracks. Factions would form. ' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Oriath didn''t learn from Sarn''s mistakes, but they cannot be blamed. The death of a ruler always has and always will throw an empire''s direction into the wind.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
With an Eternal Queen, this is a problem we will never have to face. ' || char(13) || '
', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/CatarinaGlyph/CAT_51.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[374]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4549, 'CatarinaCombatOne', '[]', 'Arise, my children.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Catarina/CAT_20.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[345,366]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4550, 'CatarinaCombatTwo', '[]', 'Darkness swarms!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Catarina/CAT_21.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[345,366]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4551, 'CatarinaCombatThree', '[]', 'Feed!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Catarina/CAT_22.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[345,366]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4552, 'CatarinaCombatFour', '[]', 'Feel death''s grip!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Catarina/CAT_23.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[345,366]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4553, 'CatarinaCombatFive', '[]', 'Mortal!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Catarina/CAT_24.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[345,366]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4554, 'CatarinaCombatSix', '[]', 'Your soul burns for me!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Catarina/CAT_25.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[345,366]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4555, 'CatarinaCombatSeven', '[]', 'Dead, give me life!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Catarina/CAT_26.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[345,366]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4556, 'CatarinaCombatEight', '[]', 'Give in, Jun!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Catarina/CAT_27.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[345,366]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4557, 'CatarinaCombatNine', '[]', 'Give your soul to me.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Catarina/CAT_28.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[345,366]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4558, 'CatarinaCombatTen', '[]', 'Kulemak!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BetrayalLeague/Catarina/CAT_29.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[345,366]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4559, 'VenariusIntroduction', '[]', 'An Exile...? Please, you must help me.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
I-... I don''t know where I am or how I got here. I don''t remember my name... I don''t-... I don''t remember anything. I suppose for now you can call me... Cavas...' || char(13) || '
', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Cavas/Ven_013.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[375,376]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4560, 'VenariusBossFightIntroduction1', '[]', 'Remember me? When we''re through here, you won''t.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/CavasCombat/Ven_063.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[380]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4561, 'VenariusBossFightIntroduction2', '[]', 'What secrets are you hiding in that murderous mind of yours? Let''s find out.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/CavasCombat/Ven_062.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[380]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4562, 'VenariusBossFightGolemOne', '[]', 'Valdo had some ingenious designs hidden in his memories... observe!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/CavasCombat/Ven_064.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[380]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4563, 'VenariusBossFightGolemOneDefeat', '[]', 'Valdo''s designs were flawed.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/CavasCombat/Ven_065.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[380]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4564, 'VenariusBossFightHumanoidOne', '[]', 'Do you remember dying here? You will.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/CavasCombat/Ven_066.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[380]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4565, 'VenariusBossFightHumanoidOneDefeat', '[]', 'What are you?', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/CavasCombat/Ven_067.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[380]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4566, 'VenariusBossFightMapDevice', '[]', 'In this, the realm of the past, I am King, and you will bow!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/CavasCombat/Ven_068.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[380]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4567, 'VenariusBossFightGolemTwo', '[]', 'This one is my own creation!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/CavasCombat/Ven_069.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[380]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4568, 'VenariusBossFightGolemTwoDefeat', '[]', 'Plenty more where that came from.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/CavasCombat/Ven_070.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[380]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4569, 'VenariusBossFightHumanoidTwo', '[]', 'Face your destruction!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/CavasCombat/Ven_071.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[380]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4570, 'VenariusBossFightHumanoidTwoDefeat', '[]', 'No! Impossible! How!?', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/CavasCombat/Ven_072.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[380]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4571, 'VenariusBossFightDepart', '[]', 'This isn''t over. This will never be over! I will unify humanity!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/CavasCombat/Ven_073.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[380]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4572, 'VenariusBossFightWormholeStart', '[]', 'Feel the pull of the void!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/CavasCombat/Ven_074.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[380]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4573, 'VenariusBossFightWormholeGotcha', '[]', 'Yes, that''s it! Death sweeps in.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/CavasCombat/Ven_075.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[380]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4574, 'VenariusBossFightWormholeDidntGotcha', '[]', 'I will crush you!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/CavasCombat/Ven_076.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[380]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4575, 'VenariusBossFightCameraLens', '[]', 'Sin surrounds you!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/CavasCombat/Ven_280.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[380]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4576, 'VenariusBossFightMassTeleport', '[]', 'Faith empowers!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/CavasCombat/Ven_281.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[380]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4577, 'VenariusBossFightMassTeleportCollapse', '[]', 'Belief overwhelms!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/CavasCombat/Ven_282.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[380]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4578, 'VenariusBossFightRotatingOrbs', '[]', 'Bow!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/CavasCombat/Ven_078.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[380]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4579, 'VenariusBossFightGolemNuke', '[]', 'Haha! Yes! Feed!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/CavasCombat/Ven_287.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[380]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4580, 'VenariusBossFightGolemNukeSlam', '[]', 'Obliterate sin!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/CavasCombat/Ven_077.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[380]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4581, 'VenariusBossFightSpinningLaserNuke', '[]', 'Cleansing flames!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/CavasCombat/Ven_288.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[380]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4582, 'VenariusBossFightSequentialArcs', '[]', 'Repent!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/CavasCombat/Ven_291.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[380]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4583, 'VenariusBossFightLaserBarrage', '[]', 'Be no more.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/CavasCombat/Ven_100.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[380]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4584, 'VenariusBossFightConcentratedLaser', '[]', 'Burn away sin!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/CavasCombat/Ven_289.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[380]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4585, 'VenariusBossFightGolemShockRifle', '[]', 'Reveal your past!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/CavasCombat/Ven_058.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[380]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4586, 'VenariusBossFightGolemMassShockRifle', '[]', 'Open your mind to me!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/CavasCombat/Ven_059.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[380]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4587, 'VenariusGuardian1Intro', '[]', 'If I must destroy you before uniting mankind, I will.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/CavasCombat/Ven_079.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[380]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4588, 'VenariusGuardian2Intro', '[]', 'You and I were allies once, even friends. A pity.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/CavasCombat/Ven_080.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[380]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4589, 'VenariusGuardian3Intro', '[]', 'I owe you my renewed existence, but that debt only extends so far.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/CavasCombat/Ven_081.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[380]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4590, 'VenariusGuardian4Intro', '[]', 'I cannot allow you to impede the cause.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/CavasCombat/Ven_082.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[380]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4591, 'VenariusGuardian1Defeat', '[]', 'With each new murder you make mankind more vulnerable!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/CavasCombat/Ven_083.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[380]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4592, 'VenariusGuardian2Defeat', '[]', 'Every friendship becomes a betrayal, given enough time.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/CavasCombat/Ven_084.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[380]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4593, 'VenariusGuardian3Defeat', '[]', 'Keep pushing me, and I''ll be forced to pursue those close to you.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/CavasCombat/Ven_085.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[380]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4594, 'VenariusGuardian4Defeat', '[]', 'I will sacrifice everything for the cause. Can you say the same?', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/CavasCombat/Ven_086.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[380]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4595, 'VenariusGuardian1MinionPhase', '[]', 'What morality do you have to stand in my way?', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/CavasCombat/Ven_087.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[380]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4596, 'VenariusGuardian2MinionPhase', '[]', 'To think, I trusted you!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/CavasCombat/Ven_088.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[380]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4597, 'VenariusGuardian3MinionPhase', '[]', 'I wish I didn''t know what I know now.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/CavasCombat/Ven_089.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[380]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4598, 'VenariusGuardian4MinionPhase', '[]', 'I will resist you to the last, because I must!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/CavasCombat/Ven_090.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[380]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4599, 'VenariusGuardian1LeftToRightWave', '[]', 'Begone!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/CavasCombat/Ven_091.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[380]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4600, 'VenariusGuardian1MassWaveSpiral', '[]', 'I do this for all mankind.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/CavasCombat/Ven_092.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[380]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4601, 'VenariusGuardian1TriangleSlam', '[]', 'Cower!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/CavasCombat/Ven_290.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[380]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4602, 'VenariusGuardian1SequentialArcs', '[]', 'Repent!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/CavasCombat/Ven_291.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[380]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4603, 'VenariusGuardian2MassProjectile', '[]', 'Open your mind...', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/CavasCombat/Ven_093.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[380]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4604, 'VenariusGuardian2MassProjectileExplode', '[]', '...and be erased!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/CavasCombat/Ven_094.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[380]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4605, 'VenariusGuardian2DoubleDash', '[]', 'I am everywhere.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/CavasCombat/Ven_297.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[380]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4606, 'VenariusGuardian2SpinSlam', '[]', 'Annihilate!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/CavasCombat/Ven_292.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[380]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4607, 'VenariusGuardian2EpicSlash', '[]', 'Wraeclast will serve...', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/CavasCombat/Ven_293.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[380]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4608, 'VenariusGuardian2EpicSlashBlast', '[]', 'And so will you!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/CavasCombat/Ven_295.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[380]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4609, 'VenariusGuardian3QuadMortar', '[]', 'Necessary!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/CavasCombat/Ven_095.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[380]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4610, 'VenariusGuardian3QuadMortarReturn', '[]', 'Justified!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/CavasCombat/Ven_096.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[380]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4611, 'VenariusGuardian3MassMortar', '[]', 'Obliteration!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/CavasCombat/Ven_283.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[380]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4612, 'VenariusGuardian3MassMortarReturn', '[]', 'Return!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/CavasCombat/Ven_284.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[380]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4613, 'VenariusGuardian3SpinningBeams', '[]', 'Only a matter of time.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/CavasCombat/Ven_097.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[380]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4614, 'VenariusGuardian3VoidZone', '[]', 'Be still!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/CavasCombat/Ven_098.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[380]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4615, 'VenariusGuardian3RefractionBeam', '[]', 'Erasure!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/CavasCombat/Ven_099.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[380]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4616, 'VenariusGuardian4VSlam', '[]', 'Wraeclast needs me!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/CavasCombat/Ven_298.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[380]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4617, 'VenariusGuardian4LaserGun', '[]', 'Light of salvation!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/CavasCombat/Ven_299.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[380]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4618, 'VenariusGuardian4RotatingGun', '[]', 'Darkness surrounds us!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/CavasCombat/Ven_300.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[380]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4619, 'SynthesisTipVenariusIntro', '[]', 'I recognise these men! That''s High Templar Venarius with his guards. The other man is Valdo Caeserius. A man of science. They are building something together. Something important.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/CavasCombat/Ven_041.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[380]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4620, 'SynthesisTipVenariusDefendVenarius', '[]', 'That can''t be right. Venarius was - is - a good man. A pious man. He would not lash out like that. No, he must have been provoked.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/CavasCombat/Ven_042.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[380]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4621, 'SynthesisTipVenariusDefendVenariusTwo', '[]', 'Valdo is shouting at him, you see? Threatening him. The High Templar has no choice!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/CavasCombat/Ven_043.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[380]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4622, 'SynthesisTipVenariusDefendVenariusThree', '[]', 'Oh, dear! What just happened? Was that... because of me?', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/CavasCombat/Ven_044.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[380]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4623, 'SynthesisTipZanaInterrupt', '[]', 'Apologies for the intrusion, Exile, but when we found my father''s memory fragment, I thought we could explore it with Cavas'' help... Now I know what a mistake that would have been. Cavas has altered this memory and he has likely been altering many others.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/ZanaCombat/360Zana_08.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[386]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4624, 'SynthesisTipVenariusInterruptReply', '[]', 'That''s ridiculous. I''m innocent. All the memories we''ve seen clearly prove that.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/CavasCombat/Ven_045.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[380]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4625, 'SynthesisTipZanaProvokeOne', '[]', 'Of course they do. You''ve made sure of that. You''re no stranger to rewriting history... High Templar.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/ZanaCombat/360Zana_09.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[386]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4626, 'SynthesisTipVenariusNameDropReply', '[]', 'No.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/CavasCombat/Ven_046.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[380]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4627, 'SynthesisTipZanaProvokeTwo', '[]', 'Yes.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/ZanaCombat/360Zana_10.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[386]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4628, 'SynthesisTipVenariusRemember', '[]', 'Was I... Am I...? I am the High Templar... Venarius? It''s starting to make sense now. I sought power to wield against evil...', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/CavasCombat/Ven_047.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[380]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4629, 'SynthesisTipZanaPlea', '[]', 'Stop! Can''t you see what you''re doing?', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/ZanaCombat/360Zana_11.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[386]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4630, 'SynthesisTipVenariusRememberTwo', '[]', '...And I found it. Yes, this is a start. This is more than I possibly could have hoped for when I drew the blade and awoke -- yes, of course! Now I can protect Wraeclast properly.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/CavasCombat/Ven_048.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[380]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4631, 'SynthesisTipZanaPleaTwo', '[]', '... protect Wraeclast...?', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/ZanaCombat/360Zana_12.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[386]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4632, 'SynthesisTipVenariusJustify', '[]', 'What am I, a monster? No, the real monsters surround us.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/CavasCombat/Ven_049.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[380]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4633, 'SynthesisTipZanaJustifyReply', '[]', 'And what does that mean?', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/ZanaCombat/360Zana_13.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[386]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4634, 'SynthesisTipVenariusExplainEvil', '[]', 'Demons, child. Countless. They watch us from the darkness. They claw at the thin veil that keeps our world separated from theirs. A great tide of evil that wishes only to crash down upon us and sweep our civilisation into oblivion. But I will stand against it.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/CavasCombat/Ven_050.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[380]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4635, 'SynthesisTipZanaPleasThree', '[]', 'Then we''re on the same side. The entity that fed on your memories is doing the same thing to my father. Help us stop it!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/ZanaCombat/360Zana_14.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[386]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4636, 'SynthesisTipVenariusConclusion', '[]', 'Oh, little one, it is you who will help me... Your memories will show what I need them to show, for the cause. Every thinking man and woman of Wraeclast will come to simply know that they must unite... under me. It is the only way to guarantee a unified defence.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/CavasCombat/Ven_051.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[380]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4637, 'SynthesisTipZanaFlee', '[]', 'We won''t let you get away!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/ZanaCombat/360Zana_90.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[386]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4638, 'VenariusNexusQuest', '[]', 'All these memories we''ve collected... When I gaze upon them, I feel as though I''m close to remembering something important. Like there are memories trapped in my mind but I just can''t quite reach them.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Oh. Oh dear. Oh DEAR! I''ve remembered something! Exile, it is time we go to the Nexus.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Cavas/Ven_019.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[375,376]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4639, 'VenariusNexusQuest2', '[]', 'I remember this! This place is the Nexus of... uh... something. The name doesn''t matter. What matters is what it can do! A doorway! A doorway into these memories!' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Here. Take them and lay them out in this machine. It will reinforce the stability of the memories. They won''t last too long, mind you, but they''ll remain long enough to be explored. Build a path to the memories that lay out of reach. I''m sure this will help us. Sure of it!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Cavas/Ven_020.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[378]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4640, 'VenariusNexusQuest3', '[]', 'Yes, that was wonderful Exile. For a brief moment I felt whole again. Here, let me try something...' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Hello Exile, my name is-...' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Oh. Oh dear. I thought, maybe... But no.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Well perhaps we can try again. Though the machine seems to keep the memories more stable, they still degrade. Keep that in mind - because I''m not so sure I will be able to.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Cavas/Ven_021.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[378]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4641, 'VenariusQuestOffering', '[]', 'I don''t know who I am, but I do know that this... thing here is important. That there are answers inside.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
You look strong... Could you spare a moment to help an old man? Perhaps we can solve this mystery together.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Cavas/Ven_014.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[376]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4642, 'VenariusFirstMission', '[]', 'How strange... I can see through your eyes. This place seems so familiar, yet... There! That strange object is important, I''m sure of it!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/CavasNarrator/Ven_015.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[376]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4643, 'VenariusFirstObject', '[]', 'Oh dear! It seems your time here is limited. Make haste! I feel the world around us dissolving!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/CavasNarrator/Ven_016.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[376]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4644, 'VenariusFirstMissionComplete', '[]', 'I... I think this was a memory of mine. It has been corrupted, but I indeed recall fragments... A sunny day at the beach when I was but a boy. I remember the warm sand between my toes. I chose a seashell to bring home... A happy day. ' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
But... I do not remember taking the shell home. I do not remember home at all. So much is yet missing... Wait! I remember seeing another of these memories. Where was it? Oh dear. I don''t remember... ' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
I''ll take this with me. I might remember if I take it with me. I hope we run into each other again soon.' || char(13) || '
', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Cavas/Ven_017.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[375,376]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4645, 'VenariusFirstMissionFailed', '[]', 'I thought for a moment I knew that place... I cannot be sure, and now it is gone. Oh dear... Wait...! I think I remember seeing another one of these memories somewhere... Where was it? Oh dear. I don''t remember. ' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
I must have a look around. It was around here somewhere... Or was it back in that cave? Was I in a cave? Hmm.' || char(13) || '
', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Cavas/Ven_018.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[376]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4646, 'VenariusMissionFail', '[]', 'It''s alright, Exile. I''m sure that memory was nothing I truly needed... after all, how many memories does a man really need to be considered himself again? We''ll keep looking.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Cavas/Ven_022.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[376]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4647, 'VenariusMissionStart', '[]', 'An Exile...? Please, you must help me -' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Oh, it''s you, my friend. I can''t seem to hold on to my thoughts for long... ' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Can you spare another minute to help me? Enter this memory... let us experience it together so that we might ascertain its owner.' || char(13) || '
', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Cavas/Ven_023.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[376]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4648, 'VenariusAboutMemories', '[]', 'Even shattered as I am, I know that memories floating around like this is not... normal. I believe something terrible has happened to me. ' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
What if other men fall victim? What if mothers forget their children? What if... what if the children are left alone and scared to fend for themselves in a world of nightmare... Exile, can you fathom the horror?' || char(13) || '
', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Cavas/Ven_024.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[375,377,378,376]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4649, 'VenariusAboutPast1', '[]', 'I remember nothing at all, save the flash of the sun on my mortal skin in a dream. I was a living man. I know I was. Ask me again when we have retrieved further memories, and I shall hopefully have more to tell you.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Cavas/Ven_025.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[375,377,378]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4650, 'VenariusAboutPast2', '[]', 'I was... a good man! I fought for God. I remember saying so. That symbol... the Descry... it stirs my half-remembered blood to think of it. I wanted to do good things. Important things. Can you imagine finding the truth of oneself on the wrong side of morality? I have thought long on this fearful notion... but now I know, exile, and that relieves me. I am no longer afraid to recover more of my memories.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Cavas/Ven_026.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[375,377,378]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4651, 'VenariusAboutPast3', '[]', 'I''m certain now that I was a Templar. Yes, I remember watching their mighty parades through Oriath Square as a child, and I can still feel that sense of satisfaction the day I truly donned the mantle. All of the pain and sacrifice was worth it, to do good, to protect mankind... to protect the children...', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Cavas/Ven_027.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[375,377,378]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4652, 'VenariusAboutPast4', '[]', 'I was a Templar, yes, but now I remember that I secretly despised them. I understood that they were a diseased organization prone to brutal oppression. Friend, was I exiled as well? I cannot imagine my resentment would have gone over well with my superiors. Maybe I kept my thoughts to myself and lived a life of quiet desperation, but I feel like I was the kind of man to act.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
So what did I do?' || char(13) || '
', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Cavas/Ven_028.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[375,377,378]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4653, 'VenariusAboutBridges', '[]', 'Exile, there is something about all this that I cannot fathom. The memories I somewhat understand. A man''s thoughts, a woman''s remembrance, a child''s sorrow - these things come from the living, or the once-living. They are real. But the ancient bridges that you cross between memories? Those were already out there. They came from no man, woman, or child of our land.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
I suspect those pathways are not made of the iron we think we see. To dwell on their origins or true nature could send one over the brink, I suspect!' || char(13) || '
', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Cavas/Ven_029.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[375,377,378]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4654, 'VenariusAboutItemSynth', '[]', 'These are memories, yes, but they are also real in a sense. We feel pain within them. We find real material objects within them. Yet some of these objects are not quite right. It is as though they are stuck, half-remembered. ' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
There''s a device in the Nexus that seems attuned to such objects. It seems to draw upon their properties to create something new. Its creator must have been seeking something very important in his or her past... I wonder if they ever found it.' || char(13) || '
', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Cavas/Ven_030.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[375,377,378]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4655, 'VenariusMemoryRunTime', '[]', 'It is time, friend. Energy courses through my being. I sense an opportunity to weave together my memories. Let us abscond to the Nexus!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Cavas/Ven_031.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[375,376,377,378,387]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4656, 'VenariusGenericErrorRandom', '[]', 'An Exile...? Please, you must help me... do... something...', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Cavas/Ven_032.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[377,378]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4657, 'VenariusGenericError2', '[]', 'An Exile...? Please, you must help me... do... something... I can''t remember...', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Cavas/Ven_033.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[377,378]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4658, 'VenariusGenericError3', '[]', 'Oh, hello there! I was meant to do something, but I can''t for the life of me remember what... Let''s try this again later.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Cavas/Ven_034.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[375,376,377,378,387]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4659, 'VenariusAboutZana', '[]', 'I sense within myself a natural affinity for the curious. I am not overly curious myself, but rather, I appreciate the rare resource that is a scientific soul. The child''s work is crucial to protect mankind from the nightmare that lurks... out there. Her work must continue no matter the cost.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Cavas/Ven_035.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[375,376,377,378,387]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4660, 'VenariusAboutEinhar', '[]', 'That man is quite ...jolly, but he doesn''t seem to be able to see me yet. Perhaps that will change when I regain my memories.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Cavas/Ven_036.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[375,376,377,378,387]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4661, 'VenariusAboutJun', '[]', 'Sometimes I think she senses my presence, but she is too surrounded by ghosts of her own to take heed of me.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Cavas/Ven_037.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[375,376,377,378,387]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4662, 'VenariusAboutNavali', '[]', 'The revenant looks right at my eyes when I try to talk to her. She listens, but has nothing to say to me. What does that mean, Exile?', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Cavas/Ven_038.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[375,376,377,378,387]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4663, 'VenariusAboutAlva', '[]', 'The treasure hunter has her eye on one thing and one thing only. If she senses my presence, she gives it no notice, for I do not gleam of gold.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Cavas/Ven_039.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[375,376,377,378,387]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4664, 'VenariusAboutNiko', '[]', 'The miner is the only one, other than you, who can hear me in my current form. We converse at length, and his conversations help me keep my wits about me in this time of loneliness, but at times he seems to speak to others that not even I can perceive. There is too much competition for his attention.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Cavas/Ven_040.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[375,376,377,378,387]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4665, 'VenariusWildGreetingsRandom', '[]', 'Please! Kind soul!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Cavas/Ven_010.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[375,376,377,378,387]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4666, 'VenariusWildGreetings2', '[]', 'Oh, lost again...', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Cavas/Ven_011.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[375,376,377,378,387]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4667, 'VenariusWildGreetings3', '[]', 'Oh dear, oh dear, oh dear...', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Cavas/Ven_012.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[375,376,377,378,387]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4668, 'VenariusSynthMemoryCoastA', '[]', 'Sapinti went on her first fishing trip alone and did not return. When her body finally washed ashore, it looked as though it had been mummified for a thousand years. The fish did not touch her flesh.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/CavasNarrator/Ven_101.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[376]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4669, 'VenariusSynthMemoryCoastB', '[]', 'She was perfectly preserved, but drained of her blood. We buried her, but within days the earth rejected her. Whatever killed her took root in that place. The earth soured and we had to move, abandoning her body.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/CavasNarrator/Ven_102.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[376]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4670, 'VenariusSynthMemoryCoastC', '[]', ' This memory seems ancient. I do not believe this was mine, and I hope I never learn more of it.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Cavas/Ven_103.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[376]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4671, 'VenariusSynthMemoryAcidCaveA', '[]', 'Why won''t you let me leave? I found you so many yellow rocks... this pick is getting dull, and I''m so tired...', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/CavasNarrator/Ven_104.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[376]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4672, 'VenariusSynthMemoryAcidCaveB', '[]', 'I can''t... get up... stop hurting me...', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/CavasNarrator/Ven_105.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[376]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4673, 'VenariusSynthMemoryAcidCaveC', '[]', 'Oh dear. I don''t know whose memory this was, but they were far too young for such cruelty. Sometimes, Exile, mankind makes me weep. Who could create such an inhuman system of exploitation, and for what purpose?', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Cavas/Ven_106.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[376]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4674, 'VenariusSynthMemoryArchivesA', '[]', 'I used to pride myself on taking care of these tomes, but the ancient treatises concerning the Vaal... should be burned. He''s making me research for him, and the things I am reading about concern the destruction of all mankind.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/CavasNarrator/Ven_107.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[376]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4675, 'VenariusSynthMemoryArchivesB', '[]', 'I would think my fears of the end of the world ridiculous... except... it''s happened before. I must run... I must flee... and take my secrets with me.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/CavasNarrator/Ven_108.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[376]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4676, 'VenariusSynthMemoryArchivesC', '[]', 'Exile, was this me? I''m no master of the spoken or written word, so I don''t think I was a scholar.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Cavas/Ven_109.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[376]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4677, 'VenariusSynthMemoryAshenWoodA', '[]', 'I awake to the sound of screaming. My eyes and throat sting. Smoke billows into the hut from outside. Something is terribly wrong. I dash outside and am confronted by a wall of heat. Smoke makes it difficult to see, but the village is in flames.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/CavasNarrator/Ven_110.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[376]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4678, 'VenariusSynthMemoryAshenWoodB', '[]', 'I run from the smoke and, to my horror, realise we are trapped. A rival tribe stands at the only exit, cutting my brothers and sisters down as they flee. We''ve been ambushed. I run towards the flames and leap, praying to Valako for protection.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/CavasNarrator/Ven_111.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[376]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4679, 'VenariusSynthMemoryAshenWoodC', '[]', 'Oh dear, such violence and hate... I wonder why the tribes were at war. It''s clear this is not something I ever experienced, at least.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Cavas/Ven_112.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[376]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4680, 'VenariusSynthMemoryBazaarA', '[]', 'I see you. You are here seeking answers, because you can find them only in the stories we will leave behind when Malachai and Voll cause our destruction. In this final hour, I entertain the notion that the words I write exist in some form beyond me. Do they go on as dreams? As memories?', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/CavasNarrator/Ven_113.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[376]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4681, 'VenariusSynthMemoryBazaarB', '[]', 'I have the wildest notion that perhaps you will find a way to pick up scraps of memory, and you, whoever you are, will come across this one someday. If you do, I ask only this: slay Malachai. Slay him for yourself, or slay him for all the lost citizens of the Empire, but, most of all, slay him for Marylene.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/CavasNarrator/Ven_114.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[376]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4682, 'VenariusSynthMemoryBazaarC', '[]', 'Oh, Exile, though I am a mere shade with only figments of memory, I can say with certainty that no man has ever felt the nuances of rage and love so strongly. His was the strongest memory I have ever felt, an imprint of his entire essence. His name... was Victario.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Cavas/Ven_115.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[376]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4683, 'VenariusSynthMemoryBeachA', '[]', 'You and I, we''re the only ones that made it to shore... alive, anyway. This place is crawling with criminals. Find something you can defend yourself with.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/CavasNarrator/Ven_116.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[376]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4684, 'VenariusSynthMemoryBeachB', '[]', 'That''ll do for now. I thought I saw some smoke rising just north of here. Could be worth checking if there''s--', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/CavasNarrator/Ven_117.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[376]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4685, 'VenariusSynthMemoryBeachC', '[]', 'I saw you through someone else''s eyes, Exile! That was a memory from someone that knew you! He was relieved to see you. Were you close?', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Cavas/Ven_118.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[376]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4686, 'VenariusSynthMemoryBellyA', '[]', 'I take no pleasure in this. It simply must be done. Humanity''s purpose has been fulfilled... in me. Within this sanctum of flesh lay the tools I shall use to reshape the world.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/CavasNarrator/Ven_119.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[376]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4687, 'VenariusSynthMemoryBellyB', '[]', 'With this act, I sweep away the trappings of mortality, and bring about a new age. A world of Thaumaturgy, and I, its ruler. Farewell, my Gemling Queen...', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/CavasNarrator/Ven_120.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[376]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4688, 'VenariusSynthMemoryBellyC', '[]', 'Who was that, Exile? I felt such drive and focus. Nothing mattered but my one goal. It was... terrifying.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Cavas/Ven_121.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[376]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4689, 'VenariusSynthMemoryCaveA', '[]', 'It''s him! He sails back to me, my Daresso! I shall sing for him. I shall show him the way.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/CavasNarrator/Ven_122.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[376]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4690, 'VenariusSynthMemoryCaveB', '[]', 'It''s my Daresso! He sails back to me! I shall sing for him, and show him the way.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/CavasNarrator/Ven_123.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[376]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4691, 'VenariusSynthMemoryCaveC', '[]', 'The last vestiges of human thought in a woman consumed by madness... she saw her beloved in every passing ship, and sang to them all, never realizing their true fates.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Cavas/Ven_124.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[376]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4692, 'ZanaSynthOnNiko', '[]', 'I''ve seen men and women turn mad, but I''ve never seen a case like Niko... I think the ores and compounds he''s been handling have been affecting his mind. He seems to be aware of it, too.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Can it really be called madness when it is of your own doing?' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
It''s a shame. I''m sure we will encounter many subterranean environments where his expertise would be invaluable, but I simply can''t risk our safety. The Atlas presents its own potential threats to sanity... putting additional pressure on Niko might send him right over the brink.' || char(13) || '
', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Zana/360Zana_01.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[125,177,178,180,323,324,379,385,386,416,417]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4693, 'ZanaSynthOnEinhar', '[]', 'When I was a young girl I used to play with the neighbourhood stray cat, and one day it started bringing me mice. Einhar is that stray cat. Has he been trying to feed you raw meat too? I just don''t have the heart to tell him how inedible it is. ' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
The first time he handed me a big raw steak, I began to cook it over the fire, and he told me I was ''ruining all the good red.'' Since then, I''ve just hidden it when he isn''t looking. Sometimes I open up a map and hurl it in there. I know how irresponsible it is, but... Einhar''s a sweetheart. I don''t need to see under the mask to know how deeply he feels emotions, and I can''t bear to hurt him. ' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Watch your step out there. You may land on some of my rotten scraps.' || char(13) || '
', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Zana/360Zana_02.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[125,177,178,180,323,324,379,385,386,416,417]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4694, 'ZanaSynthOnAlva', '[]', 'As a fellow explorer, I must admit admiration for Alva. Her motivations may not be as philanthropic as mine, but you can''t deny that her methods get results. Do I wonder what kind of repercussions all her time travel is having on us? Of course! But we don''t really know what the consequences of our travel through the Atlas are either, and I''m not interested in throwing stones while living in my own little glass house. ' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
I do wish she''d look past profits, but we''ve all benefited from her finds in one way or another.' || char(13) || '
', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Zana/360Zana_03.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[125,177,178,180,323,324,379,385,386,416,417]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4695, 'ZanaSynthOnNavali', '[]', 'Navali''s powers are impressive, yes, but they are not without their limits. It seems her knowledge of things to come is restricted to our realm, however broad that may be. When it comes to the Atlas, her predictions don''t seem as reliable. ' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
I wonder how much of this is due to the source of her powers... she claims to have been given the gift of second sight by the Karui goddess Hinekora, but since the gods returned I''ve heard nothing of Hinekora. Is Navali being misled by a deceptive entity? Or is Hinekora keeping a low profile? Perhaps the goddess simply has no interest in us, as she has her own flock to tend.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Regardless, it may be worth remembering that although Navali is a good friend to have, she has her own agenda like anyone else; an agenda she may have been given by her benefactor.' || char(13) || '
', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Zana/360Zana_04.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[125,177,178,180,323,324,379,385,386,416,417]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4696, 'ZanaSynthOnJun', '[]', 'I''ve tried getting to know Jun, and maybe I''m reading into things a little bit here, but I don''t think she likes me. Whenever I try to talk to her, she gets quiet and averts her eyes. I''ve seen her fight, so I don''t think she''s exactly shy... and I catch her staring at me every so often. Long stares. The kind you do when you''re lost in thought. ' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
I wonder what I did to offend her...' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
No matter! I''ll just stay the course. I''m sure with a little more alone time we''ll become fast friends.' || char(13) || '
', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Zana/360Zana_05.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[125,177,178,180,323,324,379,385,386,416,417]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4697, 'ZanaSynthOnHelena', '[]', 'I wish I could say I trust Helena, but I''ve seen one too many of Dominus''s blackguards suddenly snap. The training and indoctrination they go through does not leave much room for one''s own judgement. ' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
I''m not trying to sound ungracious. She''s done a lot for us, but I''d be telling a fib if I claimed I didn''t sleep with a blade beneath my pillow when she''s around. ' || char(13) || '
', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Zana/360Zana_06.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[125,177,178,180,323,324,379,385,386,416,417]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4698, 'ZanaSynthOnCavas', '[]', 'What a strange entity you found, Exile. Completely devoid of memory, yet cognisant, and even driven... I hope to find the time to really get to know him, but I''ve been so caught up with the happenings out in the Atlas.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Perhaps I''ll join you on one of your memory ventures soon.' || char(13) || '
', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Zana/360Zana_07.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[125,177,178,180,323,324,379,385,386,416,417]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4699, 'ZanaSynthCavasEventA', '[]', 'Apologies for the intrusion, Exile, but when we found my father''s memory fragment, I thought we could explore it with Cavas'' help... Now I know what a mistake that would have been. Cavas has altered this memory and he has likely been altering many others.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/ZanaCombat/360Zana_08.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[386]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4700, 'ZanaSynthCavasEventB', '[]', 'Of course they do... you''ve made sure of that. You''re no stranger to rewriting history... High Templar.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/ZanaCombat/360Zana_09.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[386]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4701, 'ZanaSynthCavasEventC', '[]', 'Oh, yes.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/ZanaCombat/360Zana_10.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[386]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4702, 'ZanaSynthCavasEventD', '[]', 'Stop! Can''t you see what you''re doing?' || char(13) || '
', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/ZanaCombat/360Zana_11.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[386]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4703, 'ZanaSynthCavasEventE', '[]', '... Protect Wraeclast?', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/ZanaCombat/360Zana_12.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[386]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4704, 'ZanaSynthCavasEventF', '[]', 'And what does that mean?', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/ZanaCombat/360Zana_13.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[386]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4705, 'ZanaSynthCavasEventG', '[]', 'Then we are on the same side. The entity that fed on your memories is doing the same thing to my father. Help us stop it!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/ZanaCombat/360Zana_14.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[386]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4706, 'ZanaSynthAfterCavasEvent', '[]', 'I can''t... I don''t...' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Exile, did you know? No, of course not. I don''t think Venarius even knew who he was, how could you? But he knows now, and it seems he may remember many other things as well. ' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
If Venarius is capable of rewriting memories, he could plant very dangerous ideas into the minds of the vulnerable. We need to find those memories before he does. Don''t worry, you''re not alone in this. We are a team. ' || char(13) || '
', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Zana/360Zana_15.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[385]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4707, 'ZanaQuestMapReward1', '[]', 'Fantastic work, Exile. Here, take one of these. It will help us continue to pursue that entity.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Zana/360Zana_16.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[125,177,178,180,323,324,379,385,386,416,417]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4708, 'ZanaQuestMapReward2', '[]', 'We have to keep laying the pressure on him. Here, this should help.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Zana/360Zana_17.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[125,177,178,180,323,324,379,385,386,416,417]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4709, 'ZanaQuestMapReward3', '[]', 'As long as he keeps running, we''ll keep chasing. Here, take this, and be careful out there.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Zana/360Zana_18.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[125,177,178,180,323,324,379,385,386,416,417]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4710, 'ZanaQuestMapReward4', '[]', 'He''s retreating deeper into the Atlas. We must keep up the chase! Use this wisely.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Zana/360Zana_19.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[125,177,178,180,323,324,379,385,386,416,417]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4711, 'ZanaQuestMapReward5', '[]', 'We''re cornering him now, Exile. He must be running out of tricks. Keep pushing onwards!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Zana/360Zana_20.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[125,177,178,180,323,324,379,385,386,416,417]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4712, 'ZanaSynthUnstableElderRandom', '[]', 'Exile, to me! That thing is about to explode!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/ZanaCombat/360Zana_21.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[178]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4713, 'ZanaSynthUnstableElder2', '[]', 'It''s too unstable, Exile! Come here! Quickly!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/ZanaCombat/360Zana_22.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[178]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4714, 'ZanaSynthElderLastPhase', '[]', 'Exile, it''s almost ready! Just a little longer.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/ZanaCombat/360Zana_23.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[178]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4715, 'ZanaSynthElderSealing', '[]', 'For the men and women who died fighting you...' || char(13) || '
For the children you fed upon...' || char(13) || '
I banish you to the void between voids!' || char(13) || '
May you never be free!' || char(13) || '
', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/ZanaCombat/360Zana_24.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[178]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4716, 'ZanaSynthElderBulletHell', '[]', 'I''m hurt - I can''t protect you right now!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/ZanaCombat/360Zana_25.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[178]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4717, 'ZanaSynthElderProtectMe', '[]', 'Protect me while I seal the portal!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/ZanaCombat/360Zana_26.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[178]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4718, 'ZanaSynthRoses', '[]', 'Bloom!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/ZanaCombat/360Zana_27.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[178]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4719, 'ZanaSynthSpaceSlash', '[]', 'Begone!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/ZanaCombat/360Zana_28.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[178]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4720, 'ZanaSynthBeam', '[]', 'I''ve got your back, Exile!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/ZanaCombat/360Zana_29.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[178]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4721, 'ZanaSynthIncompleteMemoryRandom', '[]', 'Interesting... It seems as though there may be more to that memory. We''ll have to keep looking!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Zana/360Zana_84.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[385]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4722, 'ZanaSynthIncompleteMemory2', '[]', 'I think perhaps that isn''t the whole story... Let''s keep looking.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Zana/360Zana_85.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[385]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4723, 'ZanaSynthIncompleteMemory3', '[]', 'There''s more to that memory, I just know it. Perhaps we''ll find the rest somewhere else.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Zana/360Zana_86.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[385]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4724, 'ZanaSynthFailedMemoryRandom', '[]', 'I''m sorry Exile, that memory is gone. We were just not quick enough.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Zana/360Zana_87.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[385]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4725, 'ZanaSynthFailedMemory2', '[]', 'Oh... We were just too slow to save that memory... At least Venarius won''t get his hands on it.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Zana/360Zana_88.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[385]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4726, 'ZanaSynthMemoryFull', '[]', 'We''ve collected a lot of memories, Exile. Now might be a good time to visit the Memory Nexus. Perhaps we can lure that vicious little snake Venarius out of wherever he is hiding...', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Zana/360Zana_91 PICK UP.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[385]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4727, 'ZanaSynthVenariusDefeated', '[]', 'I don''t know that we will ever be able to truly destroy Venarius, Exile, but we can prevent him from taking away people''s autonomy. We didn''t ask for this duty, but it is our duty all the same, for if we don''t stop him, who will?', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Zana/360Zana_92.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[125,177,178,180,323,324,379,385,386,416,417]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4728, 'ZanaSynthVenariusDefeatedAlt', '[]', 'It''s funny... I thought once we finally defeated Venarius I would feel happy... Instead I feel frustrated. Frustrated that a man like that was able to lead the Templar. Frustrated that he took my father from me. Frustrated that he released that entity into the Atlas... Frustrated that after all we''ve done, dangers still lurk out there. When will it stop, Exile? When will we finally be safe?', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Zana/360Zana_93.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[125,177,178,180,323,324,379,385,386,416,417]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4729, 'ZanaSynthMemoryAcidCaveA', '[]', 'Breaking rocks to mine voltaxic sulphite... but I''m so small...', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/ZanaNarrator/360Zana_30.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[385]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4730, 'ZanaSynthMemoryAcidCaveB', '[]', 'Such pain... such despair... I''m going to die down here, and I never even had the chance to know what life was.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/ZanaNarrator/360Zana_31.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[385]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4731, 'ZanaSynthMemoryAcidCaveC', '[]', 'Monsters... To use a child like that... The Eternal Empire was truly cruel.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Zana/360Zana_32.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[385]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4732, 'ZanaSynthMemoryAshenWoodA', '[]', 'I awake to the sound of screaming. My eyes and throat sting. Smoke billows into the hut from the outside. Something is terribly wrong. I dash outside and am confronted by a wall of heat. Smoke makes it difficult to see, but the village is in flames.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/ZanaNarrator/360Zana_33.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[385]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4733, 'ZanaSynthMemoryAshenWoodB', '[]', 'I flee from the smoke and, to my horror, realise we''re trapped. A rival tribe stands at the only exit, cutting my brothers and sisters down as they flee. We''ve been ambushed. I run towards the flames and leap, praying to Valako for protection.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/ZanaNarrator/360Zana_34.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[385]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4734, 'ZanaSynthMemoryAshenWoodC', '[]', 'What devious maliciousness. War truly brings out the worst in people, doesn''t it. It''s clear to me this belongs to some unfortunate Karui.' || char(13) || '
', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Zana/360Zana_35.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[385]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4735, 'ZanaSynthMemoryBazaarA', '[]', 'I see you. You are seeking answers, because you can find them only in the stories we will leave behind when Malachai and Voll cause our destruction. In this final hour, I entertain the notion that the words I write exist in some form beyond me. Do they go on as dreams? As memories?', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/ZanaNarrator/360Zana_36.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[385]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4736, 'ZanaSynthMemoryBazaarB', '[]', '	I have the wildest notion that perhaps you will find a way to pick up scraps of memory, and you, whoever you are, will come across this one someday. If you do, I ask only this: slay Malachai. Slay him for yourself, or slay him for all the lost citizens of the Empire, but, most of all, slay him for Marylene.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/ZanaNarrator/360Zana_37.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[385]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4737, 'ZanaSynthMemoryBazaarC', '[]', 'That was exhilarating, Exile! Like truly seeing the mind and heart of another person, living and breathing right here with me. Why was his memory so intense? I can still feel Victario, as if he has just left the room only now.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Zana/360Zana_38.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[385]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4738, 'ZanaSynthMemoryBeachA', '[]', 'You and I, we''re the only ones that made it to shore... alive, anyway. This place is crawling with criminals. Find something you can defend yourself with.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/ZanaNarrator/360Zana_39.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[385]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4739, 'ZanaSynthMemoryBeachB', '[]', 'That''ll do for now. I thought I saw some smoke rising just north of here. Could be worth checking if there''s--', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/ZanaNarrator/360Zana_40.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[385]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4740, 'ZanaSynthMemoryBeachC', '[]', 'Ugh, my neck feels stiff. Was that you, Exile? You were in that memory, though looking a little worse for wear!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Zana/360Zana_41.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[385]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4741, 'ZanaSynthMemoryBellyA', '[]', 'I take no pleasure in this. It simply must be done. Humanity''s purpose has been fulfilled... in me. Within this sanctum of flesh lay the tools I shall use to reshape the world.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/ZanaNarrator/360Zana_42.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[385]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4742, 'ZanaSynthMemoryBellyB', '[]', 'With this act, I sweep away the trappings of mortality, and bring about a new age. A world of Thaumaturgy, and I, its ruler. Farewell, my Gemling Queen...', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/ZanaNarrator/360Zana_43.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[385]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4743, 'ZanaSynthMemoryBellyC', '[]', 'Ugh, I am left sickened and dirtied by the vile thoughts of someone intensely self-absorbed. Was that... Malachai? The monster who brought about the Cataclysm? Did I just relive that moment?', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Zana/360Zana_44.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[385]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4744, 'ZanaSynthMemoryCaveA', '[]', 'It''s him! He sails back to me, my Daresso! I shall sing for him. I shall show him the way. Come, my love. Come to me. We shall be together at last.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/ZanaNarrator/360Zana_45.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[385]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4745, 'ZanaSynthMemoryCaveB', '[]', 'No, turn away! Don''t listen to my singing, you''ll die upon the rocks! Turn away...! Turn away... Turn away...', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/ZanaNarrator/360Zana_46.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[385]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4746, 'ZanaSynthMemoryCaveC', '[]', 'Was that Merveil? That poor woman. Somewhere within her monstrous form lived the woman she once was. What a terrible curse.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Zana/360Zana_47.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[385]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4747, 'ZanaSynthMemoryChambersA', '[]', 'The Courts are burning. Accusations fly. Sinner! Heretic! I am but an initiate, and my patron urges silence. We will keep our heads down while one High Templar supplants another. It''s all about power, my patron whispers, and we have none.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/ZanaNarrator/360Zana_48.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[385]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4748, 'ZanaSynthMemoryChambersB', '[]', 'Should an accusation fall our way, we shall be doomed to die with the other accused. Be unseen and unheard, he whispers. This is what happens when men who seek power refuse to wait. I learned a valuable lesson that day: Trust without leverage is vulnerability.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/ZanaNarrator/360Zana_49.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[385]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4749, 'ZanaSynthMemoryChambersC', '[]', 'Exile! That was the moment Venarius decided to seize life and vie for power. That was the moment doom for men like my father was assured.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Zana/360Zana_50.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[385]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4750, 'ZanaSynthMemoryFissureA', '[]', 'Master''s orders were clear; I am to wait here until his return. I cast my eyes to the horizon and see smoke billowing from Sarn. The city burns, and I fear my master burns with it.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/ZanaNarrator/360Zana_51.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[385]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4751, 'ZanaSynthMemoryFissureB', '[]', 'The sky grows red. I hear screaming from the village by the Crossroads, but I will not abandon my post. Master will return, and I will await him. No matter how long, I will wait for Maligaro''s return...', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/ZanaNarrator/360Zana_52.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[385]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4752, 'ZanaSynthMemoryFissureC', '[]', 'A memory from someone close to the Inquisitor. How exciting! I bet there are many historians who would be interested in such a find.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Zana/360Zana_53.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[385]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4753, 'ZanaSynthMemoryForestA', '[]', 'Another child was taken last night, so tonight we wait, praying the demon does not return, but it does. It soars through the air and passes through the wall of the hut. We catch only a glimpse of its grey skin beneath the moonlight. We pursue the demon on foot to the edge of the woods. The child it carries does not cry out.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/ZanaNarrator/360Zana_54.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[385]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4754, 'ZanaSynthMemoryForestB', '[]', 'Anaris follows closely, but I hesitate out of fear. I gather my will and I leap into the shadows, tracking the demon by the tendrils left in its wake. But I am too late. The demon and child are gone, and Anaris stands frozen, pale as the moon. He whispers something I do not understand and falls, dead. I fear we will be hunted to extinction.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/ZanaNarrator/360Zana_55.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[385]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4755, 'ZanaSynthMemoryForestC', '[]', 'Could it be...? Exile, this sounds just like the entity hunting my father. But... the memory is so old. How is this possible?', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Zana/360Zana_56.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[385]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4756, 'ZanaSynthMemoryGardenA', '[]', 'A man in uniform visits. He is from the Courts. He says the Templar have alms for widows like my mother, but she must collect it in person. We go to the church together, and I wait outside in the gardens. The sun is setting. I don''t know how long I''ve been sitting here.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/ZanaNarrator/360Zana_57.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[385]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4757, 'ZanaSynthMemoryGardenB', '[]', 'Mother comes from around the rear. She looks pale. Her eyes are red, and her clothes are torn. She doesn''t look at me but she grabs my hand. We walk home in silence. I lay awake in bed. I hear her crying. The man comes over often after that, with toys and food, but I don''t like him...', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/ZanaNarrator/360Zana_58.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[385]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4758, 'ZanaSynthMemoryGardenC', '[]', 'I think... I think this is a memory from Venarius. How horrible. Why would he want to join an organisation like this?', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Zana/360Zana_59.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[385]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4759, 'ZanaSynthMemoryMushCaveA', '[]', 'Help! Please, somebody, help me! I''ve fallen down here! I think I''ve hurt my leg! Hello?!... Stay calm. I''m sure someone will come soon. I''m so hungry... If I get desperate, maybe I can eat some of the mushrooms down here.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/ZanaNarrator/360Zana_60.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[385]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4760, 'ZanaSynthMemoryMushCaveB', '[]', 'I feel strange. My head feels like it is filled with bubbles. Are the walls breathing? The colours here are so vibrant... oh... My stomach... I''m ill. The world is spinning and, oh, my gut! What did I eat? I feel--', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/ZanaNarrator/360Zana_61.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[385]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4761, 'ZanaSynthMemoryMushCaveC', '[]', 'Well, I''m not sure whose memory that was, but it''s safe to say you shouldn''t eat mushrooms you don''t know.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Zana/360Zana_62.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[385]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4762, 'ZanaSynthMemoryCoastA', '[]', 'Sapinti went on her first fishing trip alone and did not return. When her body finally washed ashore, it looked as though it had been mummified for a thousand years. The fish did not touch her flesh.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/ZanaNarrator/360Zana_63.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[385]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4763, 'ZanaSynthMemoryCoastB', '[]', 'She was perfectly preserved, but drained of her blood. We buried her, but within days the earth rejected her. Whatever killed her took root in that place. The earth soured and we had to move, abandoning her body.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/ZanaNarrator/360Zana_64.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[385]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4764, 'ZanaSynthMemoryCoastC', '[]', 'Hmm, this memory seems too ancient to have belonged to Venarius.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Zana/360Zana_65.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[385]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4765, 'ZanaSynthMemoryDungeonA', '[]', 'Ha! Lioneye''s failure against Kaom comes as no surprise. He was always more arrogant than skilled. It is time a real man showed the Karui the might of the Eternal Empire.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/ZanaNarrator/360Zana_66.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[385]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4766, 'ZanaSynthMemoryDungeonB', '[]', 'Shavronne assures me that my process will be relatively painless, and that my duties as warden can continue unhindered, but as my flesh swells and ruptures, I realise I am just another test subject. At least I can fulfill my duties to the Empire before my mind--', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/ZanaNarrator/360Zana_67.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[385]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4767, 'ZanaSynthMemoryDungeonC', '[]', 'I felt so... so strong! Yet I couldn''t shake the feeling I was at my breaking point. What a terrible sensation! Was that the Warden of Axiom?', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Zana/360Zana_68.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[385]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4768, 'ZanaSynthMemoryParkA', '[]', 'People stream down the street towards Oriath Square. I hear their shouts and cheers, and when my mother isn''t looking, sneak out to join the merry crowd. Just outside the pens, a Karui boy, no older than I, stands atop the gallows.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/ZanaNarrator/360Zana_69.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[385]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4769, 'ZanaSynthMemoryParkB', '[]', 'I see by the sign around his neck he has been caught stealing. I swear I will not look away, but fear overtakes me. I hear the rope snap taut and the crowd cheer, but I fight back the tears...', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/ZanaNarrator/360Zana_70.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[385]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4770, 'ZanaSynthMemoryParkC', '[]', 'Was that Venarius as a child? I think perhaps it was... society has not changed much since he was young.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Zana/360Zana_71.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[385]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4771, 'ZanaSynthMemoryPierA', '[]', 'Out of sight, out of mind. No one speaks of the cursed land anymore. That has made it quite simple to send our smugglers out in search of powerful Eternal artefacts.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/ZanaNarrator/360Zana_72.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[385]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4772, 'ZanaSynthMemoryPierB', '[]', 'We knew of the gems, but we did not know of what Malachai called his ''muse.'' The smugglers have returned with rubbings of the device they found. They call it ''miraculous.'' I know a thing or two about miracles, so I will be the judge of that.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/ZanaNarrator/360Zana_73.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[385]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4773, 'ZanaSynthMemoryPierC', '[]', 'This was almost certainly one of the High Templar''s memories. In fact, I think this was not long before he spoke to my father!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Zana/360Zana_74.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[385]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4774, 'ZanaSynthMemoryPier2A', '[]', 'The stench convenes around me thicker than the press of the vagabonds themselves. Though starving, their strength while holding on to one another is surprising. I am trapped in a knot of ragged bodies, and the men of the Church clap me in irons despite my cries.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/ZanaNarrator/360Zana_75.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[385]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4775, 'ZanaSynthMemoryPier2B', '[]', 'I am not one of them! Can''t you hear me? I''m not Maraketh, nor homeless, and I have committed no sins. That ship is not for me! Why won''t you listen?!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/ZanaNarrator/360Zana_76.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[385]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4776, 'ZanaSynthMemoryPier2C', '[]', 'A young Venarius, innocent and helpless. If only he''d stayed that way. It never ceases to amaze me how much a person can change over their lifetime.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Zana/360Zana_77.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[385]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4777, 'ZanaSynthMemoryPrisonA', '[]', 'The shackles cut into my wrists and ankles. The guards are deaf to my pleading, but I am no murderer. If I am guilty of anything, it is falling in love with the wrong person. Ugh! Justice served, they claim.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/ZanaNarrator/360Zana_78.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[385]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4778, 'ZanaSynthMemoryPrisonB', '[]', 'This is not justice. Any chance of justice evaporated the moment I walked into the courtroom and saw her husband held the gavel. I''m just the scapegoat. It''s easy to get away with murder when you''re the judge.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/ZanaNarrator/360Zana_79.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[385]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4779, 'ZanaSynthMemoryPrisonC', '[]', 'The most upsetting thing about this memory is how unsurprising it is. It''s hard to tell whose memory this was. Certainly not Venarius, but I wouldn''t be shocked to hear he was the judge.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Zana/360Zana_80.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[385]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4780, 'ZanaSynthMemoryQuarryA', '[]', 'I strike the earth once more as I have countless times, but my strike feels unfamiliar. Instead of the crack of stone, I am met with flexing sinew. I examine my pick axe. A dark red liquid froths on its tip.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/ZanaNarrator/360Zana_81.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[385]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4781, 'ZanaSynthMemoryQuarryB', '[]', 'The metal beneath rapidly corrodes. Have I found it at last? I run to alert the General. I''m told not to speak of what I found. The other slaves must continue to dig, but I am set free.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/ZanaNarrator/360Zana_82.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[385]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4782, 'ZanaSynthMemoryQuarryC', '[]', 'This must have been one of the Eternal slaves... an Ezomyte, maybe. But sinew beneath stone? What could that be?', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Zana/360Zana_83.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[385]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4783, 'ZanaSynthMemoryAntiquaryA', '[]', 'Indexing artefact one-twelve in lot ten, an ancient jawbone. Carvings on the side attribute it to... Valako? This can''t actually be the jawbone from the myth... and this... Tukohama''s tooth? Hinekora''s hair?', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/ZanaNarrator/360Zana_94.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[385]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4784, 'ZanaSynthMemoryAntiquaryB', '[]', 'These were in the archives for centuries. Are these what those thieves were after? Who would want these relics except for... followers of Kitava? But that''s absurd... best not to mention the robbery attempt.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/ZanaNarrator/360Zana_95.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[385]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4785, 'ZanaSynthMemoryAntiquaryC', '[]', 'A single decision made out of fear had such grave consequences. I wonder, if that researcher had spoken up, could the cult of Kitava have been stopped before ravaging Oriath?', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Zana/360Zana_96.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[385]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4786, 'ZanaSynthMemoryArchivesA', '[]', 'I used to pride myself on taking care of these tomes, but the ancient treatises concerning the Vaal... should be burned. He''s making me research for him, and the things I''m reading about concern the destruction of all mankind.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/ZanaNarrator/360Zana_97.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[385]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4787, 'ZanaSynthMemoryArchivesB', '[]', 'I would think my fears of the end of the world ridiculous... except... it''s happened before. I must run... I must flee... and take my secrets with me.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/ZanaNarrator/360Zana_98.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[385]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4788, 'ZanaSynthMemoryArchivesC', '[]', 'I''ve never met him directly, but I think I know whose memory this was. It''s someone Helena talks about: Eramir. I believe he lives with the Azmeri now.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Zana/360Zana_99.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[385]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4789, 'ZanaSynthMemoryBathsA', '[]', 'Sometimes, we in the Brotherhood don''t need to harm anyone at all. We surround Drusus in the Baths. He has a family, and that means he''s vulnerable.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/ZanaNarrator/360Zana_100.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[385]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4790, 'ZanaSynthMemoryBathsB', '[]', 'He doesn''t even protest. He knows what this is. Wordlessly, he backs into the baths and sinks to the bottom. All that remains are the bubbles of his last breath.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/ZanaNarrator/360Zana_101.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[385]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4791, 'ZanaSynthMemoryBathsC', '[]', 'You know what I find most disturbing about this memory, Exile? None of the bystanders so much as lifted a finger to help poor Drusus.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Zana/360Zana_102.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[385]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4792, 'ZanaSynthMemoryCaveMineA', '[]', 'These shiny baubles we pull out of the rock are worth more than their weight in gold, yet we hardly get paid at all! We should stop work and demand our fair share.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/ZanaNarrator/360Zana_103.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[385]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4793, 'ZanaSynthMemoryCaveMineB', '[]', 'Don''t worry! They''re just sealing the entrance as a way to intimidate us! They wouldn''t dare leave a thousand men down here just to die.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/ZanaNarrator/360Zana_104.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[385]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4794, 'ZanaSynthMemoryCaveMineC', '[]', 'Human beings seem to believe the world has an inherent decency. It cost those men their lives.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Zana/360Zana_105.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[385]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4795, 'ZanaSynthMemoryChambers2A', '[]', 'The defendant is accused of Unlawful Avarice, Pecuniary Sloth, two counts of resisting Templar authority, Civil Envy, and one count of pandering.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/ZanaNarrator/360Zana_106.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[385]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4796, 'ZanaSynthMemoryChambers2B', '[]', 'You have been found guilty by the power of the Court, and will hereby be exiled to Wraeclast as penance for your sins.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/ZanaNarrator/360Zana_107.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[385]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4797, 'ZanaSynthMemoryChambers2C', '[]', 'You know all too well how little true justice the Templar meted out. I hope you at least got to argue your case.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Zana/360Zana_108.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[385]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4798, 'ZanaSynthMemoryCryptA', '[]', 'He wasn''t a pious man, and certainly had a gambling problem, but he didn''t deserve to end up like this. I feel like somebody should say something as we cover his tomb, but nobody does.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/ZanaNarrator/360Zana_109.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[385]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4799, 'ZanaSynthMemoryCryptB', '[]', 'The others begin to file away while I linger by the tomb a moment. A muffled banging sounds from within, and I consider rushing to get help... but then I remember, and leave without another word.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/ZanaNarrator/360Zana_110.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[385]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4800, 'ZanaSynthMemoryCryptC', '[]', 'I wish I could tell you what he remembered, Exile. It seems these memories have their limits.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Zana/360Zana_111.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[385]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4801, 'ZanaSynthMemoryDarkForestA', '[]', 'Farrul, lend us your eyes, that we may see past the darkness in our hearts. Fenumus, lend us your web, that we may bind our tribes together.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/ZanaNarrator/360Zana_112.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[385]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4802, 'ZanaSynthMemoryDarkForestB', '[]', 'Craiceann, lend us your shell, that we may hold out against our oppressors. Saqawal, lend us your feathers, that we may be carried to a better future. We call out in your name!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/ZanaNarrator/360Zana_113.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[385]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4803, 'ZanaSynthMemoryDarkForestC', '[]', 'So that''s what faith feels like... I''m no stranger to religion, but I never truly believed what the Templars taught us. I just had a brief glimpse into a life without doubt. I must say, I understand the allure.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Zana/360Zana_114.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[385]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4804, 'ZanaSynthMemoryFieldsA', '[]', 'I come here on sunny days to get away from the squalor of the streets and alleyways around my home. It''s not the cutpurses that bother me. It''s the city guard. Even so, a legionnaire approaches me and asks me my intent in the fields.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/ZanaNarrator/360Zana_115.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[385]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4805, 'ZanaSynthMemoryFieldsB', '[]', 'I do not answer him, instead shaking my head and holding a finger over my lips. Better to act mute than risk being clapped in irons for the sin of being born Ezomyte.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/ZanaNarrator/360Zana_116.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[385]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4806, 'ZanaSynthMemoryFieldsC', '[]', 'It''s hard to believe, but the Eternals of Sarn back then were even more rotten than the people of Oriath today. Sometimes I wonder if the Empire was doomed with or without the Cataclysm.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Zana/360Zana_117.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[385]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4807, 'ZanaSynthMemoryGlacierA', '[]', 'Rami waits at the cavern entrance for the passing aspirants. One at a time he pulls them in from the snowstorm and covers their mouth as I slice their throats. Blood stains the cavern floor.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/ZanaNarrator/360Zana_118.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[385]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4808, 'ZanaSynthMemoryGlacierB', '[]', 'Rami pulls in the last straggler and we make quick work of her. Just we two remain. Before Rami makes this realisation I plunge my blade into his eye. I alone will lead the Mutewind.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/ZanaNarrator/360Zana_119.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[385]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4809, 'ZanaSynthMemoryGlacierC', '[]', 'That was quite a brutal memory. You know, I''d never dare ask her, but is Jun Mutewind?', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Zana/360Zana_120.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[385]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4810, 'ZanaSynthMemoryGraveYardA', '[]', 'As I kneel over her grave, the night sky joins my tears. The earth becomes scattershot, stained by sputtering torchlight. She reaches out to me, and I smile...', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/ZanaNarrator/360Zana_121.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[385]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4811, 'ZanaSynthMemoryGraveYardB', '[]', '...until I see other lost loved ones reaching up through dirt. The rain smells like leather-grease, and my torch goes out as the first of the dead breaks free.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/ZanaNarrator/360Zana_122.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[385]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4812, 'ZanaSynthMemoryGraveYardC', '[]', 'Gods, the terror that gripped him in those final moments. I hope I never feel that again!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Zana/360Zana_123.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[385]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4813, 'ZanaSynthMemoryHauntA', '[]', 'I know I have no voice as a servant, but there is something deeply troubling here. This manor holds a dreadful presence which permeates the very air.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/ZanaNarrator/360Zana_124.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[385]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4814, 'ZanaSynthMemoryHauntB', '[]', 'When they find the third dead and disemboweled maid, I speak up, but the master of the household doesn''t listen. He refuses to even look at me. It is then that I realise... I am already dead...', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/ZanaNarrator/360Zana_125.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[385]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4815, 'ZanaSynthMemoryHauntC', '[]', 'Exile, how does a ghost form memories without a brain? It seems there''s much more left to discover in this world.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Zana/360Zana_126.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[385]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4816, 'ZanaSynthMemoryIcebergA', '[]', 'Nineteen more days in the mountains... I''ll never survive, never earn my Mutewind name... I''m already starving and dying after ten... and is that... a wolf?!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/ZanaNarrator/360Zana_127.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[385]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4817, 'ZanaSynthMemoryIcebergB', '[]', 'Kindest friend, kindred wolf. You kept me warm for nineteen days. I will return one day, when I am old, and let your descendants feast upon my remains.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/ZanaNarrator/360Zana_128.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[385]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4818, 'ZanaSynthMemoryIcebergC', '[]', 'I never knew barren mountains could be so beautiful.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Zana/360Zana_129.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[385]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4819, 'ZanaSynthMemoryLibraryA', '[]', 'I move through the stacks, seeking that one perfect moment from my youth. I once read a book here, its name lost to me, that perfectly struck the chords of my heart.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/ZanaNarrator/360Zana_130.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[385]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4820, 'ZanaSynthMemoryLibraryB', '[]', 'It was as if that book was written for me, and yet, I cannot find it now. There are more tomes here than I could ever pick up and check in an entire lifetime.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/ZanaNarrator/360Zana_131.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[385]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4821, 'ZanaSynthMemoryLibraryC', '[]', 'So many books have been destroyed by Wraeclast''s troubles through the years. I hope one day I can help rebuild Oriath''s libraries with new knowledge.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Zana/360Zana_132.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[385]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4822, 'ZanaSynthMemoryLunarisA', '[]', 'I don''t know much longer I can do this. Every day, we cart in the poor folk the General has rounded up for the Witch''s experiments. I used to count, but I stopped at two thousand.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/ZanaNarrator/360Zana_133.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[385]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4823, 'ZanaSynthMemoryLunarisB', '[]', 'This is not the career the Blackguards promised me. We''re worse than monsters. Look at this place! Rivers of blood! Piles of corpses! We were just following orders...', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/ZanaNarrator/360Zana_134.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[385]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4824, 'ZanaSynthMemoryLunarisC', '[]', 'Just following orders... spineless little--! How many lives were lost because someone wouldn''t stand up for what''s right? Wouldn''t think for themselves?', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Zana/360Zana_135.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[385]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4825, 'ZanaSynthMemoryMineshaftA', '[]', 'We''re trapped down here. Though we strike it again and again, the Sekhema''s seal remains unharmed. No one down here can sleep. My throat is parched, yet I feel no thirst.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/ZanaNarrator/360Zana_136.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[385]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4826, 'ZanaSynthMemoryMineshaftB', '[]', 'The foreman is beginning to show signs of madness. He claims the walls, earth, and even his pick have become sticky as honey. I pray death comes for us soon, but I fear we will receive something far worse.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/ZanaNarrator/360Zana_137.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[385]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4827, 'ZanaSynthMemoryMineshaftC', '[]', 'It seems the mines of Highgate were sealed before everyone could be evacuated... what a terrible fate...', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Zana/360Zana_138.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[385]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4828, 'ZanaSynthMemoryMoonTempleA', '[]', 'Lunaris, help me find calm. Help me find peace. Help me silence those who trouble me!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/ZanaNarrator/360Zana_139.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[385]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4829, 'ZanaSynthMemoryMoonTempleB', '[]', 'Lunaris, help me destroy my enemies! Help me take what is rightfully mine!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/ZanaNarrator/360Zana_140.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[385]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4830, 'ZanaSynthMemoryMoonTempleC', '[]', 'Somewhere in history, the old religions lost their way. Or perhaps this is the journey every religion takes eventually...', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Zana/360Zana_141.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[385]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4831, 'ZanaSynthMemoryOasisA', '[]', 'I cannot escape the feeling that I am being cooked by the sun in a cauldron made of sand. As I dream of water, walking, dying, I see it: an oasis.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/ZanaNarrator/360Zana_142.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[385]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4832, 'ZanaSynthMemoryOasisB', '[]', 'I slake my thirst with chill liquid that sparkles in the sun. I dunk my head, then lie down, exhausted and exhilarated. Today, I get to live.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/ZanaNarrator/360Zana_143.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[385]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4833, 'ZanaSynthMemoryOasisC', '[]', 'At long last, a memory that didn''t make me want to curl up into a ball and weep!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Zana/360Zana_144.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[385]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4834, 'ZanaSynthMemoryRooftopA', '[]', 'The last three weeks feel like they''ve passed in an instant. The atmosphere here since the High Templar''s disappearance has been so relaxed, but, while enjoying the sun on my roof this morning, I saw the black smoke billowing from the Chamber of Innocence turn red.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/ZanaNarrator/360Zana_145.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[385]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4835, 'ZanaSynthMemoryRooftopB', '[]', 'The Seneschals have at last elected a new High Templar. Rumour has it they''ve sought young blood. Someone who can revitalise the Templar. Someone who can bring them into the modern age. Whoever it is, he can''t be worse than the last one. Bastard set us back fifty years!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/ZanaNarrator/360Zana_146.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[385]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4836, 'ZanaSynthMemoryRooftopC', '[]', 'That was Dominus'' ascension to power. I remember seeing the smoke from the orphanage... it was so soon after my father''s disappearance.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Zana/360Zana_147.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[385]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4837, 'ZanaSynthMemorySanctuaryA', '[]', 'What is it? You know I am not to be disturbed during my communion with God-- it''s here? Well get it to the lab immediately, and do not disturb me again, lest I take your head!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/ZanaNarrator/360Zana_148.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[385]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4838, 'ZanaSynthMemorySanctuaryB', '[]', 'I feel a rush of excitement as I review the contents of the crate. The pieces, aged as they are, still hum with energy. I can feel its potential, and it fills me with hope and terror. I cannot assemble it, but I know who can. I need only apply a little pressure...', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/ZanaNarrator/360Zana_149.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[385]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4839, 'ZanaSynthMemorySanctuaryC', '[]', 'Exile, who was that? How did he come to have pieces of the map device? Were they then delivered to my father?', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Zana/360Zana_150.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[385]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4840, 'ZanaSynthMemoryScepterA', '[]', 'I am so very late. This is deeply embarrassing. I fear the wait will be too long now. But this is the one chance I get to meet the great Laureate and I will not let it go to waste!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/ZanaNarrator/360Zana_151.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[385]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4841, 'ZanaSynthMemoryScepterB', '[]', 'Malachai says he has perfected new techniques that will unlock the raw power hidden within the Virtue Gems. I have volunteered my body to the cause. I feel no fear, no hunger, no pleasure... nothing. I only hear his voice. I must obey...', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/ZanaNarrator/360Zana_152.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[385]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4842, 'ZanaSynthMemoryScepterC', '[]', 'Ugh, I feel disgusting after that. Even within that memory I could feel Malachai''s presence wrapping around my mind like grasping little fingers.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Zana/360Zana_153.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[385]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4843, 'ZanaSynthMemorySewersA', '[]', 'We walk in absolute silence through the murk. It''s after midnight, but the streets above are still abuzz with activity. Hours pass before the streets fall silent. We emerge one by one into a pitch-black room.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/ZanaNarrator/360Zana_154.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[385]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4844, 'ZanaSynthMemorySewersB', '[]', 'As I help our last out of the sewers, a flint is struck, and we are surrounded by light and gleaming imperial armour. There''s a dagger at my throat. A setup! Dragged into a cell, the guards laughing. I still reek of the sewers...', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/ZanaNarrator/360Zana_155.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[385]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4845, 'ZanaSynthMemorySewersC', '[]', 'There are times, Exile, when I wish those memories weren''t so vivid. Sometimes I don''t need to know what a memory smells like.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Zana/360Zana_156.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[385]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4846, 'ZanaSynthMemorySolarisA', '[]', 'Tonight is a celebration. On this, the night of a Thousand Ribbons, we honour Emperor Chitus for his heroic defense of our beloved capital. Long may he reign!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/ZanaNarrator/360Zana_157.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[385]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4847, 'ZanaSynthMemorySolarisB', '[]', 'I feel fear... and hatred. The Emperor stands before me, and I know this is my chance. I strike at him. I pierce his belly, but it is not immediately lethal. I lock eyes with the man. I watch him raise his axe...', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/ZanaNarrator/360Zana_158.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[385]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4848, 'ZanaSynthMemorySolarisC', '[]', 'I felt my body split into two. Agony! That''s the last thing I remember. This memory must have belonged to Ondar, the Betrayer. For some reason, I always thought that was a myth... but apparently not.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Zana/360Zana_159.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[385]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4849, 'ZanaSynthMemorySpiderForestA', '[]', 'I''m a fool to have gotten lost here, but it was getting dark, and I thought I saw a way home. A crowd stands silently around me, their faces blank white, their bodies covered in webs.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/ZanaNarrator/360Zana_160.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[385]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4850, 'ZanaSynthMemorySpiderForestB', '[]', 'The crowd begins to shiver and shake as I creep between their bound hands. Some moan for help. Others scream. As their bodies bubble, I realise I cannot help them. Tiny spiders pour out of open wounds.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/ZanaNarrator/360Zana_161.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[385]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4851, 'ZanaSynthMemorySpiderForestC', '[]', 'Exile, if you ever find me trapped in webbing like that... put me out of my misery.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Zana/360Zana_162.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[385]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4852, 'ZanaSynthMemorySwampBogA', '[]', 'Beneath the summer sun we follow Tarcus in search of the promised land. Before long, hunger grips our stomachs. The doomlands take their toll. Our numbers dwindle, and discord spreads amongst the tribesmen.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/ZanaNarrator/360Zana_163.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[385]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4853, 'ZanaSynthMemorySwampBogB', '[]', 'Veruso''s words quell our hearts, but not our stomachs. In the dead of night, a woman goes missing, and our hunger is abated. We reach the ruins of Azala Vaal alive, but dark deeds hide in our bellies.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/ZanaNarrator/360Zana_164.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[385]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4854, 'ZanaSynthMemorySwampBogC', '[]', 'How horrible... the founders of Sarn! Not such a promising start.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Zana/360Zana_165.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[385]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4855, 'ZanaSynthMemoryThicketA', '[]', 'He told me to meet him out here at midnight. Well, it''s midnight and he isn''t here, and I can hear wolves nearby. He better hurry up or I''m leaving.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/ZanaNarrator/360Zana_166.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[385]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4856, 'ZanaSynthMemoryThicketB', '[]', 'That''s it. I''m out of here. Now which way did I come from? Was it this way? No. Must have been this way. Hmm... this doesn''t look familiar either. None of this looks familiar, and I think I hear the wolves coming closer...', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/ZanaNarrator/360Zana_167.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[385]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4857, 'ZanaSynthMemoryThicketC', '[]', 'Huh... I''ve never felt lost like that before... I didn''t care for it. I think I prefer knowing exactly where I stand.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Zana/360Zana_168.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[385]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4858, 'ZanaSynthMemoryCausewayA', '[]', 'We pack up our camp just before sunrise and journey towards the capital, Azala Vaal. We hear the crowd before we see them. Word of our victory spread quickly, and even the Queen has come to meet us.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/ZanaNarrator/360Zana_169.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[385]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4859, 'ZanaSynthMemoryCausewayB', '[]', 'My family has come to watch the ceremony. As I lay on the stone altar, I hear them chanting my name. It''s the last thing I hear before the Queen''s dagger is plunged into my chest.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/ZanaNarrator/360Zana_170.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[385]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4860, 'ZanaSynthMemoryCausewayC', '[]', 'I saw her, Exile... I saw the Queen of the Vaal! She had such a terrible presence...', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Zana/360Zana_171.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[385]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4861, 'ZanaSynthMemoryDriedLakeA', '[]', 'Six moons have passed since the earth supped the rain. The riverbed is dry, and the lake is but a puddle. The beasts here have become desperate and dangerous.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/ZanaNarrator/360Zana_172.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[385]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4862, 'ZanaSynthMemoryDriedLakeB', '[]', 'There are rumours that Lord Yriel''s blood-fed crops have swelled, but the fruit they bear can send a man mad. We look to our children for the answer. A child cannot hunt, but it can still provide. The taste is hard to forget.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/ZanaNarrator/360Zana_173.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[385]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4863, 'ZanaSynthMemoryDriedLakeC', '[]', 'They ate-- Gods, Exile...! I feel sick to my stomach.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Zana/360Zana_174.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[385]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4864, 'ZanaSynthMemoryCellsA', '[]', 'You can''t just keep me locked up! I have rights you know! I deserve a fair trial! Hey! You hear me!?', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/ZanaNarrator/360Zana_175.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[385]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4865, 'ZanaSynthMemoryCellsB', '[]', 'Hello?! Guard!? I smell smoke! Get me out of here-- please! Don''t just leave me to die! Someone please help! Please!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/ZanaNarrator/360Zana_176.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[385]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4866, 'ZanaSynthMemoryCellsC', '[]', 'After everything that has happened, this one hits too close to home.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Zana/360Zana_177.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[385]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4867, 'ZanaSynthMemoryLushBeachCliffA', '[]', 'I don''t understand. I saw Bryn die. I held him. The fever that took him was so intense... I remember the moment his body went cold. But now he lives once more.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/ZanaNarrator/360Zana_178.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[385]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4868, 'ZanaSynthMemoryLushBeachCliffB', '[]', 'Yet it is not truly him. I know that. A mother knows her son and this creature is not my son. It is a hollow imposter. My son''s spirit is with Innocence. So I go to him at last.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/ZanaNarrator/360Zana_179.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[385]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4869, 'ZanaSynthMemoryLushBeachCliffC', '[]', 'She leapt, Exile. I felt her fall. What terrible anguish she felt...', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Zana/360Zana_180.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[385]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4870, 'ZanaSynthMemoryRidgeA', '[]', 'Everyone is dead and I am alone. The Karui swept through the watch so quickly, we didn''t have a chance to flee. Men, women, even children, slaughtered. I''m lucky to be alive. But I cannot return home now. No.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/ZanaNarrator/360Zana_181.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[385]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4871, 'ZanaSynthMemoryRidgeB', '[]', 'I''d be branded a coward, imprisoned, and hung for desertion. I have no choice. I must make do out in the wilds. Perhaps a farmer will take pity on me. And if not, I have my blade. I will take what I need by force.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/ZanaNarrator/360Zana_182.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[385]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4872, 'ZanaSynthMemoryRidgeC', '[]', 'It''s hard to feel pity for a man like that, desperate as he was.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Zana/360Zana_183.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[385]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4873, 'ZanaSynthMemoryPoolsAndStreamsA', '[]', 'My legs ache, but at last they can rest. We are two days journey from the nearest city, and the trickle of water sets me at ease. I begin to set up camp.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/ZanaNarrator/360Zana_184.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[385]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4874, 'ZanaSynthMemoryPoolsAndStreamsB', '[]', 'My wife bathes naked in the stream. I appreciate her form from the banks. With any luck, we will never see another person as long as we live.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/ZanaNarrator/360Zana_185.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[385]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4875, 'ZanaSynthMemoryPoolsAndStreamsC', '[]', 'It''s not all doom and gloom, Exile. It''s worth remembering that.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Zana/360Zana_186.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[385]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4876, 'ZanaSynthMemoryReefA', '[]', 'The storm is bad now. The ship rocks to and fro. The other exiles exchange glances as a guard struggles to regain his footing. Then, we hit the rocks.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/ZanaNarrator/360Zana_187.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[385]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4877, 'ZanaSynthMemoryReefB', '[]', 'When I come to, I''m alone on a tiny island. Little more than a rock, really. I can''t see any other land. Even Wraeclast would''ve been better than this.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/ZanaNarrator/360Zana_188.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[385]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4878, 'ZanaSynthMemoryReefC', '[]', 'Just goes to show, even as the world around us lays in ruins, things could always be worse.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Zana/360Zana_189.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[385]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4879, 'ZanaSynthMemoryForestCaveA', '[]', 'The world is changing in dark and subtle ways around us as I run. My arms burn from the weight of my young children. The sun is turning blood red, and there''s only one place of safety I can imagine.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/ZanaNarrator/360Zana_190.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[385]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4880, 'ZanaSynthMemoryForestCaveB', '[]', 'The walls of the cave we huddle in tremble. The screaming outside keeps us from fleeing into the open air. Life has gone mad, and the sky is burning. The children cry out for their mother, but I haven''t the heart to tell them what she became in front of my eyes.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/ZanaNarrator/360Zana_191.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[385]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4881, 'ZanaSynthMemoryForestCaveC', '[]', 'How horrible... I wonder what ever happened to those children. Perhaps it''s better not to know.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Zana/360Zana_192.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[385]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4882, 'ZanaSynthMemoryForestCanalsA', '[]', 'The boats are the only way out of the city! Don''t you understand? The sky is burning! We have to go!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/ZanaNarrator/360Zana_193.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[385]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4883, 'ZanaSynthMemoryForestCanalsB', '[]', 'Everyone had the same idea. The crowded boats aren''t moving at all. The others scream and wail. Everything begins to burn. I hold my son under the water and pray his death is quicker than mine.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/ZanaNarrator/360Zana_194.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[385]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4884, 'ZanaSynthMemoryForestCanalsC', '[]', 'The most horrible thing is, I''m certain that parent was doing their child a mercy.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Zana/360Zana_195.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[385]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4885, 'ZanaSynthMemoryRuinedTempleA', '[]', 'My grandparents worshipped here, back when it was still a place of faith. I wonder, did the gods ever hear them?', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/ZanaNarrator/360Zana_196.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[385]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4886, 'ZanaSynthMemoryRuinedTempleB', '[]', 'I choose to believe the gods did listen, and that I am here now out of that benevolence. It is the only way I can explain surviving the troubles.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/ZanaNarrator/360Zana_197.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[385]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4887, 'ZanaSynthMemoryRuinedTempleC', '[]', 'Knowing what we now know about the gods, I think we can safely say benevolence was not the cause.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Zana/360Zana_198.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[385]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4888, 'ZanaSynthMemorySpiderThicketA', '[]', 'Where am I? What happened? I remember a massive spider coming at me, and then... huh, I''m stuck in webbing...', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/ZanaNarrator/360Zana_199.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[385]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4889, 'ZanaSynthMemorySpiderThicketB', '[]', 'My stomach is really rumbling... and it hurts... and it''s bulging... and rippling...', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/ZanaNarrator/360Zana_200.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[385]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4890, 'ZanaSynthMemorySpiderThicketC', '[]', 'Ugh, what a horrid way to die. Exile, if you ever find me in that state, you know what to do, right?', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Zana/360Zana_201.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[385]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4891, 'ZanaSynthMemoryCitySlumsA', '[]', 'Sarn is the city of opportunity, they said. The cradle of civilisation. Pardon me if I don''t feel swaddled and taken care of in this ''cradle.''', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/ZanaNarrator/360Zana_202.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[385]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4892, 'ZanaSynthMemoryCitySlumsB', '[]', 'It''s starve or steal. I think I know which one I like better.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/ZanaNarrator/360Zana_203.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[385]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4893, 'ZanaSynthMemoryCitySlumsC', '[]', 'With Oriath in the state it''s in, I worry we''re not far from tumbling down this same road. At least we can rule Venarius out of that memory.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Zana/360Zana_204.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[385]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4894, 'ZanaSynthMemoryDaressoA', '[]', 'With one motion, I cleave a man in twain. A kick sends another flying, and the roar of the crowd swells. I am their idol!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/ZanaNarrator/360Zana_205.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[385]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4895, 'ZanaSynthMemoryDaressoB', '[]', 'I was always meant to be at the top of the pile. Nobody else can compare. And this tiny man, this new challenger, Daresso, will fall like the rest to the might of Barkhul.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/ZanaNarrator/360Zana_206.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[385]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4896, 'ZanaSynthMemoryDaressoC', '[]', 'Ha! We know how that ended, don''t we?', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Zana/360Zana_207.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[385]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4897, 'ZanaSynthMemoryPlateauA', '[]', 'I''ve thirsted for adventure my entire life, but I suppose, at eighty-two, the most I can do now is walk along the village plateau.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/ZanaNarrator/360Zana_208.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[385]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4898, 'ZanaSynthMemoryPlateauB', '[]', 'I dreamt of magic and adventure when I was younger. It''s a shame this world isn''t more exciting.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/ZanaNarrator/360Zana_209.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[385]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4899, 'ZanaSynthMemoryPlateauC', '[]', 'Ah, what I would give for a boring life...', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Zana/360Zana_210.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[385]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4900, 'ZanaSynthMemoryControlBlocksA', '[]', 'I wear the armor of a Templar, and I walk among the guards, but I am not one of them. My soul is Kitava''s to consume.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/ZanaNarrator/360Zana_211.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[385]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4901, 'ZanaSynthMemoryControlBlocksB', '[]', 'The time nears. At the appointed hour, I will open the gates... all the gates.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/ZanaNarrator/360Zana_212.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[385]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4902, 'ZanaSynthMemoryControlBlocksC', '[]', 'Bastard... that bastard! Do you think he knew what he was about to loose upon us? No... I can''t believe anyone would knowingly do that.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Zana/360Zana_213.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[385]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4903, 'ZanaSynthMemoryOssuaryA', '[]', 'Centuries of my predecessors line these walls. It is supposedly the ultimate honor to rest with them, but I have my doubts.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/ZanaNarrator/360Zana_214.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[385]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4904, 'ZanaSynthMemoryOssuaryB', '[]', 'How would anyone know which bones are mine? How would anyone know that I am even here? Because I recognise none of these remains myself...', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/ZanaNarrator/360Zana_215.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[385]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4905, 'ZanaSynthMemoryOssuaryC', '[]', 'Confronting one''s mortality is always troubling, isn''t it? I believe Venarius would not be so humble as the owner of this memory.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Zana/360Zana_216.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[385]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4906, 'ZanaSynthMemoryCanalsA', '[]', 'I feel very nervous. Am I sweating? I think I''m sweating. I hope she doesn''t notice how much I''m sweating. Oh no, she looked at me. She can definitely see how sweaty I am. I should say something. Your face is good?! Why would you say that!?', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/ZanaNarrator/360Zana_217.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[385]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4907, 'ZanaSynthMemoryCanalsB', '[]', 'She laughed at you. Now she''s gonna tell all the women in Sarn how stupid and useless you are. You''re gonna die alone. Wait... is she-- she''s holding your hand! You did it! Your face is good! Classic line. Works every time.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/ZanaNarrator/360Zana_218.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[385]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4908, 'ZanaSynthMemoryCanalsC', '[]', 'That was... deeply uncomfortable to witness.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Zana/360Zana_219.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[385]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4909, 'ZanaSynthMemoryReef2A', '[]', 'This is not good. I can''t believe I fell asleep. Now I''m in the middle of the bloody ocean without a bloody paddle. Micah, you stupid shite. Why couldn''t you just follow the bloody captain''s orders?', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/ZanaNarrator/360Zana_220.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[385]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4910, 'ZanaSynthMemoryReef2B', '[]', 'Now you''ve gone and got yourself killed. Unless... what is that? Is that a ship on the horizon? It looks like Roth''s! Long as he doesn''t hold a grudge, I''m saved!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/ZanaNarrator/360Zana_221.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[385]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4911, 'ZanaSynthMemoryReef2C', '[]', 'Roth? Could it be-- no, that is simply too much of a coincidence. Still, I can''t help but wonder...', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Zana/360Zana_222.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[385]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4912, 'VenariusSynthMemoryAntiquaryA', '[]', 'Indexing artefact one-twelve in lot ten, an ancient jawbone. Carvings on the side attribute it to... Valako? This can''t actually be the jawbone from the myth... and this... Tukohama''s tooth? Hinekora''s hair?', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/CavasNarrator/Ven_163.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[376]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4913, 'VenariusSynthMemoryAntiquaryB', '[]', 'These were in the archives for centuries. Are these what those thieves were after? Who would want these relics, except for followers of Kitava? But that''s absurd... best not to mention the robbery attempt.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/CavasNarrator/Ven_164.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[376]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4914, 'VenariusSynthMemoryAntiquaryC', '[]', 'Exile, I think a historian somewhere made a grave mistake by keeping quiet.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Cavas/Ven_165.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[376]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4915, 'VenariusSynthMemoryArachnidTombA', '[]', 'I''m a fool to have gotten lost here, but it was getting dark, and I thought I saw a way home. A crowd stands silently around me, their faces blank white, their bodies covered in webs.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/CavasNarrator/Ven_262.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[376]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4916, 'VenariusSynthMemoryArachnidTombB', '[]', 'The crowd begins to shiver and shake as I creep between their bound hands. Some moan for help. Others scream as their bodies bubble, and I realise I cannot help them. Tiny spiders pour out of open wounds.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/CavasNarrator/Ven_263.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[376]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4917, 'VenariusSynthMemoryArachnidTombC', '[]', 'Eugh, no! I can still feel them crawling on me!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Cavas/Ven_264.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[376]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4918, 'VenariusSynthMemoryBathsA', '[]', 'Sometimes, we in the Brotherhood don''t need to harm anyone at all. We surround Drusus in the Baths. He has a family, and that means he is vulnerable.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/CavasNarrator/Ven_238.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[376]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4919, 'VenariusSynthMemoryBathsB', '[]', 'He doesn''t even protest. He knows what this is. Wordlessly, he backs into the baths and sinks to the bottom. All that remains are the bubbles of his last breath.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/CavasNarrator/Ven_239.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[376]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4920, 'VenariusSynthMemoryBathsC', '[]', 'I find myself less perturbed by that memory than I should be. It was almost... peaceful. What does that say about me?', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Cavas/Ven_240.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[376]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4921, 'VenariusSynthMemoryCanalsA', '[]', 'The boats are the only way out of the city! Don''t you understand? The sky is burning! We have to go!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/CavasNarrator/Ven_268.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[376]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4922, 'VenariusSynthMemoryCanalsB', '[]', 'Everyone had the same idea. The crowded boats aren''t moving at all. The others scream and wail. Everything begins to burn. I hold my son under the water and pray his death is quicker than mine.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/CavasNarrator/Ven_269.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[376]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4923, 'VenariusSynthMemoryCanalsC', '[]', 'Such suffering and loss in this world... sometimes I wonder if I''m better off not remembering.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Cavas/Ven_270.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[376]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4924, 'VenariusSynthMemoryCausewayA', '[]', 'We pack up our camp just before sunrise and journey towards the capital, Azala Vaal. We hear the crowd before we see them. Word of our victory spread quickly, and even the Queen has come to meet us.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/CavasNarrator/Ven_205.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[376]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4925, 'VenariusSynthMemoryCausewayB', '[]', 'My family has come to watch the ceremony. As I lay on the stone altar, I hear them chanting my name. It is the last thing I hear before the Queen''s dagger is plunged into my chest.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/CavasNarrator/Ven_206.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[376]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4926, 'VenariusSynthMemoryCausewayC', '[]', ' I could almost feel the blade. What a chilling moment from a terrible time in history. Far older than I, I''m afraid.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Cavas/Ven_207.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[376]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4927, 'VenariusSynthMemoryCaveMineA', '[]', 'These shiny baubles we pull out of the rock are worth more than their weight in gold, yet we hardly get paid at all! We should stop work and demand our fair share.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/CavasNarrator/Ven_241.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[376]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4928, 'VenariusSynthMemoryCaveMineB', '[]', 'Don''t worry! They''re just sealing the entrance as a way to intimidate us! They wouldn''t dare leave a thousand men down here to die.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/CavasNarrator/Ven_242.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[376]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4929, 'VenariusSynthMemoryCaveMineC', '[]', 'It seems the Empire was harsher than even its citizens knew. I doubt their bodies were ever found.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Cavas/Ven_243.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[376]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4930, 'VenariusSynthMemoryCellsA', '[]', 'You can''t just keep me locked up! I have rights you know! I deserve a fair trial! Hey! You hear me!?', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/CavasNarrator/Ven_265.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[376]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4931, 'VenariusSynthMemoryCellsB', '[]', 'Hello?! Guard!? I smell smoke! Get me out of here-- please! Don''t just leave me to die! Someone please help! Please!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/CavasNarrator/Ven_266.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[376]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4932, 'VenariusSynthMemoryCellsC', '[]', 'I fear that man never again saw the light of day. I''m so grateful I was never incarcerated.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Cavas/Ven_267.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[376]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4933, 'VenariusSynthMemoryChambersA', '[]', 'The Courts are burning. Accusations fly. Sinner! Heretic! I am but an initiate, and my patron urges silence. We will keep our heads down while one High Templar supplants another. It is all about power, my patron whispers, and we have none.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/CavasNarrator/Ven_127.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[376]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4934, 'VenariusSynthMemoryChambersB', '[]', 'Should an accusation fall our way, we shall be doomed to die with the other accused. Be unseen and unheard, he whispers. This is what happens when men who seek power refuse to wait. I learned a valuable lesson that day: Trust without leverage is vulnerability.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/CavasNarrator/Ven_128.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[376]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4935, 'VenariusSynthMemoryChambersC', '[]', 'Oh, Exile, I was caught up in the memory. It felt so familiar. Was it one of mine?', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Cavas/Ven_129.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[376]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4936, 'VenariusSynthMemoryColosseumA', '[]', 'With one motion, I cleave a man in twain. A kick sends another flying, and the roar of the crowd swells. I am their idol!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/CavasNarrator/Ven_226.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[376]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4937, 'VenariusSynthMemoryColosseumB', '[]', 'I was always meant to be at the top of the pile. Nobody else can compare. And this tiny man, this new challenger, Daresso, will fall like the rest to the might of Barkhul.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/CavasNarrator/Ven_227.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[376]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4938, 'VenariusSynthMemoryColosseumC', '[]', 'From the look of the carnage around that ''Daresso'' person, I think that ancient gladiator was in for quite a surprise.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Cavas/Ven_228.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[376]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4939, 'VenariusSynthMemoryControlBlocksA', '[]', 'I wear the armor of a Templar, and I walk among the guards, but I am not one of them. My soul is Kitava''s to consume.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/CavasNarrator/Ven_229.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[376]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4940, 'VenariusSynthMemoryControlBlocksB', '[]', 'The time nears. At the appointed hour, I will open the gates... all the gates.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/CavasNarrator/Ven_230.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[376]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4941, 'VenariusSynthMemoryControlBlocksC', '[]', 'I don''t think I was some sort of cultist... his urge toward self-destruction was overwhelming.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Cavas/Ven_231.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[376]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4942, 'VenariusSynthMemoryCryptA', '[]', 'He wasn''t a pious man, and certainly had a gambling problem, but he didn''t deserve to end up like this. I feel like somebody should say something as we cover his tomb, but nobody does.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/CavasNarrator/Ven_247.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[376]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4943, 'VenariusSynthMemoryCryptB', '[]', 'The others begin to file away while I linger by the tomb a moment. A muffled banging sounds from within, and I consider rushing to get help... but then I remember, and leave without another word.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/CavasNarrator/Ven_248.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[376]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4944, 'VenariusSynthMemoryCryptC', '[]', 'Exile... the sensation... that man recalled another memory while I was in his memory... but I couldn''t see that one! Why did he leave, I wonder?', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Cavas/Ven_249.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[376]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4945, 'VenariusSynthMemoryDarkForestA', '[]', 'Farrul, lend us your eyes, that we may see past the darkness in our hearts. Fenumus, lend us your web, that we may bind our tribes together.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/CavasNarrator/Ven_196.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[376]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4946, 'VenariusSynthMemoryDarkForestB', '[]', 'Craiceann, lend us your shell, that we may hold out against our oppressors. Saqawal, lend us your feathers, that we may be carried to a better future. We call out in your name!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/CavasNarrator/Ven_197.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[376]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4947, 'VenariusSynthMemoryDarkForestC', '[]', 'Hmm... a ritual of some sort. I do not recognise the names, though they sound Ezomyte to my ear. Silly superstitions, if you ask me.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Cavas/Ven_198.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[376]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4948, 'VenariusSynthMemoryDriedLakeA', '[]', 'Six moons have passed since the earth supped the rain. The riverbed is dry, and the lake is but a puddle. The beasts here have become desperate and dangerous.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/CavasNarrator/Ven_208.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[376]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4949, 'VenariusSynthMemoryDriedLakeB', '[]', 'There are rumours that Lord Yriel''s blood-fed crops have swelled, but the fruit they bear can send a man mad. We look to our children for the answer. A child cannot hunt, but it can still provide. The taste is hard to forget.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/CavasNarrator/Ven_209.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[376]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4950, 'VenariusSynthMemoryDriedLakeC', '[]', 'Exile... this is a memory I would rather not have experienced. How nauseating.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Cavas/Ven_210.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[376]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4951, 'VenariusSynthMemoryDungeonA', '[]', 'Lioneye''s failure against Kaom comes as no surprise. He was always more arrogant than skilled. It is time a real man showed the Karui the might of the Eternal Empire.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/CavasNarrator/Ven_130.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[376]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4952, 'VenariusSynthMemoryDungeonB', '[]', 'Shavronne assures me the process will be relatively painless and that my duties as warden can continue unhindered, but as my flesh swells and ruptures I realise I am just another test subject. At least I can fulfill my duties to the Empire before my mind--', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/CavasNarrator/Ven_131.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[376]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4953, 'VenariusSynthMemoryDungeonC', '[]', 'Ohh, such might, Exile. I felt so strong, yet I felt I was losing control. Another memory that felt too ancient to be mine, however.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Cavas/Ven_132.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[376]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4954, 'VenariusSynthMemoryFieldsA', '[]', 'I come here on sunny days to get away from the squalor of the streets and alleyways around my home. It is not the cutpurses that bother me. It''s the city guard. Even so, a legionnaire approaches me and asks my intent in the fields.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/CavasNarrator/Ven_253.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[376]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4955, 'VenariusSynthMemoryFieldsB', '[]', 'I do not answer him, instead shaking my head and holding a finger over my lips. Better to act mute than risk being clapped in irons for the sin of being born Ezomyte.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/CavasNarrator/Ven_254.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[376]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4956, 'VenariusSynthMemoryFieldsC', '[]', 'Thank the Gods I''m no Ezomyte, Exile. I''d not stand for such treatment.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Cavas/Ven_255.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[376]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4957, 'VenariusSynthMemoryFissureA', '[]', 'Master''s orders were clear. I am to wait here until his return. I cast my eyes to the horizon and see smoke billowing from Sarn. The city burns, and I fear my master burns with it.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/CavasNarrator/Ven_133.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[376]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4958, 'VenariusSynthMemoryFissureB', '[]', 'The sky grows red. I hear screaming from the village by the Crossroads, but I will not abandon my post. Master will return, and I will await him. No matter how long, I will wait for Maligaro''s return.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/CavasNarrator/Ven_134.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[376]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4959, 'VenariusSynthMemoryFissureC', '[]', 'Maligaro... that name rings a bell... was it mine? No... this memory feels too old.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Cavas/Ven_135.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[376]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4960, 'VenariusSynthMemoryForestA', '[]', 'Another child was taken last night, so tonight we wait, praying the demon does not return, but it does. We catch only glimpses of its grey skin beneath the moonlight. We pursue the demon on foot to the edge of the woods. The child it carries does not cry out.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/CavasNarrator/Ven_136.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[376]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4961, 'VenariusSynthMemoryForestB', '[]', 'Anaris follows closely, but I hesitate. I gather my will and leap into the shadows, tracking the demon. But I am too late. The demon and child are gone, and Anaris stands frozen, pale as the moon. He whispers something I do not hear and falls, dead. I fear we will be hunted to extinction.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/CavasNarrator/Ven_137.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[376]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4962, 'VenariusSynthMemoryForestC', '[]', 'Can such a horrible tale be true? I pray not. It is no memory of mine, of that I am certain.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Cavas/Ven_138.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[376]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4963, 'VenariusSynthMemoryForestCaveA', '[]', 'The world is changing in dark and subtle ways around us as I run. My arms burn from the weight of my young children. The sun is turning blood red, and there''s only one place of safety I can imagine.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/CavasNarrator/Ven_235.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[376]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4964, 'VenariusSynthMemoryForestCaveB', '[]', 'The walls of the cave we huddle in tremble, but the screaming outside keeps us from fleeing into the open air. Life itself has gone mad, and the sky is burning. The children cry out for their mother, but I haven''t the heart to tell them what she became in front of my eyes.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/CavasNarrator/Ven_236.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[376]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4965, 'VenariusSynthMemoryForestCaveC', '[]', 'Oh, my friend, these memories are sometimes too much to bear.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Cavas/Ven_237.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[376]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4966, 'VenariusSynthMemoryGardenA', '[]', 'A man in uniform visits. He is from the Courts. He says the Templar have alms for widows like my mother, but she must collect it in person. We go to the church, and I wait outside in the gardens. The sun is setting. I don''t know how long I''ve been sitting here.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/CavasNarrator/Ven_139.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[376]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4967, 'VenariusSynthMemoryGardenB', '[]', 'When mother returns, she looks pale. Her eyes are red, and her clothes are torn. She grabs my hand, and we walk home in silence. I lie awake in bed. I hear her crying. The man comes over often after that, with toys and food, but I don''t like him...', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/CavasNarrator/Ven_140.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[376]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4968, 'VenariusSynthMemoryGardenC', '[]', 'Oh, I remember this... Mother was never the same after that day. I wish I had understood at the time... I might have been able to do something.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Cavas/Ven_141.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[376]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4969, 'VenariusSynthMemoryGlacierA', '[]', 'Rami waits at the cavern entrance for the passing aspirants. One at a time he pulls them in from the snowstorm and covers their mouth as I slice their throats. Blood stains the cavern floor.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/CavasNarrator/Ven_199.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[376]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4970, 'VenariusSynthMemoryGlacierB', '[]', 'Rami pulls in the last straggler and we make quick work of her. Just we two remain. Before Rami makes this realisation, I plunge my blade into his eye. I alone will lead the Mutewind.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/CavasNarrator/Ven_200.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[376]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4971, 'VenariusSynthMemoryGlacierC', '[]', 'What a barbaric memory. Were all Mutewind this vicious? I certainly hope I was not one of them.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Cavas/Ven_201.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[376]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4972, 'VenariusSynthMemoryGraveYardA', '[]', 'As I kneel over her grave, the night sky joins my tears. The earth becomes scattershot, stained by sputtering torchlight. She reaches out to me, and I smile...', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/CavasNarrator/Ven_250.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[376]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4973, 'VenariusSynthMemoryGraveYardB', '[]', '...until I see other lost loved ones reaching up through dirt. The rain smells like leather-grease, and my torch goes out as the first of the dead bursts free.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/CavasNarrator/Ven_251.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[376]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4974, 'VenariusSynthMemoryGraveYardC', '[]', 'Why is Wraeclast beset by such evils? My friend, we must find a way to protect the people.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Cavas/Ven_252.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[376]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4975, 'VenariusSynthMemoryHauntA', '[]', 'I know I have no voice as a servant, but there is something deeply troubling here. This manor holds a dreadful presence which permeates the very air.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/CavasNarrator/Ven_166.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[376]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4976, 'VenariusSynthMemoryHauntB', '[]', 'When they find the third dead and disemboweled maid, I speak up, but the master of the household doesn''t listen. He refuses to even look at me. It is then that I realize... I am already dead.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/CavasNarrator/Ven_167.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[376]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4977, 'VenariusSynthMemoryHauntC', '[]', 'Quite the twist on that memory, Exile, but I was never a servant, nor a manor-bound spirit. At least, as far as I know...', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Cavas/Ven_168.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[376]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4978, 'VenariusSynthMemoryIcebergA', '[]', 'Nineteen more days in the mountains... I''ll never survive, never earn my Mutewind name... I''m already starving and dying after ten... and is that... a wolf?!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/CavasNarrator/Ven_169.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[376]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4979, 'VenariusSynthMemoryIcebergB', '[]', 'Kindest friend, kindred wolf. You kept me warm for nineteen days. I will return one day, when I am old, and let your descendants feast upon my remains.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/CavasNarrator/Ven_170.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[376]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4980, 'VenariusSynthMemoryIcebergC', '[]', 'Exile! I felt a wolf''s fur... whose life was that? So very different from what I expected!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Cavas/Ven_171.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[376]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4981, 'VenariusSynthMemoryLibraryA', '[]', 'I move through the stacks, seeking that one perfect moment from my youth. I once read a book here, its name lost to me, that perfectly struck the chords of my heart.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/CavasNarrator/Ven_172.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[376]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4982, 'VenariusSynthMemoryLibraryB', '[]', 'It was as if that book was written for me, and yet, I cannot find it now. There are more tomes here than I could ever pick up and check in an entire lifetime.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/CavasNarrator/Ven_173.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[376]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4983, 'VenariusSynthMemoryLibraryC', '[]', 'The words of the story he read were... so poignant... and yet they escape me, like sand blown from the ridge of a dune.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Cavas/Ven_174.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[376]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4984, 'VenariusSynthMemoryLunarisA', '[]', 'I don''t know much longer I can do this. Every day, we cart in the poor folk the General has rounded up for the Witch''s experiments. I used to count, but I stopped at two thousand.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/CavasNarrator/Ven_256.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[376]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4985, 'VenariusSynthMemoryLunarisB', '[]', 'This is not the career the Blackguards promised me. We''re worse than monsters. Look at this place! Rivers of blood! Piles of corpses! We were just following orders...', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/CavasNarrator/Ven_257.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[376]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4986, 'VenariusSynthMemoryLunarisC', '[]', 'We were just following orders. Hollow words. He didn''t believe his own absolution.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Cavas/Ven_258.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[376]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4987, 'VenariusSynthMemoryLushCraterA', '[]', 'I don''t understand. I saw Bryn die. I held him. The fever that took him was so intense... I remember the moment his body went cold. But now he lives once more.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/CavasNarrator/Ven_211.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[376]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4988, 'VenariusSynthMemoryLushCraterB', '[]', 'Yet it is not truly him. I know that. A mother knows her son and this creature is not my son. It is a hollow imposter. My son''s spirit is with Innocence. So I go to him at last.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/CavasNarrator/Ven_212.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[376]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4989, 'VenariusSynthMemoryLushCraterC', '[]', 'If I still possessed a heart, it would now be broken. We are no strangers to the returning dead, but this was not my memory.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Cavas/Ven_213.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[376]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4990, 'VenariusSynthMemoryMesaA', '[]', 'I''ve thirsted for adventure my entire life, but I suppose, at eighty-two, the most I can do now is walk along the village plateau.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/CavasNarrator/Ven_274.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[376]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4991, 'VenariusSynthMemoryMesaB', '[]', 'I dreamt of magic and adventure when I was younger. It''s a shame this world isn''t more exciting.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/CavasNarrator/Ven_275.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[376]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4992, 'VenariusSynthMemoryMesaC', '[]', 'From what I''ve seen in my time with you, Exile, the owner of that memory must have been uncommonly lucky to avoid Wraeclast''s dangers. Or, seemingly, unlucky.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Cavas/Ven_276.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[376]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4993, 'VenariusSynthMemoryMineshaftA', '[]', 'We''re trapped down here. Though we strike it again and again, the Sekhema''s seal remains unharmed. No one down here can sleep. My throat is parched, yet I feel no thirst.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/CavasNarrator/Ven_202.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[376]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4994, 'VenariusSynthMemoryMineshaftB', '[]', 'The foreman is beginning to show signs of madness. He claims the walls, earth, and even his pick have become sticky as honey. I pray death comes for us soon, but I fear we will receive something far worse.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/CavasNarrator/Ven_203.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[376]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4995, 'VenariusSynthMemoryMineshaftC', '[]', 'Some of these events have the ring of familiarity, yet I cannot place myself in this one. I suspect it is simply too old to be mine.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Cavas/Ven_204.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[376]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4996, 'VenariusSynthMemoryMoonTempleA', '[]', 'Lunaris, help me find calm. Help me find peace. Help me silence those who trouble me.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/CavasNarrator/Ven_175.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[376]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4997, 'VenariusSynthMemoryMoonTempleB', '[]', 'Lunaris, help me destroy my enemies! Help me take what is rightfully mine!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/CavasNarrator/Ven_176.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[376]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4998, 'VenariusSynthMemoryMoonTempleC', '[]', 'Such a strange evolution of beliefs... that is most assuredly not my memory. I know I was a man of conviction.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Cavas/Ven_177.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[376]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(4999, 'VenariusSynthMemoryMushCaveA', '[]', 'Help! Please, somebody, help me! I''ve fallen down here! I think I''ve hurt my leg! Hello?! Stay calm. I''m sure someone will come soon. I''m so hungry... If I get desperate, maybe I can eat some of the mushrooms down here.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/CavasNarrator/Ven_142.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[376]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100);
INSERT INTO "NPCTextAudio" ("_row", "Id", "Characters", "Text", "Mono_AudioFile", "Stereo_AudioFile", "HasStereo", "__col6", "Video", "__col8", "__col9", "__col10", "NPCs", "NPCPortrait", "__col13", "__col14", "Cooldown", "__col16") VALUES
(5000, 'VenariusSynthMemoryMushCaveB', '[]', 'I feel strange... my head feels like it is filled with bubbles. Are the walls breathing? The colours here are so vibrant... oh... my stomach... I''m ill. The world is spinning and, oh, my gut! What did I eat? I feel--', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/CavasNarrator/Ven_143.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[376]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5001, 'VenariusSynthMemoryMushCaveC', '[]', 'Wow... Exile... that was a very strange memory. Certainly not my own.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Cavas/Ven_144.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[376]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5002, 'VenariusSynthMemoryOasisA', '[]', 'I cannot escape the feeling that I am being cooked by the sun in a cauldron made of sand. As I dream of water, walking, dying, I see it: an oasis.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/CavasNarrator/Ven_259.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[376]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5003, 'VenariusSynthMemoryOasisB', '[]', 'I slake my thirst with chill liquid that sparkles in the sun. I dunk my head, then lie down, exhausted and exhilarated. Today, I get to live.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/CavasNarrator/Ven_260.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[376]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5004, 'VenariusSynthMemoryOasisC', '[]', 'Even if I could remember my life, Exile, I am certain no single drink would ever have tasted so good.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Cavas/Ven_261.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[376]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5005, 'VenariusSynthMemoryOssuaryA', '[]', 'Centuries of my predecessors line these walls. It is the ultimate honor to rest with them, supposedly, but I have my doubts.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/CavasNarrator/Ven_232.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[376]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5006, 'VenariusSynthMemoryOssuaryB', '[]', 'How would anyone know which bones are mine? How would anyone know that I am even here? Because I recognise none of these remains myself...', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/CavasNarrator/Ven_233.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[376]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5007, 'VenariusSynthMemoryOssuaryC', '[]', 'I can relate to that feeling, Exile.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Cavas/Ven_234.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[376]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5008, 'VenariusSynthMemoryParkA', '[]', 'People stream down the street towards Oriath Square. I hear their shouts and cheers, and when Mother isn''t looking, sneak out to join the merry crowd. Just outside the pens, a Karui boy, no older than I, stands atop the gallows.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/CavasNarrator/Ven_145.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[376]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5009, 'VenariusSynthMemoryParkB', '[]', 'I see by the sign around his neck he has been caught stealing. I swear I will not look away. But fear overtakes me. I hear the rope snap taut and the crowd cheer, but I fight back tears...', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/CavasNarrator/Ven_146.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[376]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5010, 'VenariusSynthMemoryParkC', '[]', 'I remember this well, Exile. I remember hearing that snap in my dreams for many years.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Cavas/Ven_147.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[376]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5011, 'VenariusSynthMemoryPierA', '[]', 'The stench convenes around me thicker than the press of the vagabonds themselves. Though starving, their strength while holding on to one another is surprising. I''m trapped in a knot of ragged bodies, and the men of the Church clap me in irons despite my cries.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/CavasNarrator/Ven_151.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[376]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5012, 'VenariusSynthMemoryPierB', '[]', 'I''m not one of them! Can''t you hear me? I''m not Maraketh, nor homeless, and have committed no sins. That ship is not for me! Why won''t you listen?', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/CavasNarrator/Ven_152.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[376]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5013, 'VenariusSynthMemoryPierC', '[]', 'I think this is one of mine, Exile. I feel it: at eight years old, I was almost exiled by mere happenstance. If my mother had not found me and gotten the Templars to release me, I would have been lost...', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Cavas/Ven_153.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[376]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5014, 'VenariusSynthMemoryPlateauA', '[]', 'I''ve thirsted for adventure my entire life, but I suppose, at eighty-two, the most I can do now is walk along the village plateau.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/CavasNarrator/Ven_274.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[376]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5015, 'VenariusSynthMemoryPlateauB', '[]', 'I dreamt of magic and adventure when I was younger. It''s a shame this world isn''t more exciting.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/CavasNarrator/Ven_275.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[376]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5016, 'VenariusSynthMemoryPlateauC', '[]', 'From what I''ve seen in my time with you, Exile, the owner of that memory must have been uncommonly lucky to avoid Wraeclast''s dangers. Or, seemingly, unlucky.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Cavas/Ven_276.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[376]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5017, 'VenariusSynthMemoryPoolsAndStreamsA', '[]', 'My legs ache, but at last they can rest. We are two days journey from the nearest city, and the trickle of water sets me at ease. I begin to set up camp.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/CavasNarrator/Ven_217.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[376]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5018, 'VenariusSynthMemoryPoolsAndStreamsB', '[]', 'My wife bathes naked in the stream. I appreciate her form from the banks. With any luck, we will never see another person as long as we live.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/CavasNarrator/Ven_218.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[376]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5019, 'VenariusSynthMemoryPoolsAndStreamsC', '[]', 'So peaceful. I could have dwelt in that memory forever. Alas, I do not think it belongs to me.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Cavas/Ven_219.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[376]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5020, 'VenariusSynthMemoryPrisonA', '[]', 'The shackles cut into my wrists and ankles. The guards are deaf to my pleading, but I am no murderer. If I am guilty of anything, it is falling in love with the wrong person. Justice served, they claim.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/CavasNarrator/Ven_154.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[376]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5021, 'VenariusSynthMemoryPrisonB', '[]', 'This is not justice. Any chance at justice evaporated the moment I walked into the courtroom and saw her husband held the gavel. I''m just the scapegoat. It''s easy to get away with murder when you''re the judge...', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/CavasNarrator/Ven_155.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[376]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5022, 'VenariusSynthMemoryPrisonC', '[]', 'How horrid! Are all people as corrupt, Exile? Thankfully I''m certain this was not me.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Cavas/Ven_156.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[376]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5023, 'VenariusSynthMemoryQuarryA', '[]', 'I strike the earth once more as I have countless times, but my strike feels unfamiliar. Instead of the crack of stone, I am met with flexing sinew. I examine my pick axe. A dark red liquid froths on its tip.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/CavasNarrator/Ven_157.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[376]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5024, 'VenariusSynthMemoryQuarryB', '[]', 'The metal beneath rapidly corrodes. Have I found it at last? I run to alert the General. I''m told not to speak of what I found. The other slaves must continue the dig, but I am set free...', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/CavasNarrator/Ven_158.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[376]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5025, 'VenariusSynthMemoryQuarryC', '[]', 'I don''t think I was ever a slave. What did they find, I wonder?', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Cavas/Ven_159.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[376]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5026, 'VenariusSynthMemoryReefA', '[]', 'The storm is bad now. The ship rocks to and fro. The other exiles exchange glances as a guard struggles to regain his footing. Then, we hit the rocks.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/CavasNarrator/Ven_271.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[376]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5027, 'VenariusSynthMemoryReefB', '[]', 'When I come to, I''m alone on a tiny island. Little more than a rock, really. I can''t see any other land. Even Wraeclast would''ve been better than this.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/CavasNarrator/Ven_272.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[376]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5028, 'VenariusSynthMemoryReefC', '[]', 'I''m certain I was never exiled, and thank the Gods. What a terrible fate... oh... oh, dear. Sorry.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Cavas/Ven_273.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[376]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5029, 'VenariusSynthMemoryRidgeA', '[]', 'Everyone is dead and I''m alone. The Karui swept through the watch so quickly, we didn''t have a chance to flee. Men, women, even children, slaughtered. I''m lucky to be alive. But I cannot return home now. No.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/CavasNarrator/Ven_214.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[376]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5030, 'VenariusSynthMemoryRidgeB', '[]', 'I''d be branded a coward, imprisoned, and hung for desertion. I''ve no other choice. I must make do out in the wilds. Perhaps a farmer will take pity on me. And if not, I have my blade. I will take what I need by force.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/CavasNarrator/Ven_215.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[376]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5031, 'VenariusSynthMemoryRidgeC', '[]', 'What a ghastly man. I pray it was not me.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Cavas/Ven_216.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[376]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5032, 'VenariusSynthMemoryRooftopA', '[]', 'The last three weeks feel like they''ve passed in an instant. The atmosphere here since the High Templar''s disappearance has been so relaxed, but, while enjoying the sun on my roof this morning, I saw the black smoke billowing from the Chamber of Innocence turn red.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/CavasNarrator/Ven_160.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[376]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5033, 'VenariusSynthMemoryRooftopB', '[]', 'The Seneschals have at last elected a new High Templar. Rumour has it they''ve sought young blood. Someone who can revitalise the Templar. Someone who can bring them into the modern age. Whoever it is, he can''t be worse than the last one. The bastard set us back fifty years!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/CavasNarrator/Ven_161.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[376]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5034, 'VenariusSynthMemoryRooftopC', '[]', 'A changing of the guard? I don''t think this was me, but it feels strangely familiar.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Cavas/Ven_162.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[376]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5035, 'VenariusSynthMemoryRuinedTempleA', '[]', 'My grandparents worshipped here, back when it was still a place of faith. I wonder, did the Gods ever hear them?', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/CavasNarrator/Ven_277.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[376]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5036, 'VenariusSynthMemoryRuinedTempleB', '[]', 'I choose to believe the Gods did listen, and that I am here now out of that benevolence. It is the only way I can explain surviving the troubles.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/CavasNarrator/Ven_278.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[376]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5037, 'VenariusSynthMemoryRuinedTempleC', '[]', 'Was I a person of faith, Exile? I think... I might have been. At the very least, I remember the trappings of faith, though I cannot say to which God.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Cavas/Ven_279.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[376]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5038, 'VenariusSynthMemorySanctuaryA', '[]', 'What is it? You know I am not to be disturbed during my communion with God. It''s here? Get it to the lab immediately! I feel a rush of excitement as I review the contents of the crate.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/CavasNarrator/Ven_178.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[376]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5039, 'VenariusSynthMemorySanctuaryB', '[]', 'The pieces, aged as they are, still hum with energy. I can feel its potential, and it fills me with hope and terror. I cannot assemble it, but I know who can. I need only apply a little pressure...', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/CavasNarrator/Ven_179.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[376]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5040, 'VenariusSynthMemorySanctuaryC', '[]', 'How curious... this feels familiar to me. What was inside the box? Perhaps another memory will tell us.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Cavas/Ven_180.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[376]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5041, 'VenariusSynthMemoryScepterA', '[]', 'I''m so very late. This is deeply embarrassing. I fear the wait will be too long now. But this is my one chance to meet the great Laureate and I will not let it go to waste!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/CavasNarrator/Ven_181.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[376]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5042, 'VenariusSynthMemoryScepterB', '[]', 'Malachai says he has perfected new techniques that will unlock the raw power hidden within the Virtue Gems. I have volunteered my body to the cause. I feel no fear, no hunger, no pleasure... nothing. I hear only his voice. I must obey...', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/CavasNarrator/Ven_182.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[376]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5043, 'VenariusSynthMemoryScepterC', '[]', 'Exile, what a horrible moment I just experienced. I feel for whoever this memory belonged to. I''m glad it was not mine.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Cavas/Ven_183.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[376]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5044, 'VenariusSynthMemorySewersA', '[]', 'We walk in absolute silence through the murk. It''s after midnight, but the streets above are still abuzz with activity. Hours pass before the streets fall silent. We emerge one by one into a pitch-black room.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/CavasNarrator/Ven_184.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[376]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5045, 'VenariusSynthMemorySewersB', '[]', 'As I help our last out of the sewers, a flint is struck, and we are surrounded by light and gleaming imperial armour. There''s a dagger at my throat. A setup. Dragged into a cell, the guards laughing. I still reek of the sewers...', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/CavasNarrator/Ven_185.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[376]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5046, 'VenariusSynthMemorySewersC', '[]', 'Did I lead a life of crime? I don''t think so... I expect this story did not end well. The Empire was not too kind to thieves.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Cavas/Ven_186.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[376]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5047, 'VenariusSynthMemorySlumsA', '[]', 'Sarn is the land of opportunity, they said. The cradle of civilisation. Pardon me if I don''t feel swaddled and taken care of in this ''cradle.''', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/CavasNarrator/Ven_223.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[376]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5048, 'VenariusSynthMemorySlumsB', '[]', 'It''s starve or steal, and I think I know which one I like better.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/CavasNarrator/Ven_224.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[376]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5049, 'VenariusSynthMemorySlumsC', '[]', 'Was I poor and hungry on the streets of Sarn? I think not, exile. This memory feels foreign to me.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Cavas/Ven_225.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[376]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5050, 'VenariusSynthMemorySolarisA', '[]', 'Tonight is a celebration. On this, the night of a Thousand Ribbons, we honour Emperor Chitus for his heroic defense of our beloved capital. Long may he reign!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/CavasNarrator/Ven_187.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[376]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5051, 'VenariusSynthMemorySolarisB', '[]', 'I feel fear... and hatred. The Emperor stands before me, and I know this is my chance. I strike at him. I pierce his belly, but it is not immediately lethal. I lock eyes with the man. I watch him raise his axe...', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/CavasNarrator/Ven_188.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[376]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5052, 'VenariusSynthMemorySolarisC', '[]', 'He killed me. Exile! That Emperor Chitus, he cut me in half...! No, not me. I am no backstabber. I would have faced him head-on.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Cavas/Ven_189.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[376]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5053, 'VenariusSynthMemorySpiderForestA', '[]', 'I''m a fool to have gotten lost here, but it was getting dark, and I thought I saw a way home. A crowd stands silently around me, their faces blank white, their bodies covered in webs.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/CavasNarrator/Ven_262.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[376]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5054, 'VenariusSynthMemorySpiderForestB', '[]', 'The crowd begins to shiver and shake as I creep between their bound hands. Some moan for help. Others scream as their bodies bubble, and I realize I cannot help them. Tiny spiders pour out of open wounds.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/CavasNarrator/Ven_263.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[376]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5055, 'VenariusSynthMemorySpiderForestC', '[]', 'Oh, no! I can still feel them crawling on me!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Cavas/Ven_264.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[376]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5056, 'VenariusSynthMemorySpiderThicketA', '[]', 'Where am I? What happened? I remember a massive spider coming at me, and then... huh, I''m stuck in webbing...', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/CavasNarrator/Ven_220.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[376]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5057, 'VenariusSynthMemorySpiderThicketB', '[]', 'My stomach is really rumbling... and it hurts... and it''s bulging... and rippling...', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/CavasNarrator/Ven_221.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[376]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5058, 'VenariusSynthMemorySpiderThicketC', '[]', 'After that memory, I think I''m afraid of spiders.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Cavas/Ven_222.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[376]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5059, 'VenariusSynthMemorySwampBogA', '[]', 'Beneath the summer sun we follow Tarcus in search of the promised land. Before long, hunger grips our stomachs. The doomlands take their toll. Our numbers dwindle, and discord spreads among the tribesmen.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/CavasNarrator/Ven_190.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[376]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5060, 'VenariusSynthMemorySwampBogB', '[]', 'Veruso''s words quell our hearts, but not our stomachs. In the dead of night, a woman goes missing, and our hunger is abated. We reach the ruins of Azala Vaal alive, but dark deeds hide in our bellies.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/CavasNarrator/Ven_191.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[376]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5061, 'VenariusSynthMemorySwampBogC', '[]', 'Exile, this terrible memory is far too old to have been mine. Let''s keep looking.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Cavas/Ven_192.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[376]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5062, 'VenariusSynthMemoryThicketA', '[]', 'He told me to meet him out here at midnight. Well, it''s midnight and he isn''t here, and I can hear wolves nearby. He better hurry up or I''m leaving.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/CavasNarrator/Ven_193.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[376]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5063, 'VenariusSynthMemoryThicketB', '[]', 'That''s it. I''m out of here. Now... which way did I come from? Was it this way? No. Must have been this way. Hmm... this doesn''t look familiar either. None of this looks familiar, and I think I can hear the wolves coming closer...', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/CavasNarrator/Ven_194.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[376]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5064, 'VenariusSynthMemoryThicketC', '[]', 'Oh dear, what a frightful situation. I don''t think I did much midnight hiking, Exile.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Cavas/Ven_195.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[376]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5065, 'ZanaSynthMemoryArachnidTombA', '[]', 'I''m a fool to have gotten lost here, but it was getting dark, and I thought I saw a way home. A crowd stands silently around me, their faces blank white, their bodies covered in webs.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/ZanaNarrator/360Zana_160.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[376]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5066, 'ZanaSynthMemoryArachnidTombB', '[]', 'The crowd begins to shiver and shake as I creep between their bound hands. Some moan for help. Others scream. As their bodies bubble, I realize I cannot help them. Tiny spiders pour out of open wounds.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/ZanaNarrator/360Zana_161.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[376]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5067, 'ZanaSynthMemoryArachnidTombC', '[]', 'Exile, if you ever find me trapped in webbing like that... put me out of my misery.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Zana/360Zana_162.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[385]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5068, 'ZanaSynthMemoryColosseumA', '[]', 'With one motion, I cleave a man in twain. A kick sends another flying, and the roar of the crowd swells. I am their idol!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/ZanaNarrator/360Zana_205.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[385]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5069, 'ZanaSynthMemoryColosseumB', '[]', 'I was always meant to be at the top of the pile. Nobody else can compare. And this tiny man, this new challenger, Daresso, will fall like the rest to the might of Barkhul.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/ZanaNarrator/360Zana_206.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[385]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5070, 'ZanaSynthMemoryColosseumC', '[]', 'Ha! We know how that ended, don''t we?', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Zana/360Zana_207.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[385]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5071, 'ZanaSynthMemoryLushCraterA', '[]', 'I don''t understand... I saw Bryn die. I held him. The fever that took him was so intense... I remember the moment his body went cold. But now he lives once more.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/ZanaNarrator/360Zana_178.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[385]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5072, 'ZanaSynthMemoryLushCraterB', '[]', 'Yet it is not truly him. I know that. A mother knows her son and this creature is not my son. It is a hollow imposter. My son''s spirit is with Innocence. So I go to him at last.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/ZanaNarrator/360Zana_179.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[385]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5073, 'ZanaSynthMemoryLushCraterC', '[]', 'She leapt, Exile. I felt her fall... What terrible anguish she felt...', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Zana/360Zana_180.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[385]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5074, 'ZanaSynthMemoryMesaA', '[]', 'I''ve thirsted for adventure my entire life, but I suppose, at eighty-two, the most I can do now is walk along the village plateau.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/ZanaNarrator/360Zana_208.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[385]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5075, 'ZanaSynthMemoryMesaB', '[]', 'I dreamt of magic and adventure when I was younger. It''s a shame this world isn''t more exciting.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/ZanaNarrator/360Zana_209.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[385]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5076, 'ZanaSynthMemoryMesaC', '[]', 'Ah, what I would give for a boring life...', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Zana/360Zana_210.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[385]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5077, 'VenariusSynthIncompleteMemoryRandom', '[]', 'There was more to that memory, I''m sure of it. We must keep looking!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Cavas/Ven_124npc.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[376]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5078, 'VenariusSynthIncompleteMemory2', '[]', 'That memory ended so suddenly... I wonder if perhaps we can find the whole memory somewhere.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Cavas/Ven_125.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[376]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5079, 'VenariusSynthIncompleteMemory3', '[]', 'I get the distinct impression that there''s more to that memory than we''ve seen... Oh, I hope we find the rest of it soon!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Cavas/Ven_126.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[376]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5080, 'LegionHyrriBattleCry1', '[]', 'We will not let these dogs take our lands!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Hyrri/HE01_A_2.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[388]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5081, 'LegionHyrriBattleCry2', '[]', 'Hinekora, today we send you a gift!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Hyrri/HE01_B_1.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[388]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5082, 'LegionHyrriBattleCry3', '[]', 'We do this for freedom!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Hyrri/HE01_C_2.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[388]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5083, 'LegionHyrriBattleCry4', '[]', 'Vala Ngamahu!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Hyrri/HE01_D_1.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[388]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5084, 'LegionHyrriBattleCry5', '[]', 'Give no ground!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Hyrri/HE01_E_1.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[388]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5085, 'LegionHyrriAttackOneRandom', '[]', 'Stay, dog!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Hyrri/HE02_A_1.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[388]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5086, 'LegionHyrriAttackOne2', '[]', 'Stay, dog!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Hyrri/HE02_A_2.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[388]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5087, 'LegionHyrriAttackTwoRandom', '[]', 'Turn back!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Hyrri/HE02_B_1.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[388]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5088, 'LegionHyrriAttackTwo2', '[]', 'Turn back!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Hyrri/HE02_B_2.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[388]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5089, 'LegionHyrriAttackThreeRandom', '[]', 'For Tukohama!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Hyrri/HE02_C_2.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[388]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5090, 'LegionHyrriAttackThree2', '[]', 'For Tukohama!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Hyrri/HE02_C_3.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[388]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5091, 'LegionHyrriFleeing1', '[]', 'Into the hills!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Hyrri/HE03_A_1.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[388]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5092, 'LegionHyrriFleeing2', '[]', 'Retreat! Draw them out!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Hyrri/HE03_B_2.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[388]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5093, 'LegionHyrriFleeing3', '[]', 'Back! Regroup!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Hyrri/HE03_C_1.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[388]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5094, 'LegionHyrriMapIntro1', '[]', 'We will paint the earth with your blood.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Hyrri/HE04_A.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[388]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5095, 'LegionHyrriMapIntro2', '[]', 'Your skin will make a fine quiver, slaver!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Hyrri/HE04_B.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[388]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5096, 'LegionHyrriMapIntro3', '[]', 'It''s been too long since my arrows tasted slaver blood.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Hyrri/HE04_C.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[388]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5097, 'LegionHyrriDefeat1', '[]', 'Is this-... am I... dying...?', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Hyrri/HE05_A.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[388]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5098, 'LegionHyrriDefeat2', '[]', 'Hinekora... I come to you... at last...', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Hyrri/HE05_B.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[388]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5099, 'LegionHyrriDefeat3', '[]', 'Free... I''m free...', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Hyrri/HE05_C.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[388]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5100, 'LegionHyrriInjured1', '[]', 'You''ll have to do better than that.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Hyrri/HE06_A_1.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[388]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5101, 'LegionHyrriInjured2', '[]', 'I won''t stop until one of us is dead.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Hyrri/HE06_B_2.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[388]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5102, 'LegionHyrriInjured3', '[]', 'Pain only fuels me.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Hyrri/HE06_C_1.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[388]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5103, 'LegionHyrriTaunt1', '[]', 'Turn around, slaver. Your kind doesn''t survive long here.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Hyrri/HE07_A_1.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[388]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5104, 'LegionHyrriTaunt2', '[]', 'Ten thousand eyes are watching your every step, pakarui.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Hyrri/HE07_B_1.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[388]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5105, 'LegionHyrriTaunt3', '[]', 'Are you so desperate to meet our mother of death?', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Hyrri/HE07_C_2.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[388]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5106, 'LegionLioneyeBattleCry1', '[]', 'We will defend our emperor to our last!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Lioneye/LI01_A_3.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[389]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5107, 'LegionLioneyeBattleCry2', '[]', 'Deserters will be used for target practice!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Lioneye/LI01_B_2.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[389]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5108, 'LegionLioneyeBattleCry3', '[]', 'Stand your ground!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Lioneye/LI01_C_1.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[389]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5109, 'LegionLioneyeBattleCry4', '[]', 'We. Are. Eternal!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Lioneye/LI01_D_2.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[389]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5110, 'LegionLioneyeBattleCry5', '[]', 'For our Emperor!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Lioneye/LI01_E_1.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[389]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5111, 'LegionLioneyeAttackOneRandom', '[]', 'Fire!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Lioneye/LI02_A_1.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[389]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5112, 'LegionLioneyeAttackOne2', '[]', 'Fire!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Lioneye/LI02_A_3.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[389]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5113, 'LegionLioneyeAttackTwoRandom', '[]', 'You can''t hide from me!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Lioneye/LI02_B_1.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[389]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5114, 'LegionLioneyeAttackTwo2', '[]', 'You can''t hide from me!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Lioneye/LI02_B_2.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[389]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5115, 'LegionLioneyeAttackThreeRandom', '[]', 'Try to run!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Lioneye/LI02_C_1.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[389]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5116, 'LegionLioneyeAttackThree2', '[]', 'Try to run!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Lioneye/LI02_C_2.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[389]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5117, 'LegionLioneyeAttackFourRandom', '[]', 'Traitors!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Lioneye/LI02_D_1.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[389]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5118, 'LegionLioneyeAttackFour2', '[]', 'Traitors!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Lioneye/LI02_D_2.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[389]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5119, 'LegionLioneyeArrackFiveRandom', '[]', 'Right between the eyes...', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Lioneye/LI02_E_1.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[389]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5120, 'LegionLioneyeAttackFive2', '[]', 'Right between the eyes...', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Lioneye/LI02_E_2.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[389]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5121, 'LegionLioneyeFleeing1', '[]', 'Fall back!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Lioneye/LI03_A_2.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[389]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5122, 'LegionLioneyeFleeing2', '[]', 'To the gates!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Lioneye/LI03_B_3.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[389]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5123, 'LegionLioneyeFleeing3', '[]', 'To safety! Protect the Emperor!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Lioneye/LI03_C_1.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[389]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5124, 'LegionLioneyeMapIntro1', '[]', 'Dead end, rebel turncoat. Time to pay for your crimes!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Lioneye/LI04_A_1.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[389]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5125, 'LegionLioneyeMapIntro2', '[]', 'Your rebellion ends here!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Lioneye/LI04_B_1.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[389]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5126, 'LegionLioneyeMapIntro3', '[]', 'Traitor, the Emperor''s will is law.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Lioneye/LI04_C_1.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[389]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5127, 'LegionLioneyeMapIntro4', '[]', 'You cannot destroy that which is eternal.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Lioneye/LI04_D_1.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[389]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5128, 'LegionLioneyeDefeat1', '[]', 'No... This--... This feels... familiar...', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Lioneye/LI05_A.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[389]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5129, 'LegionLioneyeDefeat2', '[]', 'I die... for my Emperor.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Lioneye/LI05_B.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[389]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5130, 'LegionLioneyeDefeat3', '[]', 'Chitus... Forgive me.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Lioneye/LI05_C.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[389]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5131, 'LegionLioneyeDefeat4', '[]', 'A... warrior''s death.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Lioneye/LI05_D_1.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[389]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5132, 'LegionLioneyeInjured1', '[]', 'We''re just getting started!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Lioneye/LI06_A_1.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[389]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5133, 'LegionLioneyeInjured2', '[]', 'I''ll wear these scars with pride.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Lioneye/LI06_B_2.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[389]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5134, 'LegionLioneyeInjured3', '[]', 'A worthy adversary at last.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Lioneye/LI06_C_1.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[389]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5135, 'LegionLioneyeTaunt1', '[]', 'Rebel! The Emperor will reward me richly for your head.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Lioneye/LI07_A.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[389]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5136, 'LegionLioneyeTaunt2', '[]', 'Can you outrun an arrow, rebel?', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Lioneye/LI07_B.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[389]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5137, 'LegionLioneyeTaunt3', '[]', 'Are you ready to die for your cause, traitor?', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Lioneye/LI07_C.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[389]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5138, 'LegionAukunaBattleCry1', '[]', 'Protect the gates at any cost!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Aukuna/AK01_A_1.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[390,391]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5139, 'LegionAukunaBattleCry2', '[]', 'Dekhara! Forward! Strike!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Aukuna/AK01_B_3.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[390,391]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5140, 'LegionAukunaBattleCry3', '[]', 'Darakatha! We shall not die this day!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Aukuna/AK01_C_3.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[390,391]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5141, 'LegionAukunaAttackOneRandom', '[]', 'Abomination!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Aukuna/AK02_A_5.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[390,391]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5142, 'LegionAukunaAttackOne2', '[]', 'Abomination!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Aukuna/AK02_A_6.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[390,391]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5143, 'LegionAukunaAttackTwoRandom', '[]', 'Back to the dust!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Aukuna/AK02_B_5.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[390,391]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5144, 'LegionAukunaAttackTwo2', '[]', 'Back to the dust!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Aukuna/AK02_B_6.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[390,391]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5145, 'LegionAukunaAttackThreeRandom', '[]', 'Winds take you!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Aukuna/AK02_C_1.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[390,391]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5146, 'LegionAukunaAttackThree2', '[]', 'Winds take you!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Aukuna/AK02_C_2.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[390,391]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5147, 'LegionAukunaFleeing1', '[]', 'Back, everyone! Back!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Aukuna/AK03_A_1.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[390,391]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5148, 'LegionAukunaFleeing2', '[]', 'Break formation!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Aukuna/AK03_B_2.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[390,391]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5149, 'LegionAukunaFleeing3', '[]', 'To the high ground!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Aukuna/AK03_C_3.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[390,391]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5150, 'LegionAukunaMapIntro1', '[]', 'Time has come, my <i>{akhara}, to push the lumberers back beneath the sands.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Aukuna/AK04_A.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[390,391]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5151, 'LegionAukunaMapIntro2', '[]', 'Only the sun can bring about the dawn, but we will fight to see it!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Aukuna/AK04_B.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[390,391]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5152, 'LegionAukunaMapIntro3', '[]', 'The hyenas do not howl. A good omen!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Aukuna/AK04_C.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[390,391]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5153, 'LegionAukunaDefeat1', '[]', 'No... I must... fight...', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Aukuna/AK05_A.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[390,391]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5154, 'LegionAukunaDefeat2', '[]', 'Great Roc... Sweep me... up...', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Aukuna/AK05_B.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[390,391]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5155, 'LegionAukunaDefeat3', '[]', 'Forgive me... my... <i>{akhara}...', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Aukuna/AK05_C.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[390,391]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5156, 'LegionAukunaInjured1', '[]', 'While I breathe, I will fight.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Aukuna/AK06_A_1.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[390,391]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5157, 'LegionAukunaInjured2', '[]', 'I would die before I submit!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Aukuna/AK06_B_2.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[390,391]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5158, 'LegionAukunaInjured3', '[]', 'I bleed for my <i>{akhara}.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Aukuna/AK06_C_3.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[390,391]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5159, 'LegionAukunaTaunt1', '[]', 'Abominations have no place here. We will send you back to the dirt.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Aukuna/AK07_A_3.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[390,391]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5160, 'LegionAukunaTaunt2', '[]', 'I have but one gift to offer you. A quick death.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Aukuna/AK07_B_1.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[390,391]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5161, 'LegionAukunaTaunt3', '[]', 'You''ll be given no mercy!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Aukuna/AK07_C_2.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[390,391]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5162, 'LegionAukunaDismount1', '[]', 'Shiyo! Your death will not be in vain.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Aukuna/AK08_A.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[390,391]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5163, 'LegionAukunaDismount2', '[]', 'Shiyo, I will avenge you.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Aukuna/AK08_B.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[390,391]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5164, 'LegionAukunaDismount3', '[]', 'I am sorry, Shiyo!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Aukuna/AK08_C.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[390,391]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5165, 'LegionNapuatziBattleCry1', '[]', 'Look upon us and despair!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Viper/VP01_A_1.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[393]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5166, 'LegionNapuatziBattleCry2', '[]', 'Bow to your Queen, or die!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Viper/VP01_B_2.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[393]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5167, 'LegionNapuatziBattleCry3', '[]', 'Serve the Vaal in life or in death.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Viper/VP01_C_1.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[393]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5168, 'LegionNapuatziAttackOneRandom', '[]', 'For the Queen!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Viper/VP02_A_2.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[393]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5169, 'LegionNapuatziAttackOne2', '[]', 'For the Queen!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Viper/VP02_A_3.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[393]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5170, 'LegionNapuatziAttackTwoRandom', '[]', 'Yield and save yourself!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Viper/VP02_B_1.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[393]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5171, 'LegionNapuatziAttackTwo2', '[]', 'Yield and save yourself!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Viper/VP02_B_2.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[393]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5172, 'LegionNapuatziAttackThreeRandom', '[]', 'Fall before us!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Viper/VP02_D_6.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[393]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5173, 'LegionNapuatziAttackThree2', '[]', 'Fall before us!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Viper/VP02_D_7.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[393]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5174, 'LegionNapuatziAttackFourRandom', '[]', 'Locust!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Viper/VP02_E_1.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[393]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5175, 'LegionNapuatziAttackFour2', '[]', 'Locust!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Viper/VP02_E_3.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[393]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5176, 'LegionNapuatziAttackFiveRandom', '[]', 'Insect!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Viper/VP02_F_1.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[393]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5177, 'LegionNapuatziAttackFive2', '[]', 'Insect!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Viper/VP02_F_3.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[393]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5178, 'LegionNapuatziFleeing1', '[]', 'When I return, it will be with an army of thousands.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Viper/VP03_A_1.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[393]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5179, 'LegionNapuatziFleeing2', '[]', 'Enjoy this brief victory. You will not have another.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Viper/VP03_B_1.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[393]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5180, 'LegionNapuatziFleeing3', '[]', 'These are Vaal lands. You only delay your destiny.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Viper/VP03_C_1.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[393]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5181, 'LegionNapuatziMapIntro1', '[]', 'Children of darkness, we are your illumination!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Viper/VP04_A.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[393]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5182, 'LegionNapuatziMapIntro2', '[]', 'Do not weep. Your sacrifice is not without value.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Viper/VP04_B.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[393]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5183, 'LegionNapuatziMapIntro3', '[]', 'Rejoice! The Queen has deemed you worthy of sacrifice!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Viper/VP04_C.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[393]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5184, 'LegionNapuatziDefeat1', '[]', 'I''m sorry... my... queen...', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Viper/VP05_A.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[393]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5185, 'LegionNapuatziDefeat2', '[]', 'Free... at... last...', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Viper/VP05_B.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[393]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5186, 'LegionNapuatziDefeat3', '[]', 'Is... is it over...?', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Viper/VP05_C.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[393]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5187, 'LegionNapuatziInjured1', '[]', 'Pain is nothing.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Viper/VP06_A_2.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[393]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5188, 'LegionNapuatziInjured2', '[]', 'Pain sharpens the mind.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Viper/VP06_B_2.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[393]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5189, 'LegionNapuatziInjured3', '[]', 'Every scar is a gift.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Viper/VP06_C_1.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[393]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5190, 'LegionNapuatziTaunt1', '[]', 'Your skull will adorn the halls of the queen.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Viper/VP07_A.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[393]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5191, 'LegionNapuatziTaunt2', '[]', 'Your death is written into the stars.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Viper/VP07_B.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[393]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5192, 'LegionNapuatziTaunt3', '[]', 'You are a locust, and I will crush you underfoot.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Viper/VP07_C.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[393]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5193, 'LegionSanctusVoxBattleCry1', '[]', 'Back, sinners! Back into your shacks!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Vox/VX01_A_3.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[392]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5194, 'LegionSanctusVoxBattleCry2', '[]', 'Adhere to your curfew or face our steel!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Vox/VX01_B_2.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[392]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5195, 'LegionSanctusVoxBattleCry3', '[]', 'Trespasser! This is Templar property!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Vox/VX01_C_2.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[392]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5196, 'LegionSanctusVoxAttackOneRandom', '[]', 'Repent!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Vox/VX02_A_3.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[392]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5197, 'LegionSanctusVoxAttackOne2', '[]', 'Repent!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Vox/VX02_A_4.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[392]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5198, 'LegionSanctusVoxAttackTwoRandom', '[]', 'Sinners! All of you!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Vox/VX02_B_1.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[392]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5199, 'LegionSanctusVoxAttackTwo2', '[]', 'Sinners! All of you!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Vox/VX02_B_3.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[392]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5200, 'LegionSanctusVoxAttackThreeRandom', '[]', 'Impure filth!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Vox/VX02_C_2.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[392]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5201, 'LegionSanctusVoxAttackThree2', '[]', 'Impure filth!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Vox/VX02_C_3.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[392]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5202, 'LegionSanctusVoxFleeing1', '[]', 'Retreat! Close the gates!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Vox/VX03_A_1.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[392]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5203, 'LegionSanctusVoxFleeing2', '[]', 'There''s too many of them! Make way!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Vox/VX03_B_4.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[392]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5204, 'LegionSanctusVoxFleeing3', '[]', 'Fall back to the supplies! We must protect the supplies!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Vox/VX03_C_1.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[392]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5205, 'LegionSanctusVoxMapIntro1', '[]', 'Sinners! You have been judged and found wanting.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Vox/VX04_A_1.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[392]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5206, 'LegionSanctusVoxMapIntro2', '[]', 'The sky burns, and sinners will burn with it!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Vox/VX04_B_1.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[392]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5207, 'LegionSanctusVoxMapIntro3', '[]', 'Hahaha! Rejoice! This is your day of judgement.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Vox/VX04_C_1.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[392]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5208, 'LegionSanctusVoxDefeat1', '[]', 'Innocence... Take me.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Vox/VX05_A_1.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[392]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5209, 'LegionSanctusVoxDefeat2', '[]', 'My time... at last...', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Vox/VX05_B_2.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[392]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5210, 'LegionSanctusVoxDefeat3', '[]', 'I go now... to... paradise...', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Vox/VX05_C.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[392]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5211, 'LegionSanctusVoxInjured1', '[]', 'Innocence damn you!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Vox/VX06_A_2.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[392]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5212, 'LegionSanctusVoxInjured2', '[]', 'Back, knave! Back!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Vox/VX06_B_1.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[392]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5213, 'LegionSanctusVoxInjured3', '[]', 'Voll, give me strength!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Vox/VX06_C_2.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[392]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5214, 'LegionSanctusVoxTaunt1', '[]', 'You have sinned and fornicated and shall at last receive justice!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Vox/VX07_A.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[392]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5215, 'LegionSanctusVoxTaunt2', '[]', 'God tests me, sinners. I will be his flaming sword.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Vox/VX07_B.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[392]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5216, 'LegionSanctusVoxTaunt3', '[]', 'Repent, and you may yet rescue yourselves!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Vox/VX07_C.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[392]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5217, 'BlightBuilderIntroduction', '[]', 'Hm? What do we have here? Yet another of Oriath''s cast-offs? With the problems we''re facing here, I do wish they''d send someone with a little more... utility. Alas, we have useless exiles blowing in like spores on the wind.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Cassia, by the by. Pleasure.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Cassia/Cas_04.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[395,396,397]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5218, 'BlightBuilderQuest', '[]', 'See this growth? Not on me, you--... The fruiting body. The-... the big mushroom. Strange, is it not? Wouldn''t expect something of this scale in a place like this. Stands out like a sin during a sermon. Unfortunately, this is one of many, and they''re all filled with an extremely toxic fluid. Quite dangerous to one''s health, and no one is paying any attention. No one but I, of course. That''s why I''ve attached this purification pump to the gleba. The spore mass. ...The big yellow round part. ' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
I plan to pump the toxic fluids from the mycelium -- the rooty looking parts -- through the spore mass, robbing this growth of the fluids that allow it to thrive. Even if I can''t find a use for it, at least it won''t get into dangerous or clumsy hands.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
In response, the mycelium is going to react. Violently. This is where you enter. ' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
My Mother Superior used to tell us that ''God helps those who help each other''. I''m dubious of the sort of help you might provide, as it has not escaped me that you are, for lack of a better term, drenched in viscera. Even so...' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
I''ve some devices we can deploy to help protect my purification pump here. When you''re ready, start the pump, then choose a place along the mycelium to deploy a device. Then get yourself ready, as I expect there will be more viscera.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Cassia/Cas_05.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[396]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5219, 'BlightBuilderQuestComplete', '[]', 'Success! And I couldn''t have done it without God. I suppose you were of some help as well. Don''t get a big head. ' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Alas, this is but one of many impure growths. We have much work ahead of ourselves if we are to banish this blight from Wraeclast. Since you performed... adequately... I believe we should make our partnership ongoing. You''ll know where to find me.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Cassia/Cas_12.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[396]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5220, 'BlightBuilderQuestFailed', '[]', 'It was I who tasked you with protecting the pump, so ultimately we know where the blame lies. On <i>{you}. For not protecting the pump. It''s in terrible shape. It may take weeks to fix it. Months even. I--... Oh, no, I''ve fixed it, thank God. Consider yourself extremely lucky.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
You''re not ready for this yet, I suppose. I''ll pray that you will be soon, as you now owe me. Get better at this, then find me. You know how to find me, right? Just go to the nearest pulsating growth.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Cassia/Cas_13.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[396]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5221, 'BlightBuilderExile', '[]', 'Yes, it''s true, I, like you, am an exile. I caught the High Templar''s eye several years ago. I showed an interest in the mechanical arts, and he had need for someone like myself for some highly secret projects he had started. He sought ways to tap into the power contained within the virtue gems in ways that I''m not sure were in line with God''s plan. I did not openly refuse his orders; I simply... interpreted them differently. The mechanisms I built were brilliant and powerful, and totally useless for his desires. I may have kept some of them. ' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Unfortunately, as you know, little slips past Dominus. I was exiled as a matter of secrecy. Rapidly replaced by some little whore. ' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
What? She <i>{is} a whore.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Cassia/Cas_14.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[395,396,397]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5222, 'BlightBuilderReplacement', '[]', 'You likely know her by the name High Templar Dominus gave her -- Piety. A whore-turned-thaumaturgist-turned-inventor. Or at least, she wishes she were. I''ve seen some of her work. Unimpressive, considering the resources she has available to her.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Not that I''m envious. I''m not. Really, good for her. But, you know, creators have a habit of getting caught in the teeth of their own creations, and Piety seems to favour creations with many, many teeth.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Cassia/Cas_15.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[395,396,397]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5223, 'BlightBuilderDevices', '[]', 'I''ve worked on many beautiful little machines in my time. Let''s see... There was the one that was originally designed to rapidly peel and pith fruit. That one is now called the Descalper.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
The portable oven turned out to be less of an oven and more of a red-hot ember dispenser. Still quite popular.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
And of course, the towers I have been assembling for use in protecting the portable-purifying-pumping unit. Those I am particularly proud of. Powered by the toxic fluid that runs through the fungal fibres. Surprisingly robust, and safe! Relatively safe. Almost no one has died yet who wasn''t meant to.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Cassia/Cas_16.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[395,396,397]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5224, 'BlightBuilderFungi', '[]', 'I''ve not seen anything like it before. The growths show no sign of intelligent thought, no clear ambition, yet the moment the pump''s needle pierces the fungal flesh, creatures of all shapes and sizes begin to emerge from the mycelium -- and they never stray away from it. ' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
The fluid within those growths may hold the key to controlling the minds of creatures... And hopefully, something to protect us from such a power. Too many already vie for control of our wills, but that is the domain of the divine.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Cassia/Cas_17.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[395,396,397]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5225, 'BlightBuilderTemplars', '[]', 'You''ve no doubt heard me singing some of the Templar hymns. One of the many habits that stuck with me, other than the one I still wear. Though the Templar have their... ''issues'', they are not without merit. They are, after all, doing God''s work. And by Innocence, their hymns are truly catchy little earworms. Singing them helps me focus.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Cassia/Cas_18.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[395,396,397]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5226, 'BlightBuilderInfectedMaps', '[]', 'I''m starting to believe that these growths have some sort of central... well, brain isn''t exactly the right word, but it isn''t far off.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
These larger growths, these "blighted maps" you''ve found, they may lead us to the original source of the Blight.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Not long ago, I believed they were a symptom of Wraeclast''s death. Fungal growths feeding on a rotting carcass. Now? I''m certain they''re a parasite. Wraeclast isn''t dead, but it is dying, weakened by its violent history, and being overpowered and smothered by the blight. ' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
God has laid out all the puzzle pieces. All we need to do now is put them together. I hope you''re good at puzzles.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Cassia/Cas_19.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[395,396,397]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5227, 'BlightBuilderWildAttention1', '[]', '[UNUSED] Burning away our sins, burning away our sins...!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/CassiaSing/Cas_01_1A.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[396]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5228, 'BlightBuilderWildAttention2', '[]', '[UNUSED] Cast your burning gaze to thine soul!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/CassiaSing/Cas_01_2A.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[396]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5229, 'BlightBuilderWildAttention3', '[]', '[UNUSED] And the unrighteous were turned to ash!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/CassiaSing/Cas_01_3A.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[396]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5230, 'CassiaFirstEncounterOne', '[]', 'Well done. Now be a good assistant and find a place to deploy a tower.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Cassia/Cas_06.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[396]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5231, 'CassiaFirstEncounterTwo', '[]', 'Exile? Are you going to build a tower as I''ve so kindly requested?', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Cassia/Cas_07.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[396]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5232, 'CassiaFirstEncounterThree', '[]', 'Hellooooo? Please do not test my limits. Patience is not something I possess great quantities of. Build the tower, Exile. <i>{Now.}', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Cassia/Cas_08.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[396]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5233, 'CassiaAfterTowerBuilt', '[]', 'By His flame, the blight is reacting...', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Cassia/Cas_09.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[396]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5234, 'CassiaAfterPumpTakesDamage', '[]', 'Protect the pump, Exile.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Cassia/Cas_10.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[396]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5235, 'CassiaFurtherPumpDamage', '[]', 'For the love of Innocence, protect the pump!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Cassia/Cas_11.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[396]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5236, 'CassiaPietyAndDominus', '[]', 'Strange as it may sound, I''m somewhat sad. I know in my heart of hearts that they were not good people, but they were still people. I knew Dominus well. We worked together. Ate together. There was a time when I would have called him my friend. And Piety was fighting her own demons. ' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
I hope God sees fit to forgive their souls... And mine.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Cassia/Cas_20.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[395,396,397]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5237, 'CassiaTheGods', '[]', 'The Innocence you slew was not the God I know. My God is selfless. Humble. Yes, he is prone to burning sinners, but who among us isn''t?' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
You just wait, Exile. Eternity will prove me right.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Cassia/Cas_21.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[395,396,397]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5238, 'CassiaTheBlightHeart', '[]', 'You''ve done well, my little apostle. Ahead of us lies the moment of truth. Where are you looking? I''m being metaphorical. We''ll work on that.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Before we strike at the heart of the Blight, please make sure you''re ready for what awaits us. This would be a very inconvenient time for you to die. I may even miss you. ' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
I suggest you limber up, because you''re going to be doing some running.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Cassia/Cas_22.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[395,396,397]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5239, 'CassiaAnointingOils', '[]', 'I see you''ve scavenged some oils with your sticky little hands. What in God''s name are you planning to do with them? Don''t bother answering -- I don''t actually care, as I have a much better use than whatever nonsense you had planned.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Bring me a few phials of those oils and I''ll anoint your amulet and rings, as is tradition among the clergy. Such a blessing will unlock gifts within you that you may not even know you had. God helps those who help each other, after all.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Cassia/Cas_23.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[395,396,397]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5240, 'CassiaAfterBlightHeartDefeat', '[]', 'Exile, I--... I can''t believe it. We destroyed it. We destroyed the source of the blight! This may not cleanse Wraeclast immediately, but it is the turning point in the war against this foul rot. ' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Growths are still out there, spreading and consuming and possessing, but without the beating black heart, it''s simply a matter of time until Wraeclast is free once and for all. And it''s all thanks to me.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Cassia/Cas_24.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[396]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5241, 'CassiaInviteToHideout', '[]', 'Research is best done from a safe location. Such places are few and far between out here. If you know of one, I''d be grateful.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Cassia/Cas_25.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[396]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5242, 'CassiaDismissHideout', '[]', 'So be it. It was getting cramped in here anyway.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Cassia/Cas_26.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[396]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5243, 'CassiaCombatRandom', '[]', 'Filth!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Cassia/Cas_27_1A.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[396]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5244, 'CassiaCombat1', '[]', 'Filth!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Cassia/Cas_27_1B.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[396]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5245, 'CassiaCombat2', '[]', 'Filth!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Cassia/Cas_27_1C.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[396]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5246, 'CassiaCombat3', '[]', 'Vile little...', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Cassia/Cas_27_2A.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[396]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5247, 'CassiaCombat4', '[]', 'Vile little...', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Cassia/Cas_27_2B.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[396]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5248, 'CassiaCombat5', '[]', 'Vile little...', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Cassia/Cas_27_2C.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[396]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5249, 'CassiaCombat6', '[]', 'You must be cleansed!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Cassia/Cas_27_3A.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[396]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
