(5292, 'CassiaSingInterrupt3', '[]', 'Oh!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/CassiaSing/Cas_32D.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[396]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5293, 'TaneOctaviusIntroduction', '[]', 'Come no closer, unless you wish to experience what my vials contain firsthand. I am Tane, a freedman, and I plan to stay that way.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Trust is not given freely, Exile. It must be earned, and you have not earned mine yet. But I do have something to give you. An opportunity.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Tane/TA_04.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[398,400,401]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5294, 'TaneOctaviusFirstQuest', '[]', 'What makes you, you, or me, me? Some say it is the soul, an intangible something that exists before we are born and carries on after death. But I have seen souls that walk the land here and show nothing that distinguishes them from the rats and the rhoas. ' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
It is something else. Something no man has discovered. A whisper. A flickering flame that burns through every inch of our being until it is extinguished. But what if we can capture it before it burns away? Bottle it up? Save it, and perhaps, even give it a new wick through which to burn once more?' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
You will find no shortage of ferocious beings near here. Kill them, cut from their flesh a sample, and bring the samples to me. We will discover the essence of being.' || char(13) || '
', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Tane/TA_05.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[400]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5295, 'TaneOctaviusFirstQuestTwo', '[]', 'These samples you''ve salvaged, though gruesome, hide within them countless secrets. Flesh and blood and bone and sinew, all but a veil, a mask that hides what truly drives us. I speak of the Intrinsic Darkness. The base desires and instincts that we all fight, yet rarely defeat. This Darkness hides within us, waiting for a moment of weakness -- a moment when it can take control. A cruel and invisible slave driver.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
But we can coax it out... ' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
My master called it Sinner''s Water. A concoction he spent much of his life perfecting. He would give it to his children and scribble notes as they beat me. In truth, I do not believe his concoction worked any more than his elixir of immortality, but that did not soften their blows.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
His formula was wrong, but his idea was sound. My formula works, as you will see. ' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Please, drop the samples in the jar, and ready your weapons. You are about to witness the darkness that drives us.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Tane/TA_06.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[400]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5296, 'TaneOctaviusFirstQuestComplete', '[]', 'Do you see now what we face, Oriathan? That was what slept within the creatures just near here. What darkness sleeps within me? Or within you? And if we can draw out that darkness, might we then be able to draw out that which makes us... us?' || char(13) || '
 ' || char(13) || '
Think on this, when we next meet, we shall begin to seek the answer.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Tane/TA_07.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[400]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5297, 'TaneOctaviusGenericMission', '[]', 'I''ve readied another darkness isolation trial. All we need are the samples. Separate them from the bodies they''re attached to and we can begin.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Tane/TA_08.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[400]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5298, 'TaneOctaviusGenericMissionTwo', '[]', 'You have the samples? Then please, place them in the jar and steel yourself. If the inoculation fails, the darkness will manifest quickly and violently.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Tane/TA_09.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[400]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5299, 'TaneOctaviusGenericMissionComplete', '[]', 'Slow progress is still progress. Do not lose sight of what we work towards.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Tane/TA_10.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[400]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5300, 'TaneOctaviusGenericMissionFailure', '[]', 'Do not blame yourself, my friend. Our foe is far stronger and more ancient than you could possibly conceive. There will be more opportunities to face it.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Tane/TA_11.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[400]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5301, 'TaneOctaviusTanesMaster', '[]', 'In Oriath I served a man named Lucan Octavius; a wealthy alchemist of high-status. I call him my master, for I was both his apprentice and his slave. Lucan''s work required handling extremely dangerous, often very hot, materials. Not the sort of thing becoming of a man of stature. So it came to be that a slave like myself learned the nuances of the alchemical arts firsthand.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
As for Lucan, he was... not the man he portrayed himself to be. He was more dangerous, more explosive, and more unstable than any material I had to handle. In public, he was fatherly and genial. In his home, he was violent and lustful.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
I do not regret what happened to him; only the part I played.' || char(13) || '
', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Tane/TA_12.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[398,399,400,401]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5302, 'TaneOctaviusAlchemy', '[]', 'My master called Alchemy the science of turning learned men to fools. Every half-wit with an alembic would try to turn lead to gold, or formulate an elixir of eternal youth, and Master Lucan was no different. But men like him rarely saw the magic in alchemy up close -- the sudden bubbling of a liquid, the heat growing in your hands, the vibrant colours and foul odours. Much knowledge is lost at a safe distance.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
In truth, the power of Alchemy is not in turning one thing into another, or creating miracles. It is in isolating and extracting. It is about finding purity within the confusion. ' || char(13) || '
', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Tane/TA_13.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[398,399,400,401]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5303, 'TaneOctaviusExile', '[]', 'How many innocent men and women can you think of who were exiled? We are here because we are violent, because we broke the laws of the land. ' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
I killed my master. I do not regret that he is dead, only that it was by my hand. My master was a sick man, with dark proclivities. A sickness of the mind that no alchemy could hope to cure. And he passed that sickness onto me. ' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
I was never violent until that day. Until that day, I could not fathom how one man could take the life of another. But Lucan drew out of me an anger I did not know I was capable of experiencing. It overcame me. Forced me out of my own body. And by the time I was in control again, my master was dead. ' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
That anger, that darkness is still in me, Exile. And that is why we are here.' || char(13) || '
', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Tane/TA_14.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[398,399,401]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5304, 'TaneOctaviusTanesGoals', '[]', 'The task I have given you is dangerous. To face the cruelty that dwells in the living, distilled and manifested, is not a task I wish upon anyone. Yet it is what I have asked of you. So you may be asking yourself, for what purpose do I seek to isolate this darkness?' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
I once thought it was a symptom of the corruption that pervades Wraeclast, but now, now I believe it to be something more primeval and universal. An element of our very beings hitherto unknown. To better understand it is to better understand life as a whole. Is that not enough?' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Very well. There is more to this story, but it may take some time. ' || char(13) || '
', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Tane/TA_15.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[398,399,401]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5305, 'TaneOctaviusTanesVision', '[]', 'To conjure a creature of darkness we use the flesh of the dead. We destroy that flesh, and draw out the ill-will that inhabits it, giving it form. My hope is that, one day, we may do the reverse -- destroy the darkness while leaving the flesh unharmed. ' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
To that end, I''ve acquired a rare ichor -- there''s no other like it in this world. The very essence of a human; for all intents and purposes, its soul. This individual was cruel beyond measure, or so I''ve heard, though not incapable of kindness. This ichor is robust enough that it might be injected into an entity of equally cruel temperament, and may be given new life. ' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Now, imagine if we could then destroy the darkness. Could this cruel soul be purified? Could it be brought back, not only from the dead, but from the precipice of damnation? ' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
That is my true goal.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Tane/TA_16.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[398,399,401]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5306, 'TaneOctaviusLabIntro', '[]', 'Welcome, Exile. This manor, and the contents within it, once belonged to Master Lucan. It was here, in this laboratory, that he met his fate, and I met mine.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
It seems that in the wake of Kitava''s rise, the rest of his family fared no better. Forgive me if I do not grieve for the family''s fate. Our relationship was... complicated.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
If there is a silver lining to be found from Kitava''s destruction of Oriath, it is that with access to this lab, we may be somewhat more ambitious with our tests.' || char(13) || '
', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Tane/TA_17.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[399]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5307, 'TaneOctaviusGreaterAmbitions', '[]', 'Though there is much left to discover from the dwellers of Wraeclast and Oriath, I wish to test my hypothesis that the darkness is not simply a property of where we live. ' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
I''ve heard rumour that there may be a way to experience... other places. I am no expert in such matters, but if you plan on such a journey, I would ask that you continue to seek out suitable samples. And if you find some which possess the darkness in great quantities, well all the better. ' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Without this lab, I''d be wary about releasing such entities into the wild. Here, they can be contained, if not controlled.' || char(13) || '
', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Tane/TA_18.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[399]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5308, 'TaneOctaviusLabFight', '[]', 'I could hardly be happier with the samples you''ve found. For both our safety and the safety of those around us, we must perform this extraction here, in the lab. When you are ready, add the samples.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Tane/TA_19.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[399]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5309, 'TaneOctaviusLabFightTwo', '[]', 'This time, my friend, we must add one extra sample -- one I have been saving for just such an occasion.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Tane/TA_20.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[400]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5310, 'TaneOctaviusLabFightComplete', '[]', 'Your victory was a great relief. I must admit, I had my moments of doubt. Unfortunately, the pathetic pool of fluid on the ground, all that remains, is the sample I added, and it appears unaffected. I will get it cleaned up, and we can try again with different samples.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Tane/TA_21.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[399]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5311, 'ZanaInitialAttention', '[]', 'You... idiot! What are you doing!?', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Zana/Z_Nov_01.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[125,177,178,180,323,324,379,385,386,416,417]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5312, 'KiracEnterTemplarCourts', '[]', 'The Courts haven''t been secured yet. Be ready for a tussle. The abominations left in Kitava''s wake have gone slack-jawed since his destruction, but they''re still prone to fly into rages if provoked.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Kirac/KI_07.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[410,411,412,413,414,415]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5313, 'KiracEnterReliquary', '[]', 'The Vault of Venarius has been sealed for years. There''s no telling what might be inside.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Kirac/KI_12.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[410,411,412,413,414,415]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5314, 'KiracReliquaryPressurePlate', '[]', 'I''ll stand on this one. You stand on the other, exile!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Kirac/KI_13.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[410,411,412,413,414,415]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5315, 'TaneOctaviusWildGreeting1', '[]', 'Approach with caution!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Tane/TA_01_A.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[400]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5316, 'TaneOctaviusWildGreeting2', '[]', 'Here, friend!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Tane/TA_01_B.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[400]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5317, 'TaneOctaviusWildGreeting3', '[]', 'Tread lightly, Exile!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Tane/TA_01_C.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[400]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5318, 'TaneOctaviusGreeting1', '[]', 'Good day.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Tane/TA_02_A.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[400]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5319, 'TaneOctaviusGreeting2', '[]', 'Tala, Exile.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Tane/TA_02_B.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[400]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5320, 'TaneOctaviusGreeting3', '[]', 'Peace to you.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Tane/TA_02_C.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[400]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5321, 'TaneOctaviusFarewells1', '[]', 'Regards.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Tane/TA_03_A.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[400]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5322, 'TaneOctaviusFarewells2', '[]', 'Good day.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Tane/TA_03_B.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[400]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5323, 'TaneOctaviusFarewells3', '[]', 'May the darkness spare you.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Tane/TA_03_C.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[400]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5324, 'TaneOctaviusCatalysts', '[]', 'In alchemy, some changes are almost instantaneous, while others require patience. It probably comes as no surprise that a profession that pursues such fantastical goals as alchemy does not attract the most patient of people. Thus, the discovery of the catalyst -- an additive which accelerates the transformation without influencing it. ' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
You might find such an additive useful for seeking out, for example, specific latent properties in certain materials. The sort of thing that could normally take many years.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Tane/TA_22.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[398,399,401]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5325, 'TaneOctaviusPiety', '[]', 'My master was no stranger to the machinations of the Templar elite like her. I feel a sort of kinship with her. We both gave up our names, though she did so voluntarily. We both sought to make something of ourselves. Where our kinship ends is how she made her name known. I can appreciate the desire for knowledge but, I can never condone the methods used to acquire it.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
If it is true that, in her dying moment, she sought to redeem herself, it casts an interesting light on our exploration of the darkness. Perhaps it is our very mortality that drives us to do good, to suppress the primal urges... Our actions outlive us, after all.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Tane/TA_22_A.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[398,399,401]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5326, 'TaneOctaviusIzaro', '[]', 'So the mad emperor continues to stomp around in his Labyrinth, a speaking dead man inside a grand machine. Did he happen to release any sort of liquid essence when you smashed his body? No? hmm. A shame. For a moment, I was certain -' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
No. It is no matter. I do not believe we want his kind of immortality...', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Tane/TA_23.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[400]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5327, 'TaneOctaviusTukohama', '[]', 'Though I know little of my natural heritage, I know enough to understand the implications of your victory against the Karui God of War. Did his long slumber weaken him, or have the gods been greatly exaggerated through the evolution of myths? In either case, this undoubtedly means we will find no divine help against the intrinsic darkness. They are not the keepers of mankind many believed them to be.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Tane/TA_24.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[398,399,401]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5328, 'TaneOctaviusNavali', '[]', 'Keep your distance from her, exile. One horrible night, my master flew into a great wrath and beat me to the precipice of death itself. For a moment, I envisioned myself walking through strange grey halls.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
She was there, watching me, unblinking, a herald for something far greater...' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
She was there. She spoke. She said that joining the Halls of the Dead was not my fate that night, but that we would meet again. These are the faded memories of a terrified and traumatized child, perhaps no more than a foolish nightmare, but I cannot stop myself from shivering when she turns her purple eyes my way... because I can tell that she recognises me.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Tane/TA_25.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[398,399,401]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5329, 'KiracIntroduction', '[]', 'Kirac''s my name, tracker and officer in Oriath''s new Citizen Vanguard. We''re the front line, ensuring the likes of Kitava and Innocence never blindside us again. The Templar kept the true nature of the world hidden from the populace, but now the rhoa''s out of the sack, and we''ll keep both eyes open. Or the one eye open, in my case.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Kirac/KI_01.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[410,411]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5330, 'KiracMapDeviceQuest', '[]', 'I''ll come right out with it, Godslayer. I have a problem, and you may be the only one that can help. ' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
My younger brother, Baran, fell in with a radical by the name of Zana Caeserius some time ago. She''s a bit of a famous one in certain parts. Many who have worked with her have ended up two pews short of a congregation, ranting and raving on street corners or accosting random citizens... you can see the cause for my concern. I''ve reason to believe she was working out of an old Templar Laboratory off the Square. Head there with me now.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Kirac/KI_02.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[410]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5331, 'KiracExplosionReaction', '[]', 'By the muscular golden arse of Innocence! What was that?!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Kirac/KI_04.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[410,411,412,413,414,415]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5332, 'KiracOnExplosion', '[]', 'My brother spoke of a device like that in his letters. He said they used it to open passage to distant lands, whatever that means... However it works, it''s clearly dangerous if it can explode in such a manner. We must do our work somewhere away from civilians. I''m going to requisition a team of tinkerers and engineers. Using the notes in this laboratory, we can construct a similar device. Your hideout will do nicely as a base of operations. Yes, I know where it is. I came up the ranks as a tracker, mind you.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Kirac/KI_05.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[411]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5333, 'KiracKeyQuest', '[]', 'Rumour has it this was built by order of a previous High Templar, the name of Venarius. If the impossible components we need are anywhere in our mortal realm, they would be in the Vault of Venarius in the Reliquary.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
We''re going to need to find the key to that Vault. Dominus was the next High Templar, and thus the one who declared his predecessor''s pursuits heretical and had them sealed as blasphemous. A load of manure to secure the secrets for himself, no doubt. A man like him would have kept the key close. My gut tells me it''s likely in his old office in the Templar Courts. Let''s head there.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Kirac/KI_06.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[411]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5334, 'KiracCourtsEnter', '[]', 'Search and destroy, men. We''ll clear a path!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Kirac/KI_08.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[410,411,412,413,414,415]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5335, 'KiracFindOffice', '[]', 'There''s the office of the man himself. Search his desk.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Kirac/KI_09.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[410,411,412,413,414,415]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5336, 'KiracFoundKey', '[]', 'That''s what we need. Let''s head to the Reliquary on the other side of Oriath Square.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Kirac/KI_10.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[410,411,412,413,414,415]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5337, 'KiracVaultOpen', '[]', 'There''s a haunting odour in the air... be wary.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Kirac/KI_14.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[410,411,412,413,414,415]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5338, 'KiracVaultEnter', '[]', 'Men! Kill everything that moves... except us.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Kirac/KI_15.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[410,411,412,413,414,415]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5339, 'KiracPartsFound', '[]', 'Hurts my eye just to look at. Those are definitely what we''re looking for. Angles that don''t make sense, shapes that shouldn''t exist, and corners to trap the sight. Let''s install these in the device and see what happens. Meet me in your hideout, exile.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Kirac/KI_16.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[414]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5340, 'KiracRebuildMapDevice', '[]', 'I think I can put the pieces together by following the plans we found. Careful now. This should either work perfectly, or explode. Based on what we''ve seen, it might even do both.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Kirac/KI_17.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[412]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5341, 'KiracOfferMap', '[]', 'The device seems stable now, though I''ve no inkling where its portals may lead. My instinct as a tracker usually gives me some sense of direction, but I just feel light-headed when I think about it... Baran''s last letter included a small crudely hewn stone map so that I might follow him if anything happened. The carvings didn''t make sense at the time, but now I understand.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Put this map in the machine. Somehow, I''m certain it''s our destination.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Kirac/KI_19.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[412]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5342, 'KiracUnlockAtlas', '[]', 'I found a specialized map in the Templar Laboratory near the old device. I believe we can fill it out to keep track of our progress.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Kirac/KI_23.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[412]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5343, 'KiracOnZana1', '[]', 'If Caeserius is still alive, I''ll track her down, and I''ll deliver her in chains for judgement. It''s not for me to decide whether skulking around Oriath with mystical technologies that explode is a crime worthy of prison. The new citizen Magistrates will handle that.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Kirac/KI_28.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[410,412]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5344, 'KiracOnZana2', '[]', 'I intended to bring Caeserius to the Magistrates, but it sounds like Baran is in real trouble. It runs at odds with my position in the Citizen Vanguard, but I think I''ve earned some discretion. We should work with her until we rescue my brother.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Kirac/KI_29.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[410,412]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5345, 'KiracOnZana3', '[]', 'Caeserius has a good head on her shoulders. I''m starting to think her reputation as a radical is unearned. By all accounts, regarding this ''Elder'' creature she and her exiles defeated, she may have done Wraeclast a service, and nobody''s the wiser. Of course, that opinion hinges on whether they''re telling the truth, and whether my brother can be saved.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Kirac/KI_30.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[410,412]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5346, 'KiracOnZana4', '[]', 'In my heart, I do blame her for what happened to Baran. If he was simply dead, that would be one thing, but he''s out there suffering eternal madness because of her. I can''t deny that bitterness. However, duty calls. The people we''ve got are it. If we tried to explain all this to the citizen Magistrates, Caeserius would be locked up for her associations with criminals, and we''d all be thrown in an asylum for our wild tales. We must face this ''Sirus'' together, all grievances aside.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Kirac/KI_31.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[410,412]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5347, 'KiracOnZana5', '[]', 'I''ll keep my own counsel on the topic of Zana, thank you. Uh, Caeserius, rather. However, it seems someone reported to the Magistrates that she''s innocent of all her supposed underhanded activities... funny that.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Kirac/KI_32.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[412,410]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5348, 'KiracOnBaran0', '[]', 'Baran sent me letters. He wrote that he was embarking on an expedition with Caeserius and several skilled exiles. Kitava''s temper tantrum kept me from Oriath, but my brother should have long since returned by now. I know that searching for one man''s brother is an inconsequential task for a Godslayer, but I have a bad feeling about this.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Kirac/KI_03.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[410]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5349, 'KiracOnBaran1', '[]', 'I knew I should have dropped everything and come back when he first wrote to me that he''d fallen in with that radical. We''ll find him. Set this right.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Kirac/KI_33.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[410,412]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5350, 'KiracOnBaran2', '[]', 'He''s in trouble, but he''s got us looking out for him. Use my skills. With my help, you can track him down in no time.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Kirac/KI_34.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[410,412]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5351, 'KiracOnBaran3', '[]', 'You actually saw my brother? He''s alive? Then finding his sanctuary is our next move.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Kirac/KI_35.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[410,412]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5352, 'KiracOnBaran4', '[]', 'It sounds like he''s a bit out of sorts. Let''s continue to pursue him. I just know that he can be saved, exile.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Kirac/KI_36.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[410,412]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5353, 'KiracOnBaran5', '[]', 'So that''s it then. Baran can''t be saved. Caeserius... did she understand the costs? Did she know the fate she was consigning my brother to? I''ve no small bitterness over how far she went to try to save her father, yet here we are, abandoning my brother to eternal madness. There''s nothing to be done about it, but it still burns.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Kirac/KI_37.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[410,412]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5354, 'KiracOnBaran6', '[]', 'Even after all that''s happened, I find myself unable to move on. Keep pursuing Baran, exile. Let''s keep trying to save him. We won''t fall into the same madness, either, because I''ll stay out here in the real world. I''m the one with the desire, and you''re the one with the strength. If we keep the two separate, the Atlas can''t trap us.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
And one day, we''ll find a way to save him.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Kirac/KI_38.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[410,412]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5355, 'KiracPostFightEndQuest', '[]', 'Seems enough was enough. The Vanguard undertook the largest evacuation in history... hundreds of ships... and Oriath has been abandoned. After the domination of the Templar, then the crackdown under Innocence, then the slaughter at Kitava''s hands, and finally the ruination by Sirus, it''s clear our little island is no place for men to live. Even cursed, one could say, though we are not entirely blameless for those disasters.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
No small irony that the Oriathan people now depend upon the Karui we once enslaved. I always said that if you kick a rhoa in the arse, one day, it''ll kick you in the head, but I underestimated the honour of our new hosts. They''re different after the death of their gods... and we are, too, after the departure of ours. I wasn''t a believer, but I can feel it. We''re on our own now.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
We''re going to have to work together to face what comes next...', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Kirac/KI_39.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[410,412]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5356, 'ZanaIntroduction', '[]', 'Do you have any idea what you''ve done!? No one was meant to ever come back here. No one was ever meant to even know this place existed! Your brash stupidity may have just doomed everyone back home!' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
We need to talk, but it isn''t safe here. Follow me through this portal.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Zana/Z_Dec_01.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[308]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5357, 'ZanaQuest', '[]', 'I suppose I was a fool for thinking I could just lock us all away -- it was always only a matter of time before someone''s curiosity got the better of them.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Exile, I know who you are and what you''ve done. I know you are strong. Capable of slaying gods! But the other exiles in the Atlas... they are beyond compare.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Yet, they must be stopped. We have a small window while they do not understand that there is a way back to Wraeclast. They are trying to find other ways out. ' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
I''ve begun finding altars like this one hidden in the spaces between maps. I''m worried the others are building them as a means of escape. We need to find a way to stop them.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
I''m sorry. I know you''ve done so much... but who else can possibly do what I ask?' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
These Exiles have found hidden pathways like this one. I''m not sure where they hide, but if you can find out, I can get us there. I''ll be waiting in your hideout.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Zana/Z_Dec_02.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[309,133,306]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5358, 'ZanaGoCorner', '[]', 'I don''t know for sure where the exiles are hiding, but it''s probably safe to assume they are going to move deeper into the Atlas to evade us. I''d suggest moving farther out in your search for them.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Zana/Z_Dec_03.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[133,306]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5359, 'ZanaSirusDiscovered', '[]', 'No... Sirus is still alive? Gods, I thought he was dead! He took the brunt of the energy released when we sealed the Elder. How did he survive? ' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Sirus was the leader of the group of Exiles I recruited. Brilliant and determined, and a force to be reckoned with even before we travelled the Atlas together. We... grew close. I was distraught when he vanished with the Elder. At first I thought the other Exiles were looking for him as I was, but perhaps they knew he was still alive...' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
I have a terrible feeling that Sirus may be tied to the madness of the others. Or perhaps he is just as mad as they are. We need to find and stop him -- if the others are looking for a way out, I''m certain he is too.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Zana/Z_Dec_04.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[133]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5360, 'ZanaSirusLocation', '[]', 'I''d never have thought the others were masking Sirus''s location... He''d been using them as a barrier the whole time! Listen, be sure you are ready for this. Sirus will not leave without a fight. He has spent all this time in the heart of the Atlas, growing more and more powerful. I''ve drawn up a map to get you to his location.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Exile, please, be careful. I really can''t bear to lose any more friends.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Zana/Z_Dec_05.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[133]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5361, 'ZanaMissionGuardianMaps', '[]', 'Exile, I think it''s important you understand what you''re up against. Words don''t adequately convey just how dangerous the Elderslayers are. So to that end, I''ve managed to recover a memory of one of the trials they had to endure, so you can see for yourself just what they''re made of. This map is identical to one they conquered on their journey to face my father, the Shaper.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Zana/Z_Dec_06.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[125]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5362, 'ZanaMissionElderGuardianMaps', '[]', 'You must think me a fool for taking so long to understand just how mad the Elderslayers have become, but... you don''t know what we were up against. Look, I''m going to show you a memory of a battle against one of the Elder''s guardians. Perhaps then you''ll see why it wasn''t so clear.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Zana/Z_Dec_07.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[125]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5363, 'ZanaMissionSynthesisMaps', '[]', 'My father was dragged into the Atlas by the High Templar Venarius. Surely you remember just how cruel and conniving he was before he "disappeared". Well, I discovered he didn''t simply disappear... He was trapped and slain in the Atlas, and now his soul haunts the fragmented memories that are scattered across the Atlas. See for yourself, but... be careful.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Zana/Z_Dec_08.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[125]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5364, 'ZanaMissionLegionMonolith', '[]', 'This will no doubt sound strange, but there''s a map with an odd stone monolith in it, and everything seems to indicate it''s actually of Wraeclast origin. To make things even stranger, it appears to be surrounded by people from Wraeclast, except... not. I know, it sounds like nonsense. That''s why I need you to see what''s really going on.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Zana/Z_Dec_09.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[125]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5365, 'ZanaOnNiko', '[]', 'I''m no stranger to madness, as you know, and Niko''s definitely heading down that path. The madness of the Atlas creeps up slowly and almost imperceptibly until you''re too far gone to be rescued. Niko seems to be aware, to some degree, of what''s happening to him, and even what the cause is, yet he continues to expose himself to it, and even craves it. ' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Exile, I urge you to keep an eye on him. I know I will.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Zana/Z_Dec_14.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[133]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5366, 'ZanaOnEinhar', '[]', 'I''ve spent far more time with far worse people than Einhar. He''s eccentric, sure, but his actions come from a place of love. Well, not for his game, but for us. Yes, he keeps bringing me slabs of completely inedible animal flesh, and yes, he is loud enough to draw every fiend in a ten mile radius towards us, but you can be damned sure he''ll stand and fight each and every fiend that comes running.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
The meat I could do without.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Zana/Z_Dec_15.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[133]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5367, 'ZanaOnAlva', '[]', 'I worry about that girl... I don''t think she fully understands what she is getting herself into. I used to be like her -- headstrong, impulsive and results-focused, and all it got me was more trouble. Alva has completely glossed over what a miracle she has access to.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Zana/Z_Dec_16.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[133]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5368, 'ZanaOnNavali', '[]', 'If it weren''t for the surprising accuracy of Navali''s predictions in Wraeclast, I''d have thought she was as mad as the exiles in the Atlas. In my experience, anyone who claims to know the future is a few cogs short of a timepiece, or they''re trying to trick you. ' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
I have to question her motives though... She claims to be an agent of Hinekora, and so far even the most benevolent of gods tend to cause utter chaos. Let alone a god of death...', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Zana/Z_Dec_17.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[133]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5369, 'ZanaOnJun', '[]', 'I don''t think Jun trusts me yet. When we speak, she always averts her eyes and keeps her sentences short, like she wants to leave. I''ve caught her staring at me too. I understand why she might be suspicious, especially given what she has been through, but... We need all the close friends we can get. We need to be able to trust each other!' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
What can I do to win her over?', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Zana/Z_Dec_18.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[133]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5370, 'ZanaOnHelena', '[]', 'Not long ago I would have had a tough time trusting someone like Helena. The training the Blackguards underwent borders on brainwashing, and it''s tough to undo something like that. But I''ve learned that trust isn''t about someone''s past -- it''s about someone''s actions.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Helena''s actions have gone a long way to prove just how trustworthy she is.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Zana/Z_Dec_19.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[133]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5371, 'ZanaOnBaran', '[]', 'Like many of those once loyal to the Templar regime, Baran held particular contempt for his former brethren. Our mutual disdain for Dominus helped us bond. We stayed up far too late on many nights, discussing where science and spirituality overlapped... and where they clashed. ' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
While I tended to agree with Veritania''s secular view that people must be responsible for their own actions, Baran was still a firm believer that trust in God was necessary for good moral judgement. Despite everything the Templar put him through, his faith was unshaken.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
We didn''t always see eye-to-eye, but we respected each other''s positions. Of course, once the madness set in, that respect vanished, replaced by fevered argument and name-calling. As the group dwindled, he found reasons to cast doubt on each of the departed. In our last fight before the two of us went our separate ways, he accused me of being sent by a shadowy demon to draw him away from the righteous path...' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
And then I was alone.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Zana/Z_Dec_21.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[133]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5372, 'ZanaOnVeritania', '[]', 'When I met her, Veritania was a paradox. She was quiet and reserved to the point of reclusiveness, yet she seemed to feel compelled to help others by a humanistic moral code she''d profess by the campfire. Before, she took care of the hungry, the down-on-their-luck, the homeless, the addicted, and the enslaved alike. She was, in fact, exiled for her charity work... helping one too many mistreated Maraketh or Karui made powerful people in Oriath very angry.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
As we explored the Atlas, Veritania''s mind became an invaluable resource. Thanks to her, we were able to stretch our limited resources farther than I could''ve possibly hoped, avoiding fruitless confrontations and conserving our strength for moments that mattered most. She''d see a bad situation coming sooner than anyone, and help steer us away from it. ' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
But her mind, like the others, soon broke beneath the weight of the Atlas, and the once-merciful Veritania became contemptuous of all we encountered. It was impossible for anyone but Drox to meet her increasingly high standards. She broke away from the group not long after we left him. The last time I saw her, she accused me of using the mysteries of Atlas as a drug to distract myself from the loss of my father. After that barb, you can imagine I''m not too eager to see her again.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Zana/Z_Dec_22.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[133]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5373, 'ZanaOnDrox', '[]', 'I''ve seen my fair share of combat, Exile, but never have I seen someone more comfortable on the battlefield than Drox. Though he was not our leader, he was our commander. When an impossible decision had to be made in the midst of battle, somehow, Drox always found the right path forward. He led us through numerous situations we thought fatal with an unflagging warm grin that let us know he believed in us.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
But at some point, almost imperceptibly, Drox stopped making decisions for the group, and started focusing only on his new dream. His smiles turned to scowls. He remained fixated on this mad idea of building a kingdom in the Atlas. He became cold to Veritania and distant to the rest of us. All his efforts went towards securing the Atlas and establishing law. His obsession was putting us in danger, and that is something I could not tolerate.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
When I led the group away from him, he either didn''t notice, or didn''t care.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Zana/Z_Dec_23.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[133]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5374, 'ZanaOnAl-Hezmin', '[]', 'When you spend as much time in the Atlas as we did, basic survival skills no longer suffice, and it becomes necessary to master the lay of the land. That''s a tall ask in a place where the land changes from day to day, and yet Al-Hezmin took to it like a rhoa to mud. I could not count the number of times he saved us from getting lost in endless twisting caverns, or spotted the tracks of a dangerous beast far sooner than the rest of us would have. ' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Our praise must have gone to his head, because he began to strive to be the best at all times. If Drox brought back two boars from a hunt, he needed to bring back three. In battle, he had to deal the flashiest and most devastating blows, and he had to make sure we all saw him do it.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
His fixation on honing his skills was actually quite useful during our campaign against the Elder, so at the time we thought nothing of it, but... It hollowed him out in some fundamental way. He was full of bravado, yet at the same time desperately afraid of being exposed as merely second or third best. He was never unkind to me, even as the madness crept upon him, but for capable warriors like Drox that threatened his self-image... A clash was inevitable. We slipped away in the dead of night, but I doubt we''ve escaped a man of his talents. He''s out there, lurking and watching, waiting for the best time to strike...', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Zana/Z_Dec_24.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[133]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5375, 'ZanaOnKirac', '[]', 'Baran did mention he had a brother who served on a distant deployment, a career military man. I''d like to think that Kirac could bring Baran back to reality, but I think he may be too far gone. I think they all might be.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Zana/Z_Dec_28.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[133,306]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5376, 'ZanaHideoutOnExperience2', '[]', 'During my first forays into the Atlas, I felt like every bit of progress unlocked deeper understanding about the nature of existence. Now I''m beginning to wonder if it isn''t the reverse. ' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
There are times when I feel like the Atlas is watching me, observing me, and offering me a glimpse of my desires to keep me coming back. It''s as though the deeper into it I explore, the more it wraps itself around my mind.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Zana/Z_Dec_20.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[133,306]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5377, 'ZanaPostSirus', '[]', 'My home... Our home... It''s... it''s just... gone. After everything it has been through, I still thought Oriath could recover, could become the place I always hoped it would be... ' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Now...? Now it''s just ash. There''s not even enough rubble left for us to scavenge through. ' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Sirus, why did you have to--...?' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
I''m sorry, Exile. I should be happy. I should be thanking you for your help. I should be focused on the future. But I don''t even know where to begin. Oriath, and the people who were in it, are scattered to the wind. We''ll just... keep going, I suppose. What else can we do? Perhaps we can settle here... Stay in one place for a change.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
But at least you''re done now, right, Exile? You''ll leave the Atlas alone... right?', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Zana/Z_Dec_25.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[133,307]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5378, 'ZanaCitadelFound', '[]', 'Kirac says he''s pinpointed the location of an Exile Citadel. It seems they must anchor their Citadel to an existing location, which should make getting there straightforward. ' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
I''ve drawn up a map that should land you there. Be careful, though. You have no idea just how strong these Exiles are.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Zana/Z_Dec_26.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[133]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5379, 'ZanaCitadelFound2', '[]', 'Kirac has located another Citadel, so I''ve taken the liberty of drawing up another map. Good luck out there. We''re counting on you.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Zana/Z_Dec_27.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[133]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5380, 'ZanaCitadelMoved', '[]', 'Unfortunately, we''ve lost track of one of the Exile citadels. You''ll have to hunt it down again. I''m sure Kirac could be of help there.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Zana/Z_Dec_29.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[133]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5381, 'ZanaEncounterSirus', '[]', 'Sirus, please, we want to help you. Don''t do anything hasty.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Zana/Z_Dec_30_1.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[125,177,178,180,323,324,379,385,386,416,417]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5382, 'ZanaEncounterSirusTwo', '[]', 'No, don''t -', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Zana/Z_Dec_30_2.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[125,177,178,180,323,324,379,385,386,416,417]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5383, 'ZanaEncounterSirusThree', '[]', 'Kirac!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Zana/Z_Dec_30_3.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[125,177,178,180,323,324,379,385,386,416,417]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5384, 'ZanaEncounterSirusFour', '[]', 'Exile, go. I''ll stay with Kirac. Get Sirus out of Oriath. Go!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Zana/Z_Dec_30_4.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[125,177,178,180,323,324,379,385,386,416,417]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5385, 'ZanaEncounterSirusFive', '[]', '', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Zana/Z_Dec_30_5.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[125,177,178,180,323,324,379,385,386,416,417]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5386, 'ZanaEncounterSirusSix', '[]', 'Kirac, now!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Zana/Z_Dec_30_6.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[125,177,178,180,323,324,379,385,386,416,417]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5387, 'ZanaEncounterSirusSeven', '[]', 'I''m sorry... Sirus... This was all my fault. I''m sorry. I''m so, so sorry.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Zana/Z_Dec_30_7.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[125,177,178,180,323,324,379,385,386,416,417]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5388, 'ZanaCraftUnlocked', '[]', 'While you''ve been pursuing the exiles, I''ve been tinkering with the map device. I''ve added some new functionality. I''ve set it up so you can try it out immediately, but after that you''ll need to provide some reagents.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Zana/Z_Dec_31.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[133]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5389, 'DroxNoStoneEncounterOne', '[]', 'First warning, for treading upon lands that do not belong to you. Travel elsewhere and the law will have no quarrel with you.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/DroxTheWarlord/DR_01.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[406]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5390, 'DroxNoStoneEncounterTwo', '[]', 'Second warning. There are many other territories in this realm that have no law. Tread upon them instead.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/DroxTheWarlord/DR_02.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[406]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5391, 'DroxNoStoneEncounterThree', '[]', 'You were twice warned. The law will have your head, trespasser.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/DroxTheWarlord/DR_03.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[406]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5392, 'DroxNoStoneFleeing', '[]', 'You can bend the law, but never break it...', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/DroxTheWarlord/DR_04.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[406]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5393, 'DroxOneStoneEncounterOne', '[]', 'The criminal returns! How audacious!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/DroxTheWarlord/DR_05.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[406]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5394, 'DroxOneStoneEncounterTwo', '[]', 'Have you no respect for order?', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/DroxTheWarlord/DR_06.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[406]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5395, 'DroxOneStoneEncounterThree', '[]', 'You are chaos incarnate. I will teach you order.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/DroxTheWarlord/DR_07.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[406]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5396, 'DroxOneStoneFleeing', '[]', 'You reject my lesson at your own peril...', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/DroxTheWarlord/DR_08.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[406]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5397, 'DroxTwoStoneEncounterOne', '[]', 'You broach my lands yet again? An arrogant fiend!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/DroxTheWarlord/DR_09.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[406]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5398, 'DroxTwoStoneEncounterTwo', '[]', 'Beyond law, your punishment will be personal.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/DroxTheWarlord/DR_10.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[406]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5399, 'DroxTwoStoneEncounterThree', '[]', 'No respect for law and order. No right to live.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/DroxTheWarlord/DR_11 .ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[406]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5400, 'DroxTwoStoneFleeing', '[]', 'Law and order are not enough, it seems...', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/DroxTheWarlord/DR_12.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[406]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5401, 'DroxThreeStoneEncounterOne', '[]', 'Broach the anarchy you helped create.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/DroxTheWarlord/DR_13.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[406]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5402, 'DroxThreeStoneEncounterTwo', '[]', 'Without law, strength reigns supreme.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/DroxTheWarlord/DR_14.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[406]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5403, 'DroxThreeStoneEncounterThree', '[]', 'Ha! To the victor shall go the spoils.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/DroxTheWarlord/DR_15.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[406]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5404, 'DroxThreeStoneFleeing', '[]', 'You have not yet witnessed... the peak of my power...', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/DroxTheWarlord/DR_16.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[406]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5405, 'DroxFourStoneEncounter1a', '[]', 'Ah, my favourite trespasser returns!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/DroxTheWarlord/DR_17.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[406]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5406, 'DroxFourStoneEncounter1b', '[]', 'Hahaha! Kill and steal to your heart''s content. There is no law here.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/DroxTheWarlord/DR_18.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[406]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5407, 'DroxFourStoneEncounter1c', '[]', 'Anarchy is the only law here now, trespasser.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/DroxTheWarlord/DR_19.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[406]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5408, 'DroxFourStoneEncounter2a', '[]', 'Hahaha! Glorious freedom. Violence. Death! This is our promised land!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/DroxTheWarlord/DR_20.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[406]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5409, 'DroxFourStoneEncounter2b', '[]', 'I''ve been looking forward to your return. How many have you slaughtered since I last saw you?', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/DroxTheWarlord/DR_21.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[406]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5410, 'DroxFourStoneEncounter2c', '[]', 'Let us rain blood and gore upon the misty peaks and valleys of this lawless realm!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/DroxTheWarlord/DR_22.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[406]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5411, 'DroxFourStoneEncounter3a', '[]', 'Blood and gore!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/DroxTheWarlord/DR_24.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[406]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5412, 'DroxFourStoneEncounter3b', '[]', 'Visit me in my fortress, trespasser. Witness what you have created.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/DroxTheWarlord/DR_25.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[406]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5413, 'DroxFourStoneFighta', '[]', 'I shall crush all who oppose my will!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/DroxTheWarlord/DR_27.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[406]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5414, 'DroxFourStoneFightb', '[]', 'Killing you will be utterly satisfying.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/DroxTheWarlord/DR_26.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[406]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5415, 'DroxFourStoneFightc', '[]', 'You''ve made lawless criminals of us both. Let me show you what I have learned.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/DroxTheWarlord/DR_28.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[406]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5416, 'DroxFourStoneFightd', '[]', 'I wasted so much time trying to enforce the law. Those rules were nothing but a cage.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/DroxTheWarlord/DR_29.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[406]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5417, 'DroxFourStoneFighte', '[]', 'I''ve killed countless thousands. What''s one more?', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/DroxTheWarlord/DR_23.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[406]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5418, 'DroxFourStoneDeatha', '[]', 'Your strength... is the law...', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/DroxTheWarlord/DR_30.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[406]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5419, 'DroxFourStoneDeathb', '[]', 'My kingdom is yours... if you can keep it...', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/DroxTheWarlord/DR_31.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[406]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5420, 'DroxFourStoneDeathc', '[]', 'Time takes even the greatest of men...', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/DroxTheWarlord/DR_32.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[406]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5421, 'DroxFourStoneDeathd', '[]', 'Veritania... my kingdom for... Veritania...', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/DroxTheWarlord/DR_33.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[406]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5422, 'DroxFourStoneWins1', '[]', 'Might has made right.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/DroxTheWarlord/DR_34.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[406]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5423, 'DroxFourStoneWins2', '[]', 'Yes! Another challenger to bury in an unmarked grave.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/DroxTheWarlord/DR_35.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[406]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5424, 'DroxFourStoneWins3', '[]', 'Nothing makes a man feel alive like a fight to the death.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/DroxTheWarlord/DR_36.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[406]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5425, 'DroxCombatTaunt1', '[]', 'You are nothing!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/DroxTheWarlordCombat/DR_37_A_1.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[406]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5426, 'DroxCombatTaunt2', '[]', 'Lawless fiend!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/DroxTheWarlordCombat/DR_37_B_1.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[406]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5427, 'DroxCombatTaunt3', '[]', 'Face your lord!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/DroxTheWarlordCombat/DR_37_C_2.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[406]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5428, 'DroxCombatTaunt4', '[]', 'I shall crush you!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/DroxTheWarlordCombat/DR_37_D_2.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[406]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5429, 'DroxCombatTaunt5', '[]', 'Obey the law!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/DroxTheWarlordCombat/DR_37_E_1.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[406]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5430, 'DroxCombatGladiators1', '[]', 'Crush the intruder!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/DroxTheWarlordCombat/DR_38_A_3.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[406]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5431, 'DroxCombatGladiators2', '[]', 'Force of arms!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/DroxTheWarlordCombat/DR_38_B_1.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[406]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5432, 'DroxCombatGladiators3', '[]', 'I am the law!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/DroxTheWarlordCombat/DR_38_C_3.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[406]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5433, 'DroxCombatTelekinesis1', '[]', 'Answer to your lord!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/DroxTheWarlordCombat/DR_39_A_1.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[406]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5434, 'DroxCombatTelekinesis2', '[]', 'By my authority!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/DroxTheWarlordCombat/DR_39_B_2.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[406]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5435, 'DroxCombatTelekinesis3', '[]', 'My word is law!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/DroxTheWarlordCombat/DR_39_C_3.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[406]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5436, 'DroxCombatThumbsDown1', '[]', 'Unworthy!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/DroxTheWarlordCombat/DR_40_A_1.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[406]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5437, 'DroxCombatThumbsDown2', '[]', 'Your sentence is death.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/DroxTheWarlordCombat/DR_40_B_3.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[406]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5438, 'DroxCombatThumbsDown3', '[]', 'No mercy!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/DroxTheWarlordCombat/DR_40_C_3.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[406]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5439, 'DroxCombatBigSlam1', '[]', 'The weight of law!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/DroxTheWarlordCombat/DR_41_A_1.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[406]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5440, 'DroxCombatBigSlam2', '[]', 'Hand of Justice!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/DroxTheWarlordCombat/DR_41_B_2.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[406]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5441, 'DroxCombatBigSlam3', '[]', 'Lawbreaker!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/DroxTheWarlordCombat/DR_41_C_3.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[406]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5442, 'DroxCombatBanners1', '[]', 'By the people''s will!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/DroxTheWarlordCombat/DR_42_A_2.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[406]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5443, 'DroxCombatBanners2', '[]', 'Tithes for their lord!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/DroxTheWarlordCombat/DR_42_B_3.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[406]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5444, 'DroxCombatBanners3', '[]', 'I call upon my kingdom!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/DroxTheWarlordCombat/DR_42_C_3.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[406]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5445, 'DroxCombatBanners4', '[]', 'My kingdom''s wrath!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/DroxTheWarlordCombat/DR_42_D_1.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[406]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5446, 'DroxCombatMartialLaw', '[]', 'I declare martial law until justice is served!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/DroxTheWarlordCombat/DR_43_1.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[406]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5447, 'DroxResponseToSirus0', '[]', 'Exile, there is always a mightier lord.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/DroxTheWarlord/DR_44.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[406]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5448, 'DroxResponseToSirus2', '[]', 'Beyond law and anarchy, Exile, there is annihilation.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/DroxTheWarlord/DR_45.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[406]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5449, 'DroxResponseToSirus3', '[]', 'Even Kings answer to an Emperor, fool...', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/DroxTheWarlord/DR_46.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[406]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5450, 'DroxResponseToSirus4', '[]', 'If might makes right, then no law can judge Sirus.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/DroxTheWarlord/DR_47.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[406]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5451, 'DroxResponseToSirus5', '[]', 'Sirus has no need of laws or punishments. He merely obliterates.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/DroxTheWarlord/DR_48.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[406]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5452, 'DroxResponseToSirus6', '[]', 'Exile, you''ve stirred the beast!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/DroxTheWarlord/DR_49.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[406]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5453, 'DroxResponseToSirus7', '[]', 'What is a kingdom with no subjects? A land of corpses and flames will be all that remains.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/DroxTheWarlord/DR_50.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[406]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5454, 'DroxWatchstoneGlyph1', '[]', 'There is always another verdant hill over the horizon in these untouched endless lands. Once exiled and left with nothing, now I have found a realm where life can be built anew. ' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Now that the Elder and Shaper are gone, we can craft a kingdom of law and justice here. We can leave the militant domination of the Templars behind. No more will we have to fear those in power, for I shall be the one who leads, and by my strength the law will be equal and fair for all.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
A dream, perhaps, but one that I can make reality through force. Each valley whose threats I fell is one more valley for the people I will one day bring here. They will be free, and I will be their lord, ruling by the people''s respect rather than through fear or religion. ' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Drox the Just', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/DroxTheWarlord/DR_51.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[433]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5455, 'DroxWatchstoneGlyph2', '[]', 'Each valley I secure adds to the width and breadth of my lands, yet when I return they seem populated by phantasms and twisted imaginings once more. Are the mists coalescing into feverish creatures as soon as I move on, or am I unable to find my way back along my own path? A kingdom lost in fog is no kingdom at all.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Yet I find that the mists hearken to my expectations in subtle ways as my strength grows. Perhaps I can control this realm with greater finesse as my might becomes unquestionable.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Yes, that is the key. I must grow stronger. Only then will my kingdom become real.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Drox the Mighty', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/DroxTheWarlord/DR_52.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[434]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5456, 'DroxWatchstoneGlyph3', '[]', 'I strike harder and move more quickly with each passing clash. Always, I am on the verge of reaching that glorious flow of battle when my haste shall outmatch the mists. I feel it in my limbs, burning in my arms as I cleave the enemy in twain. It no longer matters what phantasm I fight, only that it falls in a single blow, making way for my next opponent.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
The dream is close. My kingdom is nearly within my grasp. I will have it, even if it means I must fight ceaselessly and forever. Raw might flows through me, and exhilaration is my constant companion. My people will have their home.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Drox the Warrior', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/DroxTheWarlord/DR_53.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[435]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5457, 'DroxWatchstoneGlyph4', '[]', 'The people hail their king! They cheer for the awe and power of my reign as I fell enemy after enemy in a blaze of golden glory. This is justice! Free lands for a free people, raising their hands and shouting their hopes out of the mists as I obliterate the enemies that fill these lands. ' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Finally, we are free, through the force of our arms and the blade of justice. I shall never rest, so that my people may fill the valleys of the Atlas and prosper. They will know me as they know the Sun, shining on them as I pass in a golden blaze.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Drox the Warlord', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/DroxTheWarlord/DR_54.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[436]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5458, 'AlHezminNoStoneEncounterOne', '[]', 'I''ve been watching you. You show promise, but I can''t let just anyone traipse through my lands.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Al-Hezmin/AL_01.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[405]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5459, 'AlHezminNoStoneEncounterTwo', '[]', 'You and I are going to have quite the dance if you persist in your invasion!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Al-Hezmin/AL_02.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[405]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5460, 'AlHezminNoStoneEncounterThree', '[]', 'This is going to be fun... for one of us.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Al-Hezmin/AL_03.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[405]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5461, 'AlHezminNoStoneFleeing', '[]', 'Fun... for you...', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Al-Hezmin/AL_04.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[405]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5462, 'AlHezminOneStoneEncounterOne', '[]', 'Back for another sparring session, exile? I''ve learned a few new techniques since our last clash.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Al-Hezmin/AL_05.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[405]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5463, 'AlHezminOneStoneEncounterTwo', '[]', 'Hah! A determined one. Chase me down a second time. Consider it a dare.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Al-Hezmin/AL_06.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[405]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5464, 'AlHezminOneStoneEncounterThree', '[]', 'You''re not dealing with the average hunter anymore!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Al-Hezmin/AL_07.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[405]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5465, 'AlHezminOneStoneFleeing', '[]', 'This is no longer enjoyable...', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Al-Hezmin/AL_08.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[405]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5466, 'AlHezminTwoStoneEncounterOne', '[]', 'Not you again! Can''t you bother Drox instead?', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Al-Hezmin/AL_09.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[405]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5467, 'AlHezminTwoStoneEncounterTwo', '[]', 'You''re still pursuing me? This is untenable!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Al-Hezmin/AL_10.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[405]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5468, 'AlHezminTwoStoneEncounterThree', '[]', 'I won''t hold back this time. You''ve crossed the line.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Al-Hezmin/AL_11.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[405]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5469, 'AlHezminTwoStoneFleeing', '[]', 'This is not the wondrous land we imagined. We should have listened to Zana.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Al-Hezmin/AL_12.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[405]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5470, 'AlHezminThreeStoneEncounterOne', '[]', 'Are you even real? I can''t tell anymore.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Al-Hezmin/AL_13.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[405]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5471, 'AlHezminThreeStoneEncounterTwo', '[]', 'Yes, I understand now. You''re a spectre out of the mists of the Atlas, sent to torment me.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Al-Hezmin/AL_14.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[405]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5472, 'AlHezminThreeStoneEncounterThree', '[]', 'I will unmake you, whatever you are.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Al-Hezmin/AL_15.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[405]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5473, 'AlHezminThreeStoneFleeing', '[]', 'Not... possible...', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Al-Hezmin/AL_16.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[405]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5474, 'AlHezminFourStoneEncounter1a', '[]', 'Why are you doing this? Leave me be, foul dream!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Al-Hezmin/AL_17A.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[405]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5475, 'AlHezminFourStoneEncounter1b', '[]', 'In pursuit of my lauded fortress, no doubt. It''s always the same.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Al-Hezmin/AL_17B.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[405]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5476, 'AlHezminFourStoneEncounter1c', '[]', 'Home is a dream. I no longer remember why I fight.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Al-Hezmin/AL_17C.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[405]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5477, 'AlHezminFourStoneEncounter2a', '[]', 'Have we done this before? I''m having the strangest sense of repetition.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Al-Hezmin/AL_17D.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[405]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5478, 'AlHezminFourStoneEncounter2b', '[]', 'Exile! The dance never ends, does it?', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Al-Hezmin/AL_17E.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[405]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5479, 'AlHezminFourStoneEncounter2c', '[]', 'You draw nearer to my sanctuary, as always.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Al-Hezmin/AL_18A.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[405]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5480, 'AlHezminFourStoneEncounter3a', '[]', 'Dream becomes nightmare in this place.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Al-Hezmin/AL_18B.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[405]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5481, 'AlHezminFourStoneEncounter3b', '[]', 'The pursuit, endless. The hunt, ceaseless.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Al-Hezmin/AL_18C.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[405]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5482, 'AlHezminFourStoneFighta', '[]', 'There is no true safety from you, is there?', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Al-Hezmin/AL_18D.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[405]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5483, 'AlHezminFourStoneFightb', '[]', 'Come, monster. Do your worst.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Al-Hezmin/AL_19C.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[405]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5484, 'AlHezminFourStoneFightc', '[]', 'I will never go down without a fight, beast.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Al-Hezmin/AL_19B.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[405]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5485, 'AlHezminFourStoneFightd', '[]', 'The spectre out of the mist comes to haunt me yet again.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Al-Hezmin/AL_19D.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[405]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5486, 'AlHezminFourStoneFighte', '[]', 'With your death, this nightmare may finally end.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Al-Hezmin/AL_19A.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[405]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5487, 'AlHezminFourStoneDeatha', '[]', 'You''ve killed me a thousand times, but those were just dreams...', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Al-Hezmin/AL_20A.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[405]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5488, 'AlHezminFourStoneDeathb', '[]', 'Molten One, save me from this unending nightmare!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Al-Hezmin/AL_20B.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[405]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5489, 'AlHezminFourStoneDeathc', '[]', 'Let me out... please, let me out...', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Al-Hezmin/AL_20C.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[405]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5490, 'AlHezminFourStoneDeathd', '[]', 'I awaken from this nightmare... at last...', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Al-Hezmin/AL_20D.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[405]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5491, 'AlHezminFourStoneWina', '[]', 'A victory, but there is no prize for me.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Al-Hezmin/AL_21A.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[405]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5492, 'AlHezminFourStoneWinb', '[]', 'I''ve killed you a thousand times, but those were just dreams...', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Al-Hezmin/AL_21B.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[405]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5493, 'AlHezminFourStoneWinc', '[]', 'You''ll be back again. The same dream, every night, but no waking between...', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Al-Hezmin/AL_21C.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[405]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5494, 'AlHezminCombatDoubleStrike1', '[]', 'Skin you alive!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Al-HezminCombat/AL_22_1A.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[405]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5495, 'AlHezminCombatDoubleStrike2', '[]', 'Hold still!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Al-HezminCombat/AL_22_2A.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[405]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5496, 'AlHezminCombatDoubleStrike3', '[]', 'Put up a fight.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Al-HezminCombat/AL_22_3A.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[405]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5497, 'AlHezminCombatSpin1', '[]', 'Dance with me', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Al-HezminCombat/AL_23_1C.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[405]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5498, 'AlHezminCombatSpin2', '[]', 'I can''t be bested.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Al-HezminCombat/AL_23_2A.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[405]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5499, 'AlHezminCombatSpin3', '[]', 'Easy prey.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Al-HezminCombat/AL_23_3C.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[405]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100);
INSERT INTO "NPCTextAudio" ("_row", "Id", "Characters", "Text", "Mono_AudioFile", "Stereo_AudioFile", "HasStereo", "__col6", "Video", "__col8", "__col9", "__col10", "NPCs", "NPCPortrait", "__col13", "__col14", "Cooldown", "__col16") VALUES
(5500, 'AlHezminCombatDash1', '[]', 'I''m too quick.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Al-HezminCombat/AL_24_1B.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[405]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5501, 'AlHezminCombatDash2', '[]', 'Over here!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Al-HezminCombat/AL_24_2B.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[405]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5502, 'AlHezminCombatDash3', '[]', 'You can''t escape.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Al-HezminCombat/AL_24_3B.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[405]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5503, 'AlHezminCombatDash4', '[]', 'I''ll always find you.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Al-HezminCombat/AL_24_4B.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[405]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5504, 'AlHezminCombatBackDash1', '[]', 'Try to catch me!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Al-HezminCombat/AL_25_1A.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[405]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5505, 'AlHezminCombatBackDash2', '[]', 'Not so easily!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Al-HezminCombat/AL_25_2B.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[405]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5506, 'AlHezminCombatBackDash3', '[]', 'Keep chasing!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Al-HezminCombat/AL_25_3B.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[405]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5507, 'AlHezminCombatWyvern1', '[]', 'Out! Strike!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Al-HezminCombat/AL_26_1A.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[405]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5508, 'AlHezminCombatWyvern2', '[]', 'I''m not the only hunter.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Al-HezminCombat/AL_26_2A.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[405]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5509, 'AlHezminCombatWyvern3', '[]', 'Feeding time!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Al-HezminCombat/AL_26_3A.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[405]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5510, 'AlHezminCombatSnakeBarrage1', '[]', 'How quick are you?', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Al-HezminCombat/AL_27_1A.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[405]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5511, 'AlHezminCombatSnakeBarrage2', '[]', 'Dance! Haha! Dance!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Al-HezminCombat/AL_27_2B.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[405]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5512, 'AlHezminCombatSnakeBarrage3', '[]', 'You''re in my sights!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Al-HezminCombat/AL_27_3C.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[405]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5513, 'AlHezminCombatPhaseChangeMelee1', '[]', 'I''m stronger!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Al-HezminCombat/AL_28_1B.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[405]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5514, 'AlHezminCombatPhaseChangeMelee2', '[]', 'I''m better!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Al-HezminCombat/AL_28_3B.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[405]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5515, 'AlHezminCombatPhaseChangeRanged1', '[]', 'I''m faster!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Al-HezminCombat/AL_28_2A.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[405]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5516, 'AlHezminCombatPhaseChangeRanged2', '[]', 'I''m better!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Al-HezminCombat/AL_28_3B.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[405]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5517, 'AlHezminWatchstoneGlyph1', '[]', 'Baran: Prayer is the centre of his regimen. All other activities are flexible, including eating and sleeping, but prayer time never shifts. Bad knees.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Veritania: Insists on reading every night. Not sure where she got the books. Don''t really care.' || char(13) || '
Talks in her sleep. Just noises, though - no discernible words.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Zana: Hiding something important. Not sure what yet. Probably related to what happened to the previous group. Keeps checking on us.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Drox: Loudmouth. Does weapon drills late into the night. Sometimes I hear him patrolling around the camp early in the morning. He must sleep, but I don''t know when.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Al-Hezmin/AL_29.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[429]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5518, 'AlHezminWatchstoneGlyph2', '[]', 'The Old Man: Zana knows him. Grandfather? Mentor? Either way, he doesn''t seem to recognise her. Impressive powers. Must be careful around him.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
The Demon: Bad, bad, bad. No discernable motives. No discernable weaknesses. Completely silent. Need to be really, really careful around it. Probably better just to run.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Sirus: Quiet, but when he does speak, speaks with authority. Likes Zana? Definitely something going on there. ' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Al-Hezmin: The greatest hunter alive.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Al-Hezmin/AL_30.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[430]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5519, 'AlHezminWatchstoneGlyph3', '[]', 'Baran is talking about God again, so I told him I need to go "write in my journal". What is it about the Templar training that results in such boring storytellers? He''s nice enough, I guess. I just wish we could weaponise his stories somehow. Could probably just send the demon to sleep for good.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Yesterday I hunted a boar for the group. Today, Drox brought back two. Tomorrow I''ll bring back three. Show that loud idiot that I''m the top hunter.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
I know Zana can sense the tension between Drox and myself. I don''t think she knows that I can sense the tension between her and Sirus. I''ve seen her making eyes at him. I''ve seen him making eyes at her too. I don''t think either one of them knows the other is interested. ' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
I thought Veritania was flirting with me, as she spoke with a smile for once, but I just had boar blood on my lip and it looked like a red moustache. After I wiped it off she went back to reading. ' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Shut up Baran. Shut up. Shut up. Shut up.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
I forfeit. He wins. I''m going to bed.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Al-Hezmin/AL_31.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[431]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5520, 'AlHezminWatchstoneGlyph4', '[]', 'New Person: I don''t recognise this one. Doesn''t move like the other ones. More sentience. Saw them talking to Zana. Didn''t see where they came from or where they went.' || char(13) || '
Seems strong. Stronger than a lot of the other exiles we saw. Would definitely have remembered this one if I''d seen them before. Maybe Zana hid them from us. ' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Not as strong as me though.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Going to lay some traps. Test them out. See what they are made of. ' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Then I''ll kill Drox.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Al-Hezmin/AL_32.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[432]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5521, 'AlHezminResponseToSirus0', '[]', 'Damn! That was too close. Too close!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Al-Hezmin/AL_33.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[405]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5522, 'AlHezminResponseToSirus2', '[]', 'What did you do to anger Sirus like this?', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Al-Hezmin/AL_34.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[405]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5523, 'AlHezminResponseToSirus3', '[]', 'Wake up. Wake up wake up!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Al-Hezmin/AL_35.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[405]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5524, 'AlHezminResponseToSirus4', '[]', 'Effective, but not so subtle.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Al-Hezmin/AL_36.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[405]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5525, 'AlHezminResponseToSirus5', '[]', 'If I were you I''d just jump in the flames, Exile.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Al-Hezmin/AL_37.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[405]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5526, 'AlHezminResponseToSirus6', '[]', 'He''s... he''s just so strong... I don''t understand it!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Al-Hezmin/AL_38.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[405]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5527, 'VeritaniaNoStoneEncounterOne', '[]', 'Another glutton come to feast on the infinite delights of the Atlas.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Veritania/VE_01.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[404]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5528, 'VeritaniaNoStoneEncounterTwo', '[]', 'You simply cannot resist your own hunger.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Veritania/VE_02.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[404]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5529, 'VeritaniaNoStoneEncounterThree', '[]', 'Take your first step into gluttonous obsession with a feast of violence.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Veritania/VE_03.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[404]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5530, 'VeritaniaNoStoneFleeing', '[]', 'You and I both know this isn''t over.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Veritania/VE_04.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[404]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5531, 'VeritaniaOneStoneEncounterOne', '[]', 'Like a Trarthan to a flesh-pit, I knew you''d come crawling back.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Veritania/VE_05.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[404]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5532, 'VeritaniaOneStoneEncounterTwo', '[]', 'The lust for violence and treasure has already germinated in your heart. It will be your undoing.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Veritania/VE_06.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[404]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5533, 'VeritaniaOneStoneEncounterThree', '[]', 'Let us indulge your disgusting lust.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Veritania/VE_07.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[404]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5534, 'VeritaniaOneStoneFleeing', '[]', 'The roots have taken hold. We shall see each other again.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Veritania/VE_08.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[404]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5535, 'VeritaniaTwoStoneEncounterOne', '[]', 'You have no idea you are the lead of a tragedy that has already been written.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Veritania/VE_09.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[404]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5536, 'VeritaniaTwoStoneEncounterTwo', '[]', 'Tread further upon my domain. Bring your tragedy of pride toward its apex.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Veritania/VE_10.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[404]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5537, 'VeritaniaTwoStoneEncounterThree', '[]', 'I shall save you from your own mortal frailties.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Veritania/VE_11.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[404]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5538, 'VeritaniaTwoStoneFleeing', '[]', 'You insist on dooming yourself...', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Veritania/VE_12.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[404]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5539, 'VeritaniaThreeStoneEncounterOne', '[]', 'You are incapable of stopping yourself. Pathetic.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Veritania/VE_13.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[404]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5540, 'VeritaniaThreeStoneEncounterTwo', '[]', 'There are no words to sway those who will not listen.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Veritania/VE_14.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[404]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5541, 'VeritaniaThreeStoneEncounterThree', '[]', 'Some are simply beyond saving.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Veritania/VE_15.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[404]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5542, 'VeritaniaThreeStoneFleeing', '[]', 'The thrill of victory shall forever be your prison...', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Veritania/VE_16.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[404]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5543, 'VeritaniaFourStoneEncounter1a', '[]', 'The beginning of the cycle of madness.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Veritania/VE_17.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[404]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5544, 'VeritaniaFourStoneEncounter1b', '[]', 'There was hope for you before. No longer.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Veritania/VE_18.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[404]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5545, 'VeritaniaFourStoneEncounter1c', '[]', 'You think only of victory. It is your prison.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Veritania/VE_19.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[404]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5546, 'VeritaniaFourStoneEncounter2a', '[]', 'There once was a fox who found a valley of infinite rabbits...', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Veritania/VE_22.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[404]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5547, 'VeritaniaFourStoneEncounter2b', '[]', '... but when the fox finished one hunt, there was always another. A slave to greed, he could never rest.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Veritania/VE_20.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[404]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5548, 'VeritaniaFourStoneEncounter2c', '[]', 'When was the last time you saw the sun, exile? The true sun.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Veritania/VE_21.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[404]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5549, 'VeritaniaFourStoneEncounter3a', '[]', 'You pursue my tower yet again, even knowing I will be waiting.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Veritania/VE_23.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[404]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5550, 'VeritaniaFourStoneEncounter3b', '[]', 'How can we help but hate each other?', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Veritania/VE_25.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[404]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5551, 'VeritaniaFourStoneFighta', '[]', 'This is my punishment. Come receive yours, exile.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Veritania/VE_24.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[404]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5552, 'VeritaniaFourStoneFightb', '[]', 'This time, I may show mercy.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Veritania/VE_27.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[404]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5553, 'VeritaniaFourStoneFightc', '[]', 'The truth is cold. Let me show you.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Veritania/VE_28.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[404]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5554, 'VeritaniaFourStoneFightd', '[]', 'I think I shall torture you this time.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Veritania/VE_26.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[404]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5555, 'VeritaniaFourStoneFighte', '[]', 'Welcome! Time has no meaning here. Your pain will be endless.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Veritania/VE_29.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[404]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5556, 'VeritaniaFourStoneDeatha', '[]', 'The end of the cycle of madness... until next time...', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Veritania/VE_30.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[404]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5557, 'VeritaniaFourStoneDeathb', '[]', 'I thought myself better than you... but you and I are bound to waltz together forever...', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Veritania/VE_32.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[404]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5558, 'VeritaniaFourStoneDeathc', '[]', 'My only consolation... is that I am not alone in this torture... see you soon...', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Veritania/VE_33.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[404]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5559, 'VeritaniaFourStoneDeathd', '[]', 'You stand victorious, your heart''s desire... the Atlas provides... your addiction...', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Veritania/VE_34.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[404]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5560, 'VeritaniaFourStoneWina', '[]', 'In death, there is still no escape from your lusts.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Veritania/VE_35.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[404]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5561, 'VeritaniaFourStoneWinb', '[]', 'A glutton for punishment.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Veritania/VE_36.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[404]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5562, 'VeritaniaFourStoneWinc', '[]', 'Pride preceded the fall.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Veritania/VE_37.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[404]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5563, 'VeritaniaSupersonicDash1', '[]', 'Sloth!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/VeritaniaCombat/VE_37_A2.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[404]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5564, 'VeritaniaSupersonicDash2', '[]', 'Repugnant!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/VeritaniaCombat/VE_37_B3.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[404]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5565, 'VeritaniaSupersonicDash3', '[]', 'Revolting!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/VeritaniaCombat/VE_37_C3.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[404]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5566, 'VeritaniaBarrage1', '[]', 'Loathsome!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/VeritaniaCombat/VE_38_A2.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[404]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5567, 'VeritaniaBarrage2', '[]', 'Wrath!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/VeritaniaCombat/VE_38_B2.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[404]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5568, 'VeritaniaBarrage3', '[]', 'Vile!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/VeritaniaCombat/VE_38_C3.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[404]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5569, 'VeritaniaWhirl1', '[]', 'Be judged!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/VeritaniaCombat/VE_39_A1.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[404]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5570, 'VeritaniaWhirl2', '[]', 'Away with you!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/VeritaniaCombat/VE_39_B1.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[404]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5571, 'VeritaniaWhirl3', '[]', 'Distasteful!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/VeritaniaCombat/VE_39_C2.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[404]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5572, 'VeritaniaDiveLanding', '[]', 'I shall free you.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/VeritaniaCombat/VE_40_1.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[404]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5573, 'VeritaniaResponseToSirus0', '[]', 'There is one who has transcended all mortal vice.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Veritania/VE_41.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[404]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5574, 'VeritaniaResponseToSirus2', '[]', 'None stand fit to judge one such as he.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Veritania/VE_42.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[404]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5575, 'VeritaniaResponseToSirus3', '[]', 'Sirus sits in judgement of all mankind.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Veritania/VE_43.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[404]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5576, 'VeritaniaResponseToSirus4', '[]', 'Pride and gluttony will be cleansed from this world.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Veritania/VE_44.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[404]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5577, 'VeritaniaResponseToSirus5', '[]', 'Sirus was once a mortal man with vices like any other, but they consumed his humanity, leaving him pure.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Veritania/VE_45.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[404]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5578, 'VeritaniaResponseToSirus6', '[]', 'What use is the war against vice in a dead world?', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Veritania/VE_46.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[404]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5579, 'VeritaniaResponseToSirus7', '[]', 'You''ve doomed us all, Exile.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Veritania/VE_47.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[404]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5580, 'VeritaniaGlyph1', '[]', 'This so-called ''Atlas'' makes me uneasy. When the Elder and the Shaper fought for dominion, their territories made a certain violent sense. There was a known purpose behind the miscreations we fought. Now that those purposes are gone, these lands have reverted to a primordial malleable clay which seems to offer up our very desires as offering and appeasement.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Long ago, before I was exiled, indeed before I truly knew the uncouth adult realities of humanity, I wandered a hall of mirrors at a carnival in Theopolis. By flickering torchlight, I saw myself reflected into infinity, finally obscured not by any horizon, but by the darkening and shrinking of my own image as it grew more and more distant behind echoes of itself.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
The mists of the Atlas are the same. There is no fog, no humidity, no obscuring and coiling haze. There is only my will, my thoughts, and my expectations, reflected as countless echoes through a vast and immeasurable space. A pure being might make this a paradise, but we are mortal, and brimming with vices.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Desire is the true enemy here.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Veritania the Disciplined', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Veritania/VE_48.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[425]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5581, 'VeritaniaGlyph2', '[]', 'For a brief time before we lost Sirus, I would have called these fellow exiles friends. Perhaps, even family. A certain bond forms between those who believe they are about to die, and that kept us focused... but we did not die. Sirus sacrificed himself, and we won the day.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
At what cost? We are drifting apart. Each of us sees that which we desire on the formless horizon, and each of us pursues our own path. I saw Baran continuing his crusade in a righteous wrath, though I know not how many days past, for the sun is false in this place. I suspect each valley I tread has a sun only because I expect it to be hanging in the sky. Does each valley only have a sky because I expect that, too? I no longer believe anything at all.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
I would not call myself bitter, but I do see the others descending, while I remain steadfast in my convictions. Drox believes he can forge a new land here, with himself as king. His pride draws him ever further from me. Al-Hezmin seeks to hone his skills against ever more dangerous enemies in a vain attempt to be more powerful than Drox and Baran, a curious kind of envy that poisons both his soul and the land around him.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
They are all becoming disgusting.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Veritania the Principled', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Veritania/VE_49.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[426]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5582, 'VeritaniaGlyph3', '[]', 'I understand now. I must serve as the moral heart of this place. The others are lost in their own gluttonous pursuits. They have become naught but delusional addicts lost in a haze of indulgence, and the thought of them makes me nauseous.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
I continue to fight the horrors out of the mists because I must keep them in check. The pure require strength to impose order on a chaotic world, and I cannot allow the likes of Al-Hezmin or Drox to spread their filthy vices.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Yes, I am the only one among us free of the hall of mirrors. I am the only one still thinking clearly. I have to get us out of here before it is too late... I am the only one that can save us.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Veritania the Pure', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Veritania/VE_50.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[427]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5583, 'VeritaniaGlyph4', '[]', 'Loathsome, foul creatures! This ''Atlas'' is infested with vice. In every direction, they emerge from the mists, dancing, laughing, eating, drinking, and cavorting in grotesque exaggeration of mortal frailties. The smack of their lips as they chew grates on my ears, the gulps from their bulging throats as they down their wine fills me with fury, and the embrace of coins and jewels and golden treasure makes me shudder.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Do you not see how repugnant you are? Stop consuming, stop partaking, and look at the abomination you have become! Every morsel you stuff down your gullet and every lie you tell yourself just makes you that much more monstrous. You are changing. You are misshapen. Your mouth bulges and grows, your eyes bulge, and your hands bloat. Do you not see yourself?!' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
I shall save you from your own vices by purging your weakness.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Veritania the Redeemer', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Veritania/VE_51.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[428]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5584, 'BaranNoStoneEncounterOne', '[]', 'You reek of antipathy. Whatever you are, stay far from my sanctuary.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BaranTheCrusader/BA_01.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[403]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5585, 'BaranNoStoneEncounterTwo', '[]', 'Oh yes... I understand your darkness now. Sin has sent his lackey to defile the devout.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BaranTheCrusader/BA_02.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[403]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5586, 'BaranNoStoneEncounterThree', '[]', 'I will not allow Sin to overtake purity.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BaranTheCrusader/BA_03.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[403]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5587, 'BaranNoStoneFleeing', '[]', 'No minion of Sin could be this powerful... what are you?', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BaranTheCrusader/BA_04.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[403]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5588, 'BaranOneStoneEncounterOne', '[]', 'I see now. You are a test sent to me by God as I reach the threshold of worthiness.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BaranTheCrusader/BA_05.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[403]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5589, 'BaranOneStoneEncounterTwo', '[]', 'Draw closer. Bring the holy fires. I shall not burn.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BaranTheCrusader/BA_06.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[403]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5590, 'BaranOneStoneEncounterThree', '[]', 'To prove oneself to God is the ultimate trial.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BaranTheCrusader/BA_07.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[403]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5591, 'BaranOneStoneFleeing', '[]', '... yours is no righteous strength. Deceiver! You are no servant of Innocence!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BaranTheCrusader/BA_08.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[403]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5592, 'BaranTwoStoneEncounterOne', '[]', 'Ah, my fellow forsaken soul. You, too, found the void lonely. You seek my wisdom.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BaranTheCrusader/BA_09.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[403]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5593, 'BaranTwoStoneEncounterTwo', '[]', 'Good and evil have abandoned us. From whence does morality spring in the absence of God?', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BaranTheCrusader/BA_10.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[403]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5594, 'BaranTwoStoneEncounterThree', '[]', 'In this blasted land unseen by the divine, we must make our own truths. I shall show you the light.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BaranTheCrusader/BA_11.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[403]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5595, 'BaranTwoStoneFleeing', '[]', 'You reject... my wisdom...? Blasphemer...', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BaranTheCrusader/BA_12.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[403]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5596, 'BaranThreeStoneEncounterOne', '[]', 'Yet again, the void in your soul draws you back to my domain.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BaranTheCrusader/BA_13.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[403]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5597, 'BaranThreeStoneEncounterTwo', '[]', 'Intrude upon my citadel. I promise you a revelation.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BaranTheCrusader/BA_14.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[403]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5598, 'BaranThreeStoneEncounterThree', '[]', 'You seek the light, and you have found it. I am become God, Creator and Shaper of Worlds.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BaranTheCrusader/BA_15.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[403]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5599, 'BaranThreeStoneFleeing', '[]', 'I see now... what you are... even God has his opposite...', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BaranTheCrusader/BA_16.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[403]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5600, 'BaranFourStoneEncounter1a', '[]', 'The Creator and the Destroyer meet once more, and in that eternal struggle, the world is forged.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BaranTheCrusader/BA_17.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[403]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5601, 'BaranFourStoneEncounter1b', '[]', 'My soul is free of doubt, for I cast it aside, and it became you.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BaranTheCrusader/BA_18.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[403]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5602, 'BaranFourStoneEncounter1c', '[]', 'You are drawn to me like a moth to a flame, for you cannot exist without me.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BaranTheCrusader/BA_19.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[403]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5603, 'BaranFourStoneEncounter2a', '[]', 'Like Sin and Innocence before us, we two are bound forever; God and his shadow.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BaranTheCrusader/BA_22.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[403]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5604, 'BaranFourStoneEncounter2b', '[]', 'You mean to torment me, but you are the weakness I once had. I reject you.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BaranTheCrusader/BA_23.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[403]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5605, 'BaranFourStoneEncounter2c', '[]', 'The Fire of Creation burns within me, and it will reshape you into something worthy. Only then will you be Forgiven.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BaranTheCrusader/BA_24.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[403]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5606, 'BaranFourStoneEncounter3a', '[]', 'Here, whole worlds come into existence at my whim. What hope can you possibly have?', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BaranTheCrusader/BA_25.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[403]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5607, 'BaranFourStoneEncounter3b', '[]', 'I seek to create a land of pure righteousness. What do you seek, except to destroy?', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BaranTheCrusader/BA_21.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[403]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5608, 'BaranFourStoneFighta', '[]', 'Shadow can never overtake light, demon.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BaranTheCrusader/BA_26.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[403]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5609, 'BaranFourStoneFightb', '[]', 'How dare you question God?!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BaranTheCrusader/BA_28.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[403]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5610, 'BaranFourStoneFightc', '[]', 'You seek Forgiveness, but you do not deserve it.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BaranTheCrusader/BA_20.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[403]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5611, 'BaranFourStoneFightd', '[]', 'I am the Fire of Creation, and I shall purify your soul.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BaranTheCrusader/BA_27.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[403]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5612, 'BaranFourStoneFighte', '[]', 'I shall cast you into a pit of infinite tortures.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BaranTheCrusader/BA_29.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[403]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5613, 'BaranFourStoneStoryDeathTalk', '[]', 'Kirac... sent you? You must keep him out of the Atlas... I cannot be saved... he will find only his own doom, endlessly pursuing my rescue... he will end up... like me...' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Tell Zana... she was right... to seal us away... Sirus must never... be...', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BaranTheCrusader/BA_30.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[403]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5614, 'BaranFourStoneDeatha', '[]', 'Tell Zana... ... ...<italic>{demons}...', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BaranTheCrusader/BA_31.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[403]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5615, 'BaranFourStoneDeathb', '[]', '... tell my brother... that I cannot be saved...', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BaranTheCrusader/BA_32.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[403]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5616, 'BaranFourStoneDeathc', '[]', 'Keep Kirac... out of the Atlas... at all costs...', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BaranTheCrusader/BA_33.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[403]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5617, 'BaranFourStoneDeathd', '[]', 'A brief moment of sanity... it never lasts...', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BaranTheCrusader/BA_34.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[403]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5618, 'BaranFourStoneWina', '[]', 'In death, you are Forgiven.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BaranTheCrusader/BA_35.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[403]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5619, 'BaranFourStoneWinb', '[]', 'You were nothing before God.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BaranTheCrusader/BA_36.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[403]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5620, 'BaranFourStoneWinc', '[]', 'You were a fool to challenge me, mortal child.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BaranTheCrusader/BA_37.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[403]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5621, 'BaranRuneActivation1', '[]', 'Faithless!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BaranTheCrusaderCombat/BA_38_A_1.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[403]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5622, 'BaranRuneActivation2', '[]', 'Banished!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BaranTheCrusaderCombat/BA_38_B_3.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[403]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5623, 'BaranRuneActivation3', '[]', 'Face your destiny!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BaranTheCrusaderCombat/BA_38_C_3.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[403]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5624, 'BaranRuneActivation4', '[]', 'Faith empowers!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BaranTheCrusaderCombat/BA_38_D_1.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[403]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5625, 'BaranRuneActivation5', '[]', 'Heretic!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BaranTheCrusaderCombat/BA_38_E_1.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[403]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5626, 'BaranSlam1', '[]', 'Release your soul!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BaranTheCrusaderCombat/BA_39_A_3.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[403]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5627, 'BaranSlam2', '[]', 'Die, and be forgiven!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BaranTheCrusaderCombat/BA_39_B_2.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[403]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5628, 'BaranSlam3', '[]', 'Sinners must be punished!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BaranTheCrusaderCombat/BA_39_C_1.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[403]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5629, 'BaranSlam4', '[]', 'Repent!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BaranTheCrusaderCombat/BA_39_D_2.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[403]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5630, 'BaranSlam5', '[]', 'Atone!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BaranTheCrusaderCombat/BA_39_E_1.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[403]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5631, 'BaranGenericSkill', '[]', 'Righteousness prevail!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BaranTheCrusaderCombat/BA_40_2.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[403]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5632, 'BaranResponseToSirus0', '[]', 'The lamb has woken the lion, and damned us all.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BaranTheCrusader/BA_41.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[403]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5633, 'BaranResponseToSirus2', '[]', 'You''ve awoken the slumbering giant, Exile.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BaranTheCrusader/BA_42.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[403]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5634, 'BaranResponseToSirus3', '[]', 'Even God fears the wrath of Sirus.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BaranTheCrusader/BA_43.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[403]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5635, 'BaranResponseToSirus4', '[]', 'There are some beyond even God''s judgement.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BaranTheCrusader/BA_44.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[403]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5636, 'BaranResponseToSirus5', '[]', 'If Sirus casts his eyes upon you, not even your soul shall remain.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BaranTheCrusader/BA_45.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[403]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5637, 'BaranResponseToSirus6', '[]', 'Seek God''s Forgiveness before Sirus seeks your head.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BaranTheCrusader/BA_46.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[403]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5638, 'BaranResponseToSirus7', '[]', 'And with his burning gaze, God swept clean the Land of Sin.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BaranTheCrusader/BA_47.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[403]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5639, 'BaranGlyph1', '[]', 'I, Baran, son of Galhad, being of full age and sound mind and memory, do make, publish and declare this to be my Last Will and Testament. We shall soon meet a cosmic abomination in battle in a place truly outside of all that is Good and Meaningful. Our chance of success, even by God''s grace, is slim. ' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
To my good friends and allies, Veritania, Sirus, Drox, and Al-Hezmin, I bequeath to you my staff and platemail. May you use it to seal the great evil that haunts these lands.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
To my brothers and sisters of the Templar faith in Exile, Herules, Gomin, Cassia, and Landren, I bequeath to you my home in Oriath, that you might never be without one again.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Signed,' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Baran, son of Galhad', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BaranTheCrusader/BA_48.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[421]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5640, 'BaranGlyph2', '[]', 'My dearest Landren,' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
It seems we may never leave this strange place. Our guide claims the device we used to come here has been broken and cannot be fixed, and that it would take a miracle for a path home to open. Unfortunately, we know the value of miracles.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
I can only hope that perhaps some intrepid explorers will discover this place and see to it that this letter finds you, though that could be a thousand years from now.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
How I wish I could have spent but a few more moments with you, and felt your hand in mine just one more time. Fate has seen to it, that like our days in the Courts, duty must come before desire. ' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Know that I did it all so that you might be safe. ' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
I hope you find happiness.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Yours eternally,' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Baran', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BaranTheCrusader/BA_49.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[422]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5641, 'BaranGlyph3', '[]', 'To the discoverer of this letter,' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
What transpired here in this strange and twisted realm is beyond comprehension. An evil older than time itself roamed these lands feeding on the memories of Valdo Caeserius, a son of Oriath. ' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Alas, the fiend that fed upon him was powerful beyond measure, and unerring in its desire to spread what we discovered was known as the ''Decay.'' I know not how long we pursued the demon. Long enough that my allies began to show signs of madness. We''d surely have fallen to the evil were it not for Sirus'' courageous leadership... and his sacrifice. ' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
We could find no way to slay the demon, though we tried countless times. It was the daughter of Valdo who found a way to seal it, though it cost poor Zana her father, rest his soul. Our gambit would have failed were it not for Sirus. The demon would not give in, clawing its way from Zana''s device. Sirus... He leapt onto it. We saw the demon tap into his body, at last relinquishing its grip. Sirus and the demon spiraled into the trap and out of our reality. Both gone. ' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Then Sirus was there once more. None of us witnessed his return. His eyes did not move, he did not blink, and his mutterings... Mad and unceasing. Then his face contorted in ways I''d seen only from men possessed by the black spirit. He struck at us again and again. We could not restrain him. We had to flee that place. That is when we discovered our path home was sealed. Valdo''s daughter had sabotaged our return. ' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
I do not know how long we have been trapped here. Weeks, at least. Possibly years. Time in the Atlas is a mirage. ' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Please, dear reader, if you have an ounce of sense in your body, do not dwell here. Return to Oriath, or wherever it is you are from. Tell of Sirus'' heroism and sacrifice, and leave him, and us, to die with the secrets we uncovered.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Baran, the Faithless', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BaranTheCrusader/BA_50.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[423]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5642, 'BaranGlyph4', '[]', 'He has gone silent. At long last, he has finally ceased his mad mutterings.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
It was inescapable. No matter where we tread, where we hid, where we sought solace, his mutterings found us. Even when we splintered, his voice wrapped around our heads like a snake, squeezing every other thought into warped shapes. I could not hear God''s whispers with such constant noise.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
I dare not visit him now. I want only to escape this prison and punish that insolent blasphemer, Caeserius, for her foolishness. Then, perhaps, I will return here with an army, and take the Atlas. What better show of faith is there than the establishment of a nation in God''s name? And then? Whatever God whispers. ' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
He has shown me a door. The stones. The paths they reveal. I need only find the right key. ' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
God almighty, I am your servant. I am your sword. I am yours, mind, body, and soul, and I promise I will deliver unto you all you wish to have.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Baran, the Blessed', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/BaranTheCrusader/BA_51.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[424]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5643, 'SirusExilEnters', '[]', 'My friends are dead, and now you come to me. Is it bravery? Or foolishness?', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Sirus/SI_01.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[407]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5644, 'SirusProtectsBody', '[]', 'Did you really think this would work?', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Sirus/SI_02.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[407]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5645, 'SirusMerges', '[]', 'I transcended all this long ago.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Sirus/SI_03.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[407]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5646, 'SirusAttacksZana', '[]', 'Destroying you is as easy as flicking a pest.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Sirus/SI_04.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[407]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5647, 'SirusSeesKiracWounded', '[]', 'How boring and small.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Sirus/SI_05.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[407]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5648, 'SirusTurnsTowardRealWorldA', '[]', 'There is nothing left for me here. For a few brief days, destroying something real may make me feel alive again.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Sirus/SI_06.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[407]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5649, 'SirusTurnsTowardRealWorldB', '[]', 'You slew my friends. You brought ruin to my worlds. You have invaded my very sanctum. I should be furious, and yet... I feel nothing.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Sirus/SI_07.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[407]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5650, 'SirusTurnsTowardRealWorldC', '[]', 'You want the Atlas? Take it. It''s yours. But Oriath? Oriath I will burn to the ground. Perhaps the suffering of my fellow citizens will finally stir something.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Sirus/SI_08.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[407]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5651, 'SirusInvasionRandom', '[]', 'Meaningless. All meaningless.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/SirusCombat/SI_09A.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 10, 0, 1, '[409]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5652, 'SirusInvasion2', '[]', 'Return to nothing.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/SirusCombat/SI_09B.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 10, 0, 1, '[409]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5653, 'SirusInvasion3', '[]', 'Bask in the emptiness.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/SirusCombat/SI_09C.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 10, 0, 1, '[409]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5654, 'SirusInvasion4', '[]', 'Immaterial.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/SirusCombat/SI_09D.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 10, 0, 1, '[409]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5655, 'SirusInvasion5', '[]', 'Wipe clean the slate.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/SirusCombat/SI_09E.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 10, 0, 1, '[409]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5656, 'SirusInvasion6', '[]', 'Cease to be.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/SirusCombat/SI_09F.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 10, 0, 1, '[409]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5657, 'SirusInvasion7', '[]', 'Be undone.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/SirusCombat/SI_09G.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 10, 0, 1, '[409]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5658, 'SirusInvasion8', '[]', 'The world unravels.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/SirusCombat/SI_09H.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 10, 0, 1, '[409]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5659, 'SirusOffScreenApparition1', '[]', 'Watch ''beauty'' crumble.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/SirusCombat/SI_10A.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[407]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5660, 'SirusOffScreenApparition2', '[]', 'This city is nothing.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/SirusCombat/SI_10B.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[407]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5661, 'SirusOffScreenApparition3', '[]', 'Your lives are meaningless.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/SirusCombat/SI_10C.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[407]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5662, 'SirusOffScreenApparition4', '[]', 'Why run? What''s the point?', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/SirusCombat/SI_10D.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[407]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5663, 'SirusMeteorShower1', '[]', 'Fury of the cosmos!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/SirusCombat/SI_11_1B.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[407]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5664, 'SirusMeteorShower2', '[]', 'Rain of stars!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/SirusCombat/SI_11_2B.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[407]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5665, 'SirusFusionNukeBeam1', '[]', 'Be utterly annihilated!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/SirusCombat/SI_12_1B.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[407]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5666, 'SirusFusionNukeBeam2', '[]', 'Creation itself!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/SirusCombat/SI_12_3B.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[407]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5667, 'SirusFusionNukeBeamC', '[]', 'Everlasting fire!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/SirusCombat/SI_12_2A.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[407]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5668, 'SirusCarpetBomb1', '[]', 'Obliteration!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/SirusCombat/SI_13_1A.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[407]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5669, 'SirusCarpetBomb2', '[]', 'Glorious flames!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/SirusCombat/SI_13_2B.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[407]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5670, 'SirusShortCooldownAHuman', '[]', 'Die.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Sirus/SI_33B.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[407]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5671, 'SirusShortCooldownBHuman', '[]', 'Give in.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Sirus/SI_34A.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[407]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5672, 'SirusShortCooldownCHuman', '[]', 'Be silent.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Sirus/SI_34C.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[407]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5673, 'SirusShortCooldownA', '[]', 'Die.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/SirusCombat/SI_14_1B.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[407]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5674, 'SirusShortCooldownB', '[]', 'Give in.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/SirusCombat/SI_14_2B.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[407]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5675, 'SirusShortCooldownC', '[]', 'Be silent.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/SirusCombat/SI_14_3B.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[407]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5676, 'SirusShortCoolDownCNoText', '[]', '', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/SirusCombat/SI_14_3B.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[407]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5677, 'SirusMediumCooldown1', '[]', 'You are nothing.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/SirusCombat/SI_15_1B.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[407]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5678, 'SirusMediumCooldown2', '[]', 'Why resist?', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/SirusCombat/SI_15_2B.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[407]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5679, 'SirusMediumCooldown3', '[]', 'Pointless.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/SirusCombat/SI_15_3B.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[407]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5680, 'SirusMediumCooldown4', '[]', 'Embrace nothingness.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/SirusCombat/SI_15_4B.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[407]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5681, 'SirusLongCooldown1', '[]', 'This world is doomed.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/SirusCombat/SI_16_1B.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[407]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5682, 'SirusLongCooldown2', '[]', 'I have seen beyond.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/SirusCombat/SI_16_2B.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[407]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5683, 'SirusLongCooldown3', '[]', 'Beyond, there is only horror.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/SirusCombat/SI_16_3B.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[407]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5684, 'SirusDismountA', '[]', 'What''s this? A real challenge? You''ve finally caught my attention!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Sirus/SI_17A.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[407]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5685, 'SirusDismountB', '[]', 'The others found strength in their projections. They became reliant on them. I am not so foolish.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Sirus/SI_17B.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[407]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5686, 'SirusDismountC', '[]', 'You assumed I share the same weakness as my fellows. I do not.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Sirus/SI_17C.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[407]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5687, 'SirusAcknowledgesExile', '[]', 'A fellow exile? One more fool under Zana''s sway. Allow me to destroy you before she has a chance to betray you, too. At least my way will be quick.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Sirus/SI_18.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[407]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5688, 'SirusHumanAndApparitionSkill1', '[]', 'Feel the thrill of <b>{the void!}', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/SirusCombat/SI_19A.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[407]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5689, 'SirusHumanAndApparitionSkill2', '[]', 'You will long for <b>{nonexistence!}', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/SirusCombat/SI_19B.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[407]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5690, 'SirusHumanAndApparitionSkill3', '[]', 'Meaning <b>{is an illusion.}', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/SirusCombat/SI_19C.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[407]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5691, 'SirusHumanAndApparitionSkillD', '[]', 'You cling to life <b>{only out of ignorance.}', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/SirusCombat/SI_19D.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[407]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5692, 'SirusDismountOneA', '[]', 'Is life really interesting enough to warrant all this pain?', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Sirus/SI_20A.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[407]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5693, 'SirusDismountOneB', '[]', 'Do you yet see the futility of your efforts?', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Sirus/SI_20B.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[407]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5694, 'SirusDismountTwoA', '[]', 'Why do you insist on continuing to exist?', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Sirus/SI_21A.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[407]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5695, 'SirusDismountTwoB', '[]', 'Everything ends. Everything crumbles. Everything.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Sirus/SI_21B.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[407]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5696, 'SirusDismountThreeA', '[]', 'On the edge of death, my heart races. I <italic>{am} alive!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Sirus/SI_22A.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[407]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5697, 'SirusDismountThreeB', '[]', 'Savour your excitement, your fear... they are the last things you will feel.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Sirus/SI_22B.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[407]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5698, 'SirusSimpleDeathLine', '[]', 'At least I felt something...', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Sirus/SI_23.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[407]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5699, 'SirusComplexDeathLineA', '[]', 'You left me there, Zana... centuries alone in the Atlas... all I wanted was to feel something again...', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Sirus/SI_24.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[407]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5700, 'SirusComplexDeathLineBOne', '[]', 'Impressive... but now you will fight on <italic>{my} lands.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Sirus/SI_25.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[407]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5701, 'SirusComplexDeathLineBTwo', '[]', 'I feel... something... at last...', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Sirus/SI_26.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[407]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5702, 'SirusComplexDeathLineCOne', '[]', 'The Atlas will fuel me. Behold. ...What?! No!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Sirus/SI_27.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[407]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5703, 'SirusComplexDeathLineCTwo', '[]', 'I always knew it would be you... Zana... to make me feel something... one last... time...', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Sirus/SI_28.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[407]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5704, 'SirusGlyph1', '[]', 'I always wanted a purpose. I wanted to find my place in life. Had I known just what it would entail, I probably would have tried to enjoy my purposeless life a little more.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
I hate this place. I hate what it makes us do. I don''t want to be in charge of these people, because I don''t believe we will survive this, and it will be my fault. ' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
If it weren''t for Zana... ' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
If it weren''t for Zana, I''d probably still be miserable.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
I''ll do it for her.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Sirus/SI_29.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[437]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5705, 'SirusGlyph2', '[]', 'I''ve done a fair bit of travelling in my life, as smugglers tend to. I''d seen some strange sights. Met some very homely, unsympathetic, and downright frightening individuals, usually ''round the pub. I thought I was as brave as they come. ' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
What I saw today shook me to my core. It emerged from nothing, like mist rising from the water''s edge, accompanied by dozens of shapeless... things. I felt my heart freeze. Goosebumps, everywhere, and I really mean everywhere. Its arms were tangled and many, its mouth an endless black abyss. It was the monster we were pursuing' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
I have never been more scared. Just being in its presence, I could feel my life being ripped away, dissolving like sugar in water. ' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
I understand now just how great the stakes are. I wanted a purpose... well, now I have one.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Sirus/SI_30.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[438]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5706, 'SirusGlyph3', '[]', 'We have cornered our foe in the heart of the Atlas. My heart aches for Zana. Her father is caught in the centre of this whole debacle, and I don''t see any way he leaves this alive. ' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Drox has been unusually silent all day. Al-Hezmin has been checking and rechecking his supplies. Baran and Veritania haven''t even argued. We all realise these may be our last moments of life.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
To have spent so long pursuing wealth and notoriety... Gods, if only I could wind back the clock. Without meaning, without purpose beyond my own selfishness... So much time wasted.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
If I survive after tomorrow, I''m going to tell her how I feel.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Sirus/SI_31.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[439]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5707, 'SirusGlyph4', '[]', 'They left me. In my moment of need, they left me.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
I remember seeing a light swallowed in an orb of darkness. Suspended. I remember its hands reaching out for something to hold. Desperation. I remember stepping forward. I wasn''t thinking of myself, or of Oriath. I was thinking of my friends, and of my brothers and sisters whose lives depended on me. I remember its cold grip tightening, then I slipped away. ' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
I remember... glass. Encased in glass. I couldn''t move. Couldn''t speak. But I could see everything. I saw everything. I saw everyone. Saw them leave. Saw her leave. It was all so quick. A thousand days and nights passed in a flash. Then...' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Nothing. I felt nothing. No sadness or anger. No joy. No pain. No pleasure. I was free. Free to move, to go where I please. Free of desire. Free to see the universe for what it was.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Empty.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Sirus/SI_32.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[440]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5708, 'KiracForbidReliquaryEarly', '[]', 'No sense in visiting the Vault without the key from Dominus'' private office in the Courts.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Kirac/KI_11.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[410,411,412,413,414,415]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5709, 'KiracFirstTrackFortress', '[]', 'Caeserius is a skilled cartographer, but she hasn''t got martial understanding of the terrain. If I was looking to build a fortress, I know where I''d place it. I''ve marked it on your Atlas. She might be able to get you there.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Kirac/KI_21.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[412]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5710, 'KiracTrackFortressRepeat', '[]', 'Judging by the trail of our quarry, I''d wager on a stronghold... there. I''ve marked it on your Atlas. Caeserius might be able to get you there.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Kirac/KI_22.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[412]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5711, 'KiracPreSirusFight', '[]', 'My brother may be lost, but I''ll see this through to the end, in memory of him.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Kirac/KI_24.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[410,411,412,413,414,415]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5712, 'KiracSavesZana', '[]', 'Zana!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Kirac/KI_25.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[410,411,412,413,414,415]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5713, 'KiracWounded', '[]', 'Leave me... Oriath needs you!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Kirac/KI_26.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[410,411,412,413,414,415]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5714, 'KiracKillingSirusOne', '[]', 'I''ve got him!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Kirac/KI_27_A.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[410,411,412,413,414,415]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5715, 'KiracKillingSirusTwo', '[]', 'Oh no you don''t!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Kirac/KI_27_B.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[410,411,412,413,414,415]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5716, 'KiracKillingSirusThree', '[]', 'You''re not getting away.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Kirac/KI_27_C.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[410,411,412,413,414,415]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5717, 'KiracKillingSirusFour', '[]', 'Now, Zana!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Kirac/KI_27_D.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[410,411,412,413,414,415]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5718, 'KiracKillingSirusFive', '[]', 'Now!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Kirac/KI_27_E.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[410,411,412,413,414,415]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5719, 'KiracKaruiArchipelagoGossip', '[]', 'Some say the Citizen Vanguard failed in its mission, but I say we succeeded, and wildly so. Oriath may have been ruined, but its people will live on, because you and I were out there in the wild unknown facing dangers that would have destroyed all of Wraeclast otherwise.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Life in the Karui Archipelago will be tough, but we''ve been through worse many times over. We''ll be alright.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Kirac/KI_40.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[410]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5720, 'KiracFoundWatchstone', '[]', 'Got to be what we''re looking for.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Kirac/KI_41.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[410,411,412,413,414,415]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5721, 'KiracCombatRandom', '[]', 'One good eye is all I need!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Kirac/KI_42_A.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[410,411,412,413,414,415]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5722, 'KiracCombat1', '[]', 'One good eye is all I need!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Kirac/KI_42_B.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[410,411,412,413,414,415]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5723, 'KiracCombat2', '[]', 'For Oriath!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Kirac/KI_43_A.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[410,411,412,413,414,415]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5724, 'KiracCombat3', '[]', 'For Oriath!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Kirac/KI_43_B.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[410,411,412,413,414,415]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5725, 'KiracCombat4', '[]', 'Not in my city!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Kirac/KI_44_A.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[410,411,412,413,414,415]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5726, 'KiracCombat5', '[]', 'Not in my city!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Kirac/KI_44_B.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[410,411,412,413,414,415]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5727, 'KiracCombat6', '[]', 'Abominations!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Kirac/KI_45_A.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[410,411,412,413,414,415]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5728, 'KiracCombat7', '[]', 'Abominations!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Kirac/KI_45_B.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[410,411,412,413,414,415]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5729, 'MetamorphLabCrumpledNote', '[]', '<b>{Further Improvements to the Preserving Fluid}' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
4 Parts pure and fine powder of Virtue Gem' || char(13) || '
4 Parts Trarthan Acid, superfluous humidity removed' || char(13) || '
2 Parts Aqueous Umbra, distilled' || char(13) || '
2 Parts Thaumetic Sulphite in its most crystalline form' || char(13) || '
1 Part Voltaxic Sulphite, kept in an ice water bath overnight' || char(13) || '
1 Part Blood (uncoagulated)' || char(13) || '
1 Part Blessed Water of Innocence ' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Mix the thaumetic sulphite with the virtue dust slowly and carefully, adding the trarthan acid one part at a time until the acid takes on a foul green hue. Wait for the dust to dissolve completely.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Add the aqueous umbra and blood at the same time. Ensure the blood is fresh. Coagulants were the cause of error last time, and the boy has paid for it in kind. Mix quickly to prevent separation of blood and umbra. The ichor will foam with dizzying fumes.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Slowly add the voltaxic sulphite, avoiding contact with the skin. Stir out the impure bodies and skim the top.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Add the blessed water and immediately imbibe. ' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
<i>{There are some separately scribbled notes}' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
The subject refuses to open his mouth. I have sent him to fetch the chains. I pray this delay does not spoil the mixture, for it is very time sensitive.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Results:' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
<i>{This part of the page was never completed}', '', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[418]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5730, 'ZanaMissionGeneric', '[]', 'I''m not sure if it''s my former allies or simply manifestations of the Atlas itself, but there are foul creatures plaguing this map, and I need them gone.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Zana/Z_Nov_40.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[125]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5731, 'ZanaBackInHideout', '[]', 'I''m sorry if I came across as harsh, but by entering the Atlas, you may have jeopardised all of humanity. ' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
My name is Zana, and some time ago I took a group of exiles like yourself into the Atlas. Our task, to ensure a creature named the Elder never reached our world, was of immeasurable importance. Even though the exiles I recruited were adept combatants, the journey was difficult. Yet we succeeded. We defeated the Elder. Though we couldn''t save--... we still succeeded. ' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
I thought we were done, but... but my companions just kept... returning. Over and over again, they would enter the Atlas, wiping clean entire worlds. It wasn''t about saving Oriath, or discovery, it was just... killing. ' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
The Atlas does strange things to one''s thought processes. I thought at first the madness was a symptom of the Elder, but now... it''s the Atlas itself. I''m sure of it. ' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
But these exiles are now so strong... I saw no other choice but to destroy our only way out. I sealed us all in and waited for death to find us.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Instead, I found you.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Zana/Z_Nov_03.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[133,306]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5732, 'ZanaWatchstoneFound', '[]', 'When Baran fled, he left a stone behind. Superficially, it resembles a virtue gem, but I don''t think that''s quite what it is. ' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
When we defeated the Elder, we didn''t kill it. I don''t think something like that can be killed. Instead, we sealed the Elder using a device designed by my father -- a design we salvaged from physical memories of his we found. When we sealed the demon, some of my father''s memories were expelled, along with those of the Elder''s countless other victims. They were muddled together, completely unparsable.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
These stones are what''s left of the Elder''s victims from across aeons. Crystallised and concentrated, and drawing the latent energies of the Atlas towards them. To hold one is to hold countless lives in your hand, to fill your mind with a maddening mix of sounds and images and emotions. ' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
I don''t know if Baran knew what he had, but I think he knew what it did. They are intoxicatingly powerful. It took all my willpower to lift my hand from the stone and step away. I can''t in good conscience let you take them, but that doesn''t mean we can''t use them in our fight against the Elderslayers.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Zana/Z_Nov_07.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[133]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5733, 'ZanaWatchstoneExplanation', '[]', 'Each Watchstone contains an immense amount of information from the earliest explorers of the Atlas. As the Exiles seek to hide from us, they will undoubtedly move into deeper territories, masking their paths. But these paths are known to the souls in these stones. ' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
I know of places in the Atlas where these stones might be used to reveal those paths. Show me on the Atlas where you want to explore more deeply, and I can use the stones to reveal locations long-hidden. Be careful, though, for these Watchstones will empower everything near them, and are certain to draw our foes out of hiding.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Zana/Z_Nov_08.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[133]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5734, 'ZanaWatchstonesCaptured', '[]', 'I have some good news and some bad news. The Watchstones we placed in the Atlas have been captured by one of the Elderslayers. The good news is Kirac can now track the location of this Elderslayer. The bad news, they are not going to give up the stones without a fight.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Zana/Z_Nov_09.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[133]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5735, 'ZanaOnMapDevice', '[]', 'The map device Kirac assembled is very similar to the one Venarius had my father put together. My clever father managed to find a few optimisations he could make. I''ve taken the liberty of enhancing yours in the same way. It''s nothing major, but it will help you scavenge a little more out of each map.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Zana/Z_Nov_13.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[133]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5736, 'TaneOnEnoughParts1', '[]', 'That should be enough. Come, let us see what you have gathered.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Tane/TA_26A.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[400]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5737, 'TaneOnEnoughParts2', '[]', 'That will do, Exile.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Tane/TA_26B.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[400]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5738, 'TaneOnEnoughParts3', '[]', 'Those samples will do just fine.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Tane/TA_26C.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[400]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5739, 'TaneOnEnoughParts4', '[]', 'That last sample should allow us to proceed, if you''re ready.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Tane/TA_26D.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[400]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5740, 'TaneOnAllParts1', '[]', 'These samples are only of use to us while they are still fresh, and you''re not going to find any better ones here.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Tane/TA_27B.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[400]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5741, 'TaneOnAllParts2', '[]', 'Don''t let your efforts go to waste. Let''s use the samples you''ve collected before they spoil.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Tane/TA_27C.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[400]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5742, 'TaneOnAllParts3', '[]', 'I believe you''ve gathered all the samples we''re likely to find here. Make sure we don''t let them go to waste.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Tane/TA_27A.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[400]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5743, 'TaneOnAreaTransition1', '[]', 'Those samples will not last long. Perhaps you should use them before you leave.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Tane/TA_28B.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[400]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5744, 'TaneOnAreaTransition2', '[]', 'The samples we use must be fresh. Let''s use what you''ve gathered before they spoil.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Tane/TA_28C.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[400]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5745, 'TaneOnAreaTransition3', '[]', 'Consider using those samples before you journey onwards, Exile.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Tane/TA_28A.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[400]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5746, 'TaneLeftAloneLab1', '[]', '...and that''s just the beginning. I''ll never tire of watching them slaughter you. I hope you can feel every cut. Every burn. I hope it haunts every moment of your pathetic existence.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Tane/TA_29B.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[400]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5747, 'TaneLeftAloneLab2', '[]', '...it kills you to see me free, doesn''t it? It kills you to know you have no power over me any more. I''m in control of both of our destinies.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Tane/TA_29C.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[400]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5748, 'TaneLeftAloneLab3', '[]', '...and what''s left of your legacy? Nothing but a few stains on the floor. All your work was for nothing, and I couldn''t be happier about it.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Tane/TA_29D.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[400]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5749, 'TaneLeftAloneLab4', '[]', '...you hear me old man? I''m never going to let you rest. Never.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Tane/TA_29A.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[400]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5750, 'TaneWhenInterrupted1', '[]', 'Welcome, my friend!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Tane/TA_30B.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[400]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5751, 'TaneWhenInterrupted2', '[]', 'There you are. Come!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Tane/TA_30C.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[400]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5752, 'TaneWhenInterrupted3', '[]', 'Come in! Please... Please come in.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Tane/TA_30D.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[400]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5753, 'TaneWhenInterrupted4', '[]', 'Ah, Exile. Welcome.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Tane/TA_30A.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[400]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5754, 'TaneOnOriathDestruction', '[]', 'Oriath is uninhabitable. Got what was coming to it, if you ask me. Do I feel for the dead? Of course. I am no monster. But sorrow and spite can coexist. Luckily for us, we do not need to live in Oriath, only work, and my underground laboratory is virtually unscathed.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Tane/TA_31.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[398,401]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5755, 'DeliriumVoiceEventOne', '[]', 'Someone wants you dead...', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Delirium/DEL_03.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[441]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5756, 'DeliriumVoiceEventTwo', '[]', 'And the rivers ran red with the blood of innocents...', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Delirium/DEL_04.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[441]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5757, 'DeliriumVoiceEventThree', '[]', 'You are being followed...', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Delirium/DEL_05.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[441]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5758, 'DeliriumVoiceEventFour', '[]', 'Fear controls you.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Delirium/DEL_06.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[441]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5759, 'DeliriumVoiceEventFive', '[]', 'You are completely alone.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Delirium/DEL_07.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[441]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5760, 'DeliriumVoiceEventSix', '[]', 'Guilt is weighing you down.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Delirium/DEL_08.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[441]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5761, 'DeliriumVoiceEventSeven', '[]', 'No one will remember you.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Delirium/DEL_09.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[441]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5762, 'DeliriumVoiceEventEight', '[]', 'Time is an illusion.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Delirium/DEL_10.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[441]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5763, 'DeliriumVoiceEventNine', '[]', 'This world is an illusion.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Delirium/DEL_11.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[441]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5764, 'DeliriumVoiceEventTen', '[]', 'Your greed will be your downfall.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Delirium/DEL_12.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[441]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5765, 'DeliriumVoiceEventEleven', '[]', 'Your actions serve no one.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Delirium/DEL_13.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[441]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5766, 'DeliriumVoiceEventTwelve', '[]', 'You are your own worst enemy.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Delirium/DEL_14.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[441]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5767, 'DeliriumVoiceEventThirteen', '[]', 'Rich and poor alike are destined to rot.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Delirium/DEL_15.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[441]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5768, 'DeliriumVoiceArea1-', '[]', 'Farewell Innocence, and hello, my agent of anarchy. It appears I''ve returned just in time for the party...', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Delirium/DEL_16.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[441]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5769, 'DeliriumVoiceArea2-', '[]', 'I know you can hear me, exile. You''re not mad... not yet...', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Delirium/DEL_17.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[441]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5770, 'DeliriumVoiceArea3-', '[]', 'What magnificent monuments to mortal absurdity. Yet it is somehow... aspirational.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Delirium/DEL_18.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[441]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5771, 'DeliriumVoiceArea4-', '[]', 'If only you knew what this place truly hides...', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Delirium/DEL_19.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[441]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5772, 'DeliriumVoiceArea5-', '[]', 'Flames and madness. I''m so glad I didn''t miss the fun.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Delirium/DEL_20.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[441]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5773, 'DeliriumVoiceArea6-', '[]', 'One person''s beginning is another''s end. I wonder what your end will begin...', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Delirium/DEL_21.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[441]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5774, 'DeliriumVoiceArea7-', '[]', 'Death still crashes upon the sands. But who are these new inhabitants?', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Delirium/DEL_22.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[441]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5775, 'DeliriumVoiceArea8-', '[]', 'Feel compelled to stride beneath the waves? Perhaps you should.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Delirium/DEL_23.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[441]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5776, 'DeliriumVoiceArea9-', '[]', 'The God of War has reshaped this region. He''s always been... unimaginative.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Delirium/DEL_24.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[441]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5777, 'DeliriumVoiceArea10-', '[]', 'Tukohama is expecting you... Don''t keep him waiting.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Delirium/DEL_25.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[441]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5778, 'DeliriumVoiceArea11-', '[]', 'New paths lead to new nightmares.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Delirium/DEL_26.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[441]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5779, 'DeliriumVoiceArea12-', '[]', 'Are you any more free than the bones trapped down here? Or are you caught in a prison of a different kind?', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Delirium/DEL_27.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[441]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5780, 'DeliriumVoiceArea13-', '[]', 'Climb to great heights, only to leap... You feel the temptation, do you not?', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Delirium/DEL_28.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[441]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5781, 'DeliriumVoiceArea14-', '[]', 'The Soul Drinker... Abberath awaits...', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Delirium/DEL_29.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[441]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5782, 'DeliriumVoiceArea15-', '[]', 'The Puppet Mistress is calling your name...', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Delirium/DEL_30.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[441]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5783, 'DeliriumVoiceArea16-', '[]', 'Can you hear it, Exile? Madness approaches.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Delirium/DEL_31.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[441]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5784, 'DeliriumVoiceArea17-', '[]', 'Life would be so much simpler if you accepted Ryslatha''s offer...', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Delirium/DEL_32.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[441]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5785, 'DeliriumVoiceArea18-', '[]', 'Salt on the wind... The river sours. The King has returned.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Delirium/DEL_33.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[441]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5786, 'DeliriumVoiceArea19-', '[]', 'Are you being led into a trap?', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Delirium/DEL_34.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[441]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5787, 'DeliriumVoiceArea20-', '[]', 'He calls to you from beyond the horizon...', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Delirium/DEL_35.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[441]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5788, 'DeliriumVoiceArea21-', '[]', 'The Lord of Salt and Sea shall set you free... Well, your soul anyway.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Delirium/DEL_36.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[441]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5789, 'DeliriumVoiceArea22-', '[]', 'All these rotten rattlers were brought down by your hand. Will they return the favour?', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Delirium/DEL_37.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[441]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5790, 'DeliriumVoiceArea23-', '[]', 'It was madness which strangled this place. You can feel it, can''t you?', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Delirium/DEL_38.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[441]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5791, 'DeliriumVoiceArea24-', '[]', 'Look what faith does. Ignore not this lesson.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Delirium/DEL_39.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[441]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5792, 'DeliriumVoiceArea25-', '[]', 'Noplace better to hide your heresy than right beneath the bishop''s nose...', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Delirium/DEL_40.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[441]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5793, 'DeliriumVoiceArea26-', '[]', 'Skill bound by logic built this grim sanctuary. Madness tore it down.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Delirium/DEL_41.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[441]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5794, 'DeliriumVoiceArea27-', '[]', 'Such magnificent talent. And you wish to ruin it...', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Delirium/DEL_42.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[441]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5795, 'DeliriumVoiceArea28-', '[]', 'Deeper still, Exile. Deeper still.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Delirium/DEL_43.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[441]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5796, 'DeliriumVoiceArea29-', '[]', 'The walls are closing in...', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Delirium/DEL_44.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[441]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5797, 'DeliriumVoiceArea30-', '[]', 'Ralakesh... My brother has been busy, hasn''t he...', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Delirium/DEL_45.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[441]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5798, 'DeliriumVoiceArea31-', '[]', 'Can you feel it? Despair, thick as cloth.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Delirium/DEL_46.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[441]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5799, 'DeliriumVoiceArea32-', '[]', 'Gruthkul got a lot less fun after, you know, all her children died. Not my fault.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Delirium/DEL_47C.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[441]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5800, 'DeliriumVoiceArea33-', '[]', 'Great works require a touch of insanity.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Delirium/DEL_48.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[441]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5801, 'DeliriumVoiceArea34-', '[]', 'An entire civilization caught in a blood-hungry frenzy. What a delight it was to witness.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Delirium/DEL_49.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[441]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5802, 'DeliriumVoiceArea35-', '[]', 'The Mother of Shadows makes herself known.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Delirium/DEL_50.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[441]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5803, 'DeliriumVoiceArea36-', '[]', 'Nice of you to help rid Sin of his former lover. I''d have told him exactly where he could put such a request.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Delirium/DEL_51C.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[441]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5804, 'DeliriumVoiceArea37-', '[]', 'What were such large walls trying to keep out? Or... keep in...?', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Delirium/DEL_52.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[441]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5805, 'DeliriumVoiceArea38-', '[]', 'Take a deep breath, Exile. That is the smell of civilised society.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Delirium/DEL_53.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[441]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5806, 'DeliriumVoiceArea39-', '[]', 'Why do mortals insist on burying all the fun things?', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Delirium/DEL_54.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[441]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5807, 'DeliriumVoiceArea40-', '[]', 'My greatest regret is not being there to witness the bedlam that led to the state of this city.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Delirium/DEL_55.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[441]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5808, 'DeliriumVoiceArea41-', '[]', 'Run through your tunnels, ugly little rat! Pick up your scraps! Beware of the cat!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Delirium/DEL_56.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[441]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5809, 'DeliriumVoiceArea42-', '[]', 'This looks like a lovely spot to lay down and die, Exile.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Delirium/DEL_57.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[441]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5810, 'DeliriumVoiceArea43-', '[]', 'Oh, this brings back memories. Solaris was not so gaudy when I knew her.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Delirium/DEL_58.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[441]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5811, 'DeliriumVoiceArea44-', '[]', 'They used to be so close, you know... The Celestial Sisters.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Delirium/DEL_59.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[441]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5812, 'DeliriumVoiceArea45-', '[]', 'Such grand monuments built to honour a petty hot-head.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Delirium/DEL_60.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[441]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5813, 'DeliriumVoiceArea46-', '[]', 'Parade your victories, hide your defeats. Mortals are so insecure.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Delirium/DEL_61.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[441]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5814, 'DeliriumVoiceArea47-', '[]', 'That little creep is near. How exciting.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Delirium/DEL_62.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[441]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5815, 'DeliriumVoiceArea48-', '[]', 'Yugul, the silver terror. Now we shall see what you''re made of, Exile.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Delirium/DEL_63.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[441]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5816, 'DeliriumVoiceArea49-', '[]', 'I''d not have wasted so much stone on these sisters.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Delirium/DEL_64.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[441]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5817, 'DeliriumVoiceArea50-', '[]', 'Lunaris was always the moody one.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Delirium/DEL_65.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[441]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5818, 'DeliriumVoiceArea51-', '[]', 'It wasn''t hard to turn them against each other. A little nudge here and there. That''s all it took.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Delirium/DEL_66.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[441]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5819, 'DeliriumVoiceArea52-', '[]', 'You wish to fight the very skies themselves. Win or lose, this will be a pleasure to see.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Delirium/DEL_67.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[441]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5820, 'DeliriumVoiceArea53-', '[]', 'Take a sip. What''s the worst that could happen?', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Delirium/DEL_68.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[441]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5821, 'DeliriumVoiceArea54-', '[]', 'You''re quite the slaughterer. Should I be wary of you?', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Delirium/DEL_69B.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[441]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5822, 'DeliriumVoiceArea55-', '[]', 'Savour the sand that stings your face. It is a reminder that I still let you live.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Delirium/DEL_70.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[441]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5823, 'DeliriumVoiceArea56-', '[]', 'You cannot slay gods. Gods are immortal. Do you question what you are told?', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Delirium/DEL_71B.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[441]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5824, 'DeliriumVoiceArea57-', '[]', 'Sin is sending you to slay his daughter now, too? You''d think he would be more upset...', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Delirium/DEL_72.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[441]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5825, 'DeliriumVoiceArea58-', '[]', 'Why do you believe Sin can be trusted?', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Delirium/DEL_73.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[441]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5826, 'DeliriumVoiceArea59-', '[]', 'It was Sin''s creation that brought about Wraeclast''s ruin. We are simply here to restore it.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Delirium/DEL_74.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[441]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5827, 'DeliriumVoiceArea60-', '[]', 'Garukhan nests near. What I wouldn''t give to relive the halcyon days of ancient Keth, when we kept mortals in their rightful place.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Delirium/DEL_75C.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[441]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5828, 'DeliriumVoiceArea61-', '[]', 'Technology is a poor substitute for power.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Delirium/DEL_76B.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[441]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5829, 'DeliriumVoiceArea62-', '[]', 'I will not miss this thing''s strangling slumber.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Delirium/DEL_77C.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[441]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5830, 'DeliriumVoiceArea63-', '[]', 'The smell is bad, but the tenants are worse...', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Delirium/DEL_78A.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[441]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5831, 'DeliriumVoiceArea64-', '[]', 'Once more into the bleeding heart of fury and depravity.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Delirium/DEL_79.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[441]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5832, 'DeliriumVoiceArea65-', '[]', 'You seek to end the madness, yet you were its herald. It was you who allowed Kitava''s return.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Delirium/DEL_80.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[441]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5833, 'DeliriumVoiceArea66-', '[]', 'Faith is born in the strangest of places.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Delirium/DEL_81.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[441]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5834, 'DeliriumVoiceArea67-', '[]', 'Such fine trinkets show their true value in times of crisis.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Delirium/DEL_82.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[441]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5835, 'DeliriumVoiceArea68-', '[]', 'Order is ephemeral. Chaos is the natural state of things.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Delirium/DEL_83.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[441]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5836, 'DeliriumVoiceArea69-', '[]', 'Nothing shatters sanity quite like blind faith.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Delirium/DEL_84.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[441]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5837, 'DeliriumVoiceArea70-', '[]', 'How deep do the dead dwell? How many will stand atop your own bones?', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Delirium/DEL_85.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[441]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5838, 'DeliriumVoiceArea71-', '[]', 'Kitava will welcome you with open jaws.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Delirium/DEL_86C.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[441]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5839, 'DeliriumVoiceArea72-', '[]', 'You walk through the corridors of madness and into the mouth of death itself. I do believe you have finally lost your mind.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Delirium/DEL_87C.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[441]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5840, 'DeliriumVoiceRandomRandom', '[]', 'Your tolerance of the intolerable is admirable.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Delirium/DEL_88.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[441]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5841, 'DeliriumVoiceRandom2', '[]', 'What will be the straw that finally breaks you? I will find it.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Delirium/DEL_89.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[441]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5842, 'DeliriumVoiceRandom3', '[]', 'I will never stop searching for that which sends you spiralling into the abyss.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Delirium/DEL_90.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[441]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5843, 'DeliriumVoiceRandom4', '[]', 'You cannot stop death.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Delirium/DEL_92.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[441]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5844, 'DeliriumVoiceRandom5', '[]', 'Your life will end, and you will be forgotten.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Delirium/DEL_93.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[441]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5845, 'DeliriumVoiceRandom6', '[]', 'This is all in your head.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Delirium/DEL_94.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[441]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5846, 'DeliriumVoiceRandom7', '[]', 'This is all an illusion.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Delirium/DEL_95.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[441]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5847, 'DeliriumVoiceRandom8', '[]', 'Nothing you do will be remembered.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Delirium/DEL_96.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[441]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5848, 'DeliriumVoiceRandom9', '[]', 'They <i>{are} out to get you.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Delirium/DEL_97.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[441]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5849, 'DeliriumVoiceRandom10', '[]', 'They are plotting against you.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Delirium/DEL_98.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[441]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5850, 'DeliriumVoiceRandom11', '[]', 'You are the only one who matters.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Delirium/DEL_99.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[441]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5851, 'DeliriumVoiceRandom12', '[]', 'You are greater than a god. Untouchable.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Delirium/DEL_100.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[441]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5852, 'DeliriumVoiceRandom13', '[]', 'You have already done this before. You are caught in a loop.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Delirium/DEL_101.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[441]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5853, 'DeliriumVoiceRandom14', '[]', 'Your life will leave no trace.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Delirium/DEL_102.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[441]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5854, 'DeliriumVoiceRandom15', '[]', 'You will die alone and afraid.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Delirium/DEL_104.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[441]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5855, 'DeliriumVoiceRandom16', '[]', 'Everything you have done has only made things worse.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Delirium/DEL_105.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[441]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5856, 'DeliriumVoiceRandom17', '[]', 'You will be remembered as a traitor and a tyrant.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Delirium/DEL_106.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[441]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5857, 'DeliriumVoiceRandom18', '[]', 'You are the cause of great misery.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Delirium/DEL_107.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[441]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5858, 'DeliriumVoiceRandom19', '[]', 'You have fabricated your entire memory.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Delirium/DEL_108.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[441]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5859, 'DeliriumVoiceRandom20', '[]', 'You are being controlled by greater forces.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Delirium/DEL_109.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[441]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5860, 'DeliriumVoiceRandom21', '[]', 'Nothing you have done was real.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Delirium/DEL_110.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[441]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5861, 'DeliriumVoiceRandom22', '[]', 'Your life has been one long lie.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Delirium/DEL_111.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[441]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5862, 'DeliriumVoiceRandom23', '[]', 'They are using you. Everyone is simply using you.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Delirium/DEL_112.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[441]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5863, 'DeliriumVoiceRandom24', '[]', 'You will never get that which you seek.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Delirium/DEL_114.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[441]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5864, 'DeliriumVoiceRandom25', '[]', 'They are getting closer. They will find you and they will destroy you.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Delirium/DEL_115.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[441]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5865, 'DeliriumVoiceRandom26', '[]', 'They know all your secrets. Nothing is hidden from their view.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Delirium/DEL_116.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[441]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5866, 'DeliriumVoiceRandom27', '[]', 'You have experienced no real pain. That will soon change.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Delirium/DEL_117.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[441]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5867, 'DeliriumVoiceRandom28', '[]', 'All suffering in this world stems from your actions.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Delirium/DEL_118.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[441]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5868, 'DeliriumVoiceRandom29', '[]', 'Feeling OK...? You''re looking a little pale, Exile...', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Delirium/DEL_119.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[441]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5869, 'DeliriumVoiceRandom30', '[]', 'Ohh, the weary traveler draws close to the end of its life!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Delirium/DEL_120.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[441]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5870, 'DeliriumVoiceRandom31', '[]', 'Still alive, exile? For now...', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Delirium/DEL_121.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[441]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5871, 'DeliriumVoiceRandom32', '[]', 'You are rotting from the inside out.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Delirium/DEL_122.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[441]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5872, 'DeliriumVoiceRandom33', '[]', 'Everyone you trust has been replaced by illusions. They are trying to get you.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Delirium/DEL_123.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[441]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5873, 'DeliriumVoiceRandom34', '[]', 'My lord, you are murdering innocent souls!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Delirium/DEL_124.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[441]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5874, 'DeliriumVoiceRandom35', '[]', 'Time is a veil. You exist in the singular eternity.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Delirium/DEL_125.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[441]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5875, 'DeliriumVoiceRandom36', '[]', 'You can never die. Why don''t you test it...?', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Delirium/DEL_126.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[441]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5876, 'DeliriumVoiceRandom37', '[]', 'The face that stares back in the mirror is a stranger.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Delirium/DEL_127.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[441]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5877, 'DeliriumVoiceRandom38', '[]', 'Why don''t you lay down your weapons and talk it over...?', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Delirium/DEL_128.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[441]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5878, 'DeliriumVoiceRandom39', '[]', 'You are destined to bring ruin to all you touch.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Delirium/DEL_130.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[441]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5879, 'DeliriumVoiceRandom40', '[]', 'They will all abandon you when they learn the truth.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Delirium/DEL_131.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[441]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5880, 'DeliriumVoiceRandom41', '[]', 'You will be captured, stupid beast.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Delirium/DEL_132.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[441]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5881, 'DeliriumVoiceRandom42', '[]', 'You are just another stumbling corpse.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Delirium/DEL_133.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[441]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5882, 'DeliriumVoiceRandom43', '[]', 'You are lost in the middle of the jungle.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Delirium/DEL_134.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[441]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5883, 'DeliriumVoiceRandom44', '[]', 'The unrighteous will be turned to ash.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Delirium/DEL_135.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[441]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5884, 'DeliriumVoiceRandom45', '[]', 'Still sane, exile?', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Delirium/DEL_136.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[441]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5885, 'DeliriumVoiceRandom46', '[]', 'They are watching you from beyond this world. Can you feel them?', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Delirium/DEL_137.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[441]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5886, 'DeliriumVoiceRandom47', '[]', 'They will turn you into red milk.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Delirium/DEL_138.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[441]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5887, 'DeliriumVoiceRandom48', '[]', 'No one knows your name. No one but me.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Delirium/DEL_139.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[441]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5888, 'DeliriumVoiceRandom49', '[]', 'You will never know my name.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Delirium/DEL_140.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[441]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5889, 'DeliriumVoiceRandom50', '[]', 'You are free to explore this vast world, yet here you are doing the bidding of others.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Delirium/DEL_141.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[441]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5890, 'DeliriumVoiceRandom51', '[]', 'Warriors far greater than you ever will be are long forgotten.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Delirium/DEL_142.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[441]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5891, 'DeliriumVoiceRandom52', '[]', 'You can''t leave this dream.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Delirium/DEL_143.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[441]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5892, 'DeliriumVoiceRandom53', '[]', 'You will never escape this nightmare.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Delirium/DEL_144.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[441]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5893, 'DeliriumVoiceRandom54', '[]', 'This is your eternity.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Delirium/DEL_145.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[441]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5894, 'DeliriumVoiceRandom55', '[]', 'True strength comes from within, and I know for a fact you are empty.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Delirium/DEL_146.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[441]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5895, 'DeliriumVoiceRandom56', '[]', 'Everyone you have slain had a life, had a family. Your turn will come one day.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Delirium/DEL_147.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[441]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5896, 'DeliriumVoiceRandom57', '[]', 'You destroy that which you cannot control.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Delirium/DEL_148.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[441]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5897, 'DeliriumVoiceRandom58', '[]', 'Are you the hunter or are you the prey?', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Delirium/DEL_149.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[441]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5898, 'DeliriumVoiceRandom59', '[]', 'Stupid dog, you are chasing your own tail.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Delirium/DEL_150.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[441]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5899, 'DeliriumVoiceRandom60', '[]', 'They''ve come to you to die. You are their mercy.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Delirium/DEL_154.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[441]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5900, 'DeliriumVoiceRandom61', '[]', 'Are you the fisherman or are you the bait?', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Delirium/DEL_155.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[441]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5901, 'DeliriumVoiceBoss1-', '[]', 'Can''t keep still...? Neither can he...', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Delirium/DEL_156.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[441]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5902, 'DeliriumVoiceBoss2-', '[]', 'Do you hear it? Your misery manifest now seeks you out.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Delirium/DEL_157.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[441]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5903, 'DeliriumVoiceBoss3-', '[]', 'Panic builds within you. You can feel it hunting you, can''t you?', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Delirium/DEL_158.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[441]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5904, 'DeliriumVoiceBoss4-', '[]', 'Your eyes do not deceive you. That demon has come for your head.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Delirium/DEL_159.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[441]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5905, 'DeliriumVoiceBoss5-', '[]', 'I wonder... what horrid visions will this being bring?', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Delirium/DEL_160.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[441]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5906, 'DeliriumVoiceBoss6-', '[]', 'Not dead yet? You''ll soon wish you were...', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Delirium/DEL_161.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[441]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5907, 'DeliriumVoiceBoss7-', '[]', 'Have you met my friend? He is so eager to meet you...', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Delirium/DEL_162.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[441]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5908, 'DeliriumVoiceBoss8-', '[]', 'It seems we have a visitor. Why don''t you welcome them?', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Delirium/DEL_163.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[441]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5909, 'DeliriumVoiceSimulacrum1-', '[]', 'Remember this ramshackle place? A second home... And yet, something seems off, does it not?', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Delirium/DEL_164.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[441]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5910, 'DeliriumVoiceSimulacrum2-', '[]', 'You''ve stood against so many horrors and survived. I think it is time to at last test your limits.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Delirium/DEL_165.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[441]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5911, 'DeliriumVoiceSimulacrum3-', '[]', 'This is only the beginning.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Delirium/DEL_166.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[441]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5912, 'DeliriumVoiceSimulacrum4-', '[]', 'Let yourself be drawn into the mire!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Delirium/DEL_173.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[441]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5913, 'DeliriumVoiceSimulacrum5-', '[]', 'Are you trying to cleanse yourself of me?', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Delirium/DEL_167.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[441]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5914, 'DeliriumVoiceSimulacrum6-', '[]', 'You can''t get rid of me, Exile. I am you.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Delirium/DEL_168.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[441]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5915, 'DeliriumVoiceSimulacrum7-', '[]', 'Nothing you do matters. The dream will end, and the dreamer will pass into the next world.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Delirium/DEL_169.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[441]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5916, 'DeliriumVoiceSimulacrum8-', '[]', 'Do you not wonder what tugs at the strings of fate? What stands astride the abyss and beckons you to fall?', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Delirium/DEL_170.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[441]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5917, 'DeliriumVoiceSimulacrum9-', '[]', 'Believe me, you will fall, Exile.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Delirium/DEL_171.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[441]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5918, 'DeliriumVoiceSimulacrum10-', '[]', 'I will break you.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Delirium/DEL_172.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[441]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5919, 'DeliriumVoiceSimulacrum11-', '[]', 'I will not be made the fool!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Delirium/DEL_174.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[441]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5920, 'DeliriumVoiceSimulacrum12-', '[]', 'So be it. Keep your precious sanity, my agent of chaos. You shall serve me, whether you like it or not. I''m not going anywhere...', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Delirium/DEL_175.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[441]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5921, 'DeliriumVoiceQuestState1-', '[]', 'Pleased with yourself? Feel all high and mighty, o powerful ''Godslayer?''', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Delirium/DEL_176.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[441]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5922, 'DeliriumVoiceQuestState2-', '[]', 'With all the gods dead, I suppose I should turn my full attention to you. We shall see how far you can be pushed.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Delirium/DEL_177.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[441]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5923, 'TutorialNPCBrutus', '[]', 'Well done on defeating Brutus.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
He was a strong foe. Powerful enemies will telegraph their attacks, rearing back to strike or summoning powerful magic. This shows they are about deal a lot of damage. It is good to learn their telegraph, so you can avoid the damage before it hits you.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Here is a reward that should help you on your journey.', '', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[327]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5924, 'TutorialNPCBuildAdvice', '[]', 'Everyone has different problems when they face enemies. To some people, enemies have high health. To others, some monsters deal lots of damage. Remember what you are strong at. Learn what you are weak at. It is good to review your equipment often, as you can change it to improve your weaknesses.', '', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[327]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5925, 'TutorialNPCResistAdvice', '[]', 'Most bosses focus on a single type of damage. It is good to review and change your equipment if you have trouble against a boss. Gear with powerful elemental resistance is valuable to keep. You can equip it later for dangerous bosses.', '', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[327]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5926, 'TutorialNPCOtherNPCs', '[]', 'I won''t always be around. It is good to talk to the others, as they will often need your help. They will offer rewards in exchange for your help with quests.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
You can also buy and sell items from some NPCs. It is good to check their items after quests. Some even offer old gems from quest rewards, or new gems you haven''t seen before.', '', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[327]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(5927, 'TutorialNPCPresetLeague', '[]', '[DNT] You can purchase a Preset League token from the ship to unlock additional rewards from me!', '', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[327]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
