(9145, 'MavenTier1AoE6', '[]', 'Crunch!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Maven/Maven_39_02_C.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[493]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(9146, 'MavenTier1AoE7', '[]', 'Pain!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Maven/Maven_39_03_A.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[493]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(9147, 'MavenTier1AoE8', '[]', 'Pain.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Maven/Maven_39_03_B.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[493]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(9148, 'MavenTier1AoE9', '[]', 'Pain.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Maven/Maven_39_03_C.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[493]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(9149, 'MavenTier1AoE10', '[]', 'Pain...', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Maven/Maven_39_03_D.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[493]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(9150, 'MavenTier1ProjectilesRandom', '[]', 'Dodge!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Maven/Maven_40_01_A.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[493]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(9151, 'MavenTier1Projectiles2', '[]', 'Dodge!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Maven/Maven_40_01_B.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[493]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(9152, 'MavenTier1Projectiles3', '[]', 'Dodge.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Maven/Maven_40_01_C.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[493]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(9153, 'MavenTier1Projectiles4', '[]', 'Dodge.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Maven/Maven_40_01_D.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[493]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(9154, 'MavenTier1Projectiles5', '[]', 'Dance!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Maven/Maven_40_02_A.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[493]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(9155, 'MavenTier1Projectiles6', '[]', 'Dance.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Maven/Maven_40_02_B.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[493]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(9156, 'MavenTier1Projectiles7', '[]', 'Dance!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Maven/Maven_40_02_C.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[493]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(9157, 'MavenTier1Projectiles8', '[]', 'Run!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Maven/Maven_40_03_A.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[493]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(9158, 'MavenTier1Projectiles9', '[]', 'Run!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Maven/Maven_40_03_B.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[493]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(9159, 'MavenTier1Projectiles10', '[]', 'Run!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Maven/Maven_40_03_C.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[493]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(9160, 'KiracOnTheEnvoy', '[]', 'This might sound naive, but any entity we run into out there that doesn''t immediately try to eat us or drive us insane is a win in my book. We need to learn all we can. Scrutinize every word The Envoy says. The fate of the world may one day hinge upon it.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Kirac/313Kirac_01.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[410,412]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(9161, 'KiracOnTheEnvoyPostMaven', '[]', 'You''ve driven away The Maven for the moment, but The Envoy is still around? That''s not a good sign. I assumed it served her, but if that isn''t true, then we may soon have a bigger problem on our hands...', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Kirac/313Kirac_02.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[410,412]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(9162, 'KiracOnTheMaven', '[]', 'Never trust floating women. I learned that the hard way in my second campaign, and the less said about that, the better. If The Maven is trying to communicate with you, learn what you can, but don''t let your guard down even for a moment.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Kirac/313Kirac_03.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[410,412]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(9163, 'KiracOnTheMavenPostBaranKilled', '[]', 'I''ve told you the job never ends, haven''t I? We''ll track down the Conquerors, we''ll face Sirus, and then we''ll figure out the mystery of this Maven entity as well. After that, we''ll have a drink, and then we''ll get right back to it when the next enemy of mankind appears. That''s what I''ve signed up for, and that''s what we''ll do.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Kirac/313Kirac_04.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[410,412]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(9164, 'KiracOnTheMavenPostMavenKilled', '[]', 'After all that, The Maven turns out to be a <i>{young} eldritch entity? I''ve seen many terrible things in my time, but this... I should be relieved. Instead, I''m filled with apprehension. If <i>{that} was a child, then what kind of powers do her elders possess? What happens when those cosmic fiends finally turn their countless eyes in <i>{our} direction? We are on a very dark path, Exile.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Kirac/313Kirac_05.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[410,412]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(9165, 'KiracOnBaranResurrection', '[]', 'You <i>{saw} Baran? How is that possible, if you slew him? Unless -' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
It''s The Maven. It has to be. She''s been recreating other powerful creatures of the Atlas for her own amusement. Of course she would do the same to my brother, given his notable strength. None of the creatures out there can challenge him, either, which means The Maven is resurrecting him to watch his fights with <i>{you}, and the Atlas is already the perfect battleground for such a show.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Keep her entertained, Exile. It will give us more time to learn about her. If we can play this right, then perhaps Baran can be saved after all.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Kirac/313Kirac_06.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[410,412]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(9166, 'KiracOnBaranResurrectionTwo', '[]', 'I was right. The Maven is capable of resurrecting Baran, and has been doing so to suit her whims. If she is the reason he cannot find peace, then we must either slay her, or convince her to let him go. In either case, we have a very long campaign ahead of us. Stay the course, Exile.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Kirac/313Kirac_07.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[410,412]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(9167, 'KiracOnBaranResurrectionThree', '[]', 'You''ve taught The Maven a lesson, but she has not been defeated, if we can ever truly defeat an entity like her. I''m not even certain we can communicate with her on a meaningful level, but I have to maintain hope. Keep playing her games, Exile. Maybe one day she will recognise you as a peer, and then perhaps we can ask her to give Baran back to us.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Kirac/313Kirac_08.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[410,412]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(9168, 'KiracToEyeOfTheStorm', '[]', 'Caeserius tells me that Sirus is on the verge of completing a map device. We should have counted on this happening once we prevented the Conquerors from interfering with each other.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
The device''s growing energy has given away the location of a secret citadel hidden within a tremendous storm. Caeserius can get us inside, and, from tracking your encounters with Sirus, I happen to know he isn''t currently there. If we can get to his map device and destroy it before he can use it, we might just finish this before it begins.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
The world is at stake once again. Danger be damned! We''re both going with you. If this is the last time we speak, it has been an honour.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Kirac/313Kirac_09.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[410,412]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(9169, 'KiracOnSirusLives', '[]', 'Sirus <i>{lives?} I would imagine Caeserius is overjoyed, unless he''s as mad as the rest of the Conquerors. I''ll keep track of your encounters with him. Maybe we''ll be able to figure out where he''s been hiding.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Kirac/313Kirac_10.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[410,412]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(9170, 'KiracOnSirusLivesTwo', '[]', 'If my brother spent his last words warning us against Sirus, then he must truly pose a tremendous threat. I hadn''t even considered what his storms could do to mankind if they were ravaging Wraeclast instead of the Atlas...', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Kirac/313Kirac_11.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[410,412]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(9171, 'KiracOnAtlasAwakening', '[]', 'There''s something happening to the Atlas, Exile. When you socketed the fourth Watchstone in a Citadel, something responded. A storm on the horizon... a creek becomes a river... I''m not a man of metaphor, but I don''t know how else to describe the crackling feeling of power on the wind. If the Atlas is a sleeping giant, our unknown force out there is slowly waking it.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Kirac/313Kirac_12.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[410,412]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(9172, 'KiracOnUnknownAwakener', '[]', 'While you''ve been tracking the Conquerors, I''ve continually noticed swaths of devastation left by a force unknown. The land reshapes and awakens with riotous power afterwards, so I thought it might simply be a property of the Atlas, but now I see there''s a pattern: a storm. There''s a storm somewhere out there, massive beyond anything we''ve ever seen, and roaring with enough force to disintegrate anything in its path. That storm... I''d bet my eye we''ll find our enigmatic Awakener right at the center.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Kirac/313Kirac_13.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[410,412]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(9173, 'KiracOnSirusDead', '[]', 'Was he an evil man? I think on it when I''m trying to sleep at night, because it seems the wound he gave me will never fully heal. It itches like rabid mudflies, damn latent disintegration eating away at me about the same speed as the skin naturally grows back...' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Oh, but Sirus. I can''t imagine being abandoned in darkness for a subjective eternity. I also can''t imagine becoming so hollow that I would attack people I loved. I suppose, in the end, it doesn''t matter. We did what we had to do... and we will again, when the time comes.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Kirac/313Kirac_14.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[410,412]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(9174, 'KiracOnNiko', '[]', 'He''s loyal, but unsuitable for duty, for obvious reasons. Sometimes wish I had a hat with a light on it myself. I tend to stumble in the night on the way to the latrine. But perhaps it''s best I not risk my one good eye with an open flame.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Kirac/313Kirac_15.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[410,412]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(9175, 'KiracOnNavali', '[]', 'Navali is dead, as I understand it. Or somewhere between life and death. I asked her if Hinekora could save Baran by doing the same for him, and Navali... she spoke with anger for the first and only time I''ve ever heard. One word: <i>{fool!}' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
It never occurred to me that her endless living death might be... painful.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Kirac/313Kirac_16.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[410,412]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(9176, 'KiracOnJun', '[]', 'That one''s a bottled up flask of rage, if I''ve ever seen it. I''ve known some good men who''ve suffered the same. When certain things happen to a soldier on the campaign trail, he returns home changed. Civilians will never understand. Let her work through her pain and revenge before we ask her to help us with the Conquerors.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Kirac/313Kirac_17.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[410,412]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(9177, 'KiracOnHelena', '[]', 'Never trusted a Blackguard in my life. Reformed or not. Never have, never will. That bastard Gravicius and his psychotic disciple Cameria... but I suppose I shouldn''t blame Helena for that. Just rankles me that he''s still got my eye.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Kirac/313Kirac_18.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[410,412]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(9178, 'KiracOnEinhar', '[]', 'Being a tracker myself, I''m no stranger to the hunt, but him - he embodies the hunt, and nothing else. I tried to ask for his aid in chasing down the Conquerors, but it was impossible to get a straight answer out of him. I was given the distinct impression that he encounters them regularly while cavorting out in the wilds. He thinks... <i>{very highly} of each of them... even Sirus. I can''t imagine what the two of them would even say to each other.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Kirac/313Kirac_19.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[410,412]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(9179, 'KiracOnCassia', '[]', 'She''s beautiful - I''m one-eyed, not blind - but she''s <i>{far} too intense. I worked with her once before, tangentially, when on the campaign for the Templars. Not that she''d remember. Too wrapped up in her God and her work. We soldiers did the dying, and she gave the credit to the divine. Wish I could get her damn songs out of my head.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Kirac/313Kirac_20.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[410,412]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(9180, 'KiracConquerorsCannotSpawn', '[]', 'The trail has gone cold, exile. The Conquerors seek the Watchstones, but we''ve defended certain territories too well. Try placing a few Watchstones in regions we''ve investigated less thoroughly to draw them out. Use their agenda against them.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Kirac/313Kirac_21.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[410,412]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(9181, 'KiracSpawnConquerorsAdvice', '[]', 'In order to draw out our quarry, we need to tempt them with bait. The Conquerors seek the Watchstones, so let''s give them the opportunity to get what they want. Place a few Watchstones in an open Citadel to draw their attention. When they leave hiding, we''ll pick up their trails.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Kirac/313Kirac_22.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[410,412]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(9182, 'KiracAdvisingWatchstone0', '[]', 'We don''t know much about that region yet, Exile. Let''s do some exploration.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Kirac/313Kirac_23_A.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[410,412]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(9183, 'KiracAdvisingWatchstone1', '[]', 'We''re going to need at least one Watchstone in that region''s Citadel to draw out a Conqueror.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Kirac/313Kirac_23_B.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[410,412]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(9184, 'KiracAdvisingWatchstone2', '[]', 'They''re wary of us. We''re going to need at least two Watchstones in that region''s Citadel to draw out a Conqueror.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Kirac/313Kirac_23_C.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[410,412]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(9185, 'KiracAdvisingWatchstone3', '[]', 'They''ve caught on to the hunt. We''re going to need at least three Watchstones in that region''s Citadel to tempt one of the Conquerors out of hiding.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Kirac/313Kirac_23_D.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[410,412]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(9186, 'KiracAdvisingWatchstone4', '[]', 'They know it''s a fight to the death now, Exile. We''re going to need at least four Watchstones in that region''s Citadel to force them to make a move.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Kirac/313Kirac_23_E.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[410,412]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(9187, 'KiracAdvisingLexProxima', '[]', 'I''ve seen hints of a trail in Lex Proxima.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Kirac/313Kirac_24_A.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[410,412]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(9188, 'KiracAdvisingTirnsEnd', '[]', 'A gut feeling tells me we should search Tirn''s End.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Kirac/313Kirac_24_B.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[410,412]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(9189, 'KiracAdvisingGlennachCairns', '[]', 'We probably need to investigate Glennach Cairns.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Kirac/313Kirac_24_C.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[410,412]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(9190, 'KiracAdvisingValdosRest', '[]', 'Caeserius might not like this, but we''re going to need to tread through Valdo''s Rest.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Kirac/313Kirac_24_D.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[410,412]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(9191, 'KiracAdvisingLexEjoris', '[]', 'Lex Ejoris has shown signs of enemy activity.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Kirac/313Kirac_24_E.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[410,412]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(9192, 'KiracAdvisingHaewarkHamlet', '[]', 'Haewark Hamlet seems to be playing host to our quarry.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Kirac/313Kirac_24_F.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[410,412]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(9193, 'KiracAdvisingNewVastir', '[]', 'New Vastir''s routes have been recently traveled by someone other than us.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Kirac/313Kirac_24_G.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[410,412]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(9194, 'KiracAdvisingLiraArthain', '[]', 'Lira Arthain is a refuge for a Conqueror. I''m certain of it.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Kirac/313Kirac_24_H.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[410,412]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(9195, 'ZanaOnTheMaven', '[]', 'There are two sources of entities within the Atlas that I know of, and I''m certain no one has entered from this side. ' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Whatever that thing is, it has come from somewhere beyond the Atlas; some unknown parallel realm. It is entirely possible it has the same provenance as The Elder, though I desperately hope not. We simply don''t have the tools to seal away another such creature.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Perhaps we''re lucky. Perhaps we are too insignificant for it to take notice of us. We are on a small island of safety for the time being, but the waters are rising, and strange new things are beginning to wash ashore. Be careful, Exile. We know not what we are dealing with, and we should all fear the unknown.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Zana/313Zana_01.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[306,307,133]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(9196, 'ZanaOnTheMavenPostSirus', '[]', 'I hope you know what you''re doing, Exile. We don''t have the tools we need to seal away another creature like The Elder, or even begin constructing anything like the Cosmic Arcana. We barely have what we need to get by day to day. ' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
If that... that <i>{thing} were to turn its gaze towards us, toward our home... We have no idea what it is capable of, or what it wants. Not really.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Zana/313Zana_02.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[306,307,133]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(9197, 'ZanaOnGettingMapDeviceAugment', '[]', 'I''ve never seen anything quite like it. It''s clearly mechanical in part, almost like the map device itself. But there''s an energy that swirls within it that fills me with dread. It''s reminiscent of The Elder, but there''s something less malignant, less in-control about it.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
I''d find some way to destroy it if I were you. The forces of the Atlas are not to be trifled with. They are beyond any reason or sense. They are chaotic, and you cannot expect to be able to wield chaos without it turning on you. I fear no good can come of this.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Zana/313Zana_03.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[306,307,133]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(9198, 'ZanaOnMapDeviceAugmented', '[]', 'Do you have any idea what you''ve just done?! Because I don''t, and we are meant to be cooperating! ' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
How do you know this isn''t some sort of scrying orb designed to allow that entity to peer into our realm, or even pass into it uncontested? Or perhaps it will simply turn you into dust when you next attempt to journey into the Atlas! You''re playing with tools you have no comprehension of, Exile. You''re following in the footsteps of my father and Venarius when they released The Elder. ' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
I want to work with you, for the sake of Wraeclast''s safety, but... I can''t help but question your judgement right now.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Zana/313Zana_04.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[306,307,133]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(9199, 'ZanaMissionMetamorph', '[]', 'Tane, a young but ambitious friend of mine, is researching manifestations of what he calls the intrinsic darkness, some primordial essence of ill intent that he believes pervades every living creature. I''d like you to help him source samples to further his research.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
He''s waiting for you on the other side of those portals.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Zana/313Zana_05.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[125]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(9200, 'ZanaMissionDelirium', '[]', 'I''m picking up a presence that, well, I just don''t have any explanation for. It''s not unlike that left in the wake of the Elderslayers, but it''s... indistinct. I''ve tried to find a source, but it''s as if it is concentrated one moment and everywhere the next. Just as I think I''m making progress, something changes. It''s maddening.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
I''m hoping you will have better luck. Look for something -- <i>{anything} -- out of the ordinary.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Zana/313Zana_06.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[125]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(9201, 'ZanaMissionHarvest', '[]', 'I''ve found something highly unusual. Plants supported by mechanisms that are remarkably similar in style to the kind employed by modern-day Oriathans. It seems someone has been carefully maintaining a crop of some kind, though not one likely to whet the appetite. ' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Please investigate this strange garden, and be wary of its fruits.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Zana/313Zana_07.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[125]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(9202, 'ZanaMissionBlightedMap', '[]', 'Sister Cassia has alerted me to a fungal growth that seems to have completely taken over a landmass of some significance. I''ll send you her way. She''s got her pump set up, but needs someone combat-capable to help hold back the fungal defenders.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Zana/313Zana_08.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[125]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(9203, 'ZanaMissionBlight', '[]', 'I''m sending you to a location that shows signs of a malign fungal infestation. Sister Cassia is already there, and setting up her equipment. I need you to help her exterminate the Blight before it can spread and infect other regions of the Atlas. Cassia can provide more information, should you need it.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Zana/313Zana_09.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[125]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(9204, 'ZanaPleadsWithSirus', '[]', 'Sirus, please, stop! You''re not well! Please, let us help!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Zana/313Zana_10.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[125]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(9205, 'ZanaOnSirusDeath', '[]', 'The man Sirus was and the entity that destroyed our homes are night and day. Whatever happened to him in the wake of The Elder''s sealing stole the very essence of his being. When Sirus returned, he returned incomplete, missing that vital essence.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Not long ago I might''ve held hope that we''d find that piece out there, that the true Sirus might be drifting through the Atlas, waiting for us to find him and bring him home. ' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
I know better now than to hope. Perhaps the Atlas has eroded that part of me, as well.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Zana/313Zana_11.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[306,307,133]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(9206, 'ZanaOnKiracTwo', '[]', 'Kirac is fixated on saving Baran, and I can''t blame him. I''ve been in his shoes. I know the desperation and powerlessness that comes from losing a loved one out there. It''s why he works tirelessly to track the movements of the Elderslayers. It''s why we keep plunging headlong into that mad place. For Kirac''s sake, I hope we do save Baran.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Zana/313Zana_12.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[306,307,133]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(9207, 'ZanaOnKiracThree', '[]', 'Kirac blames me for Baran''s affliction. Maybe he''s right. I led these people into the Atlas. I put them in the path of The Elder. But he can''t yet understand the importance of our mission - not really. He didn''t see what the Elder was capable of. He doesn''t know the fate worse than death that would have befallen our entire world were it not for our sacrifice. Were it not for... Sirus'' sacrifice. Kirac will come around in time. Perhaps even Sirus will, as well.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Zana/313Zana_13.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[306,307,133]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(9208, 'ZanaOnKiracFour', '[]', 'Sirus attempted to kill me, and were it not for Kirac''s quick thinking and selflessness, he would have succeeded. That beam carried a unique type of disintegrating energy I still can''t identify or heal... I don''t know why Kirac did what he did, but just as he will remain forever scarred, I will remain forever grateful.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
With Oriath now in ruins, it seems I''m off the hook in the eyes of the Citizen Vanguard as well. Perhaps Kirac vouched for me, or perhaps they simply have their hands full with other things. Either way, it''s one small relief amongst a mountain of new worries... but it is something.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Zana/313Zana_14.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[306,307,133]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(9209, 'ZanaToTheEyeOfTheStorm', '[]', 'Exile, this is urgent. While you were gone, our Map Device began acting strangely. Vibrating, humming, aligning its gears as though being tugged by invisible strings. I fear I know the cause...' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
There''s an enormous storm at the heart of the Atlas that has masked all information in that region since Sirus'' return. Sirus wants to escape, and he may have found a way. A Map Device of his own creation, built inside the Atlas, for a journey back to Wraeclast. That''s the only possible explanation for our own Map Device''s erratic movements. Even that storm wouldn''t be able to diffuse the energies of another Device.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
We must hurry, Exile. If Sirus makes it back to Oriath... Gods... We must destroy that device, or all is lost.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Zana/313Zana_15.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[306,307,133]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
