(12184, 'GwennenIntroWitch', '[1]', 'Now that we''ve a chance to talk without explosives and monsters around us... I''m Gwennen. Luck is my game. But it''s no game. It''s deadly serious. You have to believe you''re going to win, or you won''t. That''s the nature of this life, understand? It is what you make of it. So when you gamble with me, know that it''s your fault if you lose. You just didn''t believe hard enough.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Gwennen/Gwennen_15.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[512,520,516]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(12185, 'GwennenIntroScion', '[2]', 'Now that we''ve a chance to talk without explosives and monsters around us... I''m Gwennen. Luck is my game. But it''s no game. It''s deadly serious. You have to believe you''re going to win, or you won''t. That''s the nature of this life, understand? It is what you make of it. So when you gamble with me, know that it''s your fault if you lose. You just didn''t believe hard enough.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Gwennen/Gwennen_15.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[512,520,516]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(12186, 'GwennenIntroRanger', '[3]', 'You''re a woman of ironclad determination. I can tell. I''m Gwennen. I''ve got something I fervently believe in as well, but my religion is luck. I''ve run headlong into danger because it was what <i>{I} wanted to do, any orders be damned, and I bet it''s the same for you. When your actions and beliefs align, you can do anything. Even win at gambling. Which I bet you''ll do. Care to try your luck?', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Gwennen/Gwennen_17.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[512,520,516]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(12187, 'GwennenIntroDuelist', '[4]', 'Now that we''ve a chance to talk without explosives and monsters around us... I''m Gwennen. Luck is my game. But it''s no game. It''s deadly serious. You have to believe you''re going to win, or you won''t. That''s the nature of this life, understand? It is what you make of it. So when you gamble with me, know that it''s your fault if you lose. You just didn''t believe hard enough.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Gwennen/Gwennen_15.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[512,520,516]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(12188, 'GwennenIntroShadow', '[5]', 'Now that we''ve a chance to talk without explosives and monsters around us... I''m Gwennen. Luck is my game. But it''s no game. It''s deadly serious. You have to believe you''re going to win, or you won''t. That''s the nature of this life, understand? It is what you make of it. So when you gamble with me, know that it''s your fault if you lose. You just didn''t believe hard enough.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Gwennen/Gwennen_15.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[512,520,516]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(12189, 'GwennenIntroTemplar', '[6]', 'I can recognise a man of faith on any continent. I''m Gwennen. I''m dedicated to a cause, like you, but my religion is luck. I''ve gotten through deadly situations I had no right surviving simply because I <i>{knew} I would. I assume it''s the same for you and your prayers. This life is what we make of it. I bet I''m going to lose on our transactions, since you''re going to pray while you gamble. I don''t consider it cheating. I consider it admirable. We''ll get on just fine.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Gwennen/Gwennen_16.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[512,520,516]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(12190, 'GwennenIntroMarauder', '[0]', 'Now that we''ve a chance to talk without explosives and monsters around us... I''m Gwennen. Luck is my game. But it''s no game. It''s deadly serious. You have to believe you''re going to win, or you won''t. That''s the nature of this life, understand? It is what you make of it. So when you gamble with me, know that it''s your fault if you lose. You just didn''t believe hard enough.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Gwennen/Gwennen_15.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[512,520,516]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
