(12466, 'TujenCounterOfferRemainsSame8', '[]', 'I''ll not go lower!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Tujen/Tujen_41_04_02.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[513,517,521]', 20, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(12467, 'TujenPlayerCannotCarryRandom', '[]', 'You''re going to need to make space first.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Tujen/Tujen_42_01_01.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[513,517,521]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(12468, 'TujenPlayerCannotCarry2', '[]', 'You''re going to need to make space first.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Tujen/Tujen_42_01_02.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[513,517,521]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(12469, 'TujenPlayerCannotCarry3', '[]', 'You can''t even carry this!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Tujen/Tujen_42_02_01.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[513,517,521]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(12470, 'TujenPlayerCannotCarry4', '[]', 'You can''t even carry this!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Tujen/Tujen_42_02_02.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[513,517,521]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(12471, 'TujenPlayerCannotAffordRandom', '[]', 'You don''t have enough to pay for that!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Tujen/Tujen_43_01_01.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[513,517,521]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(12472, 'TujenPlayerCannotAfford2', '[]', 'You don''t have enough to pay for that!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Tujen/Tujen_43_01_02.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[513,517,521]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(12473, 'TujenPlayerCannotAfford3', '[]', 'You''re offering more than you have!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Tujen/Tujen_43_02_01.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[513,517,521]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(12474, 'TujenPlayerCannotAfford4', '[]', 'You''re offering more than you have!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Tujen/Tujen_43_02_02.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[513,517,521]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(12475, 'TujenGossipBlackScytheMercenaries', '[]', 'I''m of a particular purpose, see? I''m scratching up the ground in search of an ancient rowdy band. They were called the Black Scythe Mercenaries. Their founder, a particularly heroic warrior by the name of Vorana, shares ties to my bloodline. Before I can go home, I need to find out what happened to her.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Tujen/Tujen_44.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[513,517,521]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(12476, 'TujenGossipVorana', '[]', 'She was a fearsome and irrepressible warrior. King Cadigan the Third tried to mandate her service to the Crown, but she laid flat every man sent to bring her in. Eventually, he realised that she couldn''t <i>{be} controlled, and he gave her a Mercenary Charter instead. Given the freedom to operate the way she wanted, she won many great victories for the Kalguur. I respect those who make their own way.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Her fate here on Wraeclast was unknown, but I have a feeling she''s still kicking about. A burning spirit like that never goes down without a legendary fight.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Tujen/Tujen_45.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[513,517,521]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(12477, 'TujenGossipRog', '[]', 'Many a campaign would have failed if not for his logistical skills. We''ve trekked through mud, rain, snow, and sand, and yet eaten heartily throughout. It''s the true basis of war, mind you. Logistics. Don''t think we don''t know that.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Tujen/Tujen_46.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[513,517,521]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(12478, 'TujenGossipGwennen', '[]', 'She''s a distant cousin of mine, so I do what I can to protect her. Got some weird ideas about the world, though. Thinks belief can shape events. If it could, we wouldn''t have been defeated during... our last campaign.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Tujen/Tujen_47.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[513,517,521]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(12479, 'TujenGossipDannig', '[]', 'He''s a good man. A man of two worlds. Part aspiring dreamer, part cynical realist. I''ll follow him to the ends of the world, which you know, because I already have... and here we are.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Tujen/Tujen_48.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[513,517,521]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(12480, 'TujenGossipTheKalguur', '[]', 'We are a proud people, but aren''t they all? Difference is, we labour against the grim realities of life through the judicious application of bravery and courage. One''s lineage carries an ongoing tally of renown and accomplishment. We do this not for ourselves, but for our children, should we one day have ''em. Here''s hopin''.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Tujen/Tujen_49.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[513,517,521]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(12481, 'TujenGossipTheKingOne', '[]', 'Nice weather we''re having, ain''t it?', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Tujen/Tujen_50.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[513,517,521]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(12482, 'TujenGossipTheKingTwo', '[]', 'Wraeclast is a touch dangerous. I imagine you''ve got quite the story to tell.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Tujen/Tujen_51.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[513,517,521]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(12483, 'TujenGossipTheKingThree', '[]', 'Do you not understand social cues? Stop asking!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Tujen/Tujen_52.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[513,517,521]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(12484, 'TujenGossipVoranaStoryFound', '[]', 'A grim fate descended upon our people here in Wraeclast. Part of me wants to believe that Vorana took on this entire mad continent herself, but we''re here now, and monsters still abound, so I think we both know she did not win the day. But our people attempted to flee through some sort of cave? We must find out the rest!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Tujen/Tujen_53.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[513,517,521]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(12485, 'TujenGossipVoranaDefeatedStoryNotComplete', '[]', 'You defeated Vorana? I stand amazed and humbled. I''m a descendant of Annest, the daughter she sent to the homeland before the end. You''ve given peace to one of my ancestors. Colour me grateful.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Tujen/Tujen_54.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[513,517,521]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(12486, 'TujenGossipVoranaDefeatedStoryComplete', '[]', 'Now the tale of Vorana of the Black Scythe is complete. She died as she lived: making war. As a descendant of Annest, Vorana''s daughter, this fills a gap in the history of my lineage. When we return home, I will make sure the Kalguur know that Vorana went down in a blaze of glory, bringing a personal war against an entire continent of monsters herself.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
We''ll just leave out the part where she became an immortal abomination, aye?', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Tujen/Tujen_55.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[513,517,521]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(12487, 'TujenGossipUhtredDefeatedStoryComplete', '[]', 'From what you''ve found, while Vorana fought a last stand, the rest of our people here on Wraeclast attempted to escape through some ancient site of power. Uhtred was there waiting for them... and now we know what happened. He, too, fell to the corrupting madness. He must have slain them all at the threshold, though I do hope some got past him and escaped.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
The question that lingers with me though: Uhtred was the one who first declared the gems unclean. He never used them, by the accounts we found. How, then, did he go mad? What did he witness that broke his mind?', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Tujen/Tujen_56.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[513,517,521]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(12488, 'TujenExclaimsAboutVorana', '[]', 'It''s Vorana herself!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/TujenWild/Tujen_57.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[513,517,521]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
