(12654, 'TheBlackStarMeteor2', '[]', 'Astral avalanche!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/TheBlackStar/VO_Meteor_02.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[537]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(12655, 'TheBlackStarMeteor3', '[]', 'Astral avalanche!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/TheBlackStar/VO_Meteor_03.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[537]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(12656, 'TheBlackStarPlayerDefeatRandom', '[]', 'Your champion... has fallen.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/TheBlackStar/VO_Player_Defeat_01.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[537]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(12657, 'TheBlackStarPlayerDefeat2', '[]', 'Your champion... has fallen.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/TheBlackStar/VO_Player_Defeat_02.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[537]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(12658, 'TheBlackStarPlayerDefeat3', '[]', 'The Cleansing Fire prevails...', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/TheBlackStar/VO_Player_Defeat_03.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[537]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(12659, 'TheBlackStarPlayerDefeat4', '[]', 'The Cleansing Fire prevails...', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/TheBlackStar/VO_Player_Defeat_04.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[537]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(12660, 'HelenaWakeUp', '[]', 'Exile... Exile, wake up!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Helyna/HEL_317_01.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[536,368]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(12661, 'HelenaRequestYourPresence', '[]', 'Commander Kirac has requested your presence in the War Room.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Helyna/HEL_317_02.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[536,368]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(12662, 'HelenaThroughTheTunnel', '[]', 'It''s through the tunnel.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Helyna/HEL_317_03_02.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[536,368]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(12663, 'HelenaOnKitavaDefeat', '[]', 'It''s hard to believe it''s been a full year since you slew Kitava. This place is almost starting to feel like home. I left behind a piece of my heart in Oriath, even though I know we can never return there. Too many terrible things took place on that island. I think I agree with the popular sentiment that it was somehow cursed.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Helyna/HEL_317_04.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[368]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(12664, 'HelenaOnOriathCurse', '[]', 'When I really think on it, Oriath''s suffering was almost entirely the fault of its people. Not the common folk, mind you. The ones with the power. The Templars fostered a society in which monsters like Dominus and Piety could not only rise to power, but then wield that power to harm all of Wraeclast. Enslaving the Karui directly led to the cult of Kitava unleashing mayhem, and of course the tyranny of Innocence stemmed from the blind zealous faith they gave him. Then, there was the whole business with Sirus...', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Helyna/HEL_317_05.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[368]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(12665, 'HelenaOnSirus', '[]', 'That was the final nail in the coffin for Oriath. We might have been able to rebuild things after Kitava''s rampage, if not for the surprise attack by Sirus. Kirac was a lesser officer in the Vanguard then, and had to work with exiles and radicals in strange exotic realms to try to control the situation... but Sirus was far too dangerous to be contained. I''m not sure even you could have stopped him, had you been there. I don''t know exactly how they won the day, because Kirac never talks about it, but I do know a great many people died.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Helyna/HEL_317_06.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[368]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(12666, 'HelenaOnCitizenVanguard', '[]', 'We are the people''s response to the madness of Wraeclast. We''ve had enough of corruption, gods, and would-be dictators. The last year or so, the Citizen Vanguard has embarked upon a celestial war in secret in a realm called the Atlas, and we''ve lost many valiant men in battle. We need all the soldiers we can get, so it''s time for you to put your strength and wits to good use.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Helyna/HEL_317_07.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[368]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(12667, 'HelenaOnNewRole', '[]', 'Serving under Kirac in the Citizen Vanguard this past year has certainly been rewarding. This is a nobler cause by far than aiding the Blackguards. I don''t know if Piety''s atrocities can ever truly be made right, but I will keep trying until the day I die.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Helyna/HEL_317_08.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[368]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(12668, 'HelenaOnTheMapDevice', '[]', 'History, as I was taught it in Oriath, seems very skewed now. There were a great many events that were hidden from the public eye, and the use of map devices throughout the ages was one of those secrets. We know Maligaro experimented with one. There was also a map device in the possession of the Templars, though they did not know what they had. As far as we know, map devices can open portals to almost anywhere, even locations not of this world. We generally use it to enter the Atlas, although some of the exiles we worked with traveled to the domains of the Breach Lords. Those exiles were never heard from again, of course, but the portals worked.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Helyna/HEL_317_09.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[368]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(12669, 'HelenaOnZanaCaeserius', '[]', 'Where do I begin? That woman has had a very uncommon life. When she was a child, her father was tasked by High Templar Venarius to work on what would end up becoming a map device. Both her father and the High Templar would eventually disappear into the portals of that device, leaving her to grow up an orphan. That experience left her very focussed on learning the secrets of the map device, as you can imagine. It was her work that enabled all of this. The Vanguard''s foothold on the Atlas. The efforts against the mad Elderslayers. She even did some initial work with the exile The Maven first fancied as a plaything. But when Sirus died... she quit. She walked off into the Atlas, and we haven''t seen her since.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Helyna/HEL_317_10.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[368]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(12670, 'HelenaOnVenarius', '[]', 'I don''t know much about High Templar Venarius, unfortunately. The history I study is generally older than that. However, as an Oriathan, I''ve heard the same decades-old rumors as everyone else. It was an awful thing they did to his mother... if it''s true.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Helyna/HEL_317_11.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[368]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(12671, 'HelenaOnTheElder', '[]', 'I''m less studied on The Elder than I should be, but from what I understand, it was an otherworldly entity that preyed on humanity for thousands of years. It served a force called Decay. Not too long ago, the Elderslayers defeated The Elder with the help of Zana Caeserius, but that seems to have simply led to another problem. The Elder''s absence means the Atlas is a prize trophy left undefended against a cosmos full of hungry horrors.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Helyna/HEL_317_12.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[368]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(12672, 'HelenaOnTheFirstWar', '[]', 'While it may seem like control of the Atlas is constantly under contention, the first war of ownership was actually not too long ago. It''s hard to say whether The Elder created it or simply found it in ancient times, but the realm served as a haven from which humanity could be preyed upon for thousands of years. Twenty years ago, a man named Valdo Caeserius, Zana''s father, was trapped in the Atlas by the actions of High Templar Venarius. Zana''s father learned some measure of power over the Atlas, and became what we call The Shaper. He waged war against The Elder for as long as he could, until his daughter led the Elderslayers to a final triumphant victory. Unfortunately, Valdo was too far gone by then.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Helyna/HEL_317_13.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[368]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(12673, 'HelenaOnTheConquerors', '[]', 'They are probably better referred to as the Elderslayers now, but for a time, the Vanguard battled Baran, Veritania, Drox, and Al-Hezmin for control of the Atlas. The leader of the Elderslayers, Sirus, was far more powerful than the rest. Before they all went mad, he sacrificed himself to help seal The Elder, and they thought him dead... until he somehow returned, full of pain and ennui. He alone managed to escape the Atlas, and he took out his despair on Oriath, during our rebuilding efforts. As you can see, that triggered the evacuation, and we haven''t returned. ', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Helyna/HEL_317_14.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[368]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(12674, 'HelenaOnThesePeople2', '[]', 'I can''t help but feel a sense of hope that the people we have gathered are part of something greater. We''re all utterly different, but something has brought us together here and now. Alva, with her blood thaumaturgy. Tane, with his dark science. Einhar, with his natural wisdom. Niko, with his machinery skills. Jun, with her combat prowess. Kirac''s leadership, and your strength, make me confident that we can handle whatever the future brings.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Helyna/HEL_317_15.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[368]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(12675, 'KiracAsApproaching', '[]', 'Ah, Godslayer!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Kirac/KIR_317_01.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[410,412]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(12676, 'KiracIntroduction2', '[]', 'Kirac''s my name, Commander of the Citizen Vanguard. We''re the front line, ensuring callous gods and bloodthirsty fiends never blindside us again. The Templars kept the true nature of the world hidden from the populace, but now the rhoa''s out of the sack, and we''ll keep both eyes open. Or the one eye open, in my case.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Kirac/KIR_317_02.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[410,412]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(12677, 'KiracMapTutorial', '[]', 'We''ve a vital mission for you, Godslayer, but you''re not going to believe me until you see this for yourself. Take this map and put it in one of the map devices below. It will take you to a realm we call the Atlas. Once you see the world on the other side and have yourself a battle or two, we''ll talk.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Kirac/KIR_317_03.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[410,412]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(12678, 'KiracAfterMapBossDefeat', '[]', 'Now that you''ve had a glimpse of the Atlas, our mission might make more sense. There''s a whole uncharted realm out there, countless regions just like the one you explored, full of strange creatures and ancient threats. Nobody knows exactly what the Atlas is, but I can tell you my personal experience: danger, death, and loss.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
We''ve been doing our best to explore its deeper reaches, but too many good men have died. We''re out of our depth. That''s why we need you. Keep exploring the Atlas. Look for anything we can use to defend Wraeclast. Believe me, we''re going to need it against the coming darkness.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Kirac/KIR_317_04.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[410,412]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(12679, 'KiracAfterEnvoyEncounter', '[]', 'You encountered The Envoy? This is exactly what I was hoping for. He''s an enigmatic being, but he never strays far from his ward. He serves and guards a being called The Maven, and she is the true reason I''ve asked you to work with us. She is... a horrific abomination of a similar kind to the ones that are on their way. You might think I''m crazy for seeking her on purpose, but she may be the only one who can help us. You''ll understand when - and if - you find her.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Something dark is coming, Godslayer. Time is short. Keep exploring the Atlas. Where The Envoy resides, The Maven cannot be far.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Kirac/KIR_317_05.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[410,412]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(12680, 'KiracAfterMavenEncounter', '[]', 'You''ve found The Maven! Then perhaps we have a chance after all. Do your best to win her over. She''s drawn to conflict — the bloodier, the better. Try working your way deeper into the Atlas. Entertain her with combat. She might just aid her ''favourite toy'' when the time comes.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Kirac/KIR_317_06.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[410,412]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(12681, 'KiracAfterEldritchEntitiesHaveArrived', '[]', 'After all this time, all this dread and waiting... they''re finally here. This is it, Godslayer. A struggle for the fate of Wraeclast. From what I can gather, the Atlas is a tempting treasure that keeps these creatures occupied. So long as we wage war in the outer realms, Wraeclast is safe. Should we lose the Atlas to their control, it will only be a matter of time until they take notice of us... we are nothing to them, and that is our greatest opportunity. Aid The Maven. Pit these entities against each other. It may be our only chance.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Kirac/KIR_317_07.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[410,412]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(12682, 'KiracOnTangleLure', '[]', 'So The Maven has given you a tool to begin hunting The Tangle. I knew finding her was our best shot at facing these abominations. Attack it on her behalf, and we can begin setting them against each other.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Kirac/KIR_317_08.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[410,412]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(12683, 'KiracOnCleansingFireLure', '[]', 'With this new piece of equipment, we can hunt The Cleansing Fire''s footholds on the Atlas. Attack them on her behalf, and we can set them up to fight each other instead of us.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Kirac/KIR_317_09.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[410,412]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(12684, 'KiracOnInfiniteHungerKey', '[]', 'My engineers have looked at that key... it''s some sort of purposeful invitation, almost ceremonial in design. If you put this in the Map Device, it will open the way to somewhere far beyond the Atlas. It''s about time we went on the offensive. Prepare yourself for a bit of a tussle.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Kirac/KIR_317_10.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[410,412]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(12685, 'KiracOnBlackStarKey', '[]', 'This key glows brighter in proximity to the Map Device, as if it''s trying to tell us it wants to be used. It will take you beyond the Atlas itself, to some unknown place in the celestial realm. Rather than defending known lands, this will be an offensive mission into enemy territory. Wherever it leads, be ready for a skirmish.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Kirac/KIR_317_11.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[410,412]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(12686, 'KiracOnInfiniteHungerDefeat', '[]', 'Our best researchers believe you''ve just won some sort of ritual for control of the Atlas against The Tangle. Defeating The Infinite Hunger is just one stage of the conflict, however. It can never be simple, can it? Keep up the pursuit, Godslayer. There''s something much worse out there, readying itself.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Kirac/KIR_317_12.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[410,412]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(12687, 'KiracOnBlackStarDefeat', '[]', 'Our strategists believe that by defeating The Black Star, you''ve strengthened The Maven''s claim on the Atlas. No cause for celebration just yet, though. This is far from over. By all accounts, there''s something far more deadly ahead. Be ready, Godslayer.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Kirac/KIR_317_13.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[410,412]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(12688, 'KiracOnEaterOfWorldsKey', '[]', 'This is it, Godslayer. That key is an invitation to face The Tangle''s primary champion in some far-off realm. The enemy is expecting you, so stay wary.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Kirac/KIR_317_14.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[410,412]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(12689, 'KiracOnSearingExarchKey', '[]', 'That key is not a mechanism, nor a map. It appears to be an invitation. Brace yourself for battle. The Cleansing Fire''s champion will be ready for you.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Kirac/KIR_317_15.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[410,412]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(12690, 'KiracOnEaterOfWorldsDefeat', '[]', 'You''ve given The Tangle''s champion a beating, but this was only one part of some ritual of ownership between eldritch entities. You''ve solidified The Maven''s hold on the Atlas, but I doubt this is the end of the conflict. Stay wary.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Kirac/KIR_317_16.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[410,412]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(12691, 'KiracOnSearingExarchDefeat', '[]', 'I''m glad you survived your battle with The Cleansing Fire''s emissary, but I suspect this is hardly the end of The Maven''s battle for ownership of the Atlas. Keep fighting as her champion, Godslayer. She''s the best of our terrible options.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Kirac/KIR_317_17.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[410,412]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(12692, 'KiracAfterAllEntitesDefeated', '[]', 'By the gods, you actually did it! You did battle with those eldritch fiends and lived to tell the tale. You''ve bought us some time, Godslayer. For the moment, The Maven has full control of the Atlas, and she''s content to play there and leave us alone. Keep doing what you''re doing... very carefully.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Kirac/KIR_317_18.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[410,412]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(12693, 'KiracOnTheComingDarkness', '[]', 'Quite a bit has happened in the Atlas already. Suffice it to say, we have it on ominous authority that some unknown ''they'' are coming. Judging by the one who gave us that warning, all of Wraeclast would be in jeopardy should ''they'' take notice of us. It''s best for everyone if we draw a hard line in the sand across the Atlas and keep them busy there instead.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Kirac/KIR_317_19.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[410,412]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(12694, 'KiracOnTheCitizenVanguard', '[]', 'Families. These courageous men and women have families. That''s the difference between them and a traditional military. No disrespect to my old comrades in arms, but this organisation is not comprised of solitary violent-minded young men. The Citizen Vanguard is a volunteer effort filled with the ranks of ordinary people who are tired of the endless parade of doom and nightmare we call Wraeclast. I said we''d all have to work together to face what''s coming, and that''s exactly what we''re doing.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Kirac/KIR_317_20.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[410,412]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(12695, 'KiracOnTheAtlas', '[]', 'The Atlas is a grave threat to mankind, a realm unlike any we''ve seen. It offers up your wildest desires, urging you ever onward into madness and danger... and yet, it may be our greatest defence as well. The Atlas draws the attention of eldritch creatures that would otherwise destroy us without a second thought. It''s too dangerous to interact with, but too valuable to be left alone. You can see the position that leaves us in.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
We used to have the Atlas fully mapped, but it changes. It grows. After recent major events, it completely changed form. We''ve started from scratch at a moment we can ill afford to be blinded. The more you explore the Atlas, the better our chances of survival.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Kirac/KIR_317_21.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[410,412]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(12696, 'KiracOnTheMapDevice', '[]', 'The map device will transport you to a land unlike any other. We call that land the Atlas—a formidable, uncharted territory which harbours the greatest dangers man has ever seen.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
The device itself—or, the devices, rather, since we''ve managed to acquire three—have a rather long and storied history. As our resident archaeologist, Helena might know more about that kind of thing.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Kirac/KIR_317_22.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[410,412]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(12697, 'KiracOnTheEnvoy2', '[]', 'He''s a strange one. Takes the form of a man... poorly. I''m not sure what to make of him. He''s prone to cryptic speeches, but every word he says has meaning. I suggest you listen closely. We need as much information as we can get if we''re going to survive this.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Kirac/KIR_317_23.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[410,412]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(12698, 'KiracOnTheMaven2', '[]', 'The Maven is a powerful entity with a penchant for forcing combatants to fight to the death. Then, she resurrects them to do it all again, over and over. She''s tortured more than a few of my men and added them to her collection... my own brother included.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
A previous exile worked with her on our behalf, catching her interest for a time. That didn''t last. Don''t let her make you part of her collection.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Kirac/KIR_317_24.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[410,412]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(12699, 'KiracOnBaran', '[]', 'My brother, Baran, was one of the Elderslayers. I''m immensely proud of him for that, but the toll of that victory was too high. It cost him his sanity. In my first campaign in the Atlas, I worked with an exile who was forced to slay him. It couldn''t have ended any other way. I thought that would be the end of it... but The Maven ''collected'' Baran and keeps resurrecting him for her sick games.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
When all this is through, there will be a reckoning with that creature. Mark my words.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Kirac/KIR_317_25.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[410,412]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(12700, 'KiracOnTheElder', '[]', 'The Elder is the reason we''re all in this mess. From what I''m told, it preyed upon humanity for thousands of years, eating memories and shrivelling bodies. That I can''t vouch for, but I do know that other entities like it have noticed its sudden absence. We can ill afford that kind of attention. In defeating the Elder, the Elderslayers may have doomed us all.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Kirac/KIR_317_26.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[410,412]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(12701, 'KiracOnTheElderslayers', '[]', 'They were not the first to find the Atlas, but they may have been the most impactful. They worked to seal away an entity called The Elder that dominated that realm... and that victory cost most of them their sanity.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Not long after, I worked with Zana and a powerful exile to defeat the mad Elderslayers, who by then fancied themselves Conquerors. Unfortunately, we were too slow, and the leader of the Elderslayers, Sirus, escaped from the Atlas and devastated Oriath''s rebuilding efforts. Talk about kicking us while we''re down...', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Kirac/KIR_317_27.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[410,412]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(12702, 'KiracOnSirusIfMalePlayer', '[]', 'You''ve not seen tragedy until you''ve seen former comrades forced into killing one another by circumstance. Sirus could have been our salvation against the coming darkness, had he not been consumed by his own. The powerful exile I was working with at the time gave his life to deal Sirus a near-lethal wound, and then eight hundred of the Vanguard died finishing the bloody job. I myself earned an injury that will never fully heal... and Zana... well, often the heart suffers deeper cuts than the body. That was the last time any of us worked with her.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Kirac/KIR_317_28_01.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[410,412]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(12703, 'KiracOnSirusIfFemalePlayer', '[]', 'You''ve not seen tragedy until you''ve seen former comrades forced into killing one another by circumstance. Sirus could have been our salvation against the coming darkness, had he not been consumed by his own. The powerful exile I was working with at the time gave her life to deal Sirus a near-lethal wound, and then eight hundred of the Vanguard died finishing the bloody job. I myself earned an injury that will never fully heal... and Zana... well, often the heart suffers deeper cuts than the body. That was the last time any of us worked with her.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Kirac/KIR_317_28_02.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[410,412]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(12704, 'KiracOnOriath', '[]', 'It''s clear our little island is no place for men to live. Even cursed, one could say, though we are not entirely blameless for those disasters. We thought Kitava''s rampage was bad enough, let alone the domination by the Templars and the crackdown under Innocence... but Oriath was attacked yet again while you were gone. The rebuilding efforts were all for nothing. The Vanguard undertook the largest evacuation in history... hundreds of ships... and Oriath has been abandoned.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
No small irony that the Oriathan people now depend upon the Karui we once enslaved. I always said that if you kick a rhoa in the butt, one day, it''ll kick you in the head, but I underestimated the honour of our new hosts. They''re different after the death of their gods... and we are, too, after the departure of ours. I wasn''t a believer, but I can feel it. We''re on our own.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
We''re going to have to work together to face what comes next...', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Kirac/KIR_317_29.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[410,412]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(12705, 'KiracOnZana', '[]', 'She''s got a long and storied tale involving the Atlas and her father, but you''ll have to ask someone else about that. I''m not one for gossip. All I''ll say: our campaign in the Atlas resulted in the death of a man she loved. She seemed filled with despair after that, and then, that sadness became anger. I know what a desire for vengeance looks like, Godslayer. Someone''s going to get what''s coming to them.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Kirac/KIR_317_30.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[410,412]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(12706, 'KiracOnHelena2', '[]', 'I once swore I''d never trust a Blackguard in my life, reformed or not. I''ve had to begrudgingly rethink that notion. Helena''s been crucial in putting together the pieces of Wraeclast''s ominous and ancient history. Everything we face today has its roots in the evils of the past.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Kirac/KIR_317_31.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[410,412]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(12707, 'KiracToHideout', '[]', 'Your operations are too important to be done in public. Let''s move this to your hideout.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Kirac/KIR_317_NEW_01.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[410,412]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(12708, 'KiracGivingMapDevice317', '[]', 'We''ve managed to build another map device with salvaged parts. Setting it up in your hideout seems like a good idea. It''ll better allow you to eat, sleep, and breathe Atlas exploration. That''s the only way we''re going to survive this. Give it everything you''ve got, Godslayer.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Kirac/KIR_317_NEW_02.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[410,412]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(12709, 'KiracOnMavenDefeat', '[]', 'After all that, The Maven turns out to be a <i>{young} eldritch entity? It''s no wonder she needs you to fight as her champion. It''s going to take everything our absurd coalition''s got to survive this. A bunch of half-trained volunteers, an Exile, and a psychopathic hatchling standing together against cosmic abominations... I need a drink!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Kirac/KIR_317_NEW_03.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[410,412]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(12710, 'KiracRogueExilesMission', '[]', 'You''re not the first exile we''ve worked with. Wraeclast seems to be a crucible for forging powerful men and women. Unfortunately, ambition is a critical vulnerability in the Atlas. We''ve got a few rogues running rampant, so watch your back.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Kirac/KIR_317_32.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[410,412]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(12711, 'KiracFindAMapMission', '[]', 'During a recent retreat, we were forced to leave behind some supplies. Most won''t be missed, but there''s at least one map in the area. You might find it useful, so keep an eye out.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Kirac/KIR_317_33.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[410,412]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(12712, 'KiracFindAUniqueItem', '[]', 'One of our scouts noticed a very unusual item in the area you''ll be exploring. Details were sparse, but he''d never seen anything like it. Might be of use to you if you find it.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Kirac/KIR_317_34.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[410,412]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(12713, 'KiracDivinationCard', '[]', 'One of our technicians has detected a divination card in the region in question. Don''t ask me how they figure these things out, I''m not one for technological babble. I just knew you''d want to get your hands on that card.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Kirac/KIR_317_35.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[410,412]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(12714, 'KiracFindVaalFragment', '[]', 'We''ve spotted an ancient Vaal fragment in this map. Hard to say how it got from Wraeclast to the Atlas, but I suspect it''s worth tracking down.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Kirac/KIR_317_36.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[410,412]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(12715, 'KiracCompleteLabyrinthTrial', '[]', 'I''ve received a report of a mysterious gauntlet full of deadly traps located in this map. I have a feeling you''re just mad enough to brave it. Do as you like, but don''t get yourself killed.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Kirac/KIR_317_37.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[410,412]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(12716, 'KiracAbyssInMap', '[]', 'You''ll have to be careful in this one. Something seems to be lurking underground. We lost two soldiers to claws that ripped them out of sight in an instant.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Kirac/KIR_317_38.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[410,412]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(12717, 'KiracGroupsOfCorruptedMonsters', '[]', 'The map ahead appears to be infested with groups of corrupted monsters. I recommend caution, but the area would certainly be safer if you managed to clear them out.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Kirac/KIR_317_39.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[410,412]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(12718, 'KiracBeyondMission', '[]', 'We''ve clashed more than a few times with invaders from beyond the Atlas, but this map has an uncommon concentration of bloodthirsty creatures. I suspect they''re up to something, and I suggest you put an end to them before they can summon anything worse.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Kirac/KIR_317_40.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[410,412]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(12719, 'KiracEssenceMission', '[]', 'By all reports, this area contains at least one powerful beast frozen in some sort of crystal. Personally, I''d just leave it trapped, but it''s up to you.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Kirac/KIR_317_41.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[410,412]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(12720, 'KiracInvasionBoss', '[]', 'General Atlas threats, we''ve learned to handle, but there''s a particularly lethal beast in this map that has already slain a dozen of our men. Go do what you do... with prejudice.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Kirac/KIR_317_42.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[410,412]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(12721, 'KiracHarbingerMission', '[]', 'Those bloody blue bastards are trying to gain a foothold on the Atlas. Don''t let them! Give them a vengeful kick in the arse... for the Vanguard.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Kirac/KIR_317_43.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[410,412]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(12722, 'KiracUniqueStrongboxMission', '[]', 'Some of my men have spotted an ancient cache in this map. It''s a trap, of course, but I have no doubt you can handle it.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Kirac/KIR_317_44.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[410,412]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(12723, 'KiracBreachMission', '[]', 'We''re detecting instability in this map, and not the usual kind. It''s reading like a breach in the very fabric of reality. I don''t know how violence can solve such a problem, but I''m sure you''ll find a way.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Kirac/KIR_317_45.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[410,412]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(12724, 'KiracElderGuadianMap', '[]', 'This one''s not your usual romp, Godslayer. This map leads to a raw memory, a battle against a guardian of the being known as The Elder. This happened long ago, but, somehow, memories can remain real in the Atlas... and lethal. Be careful.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Kirac/KIR_317_46.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[410,412]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(12725, 'KiracLegionMission', '[]', 'This map contains a strange monolith we sighted from afar. As with everything else in the Atlas, it''s probably a trap, but I have no doubt you''ll purposely charge right in. Good luck.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Kirac/KIR_317_47.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[410,412]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(12726, 'KiracHarvestMission', '[]', 'There''s an odd sort of garden in this map. Can''t make heads or tails of the reports. Be wary.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Kirac/KIR_317_48.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[410,412]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(12727, 'KiracBlightedMap', '[]', 'You''ll be working with Sister Cassia on this one. The area''s been completely taken over by a blighted fungus. If you defend her pump well enough, she might even give you a little credit for helping her.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Kirac/KIR_317_49.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[410,412]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(12728, 'KiracMapWithBlight', '[]', 'Sister Cassia has requested assistance in this map. She''s set up her pump to work against a blighted fungus infection, and she needs someone skilled with violence to hold back the reaction when she begins her operation. Have fun with that one, Godslayer.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Kirac/KIR_317_50.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[410,412]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(12729, 'KiracDeliriumMission', '[]', 'I know this sounds mad, but a sinister voice whispered in my ear not long ago, requesting you pay this area a visit... I wasn''t certain whether I should mention this mission, but it won''t be the first trap you''ve purposely sprung. Stay wary.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Kirac/KIR_317_51.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[410,412]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(12730, 'KiracMetamorphMission', '[]', 'Tane is already in the region doing research. He mentioned needing some aid of the violent variety, and I knew just who to send his way. Try not to have too much fun.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Kirac/KIR_317_52.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[410,412]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(12731, 'KiracElderInfluence', '[]', 'A ghastly influence lingers in this map, germinating unknown dangers. Stay on high alert.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Kirac/KIR_317_53.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[410,412]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(12732, 'KiracShaperInfluence', '[]', 'Fading echoes of power still resonate in this map. They''re old, but not ancient, and vaguely remind me of someone I used to work with. It''s very odd, and likely dangerous. Keep on your toes.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Kirac/KIR_317_54.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[410,412]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(12733, 'KiracExpeditionMission', '[]', 'The Kalguurans have been working in this region, and I think they''re ready for your ''expertise.'' Go see if you can''t unearth something interesting.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Kirac/KIR_317_55.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[410,412]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(12734, 'KiracUltimatumMission', '[]', 'My men encountered the Trialmaster in this map. If you want to take him up on his challenge, he''s waiting. I''m certainly not going to do it.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Kirac/KIR_317_56.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[410,412]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(12735, 'KiracRitualMission', '[]', 'There''s an odd series of altars in this map. We''ve given the area a wide berth, but I have no doubt you''ll charge in and... touch things. Just keep your wits about you.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Kirac/KIR_317_57.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[410,412]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(12736, 'KiracHeistMission', '[]', 'One of my men followed a never-do-well recently. I believe there''s a cache of stolen goods in this map. The criminals must have their own map device technology, but at least they''re only using it for illicit exchanges. The cache is up for grabs, if you can find it.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Kirac/KIR_317_58.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[410,412]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(12737, 'KiracSynthesisMission', '[]', 'From what we can tell, there''s a raw memory floating around in this map, but we can''t identify it from afar. I suggest you take a look, if you''re inclined.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Kirac/KIR_317_59.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[410,412]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(12738, 'KiracAmbushMonstrousTreasure', '[]', 'Oh, boy. There has never been so obvious a trap than this innocent-looking map. There are no monsters, and we''ve spotted countless massive strongboxes. None of my men are going to set foot in there, so I leave it to you to explore.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Kirac/KIR_317_60.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[410,412]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(12739, 'KiracConquerorMission', '[]', 'I know the Atlas can retain the impressions of powerful memories, but it still disturbs me to encounter one of my own. This map leads to a raw memory, a battle against an Elderslayer. You might even see my brother, Baran, but it''s not truly him. Just an echo... so don''t hold back on my account.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Kirac/KIR_317_61.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[410,412]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(12740, 'MavenTangleInfluenceTier1_Random', '[]', 'Enemy...', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Maven/317_Maven_01_01.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[493]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(12741, 'MavenTangleInfluenceTier1_2', '[]', 'Enemy...', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Maven/317_Maven_01_02.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[493]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(12742, 'MavenTangleInfluenceTier2_Random', '[]', 'Angry. Invader!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Maven/317_Maven_02_01.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[493]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(12743, 'MavenTangleInfluenceTier2_2', '[]', 'Angry. Invader!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Maven/317_Maven_02_02.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[493]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(12744, 'MavenTangleInfluenceTier3_Random', '[]', 'Destroy the enemy!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Maven/317_Maven_03_01.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[493]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(12745, 'MavenTangleInfluenceTier3_2', '[]', 'Destroy the enemy!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Maven/317_Maven_03_02.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[493]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(12746, 'MavenTangleInfluenceTier4_Random', '[]', 'The Tangle cannot have the Atlas.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Maven/317_Maven_04_01.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[493]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(12747, 'MavenTangleInfluenceTier4_2', '[]', 'The Tangle cannot have the Atlas.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Maven/317_Maven_04_02.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[493]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(12748, 'MavenTangleInfluenceTier5_Random', '[]', 'The Atlas is mine now. The Tangle cannot be allowed to infest it!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Maven/317_Maven_05_01.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[493]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(12749, 'MavenTangleInfluenceTier5_2', '[]', 'The Atlas is mine now. The Tangle cannot be allowed to infest it!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Maven/317_Maven_05_02.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[493]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(12750, 'MavenTangleLureTier1_Random', '[]', 'Take.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Maven/317_Maven_06_01.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[493]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(12751, 'MavenTangleLureTier1_2', '[]', 'Take.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Maven/317_Maven_06_02.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[493]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(12752, 'MavenTangleLureTier2_Random', '[]', 'Take. Defend.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Maven/317_Maven_07_01.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[493]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(12753, 'MavenTangleLureTier2_2', '[]', 'Take. Defend.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Maven/317_Maven_07_02.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[493]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(12754, 'MavenTangleLureTier3_Random', '[]', 'Hunt The Tangle.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Maven/317_Maven_08_01.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[493]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(12755, 'MavenTangleLureTier3_2', '[]', 'Hunt The Tangle.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Maven/317_Maven_08_02.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[493]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(12756, 'MavenTangleLureTier4_Random', '[]', 'Take this device and hunt the enemy.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Maven/317_Maven_09_01.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[493]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(12757, 'MavenTangleLureTier4_2', '[]', 'Take this device and hunt the enemy.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Maven/317_Maven_09_02.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[493]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(12758, 'MavenTangleLureTier5_Random', '[]', 'Use this device to rid me of my opposition!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Maven/317_Maven_10_01.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[493]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(12759, 'MavenTangleLureTier5_2', '[]', 'Use this device to rid me of my opposition!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Maven/317_Maven_10_02.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[493]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(12760, 'MavenCleansingFireInfluence_Tier1_Random', '[]', 'Danger...', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Maven/317_Maven_11_01.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[493]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(12761, 'MavenCleansingFireInfluence_Tier1_2', '[]', 'Danger...', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Maven/317_Maven_11_02.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[493]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(12762, 'MavenCleansingFireInfluence_Tier2_Random', '[]', 'Mine. Invader!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Maven/317_Maven_12_01.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[493]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(12763, 'MavenCleansingFireInfluence_Tier2_2', '[]', 'Mine. Invader!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Maven/317_Maven_12_02.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[493]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(12764, 'MavenCleansingFireInfluence_Tier3_Random', '[]', 'Destroy the danger.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Maven/317_Maven_13_01.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[493]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(12765, 'MavenCleansingFireInfluence_Tier3_2', '[]', 'Destroy the danger.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Maven/317_Maven_13_02.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[493]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(12766, 'MavenCleansingFireInfluence_Tier4_Random', '[]', 'The Atlas is mine. ', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Maven/317_Maven_14_01.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[493]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(12767, 'MavenCleansingFireInfluence_Tier4_2', '[]', 'The Atlas is mine. The Cleansing Fire cannot have it!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Maven/317_Maven_14_02.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[493]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(12768, 'MavenCleansingFireInfluence_Tier5_Random', '[]', 'This simply will not do! The Atlas is mine.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Maven/317_Maven_15_01.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[493]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(12769, 'MavenCleansingFireInfluence_Tier5_2', '[]', 'This simply will not do! The Atlas is mine.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Maven/317_Maven_15_02.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[493]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(12770, 'MavenCleansingFireLureTier1_Random', '[]', 'Take.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Maven/317_Maven_16_01.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[493]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(12771, 'MavenCleansingFireLureTier1_2', '[]', 'Take.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Maven/317_Maven_16_02.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[493]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(12772, 'MavenCleansingFireLureTier2_Random', '[]', 'Take. Fight.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Maven/317_Maven_17_01.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[493]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(12773, 'MavenCleansingFireLureTier2_2', '[]', 'Take. Fight.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Maven/317_Maven_17_02.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[493]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(12774, 'MavenCleansingFireLureTier3_Random', '[]', 'Take this. Hunt The Cleansing Fire.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Maven/317_Maven_18_01.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[493]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(12775, 'MavenCleansingFireLureTier3_2', '[]', 'Take this. Hunt The Cleansing Fire.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Maven/317_Maven_18_02.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[493]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(12776, 'MavenCleansingFireLureTier4_Random', '[]', 'Take this device and hunt the flames for me.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Maven/317_Maven_19_01.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[493]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(12777, 'MavenCleansingFireLureTier4_2', '[]', 'Take this device and hunt the flames for me.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Maven/317_Maven_19_02.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[493]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(12778, 'MavenCleansingFireLureTier5_Random', '[]', 'Take this device and use it to extinguish The Cleansing Fire!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Maven/317_Maven_20_01.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[493]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(12779, 'MavenCleansingFireLureTier5_2', '[]', 'Take this device and use it to extinguish The Cleansing Fire!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Maven/317_Maven_20_02.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[493]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(12780, 'MavenInfiniteHungerTier1_Random', '[]', 'Mine.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Maven/317_Maven_21_01.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[493]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(12781, 'MavenInfiniteHungerTier1_2', '[]', 'Mine.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Maven/317_Maven_21_02.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[493]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(12782, 'MavenInfiniteHungerTier2_Random', '[]', 'Atlas. Mine.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Maven/317_Maven_22_01.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[493]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(12783, 'MavenInfiniteHungerTier2_2', '[]', 'Atlas. Mine.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Maven/317_Maven_22_02.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[493]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(12784, 'MavenInfiniteHungerTier3_Random', '[]', 'Duel for my Atlas.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Maven/317_Maven_23_01.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[493]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(12785, 'MavenInfiniteHungerTier3_2', '[]', 'Duel for my Atlas.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Maven/317_Maven_23_02.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 0, 1, '[493]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
