(14427, 'LyciaGodVoiceInteractDeferral3', '[]', 'A sacrifice today is a blessing tomorrow.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Lycia_GodVoice/Lycia_GodVoice_09_B_01.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[566]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(14428, 'LyciaGodVoiceInteractDeferral4', '[]', 'A sacrifice today is a blessing tomorrow.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Lycia_GodVoice/Lycia_GodVoice_09_B_02.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[566]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(14429, 'LyciaGodVoiceInteractDeferral5', '[]', 'The future is bright for those who wait.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Lycia_GodVoice/Lycia_GodVoice_09_C_01.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[566]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(14430, 'LyciaGodVoiceInteractDeferral6', '[]', 'The future is bright for those who wait.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Lycia_GodVoice/Lycia_GodVoice_09_C_02.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[566]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(14431, 'LyciaGodVoiceInteractDeferral7', '[]', 'The future is bright for those who wait.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Lycia_GodVoice/Lycia_GodVoice_09_C_03.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[566]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(14432, 'LyciaCombatIntroRandom', '[]', 'It is irritating that you have progressed so far into my domain, but not surprising. I have seen many mortals undone by curiosity – for how better to ensnare them? Sure enough, now you find yourself in a predicament from which you cannot extricate yourself.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
You have blithely wandered this prison for far too long. It is time for you to meet your end.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Lycia_Combat/Lycia_Combat_Intro_01.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[566]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(14433, 'Lycia_Glyph_01', '[]', 'When I was young, I never questioned our faith. We pile the bones of former Templars in massive ossuaries that fill the spaces under the earth. Each one is hallowed, we are told. Each one is sacred. Yet as I stood there on that broken day, gazing at the bones I was supposed to join, I realised that I had no idea who any of these people were. Lip service. Meaningless. So many have been forgotten, but I will be remembered.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Lycia_Glyph/Lycia_Glyph_01.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[570]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(14434, 'Lycia_Glyph_02', '[]', 'Their hypocrisy knows no bounds. I will see their destruction. All I must do is outlive them... Just like I''ll outlive the adventurers who roam these halls.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Lycia_Glyph/Lycia_Glyph_02.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[571]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(14435, 'Lycia_Glyph_03', '[]', 'Time passes at an infuriatingly slow pace. There were no changes to demarcate it, so I began to create my own.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
I built stone forms, animated them and made them talk. I raised a legion of undead – partly out of ennui, partly to see if I could. My creations are painfully dim, but to have them is better than enduring the passage of time without change.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
I''ve lost count of the number of skeletons I''ve prised apart. I''ve even bottled fresh blood, harvested from curious adventurers...', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Lycia_Glyph/Lycia_Glyph_03.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[572]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(14436, 'Lycia_Glyph_04', '[]', 'My eternity passed unnoticed within the Sanctum. I knew I needed to amass great power in order to harvest the will of my prey. I commanded nascent energy, raw and shapeless, and over centuries, I gave it form. I opened gateways in the wilderness of Wraeclast – and even better, I managed to lure my quarry through them. Like rodents to rhoas, they were drawn into my domain... and not one has survived.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Lycia_Glyph/Lycia_Glyph_04.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[573]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(14437, 'Lycia_Glyph_05', '[]', 'Leaving the Sanctum is a tempting prospect, but where better to ensnare hapless adventurers? There is ample treasure here, and glory for those who seek it. Better still, the glory-seekers provide entertainment. The more tenacity they have, the more fun it is... and the more sustenance they provide.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Lycia_Glyph/Lycia_Glyph_05.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[574]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(14438, 'Lycia_Glyph_06', '[]', 'Knowledge is a far greater power than gold, for money cannot buy eternity.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Lycia_Glyph/Lycia_Glyph_06.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[575]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(14439, 'Lycia_Glyph_07', '[]', 'I bargained with an entity far greater than the Templars, far greater than myself, far greater than any of the civilisations that have risen and fallen throughout Wraeclast. It blessed me immeasurably and cursed me insufferably. And, in a sense, it was a companion... almost a comfort. The adventurers will never understand the true price of having dominion over the Sanctum, nor of immortality. It is isolation. This is where the true torture lies.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Lycia_Glyph/Lycia_Glyph_07.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[576]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(14440, 'Lycia_Glyph_08', '[]', 'Beidat is a cruel master. He calls himself the Archangel of Death, but there is nothing angelic about him. He is a demon-lord, and bargaining with him was like parting with my very soul. If only he had taken my emotions... It would have made eternity pass unnoticed.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Lycia_Glyph/Lycia_Glyph_08.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[577]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(14441, 'Lycia_Glyph_09', '[]', 'I learned a forbidden Templar secret: there are no records of the deceased. They are not ''hallowed, forever, together'', like the priests told us as children. They are simply discarded, thrust away into crypts and buried haphazardly in the earth. The dead are simply... forgotten.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
I wanted to be remembered, so I sought to become what they feared. I sought to live forever. I chased heresy and the unholy power of the demons... I raised the dead, and eventually, cheated death itself. It came at an inexorable cost – and, as fate would have it, I paid with my life. Perhaps there is an irony in this.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Lycia_Glyph/Lycia_Glyph_09.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[578]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(14442, 'ChaosEntityPickedUpChaosOrbSmallStackRandom', '[]', 'A little sliver of anarchy!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/ChaosOrbArmour/ChaosArmour_01_A_01.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 2500, 1, '[579]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(14443, 'ChaosEntityPickedUpChaosOrbSmallStack2', '[]', 'A little sliver of anarchy.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/ChaosOrbArmour/ChaosArmour_01_A_02.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 2500, 1, '[579]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(14444, 'ChaosEntityPickedUpChaosOrbSmallStack3', '[]', 'A little sliver of anarchy!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/ChaosOrbArmour/ChaosArmour_01_A_03.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 2500, 1, '[579]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(14445, 'ChaosEntityPickedUpChaosOrbSmallStack4', '[]', 'Take a chance.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/ChaosOrbArmour/ChaosArmour_01_B_01.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 2500, 1, '[579]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(14446, 'ChaosEntityPickedUpChaosOrbSmallStack5', '[]', 'Take a chance.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/ChaosOrbArmour/ChaosArmour_01_B_02.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 2500, 1, '[579]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
