(18140, 'LoyalCompanion_Angry_OpenMap_12', '[]', 'You up for it?', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/LoyalCompanionDecoration_Angry/DaveDecoration_Angry_OpenMap_E_02.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 90000, 1, '[687]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(18141, 'LoyalCompanion_Angry_OpenMap_13', '[]', 'You up for it?', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/LoyalCompanionDecoration_Angry/DaveDecoration_Angry_OpenMap_E_03.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 90000, 1, '[687]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(18142, 'IslaSettlersHeistMetNotBuilt', '[]', 'Oh, hello! I''m Isla. Have we met? I always forget a face, as they say. Oh, yes... we <I>{definitely don''t know each other.} I''m hoping to sign on as an engineer here, and I don''t have <i>{any other job.} Just like you. <I>{Wink!} If you build the proper facilities, I can put together all sorts of contraptions you might find useful!', 'Audio/Dialogue/Leagues/SettlersOfKalguur/Isla/Isla/IslaSettlers_01.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[676]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(18143, 'IslaSettlersHeistNotMetNotBuilt', '[]', 'Oh, hello! Have we met? I always forget a face, as they say. I''d like to sign on here as an engineer. I can build all sorts of contraptions you might find useful. We would need the proper facilities, however. Until then, there''s not much I can do. Can''t have my inventions getting rained on!', 'Audio/Dialogue/Leagues/SettlersOfKalguur/Isla/Isla/IslaSettlers_02.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[676]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(18144, 'IslaSettlersHeistMetBuilt', '[]', 'Oh, hello! I''m Isla. Have we met? I always forget a face, as they say. Oh, yes... we <I>{definitely don''t know each other.} I''m the engineer here, and I don''t <i>{any other job.} Just like you. <I>{Wink!}', 'Audio/Dialogue/Leagues/SettlersOfKalguur/Isla/Isla/IslaSettlers_03.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[676]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(18145, 'IslaSettlersHeistNotMetBuilt', '[]', 'Oh, hello! Have we met? I always forget a face, as they say. I''m Isla, your local engineer! I specialise in contraptions, devices, inventions, and gadgets!', 'Audio/Dialogue/Leagues/SettlersOfKalguur/Isla/Isla/IslaSettlers_04.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[676]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(18146, 'IslaSettlersBeforeBuildingBuilt', '[]', 'I''m tinkering with what I have, but we''re going to need some investment before I can get a proper facility up and running.', 'Audio/Dialogue/Leagues/SettlersOfKalguur/Isla/Isla/IslaSettlers_05.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[676]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(18147, 'IslaSettlersRecombinatorIntro', '[]', 'I''ve always had a <i>{penchant} for taking things apart. You could say I''m something of a savant, if I do flatter myself. On the other hand, I''ve spent most of my life studying how to put things back together again, with... mixed results. The thing is, that actually might be quite useful to you. I''ve drawn plans for a device. A disassembling-reassembling contraption. It could take things apart, and put them back together differently, <i>{on purpose.} It''s my own personal talent in machine form. I call it ''The Isla-nator!'' If you''re interested in funding such a project, just let me know.', 'Audio/Dialogue/Leagues/SettlersOfKalguur/Isla/Isla/IslaSettlers_06.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[676]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(18148, 'IslaSettlersUnlockRecombinator', '[]', 'Ooh, I''m so excited! Stage one of the ''Isla-nator'' can only... <i>{recombinate} weapons, but I''m sure you''ll have lots of fun with that! Recombinate... <i>{recombinate...} such a pleasurable word...', 'Audio/Dialogue/Leagues/SettlersOfKalguur/Isla/Isla/IslaSettlers_07.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[676]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(18149, 'IslaSettlersUpgradeArmour', '[]', 'Stage two of the Recombinator—I''m calling it the Recombinator now!—can disassemble and reassemble armour. With another upgrade, it could do even more!', 'Audio/Dialogue/Leagues/SettlersOfKalguur/Isla/Isla/IslaSettlers_08.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[676]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(18150, 'IslaSettlersUpgradeJewellery', '[]', 'Stage three! Time to throw all your prettiest rings and necklaces into the Recombinator!', 'Audio/Dialogue/Leagues/SettlersOfKalguur/Isla/Isla/IslaSettlers_09.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[676]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(18151, 'IslaSettlersUpgradeCost', '[]', 'I''ve restructured some internal mechanisms. The <i>{recombination} process should be more efficient now!', 'Audio/Dialogue/Leagues/SettlersOfKalguur/Isla/Isla/IslaSettlers_10.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[676]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(18152, 'IslaSettlersUpgradeTier', '[]', 'With all the work I''ve done on the Recombinator, it''s starting to reassemble things better than they were before! That''s... actually quite concerning, to a woman of science...', 'Audio/Dialogue/Leagues/SettlersOfKalguur/Isla/Isla/IslaSettlers_11.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[676]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(18153, 'IslaSettlersUpgradeKeepMods', '[]', 'That''s it! The Recombinator is complete! It defies known science in a few fundamental ways, but I''m not about to take it apart to find out why... no matter how tempting that might be...', 'Audio/Dialogue/Leagues/SettlersOfKalguur/Isla/Isla/IslaSettlers_12.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[676]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(18154, 'IslaSettlersMappingIntro', '[]', 'There are rumours that you''re venturing into the Atlas. Oh, yes, I know all about that. It was twenty years ago, now, that I had the opportunity to work on a map device. I wasn''t the one that put it together, but I learned quite a bit by taking it apart. This older, wiser Isla might be able to build one for you... with the proper investment.', 'Audio/Dialogue/Leagues/SettlersOfKalguur/Isla/Isla/IslaSettlers_13.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[676]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(18155, 'IslaSettlersUnlockMapping', '[]', 'Here it is! This prototype map device can only maintain two portals, but I''m quite proud of it. My interplanar bridges are also more like... tubes... than doorways, so whoever uses it will have to more or less... <i>{slide...} but the important thing is that it works!', 'Audio/Dialogue/Leagues/SettlersOfKalguur/Isla/Isla/IslaSettlers_14.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[676]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(18156, 'IslaSettlersMapUpgradePortalsOne', '[]', 'I''ve added more power couplers, and now it should be able to maintain four portals. The ride might be a little bumpier, but that''s why we don''t test these contraptions ourselves!', 'Audio/Dialogue/Leagues/SettlersOfKalguur/Isla/Isla/IslaSettlers_15.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[676]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(18157, 'IslaSettlersMapUpgradePortalsTwo', '[]', 'MORE POWER!', 'Audio/Dialogue/Leagues/SettlersOfKalguur/Isla/Isla/IslaSettlers_21.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[676]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(18158, 'IslaSettlersMapUpgradeYellow', '[]', 'I''ve added more danger to the device, as requested!', 'Audio/Dialogue/Leagues/SettlersOfKalguur/Isla/Isla/IslaSettlers_16.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[676]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(18159, 'IslaSettlersMapUpgradeRed', '[]', 'We can now extend the reach of our interplanar tubes. They''re gonna slide right into horrible dangers, just like you wanted!', 'Audio/Dialogue/Leagues/SettlersOfKalguur/Isla/Isla/IslaSettlers_20.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[676]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(18160, 'IslaSettlersMapUpgradeHardMaps', '[]', 'I''ve overclocked the power cores. We should be able to plumb the darkest and deadliest depths of the Atlas now! How exciting!', 'Audio/Dialogue/Leagues/SettlersOfKalguur/Isla/Isla/IslaSettlers_22.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[676]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(18161, 'IslaSettlersMapUpgradeDeviceOne', '[]', 'Now we can operate a second map device! This one''s even using custom-made parts, instead of pieces I—oh, no, Isla, don''t mention <i>{that...}', 'Audio/Dialogue/Leagues/SettlersOfKalguur/Isla/Isla/IslaSettlers_18.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[676]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(18162, 'IslaSettlersMapUpgradeDeviceTwo', '[]', 'With parts smithed by Dannig and your generous investment, we''ve finally been able to complete a third map device!', 'Audio/Dialogue/Leagues/SettlersOfKalguur/Isla/Isla/IslaSettlers_23.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[676]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(18163, 'IslaSettlersMapUpgradeSpeed', '[]', 'Ooh, it''s finally time to implement my Minion—I mean, Labourer Incentives Program! ', 'Audio/Dialogue/Leagues/SettlersOfKalguur/Isla/Isla/IslaSettlers_19.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[676]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(18164, 'IslaSettlersMapUpgradeExtra', '[]', 'I''ve altered a few of the mechanisms. Don''t worry, it <i>{should} be safe.', 'Audio/Dialogue/Leagues/SettlersOfKalguur/Isla/Isla/IslaSettlers_17.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[676]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(18165, 'IslaSettlersMapUpgradeFinal', '[]', 'I now consider my prototypes complete! With my interplanar tubes, you can slide into any of a thousand different maps! Oh, Isla, you''ve certainly outdone yourself this time!', 'Audio/Dialogue/Leagues/SettlersOfKalguur/Isla/Isla/IslaSettlers_24.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[676]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(18166, 'IslaSettlersRecombinatorGossip', '[]', 'Place equipment in the Recombinator. Like matches with like. The machine will break the objects down into their constituent components, then try to reintegrate them as one fresh new piece. It''s simply genius!', 'Audio/Dialogue/Leagues/SettlersOfKalguur/Isla/Isla/IslaSettlers_25.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[676]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(18167, 'IslaSettlersMapGossip', '[]', 'With these facilities, any runners you assign will go through my portals and explore the Atlas. They''ll bring back all sorts of treasures, and you can collect the gains at your leisure! It sure beats stealing... not that... either of us would ever be involved in anything like that.', 'Audio/Dialogue/Leagues/SettlersOfKalguur/Isla/Isla/IslaSettlers_26.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[676]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(18168, 'IslaSettlersPreviousExperience', '[]', 'Twenty years ago, when I was in my first year, a certain High Templar picked me out of a crowd of Academy engineers. I was taken to the Chief Arkhon''s laboratory, among other staff and guards. That building held a functioning map device, and it was my job to repair and maintain it. Several terrible things happened there... but I learned more high science on that single job than I would have in years at the university! Good thing, too...', 'Audio/Dialogue/Leagues/SettlersOfKalguur/Isla/Isla/IslaSettlers_27.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[676]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(18169, 'IslaSettlersOnOriath', '[]', 'I heard about Oriath. I''ve no love for that city. I... wasn''t treated very well there...', 'Audio/Dialogue/Leagues/SettlersOfKalguur/Isla/Isla/IslaSettlers_28.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[676]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(18170, 'IslaSettlersOnKingsmarch', '[]', 'This place is going to be grand! When that handsome Dannig spins his tales about the years to come, I can see it as clearly as I see my inventions in my head. I''d rather be working here than for the Templars any day.', 'Audio/Dialogue/Leagues/SettlersOfKalguur/Isla/Isla/IslaSettlers_29.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[676]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(18171, 'IslaSettlersOnTheRing', '[]', '<i>{Hush!} We can''t have anybody overhearing that kind of business! ', 'Audio/Dialogue/Leagues/SettlersOfKalguur/Isla/Isla/IslaSettlers_30.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[676]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(18172, 'IslaSettlersRecruited', '[]', 'You want <i>{me} to be your engineer? This ''Kingsmarch'' sounds like a place for a proper and upstanding job. Been awhile since I had one of those. Hmm... I''ll give it a look.', 'Audio/Dialogue/Leagues/SettlersOfKalguur/Isla/Isla/IslaSettlers_31.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[676]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(18173, 'IslaSettlersIntroInHeist', '[]', 'Got somethin'' needs made? Or unmade? I can take ''em apart fast as I—oh, it''s you! I hope you won''t hold this moonlighting against me... science is a costly business. An inventor''s got to make ends meet! All''s fair, I won''t even ask what''s brought you here. Welcome.', 'Audio/Dialogue/Leagues/SettlersOfKalguur/Isla/Isla/IslaSettlers_32.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[676]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(18174, 'IslaSettlersGlyph', '[]', 'I''m so happy you''re alive! I always wondered what happened to you. A shame about your father. He was the smartest man I''ve ever known. Of course I''ll keep you apprised of my progress with the map devices! We should definitely correspond about the strange effect Kalguuran runes have on portals. I''ll send more in my next letter.', 'Audio/Dialogue/Leagues/SettlersOfKalguur/Isla/Isla_Glyph/IslaSettlers_Glyph_01.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[676,688]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(18175, 'IslaSettlersWildBuildingReaction', '[]', 'My very own <i>{invention-atorium!}', 'Audio/Dialogue/Leagues/SettlersOfKalguur/Isla/Isla_Wild/IslaSettlers_Wild_01.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[676]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(18176, 'IslaSettlersWildApproach_Random', '[]', 'Oh, hello there!', 'Audio/Dialogue/Leagues/SettlersOfKalguur/Isla/Isla_Wild/IslaSettlers_Wild_13_01.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[676]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(18177, 'IslaSettlersWildApproach_2', '[]', 'Oh, hello there!', 'Audio/Dialogue/Leagues/SettlersOfKalguur/Isla/Isla_Wild/IslaSettlers_Wild_13_02.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[676]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
