(19469, 'SirusShortCooldownAMtx', '[]', '', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/SirusCombat/SI_14_1B.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[407]', NULL, 1, 0, '[]', 100),
(19470, 'SirusShortCooldownAHumanMtx', '[]', '', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Sirus/SI_33B.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 1, '[407]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(19471, 'JohanIntroTown', '[]', 'My name is Johan, and I am from the far east. My people, the Kalguurans, are attempting to build a settlement near here. We could use someone with your talents. You know the land, you know the dangers. Will you join us? I''ll await your answer in Kingsmarch.', 'Audio/Dialogue/Leagues/SettlersOfKalguur/Johan/Johan/Johan_01.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[667,668]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(19472, 'JohanIntroKingsmarch', '[]', 'I am glad you decided to join us. I hesitate to call you ''Exile,'' for we are all exiles in this foreign land. As the King''s Hand, I serve as Treasurer of Kingsmarch. Come to me for all financial and resource management matters.', 'Audio/Dialogue/Leagues/SettlersOfKalguur/Johan/Johan/Johan_02.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[667,668]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(19473, 'JohanQuestTalkToFaustus', '[]', 'We have contracted Captain Faustus, of the <i>{Fair Marylene}, for ties to the markets of Wraeclast. Speak to him next. I am certain we will all be working together very closely.', 'Audio/Dialogue/Leagues/SettlersOfKalguur/Johan/Johan/Johan_03.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 45000, 1, '[667,668]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(19474, 'JohanQuestReturnFromFaustus', '[]', 'Next, you should familiarise yourself with our recruitment processes. Introduce yourself to Raulf, hire a recruit, and then return to me to discuss placement.', 'Audio/Dialogue/Leagues/SettlersOfKalguur/Johan/Johan/Johan_04.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 45000, 1, '[667,668]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(19475, 'JohanQuestReturnFromRaulf', '[]', 'You''ve hired someone? Then let''s place them in a role.', 'Audio/Dialogue/Leagues/SettlersOfKalguur/Johan/Johan/Johan_05.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[667,668]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(19476, 'JohanQuestAddGoldToTreasury', '[]', 'We''ll also need some initial funding for wages and administration. Deposit some gold in the Treasury, and we''ll speak further.', 'Audio/Dialogue/Leagues/SettlersOfKalguur/Johan/Johan/Johan_06.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[667,668]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(19477, 'JohanQuestInvestment', '[]', 'The last thing we need to discuss is <i>{investment.} Necessary infrastructure will require substantial resources. For now, make our first investment in our Recruitment capabilities, just to learn the process.', 'Audio/Dialogue/Leagues/SettlersOfKalguur/Johan/Johan/Johan_07.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[667,668]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(19478, 'JohanQuestComplete', '[]', 'These beginnings may seem inauspicious, but I believe great things lie ahead. As long as we cooperate, both with each other and with the Charter''s laws, everything will go according to plan.', 'Audio/Dialogue/Leagues/SettlersOfKalguur/Johan/Johan/Johan_08.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[667,668]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(19479, 'JohanOnKingsmarch', '[]', 'Several of our people were already here in Wraeclast, undertaking expeditions of their own. When their outpost reached a certain size, the King, in his great wisdom, gifted them an official charter—and a name. I was sent to aid in the execution and management of that charter. I serve as the King''s Hand.', 'Audio/Dialogue/Leagues/SettlersOfKalguur/Johan/Johan/Johan_09.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[667,668,669]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(19480, 'JohanOnAbilities', '[]', 'You don''t appear to employ the power of runes, like we Kalguurans do. I am very curious how you accomplished what you did. I see that you have upon your person one of those so-called ''virtue gems,'' but Nessa allowed me to borrow one, and it did nothing as far as I could determine.', 'Audio/Dialogue/Leagues/SettlersOfKalguur/Johan/Johan/Johan_10.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[667,668,669]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(19481, 'JohanOnRunes', '[]', 'You''ll have to ask our smith, Dannig, about runes. I am a man of figures and calculation, not metallurgy. You might actually know more than I do, if you''re familiar with your ''Ezomytes.'' They use a system of runes that is... oddly similar to our own.', 'Audio/Dialogue/Leagues/SettlersOfKalguur/Johan/Johan/Johan_11.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[667,668,669]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(19482, 'JohanOnHome', '[]', 'I am from Kalguur, on the continent of Middengard. We have reached Wraeclast by ship. The journey was quite long, and quite dangerous. Eventually, we may be able to open trade with Kalguur, but for now, we''re on our own.', 'Audio/Dialogue/Leagues/SettlersOfKalguur/Johan/Johan/Johan_12.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[667,668,669]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(19483, 'JohanOnTheKing', '[]', 'A reckoning is coming, have no doubt about that. The King has his eye on Wraeclast, and he lays far-reaching plans. Only time will tell...', 'Audio/Dialogue/Leagues/SettlersOfKalguur/Johan/Johan/Johan_13.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[667,668,669]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(19484, 'JohanOnLoyalty', '[]', 'I make no secret that I am a man of two loyalties. I must serve the King''s wishes, and I must also serve this Charter to the letter of the law. I am aware that Kingsmarch is a destination for many that would be considered... less than upstanding citizens. So long as I directly see no evidence of crime, sedition, or another rebellion, there is no conflict of interest. Kindly do not discuss your thoughts in my presence.', 'Audio/Dialogue/Leagues/SettlersOfKalguur/Johan/Johan/Johan_14.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[667,668,669]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(19485, 'JohanOnTheTavern', '[]', 'I choose not to waste resources on a gilded office. It is here, in the Tavern, where drink and loose talk best meet. My presence may, hopefully, keep any <i>{dangerous talk} to the shadows... where it belongs.', 'Audio/Dialogue/Leagues/SettlersOfKalguur/Johan/Johan/Johan_15.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[667,668,669]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(19486, 'JohanWildHalfGold_Random', '[]', 'We are down to half of our Dinar reserves.', 'Audio/Dialogue/Leagues/SettlersOfKalguur/Johan/Johan_Wild/Johan_Wild_01_01A.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[667]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(19487, 'JohanWildHalfGold_2', '[]', 'We are down to half of our Dinar reserves.', 'Audio/Dialogue/Leagues/SettlersOfKalguur/Johan/Johan_Wild/Johan_Wild_01_01B.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[667]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
