(20307, 'Eagon_Wild_BossKillCallout_18', '[]', 'You''ve done it!', 'Audio/Dialogue/Atlas/SecretsOfTheAtlas/Eagon/Eagon_Wild/Eagon_Wild_BossKillCallout_06_03.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[707,708,709,710,714]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(20308, 'Eagon_Wild_BossKillCallout_19', '[]', 'You''ve done it!', 'Audio/Dialogue/Atlas/SecretsOfTheAtlas/Eagon/Eagon_Wild/Eagon_Wild_BossKillCallout_06_04.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[707,708,709,710,714]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(20309, 'Eagon_P2_ReactionToAtlasChange', '[]', 'I struggle to understand her. How can she believe this is the only way?' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
She has rearranged the very fabric of the Atlas. It''s impressive, albeit... foreboding. But why? My ignorance leaves me fearful.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
It is imperative that I understand the mechanisms by which she is shaping this reality. If we are fortunate, understanding <i>{how} she is shaping it might illuminate <i>{why}.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Zana believes she is doing the right thing... But her choices are putting us all in danger. Can she not see that?', 'Audio/Dialogue/Atlas/SecretsOfTheAtlas/Eagon/Eagon/Eagon_P2_01.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[707,708,709,710,714]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(20310, 'Eagon_P2_BeginThoughtChasingQuest', '[]', 'It''s strange... when I returned, I found myself holding something. I''ve not seen anything like it, yet... I feel I know what must be done with it.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
I believe this object can isolate Zana''s thoughts. We must find what Zana was thinking when she fractured the Atlas. If we can focus on her methods of reshaping, this might be <i>{exactly} what we need.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
How such a fortuitous object ended up in my hand... Your guess is as good as mine. Take it. Venture into the Atlas once more. ', 'Audio/Dialogue/Atlas/SecretsOfTheAtlas/Eagon/Eagon/Eagon_P2_02.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[707,708,709,710,714]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(20311, 'Eagon_P2_FirstMissionSuccess', '[]', 'This is it. The embodiment of her residual thought. A veritable treasure trove of information... and yes, trinkets for you, I''m sure - don''t you worry, my friend! ' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
If my calculations are correct, we can travel into her thought now that you''ve dealt with the threats surrounding it.', 'Audio/Dialogue/Atlas/SecretsOfTheAtlas/Eagon/Eagon/Eagon_P2_03.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[707,708,709,710,714]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(20312, 'Eagon_P2_AfterFirstTemplarVault', '[]', 'Interesting... we haven''t shaped Zana''s exact thoughts... rather, we''ve extracted what Zana researched, but written from the perspective of those whose work she studied.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
I''ve never experienced anything like this. We are studying her studying. It''s thrilling! And more importantly, it''s progress.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
I did not anticipate the dangers our path created. Attempting to extract her thoughts thinned the dimensional barriers around the Atlas. Nothing you can''t handle, I''m sure!' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Were the trinkets you retrieved to your liking, Exile? Because I need to find more answers.', 'Audio/Dialogue/Atlas/SecretsOfTheAtlas/Eagon/Eagon/Eagon_P2_04.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[707,708,709,710,714]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(20313, 'Eagon_P2_FirstFoundCurrency', '[]', 'Excellent work. This confirms we can track down more of Zana''s relevant thoughts. I propose we spread out our explorations of this new Atlas. Perhaps the fracturing has a purpose...', 'Audio/Dialogue/Atlas/SecretsOfTheAtlas/Eagon/Eagon/Eagon_P2_05.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[707,708,709,710,714]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(20314, 'Eagon_P2_OnEagonsHistory', '[]', 'I''ve been thinking. If I am not Valdo''s bastard, why was the family who raised me so distressed by my questioning? The maid was familiar enough with the man to <i>{hum his favorite tune.}' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Possibilities race through my mind. Perhaps only the maid knew Valdo? Perhaps my foster family despised the Caeserius''s? Perhaps I am not Valdo''s child, but Zana''s? I could go on... no theory feels quite right.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
The unfortunate conclusion looming before me is: my memories might not be my own. Be they fabrications, or someone else''s, I cannot proclaim with confidence that my history is even real.', 'Audio/Dialogue/Atlas/SecretsOfTheAtlas/Eagon/Eagon/Eagon_P2_06.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[707,708,709,710,714]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(20315, 'Eagon_P2_AllTemplarVaultsWitnessed', '[]', 'Thank you, Exile. I am beginning to understand what Zana''s plans are. Unfortunately, by the time we can put this understanding to action... it is probable that Zana will be lost.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
From what we''ve gathered, Zana has created her own map device, and used some separate arcana to amplify her shaping abilities. ' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Pinpointing her location <i>{now} will be... difficult, to put it mildly. Her reshaping of the Atlas is tactical. She has hidden the Nexus, where she likely resides.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
But why shed her memories to destroy the Atlas? Who is she trying to stop? Does she not see that she is creating more danger? We don''t yet have the full picture.', 'Audio/Dialogue/Atlas/SecretsOfTheAtlas/Eagon/Eagon/Eagon_P2_07.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[707,708,709,710,714]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(20316, 'Eagon_P2_WhatsNext', '[]', 'This may sound strange, but I feel... if I knew who I was, it would help us stop Zana. ' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
When we found her, she was genuinely surprised to see me. It threw her off... and at that moment, I saw her conviction falter. ' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Am I... her weakness? She said "<i>{I} must not understand." Did she keep me away for a specific reason? Next time we meet, I want to disarm her further.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
We must find where Zana is located. We may not be able to stop her... but she could stop herself.', 'Audio/Dialogue/Atlas/SecretsOfTheAtlas/Eagon/Eagon/Eagon_P2_08.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[707,708,709,710,714]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(20317, 'Eagon_P2_OnSubstance', '[]', 'That substance... it reminds me of a Templar device, though what we''ve found is only an approximation. The Thought Extractor, it was called. I''ve always wanted to try one... within ethical parameters, of course!' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
A favorite of Templar interrogators, it could project someone''s thoughts as visions directly into the mind of the interrogator. It was able to extract truths from even the most suppressed recesses of one''s mind.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Memories are not too different from thoughts. We should be able to use this substance and extract the information we need from Zana''s mind.', 'Audio/Dialogue/Atlas/SecretsOfTheAtlas/Eagon/Eagon/Eagon_P2_09.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[707,708,709,710,714]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(20318, 'Eagon_P2_OnFindingMoreSubstance', '[]', 'I am certain there is more of this to be found. Its appearance is a byproduct of Zana''s reshaping of the Atlas.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Zana''s meddling has seemingly created this substance from her memories, an unintended residue of her tangential thoughts while constructing corporeal manifestations of these principal moments... given a physical form restricted by the framework of her singular lived experience. Obviously!' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Oh, right - let me simplify it for you: find more of that substance!', 'Audio/Dialogue/Atlas/SecretsOfTheAtlas/Eagon/Eagon/Eagon_P2_10.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[707,708,709,710,714]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(20319, 'Eagon_P2_OnZana', '[]', 'I never wondered why I did not appear in any of Zana''s writings. Obviously, as her secret half-brother, she would have no idea who I was... ' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
But now I know that isn''t true, I''m left questioning everything. I have never felt less in control. Let me tell you, I hate that, exile.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Who am I to her? I am now pained by the thought that she loves me, yet I have left no impression on her life worthy of putting pen to paper.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
She spent decades studying the Atlas, after our... <i>{her} father lost himself in pursuit of the Elder. Zana was the only person intelligent enough to stop him <i>{and} complete his mission of banishing the Elder. ' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Her drive inspired me. I was going to surpass Valdo, and even Zana, in their accomplishments. I knew they''d be proud... if they knew who I was.  ' || char(13) || '
          ' || char(13) || '
In a twisted way, I <i>{am} following in her footsteps. Just as she stopped the Shaper, I must stop Zana, to save her from what she could become.', 'Audio/Dialogue/Atlas/SecretsOfTheAtlas/Eagon/Eagon/Eagon_P2_11.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[707,708,709,710,714]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(20320, 'Eagon_P2_OnTemplarVaults', '[]', 'It''s not a literal place, if that''s what you''re asking. We did not just invade a Templar treasury. Like many things in the Atlas, the figurative must become tangible to be traversable.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Unlike her memories, these Templar vaults are conceptual representations. A physical manifestation of their secured vaults is an apt allegory for the information Zana wanted to hide.', 'Audio/Dialogue/Atlas/SecretsOfTheAtlas/Eagon/Eagon/Eagon_P2_12.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[707,708,709,710,714]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(20321, 'Eagon_P2_OnIslasVault_A', '[]', 'You say you know this "Isla"? Is she as unstable as she sounds?' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
She''s been in contact with Zana, and recently. It''s hard to believe she was once a Templar, when she''s performing such bold and, frankly, dangerous experimentation.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
To combine a map device with other magics, like runes, which draw power from differing arcanas... now that I''ve considered it a moment, it''s actually inspired. Why did I never think of that?' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Different peoples created their own map devices. The designs changed, but the functionality was relatively constant. Why not engineer it further?' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
I surmise that Zana has altered her own map device. I''m not sure how, but they must be powerful alterations, if she could reshape the Atlas so quickly. ', 'Audio/Dialogue/Atlas/SecretsOfTheAtlas/Eagon/Eagon/Eagon_P2_13_01.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[707,708,709,710,714]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(20322, 'Eagon_P2_OnIslasVault_B', '[]', 'This "Isla" character seems... dodgy.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
She''s been in contact with Zana, and recently. It''s hard to believe she was once a Templar, when she''s performing such bold and, frankly, dangerous experimentation.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
To combine a map device with other magics, like runes, which draw power from differing arcanas... now that I''ve considered it a moment, it''s actually inspired. Why did I never think of that?' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Different peoples created their own map devices. The designs changed, but the functionality was relatively constant. Why not engineer it further?' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
I surmise that Zana has altered her own map device. I''m not sure how, but they must be powerful alterations, if she could reshape the Atlas so quickly.', 'Audio/Dialogue/Atlas/SecretsOfTheAtlas/Eagon/Eagon/Eagon_P2_13_02.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[707,708,709,710,714]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(20323, 'Eagon_P2_OnVenariusVault', '[]', 'I''m surprised that Zana would even <i>{consider} lessons from High Templar Venarius. He was the reason her father disappeared... he''s undoubtedly a villain, but doubly so to her personally.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Maybe she''s looking at where he went wrong? Trying to barter with the Elder was absurd, in hindsight. The Elder ended up being a bigger threat than the interdimensional demons Venarius feared. ' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
The Atlas is a beacon for powerful beings. It allows them access to Wraeclast, among other realms. And the number of entities being drawn toward the Atlas seems to only grow.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
I would quite enjoy seeing the High Templar''s face upon hearing the Elder''s defeat attracted three more Eldritch entities in its stead...', 'Audio/Dialogue/Atlas/SecretsOfTheAtlas/Eagon/Eagon/Eagon_P2_14.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[707,708,709,710,714]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(20324, 'Eagon_P2_OnValdoVault', '[]', 'I''ve read about this Nexus of the Atlas. Sirus escaped into Oriath by obscuring his plans with a "storm at the heart of the Atlas." That''s also where the Shaper built his stronghold. ' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
I knew the Nexus was the Elder''s dreamlands, but I did not realize the Atlas originally consisted <i>{only} of the dreamlands. ' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
It''s strange to imagine it as anything less than infinite. It feels only natural for the Atlas to contain multitudes. Were the Atlas''s realms all created by Valdo?' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
For Zana to have such impressive powers... I''m certain that Zana''s base of operations is the Nexus. However, her alterations to the Atlas have made identifying this "Nexus"... complicated.', 'Audio/Dialogue/Atlas/SecretsOfTheAtlas/Eagon/Eagon/Eagon_P2_15.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[707,708,709,710,714]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(20325, 'Eagon_P2_OnZanaVault', '[]', 'Zana wrote often about the enticing nature of the Atlas. Prolonged exposure caused madness - a very particular madness. The Atlas offers to fulfill one''s greatest desires. ' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Her warnings were adamant enough that I have consciously limited my time in there. She wrote as if the Atlas had its own goals, its own discernment. A burgeoning sentience, rather than inert malleable clay.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
I wonder how much time Zana has spent in the Atlas? How did she stay sane, when all her companions could not? ' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Perhaps that is why Zana is shedding her own memories - she is purging herself of the hopes the Atlas might tempt her with. ' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
But... I think it''s deeper than that. Zana managed to fight the Atlas''s influence with her memories intact for years. Why purge them now? If the Atlas has awareness... what does it desire?', 'Audio/Dialogue/Atlas/SecretsOfTheAtlas/Eagon/Eagon/Eagon_P2_16.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[707,708,709,710,714]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(20326, 'Eagon_P2_FirstQuestCurrencyVoidstone', '[]', 'Well, that''s not <i>{exactly} what I expected. Follow the path, but... be careful, Exile.', 'Audio/Dialogue/Atlas/SecretsOfTheAtlas/Eagon/Eagon_Wild/Eagon_P2_Wild_01.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[707,708,709,710,714]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
