(20790, 'ZanaSecret_Glyph_One', '[]', 'There was a time I saw the Atlas as a miracle — a gateway to infinite potential. How naïve I was.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
It is no promised land. It is none of the things I, or my father, once hoped it might be.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
The Atlas has become a lure for the ambitious. A tool for those who would shape reality to their will – and a trap for those who cannot see the cost. By the time they understand what it truly is, if they ever do, it''s already begun to take hold.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
It does not consume you all at once. It wears you down. Thought by thought. Layer by layer. Until you are something else entirely.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
I wish I could say that I knew how to stop it. But I will find a way. I have to.', 'Audio/Dialogue/Atlas/SecretsOfTheAtlas/Zana/Zana_Glyph/ZanaSecret_Glyph_01.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[734]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(20791, 'ZanaSecret_Glyph_Two', '[]', 'Sirus and I enjoyed a simple collegial relationship, at first... it was hard not to be impressed by him. He was the finest of the Elderslayers – the brightest mind I had ever encountered.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Together, we wholly dedicated ourselves to combating the growing threat within the Atlas.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
But as with all singular pursuits, we grew blind to the dangers around us. Too possessed by purpose to consider the cost – to ourselves, and to one another.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Over time, the Atlas took hold of Sirus. His transformation was not merely of flesh, but of purpose. Twisted into something... unrecognisable. Whatever existed between us, died alongside who he once was.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Perhaps it was my fault. I should have seen the signs, should have prepared him for what awaited us. I should have seen many things... now, I choose not to see. I choose not to see the decay, the distortion... the misery.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
What happened to Sirus must never happen again. No more will be lost. No more pain. It is why my work with the Atlas remains not only vital, but necessary.', 'Audio/Dialogue/Atlas/SecretsOfTheAtlas/Zana/Zana_Glyph/ZanaSecret_Glyph_02.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[735]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(20792, 'ZanaSecret_Glyph_Three', '[]', 'The odds against success were... beyond measure. And yet, somehow, it worked.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
I set the threads in motion across time and space, and intervened before the timeline that would have consumed him began to take shape.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
What he remembers - what he <i>{believes}... is enough. He lives, untethered to the Atlas, unburdened by what came before – or after.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
It was the only way to save him. And perhaps, the only way to save us all.', 'Audio/Dialogue/Atlas/SecretsOfTheAtlas/Zana/Zana_Glyph/ZanaSecret_Glyph_03.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[736]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(20793, 'ZanaSecret_Glyph_Four', '[]', 'Few can claim to have as much blood on their hands as the Templars. In their thirst for power, they cared not who they trampled – whose lives were ruined, whose families were torn apart at the seams.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
A handful of men, and yet they commanded thousands. Thousands willing to commit horrors in the name of ''virtue''.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
My own memories of the Templars are nothing short of brutal. What they did to my family... what they did to so many...' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
And always, behind it all, the Atlas – the great unspoken prize. They saw it not as a danger, but as a weapon. A path to dominion.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
When power is given form, it invites those willing to twist it. The Templars did just that – and the scars remain, burned into the world... and into those of us who survived.', 'Audio/Dialogue/Atlas/SecretsOfTheAtlas/Zana/Zana_Glyph/ZanaSecret_Glyph_04.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[737]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(20794, 'ZanaSecret_Glyph_Five', '[]', 'I believed I had set enough safeguards in place to prevent him from following in my footsteps. More fool I, to underestimate one such as him. ' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
That he came this far – that he reached so deep into the Atlas – perhaps it was inevitable.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
A part of me cannot help but feel... proud. He overcame every obstacle I placed before him.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
But there remains one barrier he must never breach.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Some truths unravel more than they reveal. Each thread he plucks in search of answers draws us nearer to disaster.', 'Audio/Dialogue/Atlas/SecretsOfTheAtlas/Zana/Zana_Glyph/ZanaSecret_Glyph_05.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[738]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(20795, 'ZanaSecret_Glyph_Six', '[]', 'Belief can elevate. It can also erase. I''ve seen it in men... and in those who rose to godhood.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
There is no greater irony in all of Wraeclast than the name Innocence – a symbol of supposed purity, used to justify untold atrocities. From the time I was a child, I saw what belief in his name could do. What it <i>{did}. Such memories do not fade.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Faith, when unchallenged, becomes a force no less dangerous than any god. And the Atlas... is no different. It does not ask for worship. But it rewards devotion, in a twisted sense of the word. It remakes those who follow it – not into saints, but into zealots.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
I need look no further than Sirus... or my father...', 'Audio/Dialogue/Atlas/SecretsOfTheAtlas/Zana/Zana_Glyph/ZanaSecret_Glyph_06.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[739]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(20796, 'Zana_FinalMapStartTwo', '[]', 'You must give up this pursuit. Turn back. Leave!', 'Audio/Dialogue/Atlas/SecretsOfTheAtlas/Zana/Zana_GodVoice/Zana_FinalMapStartTwo.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[716,717,718]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(20797, 'Zana_FinalMapStartThree', '[]', 'You refuse to listen... Or perhaps, you do not know <i>{how} to hear me. I do not know which is which anymore', 'Audio/Dialogue/Atlas/SecretsOfTheAtlas/Zana/Zana_GodVoice/Zana_FinalMapStartThree.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[716,717,718]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(20798, 'Zana_GV_PostDestFirstTime', '[]', 'You must give up this pursuit. There is no point... The Atlas must cease to be. How much pain must it cause? How much loss must we endure? All manner of beings give in to its power... it is so... alluring. I say no more! I say let it fester and rot in the void of nothingness!', 'Audio/Dialogue/Atlas/SecretsOfTheAtlas/Zana/Zana_GodVoice/Zana_GV_MapCallouts_01.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[716,717,718]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(20799, 'Zana_GV_Random', '[]', 'Abandon this fool''s errand, I beg of you. If you do not, only ruin awaits. ', 'Audio/Dialogue/Atlas/SecretsOfTheAtlas/Zana/Zana_GodVoice/Zana_GV_MapCallouts_02.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[716,717,718]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(20800, 'Zana_GV_2', '[]', 'The Atlas is a prison, not a prize. Leave it behind.', 'Audio/Dialogue/Atlas/SecretsOfTheAtlas/Zana/Zana_GodVoice/Zana_GV_MapCallouts_03.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[716,717,718]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(20801, 'Zana_GV_3', '[]', 'You cannot master the Atlas. No one can.', 'Audio/Dialogue/Atlas/SecretsOfTheAtlas/Zana/Zana_GodVoice/Zana_GV_MapCallouts_04.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[716,717,718]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(20802, 'Zana_GV_4', '[]', 'Each step you take binds you tighter to the ruin we sought to escape.', 'Audio/Dialogue/Atlas/SecretsOfTheAtlas/Zana/Zana_GodVoice/Zana_GV_MapCallouts_05.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[716,717,718]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(20803, 'Zana_GV_5', '[]', 'Can''t you see? The deeper you go, the less of you will remain.', 'Audio/Dialogue/Atlas/SecretsOfTheAtlas/Zana/Zana_GodVoice/Zana_GV_MapCallouts_06.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[716,717,718]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(20804, 'Zana_GV_6', '[]', 'What do you hope to find here? Devastation is all that awaits', 'Audio/Dialogue/Atlas/SecretsOfTheAtlas/Zana/Zana_GodVoice/Zana_GV_MapCallouts_07.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[716,717,718]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(20805, 'Zana_GV_7', '[]', 'The Atlas twists all fates. Begone from here.', 'Audio/Dialogue/Atlas/SecretsOfTheAtlas/Zana/Zana_GodVoice/Zana_GV_MapCallouts_08.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[716,717,718]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(20806, 'Zana_GV_8', '[]', 'There is no salvation to be found here. Only the gradual undoing of all that you are.', 'Audio/Dialogue/Atlas/SecretsOfTheAtlas/Zana/Zana_GodVoice/Zana_GV_MapCallouts_09.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[716,717,718]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(20807, 'Zana_GV_9', '[]', 'You are not conquering the Atlas. It is conquering you.', 'Audio/Dialogue/Atlas/SecretsOfTheAtlas/Zana/Zana_GodVoice/Zana_GV_MapCallouts_10.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[716,717,718]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(20808, 'Zana_GV_10', '[]', 'Please... do not make my mistakes your own.', 'Audio/Dialogue/Atlas/SecretsOfTheAtlas/Zana/Zana_GodVoice/Zana_GV_MapCallouts_11.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[716,717,718]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(20809, 'Zana_GV_11', '[]', 'You gamble with forces you barely comprehend.', 'Audio/Dialogue/Atlas/SecretsOfTheAtlas/Zana/Zana_GodVoice/Zana_GV_MapCallouts_12.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[716,717,718]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(20810, 'Zana_GV_12', '[]', 'Rid yourself of your delusions. The Atlas cannot be studied – only destroyed.', 'Audio/Dialogue/Atlas/SecretsOfTheAtlas/Zana/Zana_GodVoice/Zana_GV_MapCallouts_13.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[716,717,718]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(20811, 'Zana_GV_13', '[]', 'You follow in my footsteps. In my father''s footsteps. That alone should give you pause.', 'Audio/Dialogue/Atlas/SecretsOfTheAtlas/Zana/Zana_GodVoice/Zana_GV_MapCallouts_14.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[716,717,718]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(20812, 'Zana_GV_14', '[]', 'Perhaps your intentions are good. So were mine. It makes no difference to the Atlas.', 'Audio/Dialogue/Atlas/SecretsOfTheAtlas/Zana/Zana_GodVoice/Zana_GV_MapCallouts_15.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[716,717,718]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(20813, 'Zana_GV_15', '[]', 'Abandon all pretenses and save yourself – while you still can.', 'Audio/Dialogue/Atlas/SecretsOfTheAtlas/Zana/Zana_GodVoice/Zana_GV_MapCallouts_16.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[716,717,718]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(20814, 'Zana_GV_16', '[]', 'There is no honour in what you are doing. Only hubris.', 'Audio/Dialogue/Atlas/SecretsOfTheAtlas/Zana/Zana_GodVoice/Zana_GV_MapCallouts_17.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[716,717,718]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(20815, 'Zana_GV_17', '[]', 'What you perceive is not the same as what is.', 'Audio/Dialogue/Atlas/SecretsOfTheAtlas/Zana/Zana_GodVoice/Zana_GV_MapCallouts_18.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[716,717,718]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(20816, 'Zana_GV_18', '[]', 'Stay out... Stay sane.', 'Audio/Dialogue/Atlas/SecretsOfTheAtlas/Zana/Zana_GodVoice/Zana_GV_MapCallouts_19.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[716,717,718]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(20817, 'Zana_GV_19', '[]', 'Your sanity is not promised to you here.', 'Audio/Dialogue/Atlas/SecretsOfTheAtlas/Zana/Zana_GodVoice/Zana_GV_MapCallouts_20.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[716,717,718]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(20818, 'Zana_GV_20', '[]', 'Lose yourself within this thread and I cannot help you. Leave now.', 'Audio/Dialogue/Atlas/SecretsOfTheAtlas/Zana/Zana_GodVoice/Zana_GV_MapCallouts_21.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[716,717,718]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(20819, 'Zana_GV_21', '[]', 'I am where I must be... you are not.', 'Audio/Dialogue/Atlas/SecretsOfTheAtlas/Zana/Zana_GodVoice/Zana_GV_MapCallouts_22.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[716,717,718]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(20820, 'Zana_GV_22', '[]', 'The more you aid him, the more harm you bring upon him.', 'Audio/Dialogue/Atlas/SecretsOfTheAtlas/Zana/Zana_GodVoice/Zana_GV_MapCallouts_23.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[716,717,718]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(20821, 'Zana_GV_23', '[]', 'Stay sane... exile.', 'Audio/Dialogue/Atlas/SecretsOfTheAtlas/Zana/Zana_GodVoice/Zana_GV_StaySane_01.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[716,717,718]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(20822, 'Zana_GV_24', '[]', 'Stay sane... exile.', 'Audio/Dialogue/Atlas/SecretsOfTheAtlas/Zana/Zana_GodVoice/Zana_GV_StaySane_02.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[716,717,718]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(20823, 'Zana_GV_25', '[]', 'Stay sane... exile.', 'Audio/Dialogue/Atlas/SecretsOfTheAtlas/Zana/Zana_GodVoice/Zana_GV_StaySane_03.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[716,717,718]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(20824, 'Zana_Wild_EagonTalkOne', '[]', 'I <i>{do} know you. Listen to me. This cannot be stopped. It <i>{must} not be stopped. You should leave and do not search for me again. This... is what must be.', 'Audio/Dialogue/Atlas/SecretsOfTheAtlas/Zana/Zana_Wild_Boss/Zana_Wild_01.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[716,717,718]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(20825, 'Zana_Wild_EagonTalkTwoOne', '[]', 'There is nothing to say. You will not understand. You <i>{must} not understand.', 'Audio/Dialogue/Atlas/SecretsOfTheAtlas/Zana/Zana_Wild_Boss/Zana_Wild_02_01.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[716,717,718]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(20826, 'Zana_Wild_EagonTalkTwoTwo', '[]', 'There is no other way to stop them. There is no other way to stop... him. I am sorry.', 'Audio/Dialogue/Atlas/SecretsOfTheAtlas/Zana/Zana_Wild_Boss/Zana_Wild_02_02.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[716,717,718]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(20827, 'Zana_Wild_EagonTalkThree', '[]', 'You will never give up, will you? I suppose I should have known.', 'Audio/Dialogue/Atlas/SecretsOfTheAtlas/Zana/Zana_Wild_Boss/Zana_Wild_03.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[716,717,718]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(20828, 'Zana_Wild_ConvoOne', '[]', 'There are some truths we cannot know. Some realities we cannot allow. And... Sometimes we, ourselves, cannot be saved.', 'Audio/Dialogue/Atlas/SecretsOfTheAtlas/Zana/Zana_Wild/Zana_Wild_04_01.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[716,717,718]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(20829, 'Zana_Wild_ConvoTwo', '[]', 'I cannot. I have suffered too long here to fail now. It has almost broken me. But I must succeed. The only way is to destroy it. It all must be destroyed.', 'Audio/Dialogue/Atlas/SecretsOfTheAtlas/Zana/Zana_Wild/Zana_Wild_04_02.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[716,717,718]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(20830, 'Zana_Wild_ConvoThree', '[]', 'The Atlas.', 'Audio/Dialogue/Atlas/SecretsOfTheAtlas/Zana/Zana_Wild/Zana_Wild_04_03.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[716,717,718]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(20831, 'Zana_Wild_ConvoFour', '[]', 'It has already begun. The imbalance is almost at its peak. I must remain, for I am the catalyst. Afterwards, no one can harness its power.', 'Audio/Dialogue/Atlas/SecretsOfTheAtlas/Zana/Zana_Wild/Zana_Wild_04_04.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[716,717,718]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(20832, 'Zana_Wild_ConvoFive', '[]', 'Enough. I am <i>{not} your sister. ', 'Audio/Dialogue/Atlas/SecretsOfTheAtlas/Zana/Zana_Wild/Zana_Wild_04_05.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[716,717,718]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(20833, 'Zana_Wild_ConvoSix', '[]', 'You mean... much to me. More than you could ever know. And that is why, it must all be destroyed.', 'Audio/Dialogue/Atlas/SecretsOfTheAtlas/Zana/Zana_Wild/Zana_Wild_04_06.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[716,717,718]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(20834, 'Zana_Wild_AngerCallouts_Random', '[]', 'His fury unleashes!', 'Audio/Dialogue/Atlas/SecretsOfTheAtlas/Zana/Zana_Wild/Zana_Wild_AngerCallouts_01.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[716,717,718]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(20835, 'Zana_Wild_AngerCallouts_2', '[]', 'His fury unleashes!', 'Audio/Dialogue/Atlas/SecretsOfTheAtlas/Zana/Zana_Wild/Zana_Wild_AngerCallouts_02.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[716,717,718]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(20836, 'Zana_Wild_AngerCallouts_3', '[]', 'His fury unleashes!', 'Audio/Dialogue/Atlas/SecretsOfTheAtlas/Zana/Zana_Wild/Zana_Wild_AngerCallouts_03.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[716,717,718]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(20837, 'Zana_Wild_AngerCallouts_4', '[]', 'His anger consumes him!', 'Audio/Dialogue/Atlas/SecretsOfTheAtlas/Zana/Zana_Wild/Zana_Wild_AngerCallouts_04.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[716,717,718]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(20838, 'Zana_Wild_AngerCallouts_5', '[]', 'His anger consumes him!', 'Audio/Dialogue/Atlas/SecretsOfTheAtlas/Zana/Zana_Wild/Zana_Wild_AngerCallouts_05.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[716,717,718]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(20839, 'Zana_Wild_AngerCallouts_6', '[]', 'His anger consumes him!', 'Audio/Dialogue/Atlas/SecretsOfTheAtlas/Zana/Zana_Wild/Zana_Wild_AngerCallouts_06.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[716,717,718]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(20840, 'Zana_Wild_AngerCallouts_7', '[]', 'He is not himself...', 'Audio/Dialogue/Atlas/SecretsOfTheAtlas/Zana/Zana_Wild/Zana_Wild_AngerCallouts_07.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[716,717,718]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(20841, 'Zana_Wild_AngerCallouts_8', '[]', 'He is not himself...', 'Audio/Dialogue/Atlas/SecretsOfTheAtlas/Zana/Zana_Wild/Zana_Wild_AngerCallouts_08.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[716,717,718]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(20842, 'Zana_Wild_AngerCallouts_9', '[]', 'He is not himself...', 'Audio/Dialogue/Atlas/SecretsOfTheAtlas/Zana/Zana_Wild/Zana_Wild_AngerCallouts_09.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[716,717,718]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(20843, 'Zana_Wild_AngerCallouts_10', '[]', 'He is not the Father I knew...', 'Audio/Dialogue/Atlas/SecretsOfTheAtlas/Zana/Zana_Wild/Zana_Wild_AngerCallouts_10.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[716,717,718]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(20844, 'Zana_Wild_AngerCallouts_11', '[]', 'He is not the Father I knew...', 'Audio/Dialogue/Atlas/SecretsOfTheAtlas/Zana/Zana_Wild/Zana_Wild_AngerCallouts_11.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[716,717,718]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(20845, 'Zana_Wild_AngerCallouts_12', '[]', 'He is not the Father I knew...', 'Audio/Dialogue/Atlas/SecretsOfTheAtlas/Zana/Zana_Wild/Zana_Wild_AngerCallouts_12.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[716,717,718]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(20846, 'Zana_Wild_AngerCallouts_13', '[]', 'Stay on your feet!', 'Audio/Dialogue/Atlas/SecretsOfTheAtlas/Zana/Zana_Wild/Zana_Wild_AngerCallouts_13.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[716,717,718]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(20847, 'Zana_Wild_AngerCallouts_14', '[]', 'Stay on your feet!', 'Audio/Dialogue/Atlas/SecretsOfTheAtlas/Zana/Zana_Wild/Zana_Wild_AngerCallouts_14.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[716,717,718]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(20848, 'Zana_Wild_AngerCallouts_15', '[]', 'Stay on your feet!', 'Audio/Dialogue/Atlas/SecretsOfTheAtlas/Zana/Zana_Wild/Zana_Wild_AngerCallouts_15.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[716,717,718]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(20849, 'Zana_Wild_AngerCallouts_16', '[]', 'Fury! Wrath! Fear!', 'Audio/Dialogue/Atlas/SecretsOfTheAtlas/Zana/Zana_Wild/Zana_Wild_AngerCallouts_16.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[716,717,718]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(20850, 'Zana_Wild_AngerCallouts_17', '[]', 'Fury! Wrath! Fear!', 'Audio/Dialogue/Atlas/SecretsOfTheAtlas/Zana/Zana_Wild/Zana_Wild_AngerCallouts_17.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[716,717,718]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(20851, 'Zana_Wild_AngerCallouts_18', '[]', 'Fury! Wrath! Fear!', 'Audio/Dialogue/Atlas/SecretsOfTheAtlas/Zana/Zana_Wild/Zana_Wild_AngerCallouts_18.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[716,717,718]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(20852, 'Zana_Wild_BenevolenceCallouts_Random', '[]', 'His influence overwhelms!', 'Audio/Dialogue/Atlas/SecretsOfTheAtlas/Zana/Zana_Wild/Zana_Wild_BenevolenceCallouts_01.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[716,717,718]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(20853, 'Zana_Wild_BenevolenceCallouts_2', '[]', 'His influence overwhelms!', 'Audio/Dialogue/Atlas/SecretsOfTheAtlas/Zana/Zana_Wild/Zana_Wild_BenevolenceCallouts_02.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[716,717,718]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(20854, 'Zana_Wild_BenevolenceCallouts_3', '[]', 'His influence overwhelms!', 'Audio/Dialogue/Atlas/SecretsOfTheAtlas/Zana/Zana_Wild/Zana_Wild_BenevolenceCallouts_03.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[716,717,718]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(20855, 'Zana_Wild_BenevolenceCallouts_4', '[]', 'Power corrupts all it touches!', 'Audio/Dialogue/Atlas/SecretsOfTheAtlas/Zana/Zana_Wild/Zana_Wild_BenevolenceCallouts_04.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[716,717,718]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
