(23678, 'DjinnDevice_Balbala_Open_28', '[]', 'Tread carefully.', 'Audio/Dialogue/MTX/MapDevices/DjinnMapDevice/BalbalaMapDevice/DjinnMapDevice_Balbala_Open_36.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[766]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(23679, 'DjinnDevice_Balbala_Open_29', '[]', 'Tread carefully.', 'Audio/Dialogue/MTX/MapDevices/DjinnMapDevice/BalbalaMapDevice/DjinnMapDevice_Balbala_Open_37.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[766]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(23680, 'DjinnDevice_Balbala_Open_30', '[]', 'Tread carefully.', 'Audio/Dialogue/MTX/MapDevices/DjinnMapDevice/BalbalaMapDevice/DjinnMapDevice_Balbala_Open_38.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[766]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(23681, 'Kirac_AfterFirstPinnacle', '[]', 'You''re on the right track. Maybe this Eagon fellow is who he claims to be after all. Keep on the trail. If there''s any chance to save Zana, take it.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Kirac/Kirac_AfterFirstPinnacle.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[410,412]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(23682, 'Kirac_AfterThirdPinnacle', '[]', 'Zana intends to destroy the Atlas? It all makes sense now. The Atlas has caused her nothing but pain her entire life. I can''t even begin to recount what she lost - her father, her childhood, her friends, the man she loved... I''m not sure what the consequences will be if she actually manages to bring the Atlas down... but I understand.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Kirac/Kirac_AfterThirdPinnacle.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[410,412]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(23683, 'Kirac_MemeoryTormented', '[]', 'We''ve spied several creatures that appear to be <i>{haunted} in this map. Might be worth your time to investigate.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Kirac/Kirac_MemeoryTormented.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[410,412]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(23684, 'Kirac_MemoryAbyssals', '[]', 'Abyssals have somehow found their way into this map. Let''s... show them the light.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Kirac/Kirac_MemoryAbyssals.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[410,412]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(23685, 'Kirac_MemoryEssenceExiles', '[]', 'From all reports, this map appears to contain some of our former... associates. Exiles that went rogue. Somehow, they''ve gotten themselves trapped in Essence crystals. You could let them out... or not.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Kirac/Kirac_MemoryEssenceExiles.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[410,412]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(23686, 'Kirac_MemoryFlashBreaches', '[]', 'A great host of creatures from another plane are massing, poised to assault this map. It''ll be quick and deadly. We could really use you out there.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Kirac/Kirac_MemoryFlashBreaches.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[410,412]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(23687, 'Kirac_MemoryHarbingerPortals', '[]', 'Those bloody blue bastards are trying to establish a foothold in this map! Get in there and wipe them out, before it''s too late!', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Kirac/Kirac_MemoryHarbingerPortals.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[410,412]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(23688, 'Kirac_MemoryHarvestBeasts', '[]', 'Powerful beasts have migrated into this map. They''re not the usual fare. Be careful.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Kirac/Kirac_MemoryHarvestBeasts.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[410,412]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(23689, 'Kirac_MemoryHugeHarvest', '[]', 'There''s a rather lush harvest in this map, if you''re keen on that sort of thing. Never been much of a farmer myself.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Kirac/Kirac_MemoryHugeHarvest.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[410,412]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(23690, 'Kirac_MemoryPantheon', '[]', 'I never like to mix war and religion, but our scouts have found what can only be described as a <i>{cult} forming among the denizens of this map. It''s probably wise that you look into this.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Kirac/Kirac_MemoryPantheon.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[410,412]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(23691, 'Kirac_MemoryPlayerHarbinger', '[]', 'I don''t even know what to make of this map. Reality has been altered there, somehow. You''ll find yourself changed into one of... <i>{them}.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Kirac/Kirac_MemoryPlayerHarbinger.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[410,412]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(23692, 'Kirac_MemoryReverseIncursion', '[]', 'Someone in the past seems to be trying to break through into our time. It''s probably best you put a stop to that, before everything comes apart.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Kirac/Kirac_MemoryReverseIncursion.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[410,412]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(23693, 'Kirac_MemoryStrongbox', '[]', 'Someone''s laid a vast ambush for you in this map. At least, that''s what I assume all those strongboxes are about. I imagine you''ll open them right up, regardless.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Kirac/Kirac_MemoryStrongbox.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[410,412]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(23694, 'Kirac_OnEagonsArrival', '[]', 'A man claiming to be a Caeserius appears out of the blue... I''ve heard stranger things on this job, but I''ll reserve my judgement until he proves himself.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Kirac/Kirac_OnEagonsArrival.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[410,412]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(23695, 'Kirac_OnFirstPetals', '[]', 'You''ve encountered rose petals in the Atlas? It couldn''t be... hmm... there was a friend of mine. She worked with us to help defeat would-be Conquerers of the Atlas. The cost of war breaks people though, and she walked off into the great unknown after... well. That''s a story for another time. In any case, I remember her being quite partial to rose petals...', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Kirac/Kirac_OnFirstPetals.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[410,412]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(23696, 'Kirac_OnLearningZanaTrapped', '[]', 'So, those petals were related to Zana... and she''s in trouble. Alright. Your mission is simple. Rescue her. The Citizen Vanguard never leaves a man behind. We''ll do our best to hold off those eldritch entities while you follow the trail.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Kirac/Kirac_OnLearningZanaTrapped.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[410,412]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(23697, 'Kirac_OnTheOriginator', '[]', 'So who is the ''Originator,'' after all? Is it Zana? Working this job, I hear wild new things every day, but it''ll take me some time to make sense of this. I like to think we were decently close, Zana and I, and she never mentioned a brother... or her mother, come to think of it... but Eagon has proven he truly does care for her, at the very least. If you get the chance, try to convince Zana to return to us. We could sorely use her aid.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Kirac/Kirac_OnTheOriginator.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[410,412]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(23698, 'Zana_BenevolenceCallouts_Random', '[]', 'His fury unleashes...', 'Audio/Dialogue/Atlas/SecretsOfTheAtlas/Zana/Zana_Benevolence/FragmentOfIgnorance_Zana_Wild_AngerCallouts_01.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[716]', NULL, 0, 0, '[12]', 100),
(23699, 'Zana_BenevolenceCallouts_2', '[]', 'He is not himself...', 'Audio/Dialogue/Atlas/SecretsOfTheAtlas/Zana/Zana_Benevolence/FragmentOfIgnorance_Zana_Wild_AngerCallouts_07.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[716]', NULL, 0, 0, '[12]', 100),
(23700, 'Zana_BenevolenceCallouts_3', '[]', 'He is not himself...', 'Audio/Dialogue/Atlas/SecretsOfTheAtlas/Zana/Zana_Benevolence/FragmentOfIgnorance_Zana_Wild_AngerCallouts_08.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[716]', NULL, 0, 0, '[12]', 100),
