(25169, 'Kirac_OnZana_328', '[]', 'I understand these developments are concerning, but when it comes to the Atlas, there''s no one I trust more than Zana Caeserius. I''m no fool.... I understand there''s a decent chance she''s emotionally compromised... but she''s still our only true expert. I once risked my life to save hers... I have faith in her.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Kirac/328Kirac_01.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[410,412]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(25170, 'Kirac_OnEagon_328', '[]', 'I''d say he''s proven himself as... <i>{somehow} involved in whatever''s going on in the Atlas. Not a spy, not an eldritch entity. I''m going to keep a close eye on him, but for now, let''s see how this plays out.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Kirac/328Kirac_02.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[410,412]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(25171, 'Kirac_OnEndgame_328', '[]', 'Is the Atlas being destroyed, or is it simply changing once again? There was a time when I would have destroyed the Atlas without a second thought, had I the chance... but now, I''m not so sure what the consequences might be.', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Kirac/328Kirac_03.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[410,412]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(25172, 'Kirac_Wild_Idle_Random', '[]', 'We''re at the edge of doom here...', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Kirac/328Kirac_Wild_Idle_01_01.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 200000, 1, '[410,412]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
