(25203, 'ZanaGlyphVault_Isla', '[]', 'Presented with all the parts, most would reconstruct a machine as it originally was. Not Isla. Now that she is free from Templar oversight, she has reimagined what a map device can be.' || char(13) || '
	' || char(13) || '
In our letters, she asks if I am still alone. In Kingsmarch, she continues to tinker with Kalguuran runes. Through her experiments, the Atlas has evolved, amplifying the danger and bounty within.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
What other arcana could be infused with the Atlas? If the map device is more than simply a doorway, what aspects of the Atlas could be changed by further altering the map device''s construction?' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
I seek an arcana more elusive than starlight. When I write to her next, I will ask if these Kalguurans can bring me what I need.', 'Audio/Dialogue/Atlas/SecretsOfTheAtlas/Zana/Zana_Glyph/ZanaGlyph_Isla.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[745]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(25204, 'ZanaGlyphVault_Venarius', '[]', 'A young Venarius wanted to cleanse the Templars of corruption. By the time he came into my life, that ideological man was gone. ' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
It seems it becomes... difficult to care about mankind, once you bear witness to the enormity of threats on our horizon. He sought a weapon to fight those demons, no matter the cost. ' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
One could argue Venarius was depraved... but Sirus? Sirus was the closest thing to a hero Wraeclast could have hoped for. Sirus believed in humanity, and in me... He sacrificed himself to save all of us. Yet, the Atlas still consumed him, and spat out an unfeeling husk.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Venarius was no fool. You need power to overcome the ghastly entities the Atlas draws in. But I cannot destroy the Atlas with tools wrought from it. I must create my own weapon.', 'Audio/Dialogue/Atlas/SecretsOfTheAtlas/Zana/Zana_Glyph/ZanaGlyph_Venarius.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[746]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(25205, 'ZanaGlyphVault_Valdo', '[]', 'All of this started in the dreamlands. The beating heart of the Atlas. My father''s Nexus. I always assumed it was simply the Elder''s birthplace - the shell it left behind.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
I now suspect the dreamlands existed long before the Elder''s birth. Its master, the Decay, was drawn to the dreamlands, just as other forces are now drawn by the Elder''s absence.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Those who have sought power in the Atlas utilized the Nexus. But none were as imaginative as my father. The ones who came after only played within the confines of the realms that he built. ' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
The dreamlands may be eternal... but the Atlas was his creation. He was taught by the Elder itself. And from him, I learned too. What was shaped can be unmade...', 'Audio/Dialogue/Atlas/SecretsOfTheAtlas/Zana/Zana_Glyph/ZanaGlyph_Valdo.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[747]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(25206, 'ZanaGlyphVault_Zana', '[]', 'I''ve watched those I work with and those I love fall into madness in the Atlas. My father, Sirus... even the exiles I hired. Perhaps that awareness is what keeps me from the same fate. ' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
I must stay vigilant. I cannot let the Atlas manipulate me. Even Veritania, once calm and collected, conceded to it. She became convinced that she alone could prevent others from pursuing their wicked desires. Of course I have considered the parallels between us.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
When Eagon appeared here, I assumed it was the Atlas''s temptations. I tried to remove all that tethers me to the world, so that I can give myself... completely. But there are some things I could not bring myself to remove. ' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
I did all I could to prevent him from this path. Was the Atlas calling for him, even when I kept him safe? I fear that the Atlas is working against me. I must press on, no matter what it puts in my way.', 'Audio/Dialogue/Atlas/SecretsOfTheAtlas/Zana/Zana_Glyph/ZanaGlyph_Zana.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[748]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(25207, 'Saresh_Glyph_Environmental', '[]', 'Despite a lifetime of devotion and research, the Order has betrayed me, and set the Maraketh upon me with wild tales of evil and depravity. They are all too quick to believe, simply because of how I was born. If they only had it in their hearts to stop and listen... but they do not. I know this now. I am being cast out for what I discovered, for the knowledge I alone now hold. I know what lurks in the heart of man... the seed of darkness within us all. I know what we <i>{actually are}, and that is why I must be slain at all costs... but I will not make it easy for them. For every drop of blood they take from me, a hundred Maraketh will die. Let them remember me how they will, so that I am remembered at all. That will be my lasting victory.', 'Audio/Dialogue/Leagues/Mirage/Saresh_Glyph/Saresh_Glyph_Environmental.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[799]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(25208, 'Saresh_Glyph_One', '[]', 'You meddle in events you do not understand! All you have done is damage my body and delay me, but my torment, and yours, will continue soon. The Master Below All rages in the dark, and his servants seek Kulemak''s divine spark even now. I am the <i>{only} one on Wraeclast who understands the true nature of Necromancy. Would you rather have your world dominated by merciless creatures of death that have never known life, or by a man who was - at the very least - once human? Fool!', 'Audio/Dialogue/Leagues/Mirage/Saresh_Glyph/Saresh_Glyph_One.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[801]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(25209, 'Saresh_Glyph_Two', '[]', 'You must stop interfering! We <i>{need} to release Zarokh. I cannot do... what I need to do... trapped in this malformed husk! The Afarud stole me away after Orbala gave me a warrior''s death. I was ready to die. <i>{I was}. My life had not been so glorious a thing that I would want it to go on forever... but my loyals were not ready to let me go, and a <i>{djinn} ritual was all they knew of cheating death. Can you comprehend the true horror of what they did? I am neither dead, nor undead. A soul half bound to a <i>{barya}, half bound to an object - not a totem, or a painting, but a <i>{corpse}. I <i>{feel} every melting scrap of eternally rotting flesh... think about what I endure next time you seek to interfere!', 'Audio/Dialogue/Leagues/Mirage/Saresh_Glyph/Saresh_Glyph_Two.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[801]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(25210, 'Saresh_Glyph_Three', '[]', 'Who do you serve, mortal? <i>{Varashta?} Do you believe her unbiased and truthful? Tell me, have you ever met Zarokh? Ever spoken to him? What evils has he committed on Wraeclast? None that <i>{you''ve} ever heard of, nor I. Why, then, must you so persistently disrupt me and my Afarud? If I had met you first, would you be assisting <i>{me} against <i>{her?} Stay out of this!', 'Audio/Dialogue/Leagues/Mirage/Saresh_Glyph/Saresh_Glyph_Three.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[801]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(25211, 'Saresh_Glyph_Four', '[]', 'You utter, unbelievable fool. Lurking in wait, I have watched the sands overtake the whole of the Vastiri, generation by generation... I have exhausted every attempt at escape from this half-spectral coil. I cannot sleep. I cannot eat, or drink, or rest, or die. Time has become my mortal enemy. Each moment drags spiked chains through my unceasing awareness. There is only one being I know of who might wrest Time''s torture from me, and he, too, bears a grievance against the Maraketh... this is the true reason I seek to free Zarokh... I would fight the Abyssals, if it came to it, I was not lying... but here and now, I just want to die. Please. Please stop. Please let me go.', 'Audio/Dialogue/Leagues/Mirage/Saresh_Glyph/Saresh_Glyph_Four.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[801]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(25212, 'Saresh_Idle_Head_Random', '[]', 'I will have my rest, no matter what it takes.', 'Audio/Dialogue/Leagues/Mirage/Saresh_Wild/Saresh_Idle_Head_01_01.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[801]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(25213, 'Saresh_Idle_Head_2', '[]', 'I will have my rest, no matter what it takes.', 'Audio/Dialogue/Leagues/Mirage/Saresh_Wild/Saresh_Idle_Head_01_02.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[801]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(25214, 'Saresh_Idle_Head_3', '[]', 'It seems I have made some mistakes.', 'Audio/Dialogue/Leagues/Mirage/Saresh_Wild/Saresh_Idle_Head_02_01.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[801]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(25215, 'Saresh_Idle_Head_4', '[]', 'It seems I have made some mistakes.', 'Audio/Dialogue/Leagues/Mirage/Saresh_Wild/Saresh_Idle_Head_02_02.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[801]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(25216, 'Saresh_Idle_Head_5', '[]', 'So... what now? Are you... staying long?', 'Audio/Dialogue/Leagues/Mirage/Saresh_Wild/Saresh_Idle_Head_03_01.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[801]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(25217, 'Saresh_Idle_Head_6', '[]', 'Uhh... you''re still here.', 'Audio/Dialogue/Leagues/Mirage/Saresh_Wild/Saresh_Idle_Head_04_01.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[801]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(25218, 'Saresh_Idle_Head_7', '[]', 'Uhh... you''re still here.', 'Audio/Dialogue/Leagues/Mirage/Saresh_Wild/Saresh_Idle_Head_04_02.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[801]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(25219, 'Saresh_Idle_Head_8', '[]', 'Just leave!', 'Audio/Dialogue/Leagues/Mirage/Saresh_Wild/Saresh_Idle_Head_05_01.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[801]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(25220, 'Saresh_Idle_Head_9', '[]', 'Just leave!', 'Audio/Dialogue/Leagues/Mirage/Saresh_Wild/Saresh_Idle_Head_05_02.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[801]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(25221, 'Saresh_Idle_Head_10', '[]', 'I should have taken Amanamu''s offer...', 'Audio/Dialogue/Leagues/Mirage/Saresh_Wild/Saresh_Idle_Head_06_01.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[801]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(25222, 'Saresh_Idle_Head_11', '[]', 'I should have taken Amanamu''s offer...', 'Audio/Dialogue/Leagues/Mirage/Saresh_Wild/Saresh_Idle_Head_06_02.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[801]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(25223, 'Saresh_AugmentedMeleeSwipe_Random', '[]', 'Rot away!', 'Audio/Dialogue/Leagues/Mirage/Saresh/Saresh_AugmentedMeleeSwipe_01_01.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 2, 40000, 1, '[799]', NULL, 0, 0, '[28]', 100),
