(25342, 'Varashta_Introduction_Wild', '[]', 'You there! Can you see me?', 'Audio/Dialogue/Leagues/Mirage/Varashta_Wild/Varashta_Introduction.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 15000, 1, '[788]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(25343, 'Varashta_Tutorial_01', '[]', 'Finally! I have been attempting to project myself to the surface for centuries... I see you have slain the defiler that was drawing power out of this <i>{djinn.} I thank you. ' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
I am Varashta, once a Sekhema of the Maraketh. A powerful evil seeks freedom, and I must make sure that does not happen. Fight for me! If not for glory, then for yourself. Zarokh, the Grand Djinn of Time, is siphoning these <i>{djinn} to project his power into the world. The Mirage you are about to face is his doing. I have learned to exert some... <i>{influence...} over his manipulations. Tell me what you wish for...', 'Audio/Dialogue/Leagues/Mirage/Varashta/Varashta_Tutorial_01.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[788]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(25344, 'Varashta_Tutorial_02', '[]', 'His Mirage is bound to this place by an Astral Chain. Enter the Mirage. Break the Astral Chain, then return to me.', 'Audio/Dialogue/Leagues/Mirage/Varashta/Varashta_Tutorial_02.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[788]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(25345, 'Varashta_MirageBeatenFirst', '[]', 'You have done well. Zarokh''s link to this place has been broken, so I can now free this trapped <i>{djinn}... but I, too, will soon fade from this place. I am trapped alongside Zarokh, and I can only infiltrate his projections, not create them myself... you will have to fight the Afarud on your own.', 'Audio/Dialogue/Leagues/Mirage/Varashta/Varashta_MirageBeatenFirst.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[788]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(25346, 'Varashta_AfarudGossip', '[]', 'I hold no ill will toward the Faridun, but the Afarud disgust me. They are the pariahs of the outcasts. The rejected of the rejected. The violent, the sadists, and the evil. For generations, they have made plague and darkness their tools. They steal what is ours, and commit unspeakable acts... but only on the fringes, in the dark places.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
They know the Maraketh would slaughter them otherwise... which is why it is very concerning that the Afarud would make such overt moves now, after all this time. For some reason, they now seek to free Zarokh, the accursed Grand Djinn of Time... they are not loyal to him. They are led by another, someone who remains hidden in the shadows...', 'Audio/Dialogue/Leagues/Mirage/Varashta/Varashta_OnAfarud.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[788]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(25347, 'Varashta_ZarokhGossip', '[]', 'Zarokh is my eternal nemesis, and my only companion. He and I have been trapped together for a time incomprehensible. Yes, we hate each other, but we are also the only two thinking beings in the halls of the Trial, save when an aspirant makes an attempt.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Long ago, he sought to betray me, and caged me in a prison of Time. To save the Vastiri from him, I bound him to a <i>{barya} in the lowest level... and here we are, thousands of years later. He still struggles for freedom, and I still strive to stop him. I am sure we are both quite mad by now, but it''s hard to tell, isn''t it?', 'Audio/Dialogue/Leagues/Mirage/Varashta/Varashta_OnZarokh.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[788]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(25348, 'Varashta_PrisonOfTime', '[]', 'There are no bars. No chains. Yet, I am caged all the same. Freedom is mere steps away, but my foot is moving slower than a glacier. He left my mind unslowed to torture me, but that was his greatest mistake. I have had a very <i>{long} time to focus on tapping into his power, and now I can undermine him...', 'Audio/Dialogue/Leagues/Mirage/Varashta/Varashta_PrisonOfTime.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[788]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(25349, 'Varashta_OnTrialOfTheSekhemas', '[]', 'Oh, the Trial of the Sekhemas? It is a Maraketh tradition that you need not concern yourself with. We built it, Zarokh and I... together... long ago...', 'Audio/Dialogue/Leagues/Mirage/Varashta/Varashta_OnTrialOfSekhemas.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[788]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
