(25876, 'MirageExecutioner_Glyph', '[]', 'For generations, we have endured the hatred of the Maraketh, and the contempt of the Faridun. Saresh is all that we have. Our single hope in this world - not for triumph - but for <i>{vengeance.} There can be no redemption for us, not after what we have had to do to survive.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
They must all pay the black river''s toll! They must suffer as we have! ' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Let them drown in blood. Then, we can all be forgotten together.' || char(13) || '
', 'Audio/Dialogue/Leagues/Mirage/FaridunWildBoss_Glyph/MirageExecutioner_Glyph.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 40000, 1, '[749]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
