(26027, 'VampireServant_Gossip', '[]', 'You... ask us... such a question? You care to know? We are not worthy of such compassion! ' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
My brother and I... we were bound for Pondium to serve a master with quite a reputation... But it seems fate intervened. The ship sank and we... we floated our way across the sea in a barrel. ' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
A couple of our brothers... well... they didn''t make it. But they meant our survival, at least. Once we landed ashore... we were Masterless. A fate worse than death. We fought each other bloody out of sheer anger and confusion. ' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Then you appeared... a light in the darkness. You saved us, master. And so... we are... <i>{eternally} grateful.', 'Audio/Dialogue/MTX/Hideout/NPCs/VampireServantMTX/VampireServant/VampireServant_Gossip.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[804]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(26028, 'DeepwaterNPCTutorial', '[]', '[DNT] Hello there! you look just like a fish out of water; howsabout you help me in my quest to find the great underwater treasure of the Brinerot? Hop on my boat and I''ll take you to my ship!', '', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[790]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(26029, 'DeepwaterNPCTutorialCharting', '[]', '[DNT] Welcome Aboard! First order of business is Charting that there Chart I handed ya.  Get in the diving bell and I''ll lower you down! Once you''re down there you''ll need to place Ghostflame Lanterns to push back the Ocean currents and reveal caches of Ghostflame Sulphur. Once you''ve collected enough Sulphur and used up all your lanterns, head back to the Diving Bell and I''ll reel you back up with the loot! ', '', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[790]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(26030, 'DeepwaterNPCTutorialDoneAChart', '[]', '[DNT] Wasn''t that thrilling? You''re a natural! Find some more of those Charts while you go about your journey and come back here any time to Chart them. Once you have charted enough, you''ll be able to embark on a Voyage!', '', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[790]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(26031, 'DeepwaterNPCTutorialVoyage', '[]', '[DNT] Looks like you have a nice collection of Charts stocked up, so you should now be able to run a Voyage! Take your Charts to the Voyage Planning table next to me and arrange them correctly. Then you''ll be able to Embark on a Voyage; which is just like a Chart, but bigger!', '', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[790]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(26032, 'DeepwaterNPCTutorialVoyageComplete', '[]', '[DNT] Congratulations on completing your first Voyage! Now just keep doing that and find more Sulphur, which we can use to enhance your gear!', '', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[789,794]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(26033, 'DeepwaterNPCWildCalloutCoast', '[]', '[DNT] Come here, quickly!', 'Audio/Dialogue/Leagues/BreachTwo/Ailith_Wild/Ailith_Wild_01.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[790]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(26034, 'DeepwaterNPCComeVisitMyShip', '[]', 'Whatcha want, a written contract? Let''s go!', 'Audio/Dialogue/Leagues/Deepwater/Valerie/Valerie_ComeVisitMyShip.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[790]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(26035, 'DeepwaterNPCWelcomeAboard', '[]', '[DNT] Welcome aboard The Sovereign! Here take this chart and get to Charting!', '', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[790]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
