(27000, 'Vesper_CraftEssenceDelirium_5', '[]', 'Let''s cause some chaos.', 'Audio/Dialogue/Leagues/Deepwater/Vesper_Wild/Vesper_CraftEssenceDelirium_02_02.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 100000, 1, '[795]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(27001, 'Vesper_CraftEssenceDelirium_6', '[]', 'Let''s cause some chaos.', 'Audio/Dialogue/Leagues/Deepwater/Vesper_Wild/Vesper_CraftEssenceDelirium_02_03.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 100000, 1, '[795]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(27002, 'Vesper_CraftDucat_Random', '[]', 'A cursed ducat? Well, not like things can get any worse. Let''s see what happens.', 'Audio/Dialogue/Leagues/Deepwater/Vesper_Wild/Vesper_CraftDucat_01_01.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 100000, 1, '[795]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(27003, 'Vesper_CraftDucat_2', '[]', 'A cursed ducat? Hmm. Not like things can get any worse. Let''s see what happens.', 'Audio/Dialogue/Leagues/Deepwater/Vesper_Wild/Vesper_CraftDucat_01_02.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 100000, 1, '[795]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(27004, 'Vesper_CraftUpgrade_One', '[]', 'That''ll blow a fell wind.', 'Audio/Dialogue/Leagues/Deepwater/Vesper_Wild/Vesper_CraftUpgrade_One.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[795]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(27005, 'Vesper_CraftUpgrade_Two', '[]', 'Aah, smells... cleaner, at least.', 'Audio/Dialogue/Leagues/Deepwater/Vesper_Wild/Vesper_CraftUpgrade_Two.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[795]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(27006, 'Vesper_CraftUpgrade_Three', '[]', 'Feels like pouring part of myself in it...', 'Audio/Dialogue/Leagues/Deepwater/Vesper_Wild/Vesper_CraftUpgrade_Three.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[795]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(27007, 'Vesper_CraftUpgrade_Four', '[]', 'Haha, I don''t pretend to understand this one.', 'Audio/Dialogue/Leagues/Deepwater/Vesper_Wild/Vesper_CraftUpgrade_Four.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[795]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(27008, 'Vesper_CraftUpgrade_Five', '[]', 'Oh, I <i>{knew} this shite was heretical. Those damn hypocrite Templars.', 'Audio/Dialogue/Leagues/Deepwater/Vesper_Wild/Vesper_CraftUpgrade_Five.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[795]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(27009, 'Vesper_CraftingFire', '[]', 'That''ll burn something fierce.', 'Audio/Dialogue/Leagues/Deepwater/Vesper_Wild/Vesper_CraftingFire.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[795]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(27010, 'Vesper_OnExistingAsSpiritInShip', '[]', 'It''s a strange feeling, being in the ship. Split like. I don''t feel my hands. I feel the sails. I can hear you, yeah, but I can <i>{hear} the ocean. <i>{Feel} the water as we sail. If it was by choice, I''d say it''s an interesting diversion. But it isn''t by choice... only way I don''t lose it and start screaming my bloody head off... is... I try not to think about it.', 'Audio/Dialogue/Leagues/Deepwater/Vesper/Vesper_OnExistingAsSpiritInShip.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[795]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(27011, 'Vesper_OnPlaceThisWasDone', '[]', 'That place was worse than most prisons, and believe me, I''ve seen my share. To them, I wasn''t a man. Even the bloody Templars give you that much. They spit on you, insult you, sure, but— these masked men... when they looked at me, they saw a <i>{box}. What''s in the box? Well, you got to open it to find out...', 'Audio/Dialogue/Leagues/Deepwater/Vesper/Vesper_OnPlaceThisWasDone.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[795]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(27012, 'Vesper_OnValerie', '[]', 'You might say we grew up together. I wouldn''t say that. Going from young to not-young in Pondium is no kinda growing up. It''s just <i>{not dying}. Every day a desperate terror. But looking back? Kinda fun, in its own way... I wouldn''t trade it for the life of a farmer. Nah, just kill me. Same thing I said to Val when I first... woke up... in this ship. But she won''t let me just die. And you know what? For once, I feel like things might actually go our way. Maybe. If life doesn''t owe us one lucky roll of the die after all <i>{this,} then what are we even doin'' here?', 'Audio/Dialogue/Leagues/Deepwater/Vesper/Vesper_OnValerie.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[795]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(27013, 'Vesper_OnAllflame', '[]', 'You see some of the light of that shite, but you don''t see all of it. There''s a... pit... or a... big ol'' hole... I don''t know what to call it. It''s <i>{down}, further than you can fathom. It''s filled with all sorts of terrors, shadowed so I can''t see ''em, a sea-vortex of deathly light... and it doesn''t belong to us. But the Allflame... it does. It''s <i>{ours}. And it''s growing. They''re not the same colour... the light of that pit and the light of the Allflame... close, but not the same. I have no idea what that means, but it''s not scary. It''s... hungry... it''s... <i>{grinning}...', 'Audio/Dialogue/Leagues/Deepwater/Vesper/Vesper_OnTheAllflame.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[795]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(27014, 'Vesper_OnEmbarkingChart_Random', '[]', 'Good luck down there.', 'Audio/Dialogue/Leagues/Deepwater/Vesper_Wild/Vesper_EmbarkOnChart_01_01.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 100000, 1, '[795]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(27015, 'Vesper_OnEmbarkingChart_2', '[]', 'Good luck down there.', 'Audio/Dialogue/Leagues/Deepwater/Vesper_Wild/Vesper_EmbarkOnChart_01_02.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 100000, 1, '[795]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(27016, 'Vesper_OnEmbarkingChart_3', '[]', 'Good luck down there.', 'Audio/Dialogue/Leagues/Deepwater/Vesper_Wild/Vesper_EmbarkOnChart_01_03.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 100000, 1, '[795]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(27017, 'Vesper_OnEmbarkingChart_4', '[]', 'Make sure you come back in one piece.', 'Audio/Dialogue/Leagues/Deepwater/Vesper_Wild/Vesper_EmbarkOnChart_02_01.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 100000, 1, '[795]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(27018, 'Vesper_OnEmbarkingChart_5', '[]', 'Make sure you come back in one piece.', 'Audio/Dialogue/Leagues/Deepwater/Vesper_Wild/Vesper_EmbarkOnChart_02_02.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 100000, 1, '[795]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(27019, 'Vesper_OnEmbarkingChart_6', '[]', 'Make sure you come back in one piece.', 'Audio/Dialogue/Leagues/Deepwater/Vesper_Wild/Vesper_EmbarkOnChart_02_03.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 100000, 1, '[795]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(27020, 'Vesper_OnEmbarkingChart_7', '[]', 'Bring some more Sulphur back, will ya?', 'Audio/Dialogue/Leagues/Deepwater/Vesper_Wild/Vesper_EmbarkOnChart_03_01.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 100000, 1, '[795]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(27021, 'Vesper_OnEmbarkingChart_8', '[]', 'Bring some more Sulphur back, will ya?', 'Audio/Dialogue/Leagues/Deepwater/Vesper_Wild/Vesper_EmbarkOnChart_03_02.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 100000, 1, '[795]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(27022, 'Vesper_OnEmbarkingChart_9', '[]', 'Bring some more Sulphur back, will ya?', 'Audio/Dialogue/Leagues/Deepwater/Vesper_Wild/Vesper_EmbarkOnChart_03_03.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 100000, 1, '[795]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(27023, 'Vesper_OnEmbarkingChart_10', '[]', 'See you on the other side.', 'Audio/Dialogue/Leagues/Deepwater/Vesper_Wild/Vesper_EmbarkOnChart_04_01.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 100000, 1, '[795]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(27024, 'Vesper_OnEmbarkingChart_11', '[]', 'See you on the other side.', 'Audio/Dialogue/Leagues/Deepwater/Vesper_Wild/Vesper_EmbarkOnChart_04_02.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 100000, 1, '[795]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(27025, 'Vesper_OnEmbarkingChart_12', '[]', 'See you on the other side.', 'Audio/Dialogue/Leagues/Deepwater/Vesper_Wild/Vesper_EmbarkOnChart_04_03.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 100000, 1, '[795]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(27026, 'Vesper_OnEmbarkingChart_13', '[]', 'Have a nice swim.', 'Audio/Dialogue/Leagues/Deepwater/Vesper_Wild/Vesper_EmbarkOnChart_05_01.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 100000, 1, '[795]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(27027, 'Vesper_OnEmbarkingChart_14', '[]', 'Have a nice swim.', 'Audio/Dialogue/Leagues/Deepwater/Vesper_Wild/Vesper_EmbarkOnChart_05_02.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 100000, 1, '[795]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(27028, 'Vesper_OnEmbarkingChart_15', '[]', 'Have a nice swim.', 'Audio/Dialogue/Leagues/Deepwater/Vesper_Wild/Vesper_EmbarkOnChart_05_03.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 100000, 1, '[795]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(27029, 'Vesper_OnVelkaFound', '[]', 'Makes my skin crawl imagining what Velka can do with the power of the Allflame at her disposal. It''s just as well you restored me to full strength... or close enough, anyway. Not sure we''d be able to stop her otherwise.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Allow me to imbue you with the power of the Allflame. It won''t come close to the full thing, mind... but it should be enough to let you pierce that barrier of hers.', 'Audio/Dialogue/Leagues/Deepwater/Vesper/Vesper_OnVelkaFound.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[795]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
(27030, 'Vesper_PostOnVelkaFound_Wild', '[]', 'There... I''ve done everything I can. It''s all up to you now.', 'Audio/Dialogue/Leagues/Deepwater/Vesper_Wild/Vesper_PostOnVelkaFound_Wild.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[795]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
