(27055, 'Kirac_329_OnAnomalies', '[]', 'Ever since the Atlas fractured, these ''anomalies'' have been appearing. My Vanguard says the anomalies take them... back to Wraeclast.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Now, I''ve seen my fair share of oddities in the Atlas. But to find a familiar face? To open a map, and step onto your own land? It''s unnerving.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
I suspect Eagon''s work is adding fuel to the fire. He disagrees, of course. He''s naive. He doesn''t understand why these ''mundane'' anomalies are alarming.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Stay sharp out there, will you? I hate to think what might happen if our eldritch friends found these new doorways into our home.' || char(13) || '
', 'Audio/Dialogue/NPC/Kirac/Kirac_329_01.ogg', '', 0, 0, '', 1, 0, 1, '[410,412]', NULL, 0, 0, '[]', 100),
